{
  "version": 1,
  "courseId": 995016,
  "courseSlug": "vuejs-2-the-complete-guide",
  "courseTitle": "Vue - The Complete Guide (incl. Router & Composition API)",
  "sourceLanguage": "en",
  "targetLanguage": "zh-TW",
  "errors": [],
  "lectures": [
    {
      "id": "21879486",
      "title": "Example: Animating a Modal",
      "lectureOrder": 201,
      "videoOrder": 176,
      "sourceHash": "d41cd72259cb40cc71e3b27e9936b99e92544bd711b11afbaa6ab3889a71c6f3",
      "cues": [
        {
          "id": 1,
          "start": 2.2,
          "end": 5.57,
          "en": "So let's now apply what we learned about transition,",
          "zh": "所以現在讓我們把學到的 transition 套用上去，"
        },
        {
          "id": 2,
          "start": 5.57,
          "end": 8.7,
          "en": "about this transition component, to our modal.",
          "zh": "關於這個 transition 元件，套到我們的 modal。"
        },
        {
          "id": 3,
          "start": 8.7,
          "end": 12.105,
          "en": "Because that was the thing where I explained",
          "zh": "因為那是我說明過的東西，"
        },
        {
          "id": 4,
          "start": 12.105,
          "end": 15.44,
          "en": "that we might need more help from vue's side.",
          "zh": "我們可能需要更多來自 Vue 這邊的幫助。"
        },
        {
          "id": 5,
          "start": 15.44,
          "end": 18.77,
          "en": "Especially for having a transition and animation,",
          "zh": "尤其是要有轉場和動畫，"
        },
        {
          "id": 6,
          "start": 18.77,
          "end": 20.42,
          "en": "when we close it.",
          "zh": "當我們關閉它時。"
        },
        {
          "id": 7,
          "start": 20.42,
          "end": 25.02,
          "en": "Now we can wrap transition around our own custom components,",
          "zh": "現在我們可以把 transition 包在我們自己的自訂元件外面，"
        },
        {
          "id": 8,
          "start": 25.02,
          "end": 28.41,
          "en": "just as we can wrap it around built-in elements.",
          "zh": "就像我們可以把它包在內建元素外面。"
        },
        {
          "id": 9,
          "start": 28.41,
          "end": 30.94,
          "en": "So we can use transition here,",
          "zh": "所以我們可以在這裡使用 transition，"
        },
        {
          "id": 10,
          "start": 30.94,
          "end": 33.683,
          "en": "around our base-model, just like that.",
          "zh": "包在我們的 BaseModal 外面，就像這樣。"
        },
        {
          "id": 11,
          "start": 34.58,
          "end": 37.21,
          "en": "Now we can, of course also set the name prop",
          "zh": "現在我們當然也可以設定 name prop，"
        },
        {
          "id": 12,
          "start": 37.21,
          "end": 40.09,
          "en": "to define our own prefix for all",
          "zh": "來為所有那些特殊 classes 定義我們自己的前綴，"
        },
        {
          "id": 13,
          "start": 40.09,
          "end": 42.53,
          "en": "those special classes you will add.",
          "zh": "Vue 會加上那些。"
        },
        {
          "id": 14,
          "start": 42.53,
          "end": 44.73,
          "en": "And I will add modal here.",
          "zh": "而我會在這裡加上 modal。"
        },
        {
          "id": 15,
          "start": 44.73,
          "end": 47.193,
          "en": "But again, you can pick any name you want.",
          "zh": "但再說一次，你可以挑任何你想要的名稱。"
        },
        {
          "id": 16,
          "start": 48.26,
          "end": 51.36,
          "en": "And then we can dig into our CSS code",
          "zh": "然後我們可以深入我們的 CSS 程式碼，"
        },
        {
          "id": 17,
          "start": 51.36,
          "end": 54.84,
          "en": "and start to finding those CSS classes.",
          "zh": "並開始定義那些 CSS classes。"
        },
        {
          "id": 18,
          "start": 54.84,
          "end": 59.38,
          "en": "And here I'll add a modal-enter-from class,",
          "zh": "而這裡我會加上一個 modal-enter-from class、"
        },
        {
          "id": 19,
          "start": 59.38,
          "end": 64.38,
          "en": "a modal-enter-active class and a modal-enter-to class.",
          "zh": "一個 modal-enter-active class，以及一個 modal-enter-to class。"
        },
        {
          "id": 20,
          "start": 67.87,
          "end": 70.99,
          "en": "And I will actually go to BaseModal.vue",
          "zh": "而我其實會前往 BaseModal.vue，"
        },
        {
          "id": 21,
          "start": 70.99,
          "end": 73.12,
          "en": "and make sure that I removed the animation",
          "zh": "並確定我移除了動畫，"
        },
        {
          "id": 22,
          "start": 73.12,
          "end": 74.25,
          "en": "from the modal there.",
          "zh": "從那裡的 modal。"
        },
        {
          "id": 23,
          "start": 74.25,
          "end": 76.72,
          "en": "So that we don't see this animation anymore.",
          "zh": "所以我們不再看到這個動畫。"
        },
        {
          "id": 24,
          "start": 76.72,
          "end": 80.093,
          "en": "So make sure you comment as out or remove this line.",
          "zh": "所以確定你把這行註解掉或移除。"
        },
        {
          "id": 25,
          "start": 81.22,
          "end": 83.09,
          "en": "And then let's go back to App.vue,",
          "zh": "然後讓我們回到 App.vue，"
        },
        {
          "id": 26,
          "start": 83.09,
          "end": 85.3,
          "en": "which is where we're using the base-model",
          "zh": "我們在那裡使用 BaseModal，"
        },
        {
          "id": 27,
          "start": 85.3,
          "end": 87.89,
          "en": "and where we are wrapping it with transition.",
          "zh": "也在那裡用 transition 把它包起來。"
        },
        {
          "id": 28,
          "start": 87.89,
          "end": 91.18,
          "en": "And now we can define our different styles here.",
          "zh": "而現在我們可以在這裡定義我們不同的樣式。"
        },
        {
          "id": 29,
          "start": 91.18,
          "end": 93.07,
          "en": "And it's now of course, totally up to you,",
          "zh": "而現在當然完全由你決定，"
        },
        {
          "id": 30,
          "start": 93.07,
          "end": 95.8,
          "en": "how you want to animate this modal.",
          "zh": "你想如何為這個 modal 加上動畫。"
        },
        {
          "id": 31,
          "start": 95.8,
          "end": 99.363,
          "en": "I will actually bring over my modal keyframes here.",
          "zh": "我其實會把我的 modal keyframes 搬過來。"
        },
        {
          "id": 32,
          "start": 102.12,
          "end": 105.023,
          "en": "So the keyframes from the BaseModal.vue file,",
          "zh": "所以是來自 BaseModal.vue 檔案的 keyframes，"
        },
        {
          "id": 33,
          "start": 105.95,
          "end": 109.43,
          "en": "add them here, to App.vue.",
          "zh": "把它們加到這裡，加到 App.vue。"
        },
        {
          "id": 34,
          "start": 109.43,
          "end": 111.67,
          "en": "You can have multiple sets of keyframes",
          "zh": "你可以有多組 keyframes，"
        },
        {
          "id": 35,
          "start": 111.67,
          "end": 114.08,
          "en": "in the same style tax,",
          "zh": "在同一個 style 標籤裡，"
        },
        {
          "id": 36,
          "start": 114.08,
          "end": 116.67,
          "en": "as long as you're using different names.",
          "zh": "只要你使用不同的名稱。"
        },
        {
          "id": 37,
          "start": 116.67,
          "end": 118.66,
          "en": "And I actually don't even need to enter",
          "zh": "而我其實甚至不需要 enter-from"
        },
        {
          "id": 38,
          "start": 118.66,
          "end": 120.21,
          "en": "from an enter-to now.",
          "zh": "和 enter-to。"
        },
        {
          "id": 39,
          "start": 120.21,
          "end": 123.82,
          "en": "We just need enter-active to play at animation",
          "zh": "我們只需要 enter-active 來播放動畫，"
        },
        {
          "id": 40,
          "start": 123.82,
          "end": 126,
          "en": "and this will be the modal animation,",
          "zh": "而這會是 modal 動畫，"
        },
        {
          "id": 41,
          "start": 126,
          "end": 127.603,
          "en": "which i just copied over,",
          "zh": "也就是我剛複製過來的，"
        },
        {
          "id": 42,
          "start": 128.56,
          "end": 131.723,
          "en": "give it a duration and a ease-in function.",
          "zh": "給它一個持續時間和一個 ease-in 函式。"
        },
        {
          "id": 43,
          "start": 132.8,
          "end": 135.5,
          "en": "And if we do that, we'll notice a problem.",
          "zh": "而如果我們那樣做，我們會注意到一個問題。"
        },
        {
          "id": 44,
          "start": 135.5,
          "end": 139.223,
          "en": "If we reload, this modal has no animation.",
          "zh": "如果我們重新載入，這個 modal 沒有動畫。"
        },
        {
          "id": 45,
          "start": 142.49,
          "end": 145.32,
          "en": "Now, this transition component",
          "zh": "現在，這個 transition 元件"
        },
        {
          "id": 46,
          "start": 145.32,
          "end": 147.98,
          "en": "does work on custom components.",
          "zh": "確實能在自訂元件上運作。"
        },
        {
          "id": 47,
          "start": 147.98,
          "end": 149.81,
          "en": "But we have a problem here.",
          "zh": "但我們這裡有一個問題。"
        },
        {
          "id": 48,
          "start": 149.81,
          "end": 153.57,
          "en": "The classes vue wants to add are added",
          "zh": "Vue 想加上的 classes 會被加到"
        },
        {
          "id": 49,
          "start": 153.57,
          "end": 156.71,
          "en": "to the root element of your custom component.",
          "zh": "你的自訂元件的根元素。"
        },
        {
          "id": 50,
          "start": 156.71,
          "end": 159.55,
          "en": "This is ,this attribute fall through behavior",
          "zh": "這是屬性 fallthrough 行為，"
        },
        {
          "id": 51,
          "start": 159.55,
          "end": 161.023,
          "en": "I talked about earlier.",
          "zh": "我先前談過的。"
        },
        {
          "id": 52,
          "start": 162.7,
          "end": 165.28,
          "en": "So these classes transition wants to add",
          "zh": "所以 transition 想加上的這些 classes"
        },
        {
          "id": 53,
          "start": 165.28,
          "end": 167.98,
          "en": "fall through to the root element",
          "zh": "會落到根元素上，"
        },
        {
          "id": 54,
          "start": 167.98,
          "end": 170.15,
          "en": "in the template of base-model.",
          "zh": "在 BaseModal 的範本裡。"
        },
        {
          "id": 55,
          "start": 170.15,
          "end": 174.013,
          "en": "But base-model happens to have two root elements.",
          "zh": "但 BaseModal 剛好有兩個根元素。"
        },
        {
          "id": 56,
          "start": 174.013,
          "end": 177.23,
          "en": "There's div and there's dialogue.",
          "zh": "有 div，也有 dialog。"
        },
        {
          "id": 57,
          "start": 177.23,
          "end": 180.04,
          "en": "If we comment out the div for a second,",
          "zh": "如果我們把 div 註解掉一秒，"
        },
        {
          "id": 58,
          "start": 180.04,
          "end": 183.24,
          "en": "if we remove that div, the backdrop for a second,",
          "zh": "如果我們把那個 div、那個背景拿掉一秒，"
        },
        {
          "id": 59,
          "start": 183.24,
          "end": 186.23,
          "en": "and then reload, you see, it works.",
          "zh": "然後重新載入，你看到，它能運作。"
        },
        {
          "id": 60,
          "start": 186.23,
          "end": 190.79,
          "en": "Now we have this animation for showing the modal.",
          "zh": "現在我們有這個顯示 modal 的動畫。"
        },
        {
          "id": 61,
          "start": 190.79,
          "end": 193.71,
          "en": "But if we have both root elements here,",
          "zh": "但如果我們這裡有兩個根元素，"
        },
        {
          "id": 62,
          "start": 193.71,
          "end": 196.82,
          "en": "which you of course want, then this does not work.",
          "zh": "你當然想要那樣，那麼這就不能運作。"
        },
        {
          "id": 63,
          "start": 196.82,
          "end": 199.886,
          "en": "And it doesn't work because as I mentioned before,",
          "zh": "而它不能運作，是因為如我之前提到的，"
        },
        {
          "id": 64,
          "start": 199.886,
          "end": 204.886,
          "en": "this transition component wants one direct child element.",
          "zh": "這個 transition 元件想要一個直接子元素。"
        },
        {
          "id": 65,
          "start": 206.57999999999998,
          "end": 209.4,
          "en": "Yes, it has just one child element here,",
          "zh": "是的，它在這裡只有一個子元素，"
        },
        {
          "id": 66,
          "start": 209.4,
          "end": 211.41,
          "en": "just one base-model.",
          "zh": "只有一個 BaseModal。"
        },
        {
          "id": 67,
          "start": 211.41,
          "end": 213.4,
          "en": "But of course the base-model here,",
          "zh": "但當然這裡的 BaseModal"
        },
        {
          "id": 68,
          "start": 213.4,
          "end": 216.52,
          "en": "is really just a wrapper around its template,",
          "zh": "真的只是它範本的一個包裝，"
        },
        {
          "id": 69,
          "start": 216.52,
          "end": 219.06,
          "en": "where we have two root elements.",
          "zh": "而我們在那裡有兩個根元素。"
        },
        {
          "id": 70,
          "start": 219.06,
          "end": 223.79,
          "en": "So these two root elements, this div and this dialogue,",
          "zh": "所以這兩個根元素，這個 div 和這個 dialog，"
        },
        {
          "id": 71,
          "start": 223.79,
          "end": 227.11,
          "en": "these are the actual direct child elements",
          "zh": "這些才是真正的直接子元素，"
        },
        {
          "id": 72,
          "start": 227.11,
          "end": 229.62,
          "en": "inside of this transition component.",
          "zh": "在這個 transition 元件裡面。"
        },
        {
          "id": 73,
          "start": 229.62,
          "end": 232.3,
          "en": "Well, and two elements are more than one.",
          "zh": "好，而兩個元素多於一個。"
        },
        {
          "id": 74,
          "start": 232.3,
          "end": 236.34300000000002,
          "en": "That's why this set-up here does not work.",
          "zh": "所以這裡這個設定不能運作。"
        },
        {
          "id": 75,
          "start": 237.62,
          "end": 239.1,
          "en": "What can we do about that?",
          "zh": "對那個我們能做什麼？"
        },
        {
          "id": 76,
          "start": 239.1,
          "end": 241.26,
          "en": "How can we work around that?",
          "zh": "我們如何繞過那個？"
        },
        {
          "id": 77,
          "start": 241.26,
          "end": 243.91,
          "en": "Well, there are various ways of solving this.",
          "zh": "好，有各種解決方式。"
        },
        {
          "id": 78,
          "start": 243.91,
          "end": 247.33,
          "en": "We can, for example, split this into two components",
          "zh": "我們例如可以把這個拆成兩個元件，"
        },
        {
          "id": 79,
          "start": 247.33,
          "end": 250.06,
          "en": "and manage the backdrop separately.",
          "zh": "並分開管理背景。"
        },
        {
          "id": 80,
          "start": 250.06,
          "end": 252.87,
          "en": "But we could also bring this transition component",
          "zh": "但我們也可以把這個 transition 元件"
        },
        {
          "id": 81,
          "start": 252.87,
          "end": 256.35,
          "en": "over to base-model and try using it in there",
          "zh": "搬到 BaseModal，並試著在那裡面使用它，"
        },
        {
          "id": 82,
          "start": 256.35,
          "end": 258.61,
          "en": "to transition to style log.",
          "zh": "來轉場 dialog。"
        },
        {
          "id": 83,
          "start": 258.61,
          "end": 260.63,
          "en": "And that's the route I will take here.",
          "zh": "而那是我在這裡會採取的路線。"
        },
        {
          "id": 84,
          "start": 260.63,
          "end": 262.356,
          "en": "I'll remove the transition wrapper",
          "zh": "我會移除 transition 包裝，"
        },
        {
          "id": 85,
          "start": 262.356,
          "end": 264.423,
          "en": "around my custom component.",
          "zh": "包在我的自訂元件外面的那個。"
        },
        {
          "id": 86,
          "start": 265.5,
          "end": 267.66,
          "en": "Though it theoretically would work,",
          "zh": "雖然它理論上會運作，"
        },
        {
          "id": 87,
          "start": 267.66,
          "end": 270.89,
          "en": "if our custom component had just one root element,",
          "zh": "如果我們的自訂元件只有一個根元素，"
        },
        {
          "id": 88,
          "start": 270.89,
          "end": 273.24,
          "en": "but here it doesn't, so it doesn't work.",
          "zh": "但這裡它沒有，所以它不能運作。"
        },
        {
          "id": 89,
          "start": 273.24,
          "end": 276.06,
          "en": "And I will bring it over to base-model",
          "zh": "而我會把它搬到 BaseModal，"
        },
        {
          "id": 90,
          "start": 276.06,
          "end": 280.95,
          "en": "and wrap this dialogue with transition, like this.",
          "zh": "並像這樣用 transition 包住這個 dialog。"
        },
        {
          "id": 91,
          "start": 282.57,
          "end": 284.972,
          "en": "Now I can give this a name of, modal",
          "zh": "現在我可以給這個名稱 modal，"
        },
        {
          "id": 92,
          "start": 284.972,
          "end": 286.8,
          "en": "and go back to App.vue,",
          "zh": "並回到 App.vue，"
        },
        {
          "id": 93,
          "start": 286.8,
          "end": 290.22,
          "en": "and grab my modal specific CSS classes,",
          "zh": "抓取我的 modal 專用 CSS classes，"
        },
        {
          "id": 94,
          "start": 290.22,
          "end": 293.67,
          "en": "to be precise to modal-enter-active class here,",
          "zh": "精確地說是這裡的 modal-enter-active class，"
        },
        {
          "id": 95,
          "start": 293.67,
          "end": 296.17,
          "en": "we can remove them from App.vue,",
          "zh": "我們可以把它們從 App.vue 移除，"
        },
        {
          "id": 96,
          "start": 296.17,
          "end": 299.33,
          "en": "remove the modal keyframes from App.vue",
          "zh": "把 modal keyframes 從 App.vue 移除，"
        },
        {
          "id": 97,
          "start": 299.33,
          "end": 302.26,
          "en": "and bring all of that over to BaseModal.vue.",
          "zh": "並把這一切搬到 BaseModal.vue。"
        },
        {
          "id": 98,
          "start": 302.26,
          "end": 304.65,
          "en": "There, we already got the modal keyframes,",
          "zh": "在那裡，我們已經有 modal keyframes，"
        },
        {
          "id": 99,
          "start": 304.65,
          "end": 307.63,
          "en": "and now I'm also adding the modal-enter-active class,",
          "zh": "而現在我也加上 modal-enter-active class，"
        },
        {
          "id": 100,
          "start": 307.63,
          "end": 309.67,
          "en": "which points at the modal keyframes",
          "zh": "它指向 modal keyframes，"
        },
        {
          "id": 101,
          "start": 309.67,
          "end": 311.423,
          "en": "to play it as an animation.",
          "zh": "把它當作動畫播放。"
        },
        {
          "id": 102,
          "start": 313.18,
          "end": 315.45,
          "en": "Now, however, we need to change the logic,",
          "zh": "現在，不過，我們需要改變邏輯，"
        },
        {
          "id": 103,
          "start": 315.45,
          "end": 318.02,
          "en": "how this base-model opens.",
          "zh": "這個 BaseModal 如何開啟。"
        },
        {
          "id": 104,
          "start": 318.02,
          "end": 320.91,
          "en": "At the moment, I'm adding the base-model component",
          "zh": "目前，我正在加上 BaseModal 元件，"
        },
        {
          "id": 105,
          "start": 320.91,
          "end": 324.09,
          "en": "in App.vue with v-if.",
          "zh": "在 App.vue 裡用 v-if。"
        },
        {
          "id": 106,
          "start": 324.09,
          "end": 327.54,
          "en": "And this won't work, if I want to use transition",
          "zh": "而這不能運作，如果我想在"
        },
        {
          "id": 107,
          "start": 327.54,
          "end": 329.59,
          "en": "inside of the base-model template",
          "zh": "BaseModal 範本裡面使用 transition，"
        },
        {
          "id": 108,
          "start": 329.59,
          "end": 332.95,
          "en": "to animate the addition and remove of dialogue.",
          "zh": "來為 dialog 的加上和移除加上動畫。"
        },
        {
          "id": 109,
          "start": 332.95,
          "end": 335.75,
          "en": "If transition is part of that template,",
          "zh": "如果 transition 是那個範本的一部分，"
        },
        {
          "id": 110,
          "start": 335.75,
          "end": 337.88,
          "en": "which has added and removed with v-if,",
          "zh": "而那個範本用 v-if 被加上和移除，"
        },
        {
          "id": 111,
          "start": 337.88,
          "end": 339.563,
          "en": "it won't have any effect.",
          "zh": "它不會有任何效果。"
        },
        {
          "id": 112,
          "start": 340.40999999999997,
          "end": 343.92,
          "en": "Therefore I'll now open and close the modal differently.",
          "zh": "因此我現在會用不同方式開啟和關閉 modal。"
        },
        {
          "id": 113,
          "start": 343.92,
          "end": 348.92,
          "en": "I'll add a new open prop, to my base-model component",
          "zh": "我會給我的 BaseModal 元件加一個新的 open prop，"
        },
        {
          "id": 114,
          "start": 349.11,
          "end": 351.85,
          "en": "and point at dialogue is visible there.",
          "zh": "並在那裡指向 dialogIsVisible。"
        },
        {
          "id": 115,
          "start": 351.85,
          "end": 355.55,
          "en": "So forward, the dialogue is visible property",
          "zh": "所以把 dialogIsVisible 屬性轉送"
        },
        {
          "id": 116,
          "start": 355.55,
          "end": 359.453,
          "en": "through the open prop to the base-model component.",
          "zh": "透過 open prop 到 BaseModal 元件。"
        },
        {
          "id": 117,
          "start": 361.14,
          "end": 363.76,
          "en": "And now in the base-model component,",
          "zh": "而現在在 BaseModal 元件裡，"
        },
        {
          "id": 118,
          "start": 363.76,
          "end": 367.09,
          "en": "we can accept this prop here.",
          "zh": "我們可以在這裡接受這個 prop。"
        },
        {
          "id": 119,
          "start": 367.09,
          "end": 369.753,
          "en": "So expect the open prop here.",
          "zh": "所以在這裡預期 open prop。"
        },
        {
          "id": 120,
          "start": 369.753,
          "end": 372.37,
          "en": "And now that we're getting it,",
          "zh": "而現在我們得到它了，"
        },
        {
          "id": 121,
          "start": 372.37,
          "end": 376.51,
          "en": "we can simply add it here with v-if.",
          "zh": "我們可以在這裡用 v-if 把它加上。"
        },
        {
          "id": 122,
          "start": 376.51,
          "end": 379.15,
          "en": "We can check open, so does open prop,",
          "zh": "我們可以檢查 open，所以是 open prop，"
        },
        {
          "id": 123,
          "start": 379.15,
          "end": 382.03,
          "en": "which is true or false, to control whether or not",
          "zh": "它是 true 或 false，用來控制"
        },
        {
          "id": 124,
          "start": 382.03,
          "end": 383.783,
          "en": "the dialogue is visible or not.",
          "zh": "dialog 是否可見。"
        },
        {
          "id": 125,
          "start": 384.86,
          "end": 388.7,
          "en": "So now the base-model component is always added",
          "zh": "所以現在 BaseModal 元件始終被加到"
        },
        {
          "id": 126,
          "start": 388.7,
          "end": 390.6,
          "en": "to the App.vue template,",
          "zh": "App.vue 範本，"
        },
        {
          "id": 127,
          "start": 390.6,
          "end": 393.11,
          "en": "but inside of that base-model template,",
          "zh": "但在那個 BaseModal 範本裡面，"
        },
        {
          "id": 128,
          "start": 393.11,
          "end": 396.24,
          "en": "the dialogue is still controlled with v-if.",
          "zh": "dialog 仍然用 v-if 控制。"
        },
        {
          "id": 129,
          "start": 396.24,
          "end": 398.23,
          "en": "But now it's wrapped in a transition,",
          "zh": "但現在它被包在一個 transition 裡，"
        },
        {
          "id": 130,
          "start": 398.23,
          "end": 401.763,
          "en": "and now this transition has only one direct child.",
          "zh": "而現在這個 transition 只有一個直接子元素。"
        },
        {
          "id": 131,
          "start": 403.03,
          "end": 406.3,
          "en": "And of course, we also want to add v-if here to the div,",
          "zh": "而當然，我們也想在這裡的 div 上加上 v-if，"
        },
        {
          "id": 132,
          "start": 406.3,
          "end": 409.68,
          "en": "and pass the open prop to v-if as well,",
          "zh": "並把 open prop 也傳給 v-if，"
        },
        {
          "id": 133,
          "start": 409.68,
          "end": 412.113,
          "en": "to control the visibility of the backdrop.",
          "zh": "來控制背景的可見性。"
        },
        {
          "id": 134,
          "start": 413.76,
          "end": 417.75,
          "en": "And now finally, if we reload, we got this animation",
          "zh": "而現在終於，如果我們重新載入，我們得到這個動畫，"
        },
        {
          "id": 135,
          "start": 417.75,
          "end": 419.623,
          "en": "and everything works properly.",
          "zh": "而一切都正常運作。"
        },
        {
          "id": 136,
          "start": 421.38,
          "end": 425.65,
          "en": "And we can, of course now also work on a closing animation.",
          "zh": "而我們現在當然也可以做關閉動畫。"
        },
        {
          "id": 137,
          "start": 425.65,
          "end": 429.17,
          "en": "We can add modal-leave-active here,",
          "zh": "我們可以在這裡加上 modal-leave-active，"
        },
        {
          "id": 138,
          "start": 429.17,
          "end": 431.64,
          "en": "and play the same animation.",
          "zh": "並播放相同的動畫。"
        },
        {
          "id": 139,
          "start": 431.64,
          "end": 434.74,
          "en": "Let's say with an ease-in function,",
          "zh": "比方說用一個 ease-in 函式，"
        },
        {
          "id": 140,
          "start": 434.74,
          "end": 436.64,
          "en": "just to keep things simple.",
          "zh": "只是讓事情保持簡單。"
        },
        {
          "id": 141,
          "start": 436.64,
          "end": 438.09,
          "en": "Of course, we could also play",
          "zh": "當然，我們也可以在這裡播放"
        },
        {
          "id": 142,
          "start": 438.09,
          "end": 439.97,
          "en": "a totally different animation here,",
          "zh": "一個完全不同的動畫，"
        },
        {
          "id": 143,
          "start": 439.97,
          "end": 441.56,
          "en": "or a set-up a transition",
          "zh": "或藉由也使用 from 和 to classes"
        },
        {
          "id": 144,
          "start": 441.56,
          "end": 445.01,
          "en": "by also using the from and to classes.",
          "zh": "來設定一個 transition。"
        },
        {
          "id": 145,
          "start": 445.01,
          "end": 448.21,
          "en": "But if I do it like that, if I now reload,",
          "zh": "但如果我像那樣做，如果我現在重新載入，"
        },
        {
          "id": 146,
          "start": 448.21,
          "end": 452.78,
          "en": "we got a animation for opening, and also for closing.",
          "zh": "我們有開啟的動畫，也有關閉的。"
        },
        {
          "id": 147,
          "start": 452.78,
          "end": 454.95,
          "en": "Now the closing animation, certainly is a bit off",
          "zh": "現在關閉動畫確實有點不對，"
        },
        {
          "id": 148,
          "start": 454.95,
          "end": 457.763,
          "en": "because I'm just re-using the opening animation,",
          "zh": "因為我只是重複使用開啟動畫，"
        },
        {
          "id": 149,
          "start": 458.63,
          "end": 462.55,
          "en": "but we can add the reverse value here to this animation",
          "zh": "但我們可以在這裡這個動畫上加上 reverse 值，"
        },
        {
          "id": 150,
          "start": 462.55,
          "end": 465.49,
          "en": "on modal-leave-active, to tell CSS,",
          "zh": "在 modal-leave-active 上，告訴 CSS"
        },
        {
          "id": 151,
          "start": 465.49,
          "end": 468.25,
          "en": "to actually play this animation in reverse,",
          "zh": "實際以相反方向播放這個動畫，"
        },
        {
          "id": 152,
          "start": 468.25,
          "end": 472.23,
          "en": "for this case here, for this CSS class selector.",
          "zh": "對這裡這個情況，對這個 CSS class 選擇器。"
        },
        {
          "id": 153,
          "start": 472.23,
          "end": 475.62,
          "en": "So that it will start at, to and go to, from,",
          "zh": "所以它會從 to 開始，前往 from，"
        },
        {
          "id": 154,
          "start": 475.62,
          "end": 477.113,
          "en": "if you add reverse.",
          "zh": "如果你加上 reverse。"
        },
        {
          "id": 155,
          "start": 478.51,
          "end": 481.5,
          "en": "And with that, if I save that and reload,",
          "zh": "而有了那個，如果我儲存並重新載入，"
        },
        {
          "id": 156,
          "start": 481.5,
          "end": 485.54,
          "en": "we've got a nice animation for opening and also for closing.",
          "zh": "我們有一個不錯的開啟動畫，也有關閉的。"
        },
        {
          "id": 157,
          "start": 485.54,
          "end": 488.43,
          "en": "And now, that is enabled with help of transition.",
          "zh": "而現在，那是靠 transition 的幫助才啟用的。"
        },
        {
          "id": 158,
          "start": 488.43,
          "end": 490.4,
          "en": "Keeping in mind, that transition",
          "zh": "記住，transition"
        },
        {
          "id": 159,
          "start": 490.4,
          "end": 493.3,
          "en": "must only have one direct child element.",
          "zh": "必須只有一個直接子元素。"
        },
        {
          "id": 160,
          "start": 493.3,
          "end": 495.95,
          "en": "And therefore, we had to restructure this a bit,",
          "zh": "因此我們必須把這個重新調整一點，"
        },
        {
          "id": 161,
          "start": 495.95,
          "end": 498.51,
          "en": "and I hope it's clear why we had to do it.",
          "zh": "而我希望為什麼我們必須這樣做是清楚的。"
        },
        {
          "id": 162,
          "start": 498.51,
          "end": 500.84,
          "en": "But with that, we now got a nice transition",
          "zh": "但有了那個，我們現在得到一個不錯的轉場，"
        },
        {
          "id": 163,
          "start": 500.84,
          "end": 503.36,
          "en": "for opening and for closing.",
          "zh": "給開啟，也給關閉。"
        },
        {
          "id": 164,
          "start": 503.36,
          "end": 505.61,
          "en": "So for adding and for removing,",
          "zh": "所以給加上，也給移除，"
        },
        {
          "id": 165,
          "start": 505.61,
          "end": 507.163,
          "en": "this element to the done.",
          "zh": "把這個元素加到 DOM。"
        },
        {
          "id": 166,
          "start": 509.22,
          "end": 511.192,
          "en": "Now I'll dive into some cases,",
          "zh": "現在我會深入一些情況，"
        },
        {
          "id": 167,
          "start": 511.192,
          "end": 513.76,
          "en": "where we actually are allowed to have",
          "zh": "我們其實被允許有"
        },
        {
          "id": 168,
          "start": 513.76,
          "end": 516.523,
          "en": "more than one element inside of transition.",
          "zh": "transition 裡面不只一個元素。"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "21879492",
      "title": "Transitioning Between Multiple Elements",
      "lectureOrder": 202,
      "videoOrder": 177,
      "sourceHash": "220452f3ba3e4d6bed4c0abf3519a7317e27373bdee51b9ababd2ef872252866",
      "cues": [
        {
          "id": 1,
          "start": 2.25,
          "end": 5.33,
          "en": "So, I always emphasized that transition",
          "zh": "所以，我一直強調 transition"
        },
        {
          "id": 2,
          "start": 5.33,
          "end": 8.14,
          "en": "must only have one direct child element,",
          "zh": "必須只有一個直接子元素，"
        },
        {
          "id": 3,
          "start": 8.14,
          "end": 9.24,
          "en": "and because of that,",
          "zh": "而因為那樣，"
        },
        {
          "id": 4,
          "start": 9.24,
          "end": 13.51,
          "en": "we had to change our Base Modal a little bit here,",
          "zh": "我們必須在這裡把 BaseModal 改一點，"
        },
        {
          "id": 5,
          "start": 13.51,
          "end": 15.04,
          "en": "to ensure that transition",
          "zh": "以確保 transition"
        },
        {
          "id": 6,
          "start": 15.04,
          "end": 17.633,
          "en": "has only one direct child element.",
          "zh": "只有一個直接子元素。"
        },
        {
          "id": 7,
          "start": 19.25,
          "end": 22.72,
          "en": "Well, actually there are exceptions to that rule,",
          "zh": "好，其實那條規則有例外，"
        },
        {
          "id": 8,
          "start": 22.72,
          "end": 24.95,
          "en": "there is a scenario where you might",
          "zh": "有一個情境，你可能"
        },
        {
          "id": 9,
          "start": 24.95,
          "end": 27.936,
          "en": "have more than one direct child element,",
          "zh": "有不只一個直接子元素，"
        },
        {
          "id": 10,
          "start": 27.936,
          "end": 29.72,
          "en": "and here it is.",
          "zh": "而這裡就是。"
        },
        {
          "id": 11,
          "start": 29.72,
          "end": 33.21,
          "en": "In App Vue, I'm going to add a new Div",
          "zh": "在 App.vue，我要加一個新的 div，"
        },
        {
          "id": 12,
          "start": 33.21,
          "end": 34.86,
          "en": "with a class of container,",
          "zh": "class 是 container，"
        },
        {
          "id": 13,
          "start": 34.86,
          "end": 37.06,
          "en": "simply to show you a new example",
          "zh": "只是為了示範一個新例子給你看，"
        },
        {
          "id": 14,
          "start": 37.06,
          "end": 38.65,
          "en": "inside of that Div.",
          "zh": "在那個 div 裡面。"
        },
        {
          "id": 15,
          "start": 38.65,
          "end": 41.01,
          "en": "And here, I'll add a good, old button,",
          "zh": "而這裡，我會加一個熟悉的舊按鈕，"
        },
        {
          "id": 16,
          "start": 41.01,
          "end": 44.39,
          "en": "but now we'll animate the button itself,",
          "zh": "但現在我們會為按鈕本身加上動畫，"
        },
        {
          "id": 17,
          "start": 44.39,
          "end": 46.86,
          "en": "and I'll have a button here,",
          "zh": "而我這裡會有一個按鈕，"
        },
        {
          "id": 18,
          "start": 46.86,
          "end": 49.67,
          "en": "where I say, \"Show Users.\", and below that,",
          "zh": "我說「Show Users.」，而在那下面，"
        },
        {
          "id": 19,
          "start": 49.67,
          "end": 53.72,
          "en": "a second button, where I say, \"Hide Users.\".",
          "zh": "第二個按鈕，我說「Hide Users.」。"
        },
        {
          "id": 20,
          "start": 53.72,
          "end": 55.84,
          "en": "Well, at the moment we got no users,",
          "zh": "好，目前我們沒有使用者，"
        },
        {
          "id": 21,
          "start": 55.84,
          "end": 58.17,
          "en": "but for the moment, I simply want to switch",
          "zh": "但目前，我只想切換"
        },
        {
          "id": 22,
          "start": 58.17,
          "end": 60.47,
          "en": "between these two buttons when we click them,",
          "zh": "這兩個按鈕，當我們點它們時，"
        },
        {
          "id": 23,
          "start": 60.47,
          "end": 63.95,
          "en": "so that we simply animate the switch",
          "zh": "好讓我們只是為這個切換加上動畫，"
        },
        {
          "id": 24,
          "start": 63.95,
          "end": 67.35,
          "en": "from show to hide, and back,",
          "zh": "從顯示到隱藏，再回來，"
        },
        {
          "id": 25,
          "start": 67.35,
          "end": 69.03999999999999,
          "en": "because we worked with buttons",
          "zh": "因為我們之前用過按鈕，"
        },
        {
          "id": 26,
          "start": 69.03999999999999,
          "end": 71.43,
          "en": "that change their text before,",
          "zh": "那些會改變文字的，"
        },
        {
          "id": 27,
          "start": 71.43,
          "end": 73.69,
          "en": "but whenever we had such a button,",
          "zh": "但每當我們有這樣的按鈕，"
        },
        {
          "id": 28,
          "start": 73.69,
          "end": 76.51,
          "en": "the text on the button changed instantly,",
          "zh": "按鈕上的文字會立刻改變，"
        },
        {
          "id": 29,
          "start": 76.51,
          "end": 78.6,
          "en": "and we had no animation for that.",
          "zh": "而我們沒有那個的動畫。"
        },
        {
          "id": 30,
          "start": 78.6,
          "end": 79.56,
          "en": "You might not need that,",
          "zh": "你可能不需要那個，"
        },
        {
          "id": 31,
          "start": 79.56,
          "end": 82.36,
          "en": "but if you do, you can build this",
          "zh": "但如果你需要，你可以建立這個，"
        },
        {
          "id": 32,
          "start": 82.36,
          "end": 84.10300000000001,
          "en": "with the transition component.",
          "zh": "用 transition 元件。"
        },
        {
          "id": 33,
          "start": 85.22,
          "end": 86.053,
          "en": "So first of all,",
          "zh": "所以首先，"
        },
        {
          "id": 34,
          "start": 86.053,
          "end": 88.42,
          "en": "let's make sure we switch between these buttons,",
          "zh": "讓我們確定我們在這些按鈕之間切換，"
        },
        {
          "id": 35,
          "start": 88.42,
          "end": 90.81,
          "en": "for that we can add click listeners here,",
          "zh": "為此我們可以在這裡加上 click 監聽器，"
        },
        {
          "id": 36,
          "start": 90.81,
          "end": 93.69,
          "en": "point at Show Users, on the first button,",
          "zh": "在第一個按鈕上指向 showUsers，"
        },
        {
          "id": 37,
          "start": 93.69,
          "end": 97.2,
          "en": "and then here at Hide Users.",
          "zh": "然後這裡指向 hideUsers。"
        },
        {
          "id": 38,
          "start": 97.2,
          "end": 99.39,
          "en": "So, Show Users and Hide Users,",
          "zh": "所以 showUsers 和 hideUsers，"
        },
        {
          "id": 39,
          "start": 99.39,
          "end": 102.203,
          "en": "these are 2 methods we now need to add,",
          "zh": "這是我們現在需要加上的兩個方法，"
        },
        {
          "id": 40,
          "start": 103.25,
          "end": 105.65,
          "en": "and we also need a new data property here,",
          "zh": "而我們這裡也需要一個新的 data 屬性，"
        },
        {
          "id": 41,
          "start": 105.65,
          "end": 109.19,
          "en": "which controls in which mode we are at the moment,",
          "zh": "它控制我們目前在哪種模式，"
        },
        {
          "id": 42,
          "start": 109.19,
          "end": 113.12,
          "en": "users are visible, could be the name of that property,",
          "zh": "usersAreVisible 可以是那個屬性的名稱，"
        },
        {
          "id": 43,
          "start": 113.12,
          "end": 115.05,
          "en": "initially it's false let's say,",
          "zh": "一開始比方說是 false，"
        },
        {
          "id": 44,
          "start": 115.05,
          "end": 119.02000000000001,
          "en": "and then we have a method, Show Users,",
          "zh": "然後我們有一個方法 showUsers，"
        },
        {
          "id": 45,
          "start": 119.02000000000001,
          "end": 124.02,
          "en": "where I simply set these users are visible to true,",
          "zh": "我只是把 usersAreVisible 設成 true，"
        },
        {
          "id": 46,
          "start": 124.15,
          "end": 127.38,
          "en": "and Hide Users, which is that other method",
          "zh": "以及 hideUsers，也就是另一個方法，"
        },
        {
          "id": 47,
          "start": 127.38,
          "end": 129.93,
          "en": "we're pointing at from the other button,",
          "zh": "我們從另一個按鈕指向它，"
        },
        {
          "id": 48,
          "start": 129.93,
          "end": 133.043,
          "en": "and here we can set users are visible to false.",
          "zh": "而在這裡我們可以把 usersAreVisible 設成 false。"
        },
        {
          "id": 49,
          "start": 134.73,
          "end": 136.78,
          "en": "So, this is just some dummy code,",
          "zh": "所以這只是一些示範程式碼，"
        },
        {
          "id": 50,
          "start": 136.78,
          "end": 139.62,
          "en": "but with that, we are controlling the users",
          "zh": "但有了那個，我們正在控制 usersAreVisible"
        },
        {
          "id": 51,
          "start": 139.62,
          "end": 142.943,
          "en": "are visible property here, the data property,",
          "zh": "屬性，也就是這裡的 data 屬性，"
        },
        {
          "id": 52,
          "start": 143.8,
          "end": 147,
          "en": "and we can now control which button should be visible",
          "zh": "而我們現在可以控制哪個按鈕應該可見，"
        },
        {
          "id": 53,
          "start": 147,
          "end": 149.04,
          "en": "based on that property.",
          "zh": "依那個屬性而定。"
        },
        {
          "id": 54,
          "start": 149.04,
          "end": 151.65,
          "en": "The first button here should be visible",
          "zh": "這裡第一個按鈕應該可見，"
        },
        {
          "id": 55,
          "start": 151.65,
          "end": 154.8,
          "en": "if users are visible,",
          "zh": "如果 usersAreVisible"
        },
        {
          "id": 56,
          "start": 154.8,
          "end": 156.48,
          "en": "is false,",
          "zh": "是 false，"
        },
        {
          "id": 57,
          "start": 156.48,
          "end": 158.38,
          "en": "because if they are not visible,",
          "zh": "因為如果它們不可見，"
        },
        {
          "id": 58,
          "start": 158.38,
          "end": 160.86,
          "en": "I want to show the Show Users button,",
          "zh": "我想顯示 Show Users 按鈕，"
        },
        {
          "id": 59,
          "start": 160.86,
          "end": 162.143,
          "en": "so that we show them.",
          "zh": "好讓我們顯示它們。"
        },
        {
          "id": 60,
          "start": 163.09,
          "end": 164.49,
          "en": "The other button there for",
          "zh": "因此另一個按鈕"
        },
        {
          "id": 61,
          "start": 164.49,
          "end": 167.32,
          "en": "is shown if users are visible, is true.",
          "zh": "在 usersAreVisible 是 true 時顯示。"
        },
        {
          "id": 62,
          "start": 167.32,
          "end": 169.21,
          "en": "If we see the users at the moment,",
          "zh": "如果我們目前看得到使用者，"
        },
        {
          "id": 63,
          "start": 169.21,
          "end": 171.263,
          "en": "I want to show a Hide Users button.",
          "zh": "我想顯示一個 Hide Users 按鈕。"
        },
        {
          "id": 64,
          "start": 172.21,
          "end": 173.86,
          "en": "With that, if we save this,",
          "zh": "有了那個，如果我們儲存，"
        },
        {
          "id": 65,
          "start": 173.86,
          "end": 175.31,
          "en": "we got this new button,",
          "zh": "我們得到這個新按鈕，"
        },
        {
          "id": 66,
          "start": 175.31,
          "end": 178.31,
          "en": "we can click it to switch between these buttons.",
          "zh": "我們可以點它，在這些按鈕之間切換。"
        },
        {
          "id": 67,
          "start": 178.31,
          "end": 180.73,
          "en": "In reality, that of course would do something else",
          "zh": "在現實中，那當然也會在頁面上做別的事，"
        },
        {
          "id": 68,
          "start": 180.73,
          "end": 184.16,
          "en": "on the page as well, show a list of users for example,",
          "zh": "例如顯示一份使用者清單，"
        },
        {
          "id": 69,
          "start": 184.16,
          "end": 186.83,
          "en": "but here I just want to focus on the transition",
          "zh": "但這裡我只想聚焦在這兩個按鈕之間的"
        },
        {
          "id": 70,
          "start": 186.83,
          "end": 189.01,
          "en": "between these 2 buttons,",
          "zh": "轉場，"
        },
        {
          "id": 71,
          "start": 189.01,
          "end": 192.28,
          "en": "and I already said it on the transition.",
          "zh": "而我已經在 transition 上說過。"
        },
        {
          "id": 72,
          "start": 192.28,
          "end": 194.86,
          "en": "At the moment, it's an instant change,",
          "zh": "目前，它是一個瞬間變化，"
        },
        {
          "id": 73,
          "start": 194.86,
          "end": 197.34,
          "en": "which might or might not be what you want,",
          "zh": "那可能是、也可能不是你想要的，"
        },
        {
          "id": 74,
          "start": 197.34,
          "end": 198.64,
          "en": "but if you don't want it,",
          "zh": "但如果你不想要它，"
        },
        {
          "id": 75,
          "start": 198.64,
          "end": 200.49,
          "en": "if you want to animate this,",
          "zh": "如果你想為這個加上動畫，"
        },
        {
          "id": 76,
          "start": 200.49,
          "end": 204.7,
          "en": "you can use the transition component for that,",
          "zh": "你可以用 transition 元件來做，"
        },
        {
          "id": 77,
          "start": 204.7,
          "end": 207.233,
          "en": "and wrap it around these 2 buttons,",
          "zh": "並把它包在這兩個按鈕外面，"
        },
        {
          "id": 78,
          "start": 208.21,
          "end": 210,
          "en": "and you heard that right,",
          "zh": "而你沒聽錯，"
        },
        {
          "id": 79,
          "start": 210,
          "end": 213.24,
          "en": "around these 2 buttons.",
          "zh": "包在這兩個按鈕外面。"
        },
        {
          "id": 80,
          "start": 213.24,
          "end": 215.02,
          "en": "There is one exception,",
          "zh": "有一個例外，"
        },
        {
          "id": 81,
          "start": 215.02,
          "end": 217.94,
          "en": "where you are allowed to have more than one",
          "zh": "你被允許有不只一個"
        },
        {
          "id": 82,
          "start": 217.94,
          "end": 221.56,
          "en": "direct child element inside of your transition component,",
          "zh": "直接子元素，在你的 transition 元件裡面，"
        },
        {
          "id": 83,
          "start": 221.56,
          "end": 223.74,
          "en": "and that is the exception here.",
          "zh": "而那就是這裡的例外。"
        },
        {
          "id": 84,
          "start": 223.74,
          "end": 224.82,
          "en": "The exception is,",
          "zh": "例外是，"
        },
        {
          "id": 85,
          "start": 224.82,
          "end": 228.67000000000002,
          "en": "if of the child elements you have in your transition,",
          "zh": "如果你在 transition 裡擁有的子元素，"
        },
        {
          "id": 86,
          "start": 228.67000000000002,
          "end": 231.086,
          "en": "you're guaranteed that at most one",
          "zh": "你保證最多只有一個"
        },
        {
          "id": 87,
          "start": 231.086,
          "end": 235.4,
          "en": "is added to the real dom at the same time,",
          "zh": "同時被加到真正的 DOM，"
        },
        {
          "id": 88,
          "start": 235.4,
          "end": 236.85,
          "en": "and that's the case here.",
          "zh": "而這裡就是那樣。"
        },
        {
          "id": 89,
          "start": 236.85,
          "end": 239.66,
          "en": "We got 2 alternatives If statements,",
          "zh": "我們有兩個互斥的 v-if，"
        },
        {
          "id": 90,
          "start": 239.66,
          "end": 241.35,
          "en": "and therefore we guarantee",
          "zh": "因此我們保證"
        },
        {
          "id": 91,
          "start": 241.35,
          "end": 243.62,
          "en": "that only one of these 2 buttons",
          "zh": "這兩個按鈕只有一個"
        },
        {
          "id": 92,
          "start": 243.62,
          "end": 246.823,
          "en": "will be added to the real dom at a time.",
          "zh": "會在同一時間被加到真正的 DOM。"
        },
        {
          "id": 93,
          "start": 247.76,
          "end": 250.32,
          "en": "So, if you use transition around elements",
          "zh": "所以，如果你把 transition 用在那些元素外面，"
        },
        {
          "id": 94,
          "start": 250.32,
          "end": 252.18,
          "en": "where only one is added,",
          "zh": "只有一個被加上，"
        },
        {
          "id": 95,
          "start": 252.18,
          "end": 254.02,
          "en": "then this is okay.",
          "zh": "那麼這沒問題。"
        },
        {
          "id": 96,
          "start": 254.02,
          "end": 258.1,
          "en": "If there is a chance of both buttons being added",
          "zh": "如果有機會兩個按鈕都被加到"
        },
        {
          "id": 97,
          "start": 258.1,
          "end": 259.72,
          "en": "to the page at the same,",
          "zh": "頁面上，在同一時間，"
        },
        {
          "id": 98,
          "start": 259.72,
          "end": 261.33,
          "en": "then this is not okay.",
          "zh": "那麼這就不行。"
        },
        {
          "id": 99,
          "start": 261.33,
          "end": 263.95,
          "en": "So, if we had the same If condition here,",
          "zh": "所以，如果我們這裡有相同的 v-if 條件，"
        },
        {
          "id": 100,
          "start": 263.95,
          "end": 265.32,
          "en": "then this would not be okay,",
          "zh": "那麼這就不行，"
        },
        {
          "id": 101,
          "start": 265.32,
          "end": 268.77,
          "en": "because now both buttons would be part of the page,",
          "zh": "因為現在兩個按鈕都會成為頁面的一部分，"
        },
        {
          "id": 102,
          "start": 268.77,
          "end": 271.87,
          "en": "but if we have the opposite If conditions here,",
          "zh": "但如果我們這裡有相反的 v-if 條件，"
        },
        {
          "id": 103,
          "start": 271.87,
          "end": 273.233,
          "en": "then this is okay.",
          "zh": "那麼這沒問題。"
        },
        {
          "id": 104,
          "start": 274.42,
          "end": 276.913,
          "en": "Now, let's add a nice, little transition here.",
          "zh": "現在，讓我們在這裡加一個不錯的小轉場。"
        },
        {
          "id": 105,
          "start": 278.25,
          "end": 281.64,
          "en": "Fade-button is the prefix I will use here,",
          "zh": "fade-button 是我在這裡會用的前綴，"
        },
        {
          "id": 106,
          "start": 281.64,
          "end": 284.42,
          "en": "but as always, this is totally up to you,",
          "zh": "但一如往常，這完全由你決定，"
        },
        {
          "id": 107,
          "start": 284.42,
          "end": 287.85,
          "en": "and now down there in the style code,",
          "zh": "而現在在下面的樣式程式碼裡，"
        },
        {
          "id": 108,
          "start": 287.85,
          "end": 288.9,
          "en": "maybe here,",
          "zh": "也許這裡，"
        },
        {
          "id": 109,
          "start": 288.9,
          "end": 293.173,
          "en": "I'll add fade-button-enter-from,",
          "zh": "我會加上 fade-button-enter-from，"
        },
        {
          "id": 110,
          "start": 294.6,
          "end": 296.128,
          "en": "and then copy this to all",
          "zh": "然後把這個複製到所有"
        },
        {
          "id": 111,
          "start": 296.128,
          "end": 298.67,
          "en": "the active,",
          "zh": "active"
        },
        {
          "id": 112,
          "start": 298.67,
          "end": 300.423,
          "en": "and two classes,",
          "zh": "和 to classes，"
        },
        {
          "id": 113,
          "start": 301.46,
          "end": 303.01,
          "en": "and let's say we want to start",
          "zh": "而比方說我們想從"
        },
        {
          "id": 114,
          "start": 303.01,
          "end": 305.58,
          "en": "with an invisible button,",
          "zh": "一個不可見的按鈕開始，"
        },
        {
          "id": 115,
          "start": 305.58,
          "end": 309.59,
          "en": "then we want to go to a visible button,",
          "zh": "然後我們想前往一個可見的按鈕，"
        },
        {
          "id": 116,
          "start": 309.59,
          "end": 311.72,
          "en": "and we want to animate this",
          "zh": "而我們想為這個加上動畫，"
        },
        {
          "id": 117,
          "start": 311.72,
          "end": 313.68,
          "en": "with the transition property",
          "zh": "用 transition 屬性，"
        },
        {
          "id": 118,
          "start": 313.68,
          "end": 316.24,
          "en": "where we watch the opacity property,",
          "zh": "我們在那裡監看 opacity 屬性，"
        },
        {
          "id": 119,
          "start": 316.24,
          "end": 318.87,
          "en": "and whenever that changes, because it does here.",
          "zh": "而每當那個改變，因為它在這裡確實改變。"
        },
        {
          "id": 120,
          "start": 318.87,
          "end": 320.175,
          "en": "Whenever that changes,",
          "zh": "每當那個改變，"
        },
        {
          "id": 121,
          "start": 320.175,
          "end": 325.175,
          "en": "let's see us animate that change over 0.3 seconds,",
          "zh": "讓我們把那個變更的動畫設成歷時 0.3 秒，"
        },
        {
          "id": 122,
          "start": 325.23,
          "end": 327.26,
          "en": "and now we can also add the classes",
          "zh": "而現在我們也可以加上那些 classes，"
        },
        {
          "id": 123,
          "start": 327.26,
          "end": 328.62,
          "en": "for removing a button,",
          "zh": "用來移除一個按鈕，"
        },
        {
          "id": 124,
          "start": 328.62,
          "end": 330.09,
          "en": "and now for the first time,",
          "zh": "而現在第一次，"
        },
        {
          "id": 125,
          "start": 330.09,
          "end": 331.91,
          "en": "I will reuse some code,",
          "zh": "我會重複使用一些程式碼，"
        },
        {
          "id": 126,
          "start": 331.91,
          "end": 334.08,
          "en": "because my Enter-From state",
          "zh": "因為我的 enter-from 狀態"
        },
        {
          "id": 127,
          "start": 334.08,
          "end": 336.9,
          "en": "is also my Leave-To state.",
          "zh": "也是我的 leave-to 狀態。"
        },
        {
          "id": 128,
          "start": 336.9,
          "end": 338.55,
          "en": "My Enter-To state",
          "zh": "我的 enter-to 狀態"
        },
        {
          "id": 129,
          "start": 338.55,
          "end": 343.23,
          "en": "is also my Leave-From state,",
          "zh": "也是我的 leave-from 狀態，"
        },
        {
          "id": 130,
          "start": 343.23,
          "end": 346.56,
          "en": "and I will have a separate active state though,",
          "zh": "而我會有一個分開的 active 狀態，"
        },
        {
          "id": 131,
          "start": 346.56,
          "end": 349.17,
          "en": "because I want to use a different easing function,",
          "zh": "因為我想使用不同的 easing 函式，"
        },
        {
          "id": 132,
          "start": 349.17,
          "end": 352.61,
          "en": "so Fade-Button-Leave-Active,",
          "zh": "所以 fade-button-leave-active，"
        },
        {
          "id": 133,
          "start": 352.61,
          "end": 355.09000000000003,
          "en": "there I set up a transition",
          "zh": "在那裡我設定一個 transition，"
        },
        {
          "id": 134,
          "start": 355.09000000000003,
          "end": 358.40999999999997,
          "en": "watching the opacity over 0.3 seconds",
          "zh": "監看 opacity，歷時 0.3 秒，"
        },
        {
          "id": 135,
          "start": 358.40999999999997,
          "end": 361.03,
          "en": "with an ease-in function.",
          "zh": "用一個 ease-in 函式。"
        },
        {
          "id": 136,
          "start": 361.03,
          "end": 362.93,
          "en": "If I would use ease-out here,",
          "zh": "如果我在這裡使用 ease-out，"
        },
        {
          "id": 137,
          "start": 362.93,
          "end": 364.77,
          "en": "we could of course also have merged it",
          "zh": "我們當然也可以把它合併"
        },
        {
          "id": 138,
          "start": 364.77,
          "end": 366.33,
          "en": "with this CSS rule,",
          "zh": "到這個 CSS 規則，"
        },
        {
          "id": 139,
          "start": 366.33,
          "end": 368.123,
          "en": "but I want to use ease-in here.",
          "zh": "但我想在這裡使用 ease-in。"
        },
        {
          "id": 140,
          "start": 369.37,
          "end": 371.5,
          "en": "So now, here I am reusing a little bit of code,",
          "zh": "所以現在，這裡我重複使用一點程式碼，"
        },
        {
          "id": 141,
          "start": 371.5,
          "end": 373.62,
          "en": "instead of writing everything twice,",
          "zh": "不再把每件事寫兩次，"
        },
        {
          "id": 142,
          "start": 373.62,
          "end": 375.91,
          "en": "I did it before to be more explicit,",
          "zh": "我之前那樣做是為了更明確，"
        },
        {
          "id": 143,
          "start": 375.91,
          "end": 377.7,
          "en": "but now I think we got the idea,",
          "zh": "但現在我想我們懂了，"
        },
        {
          "id": 144,
          "start": 377.7,
          "end": 379.59,
          "en": "so we can write less code here,",
          "zh": "所以我們可以在這裡寫更少程式碼，"
        },
        {
          "id": 145,
          "start": 379.59,
          "end": 381.593,
          "en": "and now if I now save that,",
          "zh": "而現在如果我儲存，"
        },
        {
          "id": 146,
          "start": 382.77,
          "end": 383.97,
          "en": "we got an error.",
          "zh": "我們得到一個錯誤。"
        },
        {
          "id": 147,
          "start": 383.97,
          "end": 386.74,
          "en": "Transition expects exactly one child element",
          "zh": "transition 預期正好一個子元素，"
        },
        {
          "id": 148,
          "start": 386.74,
          "end": 387.96,
          "en": "or an component.",
          "zh": "或一個元件。"
        },
        {
          "id": 149,
          "start": 387.96,
          "end": 390.95,
          "en": "Now, I just emphasized that it would be fine",
          "zh": "現在，我剛強調那會沒問題，"
        },
        {
          "id": 150,
          "start": 390.95,
          "end": 392.31,
          "en": "to have multiple elements,",
          "zh": "有多個元素，"
        },
        {
          "id": 151,
          "start": 392.31,
          "end": 393.93,
          "en": "if we guarantee that only one",
          "zh": "如果我們保證只有一個"
        },
        {
          "id": 152,
          "start": 393.93,
          "end": 395.424,
          "en": "is shown at the same time.",
          "zh": "在同一時間被顯示。"
        },
        {
          "id": 153,
          "start": 395.424,
          "end": 396.685,
          "en": "Well, the problem is,",
          "zh": "好，問題是，"
        },
        {
          "id": 154,
          "start": 396.685,
          "end": 401.6,
          "en": "Vue doesn't understand that these If conditions here",
          "zh": "Vue 不理解這裡這些 v-if 條件"
        },
        {
          "id": 155,
          "start": 401.6,
          "end": 404.15999999999997,
          "en": "guarantee us that only one button is added.",
          "zh": "保證我們只有一個按鈕被加上。"
        },
        {
          "id": 156,
          "start": 404.15999999999997,
          "end": 407.233,
          "en": "It doesn't analyze the If conditions.",
          "zh": "它不會分析 v-if 條件。"
        },
        {
          "id": 157,
          "start": 408.38,
          "end": 412.09000000000003,
          "en": "So, in order to give Vue a clear signal",
          "zh": "所以，為了給 Vue 一個清楚的訊號，"
        },
        {
          "id": 158,
          "start": 412.09000000000003,
          "end": 416.03,
          "en": "that it's either that or that component,",
          "zh": "表示是那個或那個元件，"
        },
        {
          "id": 159,
          "start": 416.03,
          "end": 418.76,
          "en": "we should use V-Else here,",
          "zh": "我們應該在這裡使用 v-else，"
        },
        {
          "id": 160,
          "start": 418.76,
          "end": 420.61,
          "en": "because V-Else is pretty clear.",
          "zh": "因為 v-else 非常清楚。"
        },
        {
          "id": 161,
          "start": 420.61,
          "end": 422.62,
          "en": "With V-Else, we guarantee",
          "zh": "有了 v-else，我們保證"
        },
        {
          "id": 162,
          "start": 422.62,
          "end": 427.346,
          "en": "that only this or this component is shown,",
          "zh": "只有這個或這個元件被顯示，"
        },
        {
          "id": 163,
          "start": 427.346,
          "end": 430.11,
          "en": "that we'll never have both on the screen",
          "zh": "我們永遠不會在畫面上有兩者，"
        },
        {
          "id": 164,
          "start": 430.11,
          "end": 431.253,
          "en": "at the same time.",
          "zh": "在同一時間。"
        },
        {
          "id": 165,
          "start": 432.66,
          "end": 434.523,
          "en": "So, now with that added,",
          "zh": "所以現在加上那個，"
        },
        {
          "id": 166,
          "start": 435.4,
          "end": 436.56,
          "en": "this works,",
          "zh": "這能運作，"
        },
        {
          "id": 167,
          "start": 436.56,
          "end": 441.21,
          "en": "and now you see we have this smooth transition here",
          "zh": "而現在你看到我們這裡有這個平滑轉場，"
        },
        {
          "id": 168,
          "start": 441.21,
          "end": 443.33,
          "en": "when a button is removed, it fades out,",
          "zh": "當一個按鈕被移除，它淡出，"
        },
        {
          "id": 169,
          "start": 443.33,
          "end": 446,
          "en": "when it's added, it fades in,",
          "zh": "當它被加上，它淡入，"
        },
        {
          "id": 170,
          "start": 446,
          "end": 447.69,
          "en": "but of course, it's also ugly,",
          "zh": "但當然，它也很難看，"
        },
        {
          "id": 171,
          "start": 447.69,
          "end": 451.2,
          "en": "because it jumps, and during the transition,",
          "zh": "因為它會跳，而在轉場期間，"
        },
        {
          "id": 172,
          "start": 451.2,
          "end": 453.69,
          "en": "we actually have both buttons on the screen,",
          "zh": "我們其實在畫面上有兩個按鈕，"
        },
        {
          "id": 173,
          "start": 453.69,
          "end": 455.09000000000003,
          "en": "which by the way, is okay here,",
          "zh": "順帶一提，這裡是可以的，"
        },
        {
          "id": 174,
          "start": 455.09000000000003,
          "end": 457.313,
          "en": "because this is now controlled by Vue.",
          "zh": "因為這現在由 Vue 控制。"
        },
        {
          "id": 175,
          "start": 458.71,
          "end": 461.3,
          "en": "So, this is certainly not what we want.",
          "zh": "所以這肯定不是我們想要的。"
        },
        {
          "id": 176,
          "start": 461.3,
          "end": 464.06,
          "en": "We want this fade transition,",
          "zh": "我們想要這個淡出轉場，"
        },
        {
          "id": 177,
          "start": 464.06,
          "end": 467.04,
          "en": "but we don't want both buttons at the same time",
          "zh": "但我們不想兩個按鈕同時"
        },
        {
          "id": 178,
          "start": 467.04,
          "end": 468.22,
          "en": "on the screen.",
          "zh": "在畫面上。"
        },
        {
          "id": 179,
          "start": 468.22,
          "end": 470.61,
          "en": "Instead, one button should fade out,",
          "zh": "相反，一個按鈕應該淡出，"
        },
        {
          "id": 180,
          "start": 470.61,
          "end": 472.62,
          "en": "and then the other button should fade in,",
          "zh": "然後另一個按鈕應該淡入，"
        },
        {
          "id": 181,
          "start": 472.62,
          "end": 474.25,
          "en": "that's the idea,",
          "zh": "那是想法，"
        },
        {
          "id": 182,
          "start": 474.25,
          "end": 476.93,
          "en": "and that's also something that you can control.",
          "zh": "而那也是你可以控制的事。"
        },
        {
          "id": 183,
          "start": 476.93,
          "end": 480.1,
          "en": "You can add the mode prop here",
          "zh": "你可以在這裡加上 mode prop，"
        },
        {
          "id": 184,
          "start": 480.1,
          "end": 481.91,
          "en": "to the transition component,",
          "zh": "到 transition 元件，"
        },
        {
          "id": 185,
          "start": 481.91,
          "end": 484.55,
          "en": "and mode knows two values,",
          "zh": "而 mode 知道兩個值，"
        },
        {
          "id": 186,
          "start": 484.55,
          "end": 487.36,
          "en": "in-out, and out-in,",
          "zh": "in-out 和 out-in，"
        },
        {
          "id": 187,
          "start": 487.36,
          "end": 489.43,
          "en": "and this controls whether first,",
          "zh": "而這控制是否先"
        },
        {
          "id": 188,
          "start": 489.43,
          "end": 492.21,
          "en": "the leaving element should be animated,",
          "zh": "為離開的元素加上動畫，"
        },
        {
          "id": 189,
          "start": 492.21,
          "end": 494.77,
          "en": "or the new element.",
          "zh": "或為新元素。"
        },
        {
          "id": 190,
          "start": 494.77,
          "end": 496.713,
          "en": "So if I set this to in-out,",
          "zh": "所以如果我把這個設成 in-out，"
        },
        {
          "id": 191,
          "start": 499.05,
          "end": 499.883,
          "en": "and reload,",
          "zh": "並重新載入，"
        },
        {
          "id": 192,
          "start": 499.883,
          "end": 501.94,
          "en": "we got the same behavior as before,",
          "zh": "我們得到跟之前相同的行為，"
        },
        {
          "id": 193,
          "start": 501.94,
          "end": 503.68,
          "en": "or a similar behavior.",
          "zh": "或類似的行為。"
        },
        {
          "id": 194,
          "start": 503.68,
          "end": 505.51,
          "en": "Now, the addition of the button",
          "zh": "現在，按鈕的加上"
        },
        {
          "id": 195,
          "start": 505.51,
          "end": 507.02,
          "en": "is animated first,",
          "zh": "先被加上動畫，"
        },
        {
          "id": 196,
          "start": 507.02,
          "end": 508.793,
          "en": "and then the button is removed.",
          "zh": "然後按鈕被移除。"
        },
        {
          "id": 197,
          "start": 509.84,
          "end": 513.31,
          "en": "We can switch this to out-in,",
          "zh": "我們可以把這個切換成 out-in，"
        },
        {
          "id": 198,
          "start": 513.31,
          "end": 515.45,
          "en": "and now we will have a better behavior,",
          "zh": "而現在我們會有更好的行為，"
        },
        {
          "id": 199,
          "start": 515.45,
          "end": 517.63,
          "en": "without in, if we reload,",
          "zh": "有了 out-in，如果我們重新載入，"
        },
        {
          "id": 200,
          "start": 517.63,
          "end": 520.69,
          "en": "Vue will first animate the removal of the button,",
          "zh": "Vue 會先為按鈕的移除加上動畫，"
        },
        {
          "id": 201,
          "start": 520.69,
          "end": 522.33,
          "en": "and then animate the addition",
          "zh": "然後為新按鈕的加上"
        },
        {
          "id": 202,
          "start": 522.33,
          "end": 524.04,
          "en": "of the new button.",
          "zh": "加上動畫。"
        },
        {
          "id": 203,
          "start": 524.04,
          "end": 526.05,
          "en": "So, this allows you to control",
          "zh": "所以這允許你控制"
        },
        {
          "id": 204,
          "start": 526.05,
          "end": 528.67,
          "en": "which element should be animated first,",
          "zh": "哪個元素應該先被加上動畫，"
        },
        {
          "id": 205,
          "start": 528.67,
          "end": 531.37,
          "en": "instead of animating both at the same time,",
          "zh": "而不是同時為兩者加上動畫，"
        },
        {
          "id": 206,
          "start": 531.37,
          "end": 535.06,
          "en": "which gave us this undesirable output.",
          "zh": "那給了我們這個不想要的輸出。"
        },
        {
          "id": 207,
          "start": 535.06,
          "end": 537.88,
          "en": "Now, we're having a smooth animation",
          "zh": "現在，我們有一個平滑動畫，"
        },
        {
          "id": 208,
          "start": 537.88,
          "end": 539.44,
          "en": "with help of transition,",
          "zh": "靠 transition 的幫助，"
        },
        {
          "id": 209,
          "start": 539.44,
          "end": 541.55,
          "en": "and multiple child elements,",
          "zh": "以及多個子元素，"
        },
        {
          "id": 210,
          "start": 541.55,
          "end": 542.967,
          "en": "which is okay as you'll learn,",
          "zh": "如你會學到的，那是可以的，"
        },
        {
          "id": 211,
          "start": 542.967,
          "end": 545.57,
          "en": "if you know that only one of them",
          "zh": "如果你知道它們只有一個"
        },
        {
          "id": 212,
          "start": 545.57,
          "end": 547.56,
          "en": "will be active at the same time,",
          "zh": "會在同一時間是作用中的，"
        },
        {
          "id": 213,
          "start": 547.56,
          "end": 549.87,
          "en": "and you can give a clear signal",
          "zh": "而你可以給一個清楚的訊號，"
        },
        {
          "id": 214,
          "start": 549.87,
          "end": 552.14,
          "en": "with V-If, V-Else, to Vue",
          "zh": "用 v-if、v-else，給 Vue，"
        },
        {
          "id": 215,
          "start": 552.14,
          "end": 553.49,
          "en": "that this will be the case.",
          "zh": "表示情況會是這樣。"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "21879500",
      "title": "Using Transition Events",
      "lectureOrder": 203,
      "videoOrder": 178,
      "sourceHash": "6598115af07692c8a7c053b5e17824351660e4c3510e24ede5784b558edcd053",
      "cues": [
        {
          "id": 1,
          "start": 1.567,
          "end": 4.09,
          "en": "So by now, we already learned a lot",
          "zh": "所以到現在，我們已經學了很多，"
        },
        {
          "id": 2,
          "start": 4.09,
          "end": 7.58,
          "en": "about transitions, to transition component, what it does",
          "zh": "關於轉場、transition 元件、它做什麼，"
        },
        {
          "id": 3,
          "start": 7.58,
          "end": 9.34,
          "en": "and how you may use it.",
          "zh": "以及你如何使用它。"
        },
        {
          "id": 4,
          "start": 9.34,
          "end": 14.21,
          "en": "Sometimes you'll also want to run some JavaScript code,",
          "zh": "有時你也會想執行一些 JavaScript 程式碼，"
        },
        {
          "id": 5,
          "start": 14.21,
          "end": 16.76,
          "en": "either as part of the transition,",
          "zh": "或者作為轉場的一部分，"
        },
        {
          "id": 6,
          "start": 16.76,
          "end": 20.3,
          "en": "maybe to even control the entire transition",
          "zh": "也許甚至控制整個轉場，"
        },
        {
          "id": 7,
          "start": 20.3,
          "end": 23.18,
          "en": "and the style changes Fruit JavaScript,",
          "zh": "以及透過 JavaScript 的樣式變更，"
        },
        {
          "id": 8,
          "start": 23.18,
          "end": 26.06,
          "en": "or maybe because you want to do something",
          "zh": "或也許因為你想做某件事，"
        },
        {
          "id": 9,
          "start": 26.06,
          "end": 30.01,
          "en": "when an animation starts or when it ends.",
          "zh": "當一個動畫開始或結束時。"
        },
        {
          "id": 10,
          "start": 30.01,
          "end": 34,
          "en": "And vue gives you an opportunity to do that as well.",
          "zh": "而 Vue 也給你機會這樣做。"
        },
        {
          "id": 11,
          "start": 34,
          "end": 36.25,
          "en": "It gives you various events,",
          "zh": "它給你各種事件，"
        },
        {
          "id": 12,
          "start": 36.25,
          "end": 39.94,
          "en": "which are emitted by this transition component",
          "zh": "由這個 transition 元件發出，"
        },
        {
          "id": 13,
          "start": 39.94,
          "end": 41.71,
          "en": "during a transition.",
          "zh": "在轉場期間。"
        },
        {
          "id": 14,
          "start": 41.71,
          "end": 43.35,
          "en": "So when the transition starts,",
          "zh": "所以當轉場開始時，"
        },
        {
          "id": 15,
          "start": 43.35,
          "end": 46.51,
          "en": "when an element is added or when an element is removed",
          "zh": "當一個元素被加上，或當一個元素被移除，"
        },
        {
          "id": 16,
          "start": 46.51,
          "end": 48.13,
          "en": "from the Dom",
          "zh": "從 DOM，"
        },
        {
          "id": 17,
          "start": 48.13,
          "end": 51.91,
          "en": "and I will show it here on this transition wrapping,",
          "zh": "而我會在這裡示範，在這個包住的 transition 上，"
        },
        {
          "id": 18,
          "start": 51.91,
          "end": 53.41,
          "en": "this paragraph.",
          "zh": "這個段落。"
        },
        {
          "id": 19,
          "start": 53.41,
          "end": 55.46,
          "en": "We can listen to various events here",
          "zh": "我們可以在這裡監聽各種事件，"
        },
        {
          "id": 20,
          "start": 55.46,
          "end": 59.77,
          "en": "with v-on or the short and, the @ symbol",
          "zh": "用 v-on，或簡寫，也就是 @ 符號，"
        },
        {
          "id": 21,
          "start": 59.77,
          "end": 62.29,
          "en": "and the first event to which we can list here",
          "zh": "而我們可以在這裡監聽的第一個事件"
        },
        {
          "id": 22,
          "start": 62.29,
          "end": 64.67,
          "en": "is before-enter.",
          "zh": "是 before-enter。"
        },
        {
          "id": 23,
          "start": 64.67,
          "end": 68.2,
          "en": "Here, we can run a code which will be executed",
          "zh": "這裡，我們可以執行一段程式碼，它會被執行，"
        },
        {
          "id": 24,
          "start": 68.2,
          "end": 71.63,
          "en": "when the element which is wrapped, this paragraph,",
          "zh": "當被包住的元素，這個段落，"
        },
        {
          "id": 25,
          "start": 71.63,
          "end": 74.43,
          "en": "in this case is about to enter.",
          "zh": "在這個情況裡即將進入時。"
        },
        {
          "id": 26,
          "start": 74.43,
          "end": 77.77,
          "en": "So when the enter animation starts,",
          "zh": "所以當進入動畫開始時，"
        },
        {
          "id": 27,
          "start": 77.77,
          "end": 79.91,
          "en": "so in the end, you could say,",
          "zh": "所以到最後，你可以說，"
        },
        {
          "id": 28,
          "start": 79.91,
          "end": 84.91,
          "en": "this runs whenever this enter from CSS class is being added.",
          "zh": "這會在 enter-from 這個 CSS class 被加上時執行。"
        },
        {
          "id": 29,
          "start": 85.7,
          "end": 89.65,
          "en": "So right at the beginning, when the element is added",
          "zh": "所以就在一開始，當元素被加上，"
        },
        {
          "id": 30,
          "start": 89.65,
          "end": 91.473,
          "en": "and the animation starts.",
          "zh": "而動畫開始時。"
        },
        {
          "id": 31,
          "start": 92.75999999999999,
          "end": 94.95,
          "en": "Now, I'll add a couple of methods here,",
          "zh": "現在，我會在這裡加幾個方法，"
        },
        {
          "id": 32,
          "start": 94.95,
          "end": 97.97,
          "en": "which allow us to print something to the console,",
          "zh": "它們允許我們把某樣東西印到主控台，"
        },
        {
          "id": 33,
          "start": 97.97,
          "end": 101.50999999999999,
          "en": "so that we can see this all in action in the console.",
          "zh": "好讓我們能在主控台看到這一切的實際運作。"
        },
        {
          "id": 34,
          "start": 101.50999999999999,
          "end": 104.163,
          "en": "And here I have beforeEnter,",
          "zh": "而這裡我有 beforeEnter，"
        },
        {
          "id": 35,
          "start": 107,
          "end": 108.78,
          "en": "now this method name is up to you.",
          "zh": "現在這個方法名稱由你決定。"
        },
        {
          "id": 36,
          "start": 108.78,
          "end": 111.67,
          "en": "It doesn't have to be beforeEnter.",
          "zh": "它不必是 beforeEnter。"
        },
        {
          "id": 37,
          "start": 111.67,
          "end": 115.75,
          "en": "Here, adjust once to console.log beforeEnter.",
          "zh": "這裡，我只是想 console.log beforeEnter。"
        },
        {
          "id": 38,
          "start": 115.75,
          "end": 119.533,
          "en": "So that we see that we uh, reached this event.",
          "zh": "好讓我們看到我們到達了這個事件。"
        },
        {
          "id": 39,
          "start": 120.84,
          "end": 124.64,
          "en": "Now we can point at beforeEnter here",
          "zh": "現在我們可以在這裡指向 beforeEnter，"
        },
        {
          "id": 40,
          "start": 124.64,
          "end": 128.12,
          "en": "at this newly added method on the beforeEnter event.",
          "zh": "在 before-enter 事件上指向這個新加的方法。"
        },
        {
          "id": 41,
          "start": 128.12,
          "end": 129.9,
          "en": "Again, the method name is up to you.",
          "zh": "再說一次，方法名稱由你決定。"
        },
        {
          "id": 42,
          "start": 129.9,
          "end": 132.24,
          "en": "The event name isn't beforeEnter,",
          "zh": "事件名稱不是 beforeEnter，"
        },
        {
          "id": 43,
          "start": 132.24,
          "end": 134.94,
          "en": "it's one of the built in events transition emits",
          "zh": "它是 transition 發出的內建事件之一，"
        },
        {
          "id": 44,
          "start": 134.94,
          "end": 139.81,
          "en": "and if we saved that and we opened the developer tools",
          "zh": "而如果我們儲存，並打開開發者工具，"
        },
        {
          "id": 45,
          "start": 139.81,
          "end": 142.87,
          "en": "with the JavaScript console here in the browser,",
          "zh": "在瀏覽器裡這裡的 JavaScript 主控台，"
        },
        {
          "id": 46,
          "start": 142.87,
          "end": 144.98,
          "en": "if I click toggle paragraph,",
          "zh": "如果我點 Toggle Paragraph，"
        },
        {
          "id": 47,
          "start": 144.98,
          "end": 148.39,
          "en": "we see beforeEnter being printed.",
          "zh": "我們看到 beforeEnter 被印出來。"
        },
        {
          "id": 48,
          "start": 148.39,
          "end": 149.76,
          "en": "So that works.",
          "zh": "所以那能運作。"
        },
        {
          "id": 49,
          "start": 149.76,
          "end": 152.03,
          "en": "Now, if I remove the paragraph,",
          "zh": "現在，如果我移除段落，"
        },
        {
          "id": 50,
          "start": 152.03,
          "end": 154.65,
          "en": "we don't see beforeEnter again,",
          "zh": "我們不會再看到 beforeEnter，"
        },
        {
          "id": 51,
          "start": 154.65,
          "end": 157.82,
          "en": "because it's only firing when the element enters.",
          "zh": "因為它只在元素進入時觸發。"
        },
        {
          "id": 52,
          "start": 157.82,
          "end": 160.263,
          "en": "So when the enter animation is played.",
          "zh": "所以是當進入動畫被播放時。"
        },
        {
          "id": 53,
          "start": 161.13,
          "end": 165.82,
          "en": "Of course, we can also listen to the leaving though",
          "zh": "當然，我們也可以監聽離開，"
        },
        {
          "id": 54,
          "start": 165.82,
          "end": 170.35,
          "en": "with @before-leave just as we have beforeEnter,",
          "zh": "用 @before-leave，就像我們有 beforeEnter，"
        },
        {
          "id": 55,
          "start": 170.35,
          "end": 175.34,
          "en": "we can also listen to that event or the point of time",
          "zh": "我們也可以監聽那個事件，或那個時間點，"
        },
        {
          "id": 56,
          "start": 175.34,
          "end": 179.163,
          "en": "when that element that is wrapped is leaving the Dom.",
          "zh": "當被包住的那個元素正在離開 DOM。"
        },
        {
          "id": 57,
          "start": 180.45,
          "end": 185.45,
          "en": "So here we can also add a before-Leave method",
          "zh": "所以這裡我們也可以加一個 beforeLeave 方法，"
        },
        {
          "id": 58,
          "start": 185.872,
          "end": 190.123,
          "en": "where we then console.log beforeLeave.",
          "zh": "我們在那裡 console.log beforeLeave。"
        },
        {
          "id": 59,
          "start": 191.77,
          "end": 194.93,
          "en": "Well, and of course we can now point at this method here",
          "zh": "好，而當然我們現在可以在這裡指向這個方法，"
        },
        {
          "id": 60,
          "start": 194.93,
          "end": 197.923,
          "en": "on our @before-leave event handler.",
          "zh": "在我們的 @before-leave 事件處理器上。"
        },
        {
          "id": 61,
          "start": 199.09,
          "end": 202.14,
          "en": "If we saved this, reload,",
          "zh": "如果我們儲存並重新載入，"
        },
        {
          "id": 62,
          "start": 202.14,
          "end": 205.18,
          "en": "if I click toggle paragraph, we've got beforeEnter,",
          "zh": "如果我點 Toggle Paragraph，我們得到 beforeEnter，"
        },
        {
          "id": 63,
          "start": 205.18,
          "end": 207.693,
          "en": "if I click it again, we got beforeLeave.",
          "zh": "如果我再點一次，我們得到 beforeLeave。"
        },
        {
          "id": 64,
          "start": 210.78,
          "end": 215.5,
          "en": "Now you actually also get an argument in those methods",
          "zh": "現在你在那些方法裡其實也會自動得到一個引數，"
        },
        {
          "id": 65,
          "start": 215.5,
          "end": 217.09,
          "en": "automatically by vue.",
          "zh": "由 Vue 提供。"
        },
        {
          "id": 66,
          "start": 217.09,
          "end": 221.45,
          "en": "And that is the element hence we'll name it {el} here,",
          "zh": "而那是元素，因此我們會在這裡把它命名為 el，"
        },
        {
          "id": 67,
          "start": 221.45,
          "end": 223.85,
          "en": "on which this animation runs.",
          "zh": "這個動畫在它上面執行。"
        },
        {
          "id": 68,
          "start": 223.85,
          "end": 228.85,
          "en": "If I console.log{el} here and also here in beforeLeave",
          "zh": "如果我在這裡 console.log(el)，在 beforeLeave 這裡也一樣，"
        },
        {
          "id": 69,
          "start": 231.6,
          "end": 235.23,
          "en": "and save that and reload,",
          "zh": "並儲存、重新載入，"
        },
        {
          "id": 70,
          "start": 235.23,
          "end": 237.69,
          "en": "you will notice the difficulty toggle paragraph.",
          "zh": "你會注意到切換段落的難處。"
        },
        {
          "id": 71,
          "start": 237.69,
          "end": 239.21,
          "en": "It's printing the paragraph,",
          "zh": "它印出那個段落，"
        },
        {
          "id": 72,
          "start": 239.21,
          "end": 242.35,
          "en": "which was added at the same for removing it.",
          "zh": "對移除它來說，是在同一時間被加上的那個。"
        },
        {
          "id": 73,
          "start": 242.35,
          "end": 245.16,
          "en": "So if you need to do something with that element,",
          "zh": "所以如果你需要對那個元素做某件事，"
        },
        {
          "id": 74,
          "start": 245.16,
          "end": 248.78,
          "en": "for example, change its styling In case you want to control",
          "zh": "例如，改變它的樣式，如果你想控制"
        },
        {
          "id": 75,
          "start": 248.78,
          "end": 250.9,
          "en": "the Animation Fruit JavaScript,",
          "zh": "透過 JavaScript 的動畫，"
        },
        {
          "id": 76,
          "start": 250.9,
          "end": 252.68,
          "en": "something we're going to do in the next lecture,",
          "zh": "順帶一提，我們會在下一堂做的事，"
        },
        {
          "id": 77,
          "start": 252.68,
          "end": 255.68,
          "en": "by the way, then you can do this with help of the element,",
          "zh": "那麼你可以靠這個元素的幫助來做，"
        },
        {
          "id": 78,
          "start": 255.68,
          "end": 258.41,
          "en": "which you get automatically as argument",
          "zh": "你在監聽 beforeEnter 和 beforeLeave 時"
        },
        {
          "id": 79,
          "start": 258.41,
          "end": 262.187,
          "en": "when listening to beforeEnter and beforeLeave.",
          "zh": "會自動得到它作為引數。"
        },
        {
          "id": 80,
          "start": 263.09,
          "end": 267.37,
          "en": "But beforeEnter and beforeLeave is not everything we have.",
          "zh": "但 beforeEnter 和 beforeLeave 不是我們擁有的全部。"
        },
        {
          "id": 81,
          "start": 267.37,
          "end": 271.49,
          "en": "We also have an @enter event to which we can listen.",
          "zh": "我們也有一個 @enter 事件可以監聽。"
        },
        {
          "id": 82,
          "start": 271.49,
          "end": 276.49,
          "en": "This is basically the equivalent to the Active CSS Class.",
          "zh": "這基本上等同於 active 那個 CSS class。"
        },
        {
          "id": 83,
          "start": 277.17,
          "end": 280.88,
          "en": "The enter event is triggered as a next step",
          "zh": "enter 事件會在下一步被觸發，"
        },
        {
          "id": 84,
          "start": 281.927,
          "end": 285.15,
          "en": "then beforeEnter is done, you could say.",
          "zh": "你可以說，在 beforeEnter 完成之後。"
        },
        {
          "id": 85,
          "start": 285.15,
          "end": 287.86,
          "en": "Now here, I want to trigger an enter method,",
          "zh": "現在這裡，我想觸發一個 enter 方法，"
        },
        {
          "id": 86,
          "start": 287.86,
          "end": 291.57,
          "en": "which doesn't exist yet, but which I'll of course add now.",
          "zh": "它還不存在，但我現在當然會加上。"
        },
        {
          "id": 87,
          "start": 291.57,
          "end": 294.34000000000003,
          "en": "Here, let's say I add, enter()",
          "zh": "這裡，比方說我加上 enter()，"
        },
        {
          "id": 88,
          "start": 294.34000000000003,
          "end": 298.65,
          "en": "and I console.log(enter) here.",
          "zh": "而我在這裡 console.log(enter)。"
        },
        {
          "id": 89,
          "start": 298.65,
          "end": 300.61,
          "en": "We also get the element here,",
          "zh": "我們在這裡也得到元素，"
        },
        {
          "id": 90,
          "start": 300.61,
          "end": 302.69,
          "en": "So it would be also we could interact with it here",
          "zh": "所以如果我們想要，我們也可以在這裡跟它互動，"
        },
        {
          "id": 91,
          "start": 302.69,
          "end": 305.137,
          "en": "If we wanted to enable console.log(el).",
          "zh": "啟用 console.log(el)。"
        },
        {
          "id": 92,
          "start": 306.04,
          "end": 308.07,
          "en": "If we now saved it and reload,",
          "zh": "如果我們現在儲存並重新載入，"
        },
        {
          "id": 93,
          "start": 308.07,
          "end": 312.26,
          "en": "if I toggle the paragraph we see beforeEnter first",
          "zh": "如果我切換段落，我們先看到 beforeEnter"
        },
        {
          "id": 94,
          "start": 312.26,
          "end": 315.993,
          "en": "and the paragraph, and then we see enter and the paragraph.",
          "zh": "和段落，然後我們看到 enter 和段落。"
        },
        {
          "id": 95,
          "start": 316.94,
          "end": 318.98,
          "en": "And of course we can also listen",
          "zh": "而當然我們也可以監聽"
        },
        {
          "id": 96,
          "start": 318.98,
          "end": 323.98,
          "en": "to when the animation finishes with @after-enter.",
          "zh": "動畫何時結束，用 @after-enter。"
        },
        {
          "id": 97,
          "start": 324.91,
          "end": 328.173,
          "en": "And here, I want to trigger an afterEnter method,",
          "zh": "而這裡，我想觸發一個 afterEnter 方法，"
        },
        {
          "id": 98,
          "start": 329.185,
          "end": 330.23,
          "en": "which we have yet to add.",
          "zh": "我們還沒加上的。"
        },
        {
          "id": 99,
          "start": 330.23,
          "end": 332.77,
          "en": "This will fire whenever the animation is done,",
          "zh": "這會在動畫完成時觸發，"
        },
        {
          "id": 100,
          "start": 332.77,
          "end": 335.15,
          "en": "the entering animation.",
          "zh": "也就是進入動畫。"
        },
        {
          "id": 101,
          "start": 335.15,
          "end": 340.15,
          "en": "So here, I will add an afterEnter method,",
          "zh": "所以這裡，我會加一個 afterEnter 方法，"
        },
        {
          "id": 102,
          "start": 341.78,
          "end": 345.02,
          "en": "console.log (afterEnter)",
          "zh": "console.log(afterEnter)，"
        },
        {
          "id": 103,
          "start": 346.09000000000003,
          "end": 348.45,
          "en": "and here we also get the element.",
          "zh": "而這裡我們也得到元素。"
        },
        {
          "id": 104,
          "start": 348.45,
          "end": 353.45,
          "en": "So if I print that here, saved it and reload,",
          "zh": "所以如果我在這裡印出那個，儲存並重新載入，"
        },
        {
          "id": 105,
          "start": 354.52,
          "end": 356.35,
          "en": "click toggle paragraph,",
          "zh": "點 Toggle Paragraph，"
        },
        {
          "id": 106,
          "start": 356.35,
          "end": 359.01,
          "en": "you see, we got beforeEnter first, then enter",
          "zh": "你看到，我們先得到 beforeEnter，然後 enter，"
        },
        {
          "id": 107,
          "start": 359.01,
          "end": 361.1,
          "en": "and then afterEnter.",
          "zh": "然後 afterEnter。"
        },
        {
          "id": 108,
          "start": 361.1,
          "end": 362.79,
          "en": "Now we have a quick animation here,",
          "zh": "現在我們這裡有一個很快的動畫，"
        },
        {
          "id": 109,
          "start": 362.79,
          "end": 366.65,
          "en": "So it looked like afterEnter was basically called directly",
          "zh": "所以看起來 afterEnter 基本上是直接被呼叫，"
        },
        {
          "id": 110,
          "start": 366.65,
          "end": 368.04,
          "en": "after enter",
          "zh": "在 enter 之後，"
        },
        {
          "id": 111,
          "start": 368.04,
          "end": 370.65,
          "en": "but actually it waits for the animation to finish",
          "zh": "但實際上它會等到動畫完成，"
        },
        {
          "id": 112,
          "start": 370.65,
          "end": 372.62,
          "en": "until afterEnter gets called.",
          "zh": "才呼叫 afterEnter。"
        },
        {
          "id": 113,
          "start": 372.62,
          "end": 375.7,
          "en": "And I can show this by going to .para-enter-active",
          "zh": "而我可以示範這個，前往 .para-enter-active，"
        },
        {
          "id": 114,
          "start": 375.7,
          "end": 378.563,
          "en": "and ramping this up to two seconds, let's say.",
          "zh": "並把這個拉長到兩秒，比方說。"
        },
        {
          "id": 115,
          "start": 379.53,
          "end": 382.68,
          "en": "Keep in mind that vue will read this duration.",
          "zh": "記住 Vue 會讀這個持續時間。"
        },
        {
          "id": 116,
          "start": 382.68,
          "end": 384.77,
          "en": "Vue analyzes this duration",
          "zh": "Vue 分析這個持續時間，"
        },
        {
          "id": 117,
          "start": 384.77,
          "end": 387.48,
          "en": "and it knows how long the animation will take.",
          "zh": "而它知道動畫會花多久。"
        },
        {
          "id": 118,
          "start": 387.48,
          "end": 390.153,
          "en": "It will add the CSS classes appropriately,",
          "zh": "它會適當地加上 CSS classes，"
        },
        {
          "id": 119,
          "start": 390.153,
          "end": 394.49,
          "en": "and it will also trigger those events appropriately.",
          "zh": "也會適當地觸發那些事件。"
        },
        {
          "id": 120,
          "start": 394.49,
          "end": 399.09000000000003,
          "en": "And now afterEnter will only be called after two seconds",
          "zh": "而現在 afterEnter 只會在兩秒後被呼叫，"
        },
        {
          "id": 121,
          "start": 399.09000000000003,
          "end": 401.013,
          "en": "when the animation completed.",
          "zh": "當動畫完成時。"
        },
        {
          "id": 122,
          "start": 403.15999999999997,
          "end": 405.68,
          "en": "So now if I reload here and click toggle paragraph,",
          "zh": "所以現在如果我在這裡重新載入並點 Toggle Paragraph，"
        },
        {
          "id": 123,
          "start": 405.68,
          "end": 407.15,
          "en": "we only see enter here",
          "zh": "我們在這裡只看到 enter，"
        },
        {
          "id": 124,
          "start": 407.15,
          "end": 408.475,
          "en": "and only after two seconds,",
          "zh": "而只有在兩秒之後，"
        },
        {
          "id": 125,
          "start": 408.475,
          "end": 411.57,
          "en": "we see after enter being printed",
          "zh": "我們看到 afterEnter 被印出來，"
        },
        {
          "id": 126,
          "start": 411.57,
          "end": 415.253,
          "en": "because that only is called when the animation finishes.",
          "zh": "因為那個只在動畫結束時被呼叫。"
        },
        {
          "id": 127,
          "start": 417.2,
          "end": 419.98,
          "en": "And of course we have the equivalence for removing.",
          "zh": "而當然我們有移除的對應事件。"
        },
        {
          "id": 128,
          "start": 419.98,
          "end": 422.8,
          "en": "I'll restructure this to make it a bit easier to read.",
          "zh": "我會重新整理這個，讓它比較容易讀。"
        },
        {
          "id": 129,
          "start": 422.8,
          "end": 425.02,
          "en": "We already added beforeLeave",
          "zh": "我們已經加上 beforeLeave，"
        },
        {
          "id": 130,
          "start": 425.02,
          "end": 427.15,
          "en": "but of course we now also have \"leave\"",
          "zh": "但當然我們現在也有 leave，"
        },
        {
          "id": 131,
          "start": 427.15,
          "end": 431.24,
          "en": "where I want to call @leave method and @after-leave",
          "zh": "我想在那裡呼叫 leave 方法，以及 @after-leave，"
        },
        {
          "id": 132,
          "start": 431.24,
          "end": 434.3,
          "en": "which is called when the \"leave\" transition finished,",
          "zh": "它在 leave 轉場完成時被呼叫，"
        },
        {
          "id": 133,
          "start": 434.3,
          "end": 437.84,
          "en": "here, I want to call an afterLeave method.",
          "zh": "這裡，我想呼叫一個 afterLeave 方法。"
        },
        {
          "id": 134,
          "start": 437.84,
          "end": 440.363,
          "en": "So now we can add those methods as well.",
          "zh": "所以現在我們也可以加上那些方法。"
        },
        {
          "id": 135,
          "start": 441.74,
          "end": 446.74,
          "en": "Here, I'll add a leave method where we also get the element",
          "zh": "這裡，我會加一個 leave 方法，我們也得到元素，"
        },
        {
          "id": 136,
          "start": 447.6,
          "end": 451.62,
          "en": "where we can console.log{leave}",
          "zh": "我們可以 console.log(leave)，"
        },
        {
          "id": 137,
          "start": 451.62,
          "end": 454.423,
          "en": "and then console.log[el]",
          "zh": "然後 console.log(el)，"
        },
        {
          "id": 138,
          "start": 455.28,
          "end": 459.25,
          "en": "and we've got the afterLeave method",
          "zh": "而我們有 afterLeave 方法，"
        },
        {
          "id": 139,
          "start": 459.25,
          "end": 461.28,
          "en": "where we also get the element",
          "zh": "我們也得到元素，"
        },
        {
          "id": 140,
          "start": 461.28,
          "end": 465.2,
          "en": "and then we can console.log[afterLeave] here",
          "zh": "然後我們可以在這裡 console.log(afterLeave)，"
        },
        {
          "id": 141,
          "start": 465.2,
          "end": 468.16700000000003,
          "en": "and also if you want to console.log[el].",
          "zh": "如果你想要，也可以 console.log(el)。"
        },
        {
          "id": 142,
          "start": 470.099,
          "end": 472.909,
          "en": "With all of that, if we saved this and reload,",
          "zh": "有了這一切，如果我們儲存並重新載入，"
        },
        {
          "id": 143,
          "start": 472.909,
          "end": 476.55,
          "en": "if I toggle the paragraph we got beforeEnter and enter",
          "zh": "如果我切換段落，我們得到 beforeEnter 和 enter，"
        },
        {
          "id": 144,
          "start": 476.55,
          "end": 477.92,
          "en": "and after Enter.",
          "zh": "以及 afterEnter。"
        },
        {
          "id": 145,
          "start": 477.92,
          "end": 481.07,
          "en": "And if I clear to console now and toggle it again,",
          "zh": "而如果我現在清掉主控台並再切換一次，"
        },
        {
          "id": 146,
          "start": 481.07,
          "end": 483.733,
          "en": "we got beforeLeave, leave and afterLeave.",
          "zh": "我們得到 beforeLeave、leave 和 afterLeave。"
        },
        {
          "id": 147,
          "start": 485.38,
          "end": 487.95,
          "en": "So this is how we can listen to that",
          "zh": "所以這就是我們如何監聽那個，"
        },
        {
          "id": 148,
          "start": 487.95,
          "end": 491.13,
          "en": "and that allows you to run any code you want",
          "zh": "而那允許你執行任何你想要的程式碼，"
        },
        {
          "id": 149,
          "start": 491.13,
          "end": 493.93,
          "en": "in reaction to your animation.",
          "zh": "作為對你的動畫的反應。"
        },
        {
          "id": 150,
          "start": 493.93,
          "end": 496.64,
          "en": "This can be useful for a lot of things",
          "zh": "這對很多事情可以很有用，"
        },
        {
          "id": 151,
          "start": 496.64,
          "end": 499.028,
          "en": "but you can specifically also use it",
          "zh": "但你也可以特別用它"
        },
        {
          "id": 152,
          "start": 499.028,
          "end": 502.9,
          "en": "to control the entire animation with JavaScript",
          "zh": "用 JavaScript 控制整個動畫，"
        },
        {
          "id": 153,
          "start": 502.9,
          "end": 506.65,
          "en": "instead of CSS if you want to do that.",
          "zh": "而不是 CSS，如果你想那樣做。"
        },
        {
          "id": 154,
          "start": 506.65,
          "end": 509.4,
          "en": "And that's something we'll explore in the next lecture.",
          "zh": "而那是我們會在下一堂探索的事。"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "21879512",
      "title": "Building JavaScript Transitions (instead of CSS)",
      "lectureOrder": 204,
      "videoOrder": 179,
      "sourceHash": "8f984584466f7bd2e3592418625c133a4c5f2609bc7dae84c9a20f94ce23f180",
      "cues": [
        {
          "id": 1,
          "start": 2.33,
          "end": 7.19,
          "en": "So let's now build an entire animation with JavaScript",
          "zh": "所以現在讓我們用 JavaScript 建立整個動畫，"
        },
        {
          "id": 2,
          "start": 7.19,
          "end": 9.468,
          "en": "instead of CSS.",
          "zh": "而不是 CSS。"
        },
        {
          "id": 3,
          "start": 9.468,
          "end": 12.37,
          "en": "And it will do that for this paragraph.",
          "zh": "而我會對這個段落這樣做。"
        },
        {
          "id": 4,
          "start": 12.37,
          "end": 15.07,
          "en": "Therefore, I will actually remove all",
          "zh": "因此，我其實會移除所有"
        },
        {
          "id": 5,
          "start": 15.07,
          "end": 18.01,
          "en": "those para dash classes.",
          "zh": "那些 para- classes。"
        },
        {
          "id": 6,
          "start": 18.01,
          "end": 19.98,
          "en": "I will simply delete them here",
          "zh": "我會在這裡直接刪掉它們，"
        },
        {
          "id": 7,
          "start": 19.98,
          "end": 22.99,
          "en": "so that we no longer use those CSS classes",
          "zh": "好讓我們不再使用那些 CSS classes"
        },
        {
          "id": 8,
          "start": 22.99,
          "end": 25.51,
          "en": "to control how this is being animated.",
          "zh": "來控制這是如何被加上動畫的。"
        },
        {
          "id": 9,
          "start": 25.51,
          "end": 28.58,
          "en": "Instead, I now want to use JavaScript for that.",
          "zh": "相反，我現在想用 JavaScript 來做。"
        },
        {
          "id": 10,
          "start": 28.58,
          "end": 31.437,
          "en": "And that is something which is also supported by",
          "zh": "而那也是被支援的，"
        },
        {
          "id": 11,
          "start": 31.437,
          "end": 33.69,
          "en": "the transition component.",
          "zh": "由 transition 元件。"
        },
        {
          "id": 12,
          "start": 33.69,
          "end": 38.12,
          "en": "Now typically, you will most often use CSS,",
          "zh": "現在通常，你最常會使用 CSS，"
        },
        {
          "id": 13,
          "start": 38.12,
          "end": 41.96,
          "en": "but using JavaScript instead can be useful",
          "zh": "但改用 JavaScript 可以很有用，"
        },
        {
          "id": 14,
          "start": 41.96,
          "end": 44.46,
          "en": "if you, for example, wanna use",
          "zh": "如果你例如想使用"
        },
        {
          "id": 15,
          "start": 44.46,
          "end": 48.07,
          "en": "a third party JavaScript based animation library",
          "zh": "一個以 JavaScript 為基礎的第三方動畫函式庫，"
        },
        {
          "id": 16,
          "start": 48.07,
          "end": 49.68,
          "en": "like GreenSock.",
          "zh": "像是 GreenSock。"
        },
        {
          "id": 17,
          "start": 49.68,
          "end": 52.4,
          "en": "GreenSock has nothing to do with Vue,",
          "zh": "GreenSock 跟 Vue 沒有關係，"
        },
        {
          "id": 18,
          "start": 52.4,
          "end": 56.61,
          "en": "but it is a powerful JavaScript library for orchestrating",
          "zh": "但它是一個強大的 JavaScript 函式庫，用來編排"
        },
        {
          "id": 19,
          "start": 56.61,
          "end": 61.61,
          "en": "and building animations, complex animations with JavaScript.",
          "zh": "並用 JavaScript 建立動畫、複雜動畫。"
        },
        {
          "id": 20,
          "start": 61.61,
          "end": 64.31,
          "en": "And that then would be a use case",
          "zh": "而那接著會是一個使用情境，"
        },
        {
          "id": 21,
          "start": 64.31,
          "end": 65.54,
          "en": "where you might wanna build",
          "zh": "你可能想建立"
        },
        {
          "id": 22,
          "start": 65.54,
          "end": 67.82,
          "en": "your entire transition with JavaScript,",
          "zh": "你的整個轉場，用 JavaScript，"
        },
        {
          "id": 23,
          "start": 67.82,
          "end": 71.14,
          "en": "because you might want to leverage a library like this.",
          "zh": "因為你可能想使用像這樣的函式庫。"
        },
        {
          "id": 24,
          "start": 71.14,
          "end": 74.58,
          "en": "But even without such a library, you can use JavaScript",
          "zh": "但即使沒有這樣的函式庫，你也可以使用 JavaScript"
        },
        {
          "id": 25,
          "start": 74.58,
          "end": 77.11,
          "en": "to animate this paragraph here, for example.",
          "zh": "來為這裡這個段落加上動畫，例如。"
        },
        {
          "id": 26,
          "start": 77.11,
          "end": 79.89,
          "en": "And that's exactly what we'll do now.",
          "zh": "而那正是我們現在要做的。"
        },
        {
          "id": 27,
          "start": 79.89,
          "end": 82.39,
          "en": "For that, we already added all those hooks",
          "zh": "為此，我們已經加上所有那些 hooks，"
        },
        {
          "id": 28,
          "start": 82.39,
          "end": 84.67,
          "en": "and you will need those hooks here.",
          "zh": "而你在這裡會需要那些 hooks。"
        },
        {
          "id": 29,
          "start": 84.67,
          "end": 88.23,
          "en": "You will need them because building an animation",
          "zh": "你會需要它們，因為用 JavaScript 建立動畫"
        },
        {
          "id": 30,
          "start": 88.23,
          "end": 92.64,
          "en": "with JavaScript requires those hooks here.",
          "zh": "需要這裡那些 hooks。"
        },
        {
          "id": 31,
          "start": 92.64,
          "end": 95.85,
          "en": "Because to some extent, they will still be called",
          "zh": "因為在某種程度上，它們仍然會被呼叫，"
        },
        {
          "id": 32,
          "start": 95.85,
          "end": 98.46000000000001,
          "en": "even if you have no CSS code.",
          "zh": "即使你沒有 CSS 程式碼。"
        },
        {
          "id": 33,
          "start": 98.46000000000001,
          "end": 100.928,
          "en": "Even if you have no CSS Animation.",
          "zh": "即使你沒有 CSS animation。"
        },
        {
          "id": 34,
          "start": 100.928,
          "end": 105.5,
          "en": "If I reload here, for example, and keep in mind",
          "zh": "如果我在這裡重新載入，例如，並記住"
        },
        {
          "id": 35,
          "start": 105.5,
          "end": 109.27000000000001,
          "en": "that I removed the CSS classes which were added previously.",
          "zh": "我移除了先前被加上的那些 CSS classes。"
        },
        {
          "id": 36,
          "start": 109.27000000000001,
          "end": 113.439,
          "en": "We still see beforeEnter and afterEnter being called.",
          "zh": "我們仍然看到 beforeEnter 和 afterEnter 被呼叫。"
        },
        {
          "id": 37,
          "start": 113.439,
          "end": 116.22999999999999,
          "en": "We have no actual transition.",
          "zh": "我們沒有實際的轉場。"
        },
        {
          "id": 38,
          "start": 116.22999999999999,
          "end": 120.36,
          "en": "Everything is instant, but those hooks are still called.",
          "zh": "一切都是瞬間的，但那些 hooks 仍然被呼叫。"
        },
        {
          "id": 39,
          "start": 120.36,
          "end": 122.94,
          "en": "So those events on the transition component",
          "zh": "所以 transition 元件上的那些事件"
        },
        {
          "id": 40,
          "start": 122.94,
          "end": 126.41,
          "en": "are always emitted when the wrapped element is added",
          "zh": "始終會被發出，當被包住的元素被加上"
        },
        {
          "id": 41,
          "start": 126.41,
          "end": 128.23,
          "en": "or removed to the DOM.",
          "zh": "或從 DOM 移除時。"
        },
        {
          "id": 42,
          "start": 128.23,
          "end": 131.89,
          "en": "But without any CSS code that controls the animation,",
          "zh": "但沒有任何控制動畫的 CSS 程式碼，"
        },
        {
          "id": 43,
          "start": 131.89,
          "end": 134.97,
          "en": "they just execute instantly after each other.",
          "zh": "它們只是一個接一個立刻執行。"
        },
        {
          "id": 44,
          "start": 134.97,
          "end": 138.15,
          "en": "Because of course, there is nothing to wait for.",
          "zh": "因為當然，沒有什麼要等的。"
        },
        {
          "id": 45,
          "start": 138.15,
          "end": 141.64,
          "en": "But that's something we can change with JavaScript now.",
          "zh": "但那是我們現在可以用 JavaScript 改變的事。"
        },
        {
          "id": 46,
          "start": 141.64,
          "end": 144.53300000000002,
          "en": "For that and before enter, we could set up our",
          "zh": "為此，在 beforeEnter，我們可以設定我們的"
        },
        {
          "id": 47,
          "start": 144.53300000000002,
          "end": 147.343,
          "en": "initial animation state.",
          "zh": "初始動畫狀態。"
        },
        {
          "id": 48,
          "start": 149.23,
          "end": 152.74,
          "en": "For example, here, we could reach out to this element,",
          "zh": "例如這裡，我們可以接觸這個元素，"
        },
        {
          "id": 49,
          "start": 152.74,
          "end": 153.92000000000002,
          "en": "which is the element on",
          "zh": "也就是那個元素，"
        },
        {
          "id": 50,
          "start": 153.92000000000002,
          "end": 156.36,
          "en": "which we want to perform the animation.",
          "zh": "我們想在它上面執行動畫的。"
        },
        {
          "id": 51,
          "start": 156.36,
          "end": 160.24,
          "en": "And we could set a style here.",
          "zh": "而我們可以在這裡設定一個 style。"
        },
        {
          "id": 52,
          "start": 160.24,
          "end": 162.78,
          "en": "We could set the style property here",
          "zh": "我們可以在這裡設定 style 屬性，"
        },
        {
          "id": 53,
          "start": 162.78,
          "end": 166.72,
          "en": "and give it an opacity of zero.",
          "zh": "並給它 opacity 零。"
        },
        {
          "id": 54,
          "start": 166.72,
          "end": 170.89,
          "en": "This is a way of programmatically setting the opacity off",
          "zh": "這是以程式的方式設定 opacity 的一種方式，"
        },
        {
          "id": 55,
          "start": 170.89,
          "end": 173.93,
          "en": "this element to zero initially.",
          "zh": "把這個元素一開始設成零。"
        },
        {
          "id": 56,
          "start": 173.93,
          "end": 175.82,
          "en": "This is Vanilla JavaScript,",
          "zh": "這是原生 JavaScript，"
        },
        {
          "id": 57,
          "start": 175.82,
          "end": 178.42000000000002,
          "en": "which we also can use here in Vue.",
          "zh": "我們在 Vue 裡這裡也可以使用。"
        },
        {
          "id": 58,
          "start": 178.42000000000002,
          "end": 180.34,
          "en": "Now that's my initial style.",
          "zh": "現在那是我的初始樣式。"
        },
        {
          "id": 59,
          "start": 180.34,
          "end": 183.427,
          "en": "In enter, I now want to change this to one,",
          "zh": "在 enter 裡，我現在想把這個改成 1，"
        },
        {
          "id": 60,
          "start": 183.427,
          "end": 187.822,
          "en": "but not instantly, but over a certain duration.",
          "zh": "但不是立刻，而是經過某段持續時間。"
        },
        {
          "id": 61,
          "start": 187.822,
          "end": 190.3,
          "en": "And that's something we can build",
          "zh": "而那是我們可以建立的事，"
        },
        {
          "id": 62,
          "start": 190.3,
          "end": 193.38,
          "en": "by calling setInterval here.",
          "zh": "藉由在這裡呼叫 setInterval。"
        },
        {
          "id": 63,
          "start": 193.38,
          "end": 197.16,
          "en": "SetInterval is a built-in JavaScript function,",
          "zh": "setInterval 是一個內建的 JavaScript 函式，"
        },
        {
          "id": 64,
          "start": 197.16,
          "end": 201.253,
          "en": "which allows us to execute code every few milliseconds.",
          "zh": "它允許我們每幾毫秒執行程式碼。"
        },
        {
          "id": 65,
          "start": 202.18,
          "end": 205.94,
          "en": "The second argument here is the amount of milliseconds",
          "zh": "這裡的第二個引數是毫秒數，"
        },
        {
          "id": 66,
          "start": 205.94,
          "end": 209.03,
          "en": "we wanna wait until the next code execution.",
          "zh": "我們想等到下一次程式碼執行的。"
        },
        {
          "id": 67,
          "start": 209.03,
          "end": 211.063,
          "en": "And here we could use 20.",
          "zh": "而這裡我們可以用 20。"
        },
        {
          "id": 68,
          "start": 211.91,
          "end": 213.9,
          "en": "At the first argument is a function",
          "zh": "第一個引數是一個函式，"
        },
        {
          "id": 69,
          "start": 213.9,
          "end": 218.22,
          "en": "which will now be executed every 20 milliseconds.",
          "zh": "它現在會每 20 毫秒被執行。"
        },
        {
          "id": 70,
          "start": 218.22,
          "end": 221.363,
          "en": "And here we could gradually change the opacity.",
          "zh": "而這裡我們可以逐漸改變 opacity。"
        },
        {
          "id": 71,
          "start": 222.96,
          "end": 225.46,
          "en": "We can do this by using our element",
          "zh": "我們可以藉由使用我們的元素來做，"
        },
        {
          "id": 72,
          "start": 225.46,
          "end": 227.37,
          "en": "and setting its opacity,",
          "zh": "並設定它的 opacity，"
        },
        {
          "id": 73,
          "start": 227.37,
          "end": 230.13,
          "en": "but now not to a hard coded value,",
          "zh": "但現在不是設成一個寫死的值，"
        },
        {
          "id": 74,
          "start": 230.13,
          "end": 233,
          "en": "but to a dynamically derived value.",
          "zh": "而是設成一個動態推導出來的值。"
        },
        {
          "id": 75,
          "start": 233,
          "end": 235.6,
          "en": "And to dynamically derive a value based on",
          "zh": "而要依"
        },
        {
          "id": 76,
          "start": 235.6,
          "end": 238.29,
          "en": "the number of intervals we already completed",
          "zh": "我們已經完成的 interval 次數"
        },
        {
          "id": 77,
          "start": 238.29,
          "end": 241.92,
          "en": "or the number of function executions we already completed,",
          "zh": "或我們已經完成的函式執行次數，動態推導一個值，"
        },
        {
          "id": 78,
          "start": 241.92,
          "end": 244.93,
          "en": "we can keep track of the current round, you could say.",
          "zh": "我們可以追蹤目前的回合，你可以說。"
        },
        {
          "id": 79,
          "start": 244.93,
          "end": 247.57,
          "en": "Add a little helper variable named around here.",
          "zh": "在這裡加一個小的輔助變數，名為 round。"
        },
        {
          "id": 80,
          "start": 247.57,
          "end": 252.465,
          "en": "Start at one and set the opacity equal to round times",
          "zh": "從 1 開始，並把 opacity 設成 round 乘上"
        },
        {
          "id": 81,
          "start": 252.465,
          "end": 254.62,
          "en": "0.1, for example.",
          "zh": "0.1，例如。"
        },
        {
          "id": 82,
          "start": 254.62,
          "end": 257.8,
          "en": "So in round one, we set it to 10% opacity.",
          "zh": "所以在第一回合，我們把它設成 10% opacity。"
        },
        {
          "id": 83,
          "start": 257.8,
          "end": 260.973,
          "en": "In the next round, we'll set it to 20%.",
          "zh": "在下一回合，我們會把它設成 20%。"
        },
        {
          "id": 84,
          "start": 263.72,
          "end": 266.6,
          "en": "Now we just need to increment the round",
          "zh": "現在我們只需要增加 round，"
        },
        {
          "id": 85,
          "start": 266.6,
          "end": 269.55,
          "en": "every time interval is called every time",
          "zh": "每次 interval 被呼叫、每次"
        },
        {
          "id": 86,
          "start": 269.55,
          "end": 272.19,
          "en": "this function is called by setInterval.",
          "zh": "這個函式被 setInterval 呼叫時。"
        },
        {
          "id": 87,
          "start": 272.19,
          "end": 274.29,
          "en": "And we need an exit condition",
          "zh": "而我們需要一個結束條件，"
        },
        {
          "id": 88,
          "start": 274.29,
          "end": 279.29,
          "en": "and check if round is greater than 10,",
          "zh": "並檢查 round 是否大於 10，"
        },
        {
          "id": 89,
          "start": 279.29,
          "end": 282.99,
          "en": "at which point we already reached 100% opacity.",
          "zh": "到那個點我們已經到達 100% opacity。"
        },
        {
          "id": 90,
          "start": 282.99,
          "end": 284.563,
          "en": "And if that's the case,",
          "zh": "而如果是那樣，"
        },
        {
          "id": 91,
          "start": 285.40999999999997,
          "end": 290.09000000000003,
          "en": "I want to call clearInterval and clear this interval.",
          "zh": "我想呼叫 clearInterval 並清除這個 interval。"
        },
        {
          "id": 92,
          "start": 290.09000000000003,
          "end": 293.134,
          "en": "We can do this by storing the interval,",
          "zh": "我們可以藉由儲存這個 interval 來做，"
        },
        {
          "id": 93,
          "start": 293.134,
          "end": 296.95,
          "en": "or a unique ID pointing at that interval you could say,",
          "zh": "或你可以說一個指向那個 interval 的唯一 ID，"
        },
        {
          "id": 94,
          "start": 296.95,
          "end": 301.163,
          "en": "in a constant and passing this to clearInterval.",
          "zh": "放在一個常數裡，並把這個傳給 clearInterval。"
        },
        {
          "id": 95,
          "start": 303.22,
          "end": 305.46,
          "en": "So now the interval will be cleared,",
          "zh": "所以現在這個 interval 會被清除，"
        },
        {
          "id": 96,
          "start": 305.46,
          "end": 309.373,
          "en": "will be stopped if we exceeded 10 rounds.",
          "zh": "如果我們超過 10 回合，它會被停止。"
        },
        {
          "id": 97,
          "start": 310.93,
          "end": 314.04,
          "en": "And now we should animate this over time.",
          "zh": "而現在我們應該隨著時間為這個加上動畫。"
        },
        {
          "id": 98,
          "start": 314.04,
          "end": 316.75,
          "en": "But with that alone, we'll have a small problem.",
          "zh": "但只有那樣，我們會有一個小問題。"
        },
        {
          "id": 99,
          "start": 316.75,
          "end": 318.33,
          "en": "It will work I will say that.",
          "zh": "我會說它能運作。"
        },
        {
          "id": 100,
          "start": 318.33,
          "end": 323.3,
          "en": "If I reload, we can see that the paragraph fades in, right?",
          "zh": "如果我重新載入，我們可以看到段落淡入，對吧？"
        },
        {
          "id": 101,
          "start": 323.3,
          "end": 324.92,
          "en": "That is something you can see.",
          "zh": "那是你可以看到的事。"
        },
        {
          "id": 102,
          "start": 324.92,
          "end": 327.11,
          "en": "And if it's too fast, you can slow it down",
          "zh": "而如果它太快，你可以把它放慢，"
        },
        {
          "id": 103,
          "start": 327.11,
          "end": 330.01,
          "en": "by only increasing this by 1%, let's say",
          "zh": "藉由只每次增加 1%，比方說，"
        },
        {
          "id": 104,
          "start": 330.01,
          "end": 332.223,
          "en": "and waiting for 100 rounds.",
          "zh": "並等待 100 回合。"
        },
        {
          "id": 105,
          "start": 333.38,
          "end": 335.8,
          "en": "Now we'll wait two seconds in the end",
          "zh": "現在我們最後會等兩秒，"
        },
        {
          "id": 106,
          "start": 335.8,
          "end": 338.2,
          "en": "until this is fully visible.",
          "zh": "直到這完全可見。"
        },
        {
          "id": 107,
          "start": 338.2,
          "end": 340.14300000000003,
          "en": "So if you save that and reload.",
          "zh": "所以如果你儲存並重新載入。"
        },
        {
          "id": 108,
          "start": 340.14300000000003,
          "end": 343.79,
          "en": "Now this fades in slowly here.",
          "zh": "現在這個在這裡慢慢淡入。"
        },
        {
          "id": 109,
          "start": 343.79,
          "end": 346.39,
          "en": "But you'll notice a problem here on the right.",
          "zh": "但你會注意到右邊這裡有一個問題。"
        },
        {
          "id": 110,
          "start": 346.39,
          "end": 350.3,
          "en": "If I reload, clear to console and click Toggle Paragraph,",
          "zh": "如果我重新載入、清掉主控台並點 Toggle Paragraph，"
        },
        {
          "id": 111,
          "start": 350.3,
          "end": 353.86,
          "en": "it fades in over two seconds, but afterEnter",
          "zh": "它在兩秒內淡入，但 afterEnter"
        },
        {
          "id": 112,
          "start": 353.86,
          "end": 356.22,
          "en": "is actually called right at the start.",
          "zh": "其實在一開始就被呼叫。"
        },
        {
          "id": 113,
          "start": 356.22,
          "end": 357.59000000000003,
          "en": "Watch again.",
          "zh": "再看一次。"
        },
        {
          "id": 114,
          "start": 357.59000000000003,
          "end": 359.26,
          "en": "I click Toggle Paragraph",
          "zh": "我點 Toggle Paragraph，"
        },
        {
          "id": 115,
          "start": 359.26,
          "end": 361.97,
          "en": "and afterEnter is called right away.",
          "zh": "而 afterEnter 立刻被呼叫。"
        },
        {
          "id": 116,
          "start": 361.97,
          "end": 364.34,
          "en": "This might or might not matter to you.",
          "zh": "這對你可能重要，也可能不重要。"
        },
        {
          "id": 117,
          "start": 364.34,
          "end": 366.37,
          "en": "Maybe it does not matter to you.",
          "zh": "也許對你不重要。"
        },
        {
          "id": 118,
          "start": 366.37,
          "end": 368.72,
          "en": "Maybe you don't care about this.",
          "zh": "也許你不在意這個。"
        },
        {
          "id": 119,
          "start": 368.72,
          "end": 371.38,
          "en": "But actually the order is wrong as you can tell;",
          "zh": "但實際上順序是錯的，如你可以看出，"
        },
        {
          "id": 120,
          "start": 371.38,
          "end": 372.81,
          "en": "it's called too early.",
          "zh": "它被呼叫得太早。"
        },
        {
          "id": 121,
          "start": 372.81,
          "end": 375.51,
          "en": "And in some cases this might matter.",
          "zh": "而在某些情況這可能重要。"
        },
        {
          "id": 122,
          "start": 375.51,
          "end": 377.16,
          "en": "And this is not a bug.",
          "zh": "而這不是一個錯誤。"
        },
        {
          "id": 123,
          "start": 377.16,
          "end": 380.256,
          "en": "But instead Vue has no chance of knowing",
          "zh": "但相反，Vue 沒有機會知道"
        },
        {
          "id": 124,
          "start": 380.256,
          "end": 382.877,
          "en": "when it should call afterEnter.",
          "zh": "它應該何時呼叫 afterEnter。"
        },
        {
          "id": 125,
          "start": 382.877,
          "end": 384.5,
          "en": "To us it's obvious.",
          "zh": "對我們來說很明顯。"
        },
        {
          "id": 126,
          "start": 384.5,
          "end": 387.84,
          "en": "I mean, we're done with enter, once we in the end",
          "zh": "我的意思是，我們完成 enter，一旦我們最後"
        },
        {
          "id": 127,
          "start": 387.84,
          "end": 389.73,
          "en": "make it into this if condition.",
          "zh": "進入這個 if 條件。"
        },
        {
          "id": 128,
          "start": 389.73,
          "end": 393.24,
          "en": "But that's something view doesn't really understand.",
          "zh": "但那是 Vue 並不真正理解的事。"
        },
        {
          "id": 129,
          "start": 393.24,
          "end": 395.2,
          "en": "That's way too logical.",
          "zh": "那太邏輯了。"
        },
        {
          "id": 130,
          "start": 395.2,
          "end": 398.81,
          "en": "It doesn't parse and try to understand our code",
          "zh": "它不會解析並試著理解我們的程式碼，"
        },
        {
          "id": 131,
          "start": 398.81,
          "end": 401.585,
          "en": "and our reasons behind writing that code.",
          "zh": "以及我們寫那段程式碼背後的理由。"
        },
        {
          "id": 132,
          "start": 401.585,
          "end": 405.12,
          "en": "Instead, we have to tell you when we're done here.",
          "zh": "相反，我們必須告訴 Vue 我們何時在這裡完成。"
        },
        {
          "id": 133,
          "start": 405.12,
          "end": 406.75,
          "en": "And for that, enter,",
          "zh": "而為此，enter"
        },
        {
          "id": 134,
          "start": 406.75,
          "end": 410.76,
          "en": "actually receives a second argument automatically.",
          "zh": "其實會自動收到第二個引數。"
        },
        {
          "id": 135,
          "start": 410.76,
          "end": 415.47,
          "en": "And that's a done function, which you can call whenever",
          "zh": "而那是一個 done 函式，你可以在任何時候呼叫，"
        },
        {
          "id": 136,
          "start": 415.47,
          "end": 420.233,
          "en": "you want to signal to Vue that you are done in this hook.",
          "zh": "你想向 Vue 發出訊號，表示你在這個 hook 裡完成了。"
        },
        {
          "id": 137,
          "start": 421.68,
          "end": 422.95,
          "en": "You don't need to call it",
          "zh": "你不需要呼叫它，"
        },
        {
          "id": 138,
          "start": 422.95,
          "end": 426.29,
          "en": "if you're having CSS-based animations",
          "zh": "如果你有以 CSS 為基礎的動畫，"
        },
        {
          "id": 139,
          "start": 426.29,
          "end": 429.17,
          "en": "because then Vue is able to read the duration",
          "zh": "因為那時 Vue 能夠讀出持續時間，"
        },
        {
          "id": 140,
          "start": 429.17,
          "end": 431.12,
          "en": "in the CSS code.",
          "zh": "在 CSS 程式碼裡。"
        },
        {
          "id": 141,
          "start": 431.12,
          "end": 434.98,
          "en": "But if you're not using CSS, if you have your own logic",
          "zh": "但如果你沒有使用 CSS，如果你有自己的邏輯，"
        },
        {
          "id": 142,
          "start": 434.98,
          "end": 437.84,
          "en": "and the duration is simply just made up",
          "zh": "而持續時間只是被湊出來的，"
        },
        {
          "id": 143,
          "start": 437.84,
          "end": 441.02,
          "en": "by incrementing round and checking this condition",
          "zh": "藉由增加 round 並檢查這個條件，"
        },
        {
          "id": 144,
          "start": 441.02,
          "end": 443.49,
          "en": "and having a certain interval time here,",
          "zh": "以及這裡有某個 interval 時間，"
        },
        {
          "id": 145,
          "start": 443.49,
          "end": 445.96,
          "en": "then you need to call done explicitly",
          "zh": "那麼你需要明確呼叫 done，"
        },
        {
          "id": 146,
          "start": 445.96,
          "end": 448.4,
          "en": "to let Vue know when you're done.",
          "zh": "讓 Vue 知道你何時完成。"
        },
        {
          "id": 147,
          "start": 448.4,
          "end": 451.8,
          "en": "So here after clearInterval, we call done.",
          "zh": "所以這裡在 clearInterval 之後，我們呼叫 done。"
        },
        {
          "id": 148,
          "start": 451.8,
          "end": 454.65999999999997,
          "en": "We call this done argument as a function",
          "zh": "我們把這個 done 引數當函式呼叫，"
        },
        {
          "id": 149,
          "start": 454.65999999999997,
          "end": 456.913,
          "en": "to let you know when we're done.",
          "zh": "讓 Vue 知道我們何時完成。"
        },
        {
          "id": 150,
          "start": 458.51,
          "end": 459.865,
          "en": "If I reload here.",
          "zh": "如果我在這裡重新載入。"
        },
        {
          "id": 151,
          "start": 459.865,
          "end": 464.26,
          "en": "Now we can toggle the paragraph and you see afterEnter",
          "zh": "現在我們可以切換段落，而你看到 afterEnter"
        },
        {
          "id": 152,
          "start": 464.26,
          "end": 467.46,
          "en": "is now really only called at a later point of time",
          "zh": "現在真的只在較晚的時間點被呼叫，"
        },
        {
          "id": 153,
          "start": 467.46,
          "end": 470.141,
          "en": "once we are indeed done.",
          "zh": "一旦我們確實完成。"
        },
        {
          "id": 154,
          "start": 470.141,
          "end": 473.34000000000003,
          "en": "And this is now how you can control animations",
          "zh": "而這現在就是你如何控制動畫，"
        },
        {
          "id": 155,
          "start": 473.34000000000003,
          "end": 475.398,
          "en": "with JavaScript.",
          "zh": "用 JavaScript。"
        },
        {
          "id": 156,
          "start": 475.398,
          "end": 478.12,
          "en": "And of course, we're not limited to controlling",
          "zh": "而當然，我們不限於用 JavaScript 控制"
        },
        {
          "id": 157,
          "start": 478.12,
          "end": 480.81,
          "en": "the enter animation with JavaScript.",
          "zh": "進入動畫。"
        },
        {
          "id": 158,
          "start": 480.81,
          "end": 483.63,
          "en": "We can also write something similar for leaving.",
          "zh": "我們也可以為離開寫類似的東西。"
        },
        {
          "id": 159,
          "start": 483.63,
          "end": 487.56,
          "en": "And definitely feel free to write the equivalent for",
          "zh": "而絕對歡迎你為"
        },
        {
          "id": 160,
          "start": 487.56,
          "end": 490.81,
          "en": "this enter animation for the leave case.",
          "zh": "這個進入動畫寫離開情況的對應版本。"
        },
        {
          "id": 161,
          "start": 490.81,
          "end": 493.71,
          "en": "So basically the opposite going from one to zero.",
          "zh": "所以基本上是相反，從 1 到 0。"
        },
        {
          "id": 162,
          "start": 493.71,
          "end": 496.72,
          "en": "Here is a quick pause for you to pause the video",
          "zh": "這裡給你一個短暫暫停，讓你暫停影片，"
        },
        {
          "id": 163,
          "start": 496.72,
          "end": 498.16,
          "en": "and try this on your own.",
          "zh": "並自己試試。"
        },
        {
          "id": 164,
          "start": 498.16,
          "end": 499.96,
          "en": "And there often will do it together.",
          "zh": "而接著我們常常會一起做。"
        },
        {
          "id": 165,
          "start": 502.56,
          "end": 504.6,
          "en": "So were are you successful?",
          "zh": "所以你成功了嗎？"
        },
        {
          "id": 166,
          "start": 504.6,
          "end": 506.65,
          "en": "Let's try to gather now.",
          "zh": "讓我們現在試著集合。"
        },
        {
          "id": 167,
          "start": 506.65,
          "end": 510.72,
          "en": "And for that here in leave, I will basically use",
          "zh": "而為此，這裡在 leave，我會基本上使用"
        },
        {
          "id": 168,
          "start": 510.72,
          "end": 513.57,
          "en": "the same logic as I had here for entering.",
          "zh": "跟我這裡進入時相同的邏輯。"
        },
        {
          "id": 169,
          "start": 513.57,
          "end": 517.8389999999999,
          "en": "I'll copy this entire code and bring it over to leave.",
          "zh": "我會複製這整段程式碼，把它搬到 leave。"
        },
        {
          "id": 170,
          "start": 517.8389999999999,
          "end": 520.15,
          "en": "But I'll do the opposite here.",
          "zh": "但我會在這裡做相反的事。"
        },
        {
          "id": 171,
          "start": 520.15,
          "end": 522.49,
          "en": "I will basically",
          "zh": "我會基本上"
        },
        {
          "id": 172,
          "start": 522.49,
          "end": 527.49,
          "en": "set my opacity to one minus this calculation,",
          "zh": "把我的 opacity 設成 1 減去這個計算，"
        },
        {
          "id": 173,
          "start": 528.006,
          "end": 531.14,
          "en": "so that we start at one and I reduce it",
          "zh": "好讓我們從 1 開始，而我減少它，"
        },
        {
          "id": 174,
          "start": 532.2,
          "end": 533.68,
          "en": "and they're all after we can leave",
          "zh": "而在那之後，我們可以讓"
        },
        {
          "id": 175,
          "start": 533.68,
          "end": 535.88,
          "en": "the rest of the code as it is.",
          "zh": "其餘程式碼保持原樣。"
        },
        {
          "id": 176,
          "start": 535.88,
          "end": 539.26,
          "en": "However, in before leave, I of course also want to set",
          "zh": "不過，在 beforeLeave，我當然也想設定"
        },
        {
          "id": 177,
          "start": 539.26,
          "end": 543.14,
          "en": "the initial opacity to one, though that is a bit redundant",
          "zh": "初始 opacity 為 1，雖然那有點多餘，"
        },
        {
          "id": 178,
          "start": 543.14,
          "end": 547.02,
          "en": "because that is our end state and our initial state of",
          "zh": "因為那是我們的結束狀態，也是我們的初始狀態，"
        },
        {
          "id": 179,
          "start": 547.02,
          "end": 549.97,
          "en": "the rendered and attached element anyways.",
          "zh": "對已渲染並掛上的元素來說，反正就是那樣。"
        },
        {
          "id": 180,
          "start": 549.97,
          "end": 552.89,
          "en": "Nonetheless, we can set it here to be very clear about",
          "zh": "儘管如此，我們可以在這裡設定它，好非常清楚"
        },
        {
          "id": 181,
          "start": 552.89,
          "end": 555.39,
          "en": "the fact that this is our starting state",
          "zh": "這是我們的起始狀態，"
        },
        {
          "id": 182,
          "start": 555.39,
          "end": 557.023,
          "en": "for the leave animation.",
          "zh": "對離開動畫來說。"
        },
        {
          "id": 183,
          "start": 558.65,
          "end": 562.46,
          "en": "And of course, we all need to accept this done argument here",
          "zh": "而當然，我們也需要在這裡接受這個 done 引數，"
        },
        {
          "id": 184,
          "start": 562.46,
          "end": 565.14,
          "en": "in the leave method, so that we can call it here",
          "zh": "在 leave 方法裡，好讓我們能在這裡呼叫它，"
        },
        {
          "id": 185,
          "start": 565.14,
          "end": 566.343,
          "en": "when we are done.",
          "zh": "當我們完成時。"
        },
        {
          "id": 186,
          "start": 567.32,
          "end": 568.9,
          "en": "Now, we can also of course,",
          "zh": "現在，我們當然也可以"
        },
        {
          "id": 187,
          "start": 568.9,
          "end": 570.95,
          "en": "work with different timings here,",
          "zh": "在這裡使用不同的時間，"
        },
        {
          "id": 188,
          "start": 570.95,
          "end": 573.5,
          "en": "a different amount of rounds if we wanted to.",
          "zh": "如果我們想要，不同的回合數。"
        },
        {
          "id": 189,
          "start": 573.5,
          "end": 575.75,
          "en": "But I'll leave everything as it is.",
          "zh": "但我會讓一切保持原樣。"
        },
        {
          "id": 190,
          "start": 575.75,
          "end": 577.97,
          "en": "And with that, if I reload,",
          "zh": "而有了那個，如果我重新載入，"
        },
        {
          "id": 191,
          "start": 577.97,
          "end": 581.86,
          "en": "I can toggle the paragraph to animate it in.",
          "zh": "我可以切換段落，為它進入加上動畫。"
        },
        {
          "id": 192,
          "start": 581.86,
          "end": 585.233,
          "en": "And then I can also animate it out.",
          "zh": "然後我也可以為它離開加上動畫。"
        },
        {
          "id": 193,
          "start": 587.17,
          "end": 591.45,
          "en": "And that is how you can control animations with JavaScript.",
          "zh": "而那就是你如何用 JavaScript 控制動畫。"
        },
        {
          "id": 194,
          "start": 591.45,
          "end": 594.55,
          "en": "Now, by the way, if this is animating in",
          "zh": "現在，順帶一提，如果這個正在淡入，"
        },
        {
          "id": 195,
          "start": 594.55,
          "end": 597.37,
          "en": "and I then click toggle paragraph,",
          "zh": "然後我點 Toggle Paragraph，"
        },
        {
          "id": 196,
          "start": 597.37,
          "end": 601.77,
          "en": "again, this automatically cancel and reverses it.",
          "zh": "再一次，這會自動取消並反轉它。"
        },
        {
          "id": 197,
          "start": 601.77,
          "end": 605.113,
          "en": "However, you'll also see it flickers a little bit.",
          "zh": "不過，你也會看到它閃爍一點。"
        },
        {
          "id": 198,
          "start": 606.34,
          "end": 608.63,
          "en": "And it's flickering, because in the end",
          "zh": "而它閃爍，是因為到最後"
        },
        {
          "id": 199,
          "start": 608.63,
          "end": 611.568,
          "en": "it's playing two animations at the same time.",
          "zh": "它同時播放兩個動畫。"
        },
        {
          "id": 200,
          "start": 611.568,
          "end": 615.81,
          "en": "If we cancel the first animation that effectively just means",
          "zh": "如果我們取消第一個動畫，那實際上只表示"
        },
        {
          "id": 201,
          "start": 615.81,
          "end": 617.93,
          "en": "that the leave animation starts before",
          "zh": "離開動畫在"
        },
        {
          "id": 202,
          "start": 617.93,
          "end": 621.64,
          "en": "the entering animation finished or the other way around.",
          "zh": "進入動畫完成之前就開始，或反過來。"
        },
        {
          "id": 203,
          "start": 621.64,
          "end": 624.31,
          "en": "So then both animations are playing at the same time",
          "zh": "所以那時兩個動畫同時播放，"
        },
        {
          "id": 204,
          "start": 625.21,
          "end": 627.773,
          "en": "resulting in that flickering which you saw here.",
          "zh": "造成你在這裡看到的那個閃爍。"
        },
        {
          "id": 205,
          "start": 628.65,
          "end": 631.103,
          "en": "And that's also something we can prevent.",
          "zh": "而那也是我們可以避免的事。"
        },
        {
          "id": 206,
          "start": 632.69,
          "end": 636.927,
          "en": "Because there is another useful event which is emitted by",
          "zh": "因為還有另一個有用的事件，由"
        },
        {
          "id": 207,
          "start": 636.927,
          "end": 638.76,
          "en": "the transition component.",
          "zh": "transition 元件發出。"
        },
        {
          "id": 208,
          "start": 638.76,
          "end": 643.68,
          "en": "And that is the enter dash canceled event",
          "zh": "而那是 enter-cancelled 事件，"
        },
        {
          "id": 209,
          "start": 643.68,
          "end": 648.066,
          "en": "and the leave canceled event.",
          "zh": "以及 leave-cancelled 事件。"
        },
        {
          "id": 210,
          "start": 648.066,
          "end": 651.59,
          "en": "And here we can execute methods which are called whenever",
          "zh": "而這裡我們可以執行一些方法，它們被呼叫，每當"
        },
        {
          "id": 211,
          "start": 651.59,
          "end": 654.29,
          "en": "the animation is canceled.",
          "zh": "動畫被取消時。"
        },
        {
          "id": 212,
          "start": 654.29,
          "end": 656.64,
          "en": "And by the way, those events are always emitted",
          "zh": "而順帶一提，那些事件始終會被發出，"
        },
        {
          "id": 213,
          "start": 656.64,
          "end": 659.58,
          "en": "when it's canceled, no matter if you are writing your logic",
          "zh": "當它被取消時，不論你是否用 JavaScript 寫你的邏輯，"
        },
        {
          "id": 214,
          "start": 659.58,
          "end": 661.91,
          "en": "with JavaScript as we're doing it here.",
          "zh": "如我們在這裡做的。"
        },
        {
          "id": 215,
          "start": 661.91,
          "end": 664.74,
          "en": "Or if you would be using CSS as we did before.",
          "zh": "或如果你會使用 CSS，如我們之前做的。"
        },
        {
          "id": 216,
          "start": 664.74,
          "end": 667.54,
          "en": "Whenever one transition isn't finished,",
          "zh": "每當一個轉場還沒完成，"
        },
        {
          "id": 217,
          "start": 667.54,
          "end": 670.04,
          "en": "when you start a new a transition,",
          "zh": "而你開始一個新的轉場，"
        },
        {
          "id": 218,
          "start": 670.04,
          "end": 673.53,
          "en": "the respective canceled event will be emitted.",
          "zh": "對應的 cancelled 事件就會被發出。"
        },
        {
          "id": 219,
          "start": 673.53,
          "end": 677.96,
          "en": "So here we can have an enterCanceled method",
          "zh": "所以這裡我們可以有一個 enterCancelled 方法，"
        },
        {
          "id": 220,
          "start": 677.96,
          "end": 682.46,
          "en": "and a leaveCanceled method that should be called.",
          "zh": "以及一個應該被呼叫的 leaveCancelled 方法。"
        },
        {
          "id": 221,
          "start": 682.46,
          "end": 685.65,
          "en": "Now let's add those two methods therefore.",
          "zh": "現在因此讓我們加上那兩個方法。"
        },
        {
          "id": 222,
          "start": 685.65,
          "end": 688.73,
          "en": "EnterCanceled",
          "zh": "enterCancelled"
        },
        {
          "id": 223,
          "start": 689.71,
          "end": 690.61,
          "en": "and leaveCanceled.",
          "zh": "和 leaveCancelled。"
        },
        {
          "id": 224,
          "start": 692.62,
          "end": 694.55,
          "en": "And of course here we can also log",
          "zh": "而當然這裡我們也可以 log"
        },
        {
          "id": 225,
          "start": 694.55,
          "end": 696.04,
          "en": "something to the console.",
          "zh": "某樣東西到主控台。"
        },
        {
          "id": 226,
          "start": 696.04,
          "end": 699.09,
          "en": "We also get the element here and we could change it.",
          "zh": "我們在這裡也得到元素，而我們可以改變它。"
        },
        {
          "id": 227,
          "start": 699.09,
          "end": 701.66,
          "en": "But I want to do one important thing here.",
          "zh": "但我想在這裡做一件重要的事。"
        },
        {
          "id": 228,
          "start": 701.66,
          "end": 704.06,
          "en": "If the enter animation gets canceled,",
          "zh": "如果進入動畫被取消，"
        },
        {
          "id": 229,
          "start": 704.06,
          "end": 707.86,
          "en": "I want to cancel my enter interval here,",
          "zh": "我想在這裡取消我的 enter interval，"
        },
        {
          "id": 230,
          "start": 707.86,
          "end": 711.1,
          "en": "this interval, immediately before it completes.",
          "zh": "這個 interval，在它完成之前立刻取消。"
        },
        {
          "id": 231,
          "start": 711.1,
          "end": 714.85,
          "en": "So that it's not just cleared if the rounds reach 100",
          "zh": "所以它不只在回合到達 100 時被清除，"
        },
        {
          "id": 232,
          "start": 714.85,
          "end": 719.15,
          "en": "but that I also clear it if enterCanceled is triggered.",
          "zh": "而是如果 enterCancelled 被觸發，我也清除它。"
        },
        {
          "id": 233,
          "start": 719.15,
          "end": 721.91,
          "en": "So that the enter animation is immediately canceled",
          "zh": "好讓進入動畫立刻被取消，"
        },
        {
          "id": 234,
          "start": 721.91,
          "end": 723.743,
          "en": "when the leaf animation starts.",
          "zh": "當離開動畫開始時。"
        },
        {
          "id": 235,
          "start": 724.66,
          "end": 727.93,
          "en": "And I want to do the same in leaveCanceled.",
          "zh": "而我想在 leaveCancelled 裡做同樣的事。"
        },
        {
          "id": 236,
          "start": 727.93,
          "end": 732.03,
          "en": "The problem is that we store our interval in constants,",
          "zh": "問題是我們把 interval 存在常數裡，"
        },
        {
          "id": 237,
          "start": 732.03,
          "end": 736.16,
          "en": "which are part of the enter and the leave methods.",
          "zh": "那些常數是 enter 和 leave 方法的一部分。"
        },
        {
          "id": 238,
          "start": 736.16,
          "end": 738.69,
          "en": "So these constants are only available",
          "zh": "所以這些常數只在"
        },
        {
          "id": 239,
          "start": 738.69,
          "end": 741.73,
          "en": "inside of these methods and not available",
          "zh": "這些方法裡面可用，而不可用"
        },
        {
          "id": 240,
          "start": 741.73,
          "end": 743.823,
          "en": "inside of enter and leave canceled.",
          "zh": "在 enterCancelled 和 leaveCancelled 裡面。"
        },
        {
          "id": 241,
          "start": 745.51,
          "end": 747.5,
          "en": "But the solution is simple.",
          "zh": "但解決方式很簡單。"
        },
        {
          "id": 242,
          "start": 747.5,
          "end": 751.184,
          "en": "These are regular methods in the methods property, right?",
          "zh": "這些是 methods 屬性裡的一般方法，對吧？"
        },
        {
          "id": 243,
          "start": 751.184,
          "end": 753.92,
          "en": "So, in the end, we can just use data property",
          "zh": "所以到最後，我們可以只用 data 屬性"
        },
        {
          "id": 244,
          "start": 753.92,
          "end": 755.79,
          "en": "to store those intervals.",
          "zh": "來儲存那些 intervals。"
        },
        {
          "id": 245,
          "start": 755.79,
          "end": 760.12,
          "en": "And we can have our enterInterval here,",
          "zh": "而我們可以在這裡有 enterInterval，"
        },
        {
          "id": 246,
          "start": 760.12,
          "end": 761.51,
          "en": "which initially is null.",
          "zh": "它一開始是 null。"
        },
        {
          "id": 247,
          "start": 761.51,
          "end": 765.2139999999999,
          "en": "And our leaveInterval, which initially is null.",
          "zh": "以及 leaveInterval，它一開始是 null。"
        },
        {
          "id": 248,
          "start": 765.2139999999999,
          "end": 769.08,
          "en": "And now we store the interval we create here",
          "zh": "而現在我們把我們在這裡建立的 interval 存起來，"
        },
        {
          "id": 249,
          "start": 769.08,
          "end": 770.49,
          "en": "in the Enter method",
          "zh": "在 enter 方法裡，"
        },
        {
          "id": 250,
          "start": 771.53,
          "end": 774.165,
          "en": "in this enterInterval.",
          "zh": "存進 this.enterInterval。"
        },
        {
          "id": 251,
          "start": 774.165,
          "end": 778.529,
          "en": "And we cleared this enterInterval here",
          "zh": "而我們在這裡清除這個 enterInterval，"
        },
        {
          "id": 252,
          "start": 778.529,
          "end": 781,
          "en": "and we do the same in the leave method.",
          "zh": "而我們在 leave 方法裡做同樣的事。"
        },
        {
          "id": 253,
          "start": 781,
          "end": 785.11,
          "en": "There we store the interval in this leaveInterval.",
          "zh": "在那裡我們把 interval 存在 this.leaveInterval。"
        },
        {
          "id": 254,
          "start": 785.966,
          "end": 789.7,
          "en": "And we cancel this leaveInterval.",
          "zh": "而我們取消這個 leaveInterval。"
        },
        {
          "id": 255,
          "start": 792.21,
          "end": 794.15,
          "en": "We'll face a little problem here",
          "zh": "我們會在這裡遇到一個小問題，"
        },
        {
          "id": 256,
          "start": 794.15,
          "end": 797.46,
          "en": "because here we're accessing this leaveInterval",
          "zh": "因為這裡我們正在存取 this.leaveInterval"
        },
        {
          "id": 257,
          "start": 797.46,
          "end": 800.92,
          "en": "and this enterInterval inside of a nested function.",
          "zh": "和 this.enterInterval，在一個巢狀函式裡面。"
        },
        {
          "id": 258,
          "start": 800.92,
          "end": 805.65,
          "en": "And in there to this keyword will unfortunately not refer to",
          "zh": "而在那裡面，this 關鍵字不幸不會指向"
        },
        {
          "id": 259,
          "start": 805.65,
          "end": 808.52,
          "en": "the same thing to the Vue app object",
          "zh": "同一件事，也就是 Vue 應用程式物件，"
        },
        {
          "id": 260,
          "start": 808.52,
          "end": 811.533,
          "en": "as it does outside of this nested function.",
          "zh": "如它在這個巢狀函式外面那樣。"
        },
        {
          "id": 261,
          "start": 812.53,
          "end": 816.33,
          "en": "The workaround is simple, we use an arrow function.",
          "zh": "解決方式很簡單，我們使用箭頭函式。"
        },
        {
          "id": 262,
          "start": 816.33,
          "end": 819.54,
          "en": "There to this keyword is not overwritten",
          "zh": "在那裡 this 關鍵字不會被覆寫，"
        },
        {
          "id": 263,
          "start": 819.54,
          "end": 821.89,
          "en": "and will therefore keep its context.",
          "zh": "因此會保留它的情境。"
        },
        {
          "id": 264,
          "start": 821.89,
          "end": 825,
          "en": "So make sure that in both setInterval calls",
          "zh": "所以確定在兩個 setInterval 呼叫裡"
        },
        {
          "id": 265,
          "start": 825,
          "end": 827.033,
          "en": "you use an arrow function.",
          "zh": "你都使用箭頭函式。"
        },
        {
          "id": 266,
          "start": 828.048,
          "end": 832.15,
          "en": "And with that, we can now use leave and enter interval",
          "zh": "而有了那個，我們現在可以使用 leaveInterval 和 enterInterval，"
        },
        {
          "id": 267,
          "start": 832.15,
          "end": 836.02,
          "en": "those new data properties, also in the canceled methods.",
          "zh": "那些新的 data 屬性，也在 cancelled 方法裡。"
        },
        {
          "id": 268,
          "start": 836.02,
          "end": 840.751,
          "en": "And we can call clearInterval on this",
          "zh": "而我們可以對這個呼叫 clearInterval，"
        },
        {
          "id": 269,
          "start": 840.751,
          "end": 842.91,
          "en": "enterInterval.",
          "zh": "enterInterval。"
        },
        {
          "id": 270,
          "start": 842.91,
          "end": 847.613,
          "en": "And in leaveCanceled, clearInterval on this",
          "zh": "而在 leaveCancelled 裡，對這個呼叫 clearInterval，"
        },
        {
          "id": 271,
          "start": 847.613,
          "end": 848.78,
          "en": "leaveInterval.",
          "zh": "leaveInterval。"
        },
        {
          "id": 272,
          "start": 852.06,
          "end": 853.483,
          "en": "And if we save this,",
          "zh": "而如果我們儲存，"
        },
        {
          "id": 273,
          "start": 854.39,
          "end": 855.61,
          "en": "yeah, my setup complains",
          "zh": "是的，我的設定抱怨"
        },
        {
          "id": 274,
          "start": 855.61,
          "end": 857.97,
          "en": "that I'm never using the L property.",
          "zh": "我從未使用 el 屬性。"
        },
        {
          "id": 275,
          "start": 857.97,
          "end": 861.61,
          "en": "Well therefore for completeness sake, I will log it here.",
          "zh": "因此為了完整，我會在這裡把它 log 出來。"
        },
        {
          "id": 276,
          "start": 861.61,
          "end": 864.64,
          "en": "Alternatively you omit it if you don't need it.",
          "zh": "或者如果你不需要它，你可以省略它。"
        },
        {
          "id": 277,
          "start": 864.64,
          "end": 866.97,
          "en": "But I will just leave it here so that it is clear",
          "zh": "但我會把它留在這裡，好讓清楚"
        },
        {
          "id": 278,
          "start": 866.97,
          "end": 868.65,
          "en": "that we would be getting it.",
          "zh": "我們會得到它。"
        },
        {
          "id": 279,
          "start": 868.65,
          "end": 872.08,
          "en": "Log it here, save it, everything it saves now.",
          "zh": "在這裡 log 它，儲存，現在一切都儲存了。"
        },
        {
          "id": 280,
          "start": 872.08,
          "end": 875.358,
          "en": "And now if I click Toggle Paragraph and click again,",
          "zh": "而現在如果我點 Toggle Paragraph 並再點一次，"
        },
        {
          "id": 281,
          "start": 875.358,
          "end": 877.89,
          "en": "now we have no flickering",
          "zh": "現在我們沒有閃爍，"
        },
        {
          "id": 282,
          "start": 877.89,
          "end": 879.9,
          "en": "because now we're canceling this.",
          "zh": "因為現在我們正在取消這個。"
        },
        {
          "id": 283,
          "start": 879.9,
          "end": 883.66,
          "en": "We're clearing the interval and we're going back",
          "zh": "我們正在清除 interval，而我們回去"
        },
        {
          "id": 284,
          "start": 883.66,
          "end": 885.233,
          "en": "to removing this therefore.",
          "zh": "因此移除這個。"
        },
        {
          "id": 285,
          "start": 888.17,
          "end": 892.11,
          "en": "So this is now enter and leave canceled",
          "zh": "所以這現在是 enter-cancelled 和 leave-cancelled，"
        },
        {
          "id": 286,
          "start": 892.11,
          "end": 895.433,
          "en": "that these events exist and what you can do with them.",
          "zh": "這些事件存在，以及你可以用它們做什麼。"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "21879518",
      "title": "Disabling CSS Transitions",
      "lectureOrder": 205,
      "videoOrder": 180,
      "sourceHash": "d25bd7b17c7e00db6339ac846017b30db7f5271a8d9d430fc78424a9edb501df",
      "cues": [
        {
          "id": 1,
          "start": 2.1,
          "end": 5.85,
          "en": "Now, we saw JavaScript based animations in action",
          "zh": "現在，我們看到了以 JavaScript 為基礎的動畫實際運作，"
        },
        {
          "id": 2,
          "start": 5.85,
          "end": 7.8,
          "en": "with help of these special events,",
          "zh": "靠這些特殊事件的幫助，"
        },
        {
          "id": 3,
          "start": 7.8,
          "end": 9.68,
          "en": "and I just want to emphasize again",
          "zh": "而我只想再強調一次，"
        },
        {
          "id": 4,
          "start": 9.68,
          "end": 12.43,
          "en": "that these events are always emitted,",
          "zh": "這些事件始終會被發出，"
        },
        {
          "id": 5,
          "start": 12.43,
          "end": 14.88,
          "en": "no matter if you control your animation",
          "zh": "不論你是否控制你的動畫，"
        },
        {
          "id": 6,
          "start": 14.88,
          "end": 16.63,
          "en": "with JavaScript or not.",
          "zh": "用 JavaScript 或不用。"
        },
        {
          "id": 7,
          "start": 16.63,
          "end": 19.75,
          "en": "If you control it with CSS, as we did before,",
          "zh": "如果你用 CSS 控制它，如我們之前做的，"
        },
        {
          "id": 8,
          "start": 19.75,
          "end": 21.67,
          "en": "those events are also emitted,",
          "zh": "那些事件也會被發出，"
        },
        {
          "id": 9,
          "start": 21.67,
          "end": 23.883,
          "en": "so that you can run any code you want.",
          "zh": "好讓你能執行任何你想要的程式碼。"
        },
        {
          "id": 10,
          "start": 24.96,
          "end": 27.52,
          "en": "But you can also leverage those events,",
          "zh": "但你也可以使用那些事件，"
        },
        {
          "id": 11,
          "start": 27.52,
          "end": 29.19,
          "en": "as you saw in the last lecture,",
          "zh": "如你在上一堂看到的，"
        },
        {
          "id": 12,
          "start": 29.19,
          "end": 32.53,
          "en": "to control the entire animation through JavaScript,",
          "zh": "透過 JavaScript 控制整個動畫，"
        },
        {
          "id": 13,
          "start": 32.53,
          "end": 35.58,
          "en": "either through your own JavaScript code, as we did it,",
          "zh": "或者透過你自己的 JavaScript 程式碼，如我們做的，"
        },
        {
          "id": 14,
          "start": 35.58,
          "end": 37.79,
          "en": "or by using another third party,",
          "zh": "或藉由使用另一個第三方"
        },
        {
          "id": 15,
          "start": 37.79,
          "end": 40.373,
          "en": "JavaScript animation library, for example.",
          "zh": "JavaScript 動畫函式庫，例如。"
        },
        {
          "id": 16,
          "start": 41.41,
          "end": 44.61,
          "en": "Now, if you control your entire animation",
          "zh": "現在，如果你透過 JavaScript"
        },
        {
          "id": 17,
          "start": 44.61,
          "end": 45.99,
          "en": "through JavaScript,",
          "zh": "控制你的整個動畫，"
        },
        {
          "id": 18,
          "start": 45.99,
          "end": 48.7,
          "en": "as we're doing it here on this paragraph now,",
          "zh": "如我們現在在這個段落上做的，"
        },
        {
          "id": 19,
          "start": 48.7,
          "end": 52.57,
          "en": "you can add another property on this transition.",
          "zh": "你可以在這個 transition 上加另一個屬性。"
        },
        {
          "id": 20,
          "start": 52.57,
          "end": 55.06,
          "en": "Instead of setting a name, which we don't need now,",
          "zh": "不再設定 name，我們現在不需要它，"
        },
        {
          "id": 21,
          "start": 55.06,
          "end": 58.42,
          "en": "you can add the CSS prop",
          "zh": "你可以加上 css prop，"
        },
        {
          "id": 22,
          "start": 58.42,
          "end": 61.493,
          "en": "and bind it to false.",
          "zh": "並把它繫結成 false。"
        },
        {
          "id": 23,
          "start": 62.89,
          "end": 64.51,
          "en": "Now, what does this do?",
          "zh": "現在，這做什麼？"
        },
        {
          "id": 24,
          "start": 64.51,
          "end": 67.83,
          "en": "This tells vue that this transition",
          "zh": "這告訴 Vue，這個轉場，"
        },
        {
          "id": 25,
          "start": 67.83,
          "end": 69.63,
          "en": "controlled by this transition component",
          "zh": "由這個 transition 元件控制的，"
        },
        {
          "id": 26,
          "start": 69.63,
          "end": 74.63,
          "en": "on this paragraph will not use CSS.",
          "zh": "在這個段落上，不會使用 CSS。"
        },
        {
          "id": 27,
          "start": 74.78,
          "end": 77.03,
          "en": "It will not use a CSS transition",
          "zh": "它不會使用 CSS transition，"
        },
        {
          "id": 28,
          "start": 77.03,
          "end": 80.66,
          "en": "or a CSS animation defined in CSS code.",
          "zh": "或在 CSS 程式碼裡定義的 CSS animation。"
        },
        {
          "id": 29,
          "start": 80.66,
          "end": 83.33,
          "en": "Instead, the entire transition will be controlled",
          "zh": "相反，整個轉場會透過"
        },
        {
          "id": 30,
          "start": 83.33,
          "end": 84.68299999999999,
          "en": "through JavaScript.",
          "zh": "JavaScript 被控制。"
        },
        {
          "id": 31,
          "start": 86.07,
          "end": 89.11,
          "en": "And why is this a helpful piece of information",
          "zh": "而為什麼這是一份有幫助的資訊，"
        },
        {
          "id": 32,
          "start": 89.11,
          "end": 90.78,
          "en": "we can pass to you?",
          "zh": "我們可以傳給 Vue？"
        },
        {
          "id": 33,
          "start": 90.78,
          "end": 94.61,
          "en": "It's technically not required, as you saw it worked.",
          "zh": "技術上它不是必須的，如你看到的，它能運作。"
        },
        {
          "id": 34,
          "start": 94.61,
          "end": 96.68,
          "en": "But now by passing this prop,",
          "zh": "但現在藉由傳這個 prop，"
        },
        {
          "id": 35,
          "start": 96.68,
          "end": 101.11,
          "en": "we tell vue that it doesn't even need to search",
          "zh": "我們告訴 Vue，它甚至不需要搜尋"
        },
        {
          "id": 36,
          "start": 101.11,
          "end": 104.02000000000001,
          "en": "for the respective CSS classes",
          "zh": "對應的 CSS classes，"
        },
        {
          "id": 37,
          "start": 104.02000000000001,
          "end": 106.78999999999999,
          "en": "in our CSS code for this transition.",
          "zh": "在我們給這個轉場的 CSS 程式碼裡。"
        },
        {
          "id": 38,
          "start": 106.78999999999999,
          "end": 110.64,
          "en": "It doesn't even need to try to read the duration",
          "zh": "它甚至不需要試著從我們的 CSS 程式碼讀持續時間，"
        },
        {
          "id": 39,
          "start": 110.64,
          "end": 113.84,
          "en": "from our CSS code, because it won't find it,",
          "zh": "因為它找不到，"
        },
        {
          "id": 40,
          "start": 113.84,
          "end": 115.973,
          "en": "because we're not using CSS code.",
          "zh": "因為我們沒有使用 CSS 程式碼。"
        },
        {
          "id": 41,
          "start": 117.28999999999999,
          "end": 121.46,
          "en": "Therefore, it skips this CSS analysis step,",
          "zh": "因此，它跳過這個 CSS 分析步驟，"
        },
        {
          "id": 42,
          "start": 121.46,
          "end": 125.25,
          "en": "it skips searching for the respect of CSS classes",
          "zh": "它跳過搜尋對應的 CSS classes，"
        },
        {
          "id": 43,
          "start": 125.25,
          "end": 128.13,
          "en": "and the duration of this animation in CSS.",
          "zh": "以及這個動畫在 CSS 裡的持續時間。"
        },
        {
          "id": 44,
          "start": 128.13,
          "end": 131.1,
          "en": "And that simply improves performance a little bit,",
          "zh": "而那只是稍微改善效能，"
        },
        {
          "id": 45,
          "start": 131.1,
          "end": 134.64,
          "en": "because it doesn't need to do this unnecessary step.",
          "zh": "因為它不需要做這個不必要的步驟。"
        },
        {
          "id": 46,
          "start": 134.64,
          "end": 137.68,
          "en": "Hence, you should of course only add CSS false,",
          "zh": "因此，你當然只應該加上 css 為 false，"
        },
        {
          "id": 47,
          "start": 137.68,
          "end": 141.493,
          "en": "if you really don't use CSS code for this transition.",
          "zh": "如果你真的不用 CSS 程式碼來做這個轉場。"
        },
        {
          "id": 48,
          "start": 142.47,
          "end": 143.303,
          "en": "And for example,",
          "zh": "而例如，"
        },
        {
          "id": 49,
          "start": 143.303,
          "end": 145.983,
          "en": "on the other transition user that we have here,",
          "zh": "在我們這裡另一個 transition 上，"
        },
        {
          "id": 50,
          "start": 146.89,
          "end": 149.05,
          "en": "like on these two alternative buttons,",
          "zh": "像是這兩個互斥的按鈕，"
        },
        {
          "id": 51,
          "start": 149.05,
          "end": 152.51,
          "en": "we absolutely must not set CSS to false,",
          "zh": "我們絕對不可以把 css 設成 false，"
        },
        {
          "id": 52,
          "start": 152.51,
          "end": 154.81,
          "en": "because there we are relying on",
          "zh": "因為在那裡我們依賴"
        },
        {
          "id": 53,
          "start": 154.81,
          "end": 157.183,
          "en": "CSS transitions and animations.",
          "zh": "CSS transitions 和 animations。"
        },
        {
          "id": 54,
          "start": 158.27,
          "end": 159.46,
          "en": "But if you don't do that,",
          "zh": "但如果你不那樣做，"
        },
        {
          "id": 55,
          "start": 159.46,
          "end": 163.21,
          "en": "if you just control your animation through JavaScript only,",
          "zh": "如果你只透過 JavaScript 控制你的動畫，"
        },
        {
          "id": 56,
          "start": 163.21,
          "end": 167.753,
          "en": "then you can set CSS to false, to optimize performance.",
          "zh": "那麼你可以把 css 設成 false，來最佳化效能。"
        },
        {
          "id": 57,
          "start": 169.32999999999998,
          "end": 171.62,
          "en": "With that, we reload.",
          "zh": "有了那個，我們重新載入。"
        },
        {
          "id": 58,
          "start": 171.62,
          "end": 173.74,
          "en": "This still works as before,",
          "zh": "這仍然如之前那樣運作，"
        },
        {
          "id": 59,
          "start": 173.74,
          "end": 176.78,
          "en": "but now even a bit more performant.",
          "zh": "但現在甚至更有效能一點。"
        },
        {
          "id": 60,
          "start": 176.78,
          "end": 178.77,
          "en": "Will not notice the difference here,",
          "zh": "在這裡不會注意到差別，"
        },
        {
          "id": 61,
          "start": 178.77,
          "end": 181.16,
          "en": "but it is there, and tiny things like that",
          "zh": "但它在那裡，而像那樣的小事"
        },
        {
          "id": 62,
          "start": 181.16,
          "end": 183.153,
          "en": "can make your app faster in the end.",
          "zh": "最後可以讓你的應用程式更快。"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "21880974",
      "title": "Getting Started with Animated Lists",
      "lectureOrder": 206,
      "videoOrder": 181,
      "sourceHash": "78ca38a4774d566035f462d3ba056640cf5816468598e3aa091fb2d729b13404",
      "cues": [
        {
          "id": 1,
          "start": 2.24,
          "end": 4.54,
          "en": "Now up to this point, we always added",
          "zh": "現在到目前為止，我們總是加上"
        },
        {
          "id": 2,
          "start": 4.54,
          "end": 8.02,
          "en": "the addition or removal off just one element.",
          "zh": "只是一個元素的加上或移除。"
        },
        {
          "id": 3,
          "start": 8.02,
          "end": 10.56,
          "en": "I mean, even with the two buttons here,",
          "zh": "我的意思是，即使這裡有兩個按鈕，"
        },
        {
          "id": 4,
          "start": 10.56,
          "end": 13.58,
          "en": "it was about having just one button active",
          "zh": "那也是關於同一時間在頁面上"
        },
        {
          "id": 5,
          "start": 13.58,
          "end": 15.99,
          "en": "on the page at the same time.",
          "zh": "只有一個按鈕是作用中的。"
        },
        {
          "id": 6,
          "start": 15.99,
          "end": 18.54,
          "en": "But sometimes you also have the lists of data,",
          "zh": "但有時你也有資料清單，"
        },
        {
          "id": 7,
          "start": 18.54,
          "end": 19.62,
          "en": "which you want to animate.",
          "zh": "你想為它們加上動畫。"
        },
        {
          "id": 8,
          "start": 19.62,
          "end": 21.84,
          "en": "So you have multiple list items",
          "zh": "所以你有多個清單項目，"
        },
        {
          "id": 9,
          "start": 21.84,
          "end": 23.82,
          "en": "and you might wanna animate this",
          "zh": "而你可能想為這個加上動畫，"
        },
        {
          "id": 10,
          "start": 23.82,
          "end": 27.663,
          "en": "and thankfully Vue got you covered for that as well.",
          "zh": "而幸好 Vue 在這方面也涵蓋了你。"
        },
        {
          "id": 11,
          "start": 28.67,
          "end": 32.2,
          "en": "I'll add a new component ListData.vue",
          "zh": "我會加一個新元件 ListData.vue，"
        },
        {
          "id": 12,
          "start": 32.2,
          "end": 34.05,
          "en": "the name of course is up to you",
          "zh": "名稱當然由你決定，"
        },
        {
          "id": 13,
          "start": 34.05,
          "end": 36.06,
          "en": "and I'm just using the new component",
          "zh": "而我只是使用這個新元件，"
        },
        {
          "id": 14,
          "start": 36.06,
          "end": 39.33,
          "en": "to keep the code split up and keep it manageable,",
          "zh": "好讓程式碼拆開並保持可管理，"
        },
        {
          "id": 15,
          "start": 39.33,
          "end": 42.03,
          "en": "since App.vue is already a large component",
          "zh": "因為 App.vue 已經是一個大元件，"
        },
        {
          "id": 16,
          "start": 42.03,
          "end": 44.32,
          "en": "with a lot of code in there.",
          "zh": "裡面有很多程式碼。"
        },
        {
          "id": 17,
          "start": 44.32,
          "end": 47.23,
          "en": "So ListData.vue is a simple component.",
          "zh": "所以 ListData.vue 是一個簡單元件。"
        },
        {
          "id": 18,
          "start": 47.23,
          "end": 49.41,
          "en": "We'll have an unordered list in there",
          "zh": "我們會在那裡面有一個無序清單，"
        },
        {
          "id": 19,
          "start": 49.41,
          "end": 52.57,
          "en": "and we'll have a little bit of dummy list data",
          "zh": "而我們會有一點示範用的清單資料，"
        },
        {
          "id": 20,
          "start": 52.57,
          "end": 55.77,
          "en": "in our component object here.",
          "zh": "在這裡我們的元件物件裡。"
        },
        {
          "id": 21,
          "start": 55.77,
          "end": 58.31,
          "en": "Now it's up to you, which data you want here.",
          "zh": "現在由你決定你想在這裡放什麼資料。"
        },
        {
          "id": 22,
          "start": 58.31,
          "end": 60.29,
          "en": "I will have a users key",
          "zh": "我會有一個 users 鍵，"
        },
        {
          "id": 23,
          "start": 60.29,
          "end": 63.213,
          "en": "and have 'Max', 'Manu', 'Julie'",
          "zh": "並有 'Max'、'Manu'、'Julie'、"
        },
        {
          "id": 24,
          "start": 67.071,
          "end": 70.7,
          "en": "'Angela' and 'Michael' here as names,",
          "zh": "'Angela' 和 'Michael' 作為名稱，"
        },
        {
          "id": 25,
          "start": 70.7,
          "end": 73.343,
          "en": "but you can of course add as many names as you want.",
          "zh": "但你當然可以加上你想要的任意多個名稱。"
        },
        {
          "id": 26,
          "start": 75.44,
          "end": 76.88,
          "en": "Now, my goal is of course,",
          "zh": "現在，我的目標當然是"
        },
        {
          "id": 27,
          "start": 76.88,
          "end": 80.28,
          "en": "to output those items here in a list",
          "zh": "在這裡的清單裡輸出那些項目，"
        },
        {
          "id": 28,
          "start": 80.28,
          "end": 83.64,
          "en": "so we can use v-for to loop through to users",
          "zh": "所以我們可以用 v-for 迴圈走訪 users，"
        },
        {
          "id": 29,
          "start": 83.64,
          "end": 85.76,
          "en": "so \"user in users\"",
          "zh": "所以是 \"user in users\"，"
        },
        {
          "id": 30,
          "start": 85.76,
          "end": 88.25,
          "en": "also add a key and point at user,",
          "zh": "也加上一個 key 並指向 user，"
        },
        {
          "id": 31,
          "start": 88.25,
          "end": 90.48,
          "en": "since we have unique values in there",
          "zh": "因為我們在那裡面有唯一值，"
        },
        {
          "id": 32,
          "start": 90.48,
          "end": 93.47999999999999,
          "en": "and output the user name here then.",
          "zh": "然後在這裡輸出使用者名稱。"
        },
        {
          "id": 33,
          "start": 93.47999999999999,
          "end": 95.06,
          "en": "So it's a very simple list.",
          "zh": "所以這是一個非常簡單的清單。"
        },
        {
          "id": 34,
          "start": 95.06,
          "end": 98.043,
          "en": "It also doesn't have any fancy styling at the moment.",
          "zh": "它目前也沒有任何花俏的樣式。"
        },
        {
          "id": 35,
          "start": 99.58,
          "end": 102.15,
          "en": "Now we can go to App.vue",
          "zh": "現在我們可以前往 App.vue，"
        },
        {
          "id": 36,
          "start": 102.15,
          "end": 106.75999999999999,
          "en": "and import it here as a local component, for example,",
          "zh": "並在這裡把它匯入為區域元件，例如，"
        },
        {
          "id": 37,
          "start": 106.75999999999999,
          "end": 108.68299999999999,
          "en": "so let's quickly import.",
          "zh": "所以讓我們快速匯入。"
        },
        {
          "id": 38,
          "start": 111.158,
          "end": 115.60300000000001,
          "en": "ListData or actually let's name it UsersList",
          "zh": "ListData，或其實讓我們把它命名為 UsersList，"
        },
        {
          "id": 39,
          "start": 116.64,
          "end": 118.47,
          "en": "makes a bit more sense, I guess.",
          "zh": "我想那樣更有道理。"
        },
        {
          "id": 40,
          "start": 118.47,
          "end": 121.16,
          "en": "So let's import UsersList",
          "zh": "所以讓我們匯入 UsersList，"
        },
        {
          "id": 41,
          "start": 121.16,
          "end": 125.853,
          "en": "from './components/UsersList.vue'",
          "zh": "從 './components/UsersList.vue'，"
        },
        {
          "id": 42,
          "start": 126.96,
          "end": 128.1,
          "en": "and then as you learned it",
          "zh": "然後如你所學、"
        },
        {
          "id": 43,
          "start": 128.1,
          "end": 130.28,
          "en": "and did it multiple times in the course,",
          "zh": "並在課程裡做過多次的，"
        },
        {
          "id": 44,
          "start": 130.28,
          "end": 134.29,
          "en": "we can register it as a local component here, UsersList.",
          "zh": "我們可以在這裡把它註冊為區域元件，UsersList。"
        },
        {
          "id": 45,
          "start": 136.04,
          "end": 139.49,
          "en": "And now that it is imported and registered,",
          "zh": "而現在它已被匯入並註冊，"
        },
        {
          "id": 46,
          "start": 139.49,
          "end": 141.41,
          "en": "maybe here at the very top,",
          "zh": "也許在最上方這裡，"
        },
        {
          "id": 47,
          "start": 141.41,
          "end": 145.18,
          "en": "we can add a new div with class container",
          "zh": "我們可以加一個 class 為 container 的新 div，"
        },
        {
          "id": 48,
          "start": 145.18,
          "end": 148.53,
          "en": "and then render our UsersList component here,",
          "zh": "然後在這裡渲染我們的 UsersList 元件，"
        },
        {
          "id": 49,
          "start": 148.53,
          "end": 150.373,
          "en": "the newly added component.",
          "zh": "這個新加的元件。"
        },
        {
          "id": 50,
          "start": 152.71,
          "end": 155.3,
          "en": "With that we got our user's list up here.",
          "zh": "有了那個，我們在上面得到使用者清單。"
        },
        {
          "id": 51,
          "start": 155.3,
          "end": 157.26,
          "en": "Now let's add a little bit of styling",
          "zh": "現在讓我們加一點樣式，"
        },
        {
          "id": 52,
          "start": 157.26,
          "end": 159.69,
          "en": "to make it look a little bit nicer",
          "zh": "讓它看起來好看一點，"
        },
        {
          "id": 53,
          "start": 159.69,
          "end": 162.71,
          "en": "in the UsersList.vue file.",
          "zh": "在 UsersList.vue 檔案裡。"
        },
        {
          "id": 54,
          "start": 162.71,
          "end": 167.55,
          "en": "We can add a scoped style tag here",
          "zh": "我們可以在這裡加一個 scoped style 標籤，"
        },
        {
          "id": 55,
          "start": 167.55,
          "end": 171.06,
          "en": "and on the unordered list I'll set list-style to none",
          "zh": "而在無序清單上我會把 list-style 設成 none，"
        },
        {
          "id": 56,
          "start": 171.06,
          "end": 173.4,
          "en": "to remove the bullet point,",
          "zh": "來移除項目符號，"
        },
        {
          "id": 57,
          "start": 173.4,
          "end": 176.49,
          "en": "set the margin: 0 and to padding: 0",
          "zh": "把 margin 設成 0，把 padding 設成 0。"
        },
        {
          "id": 58,
          "start": 178.26,
          "end": 181.25,
          "en": "And every individual list item",
          "zh": "而每個個別的清單項目"
        },
        {
          "id": 59,
          "start": 181.25,
          "end": 185.29,
          "en": "is then style by giving it a border of 1px solid",
          "zh": "接著藉由給它 1px solid 的 border 來設定樣式，"
        },
        {
          "id": 60,
          "start": 185.29,
          "end": 187.3,
          "en": "and a light gray color",
          "zh": "以及一個淺灰色，"
        },
        {
          "id": 61,
          "start": 187.3,
          "end": 189.46,
          "en": "and a padding off 1rem",
          "zh": "和 1rem 的 padding，"
        },
        {
          "id": 62,
          "start": 191.59,
          "end": 193.6,
          "en": "and I'll set the text-align here",
          "zh": "而我會在這裡設定 text-align"
        },
        {
          "id": 63,
          "start": 193.6,
          "end": 195.763,
          "en": "to center to center, to text.",
          "zh": "為 center，讓文字置中。"
        },
        {
          "id": 64,
          "start": 198.4,
          "end": 200.633,
          "en": "And now that is the list we have here.",
          "zh": "而現在那就是我們在這裡擁有的清單。"
        },
        {
          "id": 65,
          "start": 201.53,
          "end": 203.6,
          "en": "Now, this is a very simple list and at the moment",
          "zh": "現在，這是一個非常簡單的清單，而目前"
        },
        {
          "id": 66,
          "start": 203.6,
          "end": 205.46,
          "en": "it's not animated at all.",
          "zh": "它完全沒有動畫。"
        },
        {
          "id": 67,
          "start": 205.46,
          "end": 209.11,
          "en": "Let's make sure we can now add and remove items to it,",
          "zh": "讓我們確定現在可以對它加上和移除項目，"
        },
        {
          "id": 68,
          "start": 209.11,
          "end": 211.97,
          "en": "and then let's make sure that we can animate this",
          "zh": "然後讓我們確定我們可以為這個加上動畫，"
        },
        {
          "id": 69,
          "start": 211.97,
          "end": 213.86,
          "en": "because that's something that's missing",
          "zh": "因為那是我們在這門課裡一路解過的所有例子中"
        },
        {
          "id": 70,
          "start": 213.86,
          "end": 216.803,
          "en": "in all the examples we solve throughout this course.",
          "zh": "缺少的東西。"
        },
        {
          "id": 71,
          "start": 217.93,
          "end": 220.36,
          "en": "So to make sure new items can be added",
          "zh": "所以為了確定可以加上新項目，"
        },
        {
          "id": 72,
          "start": 220.36,
          "end": 222.88,
          "en": "in UsersList.vue in the template",
          "zh": "在 UsersList.vue 的範本裡，"
        },
        {
          "id": 73,
          "start": 222.88,
          "end": 225.23,
          "en": "below my unordered list.",
          "zh": "在我的無序清單下面。"
        },
        {
          "id": 74,
          "start": 225.23,
          "end": 229.3,
          "en": "I'll add another div here simply as a rapper",
          "zh": "我會在這裡再加一個 div，只是當作包裝，"
        },
        {
          "id": 75,
          "start": 229.3,
          "end": 233.313,
          "en": "and then have an input element here of type text.",
          "zh": "然後在這裡有一個 type 為 text 的 input 元素。"
        },
        {
          "id": 76,
          "start": 235.2,
          "end": 238.64,
          "en": "And a button where it say Add User.",
          "zh": "以及一個寫著 Add User 的按鈕。"
        },
        {
          "id": 77,
          "start": 238.64,
          "end": 240.62,
          "en": "And the ideal of course is that we take",
          "zh": "而想法當然是我們取得"
        },
        {
          "id": 78,
          "start": 240.62,
          "end": 244.84,
          "en": "whatever was entered here and added as a user to users.",
          "zh": "這裡輸入的任何東西，並把它加到 users 成為一個使用者。"
        },
        {
          "id": 79,
          "start": 244.84,
          "end": 246.87,
          "en": "And on the other end of a list item is click",
          "zh": "而另一方面，點擊清單項目"
        },
        {
          "id": 80,
          "start": 246.87,
          "end": 248.66,
          "en": "that users should be removed.",
          "zh": "應該移除那個使用者。"
        },
        {
          "id": 81,
          "start": 248.66,
          "end": 251.28,
          "en": "So add a click listener to a list item",
          "zh": "所以在清單項目上加一個 click 監聽器，"
        },
        {
          "id": 82,
          "start": 251.28,
          "end": 254.9,
          "en": "and say, removeUser here and pass the user",
          "zh": "並說 removeUser，把 user"
        },
        {
          "id": 83,
          "start": 254.9,
          "end": 257.46,
          "en": "as argument to removeUser.",
          "zh": "作為引數傳給 removeUser。"
        },
        {
          "id": 84,
          "start": 258.87,
          "end": 260.83,
          "en": "And on this button on the other end,",
          "zh": "而在另一邊的這個按鈕上，"
        },
        {
          "id": 85,
          "start": 260.83,
          "end": 263.47,
          "en": "I'll add a click listener and say, addUser.",
          "zh": "我會加一個 click 監聽器並說 addUser。"
        },
        {
          "id": 86,
          "start": 263.47,
          "end": 266.29,
          "en": "We could also use a form here if we wanted to,",
          "zh": "如果我們想要，我們也可以在這裡使用表單，"
        },
        {
          "id": 87,
          "start": 266.29,
          "end": 269.24,
          "en": "but I'll just add a good old click listener on this button.",
          "zh": "但我只會在這個按鈕上加一個熟悉的 click 監聽器。"
        },
        {
          "id": 88,
          "start": 271.1,
          "end": 274.65999999999997,
          "en": "So now we can add methods",
          "zh": "所以現在我們可以加上方法，"
        },
        {
          "id": 89,
          "start": 274.65999999999997,
          "end": 279.65999999999997,
          "en": "and addUser method and removeUser method",
          "zh": "addUser 方法和 removeUser 方法，"
        },
        {
          "id": 90,
          "start": 280.56,
          "end": 284.3,
          "en": "and on removeUser we'll get the user name,",
          "zh": "而在 removeUser 我們會得到使用者名稱，"
        },
        {
          "id": 91,
          "start": 284.3,
          "end": 286.71,
          "en": "we're passing it here as an argument.",
          "zh": "我們在這裡把它當引數傳入。"
        },
        {
          "id": 92,
          "start": 286.71,
          "end": 289.49,
          "en": "So we get it here as a parameter",
          "zh": "所以我們在這裡把它當參數得到，"
        },
        {
          "id": 93,
          "start": 289.49,
          "end": 294.49,
          "en": "and we can then set this.users = this.users.filter,",
          "zh": "然後我們可以設定 this.users = this.users.filter，"
        },
        {
          "id": 94,
          "start": 296.17,
          "end": 298.87,
          "en": "searching for the user that is equal",
          "zh": "尋找等於"
        },
        {
          "id": 95,
          "start": 298.87,
          "end": 301.27,
          "en": "to the user we're getting here.",
          "zh": "我們在這裡得到的那個 user 的使用者。"
        },
        {
          "id": 96,
          "start": 301.27,
          "end": 303.5,
          "en": "So if we got a user that's equal to the user,",
          "zh": "所以如果我們得到一個等於那個 user 的使用者，"
        },
        {
          "id": 97,
          "start": 303.5,
          "end": 304.89,
          "en": "we're currently looking at,",
          "zh": "也就是我們目前正在看的，"
        },
        {
          "id": 98,
          "start": 304.89,
          "end": 307.4,
          "en": "we want to filter it out,",
          "zh": "我們想把它濾掉，"
        },
        {
          "id": 99,
          "start": 307.4,
          "end": 311.54,
          "en": "actually by inverting this so that we keep all users",
          "zh": "其實藉由反轉這個，好讓我們保留所有使用者，"
        },
        {
          "id": 100,
          "start": 311.54,
          "end": 314.18,
          "en": "where the names are not equal",
          "zh": "名稱不等於"
        },
        {
          "id": 101,
          "start": 314.18,
          "end": 315.49,
          "en": "to the user we're getting here.",
          "zh": "我們在這裡得到的那個 user 的那些。"
        },
        {
          "id": 102,
          "start": 315.49,
          "end": 318.36,
          "en": "And if the name is equal, we return false.",
          "zh": "而如果名稱相等，我們回傳 false。"
        },
        {
          "id": 103,
          "start": 318.36,
          "end": 319.64,
          "en": "Hence we filter it out",
          "zh": "因此我們把它濾掉，"
        },
        {
          "id": 104,
          "start": 319.64,
          "end": 323.34,
          "en": "and therefore our new users is the old array minus",
          "zh": "因此我們的新 users 是舊陣列減去"
        },
        {
          "id": 105,
          "start": 323.34,
          "end": 325.873,
          "en": "the user with the username we got here.",
          "zh": "我們在這裡得到使用者名稱的那個使用者。"
        },
        {
          "id": 106,
          "start": 327.658,
          "end": 330.99,
          "en": "In addUser, we wanna get what the user entered here",
          "zh": "在 addUser 裡，我們想取得使用者在這裡輸入的東西，"
        },
        {
          "id": 107,
          "start": 330.99,
          "end": 333.927,
          "en": "and I'll use that ref for that userNameInput",
          "zh": "而我會用 ref 來做，userNameInput"
        },
        {
          "id": 108,
          "start": 335.2,
          "end": 337.443,
          "en": "is my ref, which I'll use here.",
          "zh": "是我會在這裡使用的 ref。"
        },
        {
          "id": 109,
          "start": 339.77,
          "end": 341.62,
          "en": "And then addUser.",
          "zh": "然後是 addUser。"
        },
        {
          "id": 110,
          "start": 341.62,
          "end": 344.86,
          "en": "We got the enteredUserName by reaching out",
          "zh": "我們藉由接觸"
        },
        {
          "id": 111,
          "start": 344.86,
          "end": 349.35,
          "en": "to this.$refs.userNameInput.value;",
          "zh": "this.$refs.userNameInput.value 得到 enteredUserName。"
        },
        {
          "id": 112,
          "start": 349.35,
          "end": 352.26,
          "en": "we could add validation but I wanna keep it simple.",
          "zh": "我們可以加驗證，但我想保持簡單。"
        },
        {
          "id": 113,
          "start": 352.26,
          "end": 357.14,
          "en": "And therefore a simply push my enteredUserName to users.",
          "zh": "因此我只是把 enteredUserName push 到 users。"
        },
        {
          "id": 114,
          "start": 357.14,
          "end": 358.68,
          "en": "And actually I'll not push it.",
          "zh": "而其實我不會 push 它。"
        },
        {
          "id": 115,
          "start": 358.68,
          "end": 361.223,
          "en": "I'll unshift it to add it at the top.",
          "zh": "我會 unshift 它，把它加到最上面。"
        },
        {
          "id": 116,
          "start": 363.41,
          "end": 365.84,
          "en": "Now with that, if we reload,",
          "zh": "現在有了那個，如果我們重新載入，"
        },
        {
          "id": 117,
          "start": 365.84,
          "end": 368,
          "en": "if I click Julie, she's removed.",
          "zh": "如果我點 Julie，她被移除。"
        },
        {
          "id": 118,
          "start": 368,
          "end": 371.483,
          "en": "If I add Julie again, she's back at the beginning.",
          "zh": "如果我再加 Julie，她回到開頭。"
        },
        {
          "id": 119,
          "start": 373.33,
          "end": 375.43,
          "en": "And we can always add some spacing here",
          "zh": "而我們總是可以在這裡加一些間距，"
        },
        {
          "id": 120,
          "start": 375.43,
          "end": 377.06,
          "en": "by going back to the unordered list",
          "zh": "藉由回到無序清單，"
        },
        {
          "id": 121,
          "start": 377.06,
          "end": 379.45,
          "en": "and actually adding a margin of 1rem top",
          "zh": "並實際上加上上方 1rem 的 margin，"
        },
        {
          "id": 122,
          "start": 379.45,
          "end": 383.713,
          "en": "and bottom zero left and right by adding this rule here.",
          "zh": "下方、左方和右方為零，藉由在這裡加上這條規則。"
        },
        {
          "id": 123,
          "start": 385.44,
          "end": 387.88,
          "en": "So now we got this in place.",
          "zh": "所以現在我們把這個就位了。"
        },
        {
          "id": 124,
          "start": 387.88,
          "end": 390.15,
          "en": "You can of course optimize the styling,",
          "zh": "你當然可以最佳化樣式，"
        },
        {
          "id": 125,
          "start": 390.15,
          "end": 393.42,
          "en": "but I rather wanna focus on animating now.",
          "zh": "但我寧願現在聚焦在加上動畫。"
        },
        {
          "id": 126,
          "start": 393.42,
          "end": 396.18,
          "en": "I wanna ensure that we animate",
          "zh": "我想確保我們加上動畫，"
        },
        {
          "id": 127,
          "start": 396.18,
          "end": 399.61,
          "en": "when an item is removed or added.",
          "zh": "當一個項目被移除或加上時。"
        },
        {
          "id": 128,
          "start": 399.61,
          "end": 402.423,
          "en": "And that is something we can do with the Vue.",
          "zh": "而那是我們可以用 Vue 做的事。"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "21879520",
      "title": "Animating Lists with \"transition-group\"",
      "lectureOrder": 207,
      "videoOrder": 182,
      "sourceHash": "454d7272f4856fbe508a59f57c835c38b575f0fbf2837a32d22d386c8a96c957",
      "cues": [
        {
          "id": 1,
          "start": 2.14,
          "end": 2.973,
          "en": "In the end,",
          "zh": "到最後，"
        },
        {
          "id": 2,
          "start": 2.973,
          "end": 4.74,
          "en": "what we want to do here is",
          "zh": "我們在這裡想做的是"
        },
        {
          "id": 3,
          "start": 4.74,
          "end": 7.32,
          "en": "we want to wrap this list item",
          "zh": "我們想把這個清單項目包起來，"
        },
        {
          "id": 4,
          "start": 7.32,
          "end": 8.84,
          "en": "with transition,",
          "zh": "用 transition，"
        },
        {
          "id": 5,
          "start": 8.84,
          "end": 11.13,
          "en": "because we wanna animate",
          "zh": "因為我們想為"
        },
        {
          "id": 6,
          "start": 11.13,
          "end": 15.26,
          "en": "the addition and removal of list items,",
          "zh": "清單項目的加上和移除加上動畫，"
        },
        {
          "id": 7,
          "start": 15.26,
          "end": 16.8,
          "en": "but it will have a problem.",
          "zh": "但會有一個問題。"
        },
        {
          "id": 8,
          "start": 16.8,
          "end": 18.64,
          "en": "It's not just one list item",
          "zh": "不只是一個清單項目，"
        },
        {
          "id": 9,
          "start": 18.64,
          "end": 20.07,
          "en": "because of before,",
          "zh": "因為前面那樣，"
        },
        {
          "id": 10,
          "start": 20.07,
          "end": 23.08,
          "en": "we'll have multiple list items here.",
          "zh": "我們這裡會有多個清單項目。"
        },
        {
          "id": 11,
          "start": 23.08,
          "end": 25.1,
          "en": "And therefore, transition won't work",
          "zh": "因此 transition 不能運作，"
        },
        {
          "id": 12,
          "start": 25.1,
          "end": 26.52,
          "en": "because transition is steered",
          "zh": "因為 transition 被引導成"
        },
        {
          "id": 13,
          "start": 26.52,
          "end": 28.313,
          "en": "to work with one element.",
          "zh": "跟一個元素一起運作。"
        },
        {
          "id": 14,
          "start": 29.72,
          "end": 31.65,
          "en": "But Vue has got us covered.",
          "zh": "但 Vue 涵蓋了我們。"
        },
        {
          "id": 15,
          "start": 31.65,
          "end": 35.22,
          "en": "It has the transition group component.",
          "zh": "它有 transition-group 元件。"
        },
        {
          "id": 16,
          "start": 35.22,
          "end": 37.49,
          "en": "In addition to transition,",
          "zh": "除了 transition，"
        },
        {
          "id": 17,
          "start": 37.49,
          "end": 39.14,
          "en": "transition group,",
          "zh": "transition-group，"
        },
        {
          "id": 18,
          "start": 39.14,
          "end": 40.62,
          "en": "as the name suggests,",
          "zh": "如名稱所示，"
        },
        {
          "id": 19,
          "start": 40.62,
          "end": 43.45,
          "en": "is there to work with multiple elements",
          "zh": "是用來跟多個元素一起運作的，"
        },
        {
          "id": 20,
          "start": 43.45,
          "end": 46.83,
          "en": "and it can also animate multiple elements",
          "zh": "而它也可以為多個元素加上動畫，"
        },
        {
          "id": 21,
          "start": 46.83,
          "end": 48.41,
          "en": "at the same time.",
          "zh": "在同一時間。"
        },
        {
          "id": 22,
          "start": 48.41,
          "end": 50.19,
          "en": "So it's great for lists",
          "zh": "所以它很適合清單，"
        },
        {
          "id": 23,
          "start": 51.04,
          "end": 52.17,
          "en": "where in this case,",
          "zh": "在這個情況裡，"
        },
        {
          "id": 24,
          "start": 52.17,
          "end": 55.49,
          "en": "we only add or remove one user at the same time,",
          "zh": "我們同一時間只加上或移除一個使用者，"
        },
        {
          "id": 25,
          "start": 55.49,
          "end": 57.2,
          "en": "but of course you could have other lists",
          "zh": "但你當然可以有其他清單，"
        },
        {
          "id": 26,
          "start": 57.2,
          "end": 58.49,
          "en": "where multiple items",
          "zh": "多個項目"
        },
        {
          "id": 27,
          "start": 58.49,
          "end": 60.83,
          "en": "are added or removed at the same time.",
          "zh": "在同一時間被加上或移除。"
        },
        {
          "id": 28,
          "start": 60.83,
          "end": 63.81,
          "en": "And that is why transition group is great for lists.",
          "zh": "而那就是為什麼 transition-group 很適合清單。"
        },
        {
          "id": 29,
          "start": 63.81,
          "end": 67.28,
          "en": "It is capable of animating individual lists items,",
          "zh": "它能夠為個別清單項目加上動畫，"
        },
        {
          "id": 30,
          "start": 67.28,
          "end": 70.253,
          "en": "but also multiple items at the same time.",
          "zh": "也能同時為多個項目加上動畫。"
        },
        {
          "id": 31,
          "start": 72.52,
          "end": 74.22,
          "en": "There's one important thing you gotta know",
          "zh": "有一件重要的事你必須知道，"
        },
        {
          "id": 32,
          "start": 74.22,
          "end": 76.27,
          "en": "about transition group, though.",
          "zh": "關於 transition-group。"
        },
        {
          "id": 33,
          "start": 76.27,
          "end": 80.18,
          "en": "Transition to components used before in the end,",
          "zh": "之前使用的 transition 元件，到最後，"
        },
        {
          "id": 34,
          "start": 80.18,
          "end": 83.28999999999999,
          "en": "renders no element to the Dom.",
          "zh": "不會渲染任何元素到 DOM。"
        },
        {
          "id": 35,
          "start": 83.28999999999999,
          "end": 85.22,
          "en": "It's just here in the template",
          "zh": "它只是在範本裡，"
        },
        {
          "id": 36,
          "start": 85.22,
          "end": 87.47,
          "en": "to give Vue some instructions,",
          "zh": "給 Vue 一些指示，"
        },
        {
          "id": 37,
          "start": 87.47,
          "end": 90.81,
          "en": "but you don't see it in the actual Dom.",
          "zh": "但你在實際的 DOM 裡看不到它。"
        },
        {
          "id": 38,
          "start": 90.81,
          "end": 93.25,
          "en": "If we inspect show users,",
          "zh": "如果我們檢查 Show Users，"
        },
        {
          "id": 39,
          "start": 93.25,
          "end": 95.05,
          "en": "which is the button we're animating,",
          "zh": "也就是我們正在加上動畫的按鈕，"
        },
        {
          "id": 40,
          "start": 95.05,
          "end": 97.923,
          "en": "there is no transition component here in the Dom.",
          "zh": "DOM 裡這裡沒有 transition 元件。"
        },
        {
          "id": 41,
          "start": 98.96000000000001,
          "end": 101.36,
          "en": "Now that will be different for this list",
          "zh": "現在對這個清單"
        },
        {
          "id": 42,
          "start": 101.36,
          "end": 103.25999999999999,
          "en": "and transition group, though.",
          "zh": "和 transition-group 會不同。"
        },
        {
          "id": 43,
          "start": 103.25999999999999,
          "end": 106.28,
          "en": "Transition group will render",
          "zh": "transition-group 會渲染"
        },
        {
          "id": 44,
          "start": 106.28,
          "end": 108.66,
          "en": "an element to the Dom in the end,",
          "zh": "一個元素到 DOM，到最後，"
        },
        {
          "id": 45,
          "start": 108.66,
          "end": 110.77000000000001,
          "en": "and you can control which element it is",
          "zh": "而你可以控制它是哪個元素，"
        },
        {
          "id": 46,
          "start": 110.77000000000001,
          "end": 113.28,
          "en": "by giving it detect prop.",
          "zh": "藉由給它 tag prop。"
        },
        {
          "id": 47,
          "start": 113.28,
          "end": 116.35,
          "en": "And here we want to unordered list.",
          "zh": "而這裡我們想要無序清單。"
        },
        {
          "id": 48,
          "start": 116.35,
          "end": 118.95,
          "en": "So we, in the end replace our wrapper here,",
          "zh": "所以我們到最後取代這裡的包裝，"
        },
        {
          "id": 49,
          "start": 118.95,
          "end": 120.77,
          "en": "the unordered list",
          "zh": "也就是無序清單，"
        },
        {
          "id": 50,
          "start": 120.77,
          "end": 122.84,
          "en": "with transition group,",
          "zh": "用 transition-group，"
        },
        {
          "id": 51,
          "start": 122.84,
          "end": 125.08,
          "en": "giving it a tag off UL,",
          "zh": "給它 tag 為 ul，"
        },
        {
          "id": 52,
          "start": 125.08,
          "end": 128.453,
          "en": "and you can use any valid HTML element here.",
          "zh": "而你可以在這裡使用任何有效的 HTML 元素。"
        },
        {
          "id": 53,
          "start": 129.69,
          "end": 132.313,
          "en": "You can also use a custom component here.",
          "zh": "你也可以在這裡使用自訂元件。"
        },
        {
          "id": 54,
          "start": 133.37,
          "end": 134.31,
          "en": "Now besides that",
          "zh": "現在除此之外，"
        },
        {
          "id": 55,
          "start": 134.31,
          "end": 136.86,
          "en": "it works pretty much like transition, though.",
          "zh": "它的運作方式大致跟 transition 一樣。"
        },
        {
          "id": 56,
          "start": 136.86,
          "end": 140.03,
          "en": "It also adds those CSS classes",
          "zh": "它也會把那些 CSS classes"
        },
        {
          "id": 57,
          "start": 140.03,
          "end": 141.62,
          "en": "to the elements which are added",
          "zh": "加到被加上"
        },
        {
          "id": 58,
          "start": 141.62,
          "end": 142.63,
          "en": "or removed.",
          "zh": "或被移除的元素。"
        },
        {
          "id": 59,
          "start": 142.63,
          "end": 145.97,
          "en": "It dives into the CSS code to see how long",
          "zh": "它會深入 CSS 程式碼，看"
        },
        {
          "id": 60,
          "start": 145.97,
          "end": 147.15,
          "en": "an animation takes.",
          "zh": "一個動畫花多久。"
        },
        {
          "id": 61,
          "start": 147.15,
          "end": 149.5,
          "en": "So here I'll add name prop",
          "zh": "所以這裡我會加上 name prop，"
        },
        {
          "id": 62,
          "start": 149.5,
          "end": 152.28,
          "en": "and give it a name of user list.",
          "zh": "並給它名稱 user-list。"
        },
        {
          "id": 63,
          "start": 152.28,
          "end": 153.82999999999998,
          "en": "And that is then the prefix",
          "zh": "而那接著就是前綴，"
        },
        {
          "id": 64,
          "start": 153.82999999999998,
          "end": 155.96,
          "en": "in front of the enter-from,",
          "zh": "在 enter-from、"
        },
        {
          "id": 65,
          "start": 155.96,
          "end": 157.16,
          "en": "enter-active,",
          "zh": "enter-active、"
        },
        {
          "id": 66,
          "start": 157.16,
          "end": 158.63,
          "en": "enter-to clauses,",
          "zh": "enter-to 這些 class 前面，"
        },
        {
          "id": 67,
          "start": 158.63,
          "end": 160.48,
          "en": "everything you already learned about.",
          "zh": "你已經學過的一切。"
        },
        {
          "id": 68,
          "start": 162.07,
          "end": 165.75,
          "en": "So here in my styling,",
          "zh": "所以在我的樣式裡，"
        },
        {
          "id": 69,
          "start": 165.75,
          "end": 167.43,
          "en": "I will now add user lists,",
          "zh": "我現在會加上 user-list-"
        },
        {
          "id": 70,
          "start": 167.43,
          "end": 169.2,
          "en": "enter-from,",
          "zh": "enter-from，"
        },
        {
          "id": 71,
          "start": 169.2,
          "end": 170.44,
          "en": "copy that,",
          "zh": "複製那個，"
        },
        {
          "id": 72,
          "start": 170.44,
          "end": 172.25,
          "en": "and then also add",
          "zh": "然後也加上"
        },
        {
          "id": 73,
          "start": 172.25,
          "end": 173.68,
          "en": "enter-active",
          "zh": "enter-active"
        },
        {
          "id": 74,
          "start": 173.68,
          "end": 175.2,
          "en": "and enter-to.",
          "zh": "和 enter-to。"
        },
        {
          "id": 75,
          "start": 175.2,
          "end": 176.39,
          "en": "And now as so often,",
          "zh": "而現在一如往常，"
        },
        {
          "id": 76,
          "start": 176.39,
          "end": 177.54,
          "en": "it's totally up to you",
          "zh": "完全由你決定，"
        },
        {
          "id": 77,
          "start": 177.54,
          "end": 179.5,
          "en": "what you want to add here.",
          "zh": "你想在這裡加什麼。"
        },
        {
          "id": 78,
          "start": 179.5,
          "end": 183.04,
          "en": "I will add an opacity of zero here",
          "zh": "我會在這裡加上 opacity 零，"
        },
        {
          "id": 79,
          "start": 183.04,
          "end": 185.2,
          "en": "and transform my items",
          "zh": "並 transform 我的項目，"
        },
        {
          "id": 80,
          "start": 185.2,
          "end": 190,
          "en": "to translate them along the X-axis",
          "zh": "沿 X 軸平移它們，"
        },
        {
          "id": 81,
          "start": 190,
          "end": 191.28,
          "en": "and move it a little bit further",
          "zh": "並把它再移遠一點，"
        },
        {
          "id": 82,
          "start": 191.28,
          "end": 192.193,
          "en": "to the left.",
          "zh": "往左邊。"
        },
        {
          "id": 83,
          "start": 193.6,
          "end": 195.5,
          "en": "And that's my starting position",
          "zh": "而那是我的起始位置，"
        },
        {
          "id": 84,
          "start": 195.5,
          "end": 197.243,
          "en": "when an item is added.",
          "zh": "當一個項目被加上時。"
        },
        {
          "id": 85,
          "start": 198.32999999999998,
          "end": 200.55,
          "en": "In enter-to,",
          "zh": "在 enter-to 裡，"
        },
        {
          "id": 86,
          "start": 200.55,
          "end": 203.92000000000002,
          "en": "I will then set this to zero",
          "zh": "我會接著把這個設成零，"
        },
        {
          "id": 87,
          "start": 203.92000000000002,
          "end": 206.66,
          "en": "and the opacity to one of course.",
          "zh": "而 opacity 當然設成 1。"
        },
        {
          "id": 88,
          "start": 206.66,
          "end": 208.91,
          "en": "And in enter-active,",
          "zh": "而在 enter-active 裡，"
        },
        {
          "id": 89,
          "start": 208.91,
          "end": 211.5,
          "en": "we can add the transition property",
          "zh": "我們可以加上 transition 屬性，"
        },
        {
          "id": 90,
          "start": 211.5,
          "end": 215.79,
          "en": "and watch for changes in all",
          "zh": "並監看所有"
        },
        {
          "id": 91,
          "start": 215.79,
          "end": 217.13,
          "en": "CSS properties,",
          "zh": "CSS 屬性的變更，"
        },
        {
          "id": 92,
          "start": 217.13,
          "end": 218.7,
          "en": "which might change.",
          "zh": "那些可能改變的。"
        },
        {
          "id": 93,
          "start": 218.7,
          "end": 220.41,
          "en": "And in this case only opacity",
          "zh": "而在這個情況裡只有 opacity"
        },
        {
          "id": 94,
          "start": 220.41,
          "end": 222.48,
          "en": "and transform will change",
          "zh": "和 transform 會改變，"
        },
        {
          "id": 95,
          "start": 223.64,
          "end": 225.46,
          "en": "and then add a duration.",
          "zh": "然後加上一個持續時間。"
        },
        {
          "id": 96,
          "start": 225.46,
          "end": 227.89,
          "en": "And I'll go for one second here",
          "zh": "而我這裡會用一秒，"
        },
        {
          "id": 97,
          "start": 227.89,
          "end": 230.48,
          "en": "and then also an easing function",
          "zh": "然後也加一個 easing 函式，"
        },
        {
          "id": 98,
          "start": 230.48,
          "end": 232.063,
          "en": "and I'll go for ease-out.",
          "zh": "而我會用 ease-out。"
        },
        {
          "id": 99,
          "start": 233.87,
          "end": 234.82,
          "en": "And if we do that,",
          "zh": "而如果我們那樣做，"
        },
        {
          "id": 100,
          "start": 234.82,
          "end": 236.23,
          "en": "you will see",
          "zh": "你會看到，"
        },
        {
          "id": 101,
          "start": 236.23,
          "end": 238.04,
          "en": "if I reload and I add",
          "zh": "如果我重新載入並加上"
        },
        {
          "id": 102,
          "start": 240.35,
          "end": 243.25,
          "en": "Praveen, for click add user,",
          "zh": "Praveen，點 Add User，"
        },
        {
          "id": 103,
          "start": 243.25,
          "end": 244.68,
          "en": "this is a smooth animation",
          "zh": "這是一個平滑動畫，"
        },
        {
          "id": 104,
          "start": 244.68,
          "end": 246.95,
          "en": "for adding this element.",
          "zh": "用來加上這個元素。"
        },
        {
          "id": 105,
          "start": 246.95,
          "end": 247.783,
          "en": "Now, of course,",
          "zh": "現在當然，"
        },
        {
          "id": 106,
          "start": 247.783,
          "end": 251.34,
          "en": "we also get animation for removing elements",
          "zh": "我們也得到移除元素的動畫，"
        },
        {
          "id": 107,
          "start": 251.34,
          "end": 252.3,
          "en": "for that all,",
          "zh": "為此，"
        },
        {
          "id": 108,
          "start": 252.3,
          "end": 253.133,
          "en": "in the end,",
          "zh": "到最後，"
        },
        {
          "id": 109,
          "start": 253.133,
          "end": 256.68,
          "en": "just copy my enter classes",
          "zh": "只要複製我的 enter classes，"
        },
        {
          "id": 110,
          "start": 256.68,
          "end": 259.96,
          "en": "and add my leave classes here.",
          "zh": "並在這裡加上我的 leave classes。"
        },
        {
          "id": 111,
          "start": 259.96,
          "end": 261.26,
          "en": "So leave-from,",
          "zh": "所以是 leave-from、"
        },
        {
          "id": 112,
          "start": 261.26,
          "end": 262.093,
          "en": "leave-to,",
          "zh": "leave-to、"
        },
        {
          "id": 113,
          "start": 262.093,
          "end": 262.926,
          "en": "leave-active.",
          "zh": "leave-active。"
        },
        {
          "id": 114,
          "start": 262.926,
          "end": 266.19,
          "en": "And I want to leave-from opacity one",
          "zh": "而我想要 leave-from 的 opacity 為 1，"
        },
        {
          "id": 115,
          "start": 266.19,
          "end": 269.88,
          "en": "and no change on the X-axis",
          "zh": "而 X 軸沒有變更，"
        },
        {
          "id": 116,
          "start": 269.88,
          "end": 270.713,
          "en": "and therefore,",
          "zh": "因此"
        },
        {
          "id": 117,
          "start": 270.713,
          "end": 271.67,
          "en": "We can also merge this with",
          "zh": "我們也可以把這個跟"
        },
        {
          "id": 118,
          "start": 271.67,
          "end": 273.56,
          "en": "the enter-to clause because",
          "zh": "enter-to class 合併，因為"
        },
        {
          "id": 119,
          "start": 273.56,
          "end": 274.543,
          "en": "it's the same.",
          "zh": "它是相同的。"
        },
        {
          "id": 120,
          "start": 276.71,
          "end": 277.79,
          "en": "On leave-active.",
          "zh": "在 leave-active 上，"
        },
        {
          "id": 121,
          "start": 277.79,
          "end": 279.49,
          "en": "I want to have an ease-in,",
          "zh": "我想要 ease-in，"
        },
        {
          "id": 122,
          "start": 279.49,
          "end": 282.04,
          "en": "easing function instead of ease-out",
          "zh": "easing 函式，而不是 ease-out，"
        },
        {
          "id": 123,
          "start": 282.04,
          "end": 283.71,
          "en": "and on leave-to,",
          "zh": "而在 leave-to 上，"
        },
        {
          "id": 124,
          "start": 283.71,
          "end": 286.34000000000003,
          "en": "I want to go to an opacity of zero,",
          "zh": "我想前往 opacity 零，"
        },
        {
          "id": 125,
          "start": 286.34000000000003,
          "end": 288.963,
          "en": "but then move it 30 pixels to the right.",
          "zh": "但然後把它往右移 30 像素。"
        },
        {
          "id": 126,
          "start": 290.32,
          "end": 293.05,
          "en": "So it's not the same as the enter-from state.",
          "zh": "所以它跟 enter-from 狀態不一樣。"
        },
        {
          "id": 127,
          "start": 293.05,
          "end": 295.39,
          "en": "There we had minus 30 pixels.",
          "zh": "在那裡我們有負 30 像素。"
        },
        {
          "id": 128,
          "start": 295.39,
          "end": 298.59000000000003,
          "en": "Here I have plus 30 pixels.",
          "zh": "這裡我有正 30 像素。"
        },
        {
          "id": 129,
          "start": 298.59000000000003,
          "end": 300.61,
          "en": "And if I do that and saved us,",
          "zh": "而如果我那樣做並儲存，"
        },
        {
          "id": 130,
          "start": 300.61,
          "end": 302.31,
          "en": "if I click an item,",
          "zh": "如果我點一個項目，"
        },
        {
          "id": 131,
          "start": 302.31,
          "end": 305.283,
          "en": "you see it's animated out like this,",
          "zh": "你看到它像這樣被加上動畫移出，"
        },
        {
          "id": 132,
          "start": 306.67,
          "end": 308.34,
          "en": "which is nice,",
          "zh": "那很好，"
        },
        {
          "id": 133,
          "start": 308.34,
          "end": 311.18,
          "en": "but you might notice that the list jumps,",
          "zh": "但你可能會注意到清單會跳，"
        },
        {
          "id": 134,
          "start": 311.18,
          "end": 312.54,
          "en": "when an item is removed,",
          "zh": "當一個項目被移除時，"
        },
        {
          "id": 135,
          "start": 312.54,
          "end": 313.73,
          "en": "the other elements,",
          "zh": "其他元素"
        },
        {
          "id": 136,
          "start": 313.73,
          "end": 316.26,
          "en": "snap in place there after,",
          "zh": "在那之後卡進位置，"
        },
        {
          "id": 137,
          "start": 316.26,
          "end": 317.7,
          "en": "and thankfully,",
          "zh": "而幸好"
        },
        {
          "id": 138,
          "start": 317.7,
          "end": 319.84,
          "en": "Vue actually has a solution",
          "zh": "Vue 其實也有一個解法"
        },
        {
          "id": 139,
          "start": 319.84,
          "end": 321.36,
          "en": "for that as well.",
          "zh": "給那個。"
        },
        {
          "id": 140,
          "start": 321.36,
          "end": 323.883,
          "en": "It helps us avoid such snapping.",
          "zh": "它幫我們避免這種彈跳。"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "21879526",
      "title": "Animate List Item Movement",
      "lectureOrder": 208,
      "videoOrder": 183,
      "sourceHash": "33e9864488d82e1fb78e194fd5ac7d6498d1e4e0a8fb844400e1d4fe388ea7e3",
      "cues": [
        {
          "id": 1,
          "start": 2.27,
          "end": 3.96,
          "en": "Now, how can vue help us",
          "zh": "現在，Vue 如何能幫我們"
        },
        {
          "id": 2,
          "start": 3.96,
          "end": 7.12,
          "en": "with this snapping behavior we got here,",
          "zh": "處理我們在這裡得到的這種彈跳行為，"
        },
        {
          "id": 3,
          "start": 7.12,
          "end": 9.74,
          "en": "which is not too nice to look at?",
          "zh": "看起來不太好看的？"
        },
        {
          "id": 4,
          "start": 9.74,
          "end": 12.23,
          "en": "It adds a never special clause",
          "zh": "它會加上另一個特殊 class，"
        },
        {
          "id": 5,
          "start": 12.23,
          "end": 14.89,
          "en": "when you're using transition group.",
          "zh": "當你使用 transition-group 時。"
        },
        {
          "id": 6,
          "start": 14.89,
          "end": 17.72,
          "en": "So when it's actually controlling multiple elements,",
          "zh": "所以當它實際上在控制多個元素，"
        },
        {
          "id": 7,
          "start": 17.72,
          "end": 19.3,
          "en": "instead of just one.",
          "zh": "而不只是一個。"
        },
        {
          "id": 8,
          "start": 19.3,
          "end": 21.57,
          "en": "Because you might not notice it actually,",
          "zh": "因為你可能實際上沒注意到，"
        },
        {
          "id": 9,
          "start": 21.57,
          "end": 24.15,
          "en": "whilst we're only adding and removing one element",
          "zh": "雖然我們只加上和移除一個元素，"
        },
        {
          "id": 10,
          "start": 24.15,
          "end": 25.61,
          "en": "at a time here,",
          "zh": "在這裡一次一個，"
        },
        {
          "id": 11,
          "start": 25.61,
          "end": 30.15,
          "en": "we are animating multiple elements simultaneously",
          "zh": "我們正在同時為多個元素加上動畫，"
        },
        {
          "id": 12,
          "start": 30.15,
          "end": 32.31,
          "en": "because the other elements also need",
          "zh": "因為其他元素也需要"
        },
        {
          "id": 13,
          "start": 32.31,
          "end": 35.95,
          "en": "to switch their position when a new item is added.",
          "zh": "在新項目被加上時切換它們的位置。"
        },
        {
          "id": 14,
          "start": 35.95,
          "end": 37.75,
          "en": "And that's why we use transition group.",
          "zh": "而那就是為什麼我們使用 transition-group。"
        },
        {
          "id": 15,
          "start": 37.75,
          "end": 40.903,
          "en": "It is capable of animating multiple elements.",
          "zh": "它能夠為多個元素加上動畫。"
        },
        {
          "id": 16,
          "start": 42.25,
          "end": 44.96,
          "en": "And it gives us a special clause therefore",
          "zh": "而它因此給我們一個特殊 class，"
        },
        {
          "id": 17,
          "start": 44.96,
          "end": 47.16,
          "en": "which allows us to control the animation",
          "zh": "允許我們控制動畫，"
        },
        {
          "id": 18,
          "start": 47.16,
          "end": 48.75,
          "en": "of the other elements,",
          "zh": "對其他元素，"
        },
        {
          "id": 19,
          "start": 48.75,
          "end": 51.08,
          "en": "which are not getting added or removed,",
          "zh": "那些沒有被加上或移除的，"
        },
        {
          "id": 20,
          "start": 51.08,
          "end": 53.82,
          "en": "but which also might need to move around",
          "zh": "但它們也可能需要移動，"
        },
        {
          "id": 21,
          "start": 53.82,
          "end": 55.96,
          "en": "to make place for the new element",
          "zh": "為新元素騰出位置，"
        },
        {
          "id": 22,
          "start": 55.96,
          "end": 59.34,
          "en": "or to fill up the space of the leaving element.",
          "zh": "或填上離開元素的空間。"
        },
        {
          "id": 23,
          "start": 59.34,
          "end": 63.16,
          "en": "And the special clause we add here is our prefix.",
          "zh": "而我們在這裡加上的特殊 class 是我們的前綴。"
        },
        {
          "id": 24,
          "start": 63.16,
          "end": 65.363,
          "en": "So user list in this case,",
          "zh": "所以在這個情況是 user-list，"
        },
        {
          "id": 25,
          "start": 66.3,
          "end": 68.62,
          "en": "since that's the prefix we defined here",
          "zh": "因為那是我們在這裡定義的前綴，"
        },
        {
          "id": 26,
          "start": 68.62,
          "end": 70.82,
          "en": "with the name property,",
          "zh": "用 name 屬性，"
        },
        {
          "id": 27,
          "start": 70.82,
          "end": 71.68,
          "en": "and then",
          "zh": "然後"
        },
        {
          "id": 28,
          "start": 73.7,
          "end": 75.78999999999999,
          "en": "dash move.",
          "zh": "-move。"
        },
        {
          "id": 29,
          "start": 75.78999999999999,
          "end": 78.23,
          "en": "That's another special CSS clause,",
          "zh": "那是另一個特殊的 CSS class，"
        },
        {
          "id": 30,
          "start": 78.23,
          "end": 82.06,
          "en": "which vue will add to all the other elements,",
          "zh": "Vue 會把它加到所有其他元素，"
        },
        {
          "id": 31,
          "start": 82.06,
          "end": 84.173,
          "en": "which are not entering or leaving.",
          "zh": "那些沒有進入或離開的。"
        },
        {
          "id": 32,
          "start": 85.91,
          "end": 87.71000000000001,
          "en": "And even better than that,",
          "zh": "而比那更好的是，"
        },
        {
          "id": 33,
          "start": 87.71000000000001,
          "end": 90.25,
          "en": "vue will automatically move them",
          "zh": "Vue 會自動移動它們"
        },
        {
          "id": 34,
          "start": 90.25,
          "end": 93.22999999999999,
          "en": "to their new place under the hood,",
          "zh": "到它們的新位置，在幕後，"
        },
        {
          "id": 35,
          "start": 93.22999999999999,
          "end": 96.22,
          "en": "by using the transform CSS property.",
          "zh": "藉由使用 transform 這個 CSS 屬性。"
        },
        {
          "id": 36,
          "start": 96.22,
          "end": 97.82,
          "en": "That's just something you have to know.",
          "zh": "那只是你必須知道的事。"
        },
        {
          "id": 37,
          "start": 97.82,
          "end": 100.69,
          "en": "Vue will use transform under the hood",
          "zh": "Vue 會在幕後使用 transform"
        },
        {
          "id": 38,
          "start": 100.69,
          "end": 102.05,
          "en": "for moving the elements,",
          "zh": "來移動那些元素，"
        },
        {
          "id": 39,
          "start": 102.05,
          "end": 105.743,
          "en": "which are not added or removed around to their new position.",
          "zh": "沒有被加上或移除、要移到新位置的那些。"
        },
        {
          "id": 40,
          "start": 107.02000000000001,
          "end": 109.36,
          "en": "And therefore, here in the move class,",
          "zh": "因此，在這裡的 move class 裡，"
        },
        {
          "id": 41,
          "start": 109.36,
          "end": 112.56,
          "en": "we can actually transition the transform property",
          "zh": "我們其實可以轉場 transform 屬性，"
        },
        {
          "id": 42,
          "start": 112.56,
          "end": 113.95,
          "en": "on those elements.",
          "zh": "在那些元素上。"
        },
        {
          "id": 43,
          "start": 113.95,
          "end": 118.44,
          "en": "Let's say over dot eight seconds with a ease function.",
          "zh": "比方說歷時 0.8 秒，用一個 ease 函式。"
        },
        {
          "id": 44,
          "start": 118.44,
          "end": 122.1,
          "en": "So just ease to distribute the time evenly.",
          "zh": "所以只是 ease，把時間平均分配。"
        },
        {
          "id": 45,
          "start": 122.1,
          "end": 124.3,
          "en": "Now, if we save that and go back,",
          "zh": "現在，如果我們儲存並回去，"
        },
        {
          "id": 46,
          "start": 124.3,
          "end": 128.433,
          "en": "we'll be able to see that if we reload and add a new user.",
          "zh": "我們會看到，如果我們重新載入並加一個新使用者。"
        },
        {
          "id": 47,
          "start": 130.21,
          "end": 131.58,
          "en": "Praveen, for example.",
          "zh": "例如 Praveen。"
        },
        {
          "id": 48,
          "start": 131.58,
          "end": 134.39,
          "en": "You see the upper elements move smoothly",
          "zh": "你看到上面的元素平滑移動"
        },
        {
          "id": 49,
          "start": 134.39,
          "end": 135.593,
          "en": "to their new position.",
          "zh": "到它們的新位置。"
        },
        {
          "id": 50,
          "start": 136.77,
          "end": 140.55,
          "en": "Now, if you reload and try this for removing though,",
          "zh": "現在，如果你重新載入並對移除試試，"
        },
        {
          "id": 51,
          "start": 140.55,
          "end": 143.82,
          "en": "we still have this snapping behavior.",
          "zh": "我們仍然有這種彈跳行為。"
        },
        {
          "id": 52,
          "start": 143.82,
          "end": 147.31,
          "en": "There's one thing we got to fix for that to work",
          "zh": "有一件事我們必須修正，才能讓那個運作，"
        },
        {
          "id": 53,
          "start": 147.31,
          "end": 150.88,
          "en": "on the leave active clause.",
          "zh": "在 leave-active class 上。"
        },
        {
          "id": 54,
          "start": 150.88,
          "end": 153.38,
          "en": "So, which is added to the leaving element.",
          "zh": "所以，是加到離開元素上的那個。"
        },
        {
          "id": 55,
          "start": 153.38,
          "end": 157.233,
          "en": "We need to add a position of absolute.",
          "zh": "我們需要加上 position 為 absolute。"
        },
        {
          "id": 56,
          "start": 158.92000000000002,
          "end": 163.92000000000002,
          "en": "Once we add that to the leaving element, and I reload,",
          "zh": "一旦我們把那個加到離開元素，而我重新載入，"
        },
        {
          "id": 57,
          "start": 164.11,
          "end": 167.45,
          "en": "now you'll see the other elements move as well.",
          "zh": "現在你會看到其他元素也移動。"
        },
        {
          "id": 58,
          "start": 167.45,
          "end": 170.12,
          "en": "And they move to their new position.",
          "zh": "而它們移到它們的新位置。"
        },
        {
          "id": 59,
          "start": 170.12,
          "end": 171.88,
          "en": "Now, the rest of the page jumps",
          "zh": "現在，頁面的其餘部分會跳，"
        },
        {
          "id": 60,
          "start": 171.88,
          "end": 174.14,
          "en": "but that's something we can't avoid here.",
          "zh": "但那是我們在這裡無法避免的事。"
        },
        {
          "id": 61,
          "start": 174.14,
          "end": 175.63,
          "en": "But inside of that list,",
          "zh": "但在那個清單裡面，"
        },
        {
          "id": 62,
          "start": 175.63,
          "end": 180.373,
          "en": "we have a smooth animation for entering items.",
          "zh": "我們有進入項目的平滑動畫。"
        },
        {
          "id": 63,
          "start": 181.989,
          "end": 184.63,
          "en": "But also for leaving items",
          "zh": "也有離開項目的，"
        },
        {
          "id": 64,
          "start": 184.63,
          "end": 188.09,
          "en": "and for the rest of the list for all the items",
          "zh": "以及清單其餘部分、所有那些"
        },
        {
          "id": 65,
          "start": 188.09,
          "end": 190.88,
          "en": "that need to move to a new position.",
          "zh": "需要移到新位置的項目。"
        },
        {
          "id": 66,
          "start": 190.88,
          "end": 194.16,
          "en": "And that is how transition group can help us here.",
          "zh": "而那就是 transition-group 如何在這裡幫我們。"
        },
        {
          "id": 67,
          "start": 194.16,
          "end": 197.55,
          "en": "It allows us to animate items in a list,",
          "zh": "它允許我們為清單裡的項目加上動畫，"
        },
        {
          "id": 68,
          "start": 197.55,
          "end": 199.96,
          "en": "multiple items at the same time,",
          "zh": "同時多個項目，"
        },
        {
          "id": 69,
          "start": 199.96,
          "end": 202.84,
          "en": "it allows us to move items smoothly,",
          "zh": "它允許我們平滑移動項目，"
        },
        {
          "id": 70,
          "start": 202.84,
          "end": 205.126,
          "en": "even if they're not directly affected.",
          "zh": "即使它們沒有被直接影響。"
        },
        {
          "id": 71,
          "start": 205.126,
          "end": 208.66,
          "en": "So even if they're not the added or removed item.",
          "zh": "所以即使它們不是被加上或移除的那個項目。"
        },
        {
          "id": 72,
          "start": 208.66,
          "end": 212.45,
          "en": "And therefore, it is the component you should use",
          "zh": "因此，它是你應該使用的元件，"
        },
        {
          "id": 73,
          "start": 212.45,
          "end": 215.03,
          "en": "if you want to add multiple items.",
          "zh": "如果你想加上多個項目。"
        },
        {
          "id": 74,
          "start": 215.03,
          "end": 219.29,
          "en": "If you have one item or two alternating items you want",
          "zh": "如果你有一個項目，或兩個交替的項目你想"
        },
        {
          "id": 75,
          "start": 219.29,
          "end": 221.21,
          "en": "to animate, transition",
          "zh": "加上動畫，transition"
        },
        {
          "id": 76,
          "start": 221.21,
          "end": 222.973,
          "en": "is the component you should use.",
          "zh": "是你應該使用的元件。"
        },
        {
          "id": 77,
          "start": 223.95,
          "end": 226.41,
          "en": "Because that component is optimized",
          "zh": "因為那個元件被最佳化"
        },
        {
          "id": 78,
          "start": 226.41,
          "end": 228.32999999999998,
          "en": "for animating single items",
          "zh": "用來為單一項目加上動畫，"
        },
        {
          "id": 79,
          "start": 228.32999999999998,
          "end": 231.513,
          "en": "or alternating items like these two buttons.",
          "zh": "或像這兩個按鈕這樣的交替項目。"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "21879532",
      "title": "Animating Route Changes",
      "lectureOrder": 209,
      "videoOrder": 184,
      "sourceHash": "74c480192f9ff2638f4b2a392fee5242558ba65f3d9ce117c7cbf5f5dc69a78a",
      "cues": [
        {
          "id": 1,
          "start": 2.13,
          "end": 4.69,
          "en": "By now we get a pretty good understanding",
          "zh": "到現在我們對 Vue 如何幫我們為東西加上動畫"
        },
        {
          "id": 2,
          "start": 4.69,
          "end": 9.24,
          "en": "about how Vue helps us with animating things.",
          "zh": "有了相當好的理解。"
        },
        {
          "id": 3,
          "start": 9.24,
          "end": 12.2,
          "en": "There's one specific kind of thing",
          "zh": "有一種特定的東西"
        },
        {
          "id": 4,
          "start": 12.2,
          "end": 13.42,
          "en": "which you might want to navigate,",
          "zh": "你可能想導覽，"
        },
        {
          "id": 5,
          "start": 13.42,
          "end": 15.71,
          "en": "which we haven't seen thus far though.",
          "zh": "而我們到目前還沒看過。"
        },
        {
          "id": 6,
          "start": 15.71,
          "end": 19.89,
          "en": "And that would be changes between two routes.",
          "zh": "而那就是兩條路由之間的變化。"
        },
        {
          "id": 7,
          "start": 19.89,
          "end": 23.38,
          "en": "For that, I'll quickly add routing here,",
          "zh": "為此，我會在這裡快速加上路由，"
        },
        {
          "id": 8,
          "start": 23.38,
          "end": 25.95,
          "en": "simply by adding a new pages folder.",
          "zh": "只要加一個新的 pages 資料夾。"
        },
        {
          "id": 9,
          "start": 25.95,
          "end": 30.95,
          "en": "And then in here we could have AllUsers page, let's say,",
          "zh": "然後在這裡我們可以有 AllUsers 頁面，比方說，"
        },
        {
          "id": 10,
          "start": 31.69,
          "end": 34.21,
          "en": "and also a CourseGoals page.",
          "zh": "也有一個 CourseGoals 頁面。"
        },
        {
          "id": 11,
          "start": 34.21,
          "end": 38.37,
          "en": "I will not really populate those components with life",
          "zh": "我不會真的用真實內容"
        },
        {
          "id": 12,
          "start": 38.37,
          "end": 39.81,
          "en": "or with real values,",
          "zh": "或真實的值填滿那些元件，"
        },
        {
          "id": 13,
          "start": 39.81,
          "end": 42.86,
          "en": "I just want to dive into how we can animate",
          "zh": "我只想深入我們如何為"
        },
        {
          "id": 14,
          "start": 42.86,
          "end": 44.92,
          "en": "between these pages.",
          "zh": "這些頁面之間加上動畫。"
        },
        {
          "id": 15,
          "start": 44.92,
          "end": 47.45,
          "en": "For that, here I'll simply add a div",
          "zh": "為此，這裡我會只加一個 div，"
        },
        {
          "id": 16,
          "start": 47.45,
          "end": 52.45,
          "en": "with a class of container in the template off AllUsers.",
          "zh": "class 為 container，在 AllUsers 的範本裡。"
        },
        {
          "id": 17,
          "start": 52.87,
          "end": 57.083,
          "en": "And add a h2 tag where I say All Users.",
          "zh": "並加一個 h2 標籤，我說 All Users。"
        },
        {
          "id": 18,
          "start": 58.95,
          "end": 61.33,
          "en": "And I'll then copy that",
          "zh": "然後我會複製那個，"
        },
        {
          "id": 19,
          "start": 61.33,
          "end": 63.58,
          "en": "and add the same here to CourseGoals,",
          "zh": "並在這裡對 CourseGoals 加上相同的，"
        },
        {
          "id": 20,
          "start": 63.58,
          "end": 66.13,
          "en": "but of course here I will say CourseGoals",
          "zh": "但當然這裡我會說 Course Goals，"
        },
        {
          "id": 21,
          "start": 66.13,
          "end": 69.37,
          "en": "so that we can tell these two pages apart.",
          "zh": "好讓我們能分辨這兩個頁面。"
        },
        {
          "id": 22,
          "start": 69.37,
          "end": 71.5,
          "en": "So these are very simple dummy components",
          "zh": "所以這些是非常簡單的示範元件，"
        },
        {
          "id": 23,
          "start": 71.5,
          "end": 73.8,
          "en": "which just have templates.",
          "zh": "它們只有範本。"
        },
        {
          "id": 24,
          "start": 73.8,
          "end": 77.3,
          "en": "Now we can quit the development server with Control + C,",
          "zh": "現在我們可以用 Control+C 停止開發伺服器，"
        },
        {
          "id": 25,
          "start": 77.3,
          "end": 82.3,
          "en": "and npm install, dash, dash, save the vue-router.",
          "zh": "並 npm install --save vue-router。"
        },
        {
          "id": 26,
          "start": 82.43,
          "end": 84.74,
          "en": "This package, which we already installed",
          "zh": "這個套件，我們已經安裝過，"
        },
        {
          "id": 27,
          "start": 84.74,
          "end": 86.293,
          "en": "in the routing module.",
          "zh": "在路由模組裡。"
        },
        {
          "id": 28,
          "start": 87.61,
          "end": 90.65,
          "en": "Once it is installed, we can restart the development server",
          "zh": "一旦它安裝好，我們可以重新啟動開發伺服器，"
        },
        {
          "id": 29,
          "start": 90.65,
          "end": 93.22,
          "en": "and then add routing as you learned it",
          "zh": "然後如你所學的加上路由，"
        },
        {
          "id": 30,
          "start": 93.22,
          "end": 94.77000000000001,
          "en": "in the routing module.",
          "zh": "在路由模組裡。"
        },
        {
          "id": 31,
          "start": 94.77000000000001,
          "end": 99.25,
          "en": "So here in main.js or in a separate router.js file.",
          "zh": "所以在這裡的 main.js，或在一個獨立的 router.js 檔案。"
        },
        {
          "id": 32,
          "start": 99.25,
          "end": 102.84,
          "en": "But since we'll only have two routes, I'll go with main.js.",
          "zh": "但因為我們只有兩條路由，我會用 main.js。"
        },
        {
          "id": 33,
          "start": 102.84,
          "end": 107.84,
          "en": "You can import createRouter from vue-router",
          "zh": "你可以從 vue-router 匯入 createRouter，"
        },
        {
          "id": 34,
          "start": 107.93,
          "end": 111.36699999999999,
          "en": "and also already import createWebHistory",
          "zh": "也已經匯入 createWebHistory，"
        },
        {
          "id": 35,
          "start": 113.12,
          "end": 115.61,
          "en": "and then set up the router here.",
          "zh": "然後在這裡設定 router。"
        },
        {
          "id": 36,
          "start": 115.61,
          "end": 119.78999999999999,
          "en": "So here we have the router we created with createRouter",
          "zh": "所以這裡我們有用 createRouter 建立的 router，"
        },
        {
          "id": 37,
          "start": 119.78999999999999,
          "end": 122.313,
          "en": "and pass a config object to createRouter.",
          "zh": "並把一個設定物件傳給 createRouter。"
        },
        {
          "id": 38,
          "start": 123.15,
          "end": 125.953,
          "en": "Set the history two to result of createWebHistory.",
          "zh": "把 history 設成 createWebHistory 的結果。"
        },
        {
          "id": 39,
          "start": 127.54,
          "end": 131.2,
          "en": "And then add our routes.",
          "zh": "然後加上我們的路由。"
        },
        {
          "id": 40,
          "start": 131.2,
          "end": 133.73,
          "en": "And I gonna have two routes here.",
          "zh": "而我在這裡會有兩條路由。"
        },
        {
          "id": 41,
          "start": 133.73,
          "end": 138.73,
          "en": "The first route should be applied if we have slash, nothing.",
          "zh": "第一條路由應該被套用，如果我們有斜線、什麼都沒有。"
        },
        {
          "id": 42,
          "start": 139,
          "end": 144,
          "en": "In this case, I want to load the AllUsers component.",
          "zh": "在這個情況裡，我想載入 AllUsers 元件。"
        },
        {
          "id": 43,
          "start": 144.63,
          "end": 146.861,
          "en": "Therefore, we should import it,",
          "zh": "因此我們應該匯入它，"
        },
        {
          "id": 44,
          "start": 146.861,
          "end": 151.861,
          "en": "AllUsers from dot, slash, pages/AllUsers.vue.",
          "zh": "AllUsers 從 ./pages/AllUsers.vue。"
        },
        {
          "id": 45,
          "start": 152.03,
          "end": 155.01,
          "en": "And we can also already import CourseGoals",
          "zh": "而我們也可以已經匯入 CourseGoals，"
        },
        {
          "id": 46,
          "start": 155.01,
          "end": 159.673,
          "en": "from dot, slash, pages/CourseGoals.vue.",
          "zh": "從 ./pages/CourseGoals.vue。"
        },
        {
          "id": 47,
          "start": 160.95,
          "end": 165.11,
          "en": "Then load AllUsers here on this first route.",
          "zh": "然後在這第一條路由上載入 AllUsers。"
        },
        {
          "id": 48,
          "start": 165.11,
          "end": 166.97,
          "en": "And then add a second route",
          "zh": "然後加上第二條路由，"
        },
        {
          "id": 49,
          "start": 166.97,
          "end": 170.42000000000002,
          "en": "with a path of slash, goals, let's say,",
          "zh": "路徑是 /goals，比方說，"
        },
        {
          "id": 50,
          "start": 170.42000000000002,
          "end": 174.523,
          "en": "where we want to load the CourseGoals component.",
          "zh": "我們想在那裡載入 CourseGoals 元件。"
        },
        {
          "id": 51,
          "start": 175.55,
          "end": 178.2,
          "en": "So these are the two routes I have here.",
          "zh": "所以這是我在這裡擁有的兩條路由。"
        },
        {
          "id": 52,
          "start": 178.2,
          "end": 181.99,
          "en": "Now we can call app.use to register this router",
          "zh": "現在我們可以呼叫 app.use 來註冊這個 router，"
        },
        {
          "id": 53,
          "start": 181.99,
          "end": 183.38,
          "en": "with our Vue app.",
          "zh": "到我們的 Vue 應用程式。"
        },
        {
          "id": 54,
          "start": 183.38,
          "end": 186.533,
          "en": "And with that, Vue is aware of these routes.",
          "zh": "而有了那個，Vue 知道這些路由。"
        },
        {
          "id": 55,
          "start": 187.72,
          "end": 190.04,
          "en": "Now, as you learned that in order to load a route",
          "zh": "現在，如你所學，為了載入一條路由"
        },
        {
          "id": 56,
          "start": 190.04,
          "end": 193.76,
          "en": "and to display it, we need to go to our App.vue file,",
          "zh": "並顯示它，我們需要前往我們的 App.vue 檔案，"
        },
        {
          "id": 57,
          "start": 193.76,
          "end": 197.54,
          "en": "and in there I will actually remove all the content",
          "zh": "而在那裡面我其實會移除所有內容，"
        },
        {
          "id": 58,
          "start": 197.54,
          "end": 201.55,
          "en": "we had in there and just add router-view",
          "zh": "我們之前放在那裡的，並只加上 router-view，"
        },
        {
          "id": 59,
          "start": 201.55,
          "end": 205.32,
          "en": "so that we just switched between these two components",
          "zh": "好讓我們只在這兩個元件之間切換，"
        },
        {
          "id": 60,
          "start": 205.32,
          "end": 207.97,
          "en": "based on which route we selected.",
          "zh": "依我們選了哪條路由。"
        },
        {
          "id": 61,
          "start": 207.97,
          "end": 212.35,
          "en": "In order to move back and forth between these components",
          "zh": "為了在這些元件之間來回移動，"
        },
        {
          "id": 62,
          "start": 212.35,
          "end": 214.36,
          "en": "from inside the running app,",
          "zh": "從正在執行的應用程式裡面，"
        },
        {
          "id": 63,
          "start": 214.36,
          "end": 217.91,
          "en": "I will actually also go to AllUsers",
          "zh": "我其實也會前往 AllUsers，"
        },
        {
          "id": 64,
          "start": 217.91,
          "end": 222.323,
          "en": "and add a router link to my CourseGoals.",
          "zh": "並加一個 router-link 到我的 CourseGoals。"
        },
        {
          "id": 65,
          "start": 223.78,
          "end": 228.04,
          "en": "So therefore, the two prop points at slash, goals,",
          "zh": "所以因此，to prop 指向 /goals，"
        },
        {
          "id": 66,
          "start": 228.04,
          "end": 231.773,
          "en": "because that was the path I'm handling here.",
          "zh": "因為那是我在這裡處理的路徑。"
        },
        {
          "id": 67,
          "start": 233.26,
          "end": 234.92000000000002,
          "en": "And I will copy that.",
          "zh": "而我會複製那個。"
        },
        {
          "id": 68,
          "start": 234.92000000000002,
          "end": 237.55,
          "en": "And in CourseGoals I'll add the same link,",
          "zh": "而在 CourseGoals 我會加上相同的連結，"
        },
        {
          "id": 69,
          "start": 237.55,
          "end": 239.75,
          "en": "but I'll go to just slash here,",
          "zh": "但我會在這裡只前往斜線，"
        },
        {
          "id": 70,
          "start": 239.75,
          "end": 241.853,
          "en": "which therefore goes to AllUsers.",
          "zh": "因此那會前往 AllUsers。"
        },
        {
          "id": 71,
          "start": 243.89,
          "end": 248.34,
          "en": "If we save that, I got some complaints here",
          "zh": "如果我們儲存，我在這裡得到一些抱怨，"
        },
        {
          "id": 72,
          "start": 248.34,
          "end": 249.3,
          "en": "that I'm not using",
          "zh": "我沒有再使用"
        },
        {
          "id": 73,
          "start": 249.3,
          "end": 252.2,
          "en": "the users list component anymore in App.vue.",
          "zh": "App.vue 裡的 UsersList 元件。"
        },
        {
          "id": 74,
          "start": 252.2,
          "end": 254.34,
          "en": "And that's correct, I'm registering it here,",
          "zh": "而那是對的，我在這裡註冊它，"
        },
        {
          "id": 75,
          "start": 254.34,
          "end": 257.1,
          "en": "but I'm not doing anything with it in my template.",
          "zh": "但我在範本裡沒有對它做任何事。"
        },
        {
          "id": 76,
          "start": 257.1,
          "end": 260.42,
          "en": "So we can comment this out and remove this import",
          "zh": "所以我們可以把這個註解掉並移除這個 import，"
        },
        {
          "id": 77,
          "start": 260.42,
          "end": 263.86,
          "en": "or remove the components option entirely here.",
          "zh": "或在這裡整個移除 components 選項。"
        },
        {
          "id": 78,
          "start": 263.86,
          "end": 267.32,
          "en": "And now with that saved, we see All Users",
          "zh": "而現在儲存那個，我們看到 All Users，"
        },
        {
          "id": 79,
          "start": 267.32,
          "end": 270.52,
          "en": "and we can switch between those routes.",
          "zh": "而我們可以在那些路由之間切換。"
        },
        {
          "id": 80,
          "start": 270.52,
          "end": 274.573,
          "en": "That's all nice, but it has nothing to do with animations.",
          "zh": "那都很好，但它跟動畫沒有關係。"
        },
        {
          "id": 81,
          "start": 275.49,
          "end": 278.65,
          "en": "Well, I want to animate the transition",
          "zh": "好，我想為轉場加上動畫，"
        },
        {
          "id": 82,
          "start": 278.65,
          "end": 280.82,
          "en": "between these two routes.",
          "zh": "在這兩條路由之間。"
        },
        {
          "id": 83,
          "start": 280.82,
          "end": 283.65999999999997,
          "en": "And thankfully we can do this.",
          "zh": "而幸好我們可以這樣做。"
        },
        {
          "id": 84,
          "start": 283.65999999999997,
          "end": 286.74,
          "en": "Now, one thought you could have",
          "zh": "現在，你可能有的一個想法"
        },
        {
          "id": 85,
          "start": 286.74,
          "end": 291.74,
          "en": "is that you wrap your router-view with transition.",
          "zh": "是你用 transition 包住你的 router-view。"
        },
        {
          "id": 86,
          "start": 292.6,
          "end": 294.72,
          "en": "I mean, it's a regular component.",
          "zh": "我的意思是，它是一個一般元件。"
        },
        {
          "id": 87,
          "start": 294.72,
          "end": 297.76,
          "en": "And if we want to animate with Vue's help",
          "zh": "而如果我們想靠 Vue 的幫助加上動畫，"
        },
        {
          "id": 88,
          "start": 297.76,
          "end": 301.71,
          "en": "between two components, like the button we saw earlier,",
          "zh": "在兩個元件之間，像我們先前看到的按鈕，"
        },
        {
          "id": 89,
          "start": 301.71,
          "end": 304.73,
          "en": "then we wrap the element with transition, right?",
          "zh": "那麼我們用 transition 包住元素，對吧？"
        },
        {
          "id": 90,
          "start": 304.73,
          "end": 307.21,
          "en": "That's what we did previously in this course",
          "zh": "那是我們先前在這門課裡做的，"
        },
        {
          "id": 91,
          "start": 307.21,
          "end": 309.363,
          "en": "when we wanted to animate components.",
          "zh": "當我們想為元件加上動畫時。"
        },
        {
          "id": 92,
          "start": 310.58,
          "end": 314.88,
          "en": "And we could then defines a new CSS classes here.",
          "zh": "然後我們可以在這裡定義新的 CSS classes。"
        },
        {
          "id": 93,
          "start": 314.88,
          "end": 317.903,
          "en": "Route-enter-from.",
          "zh": "route-enter-from。"
        },
        {
          "id": 94,
          "start": 320.05,
          "end": 323.86,
          "en": "Route-enter-active.",
          "zh": "route-enter-active。"
        },
        {
          "id": 95,
          "start": 323.86,
          "end": 326.69,
          "en": "And route-enter-to.",
          "zh": "以及 route-enter-to。"
        },
        {
          "id": 96,
          "start": 326.69,
          "end": 328.27,
          "en": "And I want to use that animation,",
          "zh": "而我想使用那個動畫，"
        },
        {
          "id": 97,
          "start": 328.27,
          "end": 331.55,
          "en": "so I will actually only use route-enter-active",
          "zh": "所以我其實只會使用 route-enter-active，"
        },
        {
          "id": 98,
          "start": 331.55,
          "end": 334.98,
          "en": "and use my slide scale animation,",
          "zh": "並使用我的 slide-scale 動畫，"
        },
        {
          "id": 99,
          "start": 334.98,
          "end": 337.07,
          "en": "the key frames which are set here,",
          "zh": "這裡設定的 keyframes，"
        },
        {
          "id": 100,
          "start": 337.07,
          "end": 342.07,
          "en": "over .4 seconds and with an ease function",
          "zh": "歷時 0.4 秒，用一個 ease 函式，"
        },
        {
          "id": 101,
          "start": 342.58,
          "end": 344.9,
          "en": "or ease out, let's say.",
          "zh": "或比方說 ease-out。"
        },
        {
          "id": 102,
          "start": 344.9,
          "end": 349.35,
          "en": "And then also define route-leave-active.",
          "zh": "然後也定義 route-leave-active。"
        },
        {
          "id": 103,
          "start": 349.35,
          "end": 352.52,
          "en": "Of course, depending on which animation you want to build,",
          "zh": "當然，取決於你想建立哪種動畫，"
        },
        {
          "id": 104,
          "start": 352.52,
          "end": 356.43,
          "en": "you could also add route-leave-from and route-leave-to.",
          "zh": "你也可以加上 route-leave-from 和 route-leave-to。"
        },
        {
          "id": 105,
          "start": 356.43,
          "end": 359.39,
          "en": "But here I again, just want to apply an animation.",
          "zh": "但這裡我同樣只想套用一個動畫。"
        },
        {
          "id": 106,
          "start": 359.39,
          "end": 361.54,
          "en": "And that will be a slide scale",
          "zh": "而那會是 slide-scale，"
        },
        {
          "id": 107,
          "start": 361.54,
          "end": 363.833,
          "en": "over the same duration with ease in.",
          "zh": "相同的持續時間，用 ease-in。"
        },
        {
          "id": 108,
          "start": 365.11,
          "end": 368.61,
          "en": "And now, since I named these CSS classes",
          "zh": "而現在，既然我把這些 CSS classes"
        },
        {
          "id": 109,
          "start": 368.61,
          "end": 370.86,
          "en": "like this with route,",
          "zh": "命名成這樣，帶著 route，"
        },
        {
          "id": 110,
          "start": 370.86,
          "end": 375.86,
          "en": "we could apply this name to this transition like that.",
          "zh": "我們可以像那樣把這個 name 套到這個 transition。"
        },
        {
          "id": 111,
          "start": 376.42,
          "end": 379.46,
          "en": "But since I always say could, and so on,",
          "zh": "但既然我一直說可以，等等，"
        },
        {
          "id": 112,
          "start": 379.46,
          "end": 383,
          "en": "this probably is not how it's going to work.",
          "zh": "這大概不是它會運作的方式。"
        },
        {
          "id": 113,
          "start": 383,
          "end": 387.3,
          "en": "And indeed, we do have some strange behavior here,",
          "zh": "而確實，我們這裡有一些奇怪的行為，"
        },
        {
          "id": 114,
          "start": 387.3,
          "end": 391.54,
          "en": "but we actually see that router-view can no longer be used",
          "zh": "但我們其實看到 router-view 不再能被"
        },
        {
          "id": 115,
          "start": 391.54,
          "end": 394.18,
          "en": "directly inside of transition.",
          "zh": "直接用在 transition 裡面。"
        },
        {
          "id": 116,
          "start": 394.18,
          "end": 395.90999999999997,
          "en": "Now, it says no longer,",
          "zh": "現在，它說不再，"
        },
        {
          "id": 117,
          "start": 395.90999999999997,
          "end": 398.93,
          "en": "because previously with older versions of Vue,",
          "zh": "是因為先前在較舊的 Vue 版本裡，"
        },
        {
          "id": 118,
          "start": 398.93,
          "end": 400.14,
          "en": "that did work.",
          "zh": "那樣確實能運作。"
        },
        {
          "id": 119,
          "start": 400.14,
          "end": 401.61,
          "en": "So maybe if you learned that,",
          "zh": "所以也許如果你學過那個，"
        },
        {
          "id": 120,
          "start": 401.61,
          "end": 404.033,
          "en": "you are still used to this old way of doing it.",
          "zh": "你仍然習慣這種舊的做法。"
        },
        {
          "id": 121,
          "start": 404.93,
          "end": 408.37,
          "en": "With Vue 3 this is no longer possible.",
          "zh": "在 Vue 3 裡這不再可能。"
        },
        {
          "id": 122,
          "start": 408.37,
          "end": 410.07,
          "en": "And we actually get the solution",
          "zh": "而我們其實也得到解法，"
        },
        {
          "id": 123,
          "start": 410.07,
          "end": 411.81,
          "en": "here in the warning as well.",
          "zh": "在這裡的警告裡。"
        },
        {
          "id": 124,
          "start": 411.81,
          "end": 414.64,
          "en": "We need to restructure our code.",
          "zh": "我們需要重新調整我們的程式碼。"
        },
        {
          "id": 125,
          "start": 414.64,
          "end": 419.64,
          "en": "Transition now needs to go inside of our router-view.",
          "zh": "transition 現在需要進到我們的 router-view 裡面。"
        },
        {
          "id": 126,
          "start": 419.81,
          "end": 422.633,
          "en": "So we should move transition inside there.",
          "zh": "所以我們應該把 transition 移到那裡面。"
        },
        {
          "id": 127,
          "start": 423.67,
          "end": 425.87,
          "en": "But this alone now all the won't do it",
          "zh": "但現在只有這個並不夠，"
        },
        {
          "id": 128,
          "start": 425.87,
          "end": 429.5,
          "en": "because while router-view supports getting content",
          "zh": "因為雖然 router-view 支援取得內容，"
        },
        {
          "id": 129,
          "start": 429.5,
          "end": 431.34,
          "en": "that will be rendered inside of it,",
          "zh": "那些會在它裡面被渲染的，"
        },
        {
          "id": 130,
          "start": 431.34,
          "end": 434.14,
          "en": "now we also need to tell it",
          "zh": "現在我們也需要告訴它"
        },
        {
          "id": 131,
          "start": 434.14,
          "end": 437.51,
          "en": "where to actually render the actual page,",
          "zh": "實際要在哪裡渲染真正的頁面，"
        },
        {
          "id": 132,
          "start": 437.51,
          "end": 439.92,
          "en": "the actual component that should be rendered",
          "zh": "應該被渲染的真正元件，"
        },
        {
          "id": 133,
          "start": 439.92,
          "end": 441.983,
          "en": "based on the route that is active.",
          "zh": "依作用中的路由而定。"
        },
        {
          "id": 134,
          "start": 442.83,
          "end": 445.87,
          "en": "And for that, we can use the scoped slots syntax",
          "zh": "而為此，我們可以使用具名插槽的作用域插槽語法，"
        },
        {
          "id": 135,
          "start": 445.87,
          "end": 448.35,
          "en": "router-view uses under the hood.",
          "zh": "router-view 在幕後使用的。"
        },
        {
          "id": 136,
          "start": 448.35,
          "end": 450.13,
          "en": "Normally we don't need it,",
          "zh": "通常我們不需要它，"
        },
        {
          "id": 137,
          "start": 450.13,
          "end": 453.46,
          "en": "but for transitions with routes, you do need it.",
          "zh": "但對帶路由的轉場，你確實需要它。"
        },
        {
          "id": 138,
          "start": 453.46,
          "end": 455.76,
          "en": "You can use this v-slot directive,",
          "zh": "你可以使用這個 v-slot 指示，"
        },
        {
          "id": 139,
          "start": 455.76,
          "end": 457.86,
          "en": "which I introduced earlier in the course",
          "zh": "我在課程較早介紹過的，"
        },
        {
          "id": 140,
          "start": 457.86,
          "end": 460.12,
          "en": "when we talked about slots,",
          "zh": "當我們談插槽時，"
        },
        {
          "id": 141,
          "start": 460.12,
          "end": 464.413,
          "en": "to extract the slotProps you're getting here.",
          "zh": "來取出你在這裡得到的 slotProps。"
        },
        {
          "id": 142,
          "start": 465.26,
          "end": 468.15999999999997,
          "en": "You get those by the router-view component,",
          "zh": "你從 router-view 元件得到那些，"
        },
        {
          "id": 143,
          "start": 468.15999999999997,
          "end": 469.97,
          "en": "which is built in.",
          "zh": "它是內建的。"
        },
        {
          "id": 144,
          "start": 469.97,
          "end": 474.11,
          "en": "And you can then use the dynamic component component",
          "zh": "然後你可以使用動態的 component 元件，"
        },
        {
          "id": 145,
          "start": 474.11,
          "end": 476.97,
          "en": "to bind it to slotProps.Component.",
          "zh": "把它繫結到 slotProps.Component。"
        },
        {
          "id": 146,
          "start": 481.6,
          "end": 485.46,
          "en": "So slotProps have a property named Component",
          "zh": "所以 slotProps 有一個名為 Component 的屬性，"
        },
        {
          "id": 147,
          "start": 485.46,
          "end": 488.64,
          "en": "with a capital C, which holds the component",
          "zh": "C 是大寫，它持有元件，"
        },
        {
          "id": 148,
          "start": 488.64,
          "end": 492.68,
          "en": "that should be loaded for the currently selected route.",
          "zh": "應該為目前選到的路由載入的那個。"
        },
        {
          "id": 149,
          "start": 492.68,
          "end": 495.7,
          "en": "And this strange looking syntax is what you need",
          "zh": "而這個看起來奇怪的語法就是你需要的，"
        },
        {
          "id": 150,
          "start": 495.7,
          "end": 499.423,
          "en": "to animate switches between these components.",
          "zh": "來為這些元件之間的切換加上動畫。"
        },
        {
          "id": 151,
          "start": 500.67,
          "end": 504.34,
          "en": "If you now save this, you no longer get the warning.",
          "zh": "如果你現在儲存，你不再得到警告。"
        },
        {
          "id": 152,
          "start": 504.34,
          "end": 506.39,
          "en": "And now this kind of works,",
          "zh": "而現在這某種程度上能運作，"
        },
        {
          "id": 153,
          "start": 506.39,
          "end": 509.22,
          "en": "but of course this looks really stupid here, right?",
          "zh": "但當然這在這裡看起來真的很蠢，對吧？"
        },
        {
          "id": 154,
          "start": 509.22,
          "end": 510.93,
          "en": "I mean, it's just moving around",
          "zh": "我的意思是，它只是移來移去，"
        },
        {
          "id": 155,
          "start": 510.93,
          "end": 515.93,
          "en": "and we got two components on the page at the same time.",
          "zh": "而我們在同一時間在頁面上有兩個元件。"
        },
        {
          "id": 156,
          "start": 516.09,
          "end": 518.41,
          "en": "So this is not fully what we want,",
          "zh": "所以這不完全是我們想要的，"
        },
        {
          "id": 157,
          "start": 518.41,
          "end": 521.05,
          "en": "but technically this is correct at least.",
          "zh": "但至少技術上這是正確的。"
        },
        {
          "id": 158,
          "start": 521.05,
          "end": 522.9,
          "en": "But one thing we want to change here",
          "zh": "但我們在這裡想改變的一件事"
        },
        {
          "id": 159,
          "start": 522.9,
          "end": 525.15,
          "en": "is something we already saw earlier",
          "zh": "是我們先前已經看過的，"
        },
        {
          "id": 160,
          "start": 525.15,
          "end": 527.29,
          "en": "when we switched between two buttons.",
          "zh": "當我們在兩個按鈕之間切換時。"
        },
        {
          "id": 161,
          "start": 527.29,
          "end": 529.52,
          "en": "We want to make sure that only one component",
          "zh": "我們想確保只有一個元件"
        },
        {
          "id": 162,
          "start": 529.52,
          "end": 532.9,
          "en": "is shown on the page at the same time.",
          "zh": "在同一時間顯示在頁面上。"
        },
        {
          "id": 163,
          "start": 532.9,
          "end": 535.39,
          "en": "And you might remember that we can achieve this",
          "zh": "而你可能記得我們可以達成這個，"
        },
        {
          "id": 164,
          "start": 535.39,
          "end": 539.08,
          "en": "by adding the mode prop to the transition component.",
          "zh": "藉由把 mode prop 加到 transition 元件。"
        },
        {
          "id": 165,
          "start": 539.08,
          "end": 543.21,
          "en": "And there we add out-in and in-out.",
          "zh": "而在那裡我們加上 out-in 和 in-out。"
        },
        {
          "id": 166,
          "start": 543.21,
          "end": 546.23,
          "en": "And if we use out-in, we ensure that first,",
          "zh": "而如果我們使用 out-in，我們確保首先"
        },
        {
          "id": 167,
          "start": 546.23,
          "end": 548.63,
          "en": "the leaving component is animated",
          "zh": "離開的元件被加上動畫，"
        },
        {
          "id": 168,
          "start": 548.63,
          "end": 553.2,
          "en": "before then the entering component is animated.",
          "zh": "然後進入的元件才被加上動畫。"
        },
        {
          "id": 169,
          "start": 553.2,
          "end": 555.4,
          "en": "So with that, if I reload,",
          "zh": "所以有了那個，如果我重新載入，"
        },
        {
          "id": 170,
          "start": 555.4,
          "end": 559.16,
          "en": "now this leaves and then we have the new component.",
          "zh": "現在這個離開，然後我們有新元件。"
        },
        {
          "id": 171,
          "start": 559.16,
          "end": 561.96,
          "en": "I will admit it still looks strange,",
          "zh": "我承認它看起來仍然奇怪，"
        },
        {
          "id": 172,
          "start": 561.96,
          "end": 565.903,
          "en": "but that's just because of the animation CSS code we set up.",
          "zh": "但那只是因為我們設定的動畫 CSS 程式碼。"
        },
        {
          "id": 173,
          "start": 567.67,
          "end": 569.3,
          "en": "If we use a different animation,",
          "zh": "如果我們使用不同的動畫，"
        },
        {
          "id": 174,
          "start": 569.3,
          "end": 572.38,
          "en": "like the fade button classes we have here,",
          "zh": "像我們這裡有的 fade-button classes，"
        },
        {
          "id": 175,
          "start": 572.38,
          "end": 576.25,
          "en": "if I use this as a name here, fade button,",
          "zh": "如果我在這裡用這個當 name，fade-button，"
        },
        {
          "id": 176,
          "start": 576.25,
          "end": 577.613,
          "en": "this will look nicer.",
          "zh": "這會好看一些。"
        },
        {
          "id": 177,
          "start": 578.64,
          "end": 581.38,
          "en": "With that we've got a nice fade animation",
          "zh": "有了那個，我們得到一個不錯的淡出動畫，"
        },
        {
          "id": 178,
          "start": 581.38,
          "end": 582.623,
          "en": "between these routes.",
          "zh": "在這些路由之間。"
        },
        {
          "id": 179,
          "start": 583.75,
          "end": 587.94,
          "en": "So that is how you can animate route transitions.",
          "zh": "所以那就是你如何為路由轉場加上動畫。"
        },
        {
          "id": 180,
          "start": 587.94,
          "end": 590.5,
          "en": "Now, one thing you might have noticed before",
          "zh": "現在，你先前可能注意到的一件事"
        },
        {
          "id": 181,
          "start": 590.5,
          "end": 593.73,
          "en": "is that when you used that other animation",
          "zh": "是當你使用那個其他動畫，"
        },
        {
          "id": 182,
          "start": 593.73,
          "end": 597.5,
          "en": "which looked a bit strange, the route animation here,",
          "zh": "看起來有點奇怪的，這裡的 route 動畫，"
        },
        {
          "id": 183,
          "start": 597.5,
          "end": 601.14,
          "en": "we even saw that animation when we loaded the page",
          "zh": "我們甚至在第一次載入頁面時"
        },
        {
          "id": 184,
          "start": 601.14,
          "end": 603.46,
          "en": "for the first time.",
          "zh": "看到那個動畫。"
        },
        {
          "id": 185,
          "start": 603.46,
          "end": 606.31,
          "en": "So you have this initial animation.",
          "zh": "所以你有這個最初的動畫。"
        },
        {
          "id": 186,
          "start": 606.31,
          "end": 609.27,
          "en": "The reason for data's that with the vue-router,",
          "zh": "原因是，用 vue-router，"
        },
        {
          "id": 187,
          "start": 609.27,
          "end": 613.39,
          "en": "technically the first act of route is an empty route.",
          "zh": "技術上第一個作用中的路由是一條空路由。"
        },
        {
          "id": 188,
          "start": 613.39,
          "end": 615.5,
          "en": "And then when your page starts,",
          "zh": "然後當你的頁面開始，"
        },
        {
          "id": 189,
          "start": 615.5,
          "end": 617.82,
          "en": "when your page is loaded for the first time,",
          "zh": "當你的頁面第一次被載入時，"
        },
        {
          "id": 190,
          "start": 617.82,
          "end": 621.26,
          "en": "it immediately switches to the route that should be used",
          "zh": "它立刻切換到應該被使用的路由，"
        },
        {
          "id": 191,
          "start": 621.26,
          "end": 623.053,
          "en": "for the given path in your URL.",
          "zh": "給你 URL 裡給定的路徑。"
        },
        {
          "id": 192,
          "start": 624.33,
          "end": 627.48,
          "en": "That means that technically when the app starts,",
          "zh": "那表示技術上當應用程式開始時，"
        },
        {
          "id": 193,
          "start": 627.48,
          "end": 629.97,
          "en": "the vue-router goes from no route",
          "zh": "vue-router 從沒有路由"
        },
        {
          "id": 194,
          "start": 629.97,
          "end": 633.87,
          "en": "to the chosen route for to given path.",
          "zh": "前往給定路徑所選的路由。"
        },
        {
          "id": 195,
          "start": 633.87,
          "end": 635.98,
          "en": "And hence it plays an animation",
          "zh": "因此它播放一個動畫，"
        },
        {
          "id": 196,
          "start": 635.98,
          "end": 639,
          "en": "because we go from one component, nothing,",
          "zh": "因為我們從一個元件、什麼都沒有，"
        },
        {
          "id": 197,
          "start": 639,
          "end": 640.943,
          "en": "to the to be loaded component.",
          "zh": "前往即將被載入的元件。"
        },
        {
          "id": 198,
          "start": 641.95,
          "end": 646.19,
          "en": "To avoid this behavior, you can go to main.js",
          "zh": "為了避免這個行為，你可以前往 main.js，"
        },
        {
          "id": 199,
          "start": 646.19,
          "end": 648.38,
          "en": "where you register the router",
          "zh": "你在那裡註冊 router，"
        },
        {
          "id": 200,
          "start": 648.38,
          "end": 652.1,
          "en": "and there you can actually use the router",
          "zh": "而在那裡你其實可以使用 router"
        },
        {
          "id": 201,
          "start": 652.1,
          "end": 655.18,
          "en": "to call the is ready method on it.",
          "zh": "對它呼叫 isReady 方法。"
        },
        {
          "id": 202,
          "start": 655.18,
          "end": 657.3,
          "en": "This method will let you know",
          "zh": "這個方法會讓你知道"
        },
        {
          "id": 203,
          "start": 657.3,
          "end": 660.93,
          "en": "when the router successfully evaluated",
          "zh": "router 何時成功判斷"
        },
        {
          "id": 204,
          "start": 660.93,
          "end": 662.753,
          "en": "which page should be loaded.",
          "zh": "應該載入哪個頁面。"
        },
        {
          "id": 205,
          "start": 664.25,
          "end": 668.21,
          "en": "This gives you a promise and hence you can call then on it.",
          "zh": "這給你一個 Promise，因此你可以對它呼叫 then。"
        },
        {
          "id": 206,
          "start": 668.21,
          "end": 671.33,
          "en": "And in the function you pass to this then block,",
          "zh": "而在你傳給這個 then 區塊的函式裡，"
        },
        {
          "id": 207,
          "start": 671.33,
          "end": 674.95,
          "en": "in this function the router will now not go",
          "zh": "在這個函式裡，router 現在不會"
        },
        {
          "id": 208,
          "start": 674.95,
          "end": 678.52,
          "en": "from the empty to the to be selected page.",
          "zh": "從空的前往即將被選到的頁面。"
        },
        {
          "id": 209,
          "start": 678.52,
          "end": 680.28,
          "en": "But instead, at this point of time,",
          "zh": "相反，在這個時間點，"
        },
        {
          "id": 210,
          "start": 680.28,
          "end": 682.68,
          "en": "it is aware of the page that should be loaded",
          "zh": "它知道應該被載入的頁面，"
        },
        {
          "id": 211,
          "start": 682.68,
          "end": 687.12,
          "en": "and it will therefore not make this initial transition.",
          "zh": "因此它不會做這個最初的轉場。"
        },
        {
          "id": 212,
          "start": 687.12,
          "end": 690.84,
          "en": "So you can then mount your app inside of this function",
          "zh": "所以你可以接著在這個函式裡面掛載你的應用程式，"
        },
        {
          "id": 213,
          "start": 690.84,
          "end": 695.13,
          "en": "to only mount and therefore render your app",
          "zh": "只掛載並因此渲染你的應用程式，"
        },
        {
          "id": 214,
          "start": 695.13,
          "end": 699.17,
          "en": "once the router is fully set up and aware of the page",
          "zh": "一旦 router 完全設定好並知道那個頁面，"
        },
        {
          "id": 215,
          "start": 699.17,
          "end": 700.86,
          "en": "that should be loaded.",
          "zh": "應該被載入的。"
        },
        {
          "id": 216,
          "start": 700.86,
          "end": 702.88,
          "en": "And if you do that and reload,",
          "zh": "而如果你那樣做並重新載入，"
        },
        {
          "id": 217,
          "start": 702.88,
          "end": 705.01,
          "en": "you don't have this initial animation.",
          "zh": "你沒有這個最初的動畫。"
        },
        {
          "id": 218,
          "start": 705.01,
          "end": 708.16,
          "en": "Now you just have it if you switch routes.",
          "zh": "現在你只在切換路由時有它。"
        },
        {
          "id": 219,
          "start": 708.16,
          "end": 710.84,
          "en": "And now I'm going back to the other animation",
          "zh": "而現在我要回到另一個動畫，"
        },
        {
          "id": 220,
          "start": 710.84,
          "end": 712.4,
          "en": "since that looked nicer,",
          "zh": "因為那個看起來比較好，"
        },
        {
          "id": 221,
          "start": 712.4,
          "end": 715.1,
          "en": "so to the fade button animation here.",
          "zh": "所以是這裡的 fade-button 動畫。"
        },
        {
          "id": 222,
          "start": 715.1,
          "end": 716.02,
          "en": "But that is it.",
          "zh": "但就是這樣。"
        },
        {
          "id": 223,
          "start": 716.02,
          "end": 719.53,
          "en": "That is how you can animate the transition",
          "zh": "那就是你如何為轉場加上動畫，"
        },
        {
          "id": 224,
          "start": 719.53,
          "end": 721.71,
          "en": "between different routes.",
          "zh": "在不同路由之間。"
        },
        {
          "id": 225,
          "start": 721.71,
          "end": 723.93,
          "en": "It's a strange looking syntax maybe,",
          "zh": "它也許是看起來奇怪的語法，"
        },
        {
          "id": 226,
          "start": 723.93,
          "end": 727.91,
          "en": "but you really only needed for this transition scenario.",
          "zh": "但你真的只在這個轉場情境需要它。"
        },
        {
          "id": 227,
          "start": 727.91,
          "end": 731.92,
          "en": "But with that, you're now able to also animate changes",
          "zh": "但有了那個，你現在也能為變更加上動畫，"
        },
        {
          "id": 228,
          "start": 731.92,
          "end": 733.433,
          "en": "between different pages.",
          "zh": "在不同頁面之間。"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "21879686",
      "title": "Module Introduction",
      "lectureOrder": 212,
      "videoOrder": 185,
      "sourceHash": "babff39b9f54fe8b8c4c9c152b02d63c02fd2d4c19e0fa79d24e33f26e307ecd",
      "cues": [
        {
          "id": 1,
          "start": 2.15,
          "end": 4.15,
          "en": "As you build bigger and bigger",
          "zh": "當你打造的"
        },
        {
          "id": 2,
          "start": 4.15,
          "end": 5.77,
          "en": "Vue applications,",
          "zh": "Vue 應用程式越來越大，"
        },
        {
          "id": 3,
          "start": 5.77,
          "end": 8.62,
          "en": "managing your application state,",
          "zh": "管理應用程式的狀態，"
        },
        {
          "id": 4,
          "start": 8.62,
          "end": 11.25,
          "en": "your application data",
          "zh": "也就是應用程式的資料，"
        },
        {
          "id": 5,
          "start": 11.25,
          "end": 13.9,
          "en": "can become more and more challenging.",
          "zh": "就會變得越來越有挑戰性。"
        },
        {
          "id": 6,
          "start": 13.9,
          "end": 18.02,
          "en": "This module is about a better state management solution",
          "zh": "這個模組要介紹一個更好的狀態管理方案，"
        },
        {
          "id": 7,
          "start": 18.02,
          "end": 19.5,
          "en": "called Vuex.",
          "zh": "叫做 Vuex。"
        },
        {
          "id": 8,
          "start": 19.5,
          "end": 23.95,
          "en": "Which can be used to replace, provide and inject",
          "zh": "對於想在多個元件之間，"
        },
        {
          "id": 9,
          "start": 23.95,
          "end": 28.74,
          "en": "for data which you wanna share across multiple components",
          "zh": "甚至在整個應用程式中共享的資料，"
        },
        {
          "id": 10,
          "start": 28.74,
          "end": 31.66,
          "en": "possibly across your entire app.",
          "zh": "它可以用來取代 provide 和 inject。"
        },
        {
          "id": 11,
          "start": 31.66,
          "end": 34.6,
          "en": "Now to understand Vuex in detail,",
          "zh": "為了深入了解 Vuex，"
        },
        {
          "id": 12,
          "start": 34.6,
          "end": 35.66,
          "en": "in this module,",
          "zh": "在這個模組中，"
        },
        {
          "id": 13,
          "start": 35.66,
          "end": 39.6,
          "en": "we'll first of all dive into what exactly Vuex is",
          "zh": "我們會先探討 Vuex 到底是什麼，"
        },
        {
          "id": 14,
          "start": 39.6,
          "end": 42.69,
          "en": "and why exactly we need or use it.",
          "zh": "以及我們為什麼需要、為什麼要使用它。"
        },
        {
          "id": 15,
          "start": 42.69,
          "end": 46.22,
          "en": "And then of course we'll explore it from the ground up",
          "zh": "接著當然會從頭開始探索它，"
        },
        {
          "id": 16,
          "start": 46.22,
          "end": 49.22,
          "en": "so that you understand how Vuex works",
          "zh": "讓你了解 Vuex 如何運作，"
        },
        {
          "id": 17,
          "start": 49.22,
          "end": 52.62,
          "en": "and how you can use it in your Vue applications",
          "zh": "以及如何在 Vue 應用程式中使用它，"
        },
        {
          "id": 18,
          "start": 52.62,
          "end": 55.45,
          "en": "to manage your application data",
          "zh": "以更好的方式"
        },
        {
          "id": 19,
          "start": 55.45,
          "end": 57.393,
          "en": "in a better way.",
          "zh": "管理應用程式的資料。"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "21879694",
      "title": "What & Why?",
      "lectureOrder": 213,
      "videoOrder": 186,
      "sourceHash": "248caf8d235f90c218c79e0b94b2a8f90e5b580b57d9ea6041da402561357909",
      "cues": [
        {
          "id": 1,
          "start": 2.15,
          "end": 5.656,
          "en": "So, exactly is Vuex?",
          "zh": "那麼，Vuex 到底是什麼？"
        },
        {
          "id": 2,
          "start": 5.656,
          "end": 10.5,
          "en": "Vuex is a library for managing global state.",
          "zh": "Vuex 是一個用來管理全域狀態的函式庫。"
        },
        {
          "id": 3,
          "start": 10.5,
          "end": 12.78,
          "en": "Okay, that's a nice sentence.",
          "zh": "好，這句話說得很漂亮，"
        },
        {
          "id": 4,
          "start": 12.78,
          "end": 14.18,
          "en": "What does it mean?",
          "zh": "但它是什麼意思？"
        },
        {
          "id": 5,
          "start": 14.18,
          "end": 15.84,
          "en": "What's state?",
          "zh": "什麼是狀態？"
        },
        {
          "id": 6,
          "start": 15.84,
          "end": 19.09,
          "en": "State could simply be translated with data,",
          "zh": "狀態可以簡單理解為資料，"
        },
        {
          "id": 7,
          "start": 19.09,
          "end": 23.85,
          "en": "data your application needs and data that affects",
          "zh": "也就是應用程式需要的資料，以及會影響"
        },
        {
          "id": 8,
          "start": 23.85,
          "end": 26.53,
          "en": "what the user sees on the screen.",
          "zh": "使用者在畫面上看到什麼的資料。"
        },
        {
          "id": 9,
          "start": 26.53,
          "end": 30.56,
          "en": "So, you can think of state as reactive data,",
          "zh": "所以你可以把狀態想成響應式資料，"
        },
        {
          "id": 10,
          "start": 30.56,
          "end": 34.45,
          "en": "data which may change and where such changes",
          "zh": "也就是可能會改變，而且這些改變"
        },
        {
          "id": 11,
          "start": 34.45,
          "end": 37.63,
          "en": "then should trigger something on the screen.",
          "zh": "應該觸發畫面上某些變化的資料。"
        },
        {
          "id": 12,
          "start": 37.63,
          "end": 41.63,
          "en": "And Vue.js is all about this reactivity, of course,",
          "zh": "而 Vue.js 的核心當然就是這種響應性，"
        },
        {
          "id": 13,
          "start": 41.63,
          "end": 43.59,
          "en": "as you learn throughout the course.",
          "zh": "這點你在整門課程中都學到了。"
        },
        {
          "id": 14,
          "start": 43.59,
          "end": 47.62,
          "en": "But managing data, state, that affects",
          "zh": "但要管理會影響"
        },
        {
          "id": 15,
          "start": 47.62,
          "end": 51.31,
          "en": "different components of your app can be tricky.",
          "zh": "應用程式中不同元件的資料、狀態，可能並不容易。"
        },
        {
          "id": 16,
          "start": 51.31,
          "end": 52.94,
          "en": "For that it's important though,",
          "zh": "為此，很重要的是"
        },
        {
          "id": 17,
          "start": 52.94,
          "end": 56.74,
          "en": "to differentiate between two main kinds of state,",
          "zh": "區分兩種主要的狀態："
        },
        {
          "id": 18,
          "start": 56.74,
          "end": 59.473,
          "en": "local state and global state.",
          "zh": "區域狀態和全域狀態。"
        },
        {
          "id": 19,
          "start": 60.67,
          "end": 64.83,
          "en": "Local state is the state the data",
          "zh": "區域狀態是指"
        },
        {
          "id": 20,
          "start": 64.83,
          "end": 67.11,
          "en": "you manage inside of one component,",
          "zh": "你在單一元件內部管理的資料，"
        },
        {
          "id": 21,
          "start": 67.11,
          "end": 71.62,
          "en": "which only affects this one component and possibly,",
          "zh": "它只會影響這個元件，或許還會"
        },
        {
          "id": 22,
          "start": 71.62,
          "end": 75.59,
          "en": "indirectly through props, also a child component.",
          "zh": "透過 props 間接影響某個子元件。"
        },
        {
          "id": 23,
          "start": 75.59,
          "end": 78.37,
          "en": "Here examples could be user input",
          "zh": "例如，使用者在 input 元素中"
        },
        {
          "id": 24,
          "start": 78.37,
          "end": 81.94,
          "en": "that was entered into input elements, or for example,",
          "zh": "輸入的內容，或是"
        },
        {
          "id": 25,
          "start": 81.94,
          "end": 85.94,
          "en": "a button that shows or hides some container.",
          "zh": "用來顯示或隱藏某個容器的按鈕。"
        },
        {
          "id": 26,
          "start": 85.94,
          "end": 87.81,
          "en": "And I got an example for you.",
          "zh": "我這裡有個例子。"
        },
        {
          "id": 27,
          "start": 87.81,
          "end": 91.35,
          "en": "This is a course project we built a little bit earlier",
          "zh": "這是我們在課程稍早、"
        },
        {
          "id": 28,
          "start": 91.35,
          "end": 95.02000000000001,
          "en": "in the course after the main component sections.",
          "zh": "主要元件章節之後打造的課程專案，"
        },
        {
          "id": 29,
          "start": 95.02000000000001,
          "end": 97.34,
          "en": "It's this learning resource manager",
          "zh": "也就是這個學習資源管理器。"
        },
        {
          "id": 30,
          "start": 98.78,
          "end": 102.47,
          "en": "and in there in the AddResource.Vue file",
          "zh": "在其中的 AddResource.vue 檔案裡，"
        },
        {
          "id": 31,
          "start": 102.47,
          "end": 105.94,
          "en": "in the AddResource component, we, for example,",
          "zh": "也就是 AddResource 元件中，"
        },
        {
          "id": 32,
          "start": 105.94,
          "end": 109.47999999999999,
          "en": "have a form where we fetch user input.",
          "zh": "有一個用來取得使用者輸入的表單。"
        },
        {
          "id": 33,
          "start": 109.47999999999999,
          "end": 113.95,
          "en": "And that user input, as well as the overall form validity",
          "zh": "這些使用者輸入以及整個表單是否有效，"
        },
        {
          "id": 34,
          "start": 113.95,
          "end": 116.21000000000001,
          "en": "only matters to this component.",
          "zh": "只與這個元件有關。"
        },
        {
          "id": 35,
          "start": 116.21000000000001,
          "end": 120.72,
          "en": "Here for example we have this inputisInvalid data",
          "zh": "例如這裡有 inputIsInvalid 這個資料，"
        },
        {
          "id": 36,
          "start": 120.72,
          "end": 124.49,
          "en": "and therefore that would be the state of that component",
          "zh": "它就是這個元件的狀態，"
        },
        {
          "id": 37,
          "start": 124.49,
          "end": 129.49,
          "en": "which influences whether or not we show this dialogue.",
          "zh": "會影響我們是否顯示這個對話框。"
        },
        {
          "id": 38,
          "start": 130.89,
          "end": 135.59,
          "en": "So, this inputisInvalid data piece is state",
          "zh": "所以 inputIsInvalid 這份資料就是狀態，"
        },
        {
          "id": 39,
          "start": 135.59,
          "end": 138.73,
          "en": "because it affects what the user sees on the screen.",
          "zh": "因為它會影響使用者在畫面上看到的內容，"
        },
        {
          "id": 40,
          "start": 138.73,
          "end": 141.13,
          "en": "We show or don't show this dialogue.",
          "zh": "決定我們是否顯示這個對話框，"
        },
        {
          "id": 41,
          "start": 141.13,
          "end": 144.09,
          "en": "And it really only matters to this component.",
          "zh": "而且它真的只與這個元件有關，"
        },
        {
          "id": 42,
          "start": 144.09,
          "end": 147.05,
          "en": "We manage it internally in this component.",
          "zh": "由這個元件在內部管理。"
        },
        {
          "id": 43,
          "start": 147.05,
          "end": 149.913,
          "en": "So, that would be an example for a local state.",
          "zh": "所以這就是區域狀態的一個例子。"
        },
        {
          "id": 44,
          "start": 150.87,
          "end": 155.417,
          "en": "On the other hand, global state is state data",
          "zh": "另一方面，全域狀態是指"
        },
        {
          "id": 45,
          "start": 156.28,
          "end": 161.28,
          "en": "that affects multiple components, possibly the entire app.",
          "zh": "會影響多個元件、甚至整個應用程式的狀態資料，"
        },
        {
          "id": 46,
          "start": 161.8,
          "end": 165.06,
          "en": "So, data which you need in a lot of different places.",
          "zh": "也就是在許多不同地方都需要的資料。"
        },
        {
          "id": 47,
          "start": 165.06,
          "end": 169.44,
          "en": "Examples here could be the user authentication status,",
          "zh": "例如使用者的驗證狀態，"
        },
        {
          "id": 48,
          "start": 169.44,
          "end": 172.07,
          "en": "whether a user is logged in or not,",
          "zh": "也就是使用者是否已登入；"
        },
        {
          "id": 49,
          "start": 172.07,
          "end": 174.85,
          "en": "shopping card items which might be presented",
          "zh": "或是購物車中的商品，可能會"
        },
        {
          "id": 50,
          "start": 174.85,
          "end": 179.47,
          "en": "in different parts of the app, and similar examples.",
          "zh": "出現在應用程式的不同地方，諸如此類。"
        },
        {
          "id": 51,
          "start": 179.47,
          "end": 181.79,
          "en": "Again, in this app I just showed you",
          "zh": "同樣地，在我剛才展示的這個應用程式中，"
        },
        {
          "id": 52,
          "start": 181.79,
          "end": 184.76,
          "en": "an example for a global state could be found",
          "zh": "全域狀態的例子可以在"
        },
        {
          "id": 53,
          "start": 184.76,
          "end": 187.71,
          "en": "in the TheResources.vue file.",
          "zh": "TheResources.vue 檔案中找到。"
        },
        {
          "id": 54,
          "start": 187.71,
          "end": 191.51,
          "en": "In there I got these stored resources",
          "zh": "這裡有 storedResources，"
        },
        {
          "id": 55,
          "start": 191.51,
          "end": 195.25,
          "en": "and those stored resources are changed",
          "zh": "這些 storedResources 會"
        },
        {
          "id": 56,
          "start": 195.25,
          "end": 198.154,
          "en": "through the addResource method, for example,",
          "zh": "透過 addResource 方法等方式改變，"
        },
        {
          "id": 57,
          "start": 198.154,
          "end": 200.79,
          "en": "but this method is triggered",
          "zh": "但這個方法是"
        },
        {
          "id": 58,
          "start": 200.79,
          "end": 204.57999999999998,
          "en": "from inside another component and the StoredResources",
          "zh": "從另一個元件內部觸發的，而 storedResources"
        },
        {
          "id": 59,
          "start": 204.57999999999998,
          "end": 208.02,
          "en": "are also used in other components of this app.",
          "zh": "也會在這個應用程式的其他元件中使用。"
        },
        {
          "id": 60,
          "start": 208.02,
          "end": 212.313,
          "en": "So, this is an app wide, or at least a multicomponent state.",
          "zh": "所以這是整個應用程式範圍，或至少是跨多個元件的狀態，"
        },
        {
          "id": 61,
          "start": 213.27,
          "end": 217.09,
          "en": "It's data that's used across multiple components.",
          "zh": "也就是在多個元件之間使用的資料。"
        },
        {
          "id": 62,
          "start": 217.09,
          "end": 221.57999999999998,
          "en": "And it's the global state where Vuex can help us.",
          "zh": "而 Vuex 能幫上忙的就是全域狀態。"
        },
        {
          "id": 63,
          "start": 221.57999999999998,
          "end": 223.4,
          "en": "Because thus far, for example,",
          "zh": "因為到目前為止，例如"
        },
        {
          "id": 64,
          "start": 223.4,
          "end": 225.61,
          "en": "in this app I just showed you,",
          "zh": "在我剛才展示的這個應用程式中，"
        },
        {
          "id": 65,
          "start": 225.61,
          "end": 230.61,
          "en": "we managed this state through provide and inject.",
          "zh": "我們是透過 provide 和 inject 管理這個狀態。"
        },
        {
          "id": 66,
          "start": 230.85,
          "end": 233.856,
          "en": "And this works, and this is not necessarily bad,",
          "zh": "這樣可行，也不一定不好，"
        },
        {
          "id": 67,
          "start": 233.856,
          "end": 236.6,
          "en": "but it has a couple of drawbacks",
          "zh": "但它有幾個缺點，"
        },
        {
          "id": 68,
          "start": 236.6,
          "end": 239.52,
          "en": "which might or might not matter to you.",
          "zh": "對你來說可能重要，也可能不重要。"
        },
        {
          "id": 69,
          "start": 239.52,
          "end": 242.67,
          "en": "One potential disadvantage for example,",
          "zh": "例如，其中一個潛在的缺點"
        },
        {
          "id": 70,
          "start": 242.67,
          "end": 245.67,
          "en": "is that you end up with all the data",
          "zh": "是所有資料"
        },
        {
          "id": 71,
          "start": 245.67,
          "end": 249.43,
          "en": "and all the methods to change the data in one component.",
          "zh": "以及修改資料的所有方法，最後都集中在一個元件中，"
        },
        {
          "id": 72,
          "start": 249.43,
          "end": 252.47,
          "en": "In this case, the TheResources component,",
          "zh": "在這個例子中就是 TheResources 元件。"
        },
        {
          "id": 73,
          "start": 252.47,
          "end": 254.65,
          "en": "which therefore gets rather big",
          "zh": "因此這個元件會變得相當龐大，"
        },
        {
          "id": 74,
          "start": 254.65,
          "end": 257.5,
          "en": "and which has a lot of data and a lot of methods",
          "zh": "裡面有大量的資料和方法，"
        },
        {
          "id": 75,
          "start": 257.5,
          "end": 260.209,
          "en": "inside of it, which isn't really needed",
          "zh": "而這些其實不是"
        },
        {
          "id": 76,
          "start": 260.209,
          "end": 262.44,
          "en": "for the template of that component,",
          "zh": "該元件的範本需要的，"
        },
        {
          "id": 77,
          "start": 262.44,
          "end": 265.79,
          "en": "but which is simply needed in other components.",
          "zh": "只是其他元件需要而已。"
        },
        {
          "id": 78,
          "start": 265.79,
          "end": 267.8,
          "en": "So, getting such a big component,",
          "zh": "所以，這樣一個龐大的元件"
        },
        {
          "id": 79,
          "start": 267.8,
          "end": 270.062,
          "en": "which manages cross components state,",
          "zh": "負責管理跨元件的狀態，"
        },
        {
          "id": 80,
          "start": 270.062,
          "end": 274.54,
          "en": "that can be hard to maintain as your application grows",
          "zh": "隨著應用程式成長，"
        },
        {
          "id": 81,
          "start": 274.54,
          "end": 276.47,
          "en": "and as you maybe have more and more",
          "zh": "需要管理的全域狀態越來越多，"
        },
        {
          "id": 82,
          "start": 276.47,
          "end": 278.053,
          "en": "global state to manage.",
          "zh": "就可能變得難以維護。"
        },
        {
          "id": 83,
          "start": 278.99,
          "end": 281.69,
          "en": "In addition, provide and inject",
          "zh": "此外，provide 和 inject"
        },
        {
          "id": 84,
          "start": 281.69,
          "end": 286.69,
          "en": "can have some tricky problems regarding reactivity.",
          "zh": "在響應性方面可能會有一些棘手的問題，"
        },
        {
          "id": 85,
          "start": 286.79,
          "end": 290.08,
          "en": "It depends on which data you provide and inject.",
          "zh": "這取決於你 provide 和 inject 的是哪些資料。"
        },
        {
          "id": 86,
          "start": 290.08,
          "end": 292.21,
          "en": "And whilst there are solutions",
          "zh": "雖然你可能遇到的所有問題"
        },
        {
          "id": 87,
          "start": 292.21,
          "end": 294.53,
          "en": "for all possible problems you could face,",
          "zh": "都有解決方法，"
        },
        {
          "id": 88,
          "start": 294.53,
          "end": 298.723,
          "en": "a solution like Vuex in the end might be the best solution.",
          "zh": "但說到底，像 Vuex 這樣的方案可能才是最好的解法。"
        },
        {
          "id": 89,
          "start": 299.64,
          "end": 303.01,
          "en": "Now, why exactly is Vuex a good solution though?",
          "zh": "那麼，為什麼 Vuex 是個好方案呢？"
        },
        {
          "id": 90,
          "start": 303.01,
          "end": 304.993,
          "en": "Why might it be worth a look?",
          "zh": "為什麼值得一看？"
        },
        {
          "id": 91,
          "start": 305.85,
          "end": 308.65,
          "en": "As I just outlined, managing app wide",
          "zh": "就像我剛才說明的，管理整個應用程式範圍"
        },
        {
          "id": 92,
          "start": 308.65,
          "end": 311.32,
          "en": "or global state can be difficult.",
          "zh": "或全域的狀態可能很困難。"
        },
        {
          "id": 93,
          "start": 311.32,
          "end": 313.86,
          "en": "You end up with such fat components,",
          "zh": "你最後會得到這種臃腫的元件，"
        },
        {
          "id": 94,
          "start": 313.86,
          "end": 315.65,
          "en": "which have a lot of logic in them,",
          "zh": "裡面有大量邏輯，"
        },
        {
          "id": 95,
          "start": 315.65,
          "end": 318.49,
          "en": "which isn't needed for the component's template,",
          "zh": "而這些邏輯不是元件範本需要的，"
        },
        {
          "id": 96,
          "start": 318.49,
          "end": 320.89,
          "en": "but in other components of the app.",
          "zh": "而是應用程式中其他元件需要的。"
        },
        {
          "id": 97,
          "start": 320.89,
          "end": 323.89,
          "en": "You also might have unpredictable behavior",
          "zh": "應用程式也可能出現難以預測的行為，"
        },
        {
          "id": 98,
          "start": 323.89,
          "end": 326.33,
          "en": "in your application because it's not always",
          "zh": "因為狀態在哪裡被修改"
        },
        {
          "id": 99,
          "start": 326.33,
          "end": 330.14300000000003,
          "en": "immediately obvious where state gets changed",
          "zh": "不一定一目瞭然，"
        },
        {
          "id": 100,
          "start": 330.14300000000003,
          "end": 333.124,
          "en": "or maybe it's possible to change state",
          "zh": "或者狀態可能會"
        },
        {
          "id": 101,
          "start": 333.124,
          "end": 336.57,
          "en": "in ways that you don't want it to be changed.",
          "zh": "以你不希望的方式被修改。"
        },
        {
          "id": 102,
          "start": 336.57,
          "end": 340.01,
          "en": "It also could be error prone because accidental",
          "zh": "這也可能容易出錯，因為可能會發生"
        },
        {
          "id": 103,
          "start": 340.01,
          "end": 343.46,
          "en": "or missed state updates could happen.",
          "zh": "意外的狀態更新，或漏掉應有的更新。"
        },
        {
          "id": 104,
          "start": 343.46,
          "end": 347.04,
          "en": "Coming back to this example in the component",
          "zh": "回到這個元件的例子，"
        },
        {
          "id": 105,
          "start": 347.04,
          "end": 351.61,
          "en": "where we inject the resources, we get the resources array,",
          "zh": "我們在這裡注入 resources，取得 resources 陣列，"
        },
        {
          "id": 106,
          "start": 351.61,
          "end": 355.25,
          "en": "which we also manage in TheResources.vue.",
          "zh": "而這個陣列也是在 TheResources.vue 中管理的。"
        },
        {
          "id": 107,
          "start": 355.25,
          "end": 358.3,
          "en": "Now, theoretically, we could edit this array",
          "zh": "理論上，我們可以在"
        },
        {
          "id": 108,
          "start": 358.3,
          "end": 360.7,
          "en": "in the place where it is injected,",
          "zh": "注入它的地方修改這個陣列，"
        },
        {
          "id": 109,
          "start": 360.7,
          "end": 364.92,
          "en": "and we would be editing the exact same array in memory.",
          "zh": "而修改的就會是記憶體中同一個陣列。"
        },
        {
          "id": 110,
          "start": 364.92,
          "end": 368.53,
          "en": "We're not doing this here, but you could do it accidentally,",
          "zh": "我們這裡沒有這麼做，但你可能會不小心這麼做，"
        },
        {
          "id": 111,
          "start": 368.53,
          "end": 371.06,
          "en": "or maybe because a colleague is working on the code",
          "zh": "或者某位同事在修改程式碼時"
        },
        {
          "id": 112,
          "start": 371.06,
          "end": 372.783,
          "en": "who isn't paying close attention.",
          "zh": "沒有特別留意。"
        },
        {
          "id": 113,
          "start": 373.68,
          "end": 375.7,
          "en": "And that is exactly what I mean with",
          "zh": "這正是我所說的"
        },
        {
          "id": 114,
          "start": 375.7,
          "end": 378.52,
          "en": "it being unpredictable or error prone.",
          "zh": "難以預測、容易出錯。"
        },
        {
          "id": 115,
          "start": 378.52,
          "end": 380.8,
          "en": "You can edit data in places",
          "zh": "你可能會在"
        },
        {
          "id": 116,
          "start": 380.8,
          "end": 382.87,
          "en": "where it shouldn't really be edited.",
          "zh": "其實不該修改資料的地方修改資料。"
        },
        {
          "id": 117,
          "start": 382.87,
          "end": 384.29,
          "en": "Of course, if you're working on your own,",
          "zh": "當然，如果你是獨自開發，"
        },
        {
          "id": 118,
          "start": 384.29,
          "end": 385.62,
          "en": "this might not be a problem,",
          "zh": "這也許不是問題，"
        },
        {
          "id": 119,
          "start": 385.62,
          "end": 387.89,
          "en": "but in bigger projects and in bigger teams,",
          "zh": "但在較大的專案和較大的團隊中，"
        },
        {
          "id": 120,
          "start": 387.89,
          "end": 389.253,
          "en": "it could become a problem.",
          "zh": "就可能成為問題。"
        },
        {
          "id": 121,
          "start": 390.12,
          "end": 392.53,
          "en": "And that's exactly where Vuex helps us",
          "zh": "而這正是 Vuex 能幫助我們的地方，"
        },
        {
          "id": 122,
          "start": 392.53,
          "end": 397.53,
          "en": "because with Vuex, we outsource the state management.",
          "zh": "因為使用 Vuex 時，我們會把狀態管理抽離出來，"
        },
        {
          "id": 123,
          "start": 397.65999999999997,
          "end": 400.46,
          "en": "It's no longer in such fat components,",
          "zh": "不再放在這種臃腫的元件中，"
        },
        {
          "id": 124,
          "start": 400.46,
          "end": 402.61,
          "en": "instead it's in a separate place,",
          "zh": "而是放在一個獨立的地方，"
        },
        {
          "id": 125,
          "start": 402.61,
          "end": 404.83299999999997,
          "en": "detached from the components.",
          "zh": "與元件分開。"
        },
        {
          "id": 126,
          "start": 405.84000000000003,
          "end": 408.68399999999997,
          "en": "It's also a more predictable because Vuex has",
          "zh": "它也更容易預測，因為 Vuex"
        },
        {
          "id": 127,
          "start": 408.68399999999997,
          "end": 412.87,
          "en": "some clear rules on where state should be managed",
          "zh": "對於狀態該在哪裡管理、"
        },
        {
          "id": 128,
          "start": 412.87,
          "end": 415.76,
          "en": "and how it should be updated and shared.",
          "zh": "該如何更新和共享，有一些明確的規則。"
        },
        {
          "id": 129,
          "start": 415.76,
          "end": 418.61,
          "en": "And therefore it's also less error prone",
          "zh": "因此它也比較不容易出錯，"
        },
        {
          "id": 130,
          "start": 418.61,
          "end": 421.51,
          "en": "because we have that clearly defined data flow,",
          "zh": "因為我們有明確定義、"
        },
        {
          "id": 131,
          "start": 421.51,
          "end": 423.68,
          "en": "which we have to adhere.",
          "zh": "必須遵守的資料流。"
        },
        {
          "id": 132,
          "start": 423.68,
          "end": 425.92,
          "en": "So, that's the what and why.",
          "zh": "以上就是 Vuex 是什麼以及為什麼要用它。"
        },
        {
          "id": 133,
          "start": 425.92,
          "end": 429.963,
          "en": "Now let's install Vuex and let's get started using it.",
          "zh": "接下來，我們就來安裝 Vuex 並開始使用它。"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "21879698",
      "title": "Creating & Using a Store",
      "lectureOrder": 214,
      "videoOrder": 187,
      "sourceHash": "a7b1b9deaeeb4188d1614dfa08fe8bf7bc89f18ddb70aef33e35d4550f24d886",
      "cues": [
        {
          "id": 1,
          "start": 2.12,
          "end": 3.76,
          "en": "Now for this module.",
          "zh": "在這個模組中，"
        },
        {
          "id": 2,
          "start": 3.76,
          "end": 7.52,
          "en": "As many times before you find a starting project attached,",
          "zh": "和之前很多次一樣，附件中有一個起始專案，"
        },
        {
          "id": 3,
          "start": 7.52,
          "end": 9.28,
          "en": "which you can download, extract,",
          "zh": "你可以下載、解壓縮，"
        },
        {
          "id": 4,
          "start": 9.28,
          "end": 10.8,
          "en": "run npm install,",
          "zh": "執行 npm install，"
        },
        {
          "id": 5,
          "start": 10.8,
          "end": 14.43,
          "en": "and they're all after you can run npm run serve though,",
          "zh": "之後就可以執行 npm run serve。不過，"
        },
        {
          "id": 6,
          "start": 14.43,
          "end": 17.31,
          "en": "before you run npm run serve,",
          "zh": "在執行 npm run serve 之前，"
        },
        {
          "id": 7,
          "start": 17.31,
          "end": 20.59,
          "en": "let's already installed the vuex",
          "zh": "我們先安裝 Vuex，"
        },
        {
          "id": 8,
          "start": 20.59,
          "end": 24.973,
          "en": "and you can do it as with npm install dash dash save vuex.",
          "zh": "可以用 npm install --save vuex 來安裝。"
        },
        {
          "id": 9,
          "start": 26.13,
          "end": 29.99,
          "en": "This now installs the vuex package into the project.",
          "zh": "這會把 vuex 套件安裝到專案中，"
        },
        {
          "id": 10,
          "start": 29.99,
          "end": 34.28,
          "en": "Just like we installed the router earlier in this course.",
          "zh": "就像我們在課程稍早安裝 router 一樣。"
        },
        {
          "id": 11,
          "start": 34.28,
          "end": 36.91,
          "en": "And now we can get started using vuex.",
          "zh": "現在就可以開始使用 Vuex 了。"
        },
        {
          "id": 12,
          "start": 36.91,
          "end": 39.5,
          "en": "And for that I got a very simple application here.",
          "zh": "為此，我這裡準備了一個非常簡單的應用程式。"
        },
        {
          "id": 13,
          "start": 39.5,
          "end": 44.18,
          "en": "Definitely not an application where we would need vuex,",
          "zh": "它絕對不是需要用到 Vuex 的應用程式，"
        },
        {
          "id": 14,
          "start": 44.18,
          "end": 47.89,
          "en": "but a great application to understand the core concepts",
          "zh": "但很適合用來理解"
        },
        {
          "id": 15,
          "start": 47.89,
          "end": 49.483,
          "en": "of vuex introduces.",
          "zh": "Vuex 引入的核心概念。"
        },
        {
          "id": 16,
          "start": 50.81,
          "end": 54.67,
          "en": "So let's start the development server with npm run serve,",
          "zh": "我們先用 npm run serve 啟動開發伺服器，"
        },
        {
          "id": 17,
          "start": 54.67,
          "end": 56.67,
          "en": "and let's see what we got on the screen.",
          "zh": "看看畫面上有什麼。"
        },
        {
          "id": 18,
          "start": 58.03,
          "end": 60.8,
          "en": "We got this simple container here.",
          "zh": "這裡有一個簡單的容器，"
        },
        {
          "id": 19,
          "start": 60.8,
          "end": 63.34,
          "en": "We're at just say Vuex,",
          "zh": "上面只寫著 Vuex。"
        },
        {
          "id": 20,
          "start": 63.34,
          "end": 66,
          "en": "now to get started with vuex,",
          "zh": "要開始使用 Vuex，"
        },
        {
          "id": 21,
          "start": 66,
          "end": 69.31,
          "en": "let's say here inside of this base container",
          "zh": "假設在 App.vue 範本中的"
        },
        {
          "id": 22,
          "start": 69.31,
          "end": 71.81,
          "en": "in the app view template here,",
          "zh": "這個 base-container 裡，"
        },
        {
          "id": 23,
          "start": 71.81,
          "end": 73.55,
          "en": "I want to have a button",
          "zh": "我想放一個按鈕，"
        },
        {
          "id": 24,
          "start": 75.89,
          "end": 79.27,
          "en": "where I say Add one",
          "zh": "上面寫著 Add 1，"
        },
        {
          "id": 25,
          "start": 79.27,
          "end": 81.11,
          "en": "and above the button.",
          "zh": "而在按鈕上方，"
        },
        {
          "id": 26,
          "start": 81.11,
          "end": 84.28,
          "en": "I actually want to have a counter.",
          "zh": "我想放一個計數器。"
        },
        {
          "id": 27,
          "start": 84.28,
          "end": 88.4,
          "en": "Let's say <h3> tag where I output to current value",
          "zh": "假設用一個 h3 標籤輸出目前的值，"
        },
        {
          "id": 28,
          "start": 88.4,
          "end": 91.09,
          "en": "is starting at zero and then incremented by one,",
          "zh": "從零開始，每次按下按鈕"
        },
        {
          "id": 29,
          "start": 91.09,
          "end": 92.74000000000001,
          "en": "every time the button is pressed.",
          "zh": "就加一。"
        },
        {
          "id": 30,
          "start": 93.66,
          "end": 96.97,
          "en": "Now we could of course implement this behavior",
          "zh": "當然，我們可以只用 data、methods"
        },
        {
          "id": 31,
          "start": 96.97,
          "end": 100.53999999999999,
          "en": "just with data and methods and what you learned.",
          "zh": "以及你已經學過的東西實作這個行為。"
        },
        {
          "id": 32,
          "start": 100.53999999999999,
          "end": 102.32,
          "en": "And for a simple app like this,",
          "zh": "對於這麼簡單的應用程式，"
        },
        {
          "id": 33,
          "start": 102.32,
          "end": 104.9,
          "en": "we normally would do that,",
          "zh": "通常確實會這麼做，"
        },
        {
          "id": 34,
          "start": 104.9,
          "end": 106.509,
          "en": "but this module is about vuex",
          "zh": "但這個模組的重點是 Vuex，"
        },
        {
          "id": 35,
          "start": 106.509,
          "end": 108.67,
          "en": "and understanding vuex.",
          "zh": "是要理解 Vuex，"
        },
        {
          "id": 36,
          "start": 108.67,
          "end": 111.7,
          "en": "So let's not do it with these tools.",
          "zh": "所以這次不用這些工具，"
        },
        {
          "id": 37,
          "start": 111.7,
          "end": 116.17,
          "en": "Instead, let's manage this counter state with vuex",
          "zh": "而是用 Vuex 管理這個計數器狀態，"
        },
        {
          "id": 38,
          "start": 116.17,
          "end": 119.15,
          "en": "as if it would be some global state,",
          "zh": "就當作它是某個全域狀態，"
        },
        {
          "id": 39,
          "start": 119.15,
          "end": 122.61,
          "en": "which we need in other parts of the app as well.",
          "zh": "應用程式的其他地方也需要用到。"
        },
        {
          "id": 40,
          "start": 122.61,
          "end": 123.54,
          "en": "And for that,",
          "zh": "為此，"
        },
        {
          "id": 41,
          "start": 123.54,
          "end": 128.54,
          "en": "we started main.js And we start by creating a vuex store,",
          "zh": "我們從 main.js 開始，先建立一個 Vuex store，"
        },
        {
          "id": 42,
          "start": 128.89,
          "end": 131.75,
          "en": "which stores our application state.",
          "zh": "用來存放應用程式的狀態。"
        },
        {
          "id": 43,
          "start": 131.75,
          "end": 134.46,
          "en": "And there is one store per app.",
          "zh": "每個應用程式只有一個 store。"
        },
        {
          "id": 44,
          "start": 134.46,
          "end": 138.49,
          "en": "So we create the store by importing, from vuex.",
          "zh": "建立 store 的方式是從 vuex 匯入，"
        },
        {
          "id": 45,
          "start": 138.49,
          "end": 143.05,
          "en": "And what we import is to createStore function.",
          "zh": "而要匯入的是 createStore 函式。"
        },
        {
          "id": 46,
          "start": 143.05,
          "end": 145.069,
          "en": "And you might see a pattern here,",
          "zh": "你可能已經看出一個規律："
        },
        {
          "id": 47,
          "start": 145.069,
          "end": 146.938,
          "en": "createApp for domain vue app,",
          "zh": "主要的 Vue 應用程式用 createApp，"
        },
        {
          "id": 48,
          "start": 146.938,
          "end": 148.749,
          "en": "createRouter for the router,",
          "zh": "router 用 createRouter，"
        },
        {
          "id": 49,
          "start": 148.749,
          "end": 150.453,
          "en": "createStore for the store.",
          "zh": "store 則用 createStore。"
        },
        {
          "id": 50,
          "start": 152.09,
          "end": 155.387,
          "en": "Then we can store the store in a constant named store.",
          "zh": "接著可以把 store 存放在一個名為 store 的常數中。"
        },
        {
          "id": 51,
          "start": 155.387,
          "end": 156.22,
          "en": "(chuckles)",
          "zh": "（笑）"
        },
        {
          "id": 52,
          "start": 156.22,
          "end": 158,
          "en": "And these are a lot of stores,",
          "zh": "這裡有好多個 store，"
        },
        {
          "id": 53,
          "start": 158,
          "end": 160.38,
          "en": "I guess, or storage's",
          "zh": "或者說好多個「儲存」。"
        },
        {
          "id": 54,
          "start": 160.38,
          "end": 163.737,
          "en": "and we can do so by calling createStore().",
          "zh": "我們可以呼叫 createStore() 來建立它。"
        },
        {
          "id": 55,
          "start": 165.01,
          "end": 167.46,
          "en": "Now it createStore() takes an object",
          "zh": "createStore() 接收一個物件，"
        },
        {
          "id": 56,
          "start": 167.46,
          "end": 169.82999999999998,
          "en": "where we configured a store",
          "zh": "用來設定 store。"
        },
        {
          "id": 57,
          "start": 169.82999999999998,
          "end": 171.47,
          "en": "and the most important thing",
          "zh": "而 store 中最重要、"
        },
        {
          "id": 58,
          "start": 172.599,
          "end": 176.553,
          "en": "with which we start in our store is the state,",
          "zh": "也是我們最先要設定的，就是 state。"
        },
        {
          "id": 59,
          "start": 177.88,
          "end": 179.95,
          "en": "state() is a method",
          "zh": "state() 是一個方法，"
        },
        {
          "id": 60,
          "start": 181.44,
          "end": 185.1,
          "en": "and it then should return your state object.",
          "zh": "它應該回傳你的狀態物件，"
        },
        {
          "id": 61,
          "start": 185.1,
          "end": 187.393,
          "en": "So it's a bit like data in a component.",
          "zh": "有點像元件中的 data。"
        },
        {
          "id": 62,
          "start": 188.35,
          "end": 191.73,
          "en": "Now this is the state of your application.",
          "zh": "這就是應用程式的狀態，"
        },
        {
          "id": 63,
          "start": 191.73,
          "end": 195.1,
          "en": "So this object will hold the application-wide data",
          "zh": "所以這個物件會存放整個應用程式範圍的資料，"
        },
        {
          "id": 64,
          "start": 195.1,
          "end": 198.39,
          "en": "and you only have one store for the entire application.",
          "zh": "而整個應用程式只會有一個 store。"
        },
        {
          "id": 65,
          "start": 198.39,
          "end": 201.07,
          "en": "You might have multiple states though,",
          "zh": "不過你可能會有多個狀態，"
        },
        {
          "id": 66,
          "start": 201.07,
          "end": 202.67000000000002,
          "en": "but I'll come back to that later",
          "zh": "這點我稍後再回來談。"
        },
        {
          "id": 67,
          "start": 204.14,
          "end": 206.95,
          "en": "now to get started with our counter here,",
          "zh": "現在要開始處理計數器，"
        },
        {
          "id": 68,
          "start": 206.95,
          "end": 211.23,
          "en": "we could have a counter here in our state object",
          "zh": "可以在這個 state 物件中加入一個 counter，"
        },
        {
          "id": 69,
          "start": 211.23,
          "end": 214.023,
          "en": "and initialize it to a value of zero.",
          "zh": "並把它初始化為零。"
        },
        {
          "id": 70,
          "start": 215.37,
          "end": 219.41,
          "en": "Now we need to connect our app to the store,",
          "zh": "接著必須把應用程式連接到 store，"
        },
        {
          "id": 71,
          "start": 219.41,
          "end": 224.05,
          "en": "which we do by calling app.use and passing the store to it",
          "zh": "做法是呼叫 app.use 並把 store 傳進去，"
        },
        {
          "id": 72,
          "start": 224.05,
          "end": 227.28300000000002,
          "en": "just as we used the router in the routing module.",
          "zh": "就像在路由模組中使用 router 一樣。"
        },
        {
          "id": 73,
          "start": 228.63,
          "end": 232.6,
          "en": "And now we can use that state in our component,",
          "zh": "現在就能在元件中使用這個狀態，"
        },
        {
          "id": 74,
          "start": 232.6,
          "end": 236.29,
          "en": "in any component of this entire app,",
          "zh": "在整個應用程式的任何元件中都可以，"
        },
        {
          "id": 75,
          "start": 236.29,
          "end": 239.97,
          "en": "we don't need to add inject here or anything like that.",
          "zh": "不需要在這裡加上 inject 之類的東西，"
        },
        {
          "id": 76,
          "start": 239.97,
          "end": 242.73,
          "en": "We can just use this state",
          "zh": "直接使用這個狀態就好。"
        },
        {
          "id": 77,
          "start": 242.73,
          "end": 244.82,
          "en": "and how do we do that?",
          "zh": "那要怎麼使用呢？"
        },
        {
          "id": 78,
          "start": 244.82,
          "end": 247.03,
          "en": "Well, there now is a new property,",
          "zh": "現在每個元件中"
        },
        {
          "id": 79,
          "start": 247.03,
          "end": 249.22,
          "en": "which we can access in every component.",
          "zh": "都可以存取一個新的屬性，"
        },
        {
          "id": 80,
          "start": 249.22,
          "end": 252.21,
          "en": "And that's the dollar sign store property,",
          "zh": "那就是 $store 屬性，"
        },
        {
          "id": 81,
          "start": 252.21,
          "end": 255.26,
          "en": "which points at the vuex store.",
          "zh": "它指向 Vuex store。"
        },
        {
          "id": 82,
          "start": 255.26,
          "end": 257.92,
          "en": "This then has a state property,",
          "zh": "它有一個 state 屬性，"
        },
        {
          "id": 83,
          "start": 257.92,
          "end": 261,
          "en": "which points at the state managed by the store.",
          "zh": "指向由 store 管理的狀態，"
        },
        {
          "id": 84,
          "start": 261,
          "end": 262.64,
          "en": "And that state of course,",
          "zh": "而這個狀態當然"
        },
        {
          "id": 85,
          "start": 262.64,
          "end": 264.77,
          "en": "is this state object.",
          "zh": "就是這個 state 物件。"
        },
        {
          "id": 86,
          "start": 264.77,
          "end": 267.62,
          "en": "Therefore, we now have a counter property in there",
          "zh": "因此，現在可以透過其中的 counter 屬性"
        },
        {
          "id": 87,
          "start": 267.62,
          "end": 269.313,
          "en": "to access our counter.",
          "zh": "存取我們的計數器。"
        },
        {
          "id": 88,
          "start": 270.73,
          "end": 272.74,
          "en": "And if I do that and save this,",
          "zh": "這樣寫並儲存之後，"
        },
        {
          "id": 89,
          "start": 272.74,
          "end": 274.593,
          "en": "we see zero here.",
          "zh": "這裡就會顯示 0。"
        },
        {
          "id": 90,
          "start": 275.58,
          "end": 276.47,
          "en": "Now clicking the button.",
          "zh": "現在點擊按鈕，"
        },
        {
          "id": 91,
          "start": 276.47,
          "end": 278.15999999999997,
          "en": "Of course doesn't do anything yet",
          "zh": "當然還不會有任何反應，"
        },
        {
          "id": 92,
          "start": 278.15999999999997,
          "end": 280.18,
          "en": "because we haven't wired this up.",
          "zh": "因為我們還沒有把它接起來。"
        },
        {
          "id": 93,
          "start": 280.18,
          "end": 281.423,
          "en": "Let's do this next.",
          "zh": "接下來就來處理這部分。"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "21879706",
      "title": "Connecting Components to State",
      "lectureOrder": 215,
      "videoOrder": 188,
      "sourceHash": "4de953a8c4e76c67d6e399eb1636383c7e62c21e835672922f6a3f6f316d7fb7",
      "cues": [
        {
          "id": 1,
          "start": 2.331,
          "end": 3.8,
          "en": "[Maximilian Schwarzmüller]To wire up the button,",
          "zh": "為了把按鈕接起來，"
        },
        {
          "id": 2,
          "start": 3.8,
          "end": 6.103,
          "en": "we can add a method here.",
          "zh": "我們可以在這裡新增一個方法，"
        },
        {
          "id": 3,
          "start": 7.13,
          "end": 9.63,
          "en": "Add one could be the method name.",
          "zh": "方法名稱可以是 addOne。"
        },
        {
          "id": 4,
          "start": 9.63,
          "end": 11.48,
          "en": "And it's the method I want to trigger",
          "zh": "這就是我想在"
        },
        {
          "id": 5,
          "start": 11.48,
          "end": 13.65,
          "en": "upon click on this button,",
          "zh": "點擊這個按鈕時觸發的方法，"
        },
        {
          "id": 6,
          "start": 13.65,
          "end": 16.32,
          "en": "just as we learned it before in this course.",
          "zh": "就像我們在課程中之前學過的那樣。"
        },
        {
          "id": 7,
          "start": 16.32,
          "end": 19.393,
          "en": "Now in here we can access this stores and store,",
          "zh": "在這個方法中，可以存取 this.$store，"
        },
        {
          "id": 8,
          "start": 20.84,
          "end": 23.15,
          "en": "access the state and there to counter",
          "zh": "存取 state，再存取其中的 counter，"
        },
        {
          "id": 9,
          "start": 23.15,
          "end": 24.763,
          "en": "and increment it like this.",
          "zh": "然後像這樣讓它加一。"
        },
        {
          "id": 10,
          "start": 25.96,
          "end": 28.56,
          "en": "We can, by the way, also outsource this here",
          "zh": "順帶一提，如果想要，"
        },
        {
          "id": 11,
          "start": 28.56,
          "end": 31.53,
          "en": "into a computed property, If we want to.",
          "zh": "也可以把這部分抽到計算屬性中。"
        },
        {
          "id": 12,
          "start": 31.53,
          "end": 33.63,
          "en": "We can add a computed property name it",
          "zh": "新增一個計算屬性，命名為"
        },
        {
          "id": 13,
          "start": 33.63,
          "end": 35.98,
          "en": "counter or whatever you want,",
          "zh": "counter 或任何你想要的名稱，"
        },
        {
          "id": 14,
          "start": 35.98,
          "end": 39.73,
          "en": "doesn't have to be counter and in their return",
          "zh": "不一定要叫 counter，然後在裡面回傳"
        },
        {
          "id": 15,
          "start": 39.73,
          "end": 42.233,
          "en": "this dollar sign store state counter.",
          "zh": "this.$store.state.counter。"
        },
        {
          "id": 16,
          "start": 43.76,
          "end": 47.12,
          "en": "And now we can use this counter here.",
          "zh": "接著就可以在這裡使用這個 counter。"
        },
        {
          "id": 17,
          "start": 47.12,
          "end": 48.58,
          "en": "Save everything.",
          "zh": "儲存所有檔案。"
        },
        {
          "id": 18,
          "start": 48.58,
          "end": 50.033,
          "en": "If we now go back,",
          "zh": "現在回到頁面，"
        },
        {
          "id": 19,
          "start": 51.22,
          "end": 52.58,
          "en": "we can click Add one,",
          "zh": "點擊 Add 1，"
        },
        {
          "id": 20,
          "start": 52.58,
          "end": 56.97,
          "en": "and this now updates with help of Vuex.",
          "zh": "數字就會藉助 Vuex 更新。"
        },
        {
          "id": 21,
          "start": 56.97,
          "end": 60.15,
          "en": "Now Vuex has way more to offer than just that.",
          "zh": "Vuex 能做的遠不只這些，"
        },
        {
          "id": 22,
          "start": 60.15,
          "end": 63.05,
          "en": "But this already shows us how it works",
          "zh": "但這已經簡單地展示了它的運作方式，"
        },
        {
          "id": 23,
          "start": 63.05,
          "end": 67.75,
          "en": "in a nutshell how you work with Vuex state in a nutshell.",
          "zh": "也就是使用 Vuex 狀態的基本方式。"
        },
        {
          "id": 24,
          "start": 67.75,
          "end": 69.09,
          "en": "And the great thing is",
          "zh": "而最棒的是，"
        },
        {
          "id": 25,
          "start": 69.09,
          "end": 71.76,
          "en": "that you now can really add any component you want,",
          "zh": "你現在可以加入任何想要的元件，"
        },
        {
          "id": 26,
          "start": 71.76,
          "end": 74.53,
          "en": "like the counter.Vue.",
          "zh": "例如 Counter.vue，"
        },
        {
          "id": 27,
          "start": 74.53,
          "end": 77.31,
          "en": "And in there, we can",
          "zh": "然後在裡面"
        },
        {
          "id": 28,
          "start": 77.31,
          "end": 79.913,
          "en": "add this h free tag.",
          "zh": "加入這個 h3 標籤。"
        },
        {
          "id": 29,
          "start": 80.82,
          "end": 83.5,
          "en": "So let's add it in the template of the counter.",
          "zh": "我們把它加到 Counter 的範本中，"
        },
        {
          "id": 30,
          "start": 83.5,
          "end": 87.65,
          "en": "And in there, I then add this computed property.",
          "zh": "再在裡面加入這個計算屬性。"
        },
        {
          "id": 31,
          "start": 87.65,
          "end": 91.41,
          "en": "So this computed property dot calculates the counter",
          "zh": "也就是把這個計算 counter 的計算屬性"
        },
        {
          "id": 32,
          "start": 91.41,
          "end": 94.963,
          "en": "counted from app Vue and added in the counter Vue.",
          "zh": "從 App.vue 中剪下，加到 Counter.vue 中。"
        },
        {
          "id": 33,
          "start": 96.50999999999999,
          "end": 101.363,
          "en": "And if we now register the counter here in app Vue,",
          "zh": "如果現在像這樣在 App.vue 中"
        },
        {
          "id": 34,
          "start": 108.72,
          "end": 111.85,
          "en": "like this, and like this,",
          "zh": "註冊 Counter，"
        },
        {
          "id": 35,
          "start": 111.85,
          "end": 114.2,
          "en": "we can add it here above the button",
          "zh": "就可以把它放在按鈕上方，"
        },
        {
          "id": 36,
          "start": 115.39,
          "end": 116.393,
          "en": "just like that.",
          "zh": "像這樣。"
        },
        {
          "id": 37,
          "start": 117.89,
          "end": 119.53,
          "en": "Save everything",
          "zh": "儲存所有檔案，"
        },
        {
          "id": 38,
          "start": 119.53,
          "end": 122.01,
          "en": "and it will still work as before, if I reload.",
          "zh": "重新載入後，一切仍然和之前一樣正常運作。"
        },
        {
          "id": 39,
          "start": 122.01,
          "end": 123.35,
          "en": "This still works,",
          "zh": "之所以仍然可行，"
        },
        {
          "id": 40,
          "start": 123.35,
          "end": 127.14,
          "en": "because it's really a global store a global state",
          "zh": "是因為這真的是全域的 store、全域的狀態，"
        },
        {
          "id": 41,
          "start": 127.14,
          "end": 131.05,
          "en": "that can be accessed from any component",
          "zh": "任何元件都能存取，"
        },
        {
          "id": 42,
          "start": 131.05,
          "end": 134.223,
          "en": "without injection without passing props around.",
          "zh": "不需要注入，也不需要到處傳遞 props。"
        },
        {
          "id": 43,
          "start": 135.11,
          "end": 138.03,
          "en": "Now, this doesn't replace props in general,",
          "zh": "不過，這並不會全面取代 props。"
        },
        {
          "id": 44,
          "start": 138.03,
          "end": 141.27,
          "en": "to a direct child, you typically want to pass props",
          "zh": "如果父元件擁有資料，要傳給直接子元件時，"
        },
        {
          "id": 45,
          "start": 141.27,
          "end": 144.24,
          "en": "if you would parent component, half the data.",
          "zh": "通常還是會使用 props。"
        },
        {
          "id": 46,
          "start": 144.24,
          "end": 146.41,
          "en": "But for application wide state,",
          "zh": "但對於整個應用程式範圍的狀態，"
        },
        {
          "id": 47,
          "start": 146.41,
          "end": 149.42000000000002,
          "en": "like here for our counter Vuex is great",
          "zh": "例如這裡的計數器，Vuex 就非常好用，"
        },
        {
          "id": 48,
          "start": 149.42000000000002,
          "end": 151.62,
          "en": "because without any extra setup,",
          "zh": "因為不需要任何額外設定，"
        },
        {
          "id": 49,
          "start": 151.62,
          "end": 154.28300000000002,
          "en": "we can tap into the state and use it.",
          "zh": "就能直接取用並使用這個狀態。"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "21879712",
      "title": "Introducing Mutations - A Better Way of Changing Data",
      "lectureOrder": 216,
      "videoOrder": 189,
      "sourceHash": "8b1b9a66e1461b3d1e03080d19ce93ce3a34e482a63dcb6bd3c41b201f86497e",
      "cues": [
        {
          "id": 1,
          "start": 2.32,
          "end": 4.21,
          "en": "Remember this slide?",
          "zh": "還記得這張投影片嗎？"
        },
        {
          "id": 2,
          "start": 4.21,
          "end": 8.33,
          "en": "There I mentioned this predictable state management,",
          "zh": "我在那裡提到了可預測的狀態管理，"
        },
        {
          "id": 3,
          "start": 8.33,
          "end": 12.14,
          "en": "this predictable flow, the clearly defined data flow,",
          "zh": "也就是可預測的流程、明確定義的資料流，"
        },
        {
          "id": 4,
          "start": 12.14,
          "end": 16.22,
          "en": "which makes sure that we have to use a certain approach",
          "zh": "確保我們必須用特定的方式"
        },
        {
          "id": 5,
          "start": 16.22,
          "end": 17.64,
          "en": "of updating our data",
          "zh": "更新資料"
        },
        {
          "id": 6,
          "start": 17.64,
          "end": 19.36,
          "en": "and of getting our data",
          "zh": "以及取得資料，"
        },
        {
          "id": 7,
          "start": 19.36,
          "end": 22.57,
          "en": "and this would be less error prone.",
          "zh": "這樣就比較不容易出錯。"
        },
        {
          "id": 8,
          "start": 22.57,
          "end": 26.356,
          "en": "Well, actually, the way we're using Vuex at the moment works",
          "zh": "其實，我們目前使用 Vuex 的方式雖然可行，"
        },
        {
          "id": 9,
          "start": 26.356,
          "end": 30.183,
          "en": "but it's not fully following the Vuex philosophy.",
          "zh": "但並沒有完全遵循 Vuex 的理念。"
        },
        {
          "id": 10,
          "start": 31.04,
          "end": 34,
          "en": "We're directly tapping into our store.state",
          "zh": "我們直接存取 store.state，"
        },
        {
          "id": 11,
          "start": 34,
          "end": 37.05,
          "en": "to change something from inside a component",
          "zh": "從元件內部修改某些東西。"
        },
        {
          "id": 12,
          "start": 37.05,
          "end": 40.02,
          "en": "and whilst this works technically here,",
          "zh": "雖然技術上這樣可行，"
        },
        {
          "id": 13,
          "start": 40.02,
          "end": 41.285,
          "en": "this is not ideal.",
          "zh": "但並不理想。"
        },
        {
          "id": 14,
          "start": 41.285,
          "end": 44.82,
          "en": "We can change the state from anywhere in the application",
          "zh": "我們可以在應用程式中的任何地方修改狀態，"
        },
        {
          "id": 15,
          "start": 44.82,
          "end": 46.95,
          "en": "and it's up to us if we add one",
          "zh": "至於是加一，"
        },
        {
          "id": 16,
          "start": 46.95,
          "end": 51.95,
          "en": "or if we set it equal to state.counter + 10",
          "zh": "還是設成 state.counter + 10，"
        },
        {
          "id": 17,
          "start": 52.06,
          "end": 55.29,
          "en": "or we have a typo and accidentally type one twice",
          "zh": "或是打錯字、不小心打了兩個 1，"
        },
        {
          "id": 18,
          "start": 55.29,
          "end": 58.383,
          "en": "and hence add 11 every time we increment this.",
          "zh": "結果每次遞增都加了 11，全都由我們自己決定。"
        },
        {
          "id": 19,
          "start": 59.3,
          "end": 61.72,
          "en": "So what I wanna say is that here,",
          "zh": "我想說的是，"
        },
        {
          "id": 20,
          "start": 61.72,
          "end": 64.87,
          "en": "we still can introduce errors",
          "zh": "在這裡我們仍然可能引入錯誤，"
        },
        {
          "id": 21,
          "start": 64.87,
          "end": 66.32,
          "en": "because we're not having",
          "zh": "因為我們沒有"
        },
        {
          "id": 22,
          "start": 66.32,
          "end": 69.16,
          "en": "a clearly defined state-changing mechanism.",
          "zh": "一個明確定義的狀態變更機制，"
        },
        {
          "id": 23,
          "start": 69.16,
          "end": 71.333,
          "en": "We can change the state from anywhere.",
          "zh": "任何地方都可以修改狀態。"
        },
        {
          "id": 24,
          "start": 72.47,
          "end": 75.72,
          "en": "That is why we should use Vuex a bit differently.",
          "zh": "這就是為什麼應該換個方式使用 Vuex。"
        },
        {
          "id": 25,
          "start": 75.72,
          "end": 78.83,
          "en": "We have this app-wide, central Data Store,",
          "zh": "我們有這個整個應用程式範圍的中央資料存放區，"
        },
        {
          "id": 26,
          "start": 78.83,
          "end": 80.36,
          "en": "this State Store,",
          "zh": "也就是狀態存放區，"
        },
        {
          "id": 27,
          "start": 80.36,
          "end": 82.12,
          "en": "and we communicate with it",
          "zh": "並從元件內部"
        },
        {
          "id": 28,
          "start": 82.12,
          "end": 83.85300000000001,
          "en": "from inside our components.",
          "zh": "與它溝通。"
        },
        {
          "id": 29,
          "start": 84.72,
          "end": 87.23,
          "en": "Now, I have a dashed arrow here",
          "zh": "這裡我畫的是虛線箭頭，"
        },
        {
          "id": 30,
          "start": 87.23,
          "end": 90.13,
          "en": "because yes, we want to communicate",
          "zh": "因為我們確實要和它溝通，"
        },
        {
          "id": 31,
          "start": 90.13,
          "end": 91.81,
          "en": "but not directly.",
          "zh": "但不是直接溝通。"
        },
        {
          "id": 32,
          "start": 91.81,
          "end": 94.35,
          "en": "What we're doing at the moment is not ideal.",
          "zh": "我們目前的做法並不理想。"
        },
        {
          "id": 33,
          "start": 94.35,
          "end": 98.663,
          "en": "Instead, Vuex has a built-in concept called mutations.",
          "zh": "Vuex 有一個內建的概念，叫做 mutations。"
        },
        {
          "id": 34,
          "start": 99.63,
          "end": 103.03,
          "en": "Mutations are clearly defined methods,",
          "zh": "mutations 是明確定義的方法，"
        },
        {
          "id": 35,
          "start": 103.03,
          "end": 106.38,
          "en": "which have the logic to update the state.",
          "zh": "內含更新狀態的邏輯。"
        },
        {
          "id": 36,
          "start": 106.38,
          "end": 108.44,
          "en": "And from inside our components,",
          "zh": "而在元件內部，"
        },
        {
          "id": 37,
          "start": 108.44,
          "end": 112.03999999999999,
          "en": "we should, in the end, just trigger those mutations",
          "zh": "我們最終只應該觸發這些 mutations，"
        },
        {
          "id": 38,
          "start": 112.03999999999999,
          "end": 114.37299999999999,
          "en": "instead of directly manipulating the state.",
          "zh": "而不是直接操作狀態。"
        },
        {
          "id": 39,
          "start": 115.43,
          "end": 117.42,
          "en": "By triggering mutations,",
          "zh": "透過觸發 mutations，"
        },
        {
          "id": 40,
          "start": 117.42,
          "end": 121.2,
          "en": "all components that want to edit a state do it",
          "zh": "所有想修改狀態的元件都會用"
        },
        {
          "id": 41,
          "start": 121.2,
          "end": 122.66,
          "en": "in the same way.",
          "zh": "相同的方式修改，"
        },
        {
          "id": 42,
          "start": 122.66,
          "end": 125.523,
          "en": "And it's guaranteed that they do it in the same way.",
          "zh": "而且保證它們用的是相同的方式。"
        },
        {
          "id": 43,
          "start": 126.49,
          "end": 128.35,
          "en": "And to give you an example,",
          "zh": "為了舉例說明，"
        },
        {
          "id": 44,
          "start": 128.35,
          "end": 131.243,
          "en": "I will actually add another component here.",
          "zh": "我要在這裡再新增一個元件，"
        },
        {
          "id": 45,
          "start": 132.285,
          "end": 134.3,
          "en": "ChangeCounter.vue.",
          "zh": "ChangeCounter.vue。"
        },
        {
          "id": 46,
          "start": 134.3,
          "end": 136.02,
          "en": "And this will be a very simple component,",
          "zh": "這會是個非常簡單的元件，"
        },
        {
          "id": 47,
          "start": 136.02,
          "end": 137.84,
          "en": "which also just has a button",
          "zh": "同樣只有一個按鈕，"
        },
        {
          "id": 48,
          "start": 139.37,
          "end": 141.6,
          "en": "where I also say Add 1",
          "zh": "上面同樣寫著 Add 1，"
        },
        {
          "id": 49,
          "start": 141.6,
          "end": 143.02,
          "en": "and where we're gonna click,",
          "zh": "點擊時，"
        },
        {
          "id": 50,
          "start": 143.02,
          "end": 145.23,
          "en": "I want a trigger addOne.",
          "zh": "我想觸發 addOne。"
        },
        {
          "id": 51,
          "start": 145.23,
          "end": 147.57,
          "en": "And then I have my script in here.",
          "zh": "然後在這裡加入 script，"
        },
        {
          "id": 52,
          "start": 147.57,
          "end": 149.61,
          "en": "And in there, my methods",
          "zh": "在其中的 methods 裡"
        },
        {
          "id": 53,
          "start": 149.61,
          "end": 153.12,
          "en": "where I have the addOne method.",
          "zh": "加入 addOne 方法。"
        },
        {
          "id": 54,
          "start": 153.12,
          "end": 156.35,
          "en": "And every component is able to use Vuex as you learned it.",
          "zh": "如你所學，每個元件都能使用 Vuex，"
        },
        {
          "id": 55,
          "start": 156.35,
          "end": 159.18,
          "en": "So here I can access store.state.counter",
          "zh": "所以這裡可以存取 $store.state.counter，"
        },
        {
          "id": 56,
          "start": 159.18,
          "end": 160.623,
          "en": "and increment this by one.",
          "zh": "並讓它加一。"
        },
        {
          "id": 57,
          "start": 162.06,
          "end": 165.287,
          "en": "Now, in App.vue, we can import ChangeCounter",
          "zh": "接著在 App.vue 中匯入 ChangeCounter，"
        },
        {
          "id": 58,
          "start": 168.279,
          "end": 169.779,
          "en": "and register it as a component",
          "zh": "把它註冊為元件，"
        },
        {
          "id": 59,
          "start": 171.22,
          "end": 173.51,
          "en": "and use it in addition to the button,",
          "zh": "並在原本就有的按鈕之外"
        },
        {
          "id": 60,
          "start": 173.51,
          "end": 175.053,
          "en": "which we already have here.",
          "zh": "也使用它。"
        },
        {
          "id": 61,
          "start": 176.16,
          "end": 177.88,
          "en": "So I got two buttons now.",
          "zh": "所以現在有兩個按鈕，"
        },
        {
          "id": 62,
          "start": 177.88,
          "end": 179.37,
          "en": "One here in the app component",
          "zh": "一個在 App 元件中，"
        },
        {
          "id": 63,
          "start": 179.37,
          "end": 180.923,
          "en": "and one in change-counter.",
          "zh": "另一個在 change-counter 中。"
        },
        {
          "id": 64,
          "start": 181.95,
          "end": 184.94,
          "en": "Both should add one but here I'm adding 11",
          "zh": "兩個都應該加一，但這裡我加的是 11，"
        },
        {
          "id": 65,
          "start": 184.94,
          "end": 188.65,
          "en": "because I mistyped or I changed my logic",
          "zh": "因為我打錯了，或是我改了邏輯，"
        },
        {
          "id": 66,
          "start": 188.65,
          "end": 191.08,
          "en": "and forgot to rename the method",
          "zh": "卻忘了改方法名稱"
        },
        {
          "id": 67,
          "start": 191.08,
          "end": 192.62,
          "en": "and the text on the button.",
          "zh": "和按鈕上的文字。"
        },
        {
          "id": 68,
          "start": 192.62,
          "end": 193.66,
          "en": "Whatever.",
          "zh": "總之就是這樣。"
        },
        {
          "id": 69,
          "start": 193.66,
          "end": 195.46,
          "en": "But now we have two buttons.",
          "zh": "但現在有兩個按鈕，"
        },
        {
          "id": 70,
          "start": 195.46,
          "end": 198.88,
          "en": "One button adds 11 and one really adds one.",
          "zh": "一個加 11，另一個真的加 1。"
        },
        {
          "id": 71,
          "start": 198.88,
          "end": 200.57999999999998,
          "en": "Now, why am I doing this?",
          "zh": "我為什麼要這麼做呢？"
        },
        {
          "id": 72,
          "start": 200.57999999999998,
          "end": 203.84,
          "en": "I want to show you that now we have different places",
          "zh": "我想讓你看到，現在應用程式中"
        },
        {
          "id": 73,
          "start": 203.84,
          "end": 206.21,
          "en": "in the app where we update our state.",
          "zh": "有不同的地方在更新狀態。"
        },
        {
          "id": 74,
          "start": 206.21,
          "end": 208.8,
          "en": "And even if we wouldn't have that stupid mistake",
          "zh": "即使沒有犯下"
        },
        {
          "id": 75,
          "start": 208.8,
          "end": 210.48,
          "en": "of having 11 here,",
          "zh": "把這裡寫成 11 的愚蠢錯誤，"
        },
        {
          "id": 76,
          "start": 210.48,
          "end": 212.27,
          "en": "even if we would have one,",
          "zh": "即使這裡是 1，"
        },
        {
          "id": 77,
          "start": 212.27,
          "end": 215.78,
          "en": "if we ever decide that we want to add two,",
          "zh": "如果哪天決定改成加 2，"
        },
        {
          "id": 78,
          "start": 215.78,
          "end": 219.67000000000002,
          "en": "we have to change that in two components.",
          "zh": "就必須修改兩個元件，"
        },
        {
          "id": 79,
          "start": 219.67000000000002,
          "end": 222.438,
          "en": "We have to go to two components",
          "zh": "必須到兩個元件中，"
        },
        {
          "id": 80,
          "start": 222.438,
          "end": 225.06,
          "en": "and change our logic in two places",
          "zh": "在兩個地方修改邏輯。"
        },
        {
          "id": 81,
          "start": 226.09,
          "end": 227.56,
          "en": "and in bigger applications,",
          "zh": "在更大型的應用程式中，"
        },
        {
          "id": 82,
          "start": 227.56,
          "end": 229.4,
          "en": "we might have even more places",
          "zh": "甚至可能有更多地方"
        },
        {
          "id": 83,
          "start": 229.4,
          "end": 232.03,
          "en": "where we need to change the logic.",
          "zh": "需要修改邏輯。"
        },
        {
          "id": 84,
          "start": 232.03,
          "end": 233.99,
          "en": "Now, that's a lot of code duplication",
          "zh": "這會造成大量重複的程式碼，"
        },
        {
          "id": 85,
          "start": 233.99,
          "end": 237.253,
          "en": "and that's exactly why we have this mutations concept.",
          "zh": "而這正是 mutations 這個概念存在的原因。"
        },
        {
          "id": 86,
          "start": 238.16,
          "end": 241.36,
          "en": "Back in main.js where we create our store,",
          "zh": "回到建立 store 的 main.js，"
        },
        {
          "id": 87,
          "start": 241.36,
          "end": 243.36,
          "en": "we don't just have the state here,",
          "zh": "這裡不只有 state，"
        },
        {
          "id": 88,
          "start": 243.36,
          "end": 246.18,
          "en": "we also have mutations.",
          "zh": "還有 mutations。"
        },
        {
          "id": 89,
          "start": 246.18,
          "end": 248.196,
          "en": "Mutations takes an object",
          "zh": "mutations 接收一個物件，"
        },
        {
          "id": 90,
          "start": 248.196,
          "end": 252.01,
          "en": "and in this object, you can define methods.",
          "zh": "在這個物件中可以定義方法，"
        },
        {
          "id": 91,
          "start": 252.01,
          "end": 255.77,
          "en": "For example, I addOne method or increment.",
          "zh": "例如 addOne 方法，或叫 increment，"
        },
        {
          "id": 92,
          "start": 255.77,
          "end": 257.14300000000003,
          "en": "Whatever you wanna call it.",
          "zh": "隨你命名。"
        },
        {
          "id": 93,
          "start": 258.06,
          "end": 260.92,
          "en": "And this method should contain the logic",
          "zh": "這個方法應該包含"
        },
        {
          "id": 94,
          "start": 260.92,
          "end": 262.493,
          "en": "to change this state.",
          "zh": "修改這個狀態的邏輯。"
        },
        {
          "id": 95,
          "start": 263.55,
          "end": 266.61,
          "en": "Now, this method will automatically get the current state",
          "zh": "這個方法會自動收到目前的狀態"
        },
        {
          "id": 96,
          "start": 266.61,
          "end": 268.41,
          "en": "as a argument.",
          "zh": "作為引數，"
        },
        {
          "id": 97,
          "start": 268.41,
          "end": 270.72,
          "en": "This is guaranteed by Vuex.",
          "zh": "這是由 Vuex 保證的。"
        },
        {
          "id": 98,
          "start": 270.72,
          "end": 272.49,
          "en": "Vuex will give us the current state",
          "zh": "每當這個方法被觸發時，"
        },
        {
          "id": 99,
          "start": 272.49,
          "end": 274.34000000000003,
          "en": "whenever this method is triggered",
          "zh": "Vuex 都會給我們目前的狀態，"
        },
        {
          "id": 100,
          "start": 274.34000000000003,
          "end": 276.98,
          "en": "and I will show you how to trigger such a method",
          "zh": "我等一下就會示範"
        },
        {
          "id": 101,
          "start": 276.98,
          "end": 277.823,
          "en": "in a second.",
          "zh": "如何觸發這樣的方法。"
        },
        {
          "id": 102,
          "start": 278.76,
          "end": 280.87,
          "en": "And since we get the current state here,",
          "zh": "既然這裡會收到目前的狀態，"
        },
        {
          "id": 103,
          "start": 280.87,
          "end": 283.32,
          "en": "the guaranteed latest state,",
          "zh": "而且保證是最新的狀態，"
        },
        {
          "id": 104,
          "start": 283.32,
          "end": 285.73,
          "en": "we can access state.counter in here",
          "zh": "就可以在這裡存取 state.counter，"
        },
        {
          "id": 105,
          "start": 285.73,
          "end": 287.92,
          "en": "and increment this by one.",
          "zh": "並讓它加一，"
        },
        {
          "id": 106,
          "start": 287.92,
          "end": 290.73,
          "en": "Also, of course, with this code.",
          "zh": "當然也可以寫成這樣。"
        },
        {
          "id": 107,
          "start": 290.73,
          "end": 292.64,
          "en": "Or if we ever change our logic,",
          "zh": "如果哪天要改變邏輯，"
        },
        {
          "id": 108,
          "start": 292.64,
          "end": 294.023,
          "en": "we simply change it here.",
          "zh": "只要在這裡修改就好。"
        },
        {
          "id": 109,
          "start": 295.12,
          "end": 297.87,
          "en": "And now we want to trigger this mutation",
          "zh": "現在，我們要在所有"
        },
        {
          "id": 110,
          "start": 297.87,
          "end": 299.34000000000003,
          "en": "from all the places",
          "zh": "應該修改狀態的地方"
        },
        {
          "id": 111,
          "start": 299.34000000000003,
          "end": 301.7,
          "en": "that should change our state.",
          "zh": "觸發這個 mutation。"
        },
        {
          "id": 112,
          "start": 301.7,
          "end": 303.61,
          "en": "And of course, it should be needless to say",
          "zh": "當然，不用說也知道，"
        },
        {
          "id": 113,
          "start": 303.61,
          "end": 305.77,
          "en": "that you can have multiple mutations.",
          "zh": "你可以有多個 mutations，"
        },
        {
          "id": 114,
          "start": 305.77,
          "end": 308.853,
          "en": "You can have as many as you need for your application.",
          "zh": "應用程式需要幾個就可以有幾個。"
        },
        {
          "id": 115,
          "start": 309.8,
          "end": 311.17,
          "en": "So here I've got one",
          "zh": "這裡我有一個，"
        },
        {
          "id": 116,
          "start": 311.17,
          "end": 314.25,
          "en": "and I wanna trigger it for the button in App.vue",
          "zh": "我想讓 App.vue 中的按鈕"
        },
        {
          "id": 117,
          "start": 314.25,
          "end": 316.67,
          "en": "and for the button in ChangeCounter.",
          "zh": "和 ChangeCounter 中的按鈕都觸發它。"
        },
        {
          "id": 118,
          "start": 316.67,
          "end": 319.98,
          "en": "Now, let's start with the button in ChangeCounter.",
          "zh": "我們先從 ChangeCounter 中的按鈕開始。"
        },
        {
          "id": 119,
          "start": 319.98,
          "end": 322.35,
          "en": "Here, to trigger a mutation,",
          "zh": "在這裡，要觸發 mutation，"
        },
        {
          "id": 120,
          "start": 322.35,
          "end": 325.02,
          "en": "we access this.$store",
          "zh": "就存取 this.$store，"
        },
        {
          "id": 121,
          "start": 325.02,
          "end": 328.61,
          "en": "but now there we've got a commit method.",
          "zh": "它有一個 commit 方法，"
        },
        {
          "id": 122,
          "start": 328.61,
          "end": 329.95,
          "en": "It's a built-in method,",
          "zh": "這是 Vuex 在 store 上"
        },
        {
          "id": 123,
          "start": 329.95,
          "end": 333.037,
          "en": "which Vuex gives you on its store.",
          "zh": "提供的內建方法。"
        },
        {
          "id": 124,
          "start": 333.037,
          "end": 336.137,
          "en": "And commit takes the name",
          "zh": "commit 接收"
        },
        {
          "id": 125,
          "start": 336.137,
          "end": 338.83299999999997,
          "en": "of the mutation you want to perform.",
          "zh": "要執行的 mutation 名稱，"
        },
        {
          "id": 126,
          "start": 340.28,
          "end": 342.73,
          "en": "In this case, that's increment",
          "zh": "在這個例子中就是 increment，"
        },
        {
          "id": 127,
          "start": 342.73,
          "end": 345.71,
          "en": "and the name should be provided as a string.",
          "zh": "而且名稱要以字串提供。"
        },
        {
          "id": 128,
          "start": 345.71,
          "end": 349.5,
          "en": "It's increment because I named my mutation increment.",
          "zh": "之所以是 increment，是因為我把 mutation 命名為 increment。"
        },
        {
          "id": 129,
          "start": 349.5,
          "end": 351.6,
          "en": "If you used a different name here,",
          "zh": "如果你在這裡用了不同的名稱，"
        },
        {
          "id": 130,
          "start": 351.6,
          "end": 354.14300000000003,
          "en": "you also need to commit a different name.",
          "zh": "commit 時也要使用那個名稱。"
        },
        {
          "id": 131,
          "start": 355.27,
          "end": 359.49,
          "en": "But now we can commit this here in ChangeCounter",
          "zh": "現在就可以在 ChangeCounter"
        },
        {
          "id": 132,
          "start": 359.49,
          "end": 361.023,
          "en": "and also in App.vue.",
          "zh": "以及 App.vue 中 commit 它。"
        },
        {
          "id": 133,
          "start": 362.25,
          "end": 364.26,
          "en": "And now we moved the logic,",
          "zh": "這樣一來，我們就把邏輯，"
        },
        {
          "id": 134,
          "start": 364.26,
          "end": 367.74,
          "en": "the concrete logic on how the state is updated out",
          "zh": "也就是如何更新狀態的具體邏輯，"
        },
        {
          "id": 135,
          "start": 367.74,
          "end": 370.14,
          "en": "of the components into our store,",
          "zh": "從元件移到了 store 中，"
        },
        {
          "id": 136,
          "start": 370.14,
          "end": 371.72,
          "en": "into this mutation.",
          "zh": "移到這個 mutation 裡，"
        },
        {
          "id": 137,
          "start": 371.72,
          "end": 374.22,
          "en": "And we just commit this mutation",
          "zh": "而元件內部"
        },
        {
          "id": 138,
          "start": 374.22,
          "end": 376.48,
          "en": "from inside our components.",
          "zh": "只負責 commit 這個 mutation。"
        },
        {
          "id": 139,
          "start": 376.48,
          "end": 377.963,
          "en": "So now, if we save that,",
          "zh": "所以現在儲存之後，"
        },
        {
          "id": 140,
          "start": 379.5,
          "end": 381.19,
          "en": "this still works",
          "zh": "一切仍然正常運作，"
        },
        {
          "id": 141,
          "start": 381.19,
          "end": 383.3,
          "en": "but now with help of mutations,",
          "zh": "但現在是透過 mutations，"
        },
        {
          "id": 142,
          "start": 383.3,
          "end": 385.08,
          "en": "which is the more elegant",
          "zh": "這是更優雅、"
        },
        {
          "id": 143,
          "start": 385.08,
          "end": 388.363,
          "en": "and more predictable way of updating our state.",
          "zh": "也更可預測的狀態更新方式。"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "21879718",
      "title": "Passing Data to Mutations with Payloads",
      "lectureOrder": 217,
      "videoOrder": 190,
      "sourceHash": "575db8f5a056af2b56d7479ffb2dc9d41a378fcef664b057f4fcd5a6f917a6ed",
      "cues": [
        {
          "id": 1,
          "start": 2.24,
          "end": 6.61,
          "en": "Now some mutations might require arguments.",
          "zh": "有些 mutations 可能需要引數。"
        },
        {
          "id": 2,
          "start": 6.61,
          "end": 8.69,
          "en": "Here, we got the increment mutation",
          "zh": "這裡有 increment mutation，"
        },
        {
          "id": 3,
          "start": 8.69,
          "end": 11.41,
          "en": "and the value by which we increment this",
          "zh": "而遞增的數值"
        },
        {
          "id": 4,
          "start": 11.41,
          "end": 13.853,
          "en": "is hard coded into this code.",
          "zh": "是寫死在程式碼中的。"
        },
        {
          "id": 5,
          "start": 15,
          "end": 17.99,
          "en": "We could add and increase mutation,",
          "zh": "我們可以新增一個 increase mutation，"
        },
        {
          "id": 6,
          "start": 17.99,
          "end": 20.9,
          "en": "which also gets to state and say that in here,",
          "zh": "它同樣會收到 state，並在裡面"
        },
        {
          "id": 7,
          "start": 20.9,
          "end": 23.36,
          "en": "we also want to change the counter,",
          "zh": "同樣修改 counter，"
        },
        {
          "id": 8,
          "start": 23.36,
          "end": 27.33,
          "en": "but we actually want to increase it by a value",
          "zh": "但我們其實想讓它增加一個"
        },
        {
          "id": 9,
          "start": 27.33,
          "end": 31.313,
          "en": "which can be defined when this mutation is committed.",
          "zh": "在 commit 這個 mutation 時才決定的數值。"
        },
        {
          "id": 10,
          "start": 32.52,
          "end": 35.94,
          "en": "And you also allow for this scenario,",
          "zh": "為了支援這種情況，"
        },
        {
          "id": 11,
          "start": 35.94,
          "end": 39.98,
          "en": "your mutations actually also take a second argument,",
          "zh": "mutations 其實還會接收第二個引數，"
        },
        {
          "id": 12,
          "start": 39.98,
          "end": 43.603,
          "en": "a payload, so a data package that can be a pendant.",
          "zh": "也就是 payload，一個可以附加上去的資料包。"
        },
        {
          "id": 13,
          "start": 44.62,
          "end": 47.27,
          "en": "And I'm going to name the argument payload here,",
          "zh": "我在這裡把這個引數命名為 payload，"
        },
        {
          "id": 14,
          "start": 47.27,
          "end": 50.65,
          "en": "though of course, these names are up to you ultimately.",
          "zh": "當然，這些名稱最終都由你決定。"
        },
        {
          "id": 15,
          "start": 50.65,
          "end": 52.7,
          "en": "Now payload can be anything.",
          "zh": "payload 可以是任何東西，"
        },
        {
          "id": 16,
          "start": 52.7,
          "end": 56.42,
          "en": "It can be a number, it can be a string, it can be an object.",
          "zh": "可以是數字、字串，也可以是物件。"
        },
        {
          "id": 17,
          "start": 56.42,
          "end": 59.78,
          "en": "And let's say here, we assume it will be an object",
          "zh": "這裡我們假設它是一個物件，"
        },
        {
          "id": 18,
          "start": 59.78,
          "end": 61.723,
          "en": "where we have a value property.",
          "zh": "其中有一個 value 屬性。"
        },
        {
          "id": 19,
          "start": 62.56,
          "end": 64.45,
          "en": "But this is entirely up to you",
          "zh": "不過這完全由你決定，"
        },
        {
          "id": 20,
          "start": 64.45,
          "end": 66.73,
          "en": "it's your store, your application,",
          "zh": "這是你的 store、你的應用程式，"
        },
        {
          "id": 21,
          "start": 66.73,
          "end": 70.943,
          "en": "you can expect any kind of data on committed mutations.",
          "zh": "commit mutations 時，你可以預期收到任何類型的資料。"
        },
        {
          "id": 22,
          "start": 71.89,
          "end": 73.743,
          "en": "But how could we now call this?",
          "zh": "那現在要怎麼呼叫它呢？"
        },
        {
          "id": 23,
          "start": 74.82,
          "end": 79.37,
          "en": "Well let's and ChangeCounter, we say add two,",
          "zh": "在 ChangeCounter 中，我們把文字改成 Add 2，"
        },
        {
          "id": 24,
          "start": 79.37,
          "end": 82.53,
          "en": "because that's more appropriate to what happens here,",
          "zh": "因為這比較符合實際發生的事。"
        },
        {
          "id": 25,
          "start": 82.53,
          "end": 85.87,
          "en": "but in App.vue, I don't want to commit increment,",
          "zh": "而在 App.vue 中，我不想 commit increment，"
        },
        {
          "id": 26,
          "start": 85.87,
          "end": 88.05,
          "en": "but the new increase mutation",
          "zh": "而是要 commit 新的 increase mutation，"
        },
        {
          "id": 27,
          "start": 89.18,
          "end": 91.563,
          "en": "and I want to increase TheCounter by 10.",
          "zh": "並讓計數器增加 10。"
        },
        {
          "id": 28,
          "start": 92.50999999999999,
          "end": 96.24000000000001,
          "en": "Now, I still don't want to manipulate the state",
          "zh": "我仍然不想從這個元件內部"
        },
        {
          "id": 29,
          "start": 96.24000000000001,
          "end": 98.32,
          "en": "from insight this component.",
          "zh": "直接操作狀態，"
        },
        {
          "id": 30,
          "start": 98.32,
          "end": 100.78,
          "en": "I still want to use a mutation,",
          "zh": "還是想使用 mutation，"
        },
        {
          "id": 31,
          "start": 100.78,
          "end": 103.86,
          "en": "but I want to pass this data package",
          "zh": "但要把這個資料包傳給"
        },
        {
          "id": 32,
          "start": 103.86,
          "end": 108.64,
          "en": "to this mutation so that we have some flexibility.",
          "zh": "這個 mutation，讓它更有彈性。"
        },
        {
          "id": 33,
          "start": 108.64,
          "end": 111.72,
          "en": "For that commit, takes a second argument,",
          "zh": "為此，commit 接收第二個引數，"
        },
        {
          "id": 34,
          "start": 111.72,
          "end": 113.46000000000001,
          "en": "which will be the payload,",
          "zh": "也就是 payload，"
        },
        {
          "id": 35,
          "start": 113.46000000000001,
          "end": 116.92,
          "en": "which then later is received in your mutation.",
          "zh": "之後會在 mutation 中收到它。"
        },
        {
          "id": 36,
          "start": 116.92,
          "end": 118.39,
          "en": "So the second argument here,",
          "zh": "所以 mutation 的第二個參數，"
        },
        {
          "id": 37,
          "start": 118.39,
          "end": 122.36,
          "en": "indeed is also the second argument you can pass to commit.",
          "zh": "對應的就是你可以傳給 commit 的第二個引數。"
        },
        {
          "id": 38,
          "start": 122.36,
          "end": 124.43,
          "en": "And this can be anything as I mentioned,",
          "zh": "如前所述，它可以是任何東西，"
        },
        {
          "id": 39,
          "start": 124.43,
          "end": 128.18,
          "en": "a number, a string, but here it should be an object",
          "zh": "數字、字串都行，但這裡應該是一個"
        },
        {
          "id": 40,
          "start": 128.18,
          "end": 130.7,
          "en": "with a value property because",
          "zh": "帶有 value 屬性的物件，因為"
        },
        {
          "id": 41,
          "start": 130.7,
          "end": 132.31,
          "en": "that is what I'm expecting here.",
          "zh": "這正是我在這裡預期的。"
        },
        {
          "id": 42,
          "start": 132.31,
          "end": 136.803,
          "en": "I'm accessing dot value on the payload in my mutation here.",
          "zh": "我在 mutation 中存取 payload 的 .value。"
        },
        {
          "id": 43,
          "start": 137.84,
          "end": 140.39,
          "en": "So here I provide a value and in this case,",
          "zh": "所以這裡我提供一個 value，在這個例子中，"
        },
        {
          "id": 44,
          "start": 140.39,
          "end": 143.523,
          "en": "let's say the value is a number and it's the number 10.",
          "zh": "假設 value 是數字 10。"
        },
        {
          "id": 45,
          "start": 144.8,
          "end": 149.8,
          "en": "If we now save this and reload, add two adds two,",
          "zh": "儲存並重新載入後，Add 2 會加 2，"
        },
        {
          "id": 46,
          "start": 150.07,
          "end": 153.73,
          "en": "because it commits the increment mutation.",
          "zh": "因為它 commit 的是 increment mutation；"
        },
        {
          "id": 47,
          "start": 153.73,
          "end": 158.29,
          "en": "But add 10 adds 10 because it calls to increase mutation",
          "zh": "而 Add 10 會加 10，因為它呼叫的是 increase mutation，"
        },
        {
          "id": 48,
          "start": 158.29,
          "end": 161.543,
          "en": "with a payload that contains this value of 10.",
          "zh": "並帶著一個包含數值 10 的 payload。"
        },
        {
          "id": 49,
          "start": 163.11,
          "end": 168.11,
          "en": "So payloads extra data can be passed to your mutations.",
          "zh": "所以，透過 payload 可以把額外資料傳給 mutations。"
        },
        {
          "id": 50,
          "start": 169.32,
          "end": 172.67000000000002,
          "en": "You also got an alternative way of committing by the way,",
          "zh": "順帶一提，還有另一種 commit 的方式。"
        },
        {
          "id": 51,
          "start": 172.67000000000002,
          "end": 174.71,
          "en": "there is nothing wrong with this approach,",
          "zh": "剛才的做法並沒有錯，"
        },
        {
          "id": 52,
          "start": 174.71,
          "end": 179.71,
          "en": "but you can also call commit and pass an object to commit.",
          "zh": "但你也可以呼叫 commit 並傳入一個物件。"
        },
        {
          "id": 53,
          "start": 180.68,
          "end": 184.08,
          "en": "Now this object now needs to have a type property",
          "zh": "這個物件需要有一個 type 屬性，"
        },
        {
          "id": 54,
          "start": 184.08,
          "end": 186.2,
          "en": "which holds the name of the mutation",
          "zh": "存放要 commit 的"
        },
        {
          "id": 55,
          "start": 186.2,
          "end": 188.22,
          "en": "that should be committed.",
          "zh": "mutation 名稱，"
        },
        {
          "id": 56,
          "start": 188.22,
          "end": 192.38,
          "en": "But in addition, it can hold as many properties as you want.",
          "zh": "此外還可以有任意多個屬性，"
        },
        {
          "id": 57,
          "start": 192.38,
          "end": 195.35,
          "en": "For example here, this value property,",
          "zh": "例如這裡的 value 屬性。"
        },
        {
          "id": 58,
          "start": 195.35,
          "end": 199.53,
          "en": "and then it's this object without the type so to say,",
          "zh": "然後，這個物件扣除 type 之後，"
        },
        {
          "id": 59,
          "start": 199.53,
          "end": 203.513,
          "en": "which will be provided as a payload to this mutation.",
          "zh": "就會作為 payload 提供給這個 mutation。"
        },
        {
          "id": 60,
          "start": 204.48,
          "end": 207.02,
          "en": "So that's simply an alternative way of committing",
          "zh": "這只是另一種 commit 的方式，"
        },
        {
          "id": 61,
          "start": 207.02,
          "end": 209.713,
          "en": "and it's up to you, which approach you prefer.",
          "zh": "要用哪一種由你決定。"
        },
        {
          "id": 62,
          "start": 210.66,
          "end": 213.363,
          "en": "This will also work as you see here.",
          "zh": "如你所見，這樣也能正常運作。"
        },
        {
          "id": 63,
          "start": 214.7,
          "end": 218.47,
          "en": "Now these are mutations, and the clear advantages",
          "zh": "這就是 mutations，它的明顯優點"
        },
        {
          "id": 64,
          "start": 218.47,
          "end": 220.51,
          "en": "that you move the concrete logic",
          "zh": "是把修改狀態的具體邏輯"
        },
        {
          "id": 65,
          "start": 220.51,
          "end": 224.13,
          "en": "that changes your state into your store.",
          "zh": "移到 store 中。"
        },
        {
          "id": 66,
          "start": 224.13,
          "end": 226.38,
          "en": "And here of course, it's very simple logic,",
          "zh": "當然，這裡的邏輯非常簡單，"
        },
        {
          "id": 67,
          "start": 226.38,
          "end": 229.32999999999998,
          "en": "but this could be way more complex in the end.",
          "zh": "但實際上可能會複雜得多。"
        },
        {
          "id": 68,
          "start": 229.32999999999998,
          "end": 233.28,
          "en": "And you just commit mutations from inside your components,",
          "zh": "而你只要從元件內部 commit mutations，"
        },
        {
          "id": 69,
          "start": 233.28,
          "end": 235.7,
          "en": "so you never, and that's really important.",
          "zh": "所以，這點真的很重要："
        },
        {
          "id": 70,
          "start": 235.7,
          "end": 239.93,
          "en": "You never directly add the state from inside components.",
          "zh": "絕對不要從元件內部直接修改狀態，"
        },
        {
          "id": 71,
          "start": 239.93,
          "end": 242.55,
          "en": "This is not considered a good practice.",
          "zh": "這不被視為良好的做法，"
        },
        {
          "id": 72,
          "start": 242.55,
          "end": 245.313,
          "en": "You should instead use mutations.",
          "zh": "而是應該使用 mutations。"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "21879732",
      "title": "Introducing Getters - A Better Way Of Getting Data",
      "lectureOrder": 218,
      "videoOrder": 191,
      "sourceHash": "39d09f717ce27726a9df2d7c4f1deb0132c21152330564f68ba70c16f58465f9",
      "cues": [
        {
          "id": 1,
          "start": 2.06,
          "end": 5.51,
          "en": "So we use mutations to edit our data",
          "zh": "所以，我們使用 mutations 來修改"
        },
        {
          "id": 2,
          "start": 5.51,
          "end": 6.5,
          "en": "in the state,",
          "zh": "state 中，"
        },
        {
          "id": 3,
          "start": 6.5,
          "end": 8.13,
          "en": "in the store.",
          "zh": "也就是 store 中的資料。"
        },
        {
          "id": 4,
          "start": 8.13,
          "end": 11.35,
          "en": "Now just as we shouldn't directly edit the state,",
          "zh": "就像我們不應該從元件內部"
        },
        {
          "id": 5,
          "start": 11.35,
          "end": 12.8,
          "en": "from inside components,",
          "zh": "直接修改狀態一樣，"
        },
        {
          "id": 6,
          "start": 12.8,
          "end": 16.28,
          "en": "we could also argue that directly reading the state,",
          "zh": "也可以說，直接讀取狀態"
        },
        {
          "id": 7,
          "start": 16.28,
          "end": 18.66,
          "en": "might not be ideal.",
          "zh": "可能也不太理想。"
        },
        {
          "id": 8,
          "start": 18.66,
          "end": 21.133,
          "en": "Why could this be sub-optimal?",
          "zh": "為什麼這可能不是最好的做法呢？"
        },
        {
          "id": 9,
          "start": 22.02,
          "end": 23.196,
          "en": "Well in this app we got the,",
          "zh": "在這個應用程式中，我們有"
        },
        {
          "id": 10,
          "start": 23.196,
          "end": 24.65,
          "en": "TheCounter component,",
          "zh": "TheCounter 元件，"
        },
        {
          "id": 11,
          "start": 24.65,
          "end": 26.87,
          "en": "where I output to counter.",
          "zh": "我在裡面輸出計數器。"
        },
        {
          "id": 12,
          "start": 26.87,
          "end": 28.46,
          "en": "Now lets say for whatever reason",
          "zh": "假設基於某種原因，"
        },
        {
          "id": 13,
          "start": 28.46,
          "end": 30.203,
          "en": "we also have another component.",
          "zh": "我們還有另一個元件，"
        },
        {
          "id": 14,
          "start": 31.09,
          "end": 33.91,
          "en": "Favoritevalue.vue",
          "zh": "FavoriteValue.vue，"
        },
        {
          "id": 15,
          "start": 34.98,
          "end": 38.84,
          "en": "And in their we do the same thing as in the counter.",
          "zh": "它做的事和 Counter 一樣，"
        },
        {
          "id": 16,
          "start": 38.84,
          "end": 40.21,
          "en": "But maybe we do more.",
          "zh": "但也許還做了更多事，"
        },
        {
          "id": 17,
          "start": 40.21,
          "end": 42.43,
          "en": "That's why we have separate component.",
          "zh": "所以才會是獨立的元件。"
        },
        {
          "id": 18,
          "start": 42.43,
          "end": 44.353,
          "en": "So we do more here.",
          "zh": "所以這裡做了更多事。"
        },
        {
          "id": 19,
          "start": 47.04,
          "end": 48.99,
          "en": "Now of course we can use this",
          "zh": "當然，我們可以"
        },
        {
          "id": 20,
          "start": 48.99,
          "end": 49.96,
          "en": "component here,",
          "zh": "在 App.vue 中"
        },
        {
          "id": 21,
          "start": 49.96,
          "end": 50.793,
          "en": "in AppVue,",
          "zh": "使用這個元件，"
        },
        {
          "id": 22,
          "start": 50.793,
          "end": 55.793,
          "en": "we can import FavoriteValue from components",
          "zh": "從 components 匯入"
        },
        {
          "id": 23,
          "start": 56.15,
          "end": 57.727,
          "en": "FavoriteValue.vue",
          "zh": "FavoriteValue.vue 中的 FavoriteValue，"
        },
        {
          "id": 24,
          "start": 57.727,
          "end": 60.05,
          "en": "and register it here,",
          "zh": "在這裡註冊它，"
        },
        {
          "id": 25,
          "start": 60.05,
          "end": 63.1,
          "en": "and also add this here below the counter maybe.",
          "zh": "然後也許在計數器下方"
        },
        {
          "id": 26,
          "start": 63.1,
          "end": 65.493,
          "en": "FavoriteValue like this.",
          "zh": "像這樣加上 FavoriteValue。"
        },
        {
          "id": 27,
          "start": 67.53,
          "end": 69.25,
          "en": "Now of course this will work.",
          "zh": "這當然能正常運作。"
        },
        {
          "id": 28,
          "start": 69.25,
          "end": 70.75,
          "en": "We got the counter twice now,",
          "zh": "現在計數器顯示了兩次，"
        },
        {
          "id": 29,
          "start": 70.75,
          "end": 73.63,
          "en": "and it updates in both components.",
          "zh": "而且兩個元件都會更新。"
        },
        {
          "id": 30,
          "start": 73.63,
          "end": 75.35,
          "en": "Now lets say we decide",
          "zh": "假設我們決定，"
        },
        {
          "id": 31,
          "start": 75.35,
          "end": 78.27,
          "en": "that actually we always want our output to counter",
          "zh": "其實希望輸出的計數器"
        },
        {
          "id": 32,
          "start": 78.27,
          "end": 79.52,
          "en": "times two.",
          "zh": "一律乘以二。"
        },
        {
          "id": 33,
          "start": 79.52,
          "end": 82.34,
          "en": "So we update it here in FavoriteValue",
          "zh": "於是我們在 FavoriteValue 中修改，"
        },
        {
          "id": 34,
          "start": 82.34,
          "end": 84.713,
          "en": "and we update it in the counter.",
          "zh": "也在 Counter 中修改。"
        },
        {
          "id": 35,
          "start": 86.42,
          "end": 87.94,
          "en": "Do you see the problem?",
          "zh": "看出問題了嗎？"
        },
        {
          "id": 36,
          "start": 87.94,
          "end": 91.36,
          "en": "We are again replicating logic here.",
          "zh": "我們又在重複邏輯，"
        },
        {
          "id": 37,
          "start": 91.36,
          "end": 93.06,
          "en": "We do have duplicate code.",
          "zh": "產生了重複的程式碼。"
        },
        {
          "id": 38,
          "start": 93.06,
          "end": 96.82,
          "en": "And again in bigger more realistic applications,",
          "zh": "而在更大、更貼近實際的應用程式中，"
        },
        {
          "id": 39,
          "start": 96.82,
          "end": 98.67,
          "en": "this might absolutely happen.",
          "zh": "這種情況絕對可能發生："
        },
        {
          "id": 40,
          "start": 98.67,
          "end": 102,
          "en": "That we need the same kind of data in different components,",
          "zh": "不同元件需要同一種資料，"
        },
        {
          "id": 41,
          "start": 102,
          "end": 104.97999999999999,
          "en": "and then we decide that we want to format",
          "zh": "然後我們決定要用不同的方式"
        },
        {
          "id": 42,
          "start": 104.97999999999999,
          "end": 107.4,
          "en": "or calculate the data differently.",
          "zh": "格式化或計算這些資料，"
        },
        {
          "id": 43,
          "start": 107.4,
          "end": 109.69,
          "en": "And therefore we suddenly need to change it",
          "zh": "結果就必須在"
        },
        {
          "id": 44,
          "start": 109.69,
          "end": 111.283,
          "en": "in all the different places.",
          "zh": "所有不同的地方修改。"
        },
        {
          "id": 45,
          "start": 112.49000000000001,
          "end": 117.12,
          "en": "This is why we might not want to directly talk to the state.",
          "zh": "這就是為什麼我們可能不想直接存取狀態，"
        },
        {
          "id": 46,
          "start": 117.12,
          "end": 120.73,
          "en": "Instead we can use a concept called Getters.",
          "zh": "而是改用一個叫做 getters 的概念。"
        },
        {
          "id": 47,
          "start": 120.73,
          "end": 121.93,
          "en": "Which in the end are,",
          "zh": "說到底，"
        },
        {
          "id": 48,
          "start": 121.93,
          "end": 124.11,
          "en": "you could say computer properties",
          "zh": "可以說它就是"
        },
        {
          "id": 49,
          "start": 124.11,
          "end": 127.08,
          "en": "defined directly in the store,",
          "zh": "直接定義在 store 中的計算屬性，"
        },
        {
          "id": 50,
          "start": 127.08,
          "end": 129.71,
          "en": "which we then can use from inside any component",
          "zh": "我們可以在任何想要的元件中"
        },
        {
          "id": 51,
          "start": 129.71,
          "end": 131.64,
          "en": "of our choice.",
          "zh": "使用它們。"
        },
        {
          "id": 52,
          "start": 131.64,
          "end": 135.83,
          "en": "So here is how we add a getter to our Vuex store.",
          "zh": "以下是在 Vuex store 中加入 getter 的方式。"
        },
        {
          "id": 53,
          "start": 135.83,
          "end": 137.76,
          "en": "Next to mutations,",
          "zh": "在 mutations 旁邊，"
        },
        {
          "id": 54,
          "start": 137.76,
          "end": 140.91,
          "en": "doesn't matter where exactly but in the same place as",
          "zh": "確切位置不重要，只要和"
        },
        {
          "id": 55,
          "start": 140.91,
          "end": 142.51,
          "en": "State and Mutations,",
          "zh": "state、mutations 放在同一層，"
        },
        {
          "id": 56,
          "start": 142.51,
          "end": 144.176,
          "en": "you add getters.",
          "zh": "加入 getters。"
        },
        {
          "id": 57,
          "start": 144.176,
          "end": 146.046,
          "en": "This takes an object,",
          "zh": "它接收一個物件，"
        },
        {
          "id": 58,
          "start": 146.046,
          "end": 149.59,
          "en": "and every getter is a method in this object now.",
          "zh": "物件中的每個 getter 都是一個方法，"
        },
        {
          "id": 59,
          "start": 149.59,
          "end": 152.81,
          "en": "So basically just like computer properties are methods",
          "zh": "基本上就像計算屬性是元件"
        },
        {
          "id": 60,
          "start": 152.81,
          "end": 155.77,
          "en": "in the computed option of components.",
          "zh": "computed 選項中的方法一樣。"
        },
        {
          "id": 61,
          "start": 155.77,
          "end": 158.96,
          "en": "Here we could have the final counter getter",
          "zh": "例如，這裡可以有一個"
        },
        {
          "id": 62,
          "start": 158.96,
          "end": 160.45,
          "en": "lets say.",
          "zh": "finalCounter getter。"
        },
        {
          "id": 63,
          "start": 160.45,
          "end": 163.21,
          "en": "And the final Counter Getter method",
          "zh": "而 finalCounter getter 方法，"
        },
        {
          "id": 64,
          "start": 163.21,
          "end": 165.397,
          "en": "like all getter method in Vuex,",
          "zh": "就像 Vuex 中所有的 getter 方法一樣，"
        },
        {
          "id": 65,
          "start": 165.397,
          "end": 167.94,
          "en": "gets two arguments.",
          "zh": "會收到兩個引數："
        },
        {
          "id": 66,
          "start": 167.94,
          "end": 169.49,
          "en": "The current State,",
          "zh": "目前的 state，"
        },
        {
          "id": 67,
          "start": 169.49,
          "end": 171.847,
          "en": "which we need to get a value out of it,",
          "zh": "我們需要從中取得值；"
        },
        {
          "id": 68,
          "start": 171.847,
          "end": 174.649,
          "en": "and other getters.",
          "zh": "以及其他 getters。"
        },
        {
          "id": 69,
          "start": 174.649,
          "end": 177.55,
          "en": "Getting other getters in a getter",
          "zh": "在 getter 中取得其他 getters，"
        },
        {
          "id": 70,
          "start": 177.55,
          "end": 181.09,
          "en": "can be helpful if the value you wanna calculate here,",
          "zh": "在你要計算的值"
        },
        {
          "id": 71,
          "start": 181.09,
          "end": 184.14,
          "en": "depends on the result of an another getter.",
          "zh": "取決於另一個 getter 的結果時會很有用。"
        },
        {
          "id": 72,
          "start": 184.14,
          "end": 185.26,
          "en": "But lets ignore that for now,",
          "zh": "不過我們先忽略這點，"
        },
        {
          "id": 73,
          "start": 185.26,
          "end": 188.04,
          "en": "lets just work with the state argument.",
          "zh": "只使用 state 引數。"
        },
        {
          "id": 74,
          "start": 188.04,
          "end": 190.1,
          "en": "We wanna return a value here,",
          "zh": "我們要在這裡回傳一個值，"
        },
        {
          "id": 75,
          "start": 190.1,
          "end": 192.098,
          "en": "a getter has to return a value.",
          "zh": "getter 必須回傳值。"
        },
        {
          "id": 76,
          "start": 192.098,
          "end": 194.47,
          "en": "And the value here is our counter",
          "zh": "這裡的值就是"
        },
        {
          "id": 77,
          "start": 194.47,
          "end": 196.29,
          "en": "which is manged in the state,",
          "zh": "state 中管理的 counter，"
        },
        {
          "id": 78,
          "start": 196.29,
          "end": 197.823,
          "en": "times two lets say.",
          "zh": "假設乘以二。"
        },
        {
          "id": 79,
          "start": 199.31,
          "end": 201.76,
          "en": "And we can now use this getter",
          "zh": "現在就可以在任何想要的元件中"
        },
        {
          "id": 80,
          "start": 201.76,
          "end": 204.17000000000002,
          "en": "from any component of our choice.",
          "zh": "使用這個 getter，"
        },
        {
          "id": 81,
          "start": 204.17000000000002,
          "end": 205.04,
          "en": "For example,",
          "zh": "例如"
        },
        {
          "id": 82,
          "start": 205.04,
          "end": 208.12,
          "en": "from inside the counter.",
          "zh": "在 Counter 裡面。"
        },
        {
          "id": 83,
          "start": 208.12,
          "end": 210.37,
          "en": "Here in this computed property,",
          "zh": "在這個保留下來的"
        },
        {
          "id": 84,
          "start": 210.37,
          "end": 211.54,
          "en": "which we keep,",
          "zh": "計算屬性中，"
        },
        {
          "id": 85,
          "start": 211.54,
          "end": 214.32,
          "en": "we now access this $store,",
          "zh": "我們現在存取 this.$store，"
        },
        {
          "id": 86,
          "start": 214.32,
          "end": 216.82999999999998,
          "en": "but no longer the state but instead",
          "zh": "但不再存取 state，而是存取"
        },
        {
          "id": 87,
          "start": 216.82999999999998,
          "end": 218.15,
          "en": "store.getters.",
          "zh": "$store.getters，"
        },
        {
          "id": 88,
          "start": 219.57999999999998,
          "end": 221.71,
          "en": "And then the name of your getter.",
          "zh": "再加上 getter 的名稱，"
        },
        {
          "id": 89,
          "start": 221.71,
          "end": 224.187,
          "en": "Which in this case was FinalCounter.",
          "zh": "在這個例子中是 finalCounter。"
        },
        {
          "id": 90,
          "start": 225.19,
          "end": 227.73,
          "en": "So here it's also FinalCounter.",
          "zh": "所以這裡也是 finalCounter。"
        },
        {
          "id": 91,
          "start": 227.73,
          "end": 229.07,
          "en": "And you don't call it,",
          "zh": "而且不需要呼叫它，"
        },
        {
          "id": 92,
          "start": 229.07,
          "end": 230.52,
          "en": "you don't execute it,",
          "zh": "不需要執行它，"
        },
        {
          "id": 93,
          "start": 230.52,
          "end": 232.03300000000002,
          "en": "you just point at it.",
          "zh": "只要指向它，"
        },
        {
          "id": 94,
          "start": 233.01,
          "end": 233.84300000000002,
          "en": "Like this.",
          "zh": "像這樣，"
        },
        {
          "id": 95,
          "start": 233.84300000000002,
          "end": 235.007,
          "en": "Like a property.",
          "zh": "就像存取屬性一樣。"
        },
        {
          "id": 96,
          "start": 235.007,
          "end": 239.23,
          "en": "And Vuex will execute this getter method for you then,",
          "zh": "Vuex 會幫你執行這個 getter 方法，"
        },
        {
          "id": 97,
          "start": 239.23,
          "end": 242.023,
          "en": "passing into current state into the getter.",
          "zh": "並把目前的 state 傳進 getter。"
        },
        {
          "id": 98,
          "start": 243.43,
          "end": 244.95,
          "en": "So we do this here,",
          "zh": "所以我們在"
        },
        {
          "id": 99,
          "start": 244.95,
          "end": 246.19,
          "en": "in the counter,",
          "zh": "Counter 中這麼做，"
        },
        {
          "id": 100,
          "start": 246.19,
          "end": 248.153,
          "en": "and also in FavoriteValue.",
          "zh": "也在 FavoriteValue 中這麼做。"
        },
        {
          "id": 101,
          "start": 249.33,
          "end": 252.83,
          "en": "And with that if we ever decide that the counter should be",
          "zh": "這樣一來，如果哪天決定計數器應該是"
        },
        {
          "id": 102,
          "start": 252.83,
          "end": 255.36,
          "en": "lets say the Value times three,",
          "zh": "例如值乘以三，"
        },
        {
          "id": 103,
          "start": 255.36,
          "end": 257.73,
          "en": "we just need to do this in one place,",
          "zh": "只要在一個地方修改就好，"
        },
        {
          "id": 104,
          "start": 257.73,
          "end": 259.733,
          "en": "instead of in two places.",
          "zh": "而不必改兩個地方。"
        },
        {
          "id": 105,
          "start": 261.41,
          "end": 263.52,
          "en": "So with that,",
          "zh": "所以，"
        },
        {
          "id": 106,
          "start": 263.52,
          "end": 266.15,
          "en": "if we go back,",
          "zh": "回到頁面上，"
        },
        {
          "id": 107,
          "start": 266.15,
          "end": 268.713,
          "en": "you see this works now.",
          "zh": "你會看到現在這樣可以運作。"
        },
        {
          "id": 108,
          "start": 269.62,
          "end": 271.613,
          "en": "And this is the concept of getters.",
          "zh": "這就是 getters 的概念。"
        },
        {
          "id": 109,
          "start": 273.222,
          "end": 275.9,
          "en": "Now I mentioned that you can't have multiple getters,",
          "zh": "我提過你可以有多個 getters，"
        },
        {
          "id": 110,
          "start": 275.9,
          "end": 279.34000000000003,
          "en": "and that getters can also depend on each other.",
          "zh": "而且 getters 之間也可以互相依賴。"
        },
        {
          "id": 111,
          "start": 279.34000000000003,
          "end": 280.173,
          "en": "Lets say,",
          "zh": "假設"
        },
        {
          "id": 112,
          "start": 280.173,
          "end": 282.12,
          "en": "besides our FinalCounter getter,",
          "zh": "除了 finalCounter getter 之外，"
        },
        {
          "id": 113,
          "start": 282.12,
          "end": 284.54,
          "en": "we have another getter",
          "zh": "我們還有另一個 getter，"
        },
        {
          "id": 114,
          "start": 285.65,
          "end": 287.543,
          "en": "which is called normalizedCounter.",
          "zh": "叫做 normalizedCounter。"
        },
        {
          "id": 115,
          "start": 289.558,
          "end": 291.17,
          "en": "And the idea here is simple,",
          "zh": "概念很簡單："
        },
        {
          "id": 116,
          "start": 291.17,
          "end": 294.03,
          "en": "I wanna use my counter value,",
          "zh": "我想使用計數器的值，"
        },
        {
          "id": 117,
          "start": 294.03,
          "end": 296.72,
          "en": "to be precise the FinalCounter value,",
          "zh": "更精確地說是 finalCounter 的值，"
        },
        {
          "id": 118,
          "start": 296.72,
          "end": 300.37,
          "en": "but I want to make sure it's greater than zero",
          "zh": "但要確保它大於零"
        },
        {
          "id": 119,
          "start": 300.37,
          "end": 302.353,
          "en": "and smaller than 100.",
          "zh": "並小於 100，"
        },
        {
          "id": 120,
          "start": 303.27,
          "end": 307.15,
          "en": "And I either output zero or 100 if one of this boundaries",
          "zh": "如果超出其中一個界線，"
        },
        {
          "id": 121,
          "start": 307.15,
          "end": 308.77,
          "en": "is crossed.",
          "zh": "就輸出 0 或 100。"
        },
        {
          "id": 122,
          "start": 308.77,
          "end": 310.77,
          "en": "Now one way of building this,",
          "zh": "其中一種寫法"
        },
        {
          "id": 123,
          "start": 310.77,
          "end": 311.94,
          "en": "would be,",
          "zh": "是"
        },
        {
          "id": 124,
          "start": 311.94,
          "end": 315.85,
          "en": "that we recalculate our counter times three here,",
          "zh": "在這裡重新計算計數器乘以三，"
        },
        {
          "id": 125,
          "start": 315.85,
          "end": 320.43,
          "en": "and then we have our FinalCounter here.",
          "zh": "得到 finalCounter，"
        },
        {
          "id": 126,
          "start": 320.43,
          "end": 324.01,
          "en": "We check if FinalCounter is smaller than zero,",
          "zh": "然後檢查 finalCounter 是否小於零，"
        },
        {
          "id": 127,
          "start": 324.01,
          "end": 327.33,
          "en": "which can't happen here but lets say we still check it.",
          "zh": "這裡雖然不可能發生，但我們還是檢查一下，"
        },
        {
          "id": 128,
          "start": 327.33,
          "end": 329.6,
          "en": "In which case we return zero,",
          "zh": "如果是就回傳 0；"
        },
        {
          "id": 129,
          "start": 329.6,
          "end": 333.12,
          "en": "we check if FinalCounter is greater than 100,",
          "zh": "再檢查 finalCounter 是否大於 100，"
        },
        {
          "id": 130,
          "start": 333.12,
          "end": 335.173,
          "en": "in which case we return 100.",
          "zh": "如果是就回傳 100；"
        },
        {
          "id": 131,
          "start": 336.27,
          "end": 339.4,
          "en": "And only if neither of the two things is the case,",
          "zh": "只有兩者都不成立時，"
        },
        {
          "id": 132,
          "start": 339.4,
          "end": 341.437,
          "en": "we return the FinalCounter.",
          "zh": "才回傳 finalCounter。"
        },
        {
          "id": 133,
          "start": 342.68,
          "end": 343.55,
          "en": "As a side note,",
          "zh": "順帶一提，"
        },
        {
          "id": 134,
          "start": 343.55,
          "end": 346.15999999999997,
          "en": "this also shows us that you of course",
          "zh": "這也說明了 getter 中當然"
        },
        {
          "id": 135,
          "start": 346.15999999999997,
          "end": 348.99,
          "en": "can have more than one line of code in a getter.",
          "zh": "可以有不只一行程式碼。"
        },
        {
          "id": 136,
          "start": 348.99,
          "end": 351.61,
          "en": "That's another advantage of using getters.",
          "zh": "這也是使用 getters 的另一個優點："
        },
        {
          "id": 137,
          "start": 351.61,
          "end": 353.35,
          "en": "You can move such code",
          "zh": "你可以把這類程式碼"
        },
        {
          "id": 138,
          "start": 353.35,
          "end": 356.36,
          "en": "out of components into your Vuex Store.",
          "zh": "從元件移到 Vuex store 中，"
        },
        {
          "id": 139,
          "start": 356.36,
          "end": 358.383,
          "en": "So that your components stay lead.",
          "zh": "讓元件保持精簡。"
        },
        {
          "id": 140,
          "start": 359.92,
          "end": 362.68,
          "en": "But now with that we got the normalizedCounter.",
          "zh": "這樣我們就有了 normalizedCounter，"
        },
        {
          "id": 141,
          "start": 362.68,
          "end": 365.08,
          "en": "And we could use the normalizedCounter",
          "zh": "並可以在 FavoriteValue 元件中"
        },
        {
          "id": 142,
          "start": 365.08,
          "end": 366.91,
          "en": "in the FavoriteValue component.",
          "zh": "使用 normalizedCounter，"
        },
        {
          "id": 143,
          "start": 366.91,
          "end": 370.703,
          "en": "Simply by referring to normalizedCounter here.",
          "zh": "只要在這裡指向 normalizedCounter，"
        },
        {
          "id": 144,
          "start": 373.37,
          "end": 375.44,
          "en": "That is the name of this getter.",
          "zh": "也就是這個 getter 的名稱。"
        },
        {
          "id": 145,
          "start": 375.44,
          "end": 377.57,
          "en": "And with that you would see",
          "zh": "這樣一來，你會看到"
        },
        {
          "id": 146,
          "start": 377.57,
          "end": 379.79,
          "en": "that as soon as we exceed 100,",
          "zh": "一旦超過 100，"
        },
        {
          "id": 147,
          "start": 379.79,
          "end": 382.72,
          "en": "the bottom counters stays at 100.",
          "zh": "下面的計數器就會停在 100，"
        },
        {
          "id": 148,
          "start": 382.72,
          "end": 384.853,
          "en": "Because of the logic we just added.",
          "zh": "這是因為我們剛才加入的邏輯。"
        },
        {
          "id": 149,
          "start": 386.02,
          "end": 388.423,
          "en": "Now this works but it's not great.",
          "zh": "這樣可行，但不太理想，"
        },
        {
          "id": 150,
          "start": 389.73,
          "end": 391.93,
          "en": "We are calculating something,",
          "zh": "因為我們計算了"
        },
        {
          "id": 151,
          "start": 391.93,
          "end": 394.81,
          "en": "which we've already calculate in another getter.",
          "zh": "另一個 getter 已經算過的東西。"
        },
        {
          "id": 152,
          "start": 394.81,
          "end": 398.82,
          "en": "And that's why we get this getters second argument here.",
          "zh": "這就是 getters 有第二個引數的原因。"
        },
        {
          "id": 153,
          "start": 398.82,
          "end": 401.53,
          "en": "With that we can refer to our getters,",
          "zh": "透過它可以存取其他 getters，"
        },
        {
          "id": 154,
          "start": 401.53,
          "end": 402.78,
          "en": "and get our FinalCounter,",
          "zh": "只要寫 getters.finalCounter"
        },
        {
          "id": 155,
          "start": 403.73,
          "end": 406.553,
          "en": "simply by calling getters.FinalCounter",
          "zh": "就能取得 finalCounter。"
        },
        {
          "id": 156,
          "start": 407.78,
          "end": 410.23,
          "en": "and imagine we had more code in there.",
          "zh": "想像一下，如果那裡面有更多程式碼，"
        },
        {
          "id": 157,
          "start": 410.23,
          "end": 412.74,
          "en": "Replicating that all in another getter,",
          "zh": "既然已經有對應的 getter，"
        },
        {
          "id": 158,
          "start": 412.74,
          "end": 416.413,
          "en": "is just unnecessary if we already do have a getter for that.",
          "zh": "再在另一個 getter 中重複一遍就完全沒必要。"
        },
        {
          "id": 159,
          "start": 417.27,
          "end": 420.49,
          "en": "So that's how we can use finalCounter like this here.",
          "zh": "所以可以像這樣使用 finalCounter。"
        },
        {
          "id": 160,
          "start": 420.49,
          "end": 421.33,
          "en": "And in this case,",
          "zh": "在這個例子中，"
        },
        {
          "id": 161,
          "start": 421.33,
          "end": 423.35,
          "en": "I don't even need to state them,",
          "zh": "我甚至不需要 state，"
        },
        {
          "id": 162,
          "start": 423.35,
          "end": 426.08,
          "en": "but if we would need it we could still use it as well.",
          "zh": "但如果需要，"
        },
        {
          "id": 163,
          "start": 426.08,
          "end": 427.523,
          "en": "In this second getter.",
          "zh": "在這第二個 getter 中仍然可以使用它。"
        },
        {
          "id": 164,
          "start": 429.16,
          "end": 432.54,
          "en": "Here I will replace the state argument with an under score,",
          "zh": "這裡我會把 state 引數換成底線，"
        },
        {
          "id": 165,
          "start": 432.54,
          "end": 435.36,
          "en": "which is a convection signaling my setup,",
          "zh": "這是一種慣例，用來告訴我的專案設定："
        },
        {
          "id": 166,
          "start": 435.36,
          "end": 439.57,
          "en": "my project setup here that I do have to take this argument",
          "zh": "我必須接收這個引數"
        },
        {
          "id": 167,
          "start": 439.57,
          "end": 441.559,
          "en": "in order to get to the second one,",
          "zh": "才能取得第二個引數，"
        },
        {
          "id": 168,
          "start": 441.559,
          "end": 444.27,
          "en": "but then I don't wanna work with it.",
          "zh": "但我不打算使用它。"
        },
        {
          "id": 169,
          "start": 444.27,
          "end": 446.79,
          "en": "Otherwise this specific project setup,",
          "zh": "否則這個專案的設定"
        },
        {
          "id": 170,
          "start": 446.79,
          "end": 449.42,
          "en": "won't complain about an unused argument,",
          "zh": "會抱怨有未使用的引數；"
        },
        {
          "id": 171,
          "start": 449.42,
          "end": 451.07,
          "en": "following this naming convection.",
          "zh": "遵循這種命名慣例，"
        },
        {
          "id": 172,
          "start": 451.07,
          "end": 452.163,
          "en": "It won't complain.",
          "zh": "它就不會抱怨。"
        },
        {
          "id": 173,
          "start": 453.02,
          "end": 455.11,
          "en": "With that if we reload if we get the same behavior",
          "zh": "這樣一來，重新載入後，"
        },
        {
          "id": 174,
          "start": 455.11,
          "end": 456.5,
          "en": "as before,",
          "zh": "行為和之前一樣，"
        },
        {
          "id": 175,
          "start": 456.5,
          "end": 458.933,
          "en": "but now in a slightly more elegant way.",
          "zh": "但寫法更優雅了一些。"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "21879758",
      "title": "Running Async Code with Actions",
      "lectureOrder": 219,
      "videoOrder": 192,
      "sourceHash": "b1a3aefc9c9e684c60e6927c80764de07d816c8dd2c9c421fe6b0fa67815c7ba",
      "cues": [
        {
          "id": 1,
          "start": 2.22,
          "end": 5.12,
          "en": "Now we got \"Mutations and Getters,\"",
          "zh": "我們已經有了 mutations 和 getters，"
        },
        {
          "id": 2,
          "start": 5.12,
          "end": 6.86,
          "en": "what could be missing?",
          "zh": "還缺什麼呢？"
        },
        {
          "id": 3,
          "start": 6.86,
          "end": 8.453,
          "en": "There is another important concept,",
          "zh": "還有另一個重要的概念，"
        },
        {
          "id": 4,
          "start": 8.453,
          "end": 12.23,
          "en": "another important feature Vuex exposes.",
          "zh": "也就是 Vuex 提供的另一個重要功能。"
        },
        {
          "id": 5,
          "start": 12.23,
          "end": 14.56,
          "en": "But in order to understand it,",
          "zh": "不過為了理解它，"
        },
        {
          "id": 6,
          "start": 14.56,
          "end": 16.76,
          "en": "let's go back to our code.",
          "zh": "我們先回到程式碼。"
        },
        {
          "id": 7,
          "start": 16.76,
          "end": 21.13,
          "en": "Let's say, in the increment mutation,",
          "zh": "假設在 increment mutation 中，"
        },
        {
          "id": 8,
          "start": 21.13,
          "end": 24.18,
          "en": "we don't wanna increment immediately.",
          "zh": "我們不想立即遞增，"
        },
        {
          "id": 9,
          "start": 24.18,
          "end": 26.51,
          "en": "Instead, we wanna wait two seconds",
          "zh": "而是想等兩秒"
        },
        {
          "id": 10,
          "start": 26.51,
          "end": 28.76,
          "en": "and then increment.",
          "zh": "之後再遞增。"
        },
        {
          "id": 11,
          "start": 28.76,
          "end": 31.14,
          "en": "Now this might be a dumb example,",
          "zh": "這可能是個很蠢的例子，"
        },
        {
          "id": 12,
          "start": 31.14,
          "end": 33.06,
          "en": "but a better example could be an app",
          "zh": "更好的例子是一個應用程式"
        },
        {
          "id": 13,
          "start": 33.06,
          "end": 35.87,
          "en": "where you send an HTTP request",
          "zh": "發送 HTTP 請求，"
        },
        {
          "id": 14,
          "start": 35.87,
          "end": 37.73,
          "en": "and you wait for the response.",
          "zh": "然後等待回應，"
        },
        {
          "id": 15,
          "start": 37.73,
          "end": 39.81,
          "en": "And only once the response is there,",
          "zh": "只有在收到回應之後，"
        },
        {
          "id": 16,
          "start": 39.81,
          "end": 41.463,
          "en": "you wanna change your state.",
          "zh": "才要修改狀態。"
        },
        {
          "id": 17,
          "start": 42.6,
          "end": 45.63,
          "en": "Put in other words, you sometimes have code,",
          "zh": "換句話說，有時候你會有"
        },
        {
          "id": 18,
          "start": 45.63,
          "end": 47.82,
          "en": "which runs asynchronously,",
          "zh": "非同步執行的程式碼，"
        },
        {
          "id": 19,
          "start": 47.82,
          "end": 49.94,
          "en": "which doesn't finish immediately,",
          "zh": "它不會立即完成，"
        },
        {
          "id": 20,
          "start": 49.94,
          "end": 51.683,
          "en": "but sometimes in the future.",
          "zh": "而是在未來某個時間點才完成。"
        },
        {
          "id": 21,
          "start": 52.62,
          "end": 57.43,
          "en": "The problem is that Mutations must be synchronous.",
          "zh": "問題在於 mutations 必須是同步的，"
        },
        {
          "id": 22,
          "start": 57.43,
          "end": 61.04,
          "en": "You're not allowed to have any asynchronous code in there.",
          "zh": "裡面不允許有任何非同步程式碼。"
        },
        {
          "id": 23,
          "start": 61.04,
          "end": 63.37,
          "en": "So if you run a Mutation,",
          "zh": "所以執行 mutation 時，"
        },
        {
          "id": 24,
          "start": 63.37,
          "end": 67.09,
          "en": "it needs to execute step-by-step-by-step without any pause",
          "zh": "它必須一步接一步地執行，不能有任何停頓，"
        },
        {
          "id": 25,
          "start": 67.09,
          "end": 69.61,
          "en": "and immediately change the state.",
          "zh": "並立即修改狀態，"
        },
        {
          "id": 26,
          "start": 69.61,
          "end": 74.28999999999999,
          "en": "It's not allowed to do anything that may take a bit longer.",
          "zh": "不允許做任何可能耗時較久的事。"
        },
        {
          "id": 27,
          "start": 74.28999999999999,
          "end": 77.07,
          "en": "The reason for that simply is that if multiple",
          "zh": "原因很簡單：如果有多個"
        },
        {
          "id": 28,
          "start": 77.07,
          "end": 78.55,
          "en": "Mutations execute,",
          "zh": "mutations 在執行，"
        },
        {
          "id": 29,
          "start": 78.55,
          "end": 81.82,
          "en": "every mutation should get the latest state.",
          "zh": "每個 mutation 都應該拿到最新的狀態。"
        },
        {
          "id": 30,
          "start": 81.82,
          "end": 84.53999999999999,
          "en": "And if another mutation was committed,",
          "zh": "如果另一個 mutation 已經 commit，"
        },
        {
          "id": 31,
          "start": 84.53999999999999,
          "end": 86.33,
          "en": "but didn't finish yet,",
          "zh": "卻還沒執行完，"
        },
        {
          "id": 32,
          "start": 86.33,
          "end": 90.53999999999999,
          "en": "that is unexpected and will lead to errors in your program.",
          "zh": "就會出乎預期，並導致程式出錯。"
        },
        {
          "id": 33,
          "start": 90.53999999999999,
          "end": 93.68,
          "en": "That's why a key requirement of Mutations",
          "zh": "這就是為什麼 mutations 的一個關鍵要求"
        },
        {
          "id": 34,
          "start": 93.68,
          "end": 97.15,
          "en": "is that they have to be synchronous.",
          "zh": "是必須同步執行。"
        },
        {
          "id": 35,
          "start": 97.15,
          "end": 100.77000000000001,
          "en": "But what if I do want to wait for two seconds?",
          "zh": "但如果我真的想等兩秒呢？"
        },
        {
          "id": 36,
          "start": 100.77000000000001,
          "end": 103.14,
          "en": "We could do it as we've set timeout.",
          "zh": "我們可以用 setTimeout，"
        },
        {
          "id": 37,
          "start": 103.14,
          "end": 105.6,
          "en": "There, we could wait two seconds,",
          "zh": "在那裡等待兩秒，"
        },
        {
          "id": 38,
          "start": 105.6,
          "end": 107.35,
          "en": "and then the function here,",
          "zh": "然後在兩秒後"
        },
        {
          "id": 39,
          "start": 107.35,
          "end": 109.8,
          "en": "which then executes after two seconds,",
          "zh": "執行的這個函式中"
        },
        {
          "id": 40,
          "start": 109.8,
          "end": 111.283,
          "en": "we update our state.",
          "zh": "更新狀態。"
        },
        {
          "id": 41,
          "start": 112.22,
          "end": 113.91,
          "en": "But this is actually not allowed.",
          "zh": "但這其實是不允許的。"
        },
        {
          "id": 42,
          "start": 113.91,
          "end": 115.57,
          "en": "It will work if you try it,",
          "zh": "如果你試試看，它確實能運作，"
        },
        {
          "id": 43,
          "start": 115.57,
          "end": 119.32,
          "en": "but it is a very bad practice and nothing you should do.",
          "zh": "但這是非常糟糕的做法，不應該這麼做。"
        },
        {
          "id": 44,
          "start": 119.32,
          "end": 122.7,
          "en": "Instead Vuex has a better concept in place",
          "zh": "Vuex 有一個更好的概念"
        },
        {
          "id": 45,
          "start": 122.7,
          "end": 125.55,
          "en": "for working with asynchronous code.",
          "zh": "可以處理非同步程式碼。"
        },
        {
          "id": 46,
          "start": 125.55,
          "end": 130.17,
          "en": "Besides Mutations and Getters, it also has Actions.",
          "zh": "除了 mutations 和 getters 之外，它還有 actions。"
        },
        {
          "id": 47,
          "start": 130.17,
          "end": 133.2,
          "en": "And Components should trigger Actions,",
          "zh": "元件應該觸發 actions，"
        },
        {
          "id": 48,
          "start": 133.2,
          "end": 135.863,
          "en": "which then in turn commit Mutations.",
          "zh": "再由 actions commit mutations，"
        },
        {
          "id": 49,
          "start": 136.81,
          "end": 141.81,
          "en": "Because Actions can now use asynchronous code.",
          "zh": "因為 actions 可以使用非同步程式碼。"
        },
        {
          "id": 50,
          "start": 141.88,
          "end": 142.82,
          "en": "And because of that,",
          "zh": "也因為如此，"
        },
        {
          "id": 51,
          "start": 142.82,
          "end": 146.41,
          "en": "it's actually considered a good practice in general,",
          "zh": "一般來說，最好的做法其實是"
        },
        {
          "id": 52,
          "start": 146.41,
          "end": 151.27,
          "en": "to always put Actions between Components and Mutations,",
          "zh": "永遠在元件和 mutations 之間放一層 actions，"
        },
        {
          "id": 53,
          "start": 151.27,
          "end": 154.79,
          "en": "even though Components could commit Mutations themselves.",
          "zh": "即使元件本身也能直接 commit mutations，"
        },
        {
          "id": 54,
          "start": 154.79,
          "end": 156.76,
          "en": "And that wouldn't be a problem",
          "zh": "而且如果只有同步程式碼，"
        },
        {
          "id": 55,
          "start": 156.76,
          "end": 159.38,
          "en": "if you only had synchronous code.",
          "zh": "那樣也不會有問題。"
        },
        {
          "id": 56,
          "start": 159.38,
          "end": 163.3,
          "en": "But even with that fact that directly committing Mutations",
          "zh": "不過，雖然從元件內部直接 commit mutations"
        },
        {
          "id": 57,
          "start": 163.3,
          "end": 166.57999999999998,
          "en": "from inside Components often would not be a problem.",
          "zh": "通常不會有問題，"
        },
        {
          "id": 58,
          "start": 166.57999999999998,
          "end": 170,
          "en": "Even with that, it is considered a good practice",
          "zh": "但一般仍認為最好的做法是"
        },
        {
          "id": 59,
          "start": 170,
          "end": 172.3,
          "en": "to always put Actions in between",
          "zh": "永遠在中間放一層 actions，"
        },
        {
          "id": 60,
          "start": 172.3,
          "end": 177.04,
          "en": "to ensure that you never accidentally put asynchronous code",
          "zh": "確保你絕不會不小心把非同步程式碼"
        },
        {
          "id": 61,
          "start": 177.04,
          "end": 178.483,
          "en": "into Mutations.",
          "zh": "放進 mutations 中。"
        },
        {
          "id": 62,
          "start": 179.57,
          "end": 180.9,
          "en": "So how do Actions work then?",
          "zh": "那麼，actions 是如何運作的呢？"
        },
        {
          "id": 63,
          "start": 180.9,
          "end": 182.633,
          "en": "How do we add them to our store?",
          "zh": "要如何把它們加入 store？"
        },
        {
          "id": 64,
          "start": 183.64,
          "end": 185.28,
          "en": "In main js,",
          "zh": "在 main.js 中，"
        },
        {
          "id": 65,
          "start": 185.28,
          "end": 188.32,
          "en": "besides Mutations and Getters and State,",
          "zh": "除了 mutations、getters 和 state 之外，"
        },
        {
          "id": 66,
          "start": 188.32,
          "end": 190.77,
          "en": "we can add Actions.",
          "zh": "還可以加入 actions。"
        },
        {
          "id": 67,
          "start": 190.77,
          "end": 194.063,
          "en": "And I'm doing this here, I'll add Actions here.",
          "zh": "我在這裡加入 actions。"
        },
        {
          "id": 68,
          "start": 195.71,
          "end": 197.88,
          "en": "And Action also takes an object",
          "zh": "actions 同樣接收一個物件，"
        },
        {
          "id": 69,
          "start": 197.88,
          "end": 200.403,
          "en": "just like Getters and Mutations did.",
          "zh": "就像 getters 和 mutations 一樣。"
        },
        {
          "id": 70,
          "start": 201.52,
          "end": 204.35,
          "en": "An action again is just a method.",
          "zh": "action 同樣只是一個方法，"
        },
        {
          "id": 71,
          "start": 204.35,
          "end": 209.14,
          "en": "For example, increment: You can use the same name here",
          "zh": "例如 increment。你可以使用"
        },
        {
          "id": 72,
          "start": 209.14,
          "end": 211.82,
          "en": "as you do in your Mutations.",
          "zh": "和 mutations 相同的名稱。"
        },
        {
          "id": 73,
          "start": 211.82,
          "end": 213.84,
          "en": "So here I've got an increment mutation.",
          "zh": "這裡我有一個 increment mutation，"
        },
        {
          "id": 74,
          "start": 213.84,
          "end": 216.143,
          "en": "I'm also using an increment action.",
          "zh": "也使用了一個 increment action。"
        },
        {
          "id": 75,
          "start": 217.1,
          "end": 218.89,
          "en": "You don't have to use the same name,",
          "zh": "不一定要使用相同的名稱，"
        },
        {
          "id": 76,
          "start": 218.89,
          "end": 222.36,
          "en": "but often you will because often you just have an action",
          "zh": "但通常會這麼做，因為很多時候，"
        },
        {
          "id": 77,
          "start": 222.36,
          "end": 225.07999999999998,
          "en": "in between a component and a mutation.",
          "zh": "action 只是夾在元件和 mutation 之間，"
        },
        {
          "id": 78,
          "start": 225.07999999999998,
          "end": 227.513,
          "en": "So using the same name makes sense.",
          "zh": "所以使用相同的名稱很合理。"
        },
        {
          "id": 79,
          "start": 229.12,
          "end": 233.97,
          "en": "Now, this action will get an object as a argument,",
          "zh": "這個 action 會收到一個物件作為引數，"
        },
        {
          "id": 80,
          "start": 233.97,
          "end": 236.03,
          "en": "a context object.",
          "zh": "也就是 context 物件，"
        },
        {
          "id": 81,
          "start": 236.03,
          "end": 240.7,
          "en": "And this context object is full of interesting things.",
          "zh": "裡面有很多有趣的東西。"
        },
        {
          "id": 82,
          "start": 240.7,
          "end": 244.36,
          "en": "The actual get this argument automatically by Vuex,",
          "zh": "action 會自動從 Vuex 收到這個引數，"
        },
        {
          "id": 83,
          "start": 244.36,
          "end": 246.503,
          "en": "like all these Veux features do.",
          "zh": "就像所有這些 Vuex 功能一樣。"
        },
        {
          "id": 84,
          "start": 247.63,
          "end": 251.47,
          "en": "Now context, for example, has a commit method,",
          "zh": "例如，context 有一個 commit 方法"
        },
        {
          "id": 85,
          "start": 251.47,
          "end": 252.75,
          "en": "which you can call.",
          "zh": "可以呼叫，"
        },
        {
          "id": 86,
          "start": 252.75,
          "end": 257.75,
          "en": "And it's does what you think, it commits a mutation,",
          "zh": "它的作用就如你所想：commit 一個 mutation，"
        },
        {
          "id": 87,
          "start": 258.04,
          "end": 261.71,
          "en": "just like you could commit it from inside a component.",
          "zh": "就像在元件內部 commit 一樣。"
        },
        {
          "id": 88,
          "start": 261.71,
          "end": 264.3,
          "en": "You can pass a second argument as a payload",
          "zh": "你可以傳入第二個引數作為 payload，"
        },
        {
          "id": 89,
          "start": 264.3,
          "end": 267.28,
          "en": "and you can pass an object alternatively",
          "zh": "也可以改用傳入物件的方式，"
        },
        {
          "id": 90,
          "start": 267.28,
          "end": 270.15,
          "en": "to the two argument way of using it.",
          "zh": "而不是兩個引數的寫法。"
        },
        {
          "id": 91,
          "start": 270.15,
          "end": 272.1,
          "en": "But here I only need one argument",
          "zh": "不過這裡我只需要一個引數，"
        },
        {
          "id": 92,
          "start": 272.1,
          "end": 274.23,
          "en": "and that will be the name of the mutation",
          "zh": "也就是要 commit 的"
        },
        {
          "id": 93,
          "start": 274.23,
          "end": 275.48,
          "en": "that should be committed.",
          "zh": "mutation 名稱。"
        },
        {
          "id": 94,
          "start": 276.37,
          "end": 278.24,
          "en": "Now we'll have a look at the other things",
          "zh": "稍後我們會看看 context 中的"
        },
        {
          "id": 95,
          "start": 278.24,
          "end": 280.53,
          "en": "inside of context in a second,",
          "zh": "其他東西，"
        },
        {
          "id": 96,
          "start": 280.53,
          "end": 282.69,
          "en": "but for the moment, let's leave it like this.",
          "zh": "但目前先維持這樣。"
        },
        {
          "id": 97,
          "start": 282.69,
          "end": 285.81,
          "en": "And now we got an action which commits increment.",
          "zh": "現在我們有一個會 commit increment 的 action。"
        },
        {
          "id": 98,
          "start": 285.81,
          "end": 288.31,
          "en": "The interesting thing is that Actions,",
          "zh": "有趣的是，actions"
        },
        {
          "id": 99,
          "start": 288.31,
          "end": 292.603,
          "en": "unlike Mutations are allowed to run asynchronous code.",
          "zh": "和 mutations 不同，可以執行非同步程式碼。"
        },
        {
          "id": 100,
          "start": 293.78,
          "end": 296.46,
          "en": "So we can take our timeout here",
          "zh": "所以我們可以把 setTimeout 拿來"
        },
        {
          "id": 101,
          "start": 297.89,
          "end": 300.663,
          "en": "and wrap context commit with it.",
          "zh": "包住 context.commit。"
        },
        {
          "id": 102,
          "start": 302.14,
          "end": 305.53,
          "en": "With that, the mutation is synchronous again,",
          "zh": "這樣一來，mutation 又是同步的了，"
        },
        {
          "id": 103,
          "start": 305.53,
          "end": 307.94,
          "en": "but the action is asynchronous,",
          "zh": "而 action 是非同步的，"
        },
        {
          "id": 104,
          "start": 307.94,
          "end": 310.45,
          "en": "which is allowed by Veux.",
          "zh": "這是 Vuex 允許的。"
        },
        {
          "id": 105,
          "start": 310.45,
          "end": 312.65,
          "en": "It simply commits the mutation only",
          "zh": "它只是在兩秒過後"
        },
        {
          "id": 106,
          "start": 312.65,
          "end": 314.493,
          "en": "once the two seconds have passed.",
          "zh": "才 commit mutation。"
        },
        {
          "id": 107,
          "start": 315.64,
          "end": 318.28,
          "en": "And now we need to change our component code",
          "zh": "接著我們需要修改元件的程式碼，"
        },
        {
          "id": 108,
          "start": 318.28,
          "end": 320.29,
          "en": "and make sure that we don't commit",
          "zh": "確保不是從元件內部"
        },
        {
          "id": 109,
          "start": 320.29,
          "end": 321.97,
          "en": "from inside the component,",
          "zh": "commit，"
        },
        {
          "id": 110,
          "start": 321.97,
          "end": 324.69,
          "en": "but that we use the action instead.",
          "zh": "而是改用 action。"
        },
        {
          "id": 111,
          "start": 324.69,
          "end": 326.95,
          "en": "And how do we use an action then?",
          "zh": "那要如何使用 action 呢？"
        },
        {
          "id": 112,
          "start": 326.95,
          "end": 330.343,
          "en": "How is that meant to happen in Veux?",
          "zh": "在 Vuex 中應該怎麼做？"
        },
        {
          "id": 113,
          "start": 331.21,
          "end": 333.09000000000003,
          "en": "Well, inside of the component",
          "zh": "在元件內部"
        },
        {
          "id": 114,
          "start": 333.09000000000003,
          "end": 335.43,
          "en": "where we previously committed,",
          "zh": "原本 commit 的地方，"
        },
        {
          "id": 115,
          "start": 335.43,
          "end": 339,
          "en": "we can now dispatch an action.",
          "zh": "現在改為 dispatch 一個 action。"
        },
        {
          "id": 116,
          "start": 339,
          "end": 342.07,
          "en": "And the cool thing is the syntax for dispatching",
          "zh": "很棒的是，dispatch 的語法"
        },
        {
          "id": 117,
          "start": 342.07,
          "end": 344.83,
          "en": "is pretty much the same as for committing.",
          "zh": "和 commit 幾乎一樣。"
        },
        {
          "id": 118,
          "start": 344.83,
          "end": 348.27,
          "en": "You can either dispatch with two arguments",
          "zh": "你可以用兩個引數 dispatch，"
        },
        {
          "id": 119,
          "start": 348.27,
          "end": 351.48,
          "en": "where the first argument is the action name.",
          "zh": "第一個引數是 action 名稱，"
        },
        {
          "id": 120,
          "start": 351.48,
          "end": 354.01,
          "en": "So in my case increments here.",
          "zh": "在我的例子中就是 increment，"
        },
        {
          "id": 121,
          "start": 354.01,
          "end": 357.90999999999997,
          "en": "And the second argument is a potential payload you want,",
          "zh": "第二個引數則是你可能需要的 payload；"
        },
        {
          "id": 122,
          "start": 357.90999999999997,
          "end": 361.293,
          "en": "or you use the one argument syntax.",
          "zh": "或者使用單一引數的語法。"
        },
        {
          "id": 123,
          "start": 362.16,
          "end": 364.64,
          "en": "Here however, I'm dispatching increase,",
          "zh": "不過這裡我 dispatch 的是 increase，"
        },
        {
          "id": 124,
          "start": 364.64,
          "end": 366.99,
          "en": "which doesn't exist as an action yet.",
          "zh": "而目前還沒有這個 action，"
        },
        {
          "id": 125,
          "start": 366.99,
          "end": 370.24,
          "en": "So I will quickly also add an increase action",
          "zh": "所以我會快速加入一個 increase action，"
        },
        {
          "id": 126,
          "start": 370.24,
          "end": 372.08,
          "en": "so that this will work.",
          "zh": "讓它能正常運作。"
        },
        {
          "id": 127,
          "start": 372.08,
          "end": 375.05,
          "en": "Simply add a new action named Increase,",
          "zh": "只要新增一個名為 increase 的 action，"
        },
        {
          "id": 128,
          "start": 375.05,
          "end": 378.173,
          "en": "and context commit Increase here.",
          "zh": "並在裡面 context.commit('increase')。"
        },
        {
          "id": 129,
          "start": 379.41,
          "end": 382.19,
          "en": "Your action will receive the payload",
          "zh": "action 會把傳給 dispatch 函式的"
        },
        {
          "id": 130,
          "start": 382.19,
          "end": 384.89,
          "en": "that was added to the dispatch function",
          "zh": "payload，"
        },
        {
          "id": 131,
          "start": 385.79,
          "end": 388.83,
          "en": "like value here, or like this second object",
          "zh": "例如這裡的 value，或是這第二個物件，"
        },
        {
          "id": 132,
          "start": 388.83,
          "end": 390.53,
          "en": "as an extra argument.",
          "zh": "作為額外的引數收到。"
        },
        {
          "id": 133,
          "start": 390.53,
          "end": 392.83,
          "en": "So here we will automatically get payload,",
          "zh": "所以這裡會自動收到 payload，"
        },
        {
          "id": 134,
          "start": 392.83,
          "end": 396.263,
          "en": "which we then can forward to the committed mutation.",
          "zh": "接著就能把它轉交給要 commit 的 mutation。"
        },
        {
          "id": 135,
          "start": 397.56,
          "end": 399.86,
          "en": "So this is how we can set up an action",
          "zh": "這就是設定一個"
        },
        {
          "id": 136,
          "start": 399.86,
          "end": 401.73,
          "en": "that also has a payload",
          "zh": "帶有 payload，"
        },
        {
          "id": 137,
          "start": 401.73,
          "end": 404.93,
          "en": "and forwards that payload to the mutation.",
          "zh": "並把 payload 轉交給 mutation 的 action 的方式。"
        },
        {
          "id": 138,
          "start": 404.93,
          "end": 407.27,
          "en": "Of course, you could also change the payload",
          "zh": "當然，你也可以在 commit mutation 之前"
        },
        {
          "id": 139,
          "start": 407.27,
          "end": 409.24,
          "en": "before you commit this mutation.",
          "zh": "修改 payload。"
        },
        {
          "id": 140,
          "start": 409.24,
          "end": 411.99,
          "en": "You can do whatever you wanna do in this action.",
          "zh": "在 action 中你想做什麼都可以，"
        },
        {
          "id": 141,
          "start": 411.99,
          "end": 414.86,
          "en": "Whatever needs to be done for your application",
          "zh": "只要是讓應用程式"
        },
        {
          "id": 142,
          "start": 414.86,
          "end": 416.033,
          "en": "to work correctly.",
          "zh": "正確運作所需要的事。"
        },
        {
          "id": 143,
          "start": 417.67,
          "end": 419.49,
          "en": "But let's get back to the Components.",
          "zh": "我們回到元件。"
        },
        {
          "id": 144,
          "start": 419.49,
          "end": 424.17,
          "en": "We dispatch Actions just as we committed Mutations",
          "zh": "dispatch actions 的方式就像 commit mutations 一樣，"
        },
        {
          "id": 145,
          "start": 424.17,
          "end": 426.37,
          "en": "with the difference that we now run Actions",
          "zh": "差別只在於現在執行的是 actions，"
        },
        {
          "id": 146,
          "start": 426.37,
          "end": 427.633,
          "en": "instead of Mutations.",
          "zh": "而不是 mutations。"
        },
        {
          "id": 147,
          "start": 428.54,
          "end": 431.23,
          "en": "And therefore we can also do this and change counter",
          "zh": "因此，在 ChangeCounter 中也可以這麼做，"
        },
        {
          "id": 148,
          "start": 431.23,
          "end": 434.263,
          "en": "and simply dispatch the increment action here.",
          "zh": "直接 dispatch increment action。"
        },
        {
          "id": 149,
          "start": 435.44,
          "end": 438.16,
          "en": "And with all those changes in place,",
          "zh": "完成所有這些修改之後，"
        },
        {
          "id": 150,
          "start": 438.16,
          "end": 441.58,
          "en": "if you go back, this still works.",
          "zh": "回到頁面，一切仍然正常運作，"
        },
        {
          "id": 151,
          "start": 441.58,
          "end": 443.54,
          "en": "And only after two seconds",
          "zh": "只是點擊 Add 2 按鈕之後，"
        },
        {
          "id": 152,
          "start": 443.54,
          "end": 447.1,
          "en": "do you add two button click is having an effect.",
          "zh": "要過兩秒才會生效。"
        },
        {
          "id": 153,
          "start": 447.1,
          "end": 450.903,
          "en": "But now we're doing this in the proper way using Actions.",
          "zh": "但現在我們用的是正確的方式，也就是使用 actions。"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "21879764",
      "title": "Understanding the Action \"Context\"",
      "lectureOrder": 220,
      "videoOrder": 193,
      "sourceHash": "bcaee4ddaf34eee76bedeaa0de1ef5ed0c2de0d512c881f02c8af67ac95cb701",
      "cues": [
        {
          "id": 1,
          "start": 2.29,
          "end": 3.96,
          "en": "So actions are important",
          "zh": "所以，actions 對於"
        },
        {
          "id": 2,
          "start": 3.96,
          "end": 6.51,
          "en": "for asynchronous code, and in general,",
          "zh": "非同步程式碼很重要，而且一般來說，"
        },
        {
          "id": 3,
          "start": 6.51,
          "end": 9.65,
          "en": "it is a good practice to use actions.",
          "zh": "使用 actions 是良好的做法。"
        },
        {
          "id": 4,
          "start": 9.65,
          "end": 14.02,
          "en": "Now, I did mention that we have this context, object",
          "zh": "我提過我們會自動收到"
        },
        {
          "id": 5,
          "start": 14.02,
          "end": 16.4,
          "en": "which we get as an argument automatically,",
          "zh": "這個 context 物件作為引數，"
        },
        {
          "id": 6,
          "start": 16.4,
          "end": 19.59,
          "en": "and that it's full of interesting things.",
          "zh": "而且裡面有很多有趣的東西。"
        },
        {
          "id": 7,
          "start": 19.59,
          "end": 22.67,
          "en": "Thus far we're only using the commit method though.",
          "zh": "不過到目前為止，我們只用了 commit 方法。"
        },
        {
          "id": 8,
          "start": 22.67,
          "end": 24.743,
          "en": "So what's inside of context as well?",
          "zh": "那 context 裡面還有什麼呢？"
        },
        {
          "id": 9,
          "start": 25.62,
          "end": 28.17,
          "en": "Well, we can simply console log context",
          "zh": "我們可以直接用 console.log 輸出 context"
        },
        {
          "id": 10,
          "start": 28.17,
          "end": 30.16,
          "en": "to have a look into it.",
          "zh": "來看看裡面有什麼。"
        },
        {
          "id": 11,
          "start": 30.16,
          "end": 34.18,
          "en": "So now I log it in increase so if I run, Add 10,",
          "zh": "我在 increase 中輸出它，所以點擊 Add 10 之後，"
        },
        {
          "id": 12,
          "start": 34.18,
          "end": 36.55,
          "en": "here is the log.",
          "zh": "這裡就是輸出的內容。"
        },
        {
          "id": 13,
          "start": 36.55,
          "end": 40.42,
          "en": "And we see we got this commit method, which we already saw,",
          "zh": "可以看到我們已經用過的 commit 方法，"
        },
        {
          "id": 14,
          "start": 40.42,
          "end": 43.47,
          "en": "but we see a couple of other interesting things.",
          "zh": "還有其他幾個有趣的東西。"
        },
        {
          "id": 15,
          "start": 43.47,
          "end": 46.65,
          "en": "Let's ignore route getters and route state for now,",
          "zh": "rootGetters 和 rootState 我們先忽略，"
        },
        {
          "id": 16,
          "start": 46.65,
          "end": 48.92,
          "en": "but let's have a look at dispatch.",
          "zh": "先來看看 dispatch。"
        },
        {
          "id": 17,
          "start": 48.92,
          "end": 53.363,
          "en": "You can also dispatch a number action from inside an action.",
          "zh": "你也可以在 action 內部 dispatch 另一個 action。"
        },
        {
          "id": 18,
          "start": 54.27,
          "end": 57.66,
          "en": "This can be helpful if you're sending an HTTP request,",
          "zh": "這在發送 HTTP 請求時很有用："
        },
        {
          "id": 19,
          "start": 57.66,
          "end": 61.12,
          "en": "and if it succeeds, you wanna trigger a success action,",
          "zh": "如果請求成功，你想觸發一個處理成功的 action；"
        },
        {
          "id": 20,
          "start": 61.12,
          "end": 62.39,
          "en": "if you get an error,",
          "zh": "如果出錯，"
        },
        {
          "id": 21,
          "start": 62.39,
          "end": 65.52,
          "en": "you wanna trigger an error handling action.",
          "zh": "則想觸發一個處理錯誤的 action。"
        },
        {
          "id": 22,
          "start": 65.52,
          "end": 67.3,
          "en": "Then you could have one action",
          "zh": "這樣就能有一個 action，"
        },
        {
          "id": 23,
          "start": 67.3,
          "end": 69.99,
          "en": "that dispatches multiple other actions",
          "zh": "根據 HTTP 請求的不同結果，"
        },
        {
          "id": 24,
          "start": 69.99,
          "end": 73.883,
          "en": "in reaction to different results of HTTP request.",
          "zh": "dispatch 多個其他 actions。"
        },
        {
          "id": 25,
          "start": 75.05,
          "end": 76.76,
          "en": "You can also access getters",
          "zh": "你也可以存取 getters，"
        },
        {
          "id": 26,
          "start": 76.76,
          "end": 79.8,
          "en": "in case your action needs some calculated value,",
          "zh": "以便在 action 需要某個"
        },
        {
          "id": 27,
          "start": 79.8,
          "end": 81.563,
          "en": "which would arrive in some getter.",
          "zh": "由 getter 計算出來的值時使用。"
        },
        {
          "id": 28,
          "start": 83.92,
          "end": 86.78999999999999,
          "en": "And you can also directly tap into the state,",
          "zh": "你也可以直接存取 state，"
        },
        {
          "id": 29,
          "start": 86.78999999999999,
          "end": 89.9,
          "en": "in case getting access to the getters might not be enough.",
          "zh": "以防光是存取 getters 還不夠。"
        },
        {
          "id": 30,
          "start": 89.9,
          "end": 91.72,
          "en": "You should not manipulate",
          "zh": "不過，你不應該在 action 內部"
        },
        {
          "id": 31,
          "start": 91.72,
          "end": 94.52000000000001,
          "en": "the state from inside the action though.",
          "zh": "直接操作 state，"
        },
        {
          "id": 32,
          "start": 94.52000000000001,
          "end": 96.733,
          "en": "Always use a mutation for that.",
          "zh": "一定要透過 mutation 來修改。"
        },
        {
          "id": 33,
          "start": 98.18,
          "end": 101.16,
          "en": "So that's context and these are actions",
          "zh": "這就是 context，以及 actions。"
        },
        {
          "id": 34,
          "start": 101.16,
          "end": 102.793,
          "en": "and with state,",
          "zh": "透過 state、"
        },
        {
          "id": 35,
          "start": 104.42,
          "end": 106.34,
          "en": "mutations,",
          "zh": "mutations、"
        },
        {
          "id": 36,
          "start": 106.34,
          "end": 109.18,
          "en": "actions and getters,",
          "zh": "actions 和 getters，"
        },
        {
          "id": 37,
          "start": 109.18,
          "end": 112.37,
          "en": "we get the core concepts vuex uses",
          "zh": "我們就掌握了 Vuex 用來"
        },
        {
          "id": 38,
          "start": 112.37,
          "end": 115.97999999999999,
          "en": "to manage state application wide",
          "zh": "管理整個應用程式狀態的核心概念，"
        },
        {
          "id": 39,
          "start": 115.97999999999999,
          "end": 118.00999999999999,
          "en": "which you can then use conveniently",
          "zh": "並且可以在任何元件內部"
        },
        {
          "id": 40,
          "start": 118.00999999999999,
          "end": 120.263,
          "en": "from inside any component.",
          "zh": "方便地使用它們。"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "21879770",
      "title": "Using Mapper Helpers",
      "lectureOrder": 221,
      "videoOrder": 194,
      "sourceHash": "0efa85fe672dda92547f7595c720e319e4d39805b80e44b6ef094c6f93c84b34",
      "cues": [
        {
          "id": 1,
          "start": 2.13,
          "end": 4.92,
          "en": "Now we know the core Vuex features,",
          "zh": "現在我們已經認識 Vuex 的核心功能，"
        },
        {
          "id": 2,
          "start": 4.92,
          "end": 8.4,
          "en": "we'll see it in a more realistic app in a second.",
          "zh": "稍後會在更貼近實際的應用程式中看到它。"
        },
        {
          "id": 3,
          "start": 8.4,
          "end": 10.41,
          "en": "Before we go there though,",
          "zh": "不過在那之前，"
        },
        {
          "id": 4,
          "start": 10.41,
          "end": 13.44,
          "en": "let's talk about a couple of utility features,",
          "zh": "我們先來談談幾個實用功能，"
        },
        {
          "id": 5,
          "start": 13.44,
          "end": 17.48,
          "en": "which make our life as a developer a bit easier.",
          "zh": "它們能讓開發工作輕鬆一點。"
        },
        {
          "id": 6,
          "start": 17.48,
          "end": 20.47,
          "en": "And let's start with mappers.",
          "zh": "我們先從 mappers 開始。"
        },
        {
          "id": 7,
          "start": 20.47,
          "end": 22.47,
          "en": "In the counter, for example,",
          "zh": "例如在 Counter 中，"
        },
        {
          "id": 8,
          "start": 22.47,
          "end": 26.8,
          "en": "we have this counter computed property,",
          "zh": "我們有這個 counter 計算屬性，"
        },
        {
          "id": 9,
          "start": 26.8,
          "end": 27.7,
          "en": "where we in the end,",
          "zh": "說到底，它只是"
        },
        {
          "id": 10,
          "start": 27.7,
          "end": 30.503,
          "en": "just access our final counter getter.",
          "zh": "存取 finalCounter getter。"
        },
        {
          "id": 11,
          "start": 31.47,
          "end": 36.09,
          "en": "So we have this code here just to get access to our getter.",
          "zh": "所以這段程式碼只是為了取得 getter。"
        },
        {
          "id": 12,
          "start": 36.09,
          "end": 38.16,
          "en": "Now, this is obviously not a lot of code,",
          "zh": "這段程式碼顯然不多，"
        },
        {
          "id": 13,
          "start": 38.16,
          "end": 40.58,
          "en": "but we're not doing anything besides",
          "zh": "但它除了深入存取 store 之外，"
        },
        {
          "id": 14,
          "start": 40.58,
          "end": 43.18,
          "en": "drilling into our store.",
          "zh": "什麼也沒做。"
        },
        {
          "id": 15,
          "start": 43.18,
          "end": 44.25,
          "en": "This is not horrible.",
          "zh": "這並不糟糕，"
        },
        {
          "id": 16,
          "start": 44.25,
          "end": 46.21,
          "en": "But in case you're not happy with that",
          "zh": "但如果你不喜歡這樣，"
        },
        {
          "id": 17,
          "start": 46.21,
          "end": 48.92,
          "en": "Vuex has a helper which you can use.",
          "zh": "Vuex 提供了一個輔助工具。"
        },
        {
          "id": 18,
          "start": 48.92,
          "end": 51.55,
          "en": "You can import something from Vuex,",
          "zh": "你可以從 Vuex 匯入一個東西，"
        },
        {
          "id": 19,
          "start": 51.55,
          "end": 56.363,
          "en": "and that something is a mapGetters function.",
          "zh": "也就是 mapGetters 函式，"
        },
        {
          "id": 20,
          "start": 57.74,
          "end": 60.4,
          "en": "You can use it inside of this computed object.",
          "zh": "並在這個 computed 物件中使用它。"
        },
        {
          "id": 21,
          "start": 60.4,
          "end": 63.94,
          "en": "Instead of defining a computed property on your own,",
          "zh": "不必自己定義計算屬性，"
        },
        {
          "id": 22,
          "start": 63.94,
          "end": 66.77,
          "en": "you can call mapGetters here.",
          "zh": "而是在這裡呼叫 mapGetters。"
        },
        {
          "id": 23,
          "start": 66.77,
          "end": 70.27,
          "en": "And this will return an object which you can then spread",
          "zh": "它會回傳一個物件，接著可以用"
        },
        {
          "id": 24,
          "start": 70.27,
          "end": 72.61,
          "en": "with the free.spread operator",
          "zh": "展開運算子把這個物件"
        },
        {
          "id": 25,
          "start": 72.61,
          "end": 75.543,
          "en": "into your computed property object.",
          "zh": "展開到計算屬性物件中。"
        },
        {
          "id": 26,
          "start": 76.4,
          "end": 80.05,
          "en": "So mapGetters gives you an object, which we now merge",
          "zh": "所以 mapGetters 給你一個物件，我們把它合併"
        },
        {
          "id": 27,
          "start": 80.05,
          "end": 82.07300000000001,
          "en": "into the computed properties object.",
          "zh": "到計算屬性物件中，"
        },
        {
          "id": 28,
          "start": 82.95,
          "end": 85.5,
          "en": "Because the object mapGetters will give you",
          "zh": "因為 mapGetters 給你的物件"
        },
        {
          "id": 29,
          "start": 85.5,
          "end": 88.17,
          "en": "is an object full of computed properties,",
          "zh": "裡面全是計算屬性，"
        },
        {
          "id": 30,
          "start": 88.17,
          "end": 90.85300000000001,
          "en": "which are defined automatically for you.",
          "zh": "而且都是自動幫你定義好的。"
        },
        {
          "id": 31,
          "start": 91.71000000000001,
          "end": 92.56,
          "en": "Well, now,",
          "zh": "那麼，"
        },
        {
          "id": 32,
          "start": 92.56,
          "end": 95.25,
          "en": "which computed properties do we get here?",
          "zh": "我們會得到哪些計算屬性呢？"
        },
        {
          "id": 33,
          "start": 95.25,
          "end": 98.56,
          "en": "Well, mapGetters takes an array as an argument.",
          "zh": "mapGetters 接收一個陣列作為引數，"
        },
        {
          "id": 34,
          "start": 98.56,
          "end": 103.42,
          "en": "And in here, you list all getter names as strings,",
          "zh": "你要在裡面以字串列出所有"
        },
        {
          "id": 35,
          "start": 103.42,
          "end": 104.71000000000001,
          "en": "which you want to have",
          "zh": "想在這個元件中"
        },
        {
          "id": 36,
          "start": 104.71000000000001,
          "end": 107.47999999999999,
          "en": "as computed properties in this component.",
          "zh": "作為計算屬性的 getter 名稱。"
        },
        {
          "id": 37,
          "start": 107.47999999999999,
          "end": 110.32,
          "en": "So in this case, for example, the final counter,",
          "zh": "例如這裡是 finalCounter，"
        },
        {
          "id": 38,
          "start": 110.32,
          "end": 112.87,
          "en": "but of course, we could have multiple getters here.",
          "zh": "當然也可以列出多個 getters。"
        },
        {
          "id": 39,
          "start": 113.74000000000001,
          "end": 115.97999999999999,
          "en": "And now this will give us a final counter",
          "zh": "這樣就會在這個元件中產生一個 finalCounter"
        },
        {
          "id": 40,
          "start": 115.97999999999999,
          "end": 118.36,
          "en": "computed property in this component,",
          "zh": "計算屬性，"
        },
        {
          "id": 41,
          "start": 118.36,
          "end": 122.053,
          "en": "which automatically points at the finalCounter getter.",
          "zh": "它會自動指向 finalCounter getter。"
        },
        {
          "id": 42,
          "start": 123.97,
          "end": 124.803,
          "en": "And with that,",
          "zh": "這樣一來，"
        },
        {
          "id": 43,
          "start": 124.803,
          "end": 127.34,
          "en": "we just need to change this here to finalCounter,",
          "zh": "只要把這裡改成 finalCounter，"
        },
        {
          "id": 44,
          "start": 127.34,
          "end": 130.29,
          "en": "because that will be the computed property name.",
          "zh": "因為那就是計算屬性的名稱。"
        },
        {
          "id": 45,
          "start": 130.29,
          "end": 132.24,
          "en": "And then if we reload,",
          "zh": "接著重新載入，"
        },
        {
          "id": 46,
          "start": 132.24,
          "end": 134.37,
          "en": "it still works as before.",
          "zh": "一切仍然和之前一樣正常運作。"
        },
        {
          "id": 47,
          "start": 134.37,
          "end": 136.12,
          "en": "But now with mapGetters,",
          "zh": "但有了 mapGetters，"
        },
        {
          "id": 48,
          "start": 136.12,
          "end": 138.5,
          "en": "especially when you use multiple getters",
          "zh": "尤其是在某個元件中"
        },
        {
          "id": 49,
          "start": 138.5,
          "end": 139.86,
          "en": "in a given component,",
          "zh": "使用多個 getters 時，"
        },
        {
          "id": 50,
          "start": 139.86,
          "end": 141.98,
          "en": "you might be able to save some code",
          "zh": "可能就能省下一些程式碼，"
        },
        {
          "id": 51,
          "start": 141.98,
          "end": 145.973,
          "en": "and not drill unnecessarily into the store all the time.",
          "zh": "不必一直不必要地深入存取 store。"
        },
        {
          "id": 52,
          "start": 147.66,
          "end": 151.37,
          "en": "Now, we have something similar for state and mutations,",
          "zh": "state 和 mutations 也有類似的工具，"
        },
        {
          "id": 53,
          "start": 151.37,
          "end": 154.84,
          "en": "but you don't really use those in your components anyways.",
          "zh": "但反正你在元件中也不太會直接用到它們。"
        },
        {
          "id": 54,
          "start": 154.84,
          "end": 157.32,
          "en": "So let's have a look at mapActions then,",
          "zh": "所以我們來看看 mapActions，"
        },
        {
          "id": 55,
          "start": 157.32,
          "end": 161.8,
          "en": "which also exists to mapActions into your components.",
          "zh": "它可以把 actions 對應到元件中。"
        },
        {
          "id": 56,
          "start": 161.8,
          "end": 163.44,
          "en": "How does this look like?",
          "zh": "它長什麼樣子呢？"
        },
        {
          "id": 57,
          "start": 163.44,
          "end": 164.98,
          "en": "Let's say in change counter,",
          "zh": "假設在 ChangeCounter 中，"
        },
        {
          "id": 58,
          "start": 164.98,
          "end": 167.98,
          "en": "we don't manually want to define methods,",
          "zh": "我們不想手動定義方法，"
        },
        {
          "id": 59,
          "start": 167.98,
          "end": 170.95,
          "en": "which in the end also just drill into the store",
          "zh": "因為這些方法說到底也只是深入 store"
        },
        {
          "id": 60,
          "start": 170.95,
          "end": 173.53300000000002,
          "en": "to dispatch some action here.",
          "zh": "dispatch 某個 action。"
        },
        {
          "id": 61,
          "start": 174.73,
          "end": 177.86,
          "en": "Instead, we could just as with getters,",
          "zh": "我們可以像 getters 一樣，"
        },
        {
          "id": 62,
          "start": 177.86,
          "end": 182.09,
          "en": "import something from Vuex,",
          "zh": "從 Vuex 匯入一個東西，"
        },
        {
          "id": 63,
          "start": 182.09,
          "end": 185.62,
          "en": "and that something here is mapActions.",
          "zh": "這次是 mapActions。"
        },
        {
          "id": 64,
          "start": 187.35,
          "end": 191.14,
          "en": "Now, just as with mapGetters we call mapActions.",
          "zh": "就像 mapGetters 一樣，我們呼叫 mapActions，"
        },
        {
          "id": 65,
          "start": 191.14,
          "end": 193.59,
          "en": "Now inside of methods though,",
          "zh": "不過是在 methods 中，"
        },
        {
          "id": 66,
          "start": 193.59,
          "end": 195.16,
          "en": "not inside of computed,",
          "zh": "不是在 computed 中，"
        },
        {
          "id": 67,
          "start": 195.16,
          "end": 197.11,
          "en": "but inside of methods.",
          "zh": "而是在 methods 中，"
        },
        {
          "id": 68,
          "start": 197.11,
          "end": 200.61,
          "en": "We call mapActions, like this.",
          "zh": "像這樣呼叫 mapActions，"
        },
        {
          "id": 69,
          "start": 200.61,
          "end": 203.84,
          "en": "And again get back an object which we merge",
          "zh": "同樣會得到一個物件，再用展開運算子"
        },
        {
          "id": 70,
          "start": 203.84,
          "end": 207.173,
          "en": "with the methods object by using the spread operator.",
          "zh": "把它合併到 methods 物件中。"
        },
        {
          "id": 71,
          "start": 208.04,
          "end": 211.25,
          "en": "MapActions now also takes an array.",
          "zh": "mapActions 同樣接收一個陣列，"
        },
        {
          "id": 72,
          "start": 211.25,
          "end": 214.09,
          "en": "And now here we define all the action names,",
          "zh": "在這裡定義所有"
        },
        {
          "id": 73,
          "start": 214.09,
          "end": 217.84,
          "en": "which we wanna have as methods in this component.",
          "zh": "想在這個元件中作為方法的 action 名稱，"
        },
        {
          "id": 74,
          "start": 217.84,
          "end": 219.82,
          "en": "So in this case, increment.",
          "zh": "在這個例子中是 increment。"
        },
        {
          "id": 75,
          "start": 219.82,
          "end": 222.66,
          "en": "But of course, we could also add the increase action here",
          "zh": "當然，也可以在這裡加入 increase action，"
        },
        {
          "id": 76,
          "start": 222.66,
          "end": 226.82,
          "en": "to map both actions to methods in this component.",
          "zh": "把兩個 actions 都對應成這個元件的方法。"
        },
        {
          "id": 77,
          "start": 226.82,
          "end": 230.31,
          "en": "And these methods will be created for you by mapActions.",
          "zh": "這些方法會由 mapActions 幫你建立，"
        },
        {
          "id": 78,
          "start": 230.31,
          "end": 232.163,
          "en": "That's the idea behind using it.",
          "zh": "這就是使用它的目的。"
        },
        {
          "id": 79,
          "start": 233.75,
          "end": 236.96,
          "en": "Now with that, we could add a second button",
          "zh": "這樣一來，我們可以加入第二個按鈕，"
        },
        {
          "id": 80,
          "start": 236.96,
          "end": 240.3,
          "en": "and on the first button, call increment.",
          "zh": "在第一個按鈕上呼叫 increment，"
        },
        {
          "id": 81,
          "start": 240.3,
          "end": 241.76,
          "en": "That's the name of the method",
          "zh": "也就是為 increment action"
        },
        {
          "id": 82,
          "start": 241.76,
          "end": 245.09,
          "en": "which will be created for the increment action",
          "zh": "建立的方法名稱，"
        },
        {
          "id": 83,
          "start": 245.09,
          "end": 247.853,
          "en": "and point at increase on the second button.",
          "zh": "而第二個按鈕則指向 increase。"
        },
        {
          "id": 84,
          "start": 248.75,
          "end": 251.47,
          "en": "Now, of course here we need a payload.",
          "zh": "當然，這裡需要 payload，"
        },
        {
          "id": 85,
          "start": 251.47,
          "end": 256.35,
          "en": "And you can simply pass your payload as an argument then.",
          "zh": "只要把 payload 當作引數傳進去就好，"
        },
        {
          "id": 86,
          "start": 256.35,
          "end": 260.36,
          "en": "So in this case, an object with a value of 10.",
          "zh": "在這個例子中，就是一個 value 為 10 的物件，"
        },
        {
          "id": 87,
          "start": 260.36,
          "end": 263.67,
          "en": "Because we expect a payload in our store,",
          "zh": "因為我們在 store 中預期的 payload"
        },
        {
          "id": 88,
          "start": 263.67,
          "end": 265.163,
          "en": "which will be an object,",
          "zh": "是一個物件，"
        },
        {
          "id": 89,
          "start": 266.03,
          "end": 268.68,
          "en": "which has a value property.",
          "zh": "並帶有 value 屬性。"
        },
        {
          "id": 90,
          "start": 268.68,
          "end": 271.78,
          "en": "So that's why we pass an object with a value property here",
          "zh": "所以這裡把帶有 value 屬性的物件"
        },
        {
          "id": 91,
          "start": 271.78,
          "end": 276.26,
          "en": "simply as an argument to this automatically created method.",
          "zh": "作為引數傳給這個自動建立的方法。"
        },
        {
          "id": 92,
          "start": 276.26,
          "end": 279.35,
          "en": "With that, we can change this button caption",
          "zh": "接著可以把這個按鈕的文字"
        },
        {
          "id": 93,
          "start": 279.35,
          "end": 282.65,
          "en": "maybe to 11 to tell it apart from the other button,",
          "zh": "改成 11，好和另一個按鈕區分，"
        },
        {
          "id": 94,
          "start": 282.65,
          "end": 284.05,
          "en": "also change the value.",
          "zh": "也修改數值。"
        },
        {
          "id": 95,
          "start": 284.05,
          "end": 285.9,
          "en": "And with that,",
          "zh": "這樣一來，"
        },
        {
          "id": 96,
          "start": 285.9,
          "end": 289.2,
          "en": "now we got this new button, which also works.",
          "zh": "新按鈕也能正常運作了。"
        },
        {
          "id": 97,
          "start": 289.2,
          "end": 291.51,
          "en": "So now we're also mapping actions",
          "zh": "所以現在我們也對應了 actions，"
        },
        {
          "id": 98,
          "start": 291.51,
          "end": 293.61,
          "en": "and this saves us the time to",
          "zh": "省去自己"
        },
        {
          "id": 99,
          "start": 293.61,
          "end": 295.973,
          "en": "add to those methods on our own.",
          "zh": "加入這些方法的時間。"
        },
        {
          "id": 100,
          "start": 297.21,
          "end": 300.7,
          "en": "There also is an alternative way of mapping actions,",
          "zh": "還有另一種對應 actions 的方式，"
        },
        {
          "id": 101,
          "start": 300.7,
          "end": 303.8,
          "en": "in case you're not happy with the default names,",
          "zh": "如果你不喜歡預設的名稱，"
        },
        {
          "id": 102,
          "start": 303.8,
          "end": 306.06,
          "en": "you can also call mapActions",
          "zh": "也可以呼叫 mapActions，"
        },
        {
          "id": 103,
          "start": 306.06,
          "end": 310.36,
          "en": "and not pass an array to it but an object instead.",
          "zh": "但不傳入陣列，而是傳入物件，"
        },
        {
          "id": 104,
          "start": 310.36,
          "end": 312.78,
          "en": "And then you can define the method names",
          "zh": "然後把元件中想要的方法名稱"
        },
        {
          "id": 105,
          "start": 312.78,
          "end": 316.92,
          "en": "you want to have in your component as keys.",
          "zh": "定義為鍵，"
        },
        {
          "id": 106,
          "start": 316.92,
          "end": 318.41,
          "en": "For example, inc,",
          "zh": "例如 inc，"
        },
        {
          "id": 107,
          "start": 318.41,
          "end": 320.33,
          "en": "and then hold the action",
          "zh": "並把要對應到這個方法的 action"
        },
        {
          "id": 108,
          "start": 320.33,
          "end": 323.573,
          "en": "which should be mapped to this method as a value.",
          "zh": "作為值。"
        },
        {
          "id": 109,
          "start": 325.13,
          "end": 330.13,
          "en": "So with that, we could go with inc and increase like this.",
          "zh": "所以可以像這樣使用 inc 和 increase。"
        },
        {
          "id": 110,
          "start": 330.19,
          "end": 332.22,
          "en": "And with that, the increment action",
          "zh": "這樣一來，increment action"
        },
        {
          "id": 111,
          "start": 332.22,
          "end": 334.11,
          "en": "would be mapped to an inc method,",
          "zh": "就會對應到 inc 方法，"
        },
        {
          "id": 112,
          "start": 334.11,
          "end": 337.15999999999997,
          "en": "increase would be mapped to an increased method.",
          "zh": "increase 則對應到 increase 方法。"
        },
        {
          "id": 113,
          "start": 337.15999999999997,
          "end": 338.96,
          "en": "And therefore we would have to call",
          "zh": "因此現在要呼叫 increment，"
        },
        {
          "id": 114,
          "start": 338.96,
          "end": 341.353,
          "en": "increment by calling inc now,",
          "zh": "就必須呼叫 inc，"
        },
        {
          "id": 115,
          "start": 342.86,
          "end": 344.06,
          "en": "increase stays increase,",
          "zh": "increase 仍然是 increase，"
        },
        {
          "id": 116,
          "start": 344.06,
          "end": 346.51,
          "en": "because that's how I'm mapping it.",
          "zh": "因為我就是這樣對應的。"
        },
        {
          "id": 117,
          "start": 346.51,
          "end": 348.52,
          "en": "And with data of course,",
          "zh": "當然，如果試試看，"
        },
        {
          "id": 118,
          "start": 348.52,
          "end": 351.363,
          "en": "that would still work if we try this.",
          "zh": "這樣仍然可以運作。"
        },
        {
          "id": 119,
          "start": 352.25,
          "end": 355.563,
          "en": "So mapActions and mapGetters can be very, very useful.",
          "zh": "所以 mapActions 和 mapGetters 非常非常實用。"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "21879776",
      "title": "Example: Adding More State",
      "lectureOrder": 222,
      "videoOrder": 195,
      "sourceHash": "f472e93c6ce9d8dd3c6d520d14cf8abb57d02ec473780f8a072fc57776e548c5",
      "cues": [
        {
          "id": 1,
          "start": 2.18,
          "end": 5.18,
          "en": "Now let's say our application is growing",
          "zh": "假設我們的應用程式持續成長，"
        },
        {
          "id": 2,
          "start": 5.18,
          "end": 8.25,
          "en": "and besides this awesome counter feature,",
          "zh": "除了這個超棒的計數器功能之外，"
        },
        {
          "id": 3,
          "start": 8.25,
          "end": 11.69,
          "en": "we now also got a user auth component,",
          "zh": "現在還有一個 UserAuth 元件，"
        },
        {
          "id": 4,
          "start": 11.69,
          "end": 14.92,
          "en": "which deals with user authentication.",
          "zh": "負責處理使用者驗證。"
        },
        {
          "id": 5,
          "start": 14.92,
          "end": 19.92,
          "en": "So in there we have a button where we say log in",
          "zh": "裡面有一個寫著 Login 的按鈕"
        },
        {
          "id": 6,
          "start": 22.21,
          "end": 24.82,
          "en": "and a button where we say log out",
          "zh": "和一個寫著 Logout 的按鈕，"
        },
        {
          "id": 7,
          "start": 24.82,
          "end": 26.73,
          "en": "and it's depends on the off state,",
          "zh": "要顯示哪個按鈕，"
        },
        {
          "id": 8,
          "start": 26.73,
          "end": 28.38,
          "en": "which button we're going to show.",
          "zh": "取決於驗證狀態。"
        },
        {
          "id": 9,
          "start": 29.47,
          "end": 31.99,
          "en": "Now, of course we could manage this locally into component,",
          "zh": "當然，我們可以在元件中區域管理這個狀態，"
        },
        {
          "id": 10,
          "start": 31.99,
          "end": 34.14,
          "en": "but again, authentication might matter",
          "zh": "但同樣地，驗證可能與"
        },
        {
          "id": 11,
          "start": 34.14,
          "end": 36.08,
          "en": "to a lot of parts of zap.",
          "zh": "應用程式的許多部分都有關，"
        },
        {
          "id": 12,
          "start": 36.08,
          "end": 39.313,
          "en": "So we wanna manage it with UX and stat.",
          "zh": "所以我們想用 Vuex 來管理它。"
        },
        {
          "id": 13,
          "start": 41.66,
          "end": 44.59,
          "en": "here I just got this template with the two buttons",
          "zh": "這裡我準備了這個包含兩個按鈕的範本，"
        },
        {
          "id": 14,
          "start": 44.59,
          "end": 49.59,
          "en": "and app view, I'm now going to import user off",
          "zh": "現在要在 App.vue 中從 components/UserAuth.vue"
        },
        {
          "id": 15,
          "start": 50.04,
          "end": 53.97,
          "en": "from components user off dot view",
          "zh": "匯入 UserAuth，"
        },
        {
          "id": 16,
          "start": 53.97,
          "end": 57.373,
          "en": "and register this as a new component user off.",
          "zh": "並把它註冊為新元件 user-auth。"
        },
        {
          "id": 17,
          "start": 58.25,
          "end": 60.11,
          "en": "And therefore we can now use this",
          "zh": "因此現在就可以使用它。"
        },
        {
          "id": 18,
          "start": 60.11,
          "end": 62.2,
          "en": "and I will create a new container here",
          "zh": "我會在這裡建立一個新的容器，"
        },
        {
          "id": 19,
          "start": 62.2,
          "end": 64.18,
          "en": "to show it visually",
          "zh": "在視覺上表示"
        },
        {
          "id": 20,
          "start": 64.18,
          "end": 68.833,
          "en": "that does this a different part of the app user off,",
          "zh": "這是應用程式中另一個部分，也就是 user-auth，"
        },
        {
          "id": 21,
          "start": 71.4,
          "end": 75.81,
          "en": "give this container a title prop off.",
          "zh": "並給這個容器一個 title prop，設為 Auth。"
        },
        {
          "id": 22,
          "start": 75.81,
          "end": 78.5,
          "en": "and make sure I only show the first container.",
          "zh": "同時確保只有在已驗證時"
        },
        {
          "id": 23,
          "start": 78.5,
          "end": 81.08,
          "en": "If we are authenticated.",
          "zh": "才顯示第一個容器。"
        },
        {
          "id": 24,
          "start": 81.08,
          "end": 82.85,
          "en": "Now at the moment we see those buttons,",
          "zh": "目前看得到這些按鈕，"
        },
        {
          "id": 25,
          "start": 82.85,
          "end": 85.23,
          "en": "but of course they don't do anything.",
          "zh": "但它們當然還不會有任何作用。"
        },
        {
          "id": 26,
          "start": 85.23,
          "end": 88.91,
          "en": "Well, that's something we can fix with UX.",
          "zh": "這可以用 Vuex 來解決。"
        },
        {
          "id": 27,
          "start": 88.91,
          "end": 92.1,
          "en": "And before I dive into the utility features",
          "zh": "在深入探討管理大型應用程式、"
        },
        {
          "id": 28,
          "start": 92.1,
          "end": 94.88,
          "en": "we have for managing bigger applications",
          "zh": "處理不同類型狀態的"
        },
        {
          "id": 29,
          "start": 94.88,
          "end": 96.56,
          "en": "with different kinds of state.",
          "zh": "實用功能之前，"
        },
        {
          "id": 30,
          "start": 96.56,
          "end": 98.28999999999999,
          "en": "Here's a quick pause,",
          "zh": "先暫停一下，"
        },
        {
          "id": 31,
          "start": 98.28999999999999,
          "end": 102.72,
          "en": "which you can use to add the functionality in UX,",
          "zh": "你可以利用這段時間用 Vuex 加入功能："
        },
        {
          "id": 32,
          "start": 102.72,
          "end": 105.959,
          "en": "to react to a log in and a log out click",
          "zh": "回應登入和登出的點擊，"
        },
        {
          "id": 33,
          "start": 105.959,
          "end": 109.38,
          "en": "to manage some is locked in state",
          "zh": "管理一個 isLoggedIn 狀態，"
        },
        {
          "id": 34,
          "start": 109.38,
          "end": 111.89,
          "en": "to show just one of the two buttons",
          "zh": "只顯示兩個按鈕中的一個，"
        },
        {
          "id": 35,
          "start": 111.89,
          "end": 114.95,
          "en": "and to show or hide this base container",
          "zh": "並根據驗證狀態"
        },
        {
          "id": 36,
          "start": 114.95,
          "end": 117.72,
          "en": "based on the off state.",
          "zh": "顯示或隱藏這個 base-container。"
        },
        {
          "id": 37,
          "start": 117.72,
          "end": 121.63,
          "en": "So add a new state and all the getters mutations and actions",
          "zh": "所以，請加入新的狀態，以及所有"
        },
        {
          "id": 38,
          "start": 121.63,
          "end": 125.23,
          "en": "you might need to manage this is locked in state,",
          "zh": "管理這個 isLoggedIn 狀態可能需要的 getters、mutations 和 actions，"
        },
        {
          "id": 39,
          "start": 125.23,
          "end": 127.73,
          "en": "which can be true or false in the end.",
          "zh": "這個狀態最終會是 true 或 false。"
        },
        {
          "id": 40,
          "start": 127.73,
          "end": 130.69,
          "en": "Here's a chance for you to pause the video thereafter",
          "zh": "現在你可以暫停影片，之後"
        },
        {
          "id": 41,
          "start": 130.69,
          "end": 132.323,
          "en": "we'll implement it together.",
          "zh": "我們再一起實作。"
        },
        {
          "id": 42,
          "start": 134.93,
          "end": 136.3,
          "en": "Where are your successful?",
          "zh": "你成功了嗎？"
        },
        {
          "id": 43,
          "start": 136.3,
          "end": 137.78300000000002,
          "en": "Let's do it together now.",
          "zh": "現在我們一起來做。"
        },
        {
          "id": 44,
          "start": 139.19,
          "end": 141.87,
          "en": "So I wanna manage an off state.",
          "zh": "我想管理一個驗證狀態，"
        },
        {
          "id": 45,
          "start": 141.87,
          "end": 146.12,
          "en": "So in my state and my story here, I will have-",
          "zh": "所以在 store 的 state 中，我會加入"
        },
        {
          "id": 46,
          "start": 146.12,
          "end": 148.12,
          "en": "is locked in state.",
          "zh": "isLoggedIn 狀態。"
        },
        {
          "id": 47,
          "start": 148.12,
          "end": 149.73,
          "en": "Of course, the name is up to you,",
          "zh": "當然，名稱由你決定，"
        },
        {
          "id": 48,
          "start": 149.73,
          "end": 151.7,
          "en": "which initially is false let's say",
          "zh": "假設初始值是 false。"
        },
        {
          "id": 49,
          "start": 153.07,
          "end": 157.43,
          "en": "now in order to change it, I want one or two mutations,",
          "zh": "接著為了修改它，我需要一個或兩個 mutations，"
        },
        {
          "id": 50,
          "start": 157.43,
          "end": 160.063,
          "en": "depending on how you decide the mutation,",
          "zh": "取決於你如何設計 mutation。"
        },
        {
          "id": 51,
          "start": 161.48,
          "end": 165.24,
          "en": "I will add one mutation and name it set off",
          "zh": "我會加入一個 mutation，命名為 setAuth，"
        },
        {
          "id": 52,
          "start": 166.18,
          "end": 170.39,
          "en": "where I expect to get the state, of course, and the payload",
          "zh": "它當然會收到 state，還有 payload。"
        },
        {
          "id": 53,
          "start": 170.39,
          "end": 172.3,
          "en": "and the payload will be important here",
          "zh": "這裡的 payload 很重要，"
        },
        {
          "id": 54,
          "start": 172.3,
          "end": 175.42000000000002,
          "en": "because it will tell me wherever I wanna set the off state",
          "zh": "因為它會告訴我要把驗證狀態"
        },
        {
          "id": 55,
          "start": 175.42000000000002,
          "end": 178.203,
          "en": "to authenticated or to not authenticated.",
          "zh": "設為已驗證還是未驗證。"
        },
        {
          "id": 56,
          "start": 179.04,
          "end": 181.12,
          "en": "So here I said, state is locked in,",
          "zh": "所以這裡我設定 state.isLoggedIn"
        },
        {
          "id": 57,
          "start": 181.12,
          "end": 184.32,
          "en": "equal to payload is all let's say,",
          "zh": "等於 payload.isAuth，"
        },
        {
          "id": 58,
          "start": 184.32,
          "end": 186.43,
          "en": "and that can be true or false.",
          "zh": "它可以是 true 或 false。"
        },
        {
          "id": 59,
          "start": 186.43,
          "end": 188.1,
          "en": "Now this is just my approach.",
          "zh": "這只是我的做法，"
        },
        {
          "id": 60,
          "start": 188.1,
          "end": 190.02,
          "en": "You probably have a different one",
          "zh": "你的做法可能不同，"
        },
        {
          "id": 61,
          "start": 190.02,
          "end": 191.69,
          "en": "and that might be fine as well.",
          "zh": "那樣也完全沒問題，"
        },
        {
          "id": 62,
          "start": 191.69,
          "end": 193.503,
          "en": "It's just one way of doing it.",
          "zh": "這只是其中一種做法。"
        },
        {
          "id": 63,
          "start": 195.04,
          "end": 196.63,
          "en": "Now that's my mutation,",
          "zh": "這就是我的 mutation，"
        },
        {
          "id": 64,
          "start": 196.63,
          "end": 199.6,
          "en": "but we shouldn't necessarily call mutations",
          "zh": "但如你所學，我們不一定應該"
        },
        {
          "id": 65,
          "start": 199.6,
          "end": 202.34,
          "en": "directly from inside components as you learned.",
          "zh": "直接從元件內部呼叫 mutations，"
        },
        {
          "id": 66,
          "start": 202.34,
          "end": 204.65,
          "en": "So I will add actions.",
          "zh": "所以我會加入 actions。"
        },
        {
          "id": 67,
          "start": 204.65,
          "end": 206.85,
          "en": "Now we could add a set of action,",
          "zh": "我們可以加入一個 setAuth action，"
        },
        {
          "id": 68,
          "start": 206.85,
          "end": 209.11,
          "en": "which basically works like the mutation,",
          "zh": "運作方式基本上和 mutation 一樣；"
        },
        {
          "id": 69,
          "start": 209.11,
          "end": 214.11,
          "en": "or we add two actions to mix things up a log in action",
          "zh": "或者換個做法，加入兩個 actions：login action"
        },
        {
          "id": 70,
          "start": 214.64,
          "end": 217.39,
          "en": "and a log out action.",
          "zh": "和 logout action。"
        },
        {
          "id": 71,
          "start": 217.39,
          "end": 220.233,
          "en": "Again, it's just my way of implementing this.",
          "zh": "同樣地，這只是我的實作方式。"
        },
        {
          "id": 72,
          "start": 221.32,
          "end": 226.32,
          "en": "We get this context object and in log in,",
          "zh": "我們會收到 context 物件，在 login 中，"
        },
        {
          "id": 73,
          "start": 227.49,
          "end": 231.12,
          "en": "I want to commit, set off.",
          "zh": "我想 commit setAuth，"
        },
        {
          "id": 74,
          "start": 231.12,
          "end": 234.7,
          "en": "That's the name of my mutation, this one,",
          "zh": "也就是這個 mutation 的名稱，"
        },
        {
          "id": 75,
          "start": 234.7,
          "end": 238.66,
          "en": "and the payload will be an object here",
          "zh": "而 payload 會是一個物件，"
        },
        {
          "id": 76,
          "start": 238.66,
          "end": 243.66,
          "en": "where I said is off to true because it's the log in action",
          "zh": "我把 isAuth 設為 true，因為這是 login action，"
        },
        {
          "id": 77,
          "start": 243.69,
          "end": 246.74,
          "en": "I want to set the user to logged in.",
          "zh": "我想把使用者設為已登入。"
        },
        {
          "id": 78,
          "start": 246.74,
          "end": 248.84,
          "en": "So dis is off property,",
          "zh": "所以我在 mutation 中讀取的"
        },
        {
          "id": 79,
          "start": 248.84,
          "end": 252.023,
          "en": "which I'm reading here in the mutation is true now.",
          "zh": "isAuth 屬性現在是 true。"
        },
        {
          "id": 80,
          "start": 254.27,
          "end": 257.16,
          "en": "And in log out, it's almost the same.",
          "zh": "logout 幾乎一樣，"
        },
        {
          "id": 81,
          "start": 257.16,
          "end": 261.173,
          "en": "It's the same mutation which I commit, but it's false.",
          "zh": "commit 的是同一個 mutation，只是值為 false。"
        },
        {
          "id": 82,
          "start": 262.61,
          "end": 265.27,
          "en": "Now of course, these actions could be asynchronous",
          "zh": "當然，這些 actions 也可以是非同步的。"
        },
        {
          "id": 83,
          "start": 265.27,
          "end": 267.81,
          "en": "In reality, we are probably sending",
          "zh": "在實際情況中，我們可能會發送"
        },
        {
          "id": 84,
          "start": 267.81,
          "end": 269.87,
          "en": "some HTTP requests around,",
          "zh": "一些 HTTP 請求，"
        },
        {
          "id": 85,
          "start": 269.87,
          "end": 272.11,
          "en": "but here I will not care about that.",
          "zh": "但這裡我不管這部分，"
        },
        {
          "id": 86,
          "start": 272.11,
          "end": 275.46,
          "en": "I will keep it simple and keep it synchronous.",
          "zh": "保持簡單，維持同步。"
        },
        {
          "id": 87,
          "start": 275.46,
          "end": 276.73,
          "en": "But in actions, of course,",
          "zh": "當然，如你所學，"
        },
        {
          "id": 88,
          "start": 276.73,
          "end": 279.513,
          "en": "we could also use asynchronous code as you learned.",
          "zh": "在 actions 中也可以使用非同步程式碼。"
        },
        {
          "id": 89,
          "start": 281.28,
          "end": 282.94,
          "en": "So now we've got actions, mutations,",
          "zh": "現在我們有了 actions、mutations"
        },
        {
          "id": 90,
          "start": 282.94,
          "end": 287.04,
          "en": "and a state what's missing a getter.",
          "zh": "和 state，還缺什麼？一個 getter。"
        },
        {
          "id": 91,
          "start": 287.04,
          "end": 291.12,
          "en": "So I will add a new getter name is up to you.",
          "zh": "所以我要加入一個新的 getter，名稱由你決定，"
        },
        {
          "id": 92,
          "start": 291.12,
          "end": 293.793,
          "en": "I will name it user is authenticated.",
          "zh": "我把它命名為 userIsAuthenticated。"
        },
        {
          "id": 93,
          "start": 295.61,
          "end": 299.89,
          "en": "And here we get our state and I will return.",
          "zh": "這裡會收到 state，然後回傳"
        },
        {
          "id": 94,
          "start": 299.89,
          "end": 304.89,
          "en": "State is logged in, which is true or false.",
          "zh": "state.isLoggedIn，也就是 true 或 false。"
        },
        {
          "id": 95,
          "start": 307.15,
          "end": 309.16,
          "en": "Now I have everything in the store",
          "zh": "現在 store 中已經有"
        },
        {
          "id": 96,
          "start": 309.16,
          "end": 310.76,
          "en": "which you'll want to have there.",
          "zh": "所有需要的東西了。"
        },
        {
          "id": 97,
          "start": 311.89,
          "end": 314.5,
          "en": "With that back and user off.",
          "zh": "接著回到 UserAuth，"
        },
        {
          "id": 98,
          "start": 314.5,
          "end": 316.68,
          "en": "I want to wire up these buttons.",
          "zh": "我想把這些按鈕接起來。"
        },
        {
          "id": 99,
          "start": 316.68,
          "end": 320.74,
          "en": "So I'll add my script part and now add my methods",
          "zh": "所以我會加入 script 區塊，並加入"
        },
        {
          "id": 100,
          "start": 320.74,
          "end": 323.163,
          "en": "for the actions that should be dispatched.",
          "zh": "要 dispatch actions 的方法。"
        },
        {
          "id": 101,
          "start": 324.1,
          "end": 326.24,
          "en": "We could use map actions here,",
          "zh": "這裡可以使用 mapActions，"
        },
        {
          "id": 102,
          "start": 326.24,
          "end": 329.3,
          "en": "or we add the manually totally up to you",
          "zh": "也可以手動加入，完全由你決定。"
        },
        {
          "id": 103,
          "start": 329.3,
          "end": 332.634,
          "en": "to show all approaches, I will add the manually here,",
          "zh": "為了展示所有做法，這裡我會手動加入，"
        },
        {
          "id": 104,
          "start": 332.634,
          "end": 337.634,
          "en": "add a log in and a log out method here.",
          "zh": "新增 login 和 logout 方法。"
        },
        {
          "id": 105,
          "start": 338.11,
          "end": 342.52,
          "en": "And in log in, I will call this store dispatch log in",
          "zh": "在 login 中呼叫 this.$store.dispatch('login')，"
        },
        {
          "id": 106,
          "start": 344.2,
          "end": 348.15,
          "en": "because log in was the action name I defined",
          "zh": "因為 login 是我定義的 action 名稱，"
        },
        {
          "id": 107,
          "start": 348.15,
          "end": 349.59000000000003,
          "en": "and for log out it's the same,",
          "zh": "logout 也一樣，"
        },
        {
          "id": 108,
          "start": 349.59000000000003,
          "end": 352.033,
          "en": "but of course, with the log out action.",
          "zh": "只是當然換成 logout action。"
        },
        {
          "id": 109,
          "start": 353.77,
          "end": 356.03,
          "en": "And now we can set up the click listeners,",
          "zh": "接著設定點擊監聽器，"
        },
        {
          "id": 110,
          "start": 356.03,
          "end": 359.469,
          "en": "trigger our log in method on the first button",
          "zh": "第一個按鈕觸發 login 方法，"
        },
        {
          "id": 111,
          "start": 359.469,
          "end": 363.083,
          "en": "and trigger log out on the second button.",
          "zh": "第二個按鈕觸發 logout。"
        },
        {
          "id": 112,
          "start": 364.59,
          "end": 367.14,
          "en": "With that we should be manipulating the state",
          "zh": "這樣就應該能修改狀態了。"
        },
        {
          "id": 113,
          "start": 367.14,
          "end": 371.19,
          "en": "now to reflect it i also want to listen to changes.",
          "zh": "為了反映狀態，我也想監聽變化。"
        },
        {
          "id": 114,
          "start": 371.19,
          "end": 372.13,
          "en": "For example, here,",
          "zh": "例如這裡，"
        },
        {
          "id": 115,
          "start": 372.13,
          "end": 374.31,
          "en": "I only wanted to show one of the two buttons",
          "zh": "我希望同一時間"
        },
        {
          "id": 116,
          "start": 374.31,
          "end": 375.333,
          "en": "at the same time.",
          "zh": "只顯示兩個按鈕中的一個。"
        },
        {
          "id": 117,
          "start": 376.64,
          "end": 379.79,
          "en": "For dav we can use computers to get access to the getters",
          "zh": "為此，可以用計算屬性存取 getters，"
        },
        {
          "id": 118,
          "start": 379.79,
          "end": 382.44,
          "en": "either with map getters or by setting up",
          "zh": "無論是透過 mapGetters，或是自己"
        },
        {
          "id": 119,
          "start": 382.44,
          "end": 384.547,
          "en": "our own computed properties.",
          "zh": "設定計算屬性。"
        },
        {
          "id": 120,
          "start": 384.547,
          "end": 388.591,
          "en": "And here I'll add the is off computed property",
          "zh": "這裡我會加入 isAuth 計算屬性，"
        },
        {
          "id": 121,
          "start": 388.591,
          "end": 392.81,
          "en": "where I returned this store getters",
          "zh": "在裡面回傳 this.$store.getters."
        },
        {
          "id": 122,
          "start": 392.81,
          "end": 396.90999999999997,
          "en": "and I named together user is authenticated.",
          "zh": "userIsAuthenticated，也就是我給 getter 取的名稱。"
        },
        {
          "id": 123,
          "start": 396.90999999999997,
          "end": 398.47,
          "en": "So that's the getter",
          "zh": "這就是"
        },
        {
          "id": 124,
          "start": 398.47,
          "end": 401.95,
          "en": "I wanna access here and now is off,",
          "zh": "我要在這裡存取的 getter，而 isAuth"
        },
        {
          "id": 125,
          "start": 401.95,
          "end": 404.98,
          "en": "is a computed property, which is true or false.",
          "zh": "是一個值為 true 或 false 的計算屬性。"
        },
        {
          "id": 126,
          "start": 404.98,
          "end": 408.71,
          "en": "And with VF, all showed a login button is off,",
          "zh": "接著用 v-if，當 isAuth 為 false 時顯示登入按鈕，"
        },
        {
          "id": 127,
          "start": 408.71,
          "end": 412.01,
          "en": "is false because of the user is not authenticated.",
          "zh": "因為使用者還沒有驗證，"
        },
        {
          "id": 128,
          "start": 412.01,
          "end": 414.5,
          "en": "I want to show the log in button",
          "zh": "所以要顯示登入按鈕；"
        },
        {
          "id": 129,
          "start": 414.5,
          "end": 416.55,
          "en": "and I want to show the log out button",
          "zh": "而已驗證時，"
        },
        {
          "id": 130,
          "start": 416.55,
          "end": 418.683,
          "en": "if we are authenticated.",
          "zh": "則顯示登出按鈕。"
        },
        {
          "id": 131,
          "start": 420.64,
          "end": 423.55,
          "en": "And we can copy the computer property",
          "zh": "我們也可以把這個計算屬性"
        },
        {
          "id": 132,
          "start": 423.55,
          "end": 428.55,
          "en": "into the app view file now here like this,",
          "zh": "像這樣複製到 App.vue 檔案中，"
        },
        {
          "id": 133,
          "start": 430.48,
          "end": 434.1,
          "en": "because I also need is off here to show",
          "zh": "因為這裡也需要 isAuth 來顯示"
        },
        {
          "id": 134,
          "start": 434.1,
          "end": 437.01,
          "en": "or hide this first base container.",
          "zh": "或隱藏第一個 base-container。"
        },
        {
          "id": 135,
          "start": 437.01,
          "end": 439.87,
          "en": "So here with VF, I wanna show it if is off,",
          "zh": "所以這裡用 v-if，isAuth 為 true 時顯示，"
        },
        {
          "id": 136,
          "start": 439.87,
          "end": 442.113,
          "en": "is true and hide it if it's false.",
          "zh": "為 false 時隱藏。"
        },
        {
          "id": 137,
          "start": 443.76,
          "end": 445.58,
          "en": "With that initially, we don't see it",
          "zh": "這樣一來，一開始看不到它，"
        },
        {
          "id": 138,
          "start": 445.58,
          "end": 447.87,
          "en": "because initially we're not logged in,",
          "zh": "因為一開始還沒登入，"
        },
        {
          "id": 139,
          "start": 447.87,
          "end": 449.74,
          "en": "but if it click log in, we see it.",
          "zh": "但點擊 Login 之後就會看到它，"
        },
        {
          "id": 140,
          "start": 449.74,
          "end": 453.31,
          "en": "We can change everything, but if I click log out,",
          "zh": "也能修改所有內容；而點擊 Logout，"
        },
        {
          "id": 141,
          "start": 453.31,
          "end": 454.9,
          "en": "we hide it.",
          "zh": "它就會被隱藏。"
        },
        {
          "id": 142,
          "start": 454.9,
          "end": 456.40999999999997,
          "en": "So that works.",
          "zh": "所以這樣可以運作，"
        },
        {
          "id": 143,
          "start": 456.40999999999997,
          "end": 459.199,
          "en": "And that's an extra piece of state managed.",
          "zh": "也多管理了一份狀態。"
        },
        {
          "id": 144,
          "start": 459.199,
          "end": 461.90999999999997,
          "en": "Now that wasn't nice practice,",
          "zh": "這是個不錯的練習，"
        },
        {
          "id": 145,
          "start": 461.90999999999997,
          "end": 464.6,
          "en": "but I started this lecture mentioning",
          "zh": "但我在這堂課一開始就提到，"
        },
        {
          "id": 146,
          "start": 464.6,
          "end": 466.58,
          "en": "that our app could be getting bigger",
          "zh": "我們的應用程式可能會越來越大，"
        },
        {
          "id": 147,
          "start": 466.58,
          "end": 469.86,
          "en": "and that we had more and more States to manage.",
          "zh": "需要管理的狀態也越來越多。"
        },
        {
          "id": 148,
          "start": 469.86,
          "end": 471.42,
          "en": "So here in this demo,",
          "zh": "所以在這個示範中，"
        },
        {
          "id": 149,
          "start": 471.42,
          "end": 474.93,
          "en": "we now added at least a little bit of extra info",
          "zh": "我們至少在 store 中"
        },
        {
          "id": 150,
          "start": 474.93,
          "end": 476.61,
          "en": "to our store.",
          "zh": "多加了一點資訊。"
        },
        {
          "id": 151,
          "start": 476.61,
          "end": 480.47,
          "en": "View UX also gives us utility methods",
          "zh": "在管理內含不同類型狀態的大型 store 時，"
        },
        {
          "id": 152,
          "start": 480.47,
          "end": 484.52,
          "en": "and features when it comes to managing bigger stores",
          "zh": "Vuex 也提供了一些實用的方法"
        },
        {
          "id": 153,
          "start": 484.52,
          "end": 487.363,
          "en": "with different kinds of state inside of it.",
          "zh": "和功能。"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "21879786",
      "title": "Organizing your Store with Modules",
      "lectureOrder": 223,
      "videoOrder": 196,
      "sourceHash": "95b2ef2880d8b3ffc820d988b09907f6bb676d819db89a84b273014697363a33",
      "cues": [
        {
          "id": 1,
          "start": 2.17,
          "end": 5.66,
          "en": "A pretty nice feature provided by Vuex",
          "zh": "隨著 store、狀態等等越來越大，"
        },
        {
          "id": 2,
          "start": 5.66,
          "end": 8.98,
          "en": "as your store and your state and zone grows",
          "zh": "Vuex 提供的一個非常好用的功能，"
        },
        {
          "id": 3,
          "start": 8.98,
          "end": 13.66,
          "en": "is the possibility to set up modules.",
          "zh": "就是可以設定模組，"
        },
        {
          "id": 4,
          "start": 13.66,
          "end": 17.023,
          "en": "To split your store into multiple modules.",
          "zh": "把 store 拆分成多個模組。"
        },
        {
          "id": 5,
          "start": 17.88,
          "end": 21.55,
          "en": "You may only have one store per application,",
          "zh": "每個應用程式只能有一個 store，"
        },
        {
          "id": 6,
          "start": 21.55,
          "end": 26.52,
          "en": "but this store can be made up of multiple modules",
          "zh": "但這個 store 可以由多個模組組成，"
        },
        {
          "id": 7,
          "start": 26.52,
          "end": 29.3,
          "en": "To keep your code more manageable.",
          "zh": "讓程式碼更容易管理。"
        },
        {
          "id": 8,
          "start": 29.3,
          "end": 32.24,
          "en": "You automatically, if you don't set up any modules,",
          "zh": "即使沒有設定任何模組，你也自動"
        },
        {
          "id": 9,
          "start": 32.24,
          "end": 34.69,
          "en": "have one module, you could say,",
          "zh": "有一個模組，可以說是"
        },
        {
          "id": 10,
          "start": 34.69,
          "end": 37.21,
          "en": "the root module, the root state,",
          "zh": "根模組，也就是根狀態，"
        },
        {
          "id": 11,
          "start": 37.21,
          "end": 41.33,
          "en": "but you can then add as many other modules as you want.",
          "zh": "但你可以再加入任意多個其他模組。"
        },
        {
          "id": 12,
          "start": 41.33,
          "end": 44.1,
          "en": "For example one module for the counter",
          "zh": "例如一個模組負責計數器，"
        },
        {
          "id": 13,
          "start": 44.1,
          "end": 47.9,
          "en": "and another module for authentication.",
          "zh": "另一個模組負責驗證；"
        },
        {
          "id": 14,
          "start": 47.9,
          "end": 51.43,
          "en": "Or you leave authentication in the root state,",
          "zh": "或是把驗證留在根狀態、"
        },
        {
          "id": 15,
          "start": 51.43,
          "end": 54.52,
          "en": "in the root module and outsource the counter",
          "zh": "根模組中，而把計數器"
        },
        {
          "id": 16,
          "start": 54.52,
          "end": 56.41,
          "en": "into an extra module.",
          "zh": "抽到另一個模組，"
        },
        {
          "id": 17,
          "start": 56.41,
          "end": 58.08,
          "en": "That would also be possible.",
          "zh": "這也是可以的。"
        },
        {
          "id": 18,
          "start": 58.08,
          "end": 60.03,
          "en": "And that's what we're going to do here.",
          "zh": "而這就是我們在這裡要做的。"
        },
        {
          "id": 19,
          "start": 60.88,
          "end": 62.65,
          "en": "So here in main.js still,",
          "zh": "所以仍然在 main.js 中，"
        },
        {
          "id": 20,
          "start": 62.65,
          "end": 65.07,
          "en": "I'm going to create a new counterModule,",
          "zh": "我要建立一個新的 counterModule，"
        },
        {
          "id": 21,
          "start": 67.41,
          "end": 70.95,
          "en": "which is an object, not a store,",
          "zh": "它是一個物件，不是 store，"
        },
        {
          "id": 22,
          "start": 70.95,
          "end": 74.43,
          "en": "just a regular JavaScript object.",
          "zh": "只是一個一般的 JavaScript 物件，"
        },
        {
          "id": 23,
          "start": 74.43,
          "end": 77.84,
          "en": "But now it's an object with exactly the same features",
          "zh": "但這個物件具有和傳給 createStore 的物件"
        },
        {
          "id": 24,
          "start": 77.84,
          "end": 80.98,
          "en": "as the object you pass to create store.",
          "zh": "完全相同的功能。"
        },
        {
          "id": 25,
          "start": 80.98,
          "end": 83.73,
          "en": "So it may have a state method.",
          "zh": "所以它可以有 state 方法，"
        },
        {
          "id": 26,
          "start": 83.73,
          "end": 86.72,
          "en": "It may have mutations, which is an object.",
          "zh": "可以有 mutations，也就是一個物件，"
        },
        {
          "id": 27,
          "start": 86.72,
          "end": 90.61,
          "en": "It may have actions, which is an object and getters.",
          "zh": "也可以有 actions 物件和 getters，"
        },
        {
          "id": 28,
          "start": 90.61,
          "end": 92.593,
          "en": "So exactly the same features.",
          "zh": "功能完全一樣。"
        },
        {
          "id": 29,
          "start": 94.6,
          "end": 97.343,
          "en": "And in state, we of course also return an object.",
          "zh": "在 state 中，當然同樣回傳一個物件。"
        },
        {
          "id": 30,
          "start": 98.62,
          "end": 102.08,
          "en": "But now we can move our counter state here",
          "zh": "現在可以把計數器狀態"
        },
        {
          "id": 31,
          "start": 102.08,
          "end": 106.06,
          "en": "out of this global store, into this counterModule.",
          "zh": "從這個全域 store 移到這個 counterModule 中。"
        },
        {
          "id": 32,
          "start": 107.38,
          "end": 110.71000000000001,
          "en": "The same for the mutations related to our counter,",
          "zh": "與計數器相關的 mutations 也一樣，"
        },
        {
          "id": 33,
          "start": 110.71000000000001,
          "end": 114.65299999999999,
          "en": "grab them and moved them here into mutations.",
          "zh": "把它們取出並移到這裡的 mutations 中。"
        },
        {
          "id": 34,
          "start": 116.5,
          "end": 118.35,
          "en": "The same for the actions of course,",
          "zh": "actions 當然也一樣，"
        },
        {
          "id": 35,
          "start": 118.35,
          "end": 121.22,
          "en": "grab the counter related actions,",
          "zh": "取出與計數器相關的 actions，"
        },
        {
          "id": 36,
          "start": 121.22,
          "end": 123.43,
          "en": "remove them from our global store,",
          "zh": "從全域 store 中移除，"
        },
        {
          "id": 37,
          "start": 123.43,
          "end": 125.063,
          "en": "and add them to actions here.",
          "zh": "加到這裡的 actions 中。"
        },
        {
          "id": 38,
          "start": 126.09,
          "end": 130.19,
          "en": "And you guessed it the same for our getters,",
          "zh": "你猜對了，getters 也一樣，"
        },
        {
          "id": 39,
          "start": 130.19,
          "end": 131.93,
          "en": "grab the counter getters,",
          "zh": "取出計數器的 getters，"
        },
        {
          "id": 40,
          "start": 131.93,
          "end": 133.853,
          "en": "remove them from the global store,",
          "zh": "從全域 store 中移除，"
        },
        {
          "id": 41,
          "start": 134.97,
          "end": 136.663,
          "en": "and add them to getters here.",
          "zh": "加到這裡的 getters 中。"
        },
        {
          "id": 42,
          "start": 138.32999999999998,
          "end": 143.32999999999998,
          "en": "With that, our global store, our main store, is way leaner.",
          "zh": "這樣一來，全域 store，也就是主要的 store，就精簡多了，"
        },
        {
          "id": 43,
          "start": 144.64,
          "end": 147.6,
          "en": "It now has only the Authlogic left.",
          "zh": "現在只剩下驗證邏輯。"
        },
        {
          "id": 44,
          "start": 147.6,
          "end": 151.36,
          "en": "And we could put this logic into a separate module as well,",
          "zh": "如果想要，也可以把這部分邏輯"
        },
        {
          "id": 45,
          "start": 151.36,
          "end": 152.363,
          "en": "if we wanted to.",
          "zh": "放到另一個模組中。"
        },
        {
          "id": 46,
          "start": 154.05,
          "end": 157.853,
          "en": "But how do we now get the module back into the store?",
          "zh": "但現在要如何把模組放回 store 中呢？"
        },
        {
          "id": 47,
          "start": 158.87,
          "end": 161.86,
          "en": "Well, createStore, this object here",
          "zh": "createStore 的這個物件"
        },
        {
          "id": 48,
          "start": 161.86,
          "end": 166,
          "en": "also takes a modules option.",
          "zh": "也接收一個 modules 選項。"
        },
        {
          "id": 49,
          "start": 166,
          "end": 168.97,
          "en": "And modules is an object.",
          "zh": "modules 是一個物件，"
        },
        {
          "id": 50,
          "start": 168.97,
          "end": 172.05,
          "en": "And here you now add all the modules",
          "zh": "在這裡加入所有"
        },
        {
          "id": 51,
          "start": 172.05,
          "end": 174.603,
          "en": "you wanna merge together into one store.",
          "zh": "想合併到同一個 store 中的模組。"
        },
        {
          "id": 52,
          "start": 175.71,
          "end": 179.8,
          "en": "You give every module an identifier of your choice,",
          "zh": "你可以為每個模組取一個識別名稱，"
        },
        {
          "id": 53,
          "start": 179.8,
          "end": 184.76,
          "en": "for example, counter or numbers",
          "zh": "例如 counter 或 numbers，"
        },
        {
          "id": 54,
          "start": 184.76,
          "end": 187.44,
          "en": "or whatever the name should be, this is up to you.",
          "zh": "或任何你想要的名稱，由你決定。"
        },
        {
          "id": 55,
          "start": 187.44,
          "end": 189.19,
          "en": "Here I'll go with numbers",
          "zh": "這裡我用 numbers，"
        },
        {
          "id": 56,
          "start": 190.24,
          "end": 194,
          "en": "and then point at the module object that should be merged.",
          "zh": "然後指向要合併的模組物件，"
        },
        {
          "id": 57,
          "start": 194,
          "end": 196.163,
          "en": "In this case, the counter module.",
          "zh": "在這個例子中就是 counterModule，"
        },
        {
          "id": 58,
          "start": 199.21,
          "end": 200.043,
          "en": "Like this.",
          "zh": "像這樣。"
        },
        {
          "id": 59,
          "start": 201.05,
          "end": 204.053,
          "en": "And now this will be merged into this store.",
          "zh": "現在它就會被合併到這個 store 中。"
        },
        {
          "id": 60,
          "start": 205.12,
          "end": 210.12,
          "en": "If you save this now, everything will work as before,",
          "zh": "現在儲存之後，一切都會和之前一樣正常運作，"
        },
        {
          "id": 61,
          "start": 210.72,
          "end": 215.23,
          "en": "because by default, modules merged into a store",
          "zh": "因為預設情況下，合併到 store 中的模組"
        },
        {
          "id": 62,
          "start": 215.23,
          "end": 218.57999999999998,
          "en": "are all merged on the same level, so to say.",
          "zh": "可以說全都合併在同一層。"
        },
        {
          "id": 63,
          "start": 218.57999999999998,
          "end": 221.61,
          "en": "So if you merge a module into this store,",
          "zh": "所以把模組合併到這個 store 中，"
        },
        {
          "id": 64,
          "start": 221.61,
          "end": 223.82999999999998,
          "en": "it is as if you would have to find",
          "zh": "就像是把所有 getters 等等"
        },
        {
          "id": 65,
          "start": 223.82999999999998,
          "end": 225.41,
          "en": "all the getters and so on",
          "zh": "直接定義在"
        },
        {
          "id": 66,
          "start": 225.41,
          "end": 226.96,
          "en": "directly in the store,",
          "zh": "store 中一樣，"
        },
        {
          "id": 67,
          "start": 226.96,
          "end": 229.303,
          "en": "as we had it before a couple of minutes ago.",
          "zh": "也就是幾分鐘前的做法。"
        },
        {
          "id": 68,
          "start": 230.24,
          "end": 232.61,
          "en": "That's why we can still dispatch all the actions",
          "zh": "這就是為什麼即使現在使用了模組，"
        },
        {
          "id": 69,
          "start": 232.61,
          "end": 235.21,
          "en": "and use all the getters as before",
          "zh": "仍然可以像之前一樣 dispatch 所有 actions、"
        },
        {
          "id": 70,
          "start": 235.21,
          "end": 238.3,
          "en": "even though we're now using a module.",
          "zh": "使用所有 getters。"
        },
        {
          "id": 71,
          "start": 238.3,
          "end": 239.133,
          "en": "And as mentioned",
          "zh": "而如前所述，"
        },
        {
          "id": 72,
          "start": 239.133,
          "end": 242.83,
          "en": "you can of course have as many modules as you want to.",
          "zh": "你當然可以有任意多個模組。"
        },
        {
          "id": 73,
          "start": 242.83,
          "end": 246.18,
          "en": "But the idea of modules doesn't end here,",
          "zh": "但模組的概念不只如此，"
        },
        {
          "id": 74,
          "start": 246.18,
          "end": 248.063,
          "en": "there's more we can do with that.",
          "zh": "它還能做更多事。"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "21879788",
      "title": "Understanding Local Module State",
      "lectureOrder": 224,
      "videoOrder": 197,
      "sourceHash": "04de56e72e106b0caa44026f07ef9df04af1e3c693c2498473bc13ab2fc5229d",
      "cues": [
        {
          "id": 1,
          "start": 1.498,
          "end": 3.87,
          "en": "I mentioned that modules",
          "zh": "我提過，模組"
        },
        {
          "id": 2,
          "start": 3.87,
          "end": 6.64,
          "en": "are merged into your main store",
          "zh": "會被合併到主要的 store 中，"
        },
        {
          "id": 3,
          "start": 6.64,
          "end": 10.083,
          "en": "on the same level as all the other things in the store.",
          "zh": "和 store 中的其他東西位於同一層。"
        },
        {
          "id": 4,
          "start": 10.95,
          "end": 12.57,
          "en": "You can change this behavior",
          "zh": "你可以改變這種行為，"
        },
        {
          "id": 5,
          "start": 12.57,
          "end": 13.98,
          "en": "and there is one place where",
          "zh": "而且其實有一個地方"
        },
        {
          "id": 6,
          "start": 13.98,
          "end": 15.993,
          "en": "it actually already did change.",
          "zh": "已經不一樣了。"
        },
        {
          "id": 7,
          "start": 16.89,
          "end": 18.457,
          "en": "Let's say inside of a mutation,",
          "zh": "假設在某個 mutation 中，"
        },
        {
          "id": 8,
          "start": 18.457,
          "end": 22.89,
          "en": "inside of the increased mutation let's say ,",
          "zh": "例如在 increase mutation 中，"
        },
        {
          "id": 9,
          "start": 22.89,
          "end": 25.83,
          "en": "we console.log, our state.",
          "zh": "我們用 console.log 輸出 state。"
        },
        {
          "id": 10,
          "start": 25.83,
          "end": 27.777,
          "en": "So that's inside of the counter module now. .",
          "zh": "這現在位於 counter 模組中，"
        },
        {
          "id": 11,
          "start": 27.777,
          "end": 29.863,
          "en": "Inside of the increased mutation.",
          "zh": "在 increase mutation 裡。"
        },
        {
          "id": 12,
          "start": 31.27,
          "end": 33.43,
          "en": "Well, let's have a look what happens",
          "zh": "我們來看看"
        },
        {
          "id": 13,
          "start": 33.43,
          "end": 34.993,
          "en": "if we click add 10.",
          "zh": "點擊 Add 10 之後會發生什麼。"
        },
        {
          "id": 14,
          "start": 36.2,
          "end": 39.56,
          "en": "This is the log here for our state.",
          "zh": "這是 state 的輸出內容。"
        },
        {
          "id": 15,
          "start": 39.56,
          "end": 42.26,
          "en": "And if we have a look at this,",
          "zh": "仔細看的話，"
        },
        {
          "id": 16,
          "start": 42.26,
          "end": 44.32,
          "en": "we see something interesting.",
          "zh": "會發現一件有趣的事。"
        },
        {
          "id": 17,
          "start": 44.32,
          "end": 45.273,
          "en": "Do you notice it?",
          "zh": "你注意到了嗎？"
        },
        {
          "id": 18,
          "start": 46.41,
          "end": 48.25,
          "en": "We see the counter in there.",
          "zh": "裡面有 counter，"
        },
        {
          "id": 19,
          "start": 48.25,
          "end": 51.16,
          "en": "But there's one thing we don't see in here.",
          "zh": "但有一樣東西沒有出現在這裡，"
        },
        {
          "id": 20,
          "start": 51.16,
          "end": 53.42,
          "en": "Our authentication state,",
          "zh": "那就是驗證狀態。"
        },
        {
          "id": 21,
          "start": 53.42,
          "end": 57.97,
          "en": "we don't see is locked in there,",
          "zh": "這裡看不到 isLoggedIn"
        },
        {
          "id": 22,
          "start": 57.97,
          "end": 59.053,
          "en": "this state.",
          "zh": "這個狀態。"
        },
        {
          "id": 23,
          "start": 59.91,
          "end": 63.49,
          "en": "Now I just said it would all be merged into one store.",
          "zh": "我剛才才說過，所有東西都會合併到同一個 store 中，"
        },
        {
          "id": 24,
          "start": 63.49,
          "end": 64.8,
          "en": "So why don't we see,",
          "zh": "那為什麼在 counter 模組的 state 中"
        },
        {
          "id": 25,
          "start": 64.8,
          "end": 67.383,
          "en": "is locked in here, in the state,",
          "zh": "看不到"
        },
        {
          "id": 26,
          "start": 68.72,
          "end": 70.913,
          "en": "of our counter module then.",
          "zh": "isLoggedIn 呢？"
        },
        {
          "id": 27,
          "start": 71.97,
          "end": 74.74,
          "en": "Because the state inside of a module,",
          "zh": "因為模組中的 state"
        },
        {
          "id": 28,
          "start": 74.74,
          "end": 77.75,
          "en": "is actually treated as a local state,",
          "zh": "其實會被視為該模組內部的"
        },
        {
          "id": 29,
          "start": 77.75,
          "end": 79.8,
          "en": "inside of the module.",
          "zh": "區域狀態。"
        },
        {
          "id": 30,
          "start": 79.8,
          "end": 82.9,
          "en": "Mutations actions and getters are global,",
          "zh": "mutations、actions 和 getters 是全域的，"
        },
        {
          "id": 31,
          "start": 82.9,
          "end": 86.26,
          "en": "you can access them as before on the main store.",
          "zh": "可以像之前一樣在主要的 store 上存取，"
        },
        {
          "id": 32,
          "start": 86.26,
          "end": 89.56,
          "en": "But the state is local to this module.",
          "zh": "但 state 是這個模組的區域狀態。"
        },
        {
          "id": 33,
          "start": 89.56,
          "end": 92.47999999999999,
          "en": "So anything you do on this state inside",
          "zh": "所以在這個模組中"
        },
        {
          "id": 34,
          "start": 92.47999999999999,
          "end": 94.83,
          "en": "of this module refers just",
          "zh": "對這個 state 所做的任何事，指的都只是"
        },
        {
          "id": 35,
          "start": 94.83,
          "end": 96.453,
          "en": "to this state module.",
          "zh": "這個模組的 state。"
        },
        {
          "id": 36,
          "start": 97.44,
          "end": 99.5,
          "en": "So for example, in a getter,",
          "zh": "例如在 getter 中，"
        },
        {
          "id": 37,
          "start": 99.5,
          "end": 102.38,
          "en": "I would not be able to get the off status.",
          "zh": "我就無法取得驗證狀態。"
        },
        {
          "id": 38,
          "start": 102.38,
          "end": 104.95,
          "en": "If I add new getter,",
          "zh": "如果我在 counter 模組的"
        },
        {
          "id": 39,
          "start": 104.95,
          "end": 106.50999999999999,
          "en": "in the counter module,",
          "zh": "getters 物件中"
        },
        {
          "id": 40,
          "start": 106.50999999999999,
          "end": 108.52000000000001,
          "en": "getters object, TestAuth",
          "zh": "新增一個 getter，叫做 testAuth，"
        },
        {
          "id": 41,
          "start": 112.8,
          "end": 117.05,
          "en": "and I try to return state is locked in,",
          "zh": "並試著回傳 state.isLoggedIn，"
        },
        {
          "id": 42,
          "start": 117.05,
          "end": 118.55,
          "en": "this will not work.",
          "zh": "這樣是行不通的。"
        },
        {
          "id": 43,
          "start": 118.55,
          "end": 121.07,
          "en": "If I now try to access TestAuth,",
          "zh": "如果我現在試著存取 testAuth，"
        },
        {
          "id": 44,
          "start": 121.07,
          "end": 123.263,
          "en": "let's say in the UserAuth component,",
          "zh": "例如在 UserAuth 元件中"
        },
        {
          "id": 45,
          "start": 124.38,
          "end": 127.353,
          "en": "we had a number of computed property is TestAuth,",
          "zh": "新增一個計算屬性 testAuth，"
        },
        {
          "id": 46,
          "start": 128.21,
          "end": 129.97,
          "en": "where I returned is newly",
          "zh": "在裡面回傳這個新"
        },
        {
          "id": 47,
          "start": 129.97,
          "end": 131.573,
          "en": "added getter, TestAuth,",
          "zh": "加入的 getter，也就是 testAuth，"
        },
        {
          "id": 48,
          "start": 133.17,
          "end": 136.25,
          "en": "which I just added to the counter module.",
          "zh": "也就是我剛加入 counter 模組的那個 getter。"
        },
        {
          "id": 49,
          "start": 136.25,
          "end": 138.2,
          "en": "If I access this here,",
          "zh": "如果我在這裡存取它，"
        },
        {
          "id": 50,
          "start": 138.2,
          "end": 140.79,
          "en": "and I then simply output the value,",
          "zh": "然後直接輸出它的值，"
        },
        {
          "id": 51,
          "start": 140.79,
          "end": 143.623,
          "en": "let's say in a paragraph, like this.",
          "zh": "例如像這樣放在一個段落中，"
        },
        {
          "id": 52,
          "start": 144.93,
          "end": 147.62,
          "en": "So if I output this newly added computed property,",
          "zh": "也就是輸出這個新加入、"
        },
        {
          "id": 53,
          "start": 147.62,
          "end": 150.4,
          "en": "which uses the new getter here,",
          "zh": "使用新 getter 的計算屬性，"
        },
        {
          "id": 54,
          "start": 150.4,
          "end": 152.13,
          "en": "this will not work.",
          "zh": "這樣是行不通的。"
        },
        {
          "id": 55,
          "start": 152.13,
          "end": 152.963,
          "en": "First of all, though,",
          "zh": "不過首先，"
        },
        {
          "id": 56,
          "start": 152.963,
          "end": 154.373,
          "en": "I have to fix an error,",
          "zh": "我必須修正 main.js 中"
        },
        {
          "id": 57,
          "start": 155.41,
          "end": 158.65,
          "en": "in main.js in the new TestAuth getter.",
          "zh": "新的 testAuth getter 的一個錯誤。"
        },
        {
          "id": 58,
          "start": 158.65,
          "end": 160.32,
          "en": "Of course, I should accept state",
          "zh": "當然，我應該接收 state"
        },
        {
          "id": 59,
          "start": 160.32,
          "end": 162.44299999999998,
          "en": "as a argument in order to use it.",
          "zh": "作為引數才能使用它。"
        },
        {
          "id": 60,
          "start": 163.81,
          "end": 165.09,
          "en": "But even with that,",
          "zh": "但即使這樣，"
        },
        {
          "id": 61,
          "start": 165.09,
          "end": 168.04500000000002,
          "en": "you notice there's nothing below the button.",
          "zh": "你會發現按鈕下方什麼都沒有，"
        },
        {
          "id": 62,
          "start": 168.04500000000002,
          "end": 170.75,
          "en": "And if we change it, there's still nothing",
          "zh": "即使改變狀態，仍然什麼都沒有，"
        },
        {
          "id": 63,
          "start": 170.75,
          "end": 173.37,
          "en": "because it doesn't find is locked",
          "zh": "因為在這個 getter 中，"
        },
        {
          "id": 64,
          "start": 173.37,
          "end": 175.156,
          "en": "in the getter here.",
          "zh": "找不到 isLoggedIn，"
        },
        {
          "id": 65,
          "start": 175.156,
          "end": 176.68,
          "en": "In the state of this getter.",
          "zh": "也就是在這個 getter 的 state 中找不到。"
        },
        {
          "id": 66,
          "start": 176.68,
          "end": 179.76,
          "en": "Because this getter is in the counter module.",
          "zh": "因為這個 getter 位於 counter 模組中，"
        },
        {
          "id": 67,
          "start": 179.76,
          "end": 182.47,
          "en": "And as As I mentioned, the state is local.",
          "zh": "而如前所述，state 是區域性的，"
        },
        {
          "id": 68,
          "start": 182.47,
          "end": 184.05,
          "en": "So here we only have access",
          "zh": "所以這裡只能存取"
        },
        {
          "id": 69,
          "start": 184.05,
          "end": 186.933,
          "en": "to the state that belongs to this module.",
          "zh": "屬於這個模組的 state。"
        },
        {
          "id": 70,
          "start": 187.86,
          "end": 190.01,
          "en": "So that's important to keep in mind.",
          "zh": "這點一定要記住。"
        },
        {
          "id": 71,
          "start": 190.01,
          "end": 191.91,
          "en": "And it's similar for actions",
          "zh": "actions 和 mutations 也類似，"
        },
        {
          "id": 72,
          "start": 191.91,
          "end": 194.75,
          "en": "and mutations there in context,",
          "zh": "例如 context 中，"
        },
        {
          "id": 73,
          "start": 194.75,
          "end": 197.132,
          "en": "for example, where you learned earlier,",
          "zh": "你之前學過，"
        },
        {
          "id": 74,
          "start": 197.132,
          "end": 199.95,
          "en": "that you all have access to the state,",
          "zh": "需要時也能存取 state，"
        },
        {
          "id": 75,
          "start": 199.95,
          "end": 201.23,
          "en": "in case you needed it,",
          "zh": "但在模組中，"
        },
        {
          "id": 76,
          "start": 201.23,
          "end": 202.68,
          "en": "you also only have access",
          "zh": "同樣只能存取"
        },
        {
          "id": 77,
          "start": 202.68,
          "end": 205.083,
          "en": "to the state of this module.",
          "zh": "這個模組的 state。"
        },
        {
          "id": 78,
          "start": 206.81,
          "end": 208.85,
          "en": "Now in case you need to work around that,",
          "zh": "不過，如果需要繞過這個限制，"
        },
        {
          "id": 79,
          "start": 208.85,
          "end": 210.75,
          "en": "there are ways though.",
          "zh": "還是有辦法的。"
        },
        {
          "id": 80,
          "start": 210.75,
          "end": 214.31,
          "en": "For example, in getters inside of a module,",
          "zh": "例如在模組中的 getters 裡，"
        },
        {
          "id": 81,
          "start": 214.31,
          "end": 216.14,
          "en": "you now don't just get state",
          "zh": "現在不只會像之前一樣收到 state"
        },
        {
          "id": 82,
          "start": 216.14,
          "end": 218.09,
          "en": "and getters as before,",
          "zh": "和 getters，"
        },
        {
          "id": 83,
          "start": 218.09,
          "end": 219.53,
          "en": "but you can now also get access",
          "zh": "還可以存取"
        },
        {
          "id": 84,
          "start": 219.53,
          "end": 221.793,
          "en": "to a root state and root getters.",
          "zh": "rootState 和 rootGetters。"
        },
        {
          "id": 85,
          "start": 223.09,
          "end": 224.37,
          "en": "And you might remember,",
          "zh": "你可能還記得，"
        },
        {
          "id": 86,
          "start": 224.37,
          "end": 227,
          "en": "that we saw similar properties",
          "zh": "在這個模組稍早，我們也在"
        },
        {
          "id": 87,
          "start": 227,
          "end": 230.28300000000002,
          "en": "on this context object earlier in the module.",
          "zh": "context 物件上看過類似的屬性。"
        },
        {
          "id": 88,
          "start": 231.75,
          "end": 233.69,
          "en": "This is your way of getting access",
          "zh": "透過它們，就能存取"
        },
        {
          "id": 89,
          "start": 233.69,
          "end": 235.54,
          "en": "to the main state,",
          "zh": "主要的 state、"
        },
        {
          "id": 90,
          "start": 235.54,
          "end": 238.95,
          "en": "the main getters of the entire store instead",
          "zh": "整個 store 的主要 getters，而不只是"
        },
        {
          "id": 91,
          "start": 238.95,
          "end": 242.493,
          "en": "of just the state of this specific module.",
          "zh": "這個特定模組的 state。"
        },
        {
          "id": 92,
          "start": 243.67,
          "end": 245.72,
          "en": "So this is your fallback way",
          "zh": "所以，這是在需要時，"
        },
        {
          "id": 93,
          "start": 245.72,
          "end": 248.62,
          "en": "of getting access to state that's not part",
          "zh": "存取不屬於這個模組的狀態的"
        },
        {
          "id": 94,
          "start": 248.62,
          "end": 251.073,
          "en": "of this module, in case you needed.",
          "zh": "備用方式。"
        },
        {
          "id": 95,
          "start": 252.2,
          "end": 253.87,
          "en": "Typically, though, of course,",
          "zh": "不過，在模組中，"
        },
        {
          "id": 96,
          "start": 253.87,
          "end": 255.2,
          "en": "inside of a module,",
          "zh": "通常當然"
        },
        {
          "id": 97,
          "start": 255.2,
          "end": 257.82,
          "en": "you tend to just work with the state",
          "zh": "只會使用"
        },
        {
          "id": 98,
          "start": 257.82,
          "end": 259.39,
          "en": "that belongs to the module.",
          "zh": "屬於該模組的 state，"
        },
        {
          "id": 99,
          "start": 259.39,
          "end": 261.8,
          "en": "So you probably don't need this too often,",
          "zh": "所以你可能不會經常需要它，"
        },
        {
          "id": 100,
          "start": 261.8,
          "end": 264.28,
          "en": "but there can definitely be situations",
          "zh": "但確實可能會有"
        },
        {
          "id": 101,
          "start": 264.28,
          "end": 265.563,
          "en": "where you do need it.",
          "zh": "需要用到它的情況。"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "21879794",
      "title": "Namespacing Modules",
      "lectureOrder": 225,
      "videoOrder": 198,
      "sourceHash": "897c8ca7cbcce697c7c748afb23b931039ea1dc397b2dc601f14409efc1268c1",
      "cues": [
        {
          "id": 1,
          "start": 2.26,
          "end": 4.46,
          "en": "Now besides this local state,",
          "zh": "除了這種區域狀態之外，"
        },
        {
          "id": 2,
          "start": 4.46,
          "end": 7.7,
          "en": "you can also make the entire module local.",
          "zh": "你也可以讓整個模組變成區域性的，"
        },
        {
          "id": 3,
          "start": 7.7,
          "end": 11.75,
          "en": "You can make it name spaced, as it's called,",
          "zh": "也就是所謂的命名空間化，"
        },
        {
          "id": 4,
          "start": 11.75,
          "end": 14.56,
          "en": "to make sure that multiple modules",
          "zh": "確保多個模組"
        },
        {
          "id": 5,
          "start": 14.56,
          "end": 17.35,
          "en": "are clearly separated from each other.",
          "zh": "彼此明確地區隔開來。"
        },
        {
          "id": 6,
          "start": 17.35,
          "end": 20.22,
          "en": "Now why might you wanna do that?",
          "zh": "為什麼要這麼做呢？"
        },
        {
          "id": 7,
          "start": 20.22,
          "end": 22.49,
          "en": "Well, as you're application grows,",
          "zh": "隨著應用程式成長，"
        },
        {
          "id": 8,
          "start": 22.49,
          "end": 25.32,
          "en": "you could of course have name clashes.",
          "zh": "當然可能會發生名稱衝突。"
        },
        {
          "id": 9,
          "start": 25.32,
          "end": 29.21,
          "en": "You might be using the same getter or the same action name",
          "zh": "你可能會在同一個 store 的不同模組中"
        },
        {
          "id": 10,
          "start": 29.21,
          "end": 33.19,
          "en": "in different modules of the same store.",
          "zh": "使用相同的 getter 或 action 名稱。"
        },
        {
          "id": 11,
          "start": 33.19,
          "end": 34.38,
          "en": "It's not the case here,",
          "zh": "這裡雖然沒有這種情況，"
        },
        {
          "id": 12,
          "start": 34.38,
          "end": 36.63,
          "en": "but if for whatever reason",
          "zh": "但如果基於某種原因，"
        },
        {
          "id": 13,
          "start": 36.63,
          "end": 40.41,
          "en": "we had a login action here, in the counter module,",
          "zh": "我們在 counter 模組中也有一個 login action，"
        },
        {
          "id": 14,
          "start": 40.41,
          "end": 44.65,
          "en": "that would be clashing with the login action",
          "zh": "就會和主要 store 中的"
        },
        {
          "id": 15,
          "start": 44.65,
          "end": 46.363,
          "en": "we got in our main store.",
          "zh": "login action 衝突。"
        },
        {
          "id": 16,
          "start": 47.51,
          "end": 49.94,
          "en": "Because at the moment, besides the state,",
          "zh": "因為目前除了 state 之外，"
        },
        {
          "id": 17,
          "start": 49.94,
          "end": 53.963,
          "en": "everything is merged together into one object basically.",
          "zh": "基本上所有東西都會合併到同一個物件中。"
        },
        {
          "id": 18,
          "start": 55.15,
          "end": 57.68,
          "en": "So in bigger apps, you could have such clashes",
          "zh": "所以在較大的應用程式中可能會發生這種衝突，"
        },
        {
          "id": 19,
          "start": 57.68,
          "end": 62.68,
          "en": "and to avoid that you can name space modules.",
          "zh": "為了避免衝突，可以把模組命名空間化。"
        },
        {
          "id": 20,
          "start": 63.5,
          "end": 65.87,
          "en": "You do that by adding an extra option,",
          "zh": "做法是在這個物件中"
        },
        {
          "id": 21,
          "start": 65.87,
          "end": 67.86,
          "en": "inside of your object here,",
          "zh": "加入一個額外的選項，"
        },
        {
          "id": 22,
          "start": 67.86,
          "end": 70.21000000000001,
          "en": "and that's the name spaced option",
          "zh": "也就是 namespaced 選項，"
        },
        {
          "id": 23,
          "start": 70.21000000000001,
          "end": 71.593,
          "en": "which you can set to true.",
          "zh": "並把它設為 true。"
        },
        {
          "id": 24,
          "start": 73.56,
          "end": 75.75,
          "en": "If you add name spaced true,",
          "zh": "加上 namespaced: true 之後，"
        },
        {
          "id": 25,
          "start": 75.75,
          "end": 79.03,
          "en": "you tell vuex that now the entire module",
          "zh": "就是在告訴 Vuex，現在整個模組，"
        },
        {
          "id": 26,
          "start": 79.03,
          "end": 82.92,
          "en": "and not just the state should be kinda detached",
          "zh": "而不只是 state，都應該和"
        },
        {
          "id": 27,
          "start": 82.92,
          "end": 84.483,
          "en": "from the rest of the store.",
          "zh": "store 的其他部分分開。"
        },
        {
          "id": 28,
          "start": 85.33,
          "end": 88.28,
          "en": "If you do that though, you will now notice",
          "zh": "不過這麼做之後，你會發現"
        },
        {
          "id": 29,
          "start": 89.75,
          "end": 94.363,
          "en": "that our getters and our action dispatchers no longer work.",
          "zh": "getters 和 dispatch actions 的地方都不能運作了，"
        },
        {
          "id": 30,
          "start": 95.2,
          "end": 98.34,
          "en": "Because now these actions and getters",
          "zh": "因為這些 actions 和 getters"
        },
        {
          "id": 31,
          "start": 98.34,
          "end": 101.82,
          "en": "are no longer available on the main store.",
          "zh": "已經不在主要的 store 上，"
        },
        {
          "id": 32,
          "start": 101.82,
          "end": 104.03999999999999,
          "en": "Instead now we have to access them",
          "zh": "現在必須指定正確的命名空間"
        },
        {
          "id": 33,
          "start": 104.03999999999999,
          "end": 107.22,
          "en": "by specifying the correct name space.",
          "zh": "才能存取它們。"
        },
        {
          "id": 34,
          "start": 107.22,
          "end": 109.763,
          "en": "And how does it work and what is the name space?",
          "zh": "那要怎麼做？命名空間又是什麼？"
        },
        {
          "id": 35,
          "start": 110.82,
          "end": 114.93,
          "en": "Well, the name space is this key you assigned",
          "zh": "命名空間就是你在 modules 物件中"
        },
        {
          "id": 36,
          "start": 114.93,
          "end": 119.93,
          "en": "for adding the module in this modules object to your store.",
          "zh": "把模組加入 store 時指定的那個鍵，"
        },
        {
          "id": 37,
          "start": 121.54,
          "end": 123.66,
          "en": "So in my case, numbers.",
          "zh": "在我的例子中就是 numbers，"
        },
        {
          "id": 38,
          "start": 123.66,
          "end": 127.35,
          "en": "That's the name space off the counter module.",
          "zh": "也就是 counter 模組的命名空間。"
        },
        {
          "id": 39,
          "start": 127.35,
          "end": 129.82,
          "en": "And we now need to use this name space",
          "zh": "現在我們必須使用這個命名空間，"
        },
        {
          "id": 40,
          "start": 129.82,
          "end": 132.79,
          "en": "to work with actions, getters and so on",
          "zh": "才能使用這個模組中的"
        },
        {
          "id": 41,
          "start": 132.79,
          "end": 134.363,
          "en": "inside of this module.",
          "zh": "actions、getters 等等。"
        },
        {
          "id": 42,
          "start": 135.87,
          "end": 137.51,
          "en": "Now here's how that will work.",
          "zh": "做法如下。"
        },
        {
          "id": 43,
          "start": 137.51,
          "end": 142.44,
          "en": "In favorite value, I access my normalized counter getter.",
          "zh": "在 FavoriteValue 中，我存取了 normalizedCounter getter。"
        },
        {
          "id": 44,
          "start": 142.44,
          "end": 145.8,
          "en": "Now you don't access dot normalized counter",
          "zh": "現在不能存取 .normalizedCounter，"
        },
        {
          "id": 45,
          "start": 145.8,
          "end": 148.12,
          "en": "but instead a special property name,",
          "zh": "而是要用一個特殊的屬性名稱，"
        },
        {
          "id": 46,
          "start": 148.12,
          "end": 150.09,
          "en": "which contains a special character,",
          "zh": "其中包含一個特殊字元，"
        },
        {
          "id": 47,
          "start": 150.09,
          "end": 151.36,
          "en": "in which you hence have to access",
          "zh": "因此必須使用"
        },
        {
          "id": 48,
          "start": 151.36,
          "end": 153.63,
          "en": "with this square bracket notation.",
          "zh": "方括號記法存取。"
        },
        {
          "id": 49,
          "start": 153.63,
          "end": 158.09,
          "en": "You pass in a string here, your property name as a string,",
          "zh": "在這裡傳入一個字串，也就是以字串表示的屬性名稱，"
        },
        {
          "id": 50,
          "start": 158.09,
          "end": 161.32999999999998,
          "en": "and this property name is now made up of",
          "zh": "而這個屬性名稱由"
        },
        {
          "id": 51,
          "start": 161.32999999999998,
          "end": 165.7,
          "en": "the old property name, so normalized counter,",
          "zh": "原本的屬性名稱，也就是 normalizedCounter 組成，"
        },
        {
          "id": 52,
          "start": 165.7,
          "end": 168.31,
          "en": "but prior to that, in front of that,",
          "zh": "但在它前面"
        },
        {
          "id": 53,
          "start": 168.31,
          "end": 170.55,
          "en": "you have your name space.",
          "zh": "要加上命名空間，"
        },
        {
          "id": 54,
          "start": 170.55,
          "end": 172.59300000000002,
          "en": "So in my case, numbers.",
          "zh": "在我的例子中就是 numbers。"
        },
        {
          "id": 55,
          "start": 174.27,
          "end": 178.57,
          "en": "So you have numbers and then a slash in between.",
          "zh": "所以是 numbers，中間再加一個斜線。"
        },
        {
          "id": 56,
          "start": 178.57,
          "end": 179.66,
          "en": "Might look strange",
          "zh": "看起來可能有點奇怪，"
        },
        {
          "id": 57,
          "start": 179.66,
          "end": 183.053,
          "en": "but this is now the property name of the normalized counter,",
          "zh": "但這就是 normalizedCounter 現在的屬性名稱："
        },
        {
          "id": 58,
          "start": 184.17,
          "end": 187.5,
          "en": "name space, slash and then your getter name,",
          "zh": "命名空間、斜線，然後是 getter 名稱、"
        },
        {
          "id": 59,
          "start": 187.5,
          "end": 189.22,
          "en": "action name, whatever it is.",
          "zh": "action 名稱或任何東西的名稱，"
        },
        {
          "id": 60,
          "start": 189.22,
          "end": 190.62,
          "en": "In this case, it's a getter.",
          "zh": "在這個例子中是 getter。"
        },
        {
          "id": 61,
          "start": 192.53,
          "end": 195.2,
          "en": "And that's when we now see at least one counter here,",
          "zh": "這樣一來，現在至少會看到一個計數器，"
        },
        {
          "id": 62,
          "start": 195.2,
          "end": 197.04,
          "en": "it's this normalized counter,",
          "zh": "也就是這個 normalizedCounter，"
        },
        {
          "id": 63,
          "start": 197.04,
          "end": 198.59,
          "en": "which I'm outputting like this.",
          "zh": "我是像這樣輸出它的。"
        },
        {
          "id": 64,
          "start": 199.97,
          "end": 203.7,
          "en": "Now if you are using map getters,",
          "zh": "如果你使用 mapGetters，"
        },
        {
          "id": 65,
          "start": 203.7,
          "end": 207.063,
          "en": "you pass a first argument to map getters,",
          "zh": "就要把命名空間作為第一個引數傳給 mapGetters，"
        },
        {
          "id": 66,
          "start": 207.98,
          "end": 211.39,
          "en": "which is your name space, in this case numbers,",
          "zh": "在這個例子中是 numbers，"
        },
        {
          "id": 67,
          "start": 211.39,
          "end": 213.76,
          "en": "and then there after you still add your array",
          "zh": "接著仍然像之前一樣"
        },
        {
          "id": 68,
          "start": 213.76,
          "end": 216.6,
          "en": "with the getter names as before.",
          "zh": "加上 getter 名稱的陣列。"
        },
        {
          "id": 69,
          "start": 216.6,
          "end": 218.52,
          "en": "So with that if we save this,",
          "zh": "這樣一來，儲存之後，"
        },
        {
          "id": 70,
          "start": 218.52,
          "end": 220.523,
          "en": "the second counter is back as well.",
          "zh": "第二個計數器也回來了。"
        },
        {
          "id": 71,
          "start": 222.02,
          "end": 224.12,
          "en": "So name space as a first argument,",
          "zh": "所以第一個引數是命名空間，"
        },
        {
          "id": 72,
          "start": 224.12,
          "end": 227.04,
          "en": "second argument is then still your array of getters",
          "zh": "第二個引數仍然是該命名空間中的"
        },
        {
          "id": 73,
          "start": 227.04,
          "end": 228.653,
          "en": "inside of that name space.",
          "zh": "getters 陣列。"
        },
        {
          "id": 74,
          "start": 230.64,
          "end": 232.97,
          "en": "And the same of course for the other parts.",
          "zh": "其他部分當然也一樣，"
        },
        {
          "id": 75,
          "start": 232.97,
          "end": 236.73,
          "en": "Map actions takes name space as a first argument",
          "zh": "mapActions 的第一個引數是命名空間，"
        },
        {
          "id": 76,
          "start": 236.73,
          "end": 240,
          "en": "and then your action names as before.",
          "zh": "接著像之前一樣是 action 名稱。"
        },
        {
          "id": 77,
          "start": 240,
          "end": 245,
          "en": "And in app vue, here we're at dispatch,",
          "zh": "而在 App.vue 中有 dispatch 的地方，"
        },
        {
          "id": 78,
          "start": 245.45,
          "end": 247.48,
          "en": "where I dispatch manually actually,",
          "zh": "也就是我手動 dispatch 的地方，"
        },
        {
          "id": 79,
          "start": 247.48,
          "end": 251.793,
          "en": "the type is now numbers slash increase.",
          "zh": "type 現在變成 numbers/increase，"
        },
        {
          "id": 80,
          "start": 252.92,
          "end": 256.423,
          "en": "So again, name space slash and then the action name.",
          "zh": "同樣是命名空間、斜線，再加上 action 名稱。"
        },
        {
          "id": 81,
          "start": 258.44,
          "end": 262.38,
          "en": "With that, all the buttons work again now",
          "zh": "這樣一來，所有按鈕又都能正常運作了。"
        },
        {
          "id": 82,
          "start": 262.38,
          "end": 265.17,
          "en": "and now we're using this name space in the future",
          "zh": "現在我們使用這個命名空間，"
        },
        {
          "id": 83,
          "start": 265.17,
          "end": 269.14,
          "en": "to detach our module and to make sure",
          "zh": "把模組分隔開來，並確保"
        },
        {
          "id": 84,
          "start": 269.14,
          "end": 272.17,
          "en": "that we don't have any name clashes,",
          "zh": "不會有任何名稱衝突，"
        },
        {
          "id": 85,
          "start": 272.17,
          "end": 274.05,
          "en": "which we of course don't have here,",
          "zh": "雖然這裡當然沒有衝突，"
        },
        {
          "id": 86,
          "start": 274.05,
          "end": 276.983,
          "en": "but which you in bigger apps definitely could have.",
          "zh": "但在較大的應用程式中絕對可能發生。"
        },
        {
          "id": 87,
          "start": 278.23,
          "end": 282.12,
          "en": "And with that, we're merging a module with our main store,",
          "zh": "這樣一來，我們把模組合併到主要的 store 中，"
        },
        {
          "id": 88,
          "start": 282.12,
          "end": 284.63,
          "en": "we still have some global state in there,",
          "zh": "其中仍然有一些全域狀態，"
        },
        {
          "id": 89,
          "start": 284.63,
          "end": 286.46,
          "en": "the authentication state,",
          "zh": "也就是驗證狀態，"
        },
        {
          "id": 90,
          "start": 286.46,
          "end": 288.87,
          "en": "but we can absolutely combine it like this",
          "zh": "但完全可以像這樣組合，"
        },
        {
          "id": 91,
          "start": 288.87,
          "end": 291.23,
          "en": "and we're even name spacing our module",
          "zh": "而且我們甚至"
        },
        {
          "id": 92,
          "start": 291.23,
          "end": 293.81,
          "en": "to make sure that we don't accidentally",
          "zh": "把模組命名空間化，確保我們不會在"
        },
        {
          "id": 93,
          "start": 293.81,
          "end": 296.54,
          "en": "trigger an action inside of this module",
          "zh": "其實想觸發全域 action 時，"
        },
        {
          "id": 94,
          "start": 296.54,
          "end": 299.93,
          "en": "when we actually wanted to trigger a global action,",
          "zh": "不小心觸發了這個模組中的 action，"
        },
        {
          "id": 95,
          "start": 299.93,
          "end": 300.923,
          "en": "for example.",
          "zh": "舉例來說。"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "21879798",
      "title": "Structuring Vuex Code & Files",
      "lectureOrder": 226,
      "videoOrder": 199,
      "sourceHash": "a58ab312848236b54aafccb7f615f088c56a717c906ff68709c076eb1f455ab6",
      "cues": [
        {
          "id": 1,
          "start": 2.12,
          "end": 3.7,
          "en": "With that, we are almost done",
          "zh": "到這裡，基礎部分"
        },
        {
          "id": 2,
          "start": 3.7,
          "end": 7.81,
          "en": "with the basics, but there is one, maybe obvious problem,",
          "zh": "差不多講完了，但有一個也許很明顯的問題："
        },
        {
          "id": 3,
          "start": 7.81,
          "end": 10.32,
          "en": "the main JS file is huge.",
          "zh": "main.js 檔案非常龐大。"
        },
        {
          "id": 4,
          "start": 10.32,
          "end": 14.12,
          "en": "It has the entire store and even an extra module in there,",
          "zh": "裡面有整個 store，甚至還有一個額外的模組。"
        },
        {
          "id": 5,
          "start": 14.12,
          "end": 16.85,
          "en": "and it might work for this app,",
          "zh": "對這個應用程式來說也許還行，"
        },
        {
          "id": 6,
          "start": 16.85,
          "end": 18.66,
          "en": "but even here, it's a lot of code.",
          "zh": "但即使在這裡，程式碼也已經很多了。"
        },
        {
          "id": 7,
          "start": 18.66,
          "end": 19.56,
          "en": "In bigger apps,",
          "zh": "在更大的應用程式中，"
        },
        {
          "id": 8,
          "start": 19.56,
          "end": 23.023,
          "en": "I definitely don't want to have that all in main JS.",
          "zh": "我絕對不想把這些全都放在 main.js 中。"
        },
        {
          "id": 9,
          "start": 23.94,
          "end": 26.27,
          "en": "Instead, just as with rooting,",
          "zh": "就像路由一樣，"
        },
        {
          "id": 10,
          "start": 26.27,
          "end": 29.03,
          "en": "you typically create extra files for that.",
          "zh": "通常會為此建立額外的檔案。"
        },
        {
          "id": 11,
          "start": 29.03,
          "end": 31.61,
          "en": "You could start with a store JS file",
          "zh": "你可以先建立一個 store.js 檔案，"
        },
        {
          "id": 12,
          "start": 31.61,
          "end": 34.82,
          "en": "and outsource your entire store into that.",
          "zh": "把整個 store 抽到裡面，"
        },
        {
          "id": 13,
          "start": 34.82,
          "end": 37.07,
          "en": "That might be a good start.",
          "zh": "這可能是個不錯的開始。"
        },
        {
          "id": 14,
          "start": 37.07,
          "end": 41.02,
          "en": "So let's grab the module and this store,",
          "zh": "所以我們把模組和 store"
        },
        {
          "id": 15,
          "start": 41.02,
          "end": 45.863,
          "en": "cut it all from main JS and instead, add it in store JS.",
          "zh": "從 main.js 中剪下，加到 store.js 中。"
        },
        {
          "id": 16,
          "start": 46.82,
          "end": 48.32,
          "en": "And then also, of course,",
          "zh": "當然，也要"
        },
        {
          "id": 17,
          "start": 48.32,
          "end": 51.05,
          "en": "cut the create store import,",
          "zh": "剪下 createStore 的匯入，"
        },
        {
          "id": 18,
          "start": 51.05,
          "end": 52.52,
          "en": "go to store JS",
          "zh": "到 store.js 中"
        },
        {
          "id": 19,
          "start": 53.43,
          "end": 55.15,
          "en": "and add the import here",
          "zh": "在這裡加入這個匯入，"
        },
        {
          "id": 20,
          "start": 55.15,
          "end": 58.17,
          "en": "because we use create store in his file,",
          "zh": "因為這個檔案中會用到 createStore。"
        },
        {
          "id": 21,
          "start": 58.17,
          "end": 62.34,
          "en": "and then in the end, export the store as a default",
          "zh": "最後把 store 作為預設匯出，"
        },
        {
          "id": 22,
          "start": 62.34,
          "end": 65.53,
          "en": "so that we can import it in main JS.",
          "zh": "這樣就能在 main.js 中匯入它："
        },
        {
          "id": 23,
          "start": 65.53,
          "end": 68.94,
          "en": "Import store from store JS",
          "zh": "從 store.js 匯入 store。"
        },
        {
          "id": 24,
          "start": 69.97,
          "end": 72.47,
          "en": "and with that, everything should be working again.",
          "zh": "這樣一來，一切應該又能正常運作了。"
        },
        {
          "id": 25,
          "start": 73.33,
          "end": 76.57,
          "en": "Yes. But this is just a start.",
          "zh": "沒錯。但這只是個開始，"
        },
        {
          "id": 26,
          "start": 76.57,
          "end": 81.2,
          "en": "Store JS is still huge and in bigger apps with many modules,",
          "zh": "store.js 仍然很龐大，在有許多模組的大型應用程式中，"
        },
        {
          "id": 27,
          "start": 81.2,
          "end": 83.873,
          "en": "this quickly becomes a super large file.",
          "zh": "它很快就會變成一個超大的檔案。"
        },
        {
          "id": 28,
          "start": 84.76,
          "end": 88.11,
          "en": "Therefore, typically, we go even further than that.",
          "zh": "因此，通常我們會更進一步。"
        },
        {
          "id": 29,
          "start": 88.11,
          "end": 91.69,
          "en": "Often, you add a separate folder named store,",
          "zh": "很多時候會新增一個名為 store 的獨立資料夾，"
        },
        {
          "id": 30,
          "start": 91.69,
          "end": 95.61,
          "en": "and in there, you then have your index JS file,",
          "zh": "在裡面放一個 index.js 檔案，"
        },
        {
          "id": 31,
          "start": 95.61,
          "end": 99.023,
          "en": "which holds your main store creation logic,",
          "zh": "存放建立主要 store 的邏輯，"
        },
        {
          "id": 32,
          "start": 99.88,
          "end": 104.88,
          "en": "then you have separate files for actions and mutations,",
          "zh": "然後為 actions 和 mutations 建立獨立的檔案，"
        },
        {
          "id": 33,
          "start": 108.43,
          "end": 111.283,
          "en": "possibly all the for getters, if you want to.",
          "zh": "如果想要，也可以為 getters 建立。"
        },
        {
          "id": 34,
          "start": 113.31,
          "end": 115.71000000000001,
          "en": "And then we create separate sub folders",
          "zh": "接著為可能有的所有模組"
        },
        {
          "id": 35,
          "start": 115.71000000000001,
          "end": 117.59,
          "en": "for all the modules we might have,",
          "zh": "建立獨立的子資料夾，"
        },
        {
          "id": 36,
          "start": 117.59,
          "end": 119.45,
          "en": "like the counter module.",
          "zh": "例如 counter 模組，"
        },
        {
          "id": 37,
          "start": 119.45,
          "end": 122.09,
          "en": "And then there again, you could have a index JS file,",
          "zh": "在裡面同樣可以有 index.js 檔案、"
        },
        {
          "id": 38,
          "start": 122.09,
          "end": 125.58,
          "en": "actions JS ends on to merge things together.",
          "zh": "actions.js 等等，再把它們合併起來。"
        },
        {
          "id": 39,
          "start": 125.58,
          "end": 127.74,
          "en": "Now I'm going to split it like this",
          "zh": "我會像這樣拆分，"
        },
        {
          "id": 40,
          "start": 127.74,
          "end": 129.89,
          "en": "to show you how this could work,",
          "zh": "示範這樣做的方式。"
        },
        {
          "id": 41,
          "start": 129.89,
          "end": 132.33,
          "en": "I will also be honest for this demo,",
          "zh": "老實說，以這個示範來說，"
        },
        {
          "id": 42,
          "start": 132.33,
          "end": 134.583,
          "en": "of course, that's all overkill.",
          "zh": "這當然完全是殺雞用牛刀。"
        },
        {
          "id": 43,
          "start": 135.89,
          "end": 137.78,
          "en": "But with Deb, we have a bunch of files",
          "zh": "但這樣我們就有了一堆檔案，"
        },
        {
          "id": 44,
          "start": 137.78,
          "end": 141.31,
          "en": "and now let's see how we split the code into those files.",
          "zh": "現在來看看如何把程式碼拆分到這些檔案中。"
        },
        {
          "id": 45,
          "start": 141.31,
          "end": 143.44,
          "en": "In store JS here,",
          "zh": "在這裡的 store.js 中，"
        },
        {
          "id": 46,
          "start": 143.44,
          "end": 147.023,
          "en": "I will grab from my main store,",
          "zh": "我會從主要的 store 中"
        },
        {
          "id": 47,
          "start": 149.35,
          "end": 153.623,
          "en": "this whole logic to create a store, including the export.",
          "zh": "取出建立 store 的整段邏輯，包括 export，"
        },
        {
          "id": 48,
          "start": 155.86,
          "end": 160.09,
          "en": "And I will cut that and add it to index JS in store.",
          "zh": "剪下並加到 store 資料夾中的 index.js。"
        },
        {
          "id": 49,
          "start": 160.09,
          "end": 163.653,
          "en": "So not index inside of counter, but index inside of store.",
          "zh": "所以不是 counter 裡的 index，而是 store 裡的 index。"
        },
        {
          "id": 50,
          "start": 164.643,
          "end": 168.37,
          "en": "I'll also grab the import here of create store",
          "zh": "我也會取出 createStore 的這個匯入，"
        },
        {
          "id": 51,
          "start": 168.37,
          "end": 171.853,
          "en": "and add that to index JS in the store folder.",
          "zh": "加到 store 資料夾中的 index.js。"
        },
        {
          "id": 52,
          "start": 173.42000000000002,
          "end": 176.66,
          "en": "Now, I grab my mutations,",
          "zh": "接著取出 mutations，"
        },
        {
          "id": 53,
          "start": 176.66,
          "end": 180.093,
          "en": "in this case, the one root mutation I have here,",
          "zh": "在這個例子中就是我這裡唯一的根 mutation，"
        },
        {
          "id": 54,
          "start": 182.06,
          "end": 187.06,
          "en": "grab this object here and in the mutations JS file,",
          "zh": "取出這個物件，然後在 mutations.js 檔案中"
        },
        {
          "id": 55,
          "start": 187.1,
          "end": 190.62,
          "en": "I will simply export this object now.",
          "zh": "直接匯出這個物件。"
        },
        {
          "id": 56,
          "start": 190.62,
          "end": 192.21,
          "en": "Again, this is overkill.",
          "zh": "再說一次，這是殺雞用牛刀，"
        },
        {
          "id": 57,
          "start": 192.21,
          "end": 194.36,
          "en": "Just having one object in a file,",
          "zh": "一個檔案中只有一個物件，"
        },
        {
          "id": 58,
          "start": 194.36,
          "end": 197.56,
          "en": "there would be nothing wrong with having that in index JS.",
          "zh": "放在 index.js 中也完全沒問題。"
        },
        {
          "id": 59,
          "start": 197.56,
          "end": 200.27,
          "en": "I'll just show you the ultimate solution",
          "zh": "我只是在這裡示範"
        },
        {
          "id": 60,
          "start": 200.27,
          "end": 201.923,
          "en": "for very big apps here.",
          "zh": "適用於大型應用程式的終極做法。"
        },
        {
          "id": 61,
          "start": 203.14,
          "end": 206.34,
          "en": "So with that, I'm exporting my mutation object",
          "zh": "這樣一來，我匯出了 mutations 物件，"
        },
        {
          "id": 62,
          "start": 206.34,
          "end": 209.66,
          "en": "and re-import that in index JS then.",
          "zh": "然後在 index.js 中重新匯入它："
        },
        {
          "id": 63,
          "start": 209.66,
          "end": 214.66,
          "en": "Import mutations from mutations JS.",
          "zh": "從 mutations.js 匯入 mutations，"
        },
        {
          "id": 64,
          "start": 216.823,
          "end": 219.87,
          "en": "Maybe also named as root mutations",
          "zh": "或許也可以命名為 rootMutations，"
        },
        {
          "id": 65,
          "start": 219.87,
          "end": 222.53,
          "en": "to make it clear that these are the mutations",
          "zh": "清楚表示這些 mutations"
        },
        {
          "id": 66,
          "start": 222.53,
          "end": 225.25,
          "en": "that influence our root state here.",
          "zh": "影響的是根狀態。"
        },
        {
          "id": 67,
          "start": 225.25,
          "end": 228.813,
          "en": "And I assign root mutations to mutations then.",
          "zh": "接著把 rootMutations 指定給 mutations。"
        },
        {
          "id": 68,
          "start": 230.41,
          "end": 232.079,
          "en": "Same for actions.",
          "zh": "actions 也一樣，"
        },
        {
          "id": 69,
          "start": 232.079,
          "end": 235.45,
          "en": "You can grab the actions, object actually,",
          "zh": "取出 actions 物件，"
        },
        {
          "id": 70,
          "start": 235.45,
          "end": 239.14,
          "en": "go to the actions JS file in the store folder,",
          "zh": "到 store 資料夾中的 actions.js 檔案，"
        },
        {
          "id": 71,
          "start": 239.14,
          "end": 243.48,
          "en": "export it as a default, like this,",
          "zh": "像這樣把它作為預設匯出，"
        },
        {
          "id": 72,
          "start": 243.48,
          "end": 245.24,
          "en": "and back in index JS,",
          "zh": "然後回到 index.js，"
        },
        {
          "id": 73,
          "start": 245.24,
          "end": 250.24,
          "en": "we then import the root actions from actions JS.",
          "zh": "從 actions.js 匯入 rootActions，"
        },
        {
          "id": 74,
          "start": 253.707,
          "end": 257.7,
          "en": "And then assign root actions here to actions.",
          "zh": "再把 rootActions 指定給 actions。"
        },
        {
          "id": 75,
          "start": 260.3,
          "end": 261.56,
          "en": "At the same, if you want,",
          "zh": "如果想要，"
        },
        {
          "id": 76,
          "start": 261.56,
          "end": 263.823,
          "en": "for getters, grab the getters,",
          "zh": "getters 也一樣，取出 getters，"
        },
        {
          "id": 77,
          "start": 264.68,
          "end": 268.223,
          "en": "export them into getters JS file, like that.",
          "zh": "像這樣匯出到 getters.js 檔案中，"
        },
        {
          "id": 78,
          "start": 269.49,
          "end": 271.17,
          "en": "And back at index JS,",
          "zh": "然後回到 index.js，"
        },
        {
          "id": 79,
          "start": 271.17,
          "end": 276.17,
          "en": "I import my root getters from ./gettersjs",
          "zh": "從 ./getters.js 匯入 rootGetters，"
        },
        {
          "id": 80,
          "start": 279.61,
          "end": 282.193,
          "en": "and assigned root getters to getters.",
          "zh": "並把 rootGetters 指定給 getters。"
        },
        {
          "id": 81,
          "start": 284.53,
          "end": 286.7,
          "en": "And now, this is a very lean file.",
          "zh": "現在這個檔案就非常精簡了。"
        },
        {
          "id": 82,
          "start": 286.7,
          "end": 289.093,
          "en": "The state stays in here by the way.",
          "zh": "順帶一提，state 留在這裡。"
        },
        {
          "id": 83,
          "start": 290.39,
          "end": 292.31,
          "en": "Now for the modules.",
          "zh": "接著處理模組。"
        },
        {
          "id": 84,
          "start": 292.31,
          "end": 295.023,
          "en": "In store JS, I still have the counter module.",
          "zh": "在 store.js 中仍然有 counter 模組，"
        },
        {
          "id": 85,
          "start": 296.38,
          "end": 298.67,
          "en": "I now grab this code,",
          "zh": "我現在把這段程式碼取出，"
        },
        {
          "id": 86,
          "start": 298.67,
          "end": 300.41,
          "en": "so that store JS is empty",
          "zh": "這樣 store.js 就空了，"
        },
        {
          "id": 87,
          "start": 300.41,
          "end": 303.13,
          "en": "and hence we can delete the file, of course,",
          "zh": "當然就可以刪除這個檔案。"
        },
        {
          "id": 88,
          "start": 303.13,
          "end": 305.95,
          "en": "and go to the counter folder in the store folder,",
          "zh": "然後到 store 資料夾中的 counter 資料夾，"
        },
        {
          "id": 89,
          "start": 305.95,
          "end": 308.513,
          "en": "and there, in index JS, I paste it in.",
          "zh": "在其中的 index.js 中貼上，"
        },
        {
          "id": 90,
          "start": 309.39,
          "end": 311.54,
          "en": "And I export this entire object",
          "zh": "並像這樣直接把整個物件"
        },
        {
          "id": 91,
          "start": 311.54,
          "end": 313.833,
          "en": "as a default simply like this.",
          "zh": "作為預設匯出。"
        },
        {
          "id": 92,
          "start": 316.68,
          "end": 319.23,
          "en": "I leave namespaced here, I'll leave state here,",
          "zh": "namespaced 和 state 留在這裡，"
        },
        {
          "id": 93,
          "start": 319.23,
          "end": 321.65,
          "en": "but I grabbed the mutations object",
          "zh": "但把 mutations 物件取出，"
        },
        {
          "id": 94,
          "start": 321.65,
          "end": 324.62,
          "en": "and move that to the mutations JS folder",
          "zh": "移到這個 counter 子資料夾中的"
        },
        {
          "id": 95,
          "start": 324.62,
          "end": 326.9,
          "en": "in this counter sub folder",
          "zh": "mutations.js 檔案，"
        },
        {
          "id": 96,
          "start": 326.9,
          "end": 329.66,
          "en": "and exports that in here.",
          "zh": "在那裡匯出它。"
        },
        {
          "id": 97,
          "start": 329.66,
          "end": 331.51,
          "en": "And then again, in index JS,",
          "zh": "接著同樣在 index.js 中，"
        },
        {
          "id": 98,
          "start": 331.51,
          "end": 334.89,
          "en": "but now in index JS inside of the counter,",
          "zh": "不過這次是 counter 裡的 index.js，"
        },
        {
          "id": 99,
          "start": 334.89,
          "end": 339.89,
          "en": "I import counter mutations from ./mutationsjs",
          "zh": "從 ./mutations.js 匯入 counterMutations，"
        },
        {
          "id": 100,
          "start": 342.6,
          "end": 346.463,
          "en": "and assign those here to mutations.",
          "zh": "並把它們指定給 mutations。"
        },
        {
          "id": 101,
          "start": 347.86,
          "end": 349.71,
          "en": "Same thing for actions.",
          "zh": "actions 也一樣，"
        },
        {
          "id": 102,
          "start": 349.71,
          "end": 353.54,
          "en": "Grab the object, go to actions JS,",
          "zh": "取出物件，到 actions.js 中，"
        },
        {
          "id": 103,
          "start": 353.54,
          "end": 355.953,
          "en": "export them here as a default,",
          "zh": "像這樣作為預設匯出，"
        },
        {
          "id": 104,
          "start": 357.55,
          "end": 362.55,
          "en": "like this, and in index JS, import them.",
          "zh": "然後在 index.js 中匯入："
        },
        {
          "id": 105,
          "start": 363.32,
          "end": 368.32,
          "en": "Import counter actions from actions JS",
          "zh": "從 actions.js 匯入 counterActions，"
        },
        {
          "id": 106,
          "start": 368.73,
          "end": 371.063,
          "en": "and assign them here to actions.",
          "zh": "並把它們指定給 actions。"
        },
        {
          "id": 107,
          "start": 373,
          "end": 373.91,
          "en": "And last but not least,",
          "zh": "最後，"
        },
        {
          "id": 108,
          "start": 373.91,
          "end": 377.24,
          "en": "we can do the same thing here for getters.",
          "zh": "getters 也可以這樣處理。"
        },
        {
          "id": 109,
          "start": 377.24,
          "end": 379.2,
          "en": "Grab the getters object,",
          "zh": "取出 getters 物件，"
        },
        {
          "id": 110,
          "start": 379.2,
          "end": 382.323,
          "en": "add a getters JS file inside of the counter,",
          "zh": "在 counter 中新增 getters.js 檔案，"
        },
        {
          "id": 111,
          "start": 383.27,
          "end": 385.983,
          "en": "export our getters object like this,",
          "zh": "像這樣匯出 getters 物件，"
        },
        {
          "id": 112,
          "start": 387.37,
          "end": 388.793,
          "en": "and then import it.",
          "zh": "然後再匯入它。"
        },
        {
          "id": 113,
          "start": 390.14,
          "end": 392.3,
          "en": "Of course, you can tweak the file names, by the way,",
          "zh": "順帶一提，檔案名稱當然可以調整，"
        },
        {
          "id": 114,
          "start": 392.3,
          "end": 394.9,
          "en": "you don't have to use these exact file names,",
          "zh": "不一定要用完全一樣的名稱，"
        },
        {
          "id": 115,
          "start": 394.9,
          "end": 397.07,
          "en": "I'm just following some convention here,",
          "zh": "我只是遵循某種慣例，"
        },
        {
          "id": 116,
          "start": 397.07,
          "end": 399.57,
          "en": "but you could also use a different file name here.",
          "zh": "你也可以在這裡使用不同的檔案名稱。"
        },
        {
          "id": 117,
          "start": 401.2,
          "end": 406.2,
          "en": "So here I then have to counter getters from getters JS.",
          "zh": "所以這裡我從 getters.js 匯入 counterGetters，"
        },
        {
          "id": 118,
          "start": 408.45,
          "end": 409.963,
          "en": "So I'll assign them here.",
          "zh": "並在這裡指定它們。"
        },
        {
          "id": 119,
          "start": 411.15999999999997,
          "end": 413.37,
          "en": "And now, this all split up,",
          "zh": "現在全部都拆分好了，"
        },
        {
          "id": 120,
          "start": 413.37,
          "end": 415.2,
          "en": "I'm exporting my module here,",
          "zh": "我在這裡匯出模組，"
        },
        {
          "id": 121,
          "start": 415.2,
          "end": 418.73,
          "en": "so now in index JS here, in the store folder,",
          "zh": "因此現在在 store 資料夾中的 index.js 裡，"
        },
        {
          "id": 122,
          "start": 418.73,
          "end": 422.49,
          "en": "I can import my counter module",
          "zh": "可以從 counter/index.js"
        },
        {
          "id": 123,
          "start": 422.49,
          "end": 427.43,
          "en": "from counter index JS.",
          "zh": "匯入 counterModule，"
        },
        {
          "id": 124,
          "start": 427.43,
          "end": 431.473,
          "en": "And now assign my counter module to numbers.",
          "zh": "並把 counterModule 指定給 numbers。"
        },
        {
          "id": 125,
          "start": 433.65,
          "end": 438.45,
          "en": "And now in main JS, we no longer import store from store JS,",
          "zh": "而在 main.js 中，不再從 store.js 匯入 store，"
        },
        {
          "id": 126,
          "start": 438.45,
          "end": 442.003,
          "en": "but from the store folder enter there the index JS file.",
          "zh": "而是從 store 資料夾，也就是其中的 index.js 檔案匯入。"
        },
        {
          "id": 127,
          "start": 443.84,
          "end": 448.43,
          "en": "And with all that out of the way, it works as before,",
          "zh": "處理完這些之後，一切都和之前一樣正常運作，"
        },
        {
          "id": 128,
          "start": 448.43,
          "end": 451.23,
          "en": "but now with a different folder structure.",
          "zh": "只是資料夾結構不同了。"
        },
        {
          "id": 129,
          "start": 451.23,
          "end": 453.68,
          "en": "Now, if you want that structure, know that it's up to you,",
          "zh": "要不要採用這種結構由你決定，"
        },
        {
          "id": 130,
          "start": 453.68,
          "end": 455.76,
          "en": "but it is one option.",
          "zh": "但這是其中一種選擇。"
        },
        {
          "id": 131,
          "start": 455.76,
          "end": 457.34000000000003,
          "en": "You can also change this a bit more.",
          "zh": "你也可以再做更多調整。"
        },
        {
          "id": 132,
          "start": 457.34000000000003,
          "end": 459.28,
          "en": "If you had multiple modules,",
          "zh": "如果有多個模組，"
        },
        {
          "id": 133,
          "start": 459.28,
          "end": 461.88,
          "en": "you could also add a modules folder here",
          "zh": "也可以在這裡新增一個 modules 資料夾，"
        },
        {
          "id": 134,
          "start": 461.88,
          "end": 464.94,
          "en": "and move counter into modules",
          "zh": "把 counter 移到 modules 中，"
        },
        {
          "id": 135,
          "start": 464.94,
          "end": 469.39,
          "en": "and then have other modules like a products module folder,",
          "zh": "如果還有其他模組，例如 products 模組資料夾，"
        },
        {
          "id": 136,
          "start": 469.39,
          "end": 472.27,
          "en": "if you had some, in the modules folder as well.",
          "zh": "也一併放在 modules 資料夾中，"
        },
        {
          "id": 137,
          "start": 472.27,
          "end": 475.763,
          "en": "To make it clearer that you manage your modules in here,",
          "zh": "更清楚地表示模組都在這裡管理。"
        },
        {
          "id": 138,
          "start": 476.61,
          "end": 478.86,
          "en": "you then just need to adjust the import",
          "zh": "接著只要調整匯入，"
        },
        {
          "id": 139,
          "start": 478.86,
          "end": 483.693,
          "en": "and import counter module from modules counter index.",
          "zh": "從 modules/counter/index 匯入 counterModule。"
        },
        {
          "id": 140,
          "start": 484.55,
          "end": 485.72,
          "en": "And as I mentioned before,",
          "zh": "而且如前所述，"
        },
        {
          "id": 141,
          "start": 485.72,
          "end": 487.46,
          "en": "you can also tweak the file names",
          "zh": "你也可以調整檔案名稱，"
        },
        {
          "id": 142,
          "start": 487.46,
          "end": 489.57,
          "en": "so that they make sense to you.",
          "zh": "讓它們對你來說更合理。"
        },
        {
          "id": 143,
          "start": 489.57,
          "end": 491.88,
          "en": "You could also split action, getters,",
          "zh": "你也可以只為根狀態拆分 actions、getters、"
        },
        {
          "id": 144,
          "start": 491.88,
          "end": 494.48,
          "en": "mutations and so on, for the root state,",
          "zh": "mutations 等等，"
        },
        {
          "id": 145,
          "start": 494.48,
          "end": 496.72,
          "en": "but not for the modules.",
          "zh": "而不拆分模組的部分。"
        },
        {
          "id": 146,
          "start": 496.72,
          "end": 499.07,
          "en": "It's up to you, which structure you want,",
          "zh": "要用哪種結構由你決定，"
        },
        {
          "id": 147,
          "start": 499.07,
          "end": 501.93,
          "en": "I'm just showing you one possible approach",
          "zh": "我只是示範一種可能的做法，"
        },
        {
          "id": 148,
          "start": 501.93,
          "end": 505.75,
          "en": "to make sure that you have small maintainable files",
          "zh": "確保你擁有小巧、好維護的檔案，"
        },
        {
          "id": 149,
          "start": 505.75,
          "end": 508.31,
          "en": "instead of one super big file,",
          "zh": "而不是一個超大的檔案，"
        },
        {
          "id": 150,
          "start": 508.31,
          "end": 511.58,
          "en": "where you then have to search for things all the time.",
          "zh": "讓你得一直在裡面找東西。"
        },
        {
          "id": 151,
          "start": 511.58,
          "end": 512.99,
          "en": "And therefore, this here,",
          "zh": "因此，這就是"
        },
        {
          "id": 152,
          "start": 512.99,
          "end": 516.35,
          "en": "is one possible way of building this.",
          "zh": "其中一種可能的做法。"
        },
        {
          "id": 153,
          "start": 516.35,
          "end": 518.53,
          "en": "It is overkill for this demo,",
          "zh": "對這個示範來說是殺雞用牛刀，"
        },
        {
          "id": 154,
          "start": 518.53,
          "end": 521.763,
          "en": "but of course it shows you what you can do in bigger apps.",
          "zh": "但它當然展示了在大型應用程式中可以怎麼做。"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "21879800",
      "title": "A Challenge!",
      "lectureOrder": 227,
      "videoOrder": 200,
      "sourceHash": "0a4208f0f4104fd8b8b8bc93a226c41225ebbd927599e496a752b40a0814e975",
      "cues": [
        {
          "id": 1,
          "start": 2.13,
          "end": 3.37,
          "en": "So now that we've learned",
          "zh": "現在我們已經學會"
        },
        {
          "id": 2,
          "start": 3.37,
          "end": 6.85,
          "en": "the basics about Vuex, I want you to practice it",
          "zh": "Vuex 的基礎，我希望你在"
        },
        {
          "id": 3,
          "start": 6.85,
          "end": 10.41,
          "en": "in at least a little bit of a bigger application.",
          "zh": "一個至少稍微大一點的應用程式中練習。"
        },
        {
          "id": 4,
          "start": 10.41,
          "end": 12.5,
          "en": "You'll find this application attached,",
          "zh": "附件中有這個應用程式，"
        },
        {
          "id": 5,
          "start": 12.5,
          "end": 16.73,
          "en": "as always, NPM install, and NPM run serve, are your friends.",
          "zh": "和往常一樣，npm install 和 npm run serve 是你的好幫手。"
        },
        {
          "id": 6,
          "start": 16.73,
          "end": 20.12,
          "en": "And we've got this very simple demo online shop there.",
          "zh": "這裡有一個非常簡單的示範線上商店，"
        },
        {
          "id": 7,
          "start": 20.12,
          "end": 22.49,
          "en": "Got a few products, we can add them to a cart,",
          "zh": "有幾個商品，可以把它們加入購物車，"
        },
        {
          "id": 8,
          "start": 22.49,
          "end": 25.12,
          "en": "and you see this cart counter increases",
          "zh": "每加入一個商品，"
        },
        {
          "id": 9,
          "start": 25.12,
          "end": 27.25,
          "en": "every time I add a product.",
          "zh": "就會看到這個購物車計數增加。"
        },
        {
          "id": 10,
          "start": 27.25,
          "end": 31.28,
          "en": "We can then view our cart, see the cart's total here,",
          "zh": "接著可以查看購物車，在這裡看到購物車總金額，"
        },
        {
          "id": 11,
          "start": 31.28,
          "end": 33.58,
          "en": "see our items here.",
          "zh": "以及其中的商品，"
        },
        {
          "id": 12,
          "start": 33.58,
          "end": 35.5,
          "en": "And we can remove items from the cart,",
          "zh": "還可以從購物車中移除商品，"
        },
        {
          "id": 13,
          "start": 35.5,
          "end": 36.9,
          "en": "and everything updates.",
          "zh": "一切都會跟著更新。"
        },
        {
          "id": 14,
          "start": 36.9,
          "end": 38.6,
          "en": "We also got this login button,",
          "zh": "這裡也有一個登入按鈕，"
        },
        {
          "id": 15,
          "start": 38.6,
          "end": 41.7,
          "en": "which doesn't do anything at the moment, actually,",
          "zh": "其實它目前沒有任何作用，"
        },
        {
          "id": 16,
          "start": 41.7,
          "end": 42.81,
          "en": "even though it should,",
          "zh": "雖然它應該要有作用，"
        },
        {
          "id": 17,
          "start": 42.81,
          "end": 45.11,
          "en": "but here we're facing some limitations",
          "zh": "但這裡遇到了"
        },
        {
          "id": 18,
          "start": 45.11,
          "end": 47.21,
          "en": "by a provide and inject.",
          "zh": "provide 和 inject 的一些限制。"
        },
        {
          "id": 19,
          "start": 47.21,
          "end": 49.95,
          "en": "If you update something which is not an array,",
          "zh": "如果你更新的不是陣列"
        },
        {
          "id": 20,
          "start": 49.95,
          "end": 52.84,
          "en": "or not an object, like in this case,",
          "zh": "或物件，例如在這個例子中，"
        },
        {
          "id": 21,
          "start": 52.84,
          "end": 56.07,
          "en": "where I'm in the end updating, is logged in,",
          "zh": "我最終更新的是 isLoggedIn，"
        },
        {
          "id": 22,
          "start": 56.07,
          "end": 57.42,
          "en": "which is a bullion,",
          "zh": "它是布林值，"
        },
        {
          "id": 23,
          "start": 57.42,
          "end": 59.56,
          "en": "the changes to that will not be reflected",
          "zh": "那麼這個變化就不會反映"
        },
        {
          "id": 24,
          "start": 59.56,
          "end": 63.283,
          "en": "back to the components that inject that status.",
          "zh": "到注入這個狀態的元件中。"
        },
        {
          "id": 25,
          "start": 64.38,
          "end": 66.3,
          "en": "We don't have to worry too much about this though,",
          "zh": "不過我們不必太擔心這點，"
        },
        {
          "id": 26,
          "start": 66.3,
          "end": 69.45,
          "en": "because your goal is a different one anyways.",
          "zh": "因為你的目標本來就不是這個。"
        },
        {
          "id": 27,
          "start": 69.45,
          "end": 74.32,
          "en": "I want you to try to migrate this entire state,",
          "zh": "我希望你試著把這整個"
        },
        {
          "id": 28,
          "start": 74.32,
          "end": 78.52,
          "en": "which is managed application-wide, to Vuex.",
          "zh": "在整個應用程式範圍內管理的狀態遷移到 Vuex，"
        },
        {
          "id": 29,
          "start": 78.52,
          "end": 79.68,
          "en": "So, the products",
          "zh": "也就是商品、"
        },
        {
          "id": 30,
          "start": 79.68,
          "end": 83.57,
          "en": "and the, is locked, in state, also the cart.",
          "zh": "isLoggedIn 狀態，還有購物車。"
        },
        {
          "id": 31,
          "start": 83.57,
          "end": 86.46000000000001,
          "en": "Set up Vuex in whichever way you want",
          "zh": "用任何你想要的方式設定 Vuex，"
        },
        {
          "id": 32,
          "start": 86.46000000000001,
          "end": 89.46000000000001,
          "en": "using modules, or not using modules,",
          "zh": "要不要使用模組，"
        },
        {
          "id": 33,
          "start": 89.46000000000001,
          "end": 91.93,
          "en": "using namespaces, or not using them.",
          "zh": "要不要使用命名空間都可以，"
        },
        {
          "id": 34,
          "start": 91.93,
          "end": 94.833,
          "en": "And try this on your own as a practice.",
          "zh": "試著自己動手練習。"
        },
        {
          "id": 35,
          "start": 95.67,
          "end": 97.35,
          "en": "From the next lecture on,",
          "zh": "從下一堂課開始，"
        },
        {
          "id": 36,
          "start": 97.35,
          "end": 99.53,
          "en": "we'll migrate this together",
          "zh": "我們會一起進行遷移，"
        },
        {
          "id": 37,
          "start": 99.53,
          "end": 102.053,
          "en": "so that you see my possible solution.",
          "zh": "讓你看看我的一種解法。"
        },
        {
          "id": 38,
          "start": 103.05,
          "end": 104.47999999999999,
          "en": "This will be a great practice,",
          "zh": "這會是很好的練習，"
        },
        {
          "id": 39,
          "start": 104.47999999999999,
          "end": 106.1,
          "en": "and hopefully helps you understand",
          "zh": "希望能幫助你理解"
        },
        {
          "id": 40,
          "start": 106.1,
          "end": 109.513,
          "en": "how you really use Vuex in projects.",
          "zh": "在專案中實際該如何使用 Vuex。"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "21879808",
      "title": "Challenge Solution (1/3)",
      "lectureOrder": 228,
      "videoOrder": 201,
      "sourceHash": "4a47d9a3dbdb0488f9414b8daa2108721339762f66cf8504802a03f180375f35",
      "cues": [
        {
          "id": 1,
          "start": 2.21,
          "end": 3.9,
          "en": "So did you succeed?",
          "zh": "所以，你成功了嗎？"
        },
        {
          "id": 2,
          "start": 3.9,
          "end": 5.81,
          "en": "Let's try this together.",
          "zh": "讓我們一起來試試看。"
        },
        {
          "id": 3,
          "start": 5.81,
          "end": 9.12,
          "en": "For this, I will add a store folder here",
          "zh": "為此，我會在這裡新增一個 store 資料夾，"
        },
        {
          "id": 4,
          "start": 9.12,
          "end": 11.593,
          "en": "and in there add an index JS file.",
          "zh": "並在其中新增一個 index.js 檔案。"
        },
        {
          "id": 5,
          "start": 12.88,
          "end": 15.8,
          "en": "I will also already add a modules folder",
          "zh": "我也會先新增一個 modules 資料夾，"
        },
        {
          "id": 6,
          "start": 15.8,
          "end": 18.71,
          "en": "because I will definitely use some modules.",
          "zh": "因為我肯定會用到一些 module。"
        },
        {
          "id": 7,
          "start": 18.71,
          "end": 21.77,
          "en": "Looking at our state here in App.vue,",
          "zh": "看看我們 App.vue 裡的 state，"
        },
        {
          "id": 8,
          "start": 21.77,
          "end": 24.71,
          "en": "I think we have three main kinds of state,",
          "zh": "我認為我們有三種主要的 state，"
        },
        {
          "id": 9,
          "start": 24.71,
          "end": 26.51,
          "en": "we have the products,",
          "zh": "我們有 products，"
        },
        {
          "id": 10,
          "start": 26.51,
          "end": 28.12,
          "en": "we have the cart,",
          "zh": "我們有 cart，"
        },
        {
          "id": 11,
          "start": 28.12,
          "end": 31.94,
          "en": "we could also treat products and cart as one state",
          "zh": "我們也可以把 products 和 cart 視為同一個 state，"
        },
        {
          "id": 12,
          "start": 31.94,
          "end": 33.853,
          "en": "to shop state so to say.",
          "zh": "也就是所謂的 shop state。"
        },
        {
          "id": 13,
          "start": 34.72,
          "end": 36.86,
          "en": "And we then have isLoggedIn",
          "zh": "然後我們還有 isLoggedIn，"
        },
        {
          "id": 14,
          "start": 36.86,
          "end": 38.773,
          "en": "which is the authentication state.",
          "zh": "也就是身分驗證的 state。"
        },
        {
          "id": 15,
          "start": 39.69,
          "end": 41.72,
          "en": "Now there will be different ways of solving this.",
          "zh": "現在，解決這個問題會有不同的方式。"
        },
        {
          "id": 16,
          "start": 41.72,
          "end": 45.76,
          "en": "But I will put isLoggedIn into my root state so to say,",
          "zh": "但我會把 isLoggedIn 放進所謂的根 state，"
        },
        {
          "id": 17,
          "start": 45.76,
          "end": 47.63,
          "en": "so not into a module,",
          "zh": "也就是不放進 module，"
        },
        {
          "id": 18,
          "start": 47.63,
          "end": 49.42,
          "en": "but then I'll work with a product",
          "zh": "而是改用一個 product"
        },
        {
          "id": 19,
          "start": 49.42,
          "end": 52.84,
          "en": "and with a cart module.",
          "zh": "以及一個 cart module。"
        },
        {
          "id": 20,
          "start": 52.84,
          "end": 56.32,
          "en": "And therefore in modules we can create two sub folders,",
          "zh": "因此，在 modules 裡我們可以建立兩個子資料夾，"
        },
        {
          "id": 21,
          "start": 56.32,
          "end": 59.35,
          "en": "products and cart and there is nothing wrong with it",
          "zh": "products 和 cart，這本身沒什麼問題，"
        },
        {
          "id": 22,
          "start": 59.35,
          "end": 61.58,
          "en": "but I will use a different approach,",
          "zh": "但我會採用不同的做法，"
        },
        {
          "id": 23,
          "start": 61.58,
          "end": 65.653,
          "en": "all instead at a cart.js and a products.js file.",
          "zh": "而是改用 cart.js 和 products.js 這兩個檔案。"
        },
        {
          "id": 24,
          "start": 66.79,
          "end": 69.27,
          "en": "That is not what I showed you in the last lectures.",
          "zh": "這不是我前幾堂課示範給你們看的做法。"
        },
        {
          "id": 25,
          "start": 69.27,
          "end": 70.38,
          "en": "I am aware of this,",
          "zh": "我知道這一點，"
        },
        {
          "id": 26,
          "start": 70.38,
          "end": 72.83,
          "en": "but that's also an alternative.",
          "zh": "但這也是一種替代做法。"
        },
        {
          "id": 27,
          "start": 72.83,
          "end": 75.63,
          "en": "I don't want to split my mutations and so on",
          "zh": "我不想把我的 mutations 等等"
        },
        {
          "id": 28,
          "start": 75.63,
          "end": 77.18,
          "en": "in separate files here,",
          "zh": "拆到不同的檔案裡，"
        },
        {
          "id": 29,
          "start": 77.18,
          "end": 79.25,
          "en": "instead, I wanna have them in one file,",
          "zh": "而是想把它們放在同一個檔案中，"
        },
        {
          "id": 30,
          "start": 79.25,
          "end": 82.64,
          "en": "but still separate files for different modules.",
          "zh": "但仍然為不同的 module 使用各自的檔案。"
        },
        {
          "id": 31,
          "start": 82.64,
          "end": 86.46000000000001,
          "en": "So that's an alternative to having multiple module folders,",
          "zh": "所以這是相對於使用多個 module 資料夾的另一種做法，"
        },
        {
          "id": 32,
          "start": 86.46000000000001,
          "end": 88.68,
          "en": "where in every module folder,",
          "zh": "在每個 module 資料夾中，"
        },
        {
          "id": 33,
          "start": 88.68,
          "end": 91.61,
          "en": "you then have separate actions and mutations files,",
          "zh": "你會分別有 actions 和 mutations 檔案，"
        },
        {
          "id": 34,
          "start": 91.61,
          "end": 93.47999999999999,
          "en": "which you could also do though,",
          "zh": "不過你也可以那樣做，"
        },
        {
          "id": 35,
          "start": 93.47999999999999,
          "end": 94.763,
          "en": "just to make this clear.",
          "zh": "只是要把這點說清楚。"
        },
        {
          "id": 36,
          "start": 96.13,
          "end": 97.61,
          "en": "But with all of that,",
          "zh": "不過，說了這麼多，"
        },
        {
          "id": 37,
          "start": 97.61,
          "end": 102.61,
          "en": "I'm going to npm install vuex,",
          "zh": "我要執行 npm install vuex，"
        },
        {
          "id": 38,
          "start": 102.67,
          "end": 105.97,
          "en": "so that we have this available here in this project",
          "zh": "這樣我們在這個專案裡就能使用它，"
        },
        {
          "id": 39,
          "start": 108.14,
          "end": 111.09,
          "en": "and bring up the development server thereafter.",
          "zh": "然後再啟動開發伺服器。"
        },
        {
          "id": 40,
          "start": 111.09,
          "end": 113.13,
          "en": "And in index.js,",
          "zh": "而在 index.js 中，"
        },
        {
          "id": 41,
          "start": 113.13,
          "end": 114.95,
          "en": "in the store folder.",
          "zh": "也就是 store 資料夾裡，"
        },
        {
          "id": 42,
          "start": 114.95,
          "end": 117.75999999999999,
          "en": "I will then import create,",
          "zh": "我接著會 import createStore，"
        },
        {
          "id": 43,
          "start": 117.75999999999999,
          "end": 120.403,
          "en": "store from vuex.",
          "zh": "就從 vuex 匯入。"
        },
        {
          "id": 44,
          "start": 121.63,
          "end": 125.98,
          "en": "And then call create store here to create a store,",
          "zh": "然後在這裡呼叫 createStore 來建立一個 store，"
        },
        {
          "id": 45,
          "start": 125.98,
          "end": 128.593,
          "en": "which I then export as a default.",
          "zh": "再將它以 default 匯出。"
        },
        {
          "id": 46,
          "start": 130.11,
          "end": 131.83,
          "en": "This store text and object",
          "zh": "這個 store 接受一個物件，"
        },
        {
          "id": 47,
          "start": 131.83,
          "end": 135.1,
          "en": "and we're going to configure the store here soon.",
          "zh": "我們稍後會在這裡設定這個 store。"
        },
        {
          "id": 48,
          "start": 135.1,
          "end": 136.54,
          "en": "Since I'm exporting the store,",
          "zh": "由於我把這個 store 匯出，"
        },
        {
          "id": 49,
          "start": 136.54,
          "end": 140.05,
          "en": "we can already import it in main.js though,",
          "zh": "不過我們已經可以在 main.js 中 import 它，"
        },
        {
          "id": 50,
          "start": 140.05,
          "end": 144.48,
          "en": "here import store from store.js.",
          "zh": "在這裡 import store from store.js。"
        },
        {
          "id": 51,
          "start": 144.48,
          "end": 146.45,
          "en": "And besides using the router,",
          "zh": "除了使用 router 之外，"
        },
        {
          "id": 52,
          "start": 146.45,
          "end": 148.513,
          "en": "we will now also use the store.",
          "zh": "我們現在也會使用 store。"
        },
        {
          "id": 53,
          "start": 150.28,
          "end": 152.24,
          "en": "But now back to the store.",
          "zh": "不過現在回到 store。"
        },
        {
          "id": 54,
          "start": 152.24,
          "end": 154.98,
          "en": "I mentioned that I want to have some global state",
          "zh": "我提過我想要有一些全域 state，"
        },
        {
          "id": 55,
          "start": 154.98,
          "end": 158.81,
          "en": "the authentication status and then module state",
          "zh": "也就是身分驗證狀態，然後還有 module state，"
        },
        {
          "id": 56,
          "start": 158.81,
          "end": 163.81,
          "en": "for my different modules for products and for the cart.",
          "zh": "給 products 和 cart 這些不同的 module。"
        },
        {
          "id": 57,
          "start": 165.39,
          "end": 167.403,
          "en": "Let's maybe start with products.",
          "zh": "我們或許就從 products 開始。"
        },
        {
          "id": 58,
          "start": 169.49,
          "end": 172.36,
          "en": "For that we're exporting an object in here,",
          "zh": "為此，我們在這裡匯出一個物件，"
        },
        {
          "id": 59,
          "start": 172.36,
          "end": 174.91,
          "en": "which will be our module object",
          "zh": "它會是我們的 module 物件，"
        },
        {
          "id": 60,
          "start": 174.91,
          "end": 177.6,
          "en": "and set up state which is a method",
          "zh": "並設定 state，它是一個方法，"
        },
        {
          "id": 61,
          "start": 177.6,
          "end": 180.74,
          "en": "it returns an object which defines our state.",
          "zh": "它會回傳一個定義我們 state 的物件。"
        },
        {
          "id": 62,
          "start": 180.74,
          "end": 181.8,
          "en": "And in here,",
          "zh": "而在這裡，"
        },
        {
          "id": 63,
          "start": 181.8,
          "end": 183.7,
          "en": "I want to have my products array,",
          "zh": "我想要放入我的 products 陣列，"
        },
        {
          "id": 64,
          "start": 183.7,
          "end": 186.63,
          "en": "which currently is in App.vue.",
          "zh": "它目前位於 App.vue 中。"
        },
        {
          "id": 65,
          "start": 186.63,
          "end": 190.63,
          "en": "So we can grab this entire array from App.vue,",
          "zh": "所以我們可以從 App.vue 取出這整個陣列，"
        },
        {
          "id": 66,
          "start": 190.63,
          "end": 191.463,
          "en": "cut it,",
          "zh": "把它剪下，"
        },
        {
          "id": 67,
          "start": 192.64,
          "end": 195.5,
          "en": "and go to products.js.",
          "zh": "然後到 products.js。"
        },
        {
          "id": 68,
          "start": 195.5,
          "end": 199.893,
          "en": "And add it here products is now this array.",
          "zh": "把它加在這裡，products 現在就是這個陣列。"
        },
        {
          "id": 69,
          "start": 202.57,
          "end": 204.1,
          "en": "In App.vue,",
          "zh": "在 App.vue 中，"
        },
        {
          "id": 70,
          "start": 204.1,
          "end": 207.423,
          "en": "we therefore no longer provide products.",
          "zh": "我們因此不再提供 products。"
        },
        {
          "id": 71,
          "start": 210.95,
          "end": 214.163,
          "en": "And we remove products from the data property.",
          "zh": "我們也把 products 從 data 屬性中移除。"
        },
        {
          "id": 72,
          "start": 215.94,
          "end": 218.97,
          "en": "Now for products I actually have no mutations",
          "zh": "其實對 products 來說，我沒有 mutations，"
        },
        {
          "id": 73,
          "start": 218.97,
          "end": 221.45,
          "en": "and actions because we never change products",
          "zh": "也沒有 actions，因為我們從不改變 products，"
        },
        {
          "id": 74,
          "start": 221.45,
          "end": 223.53,
          "en": "in this example app.",
          "zh": "在這個範例應用程式中。"
        },
        {
          "id": 75,
          "start": 223.53,
          "end": 225.01,
          "en": "They offer of course,",
          "zh": "它們當然是，"
        },
        {
          "id": 76,
          "start": 225.01,
          "end": 227.99,
          "en": "this is not really state which we need to manage.",
          "zh": "這其實不是我們需要管理的 state。"
        },
        {
          "id": 77,
          "start": 227.99,
          "end": 230.32999999999998,
          "en": "It's just some static data,",
          "zh": "它只是一些靜態資料，"
        },
        {
          "id": 78,
          "start": 230.32999999999998,
          "end": 233.75,
          "en": "which we also could export and import like this.",
          "zh": "我們也可以像這樣匯出和匯入。"
        },
        {
          "id": 79,
          "start": 233.75,
          "end": 235.23,
          "en": "But to practice vuex,",
          "zh": "但為了練習 Vuex，"
        },
        {
          "id": 80,
          "start": 235.23,
          "end": 236.62,
          "en": "I'll put it into some state",
          "zh": "我會把它放進某個 state，"
        },
        {
          "id": 81,
          "start": 236.62,
          "end": 239.463,
          "en": "even though that is state which will never change.",
          "zh": "即使那是永遠不會改變的 state。"
        },
        {
          "id": 82,
          "start": 240.75,
          "end": 242.91,
          "en": "There is at least one thing which we need though.",
          "zh": "不過至少有一件事是我們需要的。"
        },
        {
          "id": 83,
          "start": 242.91,
          "end": 244.19,
          "en": "And that's a getter.",
          "zh": "那就是一個 getter。"
        },
        {
          "id": 84,
          "start": 244.19,
          "end": 247.02,
          "en": "Because we shouldn't directly access state,",
          "zh": "因為我們不應該直接存取 state，"
        },
        {
          "id": 85,
          "start": 247.02,
          "end": 249.27,
          "en": "we should use getters for that.",
          "zh": "我們應該透過 getters 來存取。"
        },
        {
          "id": 86,
          "start": 249.27,
          "end": 251.03,
          "en": "So here I'll add a getter,",
          "zh": "所以在這裡我要新增一個 getter，"
        },
        {
          "id": 87,
          "start": 251.03,
          "end": 252.913,
          "en": "also named products maybe,",
          "zh": "或許也命名為 products，"
        },
        {
          "id": 88,
          "start": 254.13,
          "end": 257.46,
          "en": "which gets the local state of this module.",
          "zh": "它會取得這個 module 的區域 state。"
        },
        {
          "id": 89,
          "start": 257.46,
          "end": 261.89,
          "en": "And we're at then simply returns state products like this.",
          "zh": "然後就像這樣直接回傳 state.products。"
        },
        {
          "id": 90,
          "start": 261.89,
          "end": 263.71,
          "en": "So it's not a super fancy getter,",
          "zh": "所以它不是什麼很花俏的 getter，"
        },
        {
          "id": 91,
          "start": 263.71,
          "end": 265.02,
          "en": "it's not doing a lot of things,",
          "zh": "它沒有做很多事情，"
        },
        {
          "id": 92,
          "start": 265.02,
          "end": 266.873,
          "en": "but hey, it's better than nothing.",
          "zh": "但嘿，總比什麼都沒有好。"
        },
        {
          "id": 93,
          "start": 268.28,
          "end": 272.06,
          "en": "That's it for the product module already.",
          "zh": "product module 這樣就完成了。"
        },
        {
          "id": 94,
          "start": 272.06,
          "end": 273.28,
          "en": "So in index.js,",
          "zh": "所以在 index.js 中，"
        },
        {
          "id": 95,
          "start": 273.28,
          "end": 275.27,
          "en": "where I create the main store,",
          "zh": "也就是我建立主要 store 的地方，"
        },
        {
          "id": 96,
          "start": 275.27,
          "end": 278.39,
          "en": "I can import my products module",
          "zh": "我可以 import 我的 products module，"
        },
        {
          "id": 97,
          "start": 278.39,
          "end": 283.39,
          "en": "from modules/products.js,",
          "zh": "來源是 modules/products.js，"
        },
        {
          "id": 98,
          "start": 283.46,
          "end": 286.85,
          "en": "and then add the modules key here.",
          "zh": "然後在這裡加上 modules 鍵。"
        },
        {
          "id": 99,
          "start": 286.85,
          "end": 288.823,
          "en": "And add let's say,",
          "zh": "並加上，比如說，"
        },
        {
          "id": 100,
          "start": 290.05,
          "end": 295.05,
          "en": "prods as a namespace if we want to use namespaces later,",
          "zh": "如果我們之後想用 namespace，就加上 prods 作為 namespace，"
        },
        {
          "id": 101,
          "start": 295.668,
          "end": 297.46,
          "en": "otherwise this is just required,",
          "zh": "否則這其實只是必要的，"
        },
        {
          "id": 102,
          "start": 297.46,
          "end": 299.95,
          "en": "technically but has no effect.",
          "zh": "技術上是必需的，但沒有實際作用。"
        },
        {
          "id": 103,
          "start": 299.95,
          "end": 303.223,
          "en": "And register products module under the name space.",
          "zh": "並把 products module 註冊在那個 namespace 底下。"
        },
        {
          "id": 104,
          "start": 304.11,
          "end": 306.55,
          "en": "Now currently it is not name spaced.",
          "zh": "現在它目前並不是 namespaced。"
        },
        {
          "id": 105,
          "start": 306.55,
          "end": 308.82,
          "en": "Currently it will be merged globally.",
          "zh": "目前它會被合併到全域。"
        },
        {
          "id": 106,
          "start": 308.82,
          "end": 312.24,
          "en": "So together will be available just like that.",
          "zh": "所以就會直接這樣可用。"
        },
        {
          "id": 107,
          "start": 312.24,
          "end": 313.84,
          "en": "But I wanna make it name spaced",
          "zh": "但我想讓它成為 namespaced，"
        },
        {
          "id": 108,
          "start": 313.84,
          "end": 315.69,
          "en": "so that we all to practices.",
          "zh": "這樣我們也能練習一下。"
        },
        {
          "id": 109,
          "start": 315.69,
          "end": 319.31,
          "en": "Therefore, we can add name spaced as an option",
          "zh": "因此，我們可以把 namespaced 加為一個選項，"
        },
        {
          "id": 110,
          "start": 319.31,
          "end": 322.663,
          "en": "in the exported module object and set this to true.",
          "zh": "在匯出的 module 物件中，並把它設為 true。"
        },
        {
          "id": 111,
          "start": 323.55,
          "end": 327.093,
          "en": "And now prods will be the namespace for this module.",
          "zh": "現在 prods 就會是這個 module 的 namespace。"
        },
        {
          "id": 112,
          "start": 328.41,
          "end": 330.21,
          "en": "Let's continue with the cart.",
          "zh": "我們繼續看 cart。"
        },
        {
          "id": 113,
          "start": 330.21,
          "end": 332.36,
          "en": "Here in the cart.",
          "zh": "在這裡的 cart。"
        },
        {
          "id": 114,
          "start": 332.36,
          "end": 336.1,
          "en": "I of course want to have my carts data.",
          "zh": "我當然想要放入我的 cart 資料。"
        },
        {
          "id": 115,
          "start": 336.1,
          "end": 338.65999999999997,
          "en": "So we can cut this from App.vue,",
          "zh": "所以我們可以從 App.vue 剪下它，"
        },
        {
          "id": 116,
          "start": 338.65999999999997,
          "end": 342.09000000000003,
          "en": "but also later to methods that's changed the cart.",
          "zh": "但也要剪下之後那兩個改變 cart 的方法。"
        },
        {
          "id": 117,
          "start": 342.09000000000003,
          "end": 345.74,
          "en": "So in cart.js in the store modules folder,",
          "zh": "所以在 store 的 modules 資料夾裡的 cart.js 中，"
        },
        {
          "id": 118,
          "start": 345.74,
          "end": 348.9,
          "en": "we export our module object,",
          "zh": "我們匯出 module 物件，"
        },
        {
          "id": 119,
          "start": 348.9,
          "end": 350.52,
          "en": "add our state,",
          "zh": "加上我們的 state，"
        },
        {
          "id": 120,
          "start": 350.52,
          "end": 353.883,
          "en": "and here I return an object which has this cart.",
          "zh": "在這裡我回傳一個含有這個 cart 的物件。"
        },
        {
          "id": 121,
          "start": 354.74,
          "end": 355.83,
          "en": "And actually,",
          "zh": "而其實，"
        },
        {
          "id": 122,
          "start": 355.83,
          "end": 359.25,
          "en": "since this is an entire module for just the cart,",
          "zh": "既然這是專門給 cart 的完整 module，"
        },
        {
          "id": 123,
          "start": 359.25,
          "end": 363.44,
          "en": "we can also flatten this and just add items total",
          "zh": "我們也可以把它攤平，直接加上 items、total"
        },
        {
          "id": 124,
          "start": 363.44,
          "end": 368.113,
          "en": "and quantity as separate keys in this overall module state.",
          "zh": "和 quantity，作為這個整體 module state 中的獨立鍵。"
        },
        {
          "id": 125,
          "start": 371.42,
          "end": 374.6,
          "en": "Now here, we will need mutations as well,",
          "zh": "在這裡，我們也需要 mutations，"
        },
        {
          "id": 126,
          "start": 374.6,
          "end": 378.65,
          "en": "because in App.vue I have two methods for changing the cart,",
          "zh": "因為在 App.vue 中我有兩個改變 cart 的方法，"
        },
        {
          "id": 127,
          "start": 378.65,
          "end": 380.36,
          "en": "add product to cart,",
          "zh": "addProductToCart，"
        },
        {
          "id": 128,
          "start": 380.36,
          "end": 382.283,
          "en": "and remove product from cart.",
          "zh": "以及 removeProductFromCart。"
        },
        {
          "id": 129,
          "start": 383.49,
          "end": 386.093,
          "en": "So I can grab these methods,",
          "zh": "所以我可以抓取這些方法，"
        },
        {
          "id": 130,
          "start": 387.58,
          "end": 390.09,
          "en": "cut them from App.vue,",
          "zh": "把它們從 App.vue 剪下，"
        },
        {
          "id": 131,
          "start": 390.09,
          "end": 392.46,
          "en": "and add them to cart.js here",
          "zh": "並把它們加到這裡的 cart.js，"
        },
        {
          "id": 132,
          "start": 393.92,
          "end": 395.163,
          "en": "in mutations,",
          "zh": "放在 mutations 裡，"
        },
        {
          "id": 133,
          "start": 396.24,
          "end": 399.6,
          "en": "but we of course have to tweak those mutations now,",
          "zh": "但我們現在當然得調整這些 mutations，"
        },
        {
          "id": 134,
          "start": 399.6,
          "end": 402.04,
          "en": "because now they don't just get an argument",
          "zh": "因為它們現在不只是收到一個引數"
        },
        {
          "id": 135,
          "start": 402.04,
          "end": 402.98,
          "en": "and do something.",
          "zh": "然後做點事。"
        },
        {
          "id": 136,
          "start": 402.98,
          "end": 405.37,
          "en": "Instead, they now need two arguments,",
          "zh": "而是需要兩個引數，"
        },
        {
          "id": 137,
          "start": 405.37,
          "end": 408.08,
          "en": "the current state which they should change,",
          "zh": "它們應該改變的目前 state，"
        },
        {
          "id": 138,
          "start": 408.08,
          "end": 409.253,
          "en": "and the payload.",
          "zh": "以及 payload。"
        },
        {
          "id": 139,
          "start": 410.23,
          "end": 412.87,
          "en": "The payload can then hold all the extra data",
          "zh": "payload 接著可以裝載所有額外的資料，"
        },
        {
          "id": 140,
          "start": 412.87,
          "end": 414.43,
          "en": "that might be needed.",
          "zh": "可能是需要的。"
        },
        {
          "id": 141,
          "start": 414.43,
          "end": 415.59000000000003,
          "en": "Here for example,",
          "zh": "例如在這裡，"
        },
        {
          "id": 142,
          "start": 415.59000000000003,
          "end": 419.77,
          "en": "I expect to get some product data describing the product",
          "zh": "我預期會收到一些描述該 product 的資料，"
        },
        {
          "id": 143,
          "start": 419.77,
          "end": 421.643,
          "en": "that should be added to the cart.",
          "zh": "這個 product 應該被加入 cart。"
        },
        {
          "id": 144,
          "start": 422.51,
          "end": 425.06,
          "en": "So to make sure that the rest of the code works,",
          "zh": "所以為了確保其餘的程式碼能運作，"
        },
        {
          "id": 145,
          "start": 425.06,
          "end": 427.63,
          "en": "I will add a constant named product data",
          "zh": "我會新增一個名為 productData 的常數，"
        },
        {
          "id": 146,
          "start": 427.63,
          "end": 430.12,
          "en": "because that's what's getting used down there.",
          "zh": "因為下面用的就是它。"
        },
        {
          "id": 147,
          "start": 430.12,
          "end": 432.98,
          "en": "And expect to get that on my payload.",
          "zh": "並預期從 payload 取得它。"
        },
        {
          "id": 148,
          "start": 432.98,
          "end": 436.56,
          "en": "Let's say payload.product.",
          "zh": "比如說 payload.product。"
        },
        {
          "id": 149,
          "start": 436.56,
          "end": 439.03,
          "en": "We have to provide this payload later.",
          "zh": "我們之後必須提供這個 payload。"
        },
        {
          "id": 150,
          "start": 439.03,
          "end": 441.57,
          "en": "So we can of course expect any data we want.",
          "zh": "所以我們當然可以預期任何我們想要的資料。"
        },
        {
          "id": 151,
          "start": 441.57,
          "end": 444.963,
          "en": "We just have to make sure that this data exists later.",
          "zh": "我們只要確保之後真的有這份資料就行。"
        },
        {
          "id": 152,
          "start": 446.27,
          "end": 449.09,
          "en": "And then we have to update the state.",
          "zh": "接著我們必須更新 state。"
        },
        {
          "id": 153,
          "start": 449.09,
          "end": 449.96,
          "en": "So here for example,",
          "zh": "所以例如在這裡，"
        },
        {
          "id": 154,
          "start": 449.96,
          "end": 453.96,
          "en": "it's not this cart items find something.",
          "zh": "它不再是 this.cart.items.find 之類的。"
        },
        {
          "id": 155,
          "start": 453.96,
          "end": 457.2,
          "en": "It's state items,",
          "zh": "而是 state.items，"
        },
        {
          "id": 156,
          "start": 457.2,
          "end": 460.74,
          "en": "because items is now a property in our local state",
          "zh": "因為 items 現在是我們區域 state 中的一個屬性，"
        },
        {
          "id": 157,
          "start": 460.74,
          "end": 461.843,
          "en": "of this module.",
          "zh": "屬於這個 module。"
        },
        {
          "id": 158,
          "start": 465.04,
          "end": 468.853,
          "en": "Here it's also State.items.quantity.",
          "zh": "這裡也是 state.items.quantity。"
        },
        {
          "id": 159,
          "start": 471.18,
          "end": 475.73,
          "en": "Assuming that items in the cart do have a quantity field,",
          "zh": "假設 cart 中的 items 確實有 quantity 欄位，"
        },
        {
          "id": 160,
          "start": 475.73,
          "end": 479.21,
          "en": "and they do because this is how we add items to a cart,",
          "zh": "而它們確實有，因為我們就是這樣把 items 加入 cart，"
        },
        {
          "id": 161,
          "start": 479.21,
          "end": 481.53,
          "en": "we set up products ID, title, image price",
          "zh": "我們設定了 product 的 ID、title、image、price"
        },
        {
          "id": 162,
          "start": 481.53,
          "end": 484.25,
          "en": "and quantity for that product in the cart.",
          "zh": "以及那個 product 在 cart 中的 quantity。"
        },
        {
          "id": 163,
          "start": 484.25,
          "end": 485.95,
          "en": "And this should all continue to work",
          "zh": "而這一切都應該能繼續運作，"
        },
        {
          "id": 164,
          "start": 485.95,
          "end": 488.823,
          "en": "because this doesn't use the state or anything like that.",
          "zh": "因為這裡沒有使用 state 或任何類似的東西。"
        },
        {
          "id": 165,
          "start": 489.78,
          "end": 490.74,
          "en": "But then here in the end,",
          "zh": "但接著在這裡的最後，"
        },
        {
          "id": 166,
          "start": 490.74,
          "end": 494.36,
          "en": "we access state items and push our new item.",
          "zh": "我們存取 state.items 並 push 我們的新 item。"
        },
        {
          "id": 167,
          "start": 494.36,
          "end": 499.36,
          "en": "And we access state.quantity and state.total.",
          "zh": "我們也存取 state.quantity 和 state.total。"
        },
        {
          "id": 168,
          "start": 502.12,
          "end": 505.023,
          "en": "So the other state properties which we added here.",
          "zh": "也就是我們在這裡加入的其他 state 屬性。"
        },
        {
          "id": 169,
          "start": 506.14,
          "end": 509.093,
          "en": "And that's the add product to cart mutation.",
          "zh": "這就是 addProductToCart mutation。"
        },
        {
          "id": 170,
          "start": 510.07,
          "end": 512.09,
          "en": "Now for remove product from cart,",
          "zh": "現在，對於 removeProductFromCart，"
        },
        {
          "id": 171,
          "start": 512.09,
          "end": 515.09,
          "en": "we also get a state and a payload.",
          "zh": "我們同樣會收到 state 和 payload。"
        },
        {
          "id": 172,
          "start": 515.09,
          "end": 516.4,
          "en": "And again,",
          "zh": "同樣地，"
        },
        {
          "id": 173,
          "start": 516.4,
          "end": 519.53,
          "en": "prodId was received previously as an argument.",
          "zh": "先前 prodId 是以引數的形式收到。"
        },
        {
          "id": 174,
          "start": 519.53,
          "end": 521.95,
          "en": "So I will add a constant prodId,",
          "zh": "所以我會新增一個常數 prodId，"
        },
        {
          "id": 175,
          "start": 521.95,
          "end": 525.38,
          "en": "and extract this productId let's say",
          "zh": "並把這個 productId，比如說"
        },
        {
          "id": 176,
          "start": 525.38,
          "end": 526.833,
          "en": "from the payload object.",
          "zh": "從 payload 物件中取出。"
        },
        {
          "id": 177,
          "start": 527.99,
          "end": 528.823,
          "en": "And then again,",
          "zh": "然後同樣地，"
        },
        {
          "id": 178,
          "start": 528.823,
          "end": 531.603,
          "en": "we search state.items here.",
          "zh": "我們在這裡搜尋 state.items。"
        },
        {
          "id": 179,
          "start": 532.48,
          "end": 535.64,
          "en": "And here, it's all those state.items",
          "zh": "而這裡，全都是那些 state.items，"
        },
        {
          "id": 180,
          "start": 535.64,
          "end": 540.64,
          "en": "and we manipulate state items, state quantity",
          "zh": "我們操作 state.items、state.quantity"
        },
        {
          "id": 181,
          "start": 541.65,
          "end": 543.583,
          "en": "and state total.",
          "zh": "以及 state.total。"
        },
        {
          "id": 182,
          "start": 545.6,
          "end": 548.16,
          "en": "Now we get the mutations in place.",
          "zh": "現在我們把 mutations 都設定好了。"
        },
        {
          "id": 183,
          "start": 548.16,
          "end": 551.29,
          "en": "Now we learned that we shouldn't directly commit mutations",
          "zh": "我們學過不應該直接從 component 內部"
        },
        {
          "id": 184,
          "start": 551.29,
          "end": 552.52,
          "en": "from inside components.",
          "zh": "commit mutations。"
        },
        {
          "id": 185,
          "start": 552.52,
          "end": 555.38,
          "en": "So I'm going to add some actions as well.",
          "zh": "所以我也要加上一些 actions。"
        },
        {
          "id": 186,
          "start": 555.38,
          "end": 558.01,
          "en": "And here I'll add an add to cart action",
          "zh": "在這裡我會加上一個 addToCart action，"
        },
        {
          "id": 187,
          "start": 559.06,
          "end": 562.453,
          "en": "and remove from cart action.",
          "zh": "以及一個 removeFromCart action。"
        },
        {
          "id": 188,
          "start": 563.46,
          "end": 567.17,
          "en": "And add to cart receives this context",
          "zh": "addToCart 會收到這個 context，"
        },
        {
          "id": 189,
          "start": 567.17,
          "end": 569.51,
          "en": "and maybe also a payload.",
          "zh": "或許也會收到 payload。"
        },
        {
          "id": 190,
          "start": 569.51,
          "end": 572.243,
          "en": "And the same here for removed from cart.",
          "zh": "removeFromCart 這裡也是一樣。"
        },
        {
          "id": 191,
          "start": 573.61,
          "end": 575.26,
          "en": "And in here I then simply commit,",
          "zh": "在這裡我就只是 commit，"
        },
        {
          "id": 192,
          "start": 578.42,
          "end": 579.98,
          "en": "add product to cart",
          "zh": "addProductToCart，"
        },
        {
          "id": 193,
          "start": 582.28,
          "end": 585.323,
          "en": "and forwards the payload to the mutation.",
          "zh": "並把 payload 轉送給那個 mutation。"
        },
        {
          "id": 194,
          "start": 587.45,
          "end": 592.38,
          "en": "And for the other action we commit remove product from cart.",
          "zh": "而另一個 action 我們 commit removeProductFromCart。"
        },
        {
          "id": 195,
          "start": 592.38,
          "end": 596.6,
          "en": "So that would be context commit,",
          "zh": "所以那會是 context.commit，"
        },
        {
          "id": 196,
          "start": 596.6,
          "end": 599.86,
          "en": "remove product from cart and forward to payload",
          "zh": "removeProductFromCart 並轉送 payload。"
        },
        {
          "id": 197,
          "start": 601.24,
          "end": 604.83,
          "en": "And with that we just have to add some getters now.",
          "zh": "如此一來，我們現在只要加上一些 getters。"
        },
        {
          "id": 198,
          "start": 604.83,
          "end": 608.23,
          "en": "Getters that allow us to get access to various pieces",
          "zh": "這些 getters 讓我們能存取各種"
        },
        {
          "id": 199,
          "start": 608.23,
          "end": 609.903,
          "en": "of information about the cart.",
          "zh": "關於 cart 的資訊。"
        },
        {
          "id": 200,
          "start": 611.47,
          "end": 613.81,
          "en": "And here, we can get creative.",
          "zh": "在這裡，我們可以自由發揮。"
        },
        {
          "id": 201,
          "start": 613.81,
          "end": 616.49,
          "en": "Previously we shared the overall cart.",
          "zh": "先前我們共用整個 cart。"
        },
        {
          "id": 202,
          "start": 616.49,
          "end": 618.32,
          "en": "And then in different components,",
          "zh": "然後在不同的 component 中，"
        },
        {
          "id": 203,
          "start": 618.32,
          "end": 621.14,
          "en": "we extracted different features.",
          "zh": "我們取出不同的部分。"
        },
        {
          "id": 204,
          "start": 621.14,
          "end": 625.01,
          "en": "For example in the user card page,",
          "zh": "例如在 user cart 頁面中，"
        },
        {
          "id": 205,
          "start": 625.01,
          "end": 628.713,
          "en": "I extracted the cart total like this.",
          "zh": "我像這樣取出 cart 的 total。"
        },
        {
          "id": 206,
          "start": 630.82,
          "end": 632.39,
          "en": "In the header,",
          "zh": "在 header 中，"
        },
        {
          "id": 207,
          "start": 632.39,
          "end": 634.28,
          "en": "I'm extracting",
          "zh": "我取出"
        },
        {
          "id": 208,
          "start": 635.78,
          "end": 638.01,
          "en": "the card quantity here.",
          "zh": "這裡的 cart quantity。"
        },
        {
          "id": 209,
          "start": 638.01,
          "end": 642.47,
          "en": "Now we can define some getters for that in our module,",
          "zh": "現在我們可以在 module 中為此定義一些 getters，"
        },
        {
          "id": 210,
          "start": 642.47,
          "end": 644.55,
          "en": "we can have a cart item scatter,",
          "zh": "我們可以有一個 cartItems getter，"
        },
        {
          "id": 211,
          "start": 644.55,
          "end": 646.773,
          "en": "which gives us the overall cart items.",
          "zh": "它會給我們整個 cart items。"
        },
        {
          "id": 212,
          "start": 647.71,
          "end": 649.22,
          "en": "A cart total getter,",
          "zh": "一個 cartTotal getter，"
        },
        {
          "id": 213,
          "start": 649.22,
          "end": 653.53,
          "en": "which gives us the total sum and a cart quantity getter,",
          "zh": "它會給我們總和，還有一個 cartQuantity getter，"
        },
        {
          "id": 214,
          "start": 653.53,
          "end": 657.18,
          "en": "or since this is all in the cart module already",
          "zh": "或者，既然這些都已經在 cart module 裡，"
        },
        {
          "id": 215,
          "start": 657.18,
          "end": 662.09,
          "en": "just name this items or products or whatever you want,",
          "zh": "就把它命名為 items、products 或任何你想要的，"
        },
        {
          "id": 216,
          "start": 662.09,
          "end": 665.323,
          "en": "total sum maybe and quantity.",
          "zh": "或許是 totalSum 和 quantity。"
        },
        {
          "id": 217,
          "start": 666.8,
          "end": 670.5,
          "en": "And then here return state which we get",
          "zh": "然後在這裡回傳 state，我們在 getter 中"
        },
        {
          "id": 218,
          "start": 670.5,
          "end": 673.99,
          "en": "in a getter automatically state items",
          "zh": "會自動收到 state，回傳 state.items，"
        },
        {
          "id": 219,
          "start": 675.17,
          "end": 678.423,
          "en": "here in total sum return state,",
          "zh": "在這裡的 totalSum 回傳 state，"
        },
        {
          "id": 220,
          "start": 679.66,
          "end": 680.493,
          "en": "total.",
          "zh": "也就是 state.total。"
        },
        {
          "id": 221,
          "start": 681.81,
          "end": 683.36,
          "en": "And here return",
          "zh": "而在這裡回傳"
        },
        {
          "id": 222,
          "start": 684.72,
          "end": 687.27,
          "en": "state quantity.",
          "zh": "state.quantity。"
        },
        {
          "id": 223,
          "start": 687.27,
          "end": 691.3,
          "en": "And now we can go to index.js in the store folder,",
          "zh": "現在我們可以到 store 資料夾裡的 index.js，"
        },
        {
          "id": 224,
          "start": 691.3,
          "end": 696.3,
          "en": "import the cart module from ./modules/cart.js",
          "zh": "從 ./modules/cart.js import cart module，"
        },
        {
          "id": 225,
          "start": 698.58,
          "end": 701.423,
          "en": "and add this to our modules here as well.",
          "zh": "並把它也加到這裡的 modules 中。"
        },
        {
          "id": 226,
          "start": 702.5,
          "end": 705.62,
          "en": "And I'm going to namespace this cart",
          "zh": "我會把這個 cart 設為 namespaced，"
        },
        {
          "id": 227,
          "start": 705.62,
          "end": 707.853,
          "en": "and save to cart module in there.",
          "zh": "並把 cart module 儲存在那裡。"
        },
        {
          "id": 228,
          "start": 709.54,
          "end": 710.94,
          "en": "Now with that we're not done",
          "zh": "這樣我們還沒完成，"
        },
        {
          "id": 229,
          "start": 710.94,
          "end": 713.95,
          "en": "but we made an important first step.",
          "zh": "但我們已經踏出重要的第一步。"
        },
        {
          "id": 230,
          "start": 713.95,
          "end": 716.08,
          "en": "Now let's continue with cleaning up",
          "zh": "現在讓我們繼續清理，"
        },
        {
          "id": 231,
          "start": 716.08,
          "end": 718.763,
          "en": "and with using the store in the next lectures.",
          "zh": "並在後續的課程中使用 store。"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "21879810",
      "title": "Challenge Solution (2/3)",
      "lectureOrder": 229,
      "videoOrder": 202,
      "sourceHash": "17a2ca14d929f5ec39d29992589dfd8b2985f1fbdc8e5cd3a93319c091e5be0e",
      "cues": [
        {
          "id": 1,
          "start": 2.13,
          "end": 3.71,
          "en": "So let's continue now.",
          "zh": "那麼我們現在繼續。"
        },
        {
          "id": 2,
          "start": 3.71,
          "end": 4.97,
          "en": "For one, I get an error",
          "zh": "首先，我遇到一個錯誤，"
        },
        {
          "id": 3,
          "start": 4.97,
          "end": 8.06,
          "en": "that store.js wasn't found in main.js.",
          "zh": "說在 main.js 裡找不到 store.js。"
        },
        {
          "id": 4,
          "start": 8.06,
          "end": 11.46,
          "en": "Yes, because I'm importing from store/index.js.",
          "zh": "沒錯，因為我是從 store/index.js 匯入的。"
        },
        {
          "id": 5,
          "start": 11.46,
          "end": 12.89,
          "en": "That would be correct.",
          "zh": "那樣才是正確的。"
        },
        {
          "id": 6,
          "start": 12.89,
          "end": 15.683,
          "en": "So make sure you have this import set up correctly.",
          "zh": "所以請確認你的 import 設定正確。"
        },
        {
          "id": 7,
          "start": 17.01,
          "end": 18.74,
          "en": "But besides that, we now also need",
          "zh": "但除此之外，我們現在還需要"
        },
        {
          "id": 8,
          "start": 18.74,
          "end": 21.62,
          "en": "to wire up our store with the different components",
          "zh": "把我們的 store 和各個元件連接起來，"
        },
        {
          "id": 9,
          "start": 21.62,
          "end": 24.83,
          "en": "and clean up the App.vue component.",
          "zh": "並清理 App.vue 元件。"
        },
        {
          "id": 10,
          "start": 24.83,
          "end": 28.85,
          "en": "In there, I don't want to provide anything anymore",
          "zh": "在裡面，我不再想要 provide 任何東西，"
        },
        {
          "id": 11,
          "start": 28.85,
          "end": 32.22,
          "en": "because I don't want to manage any data in there anymore.",
          "zh": "因為我不再想在那裡管理任何資料。"
        },
        {
          "id": 12,
          "start": 32.22,
          "end": 34.55,
          "en": "We still have isLoggedIn in there",
          "zh": "我們在那裡還有 isLoggedIn，"
        },
        {
          "id": 13,
          "start": 34.55,
          "end": 36.82,
          "en": "but we're going to remove this soon as well,",
          "zh": "但我們很快也會把它移除，"
        },
        {
          "id": 14,
          "start": 36.82,
          "end": 38.12,
          "en": "just as these methods.",
          "zh": "就像這些 methods 一樣。"
        },
        {
          "id": 15,
          "start": 38.12,
          "end": 40.26,
          "en": "For the moment, let's ignore them though.",
          "zh": "不過目前我們先忽略它們。"
        },
        {
          "id": 16,
          "start": 40.26,
          "end": 42.93,
          "en": "But let's now start using our modules.",
          "zh": "但現在讓我們開始使用我們的 modules。"
        },
        {
          "id": 17,
          "start": 42.93,
          "end": 44.086,
          "en": "Now, one thing I forgot",
          "zh": "對了，我忘了一件事，"
        },
        {
          "id": 18,
          "start": 44.086,
          "end": 48.19,
          "en": "is in cart.js in this cart module,",
          "zh": "就是在這個 cart module 的 cart.js 裡，"
        },
        {
          "id": 19,
          "start": 48.19,
          "end": 50.32,
          "en": "I also want to namespace this.",
          "zh": "我也想要把它加上 namespace。"
        },
        {
          "id": 20,
          "start": 50.32,
          "end": 52.713,
          "en": "So set namespaced to true in here.",
          "zh": "所以在這裡把 namespaced 設為 true。"
        },
        {
          "id": 21,
          "start": 53.69,
          "end": 56.303,
          "en": "And now let's use it in different parts of this app.",
          "zh": "現在讓我們在應用程式的不同部分使用它。"
        },
        {
          "id": 22,
          "start": 57.28,
          "end": 59.74,
          "en": "For that, we can start in ProductsList.",
          "zh": "為此，我們可以從 ProductsList 開始。"
        },
        {
          "id": 23,
          "start": 59.74,
          "end": 62.72,
          "en": "Here, I previously injected products.",
          "zh": "之前我在這裡 inject 了 products。"
        },
        {
          "id": 24,
          "start": 62.72,
          "end": 64.75,
          "en": "We're no longer going to do that.",
          "zh": "我們不再那麼做了。"
        },
        {
          "id": 25,
          "start": 64.75,
          "end": 67.74,
          "en": "Instead, I now want to get access to Vuex.",
          "zh": "相反地，我現在想要存取 Vuex。"
        },
        {
          "id": 26,
          "start": 67.74,
          "end": 70.05,
          "en": "So we can add a computed property.",
          "zh": "所以我們可以加入一個 computed property。"
        },
        {
          "id": 27,
          "start": 70.05,
          "end": 72.53,
          "en": "And either use the map gathers helper",
          "zh": "可以選擇使用 mapGetters 輔助函式，"
        },
        {
          "id": 28,
          "start": 72.53,
          "end": 74.93,
          "en": "or add our own computed property,",
          "zh": "或是加入我們自己的 computed property，"
        },
        {
          "id": 29,
          "start": 74.93,
          "end": 76.53,
          "en": "which is what I will do.",
          "zh": "而我會採用後者。"
        },
        {
          "id": 30,
          "start": 76.53,
          "end": 78.28,
          "en": "Maybe name it products",
          "zh": "或許把它命名為 products，"
        },
        {
          "id": 31,
          "start": 79.25,
          "end": 82.7,
          "en": "and return this.$store",
          "zh": "然後回傳 this.$store，"
        },
        {
          "id": 32,
          "start": 82.7,
          "end": 84.28999999999999,
          "en": "and now let's see.",
          "zh": "現在我們來看看。"
        },
        {
          "id": 33,
          "start": 84.28999999999999,
          "end": 87.52,
          "en": "In the products module, I have the products getter",
          "zh": "在 products module 裡，我有 products 這個 getter，"
        },
        {
          "id": 34,
          "start": 87.52,
          "end": 89.18,
          "en": "but keep in mind that this module",
          "zh": "但請記住，這個 module"
        },
        {
          "id": 35,
          "start": 89.18,
          "end": 92.88300000000001,
          "en": "is namespaced and the namespace is prods.",
          "zh": "是 namespaced 的，而 namespace 是 prods。"
        },
        {
          "id": 36,
          "start": 93.83,
          "end": 96.97,
          "en": "So what we should access here in ProductsList.vue",
          "zh": "所以我們在 ProductsList.vue 這裡應該存取的，"
        },
        {
          "id": 37,
          "start": 96.97,
          "end": 98.78999999999999,
          "en": "in the pages folder",
          "zh": "它位在 pages 資料夾中，"
        },
        {
          "id": 38,
          "start": 98.78999999999999,
          "end": 103.78999999999999,
          "en": "is .getters and then it's prods/products.",
          "zh": "是 .getters，接著是 prods/products。"
        },
        {
          "id": 39,
          "start": 106.55,
          "end": 109.45,
          "en": "And this gives us a products computed property now,",
          "zh": "這樣就給了我們一個 products computed property，"
        },
        {
          "id": 40,
          "start": 109.45,
          "end": 111.783,
          "en": "which we can use to look for all the products.",
          "zh": "我們可以用它來取得所有產品。"
        },
        {
          "id": 41,
          "start": 112.84,
          "end": 114.4,
          "en": "Now, we currently can't preview this",
          "zh": "現在我們還無法預覽這部分，"
        },
        {
          "id": 42,
          "start": 114.4,
          "end": 116.27000000000001,
          "en": "because we've still got errors on the page",
          "zh": "因為頁面上還有錯誤，"
        },
        {
          "id": 43,
          "start": 116.27000000000001,
          "end": 117.493,
          "en": "but this should work.",
          "zh": "但這應該是可行的。"
        },
        {
          "id": 44,
          "start": 118.72999999999999,
          "end": 120.59,
          "en": "Now, let's fix the other errors.",
          "zh": "現在讓我們修正其他錯誤。"
        },
        {
          "id": 45,
          "start": 120.59,
          "end": 123.257,
          "en": "Let's make sure we also get the cart data",
          "zh": "讓我們確保也能正確取得 cart 資料"
        },
        {
          "id": 46,
          "start": 123.257,
          "end": 125.19200000000001,
          "en": "and the header correctly.",
          "zh": "以及 header。"
        },
        {
          "id": 47,
          "start": 125.19200000000001,
          "end": 127.53,
          "en": "It's no longer cart.qty",
          "zh": "不再是 cart.qty，"
        },
        {
          "id": 48,
          "start": 127.53,
          "end": 131.18,
          "en": "but let's say cartQuantity as this like this",
          "zh": "而是像這樣改成 cartQuantity，"
        },
        {
          "id": 49,
          "start": 131.18,
          "end": 135.21,
          "en": "as a computed property in the future with this name.",
          "zh": "之後就把它當作這個名稱的 computed property。"
        },
        {
          "id": 50,
          "start": 135.21,
          "end": 137.62,
          "en": "And we no longer inject anything here",
          "zh": "而且我們在這裡不再 inject 任何東西，"
        },
        {
          "id": 51,
          "start": 137.62,
          "end": 139.89,
          "en": "but instead, we add computed,",
          "zh": "取而代之，我們加入 computed，"
        },
        {
          "id": 52,
          "start": 139.89,
          "end": 143.53,
          "en": "add this cartQuantity computed property,",
          "zh": "加入這個 cartQuantity computed property，"
        },
        {
          "id": 53,
          "start": 143.53,
          "end": 145.933,
          "en": "which I just referred to in the template.",
          "zh": "也就是我剛剛在 template 裡引用的那個。"
        },
        {
          "id": 54,
          "start": 147.24,
          "end": 150.21,
          "en": "And in there, return this.$store",
          "zh": "在裡面回傳 this.$store，"
        },
        {
          "id": 55,
          "start": 152.34,
          "end": 155.57,
          "en": "and now here, we also namespaced cart.",
          "zh": "而現在這裡，我們也把 cart 加上了 namespace。"
        },
        {
          "id": 56,
          "start": 155.57,
          "end": 158.82999999999998,
          "en": "So we access this store.getters",
          "zh": "所以我們存取 this.$store.getters，"
        },
        {
          "id": 57,
          "start": 158.82999999999998,
          "end": 162.73,
          "en": "and then use the cart namespace, which is cart",
          "zh": "然後使用 cart 這個 namespace，也就是 cart，"
        },
        {
          "id": 58,
          "start": 162.73,
          "end": 166.07,
          "en": "in the index.js file in the store folder.",
          "zh": "在 store 資料夾的 index.js 檔案裡。"
        },
        {
          "id": 59,
          "start": 166.07,
          "end": 168.93,
          "en": "So access cart/",
          "zh": "所以存取 cart/"
        },
        {
          "id": 60,
          "start": 168.93,
          "end": 171.14,
          "en": "and then the getter I'm interested in",
          "zh": "然後是我感興趣的 getter，"
        },
        {
          "id": 61,
          "start": 171.14,
          "end": 174.253,
          "en": "in my case is the quantity here.",
          "zh": "在我的情況是這裡的 quantity。"
        },
        {
          "id": 62,
          "start": 175.99,
          "end": 178.743,
          "en": "So that's /quantity.",
          "zh": "所以就是 /quantity。"
        },
        {
          "id": 63,
          "start": 181.08,
          "end": 181.913,
          "en": "Let's save that.",
          "zh": "讓我們把它儲存。"
        },
        {
          "id": 64,
          "start": 183.43,
          "end": 184.89,
          "en": "And if you now reload,",
          "zh": "如果你現在重新載入，"
        },
        {
          "id": 65,
          "start": 184.89,
          "end": 186.59,
          "en": "you should see products again",
          "zh": "你應該又會看到 products，"
        },
        {
          "id": 66,
          "start": 186.59,
          "end": 188.02,
          "en": "and at least see cart.",
          "zh": "至少會看到 cart。"
        },
        {
          "id": 67,
          "start": 188.02,
          "end": 191.27,
          "en": "You can't go to cart or you'll not see anything there",
          "zh": "你沒辦法前往 cart，或者在那裡看不到任何東西，"
        },
        {
          "id": 68,
          "start": 191.27,
          "end": 192.78,
          "en": "and the app breaks",
          "zh": "應用程式會壞掉，"
        },
        {
          "id": 69,
          "start": 192.78,
          "end": 196.203,
          "en": "but at least the first pieces are working now.",
          "zh": "但至少前面這些部分現在可以運作了。"
        },
        {
          "id": 70,
          "start": 197.59,
          "end": 201,
          "en": "So let's now work on the other parts.",
          "zh": "現在讓我們處理其他部分。"
        },
        {
          "id": 71,
          "start": 201,
          "end": 204.87,
          "en": "In UserCart, I'm interested in the cart.items.",
          "zh": "在 UserCart 裡，我感興趣的是 cart.items。"
        },
        {
          "id": 72,
          "start": 204.87,
          "end": 208.16,
          "en": "So here I'll change this and expect cartItems,",
          "zh": "所以在這裡我會改成預期 cartItems，"
        },
        {
          "id": 73,
          "start": 208.16,
          "end": 211.17000000000002,
          "en": "which I soon will add as a computed property.",
          "zh": "我很快就會把它加入為 computed property。"
        },
        {
          "id": 74,
          "start": 211.17000000000002,
          "end": 213.363,
          "en": "And I also use the cartTotal here.",
          "zh": "我在這裡也使用了 cartTotal。"
        },
        {
          "id": 75,
          "start": 214.55,
          "end": 216.75,
          "en": "We no longer inject the cart here.",
          "zh": "我們在這裡不再 inject cart。"
        },
        {
          "id": 76,
          "start": 216.75,
          "end": 219.7,
          "en": "Instead, the computed property for cartTotal",
          "zh": "取而代之，cartTotal 的 computed property"
        },
        {
          "id": 77,
          "start": 220.92000000000002,
          "end": 224.07999999999998,
          "en": "will now refer to this.$store.getters",
          "zh": "現在會指向 this.$store.getters，"
        },
        {
          "id": 78,
          "start": 224.92000000000002,
          "end": 227.47,
          "en": "and then cart/,",
          "zh": "然後是 cart/，"
        },
        {
          "id": 79,
          "start": 227.47,
          "end": 228.62,
          "en": "what was it?",
          "zh": "是什麼呢？"
        },
        {
          "id": 80,
          "start": 228.62,
          "end": 229.473,
          "en": "It was totalSum,",
          "zh": "是 totalSum，"
        },
        {
          "id": 81,
          "start": 231.4,
          "end": 235.26,
          "en": "so refer to totalSum here.",
          "zh": "所以在這裡指向 totalSum。"
        },
        {
          "id": 82,
          "start": 235.26,
          "end": 239.367,
          "en": "And add another computed property called cartItems,",
          "zh": "並加入另一個叫做 cartItems 的 computed property，"
        },
        {
          "id": 83,
          "start": 240.52,
          "end": 243.773,
          "en": "or whatever you are using here in the v-for loop.",
          "zh": "或者你在 v-for 迴圈裡使用的任何名稱。"
        },
        {
          "id": 84,
          "start": 245.448,
          "end": 250.448,
          "en": "And here, return this.$store.getters cart/",
          "zh": "而在這裡回傳 this.$store.getters 的 cart/，"
        },
        {
          "id": 85,
          "start": 252.79,
          "end": 255.373,
          "en": "and then it was products I think.",
          "zh": "然後我想是 products。"
        },
        {
          "id": 86,
          "start": 256.42,
          "end": 258.403,
          "en": "Yes, products was the getter name.",
          "zh": "沒錯，getter 的名稱是 products。"
        },
        {
          "id": 87,
          "start": 260.97,
          "end": 262.54,
          "en": "With that, if we go to cart,",
          "zh": "如此一來，如果我們前往 cart，"
        },
        {
          "id": 88,
          "start": 262.54,
          "end": 264.79,
          "en": "this also works again.",
          "zh": "這部分也又能運作了。"
        },
        {
          "id": 89,
          "start": 264.79,
          "end": 266.84,
          "en": "Now let's make sure we can also add things",
          "zh": "現在讓我們確保也能加入東西"
        },
        {
          "id": 90,
          "start": 266.84,
          "end": 268.31,
          "en": "to the cart and remove them.",
          "zh": "到 cart 並移除它們。"
        },
        {
          "id": 91,
          "start": 268.31,
          "end": 270.733,
          "en": "So for that, we need to dispatch actions.",
          "zh": "為此，我們需要 dispatch actions。"
        },
        {
          "id": 92,
          "start": 271.86,
          "end": 273.6,
          "en": "So for the actions,",
          "zh": "至於 actions，"
        },
        {
          "id": 93,
          "start": 273.6,
          "end": 278.26,
          "en": "in the components folder, products, ProductItem,",
          "zh": "在 components 資料夾的 products 底下、ProductItem 裡，"
        },
        {
          "id": 94,
          "start": 278.26,
          "end": 280.713,
          "en": "I got the button to add something to the cart.",
          "zh": "我有一個把東西加入 cart 的按鈕。"
        },
        {
          "id": 95,
          "start": 281.65999999999997,
          "end": 285.11,
          "en": "Previously, I injected addProductToCart for that.",
          "zh": "之前我為此 inject 了 addProductToCart。"
        },
        {
          "id": 96,
          "start": 285.11,
          "end": 287.06,
          "en": "Now we can delete this",
          "zh": "現在我們可以刪掉這個，"
        },
        {
          "id": 97,
          "start": 287.06,
          "end": 292.003,
          "en": "and instead, call this.$store.dispatch",
          "zh": "改成呼叫 this.$store.dispatch，"
        },
        {
          "id": 98,
          "start": 294.65,
          "end": 298.15999999999997,
          "en": "and then dispatch a function,",
          "zh": "然後 dispatch 一個函式，"
        },
        {
          "id": 99,
          "start": 298.15999999999997,
          "end": 302.08,
          "en": "which is named addProductToCart.",
          "zh": "它的名稱是 addProductToCart。"
        },
        {
          "id": 100,
          "start": 304.05,
          "end": 305.61,
          "en": "No, sorry, that's the mutation,",
          "zh": "不對，抱歉，那是 mutation，"
        },
        {
          "id": 101,
          "start": 305.61,
          "end": 308.283,
          "en": "which is named addToCart, that's the action.",
          "zh": "命名為 addToCart 的才是 action。"
        },
        {
          "id": 102,
          "start": 309.21,
          "end": 311.56,
          "en": "So dispatch this",
          "zh": "所以 dispatch 這個，"
        },
        {
          "id": 103,
          "start": 311.56,
          "end": 315.023,
          "en": "but it's namespaced, so it's cart/addToCart.",
          "zh": "但它是 namespaced 的，所以是 cart/addToCart。"
        },
        {
          "id": 104,
          "start": 318.13,
          "end": 323.13,
          "en": "And now, of course, this object here is the payload,",
          "zh": "當然，這裡這個物件就是 payload，"
        },
        {
          "id": 105,
          "start": 325.97,
          "end": 328.13,
          "en": "which I want to transmit.",
          "zh": "也就是我想要傳送的資料。"
        },
        {
          "id": 106,
          "start": 328.13,
          "end": 330.97,
          "en": "And actually here, we have to be careful.",
          "zh": "而其實在這裡，我們必須小心。"
        },
        {
          "id": 107,
          "start": 330.97,
          "end": 334.22,
          "en": "In the module, the Vuex module,",
          "zh": "在 module 裡，也就是 Vuex module，"
        },
        {
          "id": 108,
          "start": 334.22,
          "end": 337.34000000000003,
          "en": "we forward that payload to the mutation",
          "zh": "我們把那個 payload 轉送給 mutation，"
        },
        {
          "id": 109,
          "start": 337.34000000000003,
          "end": 340.13,
          "en": "and in the addProductToCart mutation,",
          "zh": "而在 addProductToCart mutation 裡，"
        },
        {
          "id": 110,
          "start": 340.13,
          "end": 344.38,
          "en": "I expect to get a product key on my payload,",
          "zh": "我預期 payload 上會有一個 product 鍵，"
        },
        {
          "id": 111,
          "start": 344.38,
          "end": 347.363,
          "en": "which then has all the fields I tried to extract.",
          "zh": "裡面則有我想要取出的所有欄位。"
        },
        {
          "id": 112,
          "start": 348.67,
          "end": 351.28,
          "en": "Now, if I just pass the entire object like this",
          "zh": "現在，如果我就像這樣把整個物件"
        },
        {
          "id": 113,
          "start": 351.28,
          "end": 354.159,
          "en": "as a payload, there is no product in there.",
          "zh": "當成 payload 傳進去，裡面就沒有 product。"
        },
        {
          "id": 114,
          "start": 354.159,
          "end": 357.47,
          "en": "So we either nest this data here",
          "zh": "所以我們可以把這裡的資料"
        },
        {
          "id": 115,
          "start": 357.47,
          "end": 360.21,
          "en": "into another object under the key product",
          "zh": "巢狀放在 product 鍵底下的另一個物件裡，"
        },
        {
          "id": 116,
          "start": 360.21,
          "end": 362.3,
          "en": "in this payload object",
          "zh": "放在這個 payload 物件中，"
        },
        {
          "id": 117,
          "start": 362.3,
          "end": 365.04,
          "en": "or we pass the payload like this",
          "zh": "或者我們就這樣傳入 payload，"
        },
        {
          "id": 118,
          "start": 365.04,
          "end": 367.81,
          "en": "and adjust our logic in the mutation",
          "zh": "並調整我們在 mutation 裡的邏輯，"
        },
        {
          "id": 119,
          "start": 367.81,
          "end": 370.61,
          "en": "to simply set payload as we get it equal",
          "zh": "直接把我們收到的 payload 設定為等於"
        },
        {
          "id": 120,
          "start": 370.61,
          "end": 373.9,
          "en": "to productData from which we then extract id and so on.",
          "zh": "productData，再從中取出 id 等等。"
        },
        {
          "id": 121,
          "start": 373.9,
          "end": 375.21,
          "en": "And that's what I'm going to do",
          "zh": "而這就是我要做的，"
        },
        {
          "id": 122,
          "start": 375.21,
          "end": 377.723,
          "en": "because it means less code changes.",
          "zh": "因為這代表要改的程式碼比較少。"
        },
        {
          "id": 123,
          "start": 380.22,
          "end": 385.03,
          "en": "Now, in a CartItem, components, cart, CartItem,",
          "zh": "現在，在 CartItem 裡，也就是 components/cart/CartItem，"
        },
        {
          "id": 124,
          "start": 385.03,
          "end": 387.64,
          "en": "we got the logic for removing an item.",
          "zh": "我們有移除項目的邏輯。"
        },
        {
          "id": 125,
          "start": 387.64,
          "end": 389.91,
          "en": "Previously, I injected this.",
          "zh": "之前我是用 inject 取得它。"
        },
        {
          "id": 126,
          "start": 389.91,
          "end": 391.41,
          "en": "No longer needed.",
          "zh": "現在不再需要了。"
        },
        {
          "id": 127,
          "start": 391.41,
          "end": 392.974,
          "en": "So let's get rid of it.",
          "zh": "所以讓我們把它移除。"
        },
        {
          "id": 128,
          "start": 392.974,
          "end": 397.974,
          "en": "And instead here, I want to simply call this.$store.dispatch",
          "zh": "取而代之，在這裡我只想呼叫 this.$store.dispatch，"
        },
        {
          "id": 129,
          "start": 402.42,
          "end": 407.42,
          "en": "cart/ and then the action name is removeFromCart",
          "zh": "cart/，然後 action 名稱是 removeFromCart，"
        },
        {
          "id": 130,
          "start": 409.32,
          "end": 410.46,
          "en": "and on the payload,",
          "zh": "而在 payload 上，"
        },
        {
          "id": 131,
          "start": 410.46,
          "end": 413.18,
          "en": "which we want in the mutation,",
          "zh": "也就是我們在 mutation 裡想要的，"
        },
        {
          "id": 132,
          "start": 413.18,
          "end": 416.63,
          "en": "I expect to get a productId field in the object",
          "zh": "我預期物件裡會有一個 productId 欄位，"
        },
        {
          "id": 133,
          "start": 416.63,
          "end": 418.19,
          "en": "which I get.",
          "zh": "而我確實拿到了。"
        },
        {
          "id": 134,
          "start": 418.19,
          "end": 421.15,
          "en": "So in CartItem, I dispatch cart/removeFromCart",
          "zh": "所以在 CartItem 裡，我 dispatch cart/removeFromCart，"
        },
        {
          "id": 135,
          "start": 422.3,
          "end": 424.323,
          "en": "and pass an object as a payload,",
          "zh": "並傳入一個物件作為 payload，"
        },
        {
          "id": 136,
          "start": 424.323,
          "end": 426.33,
          "en": "which has a productId field,",
          "zh": "裡面有一個 productId 欄位，"
        },
        {
          "id": 137,
          "start": 426.33,
          "end": 428.25,
          "en": "which points at this prodId,",
          "zh": "它指向這個 prodId，"
        },
        {
          "id": 138,
          "start": 428.25,
          "end": 430.787,
          "en": "which is this prop which holds the productId.",
          "zh": "也就是這個存放 productId 的 prop。"
        },
        {
          "id": 139,
          "start": 433.69,
          "end": 436.17,
          "en": "With that, theoretically, hopefully,",
          "zh": "如此一來，理論上、但願，"
        },
        {
          "id": 140,
          "start": 436.17,
          "end": 438.71,
          "en": "we should be able to add and remove items.",
          "zh": "我們應該就能加入和移除項目。"
        },
        {
          "id": 141,
          "start": 438.71,
          "end": 440.92,
          "en": "And you'll see, the badge here updates",
          "zh": "你會看到，這裡的標記會更新，"
        },
        {
          "id": 142,
          "start": 440.92,
          "end": 443.15,
          "en": "as I add items to the cart.",
          "zh": "當我把項目加入 cart 時。"
        },
        {
          "id": 143,
          "start": 443.15,
          "end": 444.44,
          "en": "If I go to the cart,",
          "zh": "如果我前往 cart，"
        },
        {
          "id": 144,
          "start": 444.44,
          "end": 445.78,
          "en": "the total looks good.",
          "zh": "總金額看起來沒問題。"
        },
        {
          "id": 145,
          "start": 445.78,
          "end": 447.7,
          "en": "We see the cart items",
          "zh": "我們看到 cart 項目，"
        },
        {
          "id": 146,
          "start": 447.7,
          "end": 448.87,
          "en": "and if I remove them,",
          "zh": "而如果我移除它們，"
        },
        {
          "id": 147,
          "start": 448.87,
          "end": 451.31,
          "en": "the total and dispatch updates.",
          "zh": "總金額和顯示畫面都會更新。"
        },
        {
          "id": 148,
          "start": 451.31,
          "end": 452.753,
          "en": "So that seems to work.",
          "zh": "所以這似乎可行。"
        },
        {
          "id": 149,
          "start": 454.1,
          "end": 456.14,
          "en": "Now, I get a warning regarding isLoggedIn",
          "zh": "現在，我收到一個關於 isLoggedIn 的警告，"
        },
        {
          "id": 150,
          "start": 456.14,
          "end": 457.34000000000003,
          "en": "but we'll fix this soon.",
          "zh": "但我們很快就會修正它。"
        },
        {
          "id": 151,
          "start": 458.82,
          "end": 462.38,
          "en": "The main thing here is that we now migrated the products",
          "zh": "這裡的重點是我們現在已經遷移了 products"
        },
        {
          "id": 152,
          "start": 462.38,
          "end": 464.683,
          "en": "and the cart functionality.",
          "zh": "以及 cart 的功能。"
        },
        {
          "id": 153,
          "start": 465.83,
          "end": 468.57,
          "en": "Now, to score some bonus points here,",
          "zh": "現在，為了在這裡多拿一些加分，"
        },
        {
          "id": 154,
          "start": 468.57,
          "end": 472.87,
          "en": "we could actually also change our addToCart logic.",
          "zh": "我們其實也可以修改 addToCart 的邏輯。"
        },
        {
          "id": 155,
          "start": 472.87,
          "end": 476.653,
          "en": "In ProductItem, I'm current passing the entire product data.",
          "zh": "在 ProductItem 裡，我目前傳入完整的 product 資料。"
        },
        {
          "id": 156,
          "start": 477.79,
          "end": 480.37,
          "en": "We could argue that all the product data",
          "zh": "我們可以說所有的 product 資料"
        },
        {
          "id": 157,
          "start": 480.37,
          "end": 484.11,
          "en": "is already in our store right here in products.js.",
          "zh": "都已經在我們的 store 裡，就在這個 products.js 中。"
        },
        {
          "id": 158,
          "start": 484.11,
          "end": 486.21,
          "en": "Here we've got all the products.",
          "zh": "這裡有所有的 products。"
        },
        {
          "id": 159,
          "start": 486.21,
          "end": 489.25,
          "en": "So the only thing which we really have to pass here",
          "zh": "所以我們在這裡真正必須傳入的唯一東西"
        },
        {
          "id": 160,
          "start": 489.25,
          "end": 493.32,
          "en": "to addToCart should be the ID of the product.",
          "zh": "應該就是產品的 ID。"
        },
        {
          "id": 161,
          "start": 493.32,
          "end": 494.43,
          "en": "So let's do that.",
          "zh": "所以讓我們這麼做。"
        },
        {
          "id": 162,
          "start": 494.43,
          "end": 497.733,
          "en": "Let's get rid of the image and title and price here.",
          "zh": "讓我們把這裡的 image、title 和 price 移除。"
        },
        {
          "id": 163,
          "start": 499.01,
          "end": 499.94,
          "en": "Let's delete it",
          "zh": "把它刪掉，"
        },
        {
          "id": 164,
          "start": 499.94,
          "end": 503.303,
          "en": "and just forward the ID on the id field.",
          "zh": "只把 ID 透過 id 欄位傳出去。"
        },
        {
          "id": 165,
          "start": 504.56,
          "end": 509.56,
          "en": "And now in the cart, in addProductToCart,",
          "zh": "現在在 cart 裡，也就是 addProductToCart，"
        },
        {
          "id": 166,
          "start": 509.73,
          "end": 510.81,
          "en": "I get my payload,",
          "zh": "我取得我的 payload，"
        },
        {
          "id": 167,
          "start": 510.81,
          "end": 513.913,
          "en": "which no longer holds all the product data.",
          "zh": "它不再包含完整的 product 資料。"
        },
        {
          "id": 168,
          "start": 515.01,
          "end": 518.723,
          "en": "Instead, now here I just get my prodId",
          "zh": "取而代之，現在我在這裡只取得 prodId，"
        },
        {
          "id": 169,
          "start": 520.03,
          "end": 522.1,
          "en": "by accessing the id field",
          "zh": "透過存取 id 欄位，"
        },
        {
          "id": 170,
          "start": 522.1,
          "end": 522.933,
          "en": "on the payload.",
          "zh": "也就是 payload 上的欄位。"
        },
        {
          "id": 171,
          "start": 522.933,
          "end": 524.203,
          "en": "That's all I get here.",
          "zh": "這就是我在這裡拿到的全部。"
        },
        {
          "id": 172,
          "start": 525.83,
          "end": 527.58,
          "en": "And this is, of course, not enough.",
          "zh": "這當然不夠。"
        },
        {
          "id": 173,
          "start": 528.64,
          "end": 531.4,
          "en": "Now, the problem is because everything is namespaced",
          "zh": "問題在於，因為所有東西都是 namespaced，"
        },
        {
          "id": 174,
          "start": 531.4,
          "end": 535.17,
          "en": "and the state inside of a module is local anyways,",
          "zh": "而且 module 內的 state 本來就是區域的，"
        },
        {
          "id": 175,
          "start": 535.17,
          "end": 538.38,
          "en": "the state we're getting here is just this state.",
          "zh": "我們在這裡取得的 state 就只是這個 state。"
        },
        {
          "id": 176,
          "start": 538.38,
          "end": 541.61,
          "en": "It has no information about the products.",
          "zh": "它沒有任何關於 products 的資訊。"
        },
        {
          "id": 177,
          "start": 541.61,
          "end": 544.31,
          "en": "Therefore, we should actually get this product ID",
          "zh": "因此，我們其實應該取得這個 product ID，"
        },
        {
          "id": 178,
          "start": 544.31,
          "end": 546.09,
          "en": "in the action,",
          "zh": "在 action 裡，"
        },
        {
          "id": 179,
          "start": 546.09,
          "end": 548.16,
          "en": "in the addToCart action",
          "zh": "也就是在 addToCart action 裡，"
        },
        {
          "id": 180,
          "start": 548.16,
          "end": 550.39,
          "en": "because in here in this context,",
          "zh": "因為在這裡的 context 中，"
        },
        {
          "id": 181,
          "start": 550.39,
          "end": 552.8,
          "en": "we actually also do get access",
          "zh": "我們其實也能存取"
        },
        {
          "id": 182,
          "start": 552.8,
          "end": 555.47,
          "en": "to other parts of the Vuex store,",
          "zh": "Vuex store 的其他部分，"
        },
        {
          "id": 183,
          "start": 555.47,
          "end": 557.453,
          "en": "not just to this module.",
          "zh": "而不只是這個 module。"
        },
        {
          "id": 184,
          "start": 558.61,
          "end": 563.4,
          "en": "Here, on context, we will have our rootState object,",
          "zh": "在這裡，context 上會有我們的 rootState 物件，"
        },
        {
          "id": 185,
          "start": 563.4,
          "end": 565.75,
          "en": "which has access to the root state",
          "zh": "它可以存取 root state，"
        },
        {
          "id": 186,
          "start": 565.75,
          "end": 567.17,
          "en": "but even more important than that,",
          "zh": "但更重要的是，"
        },
        {
          "id": 187,
          "start": 567.17,
          "end": 569.583,
          "en": "we've got access to rootGetters.",
          "zh": "我們可以存取 rootGetters。"
        },
        {
          "id": 188,
          "start": 570.8,
          "end": 573.21,
          "en": "And on the rootGetters, we can get access",
          "zh": "而在 rootGetters 上，我們可以存取"
        },
        {
          "id": 189,
          "start": 573.21,
          "end": 575.98,
          "en": "to other namespaced getters as well.",
          "zh": "其他 namespaced getters。"
        },
        {
          "id": 190,
          "start": 575.98,
          "end": 579.98,
          "en": "Namely here to my products getter",
          "zh": "也就是我這裡的 products getter，"
        },
        {
          "id": 191,
          "start": 579.98,
          "end": 581.683,
          "en": "in the products module.",
          "zh": "位於 products module 中。"
        },
        {
          "id": 192,
          "start": 582.63,
          "end": 583.81,
          "en": "How?",
          "zh": "怎麼做呢？"
        },
        {
          "id": 193,
          "start": 583.81,
          "end": 587.04,
          "en": "Simply by accessing square brackets,",
          "zh": "只要使用方括號存取，"
        },
        {
          "id": 194,
          "start": 587.04,
          "end": 590.89,
          "en": "then the namespace name, which in this case is prods.",
          "zh": "然後是 namespace 名稱，在這裡是 prods。"
        },
        {
          "id": 195,
          "start": 590.89,
          "end": 591.95,
          "en": "For the products",
          "zh": "針對 products，"
        },
        {
          "id": 196,
          "start": 593.53,
          "end": 597.76,
          "en": "and then the getter name, which is products here",
          "zh": "然後是 getter 名稱，在這裡就是 products，"
        },
        {
          "id": 197,
          "start": 597.76,
          "end": 599.113,
          "en": "in the products module.",
          "zh": "就在 products module 裡。"
        },
        {
          "id": 198,
          "start": 600.37,
          "end": 605.18,
          "en": "With that, we actually get our products",
          "zh": "如此一來，我們就真的取得 products，"
        },
        {
          "id": 199,
          "start": 605.18,
          "end": 608.61,
          "en": "and now we can filter out the product with this ID.",
          "zh": "現在我們可以篩選出具有這個 ID 的產品。"
        },
        {
          "id": 200,
          "start": 608.61,
          "end": 611.72,
          "en": "So now we can get our product",
          "zh": "現在我們可以取得我們的產品，"
        },
        {
          "id": 201,
          "start": 611.72,
          "end": 615.21,
          "en": "by searching products with the find method",
          "zh": "透過用 find 方法搜尋 products，"
        },
        {
          "id": 202,
          "start": 615.21,
          "end": 617.33,
          "en": "for the product where the prod.id",
          "zh": "找出 prod.id"
        },
        {
          "id": 203,
          "start": 617.33,
          "end": 619.793,
          "en": "is equal to the prodId we got here.",
          "zh": "等於我們在這裡取得的 prodId 的那個產品。"
        },
        {
          "id": 204,
          "start": 621.16,
          "end": 622.3,
          "en": "This is a built-in method",
          "zh": "這是內建的方法，"
        },
        {
          "id": 205,
          "start": 622.3,
          "end": 624.33,
          "en": "for searching all items in an array",
          "zh": "用來搜尋陣列中的所有項目，"
        },
        {
          "id": 206,
          "start": 624.33,
          "end": 626.5,
          "en": "and when this function returns true,",
          "zh": "當這個函式回傳 true 時，"
        },
        {
          "id": 207,
          "start": 626.5,
          "end": 628.27,
          "en": "we got the item we wanna have",
          "zh": "我們就找到了想要的項目，"
        },
        {
          "id": 208,
          "start": 628.27,
          "end": 631.04,
          "en": "and it then returns this item.",
          "zh": "然後它會回傳這個項目。"
        },
        {
          "id": 209,
          "start": 631.04,
          "end": 633.57,
          "en": "And then it's this product,",
          "zh": "接著就是這個 product，"
        },
        {
          "id": 210,
          "start": 633.57,
          "end": 636.06,
          "en": "which we can pass as a second argument",
          "zh": "我們可以把它當作第二個引數傳入，"
        },
        {
          "id": 211,
          "start": 636.06,
          "end": 639.763,
          "en": "as a payload to our commit method here.",
          "zh": "作為 payload 傳給這裡的 commit 方法。"
        },
        {
          "id": 212,
          "start": 641,
          "end": 644.65,
          "en": "So now we receive the entire product in this mutation",
          "zh": "所以現在我們在這個 mutation 裡收到完整的產品，"
        },
        {
          "id": 213,
          "start": 644.65,
          "end": 646.62,
          "en": "and payload therefore again",
          "zh": "因此 payload 又再次"
        },
        {
          "id": 214,
          "start": 646.62,
          "end": 648.683,
          "en": "is the entire product data.",
          "zh": "是完整的產品資料。"
        },
        {
          "id": 215,
          "start": 650.81,
          "end": 652.64,
          "en": "If we now save this,",
          "zh": "如果我們現在儲存，"
        },
        {
          "id": 216,
          "start": 652.64,
          "end": 656.42,
          "en": "hopefully adding to cart still works.",
          "zh": "但願加入 cart 仍然可以運作。"
        },
        {
          "id": 217,
          "start": 656.42,
          "end": 658.44,
          "en": "And this does look good",
          "zh": "而這看起來沒問題，"
        },
        {
          "id": 218,
          "start": 658.44,
          "end": 660.68,
          "en": "and we still see our data here",
          "zh": "我們在這裡仍然看得到資料，"
        },
        {
          "id": 219,
          "start": 660.68,
          "end": 663.55,
          "en": "but now we are getting it differently,",
          "zh": "但現在我們是用不同的方式取得，"
        },
        {
          "id": 220,
          "start": 663.55,
          "end": 666.63,
          "en": "a bit leaner, leveraging actions",
          "zh": "稍微更精簡，利用 actions，"
        },
        {
          "id": 221,
          "start": 666.63,
          "end": 669.61,
          "en": "and not passing all the data around as a payload,",
          "zh": "而不是把所有資料都當作 payload 傳來傳去，"
        },
        {
          "id": 222,
          "start": 669.61,
          "end": 673.81,
          "en": "at least not when we dispatch it inside of our component.",
          "zh": "至少在我們於元件內 dispatch 時不是這樣。"
        },
        {
          "id": 223,
          "start": 673.81,
          "end": 676.09,
          "en": "It's up to you which approach you prefer",
          "zh": "你偏好哪一種做法由你決定，"
        },
        {
          "id": 224,
          "start": 676.09,
          "end": 677.74,
          "en": "but this is a common scenario.",
          "zh": "但這是常見的情境。"
        },
        {
          "id": 225,
          "start": 677.74,
          "end": 680.24,
          "en": "Therefore, I also wanted to show this to you here.",
          "zh": "因此，我也想在這裡示範給你看。"
        },
        {
          "id": 226,
          "start": 682.41,
          "end": 685.653,
          "en": "With that, the only thing that's left is the login state.",
          "zh": "如此一來，唯一剩下的就是登入狀態。"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "21879812",
      "title": "Challenge Solution (3/3)",
      "lectureOrder": 230,
      "videoOrder": 203,
      "sourceHash": "0fc255909035b7760e1e82f1df2b565e08223bb7341457e613fe5167aea8deb6",
      "cues": [
        {
          "id": 1,
          "start": 2.29,
          "end": 3.64,
          "en": "Now lets finish this up",
          "zh": "現在讓我們把這件事完成，"
        },
        {
          "id": 2,
          "start": 3.64,
          "end": 6.193,
          "en": "by migrating is logged in.",
          "zh": "把 isLoggedIn 也遷移過去。"
        },
        {
          "id": 3,
          "start": 7.51,
          "end": 9.33,
          "en": "Currently we're managing it in App Vue",
          "zh": "目前我們是在 App.vue 裡管理它，"
        },
        {
          "id": 4,
          "start": 9.33,
          "end": 11.05,
          "en": "and that's of course not the goal.",
          "zh": "而這當然不是我們的目標。"
        },
        {
          "id": 5,
          "start": 11.05,
          "end": 13.48,
          "en": "Instead, I'll manage this as a route state,",
          "zh": "相反地，我會把它當作 root state 來管理，"
        },
        {
          "id": 6,
          "start": 13.48,
          "end": 15.07,
          "en": "which is not in a module,",
          "zh": "它不是放在 module 裡，"
        },
        {
          "id": 7,
          "start": 15.07,
          "end": 17.05,
          "en": "but which is managed ind the store itself",
          "zh": "而是直接在 store 本身管理，"
        },
        {
          "id": 8,
          "start": 17.05,
          "end": 18.53,
          "en": "though, of course you could put it",
          "zh": "不過當然，你也可以把它"
        },
        {
          "id": 9,
          "start": 18.53,
          "end": 20.623,
          "en": "into a module if you want it to.",
          "zh": "放進 module 裡，如果你想要的話。"
        },
        {
          "id": 10,
          "start": 21.7,
          "end": 23.95,
          "en": "But with that we return an object here",
          "zh": "如此一來，我們在這裡回傳一個物件，"
        },
        {
          "id": 11,
          "start": 23.95,
          "end": 25.8,
          "en": "and then there we got is logged in,",
          "zh": "然後在裡面我們有 isLoggedIn，"
        },
        {
          "id": 12,
          "start": 25.8,
          "end": 29.923,
          "en": "which initially is false in our main store.",
          "zh": "它在我們的主要 store 裡一開始是 false。"
        },
        {
          "id": 13,
          "start": 30.76,
          "end": 31.86,
          "en": "With that in App Vue,",
          "zh": "如此一來，在 App.vue 裡，"
        },
        {
          "id": 14,
          "start": 31.86,
          "end": 33.823,
          "en": "we can entirely get rid of data.",
          "zh": "我們可以完全移除 data。"
        },
        {
          "id": 15,
          "start": 35.2,
          "end": 36.35,
          "en": "Now I got these two methods,",
          "zh": "現在我這裡有這兩個 methods，"
        },
        {
          "id": 16,
          "start": 36.35,
          "end": 38.17,
          "en": "which I will now also cut",
          "zh": "我現在也要把它們剪下，"
        },
        {
          "id": 17,
          "start": 38.17,
          "end": 40.69,
          "en": "and hence, we can remove methods here",
          "zh": "因此，我們可以把這裡的 methods 移除，"
        },
        {
          "id": 18,
          "start": 40.69,
          "end": 43.63,
          "en": "and add them as mutations instead.",
          "zh": "改以 mutations 的形式加入。"
        },
        {
          "id": 19,
          "start": 43.63,
          "end": 45.63,
          "en": "So here we got the mutations",
          "zh": "所以在這裡我們有 mutations，"
        },
        {
          "id": 20,
          "start": 46.92,
          "end": 49.89,
          "en": "and in login we get to the state",
          "zh": "而在 login 裡我們取得 state，"
        },
        {
          "id": 21,
          "start": 49.89,
          "end": 51.75,
          "en": "and we change state is logged in",
          "zh": "然後我們把 state.isLoggedIn"
        },
        {
          "id": 22,
          "start": 51.75,
          "end": 53.59,
          "en": "and set it to true.",
          "zh": "設為 true。"
        },
        {
          "id": 23,
          "start": 53.59,
          "end": 55.423,
          "en": "In logout we do the opposite.",
          "zh": "在 logout 裡我們做相反的事。"
        },
        {
          "id": 24,
          "start": 57.2,
          "end": 59.67,
          "en": "Now we also need actions as you learned.",
          "zh": "如你所學到的，我們現在也需要 actions。"
        },
        {
          "id": 25,
          "start": 59.67,
          "end": 64.67,
          "en": "So here I will also add login and logout actions",
          "zh": "所以在這裡我也會加入 login 和 logout actions，"
        },
        {
          "id": 26,
          "start": 66.82,
          "end": 69.68,
          "en": "and we get our context here",
          "zh": "我們在這裡取得 context，"
        },
        {
          "id": 27,
          "start": 69.68,
          "end": 73.563,
          "en": "and then context commit login here.",
          "zh": "然後在這裡呼叫 context.commit，觸發 login。"
        },
        {
          "id": 28,
          "start": 74.48,
          "end": 79.373,
          "en": "And in logout, we do the same with the log out mutation.",
          "zh": "而在 logout 裡，我們對 logout mutation 做一樣的事。"
        },
        {
          "id": 29,
          "start": 80.6,
          "end": 82.03,
          "en": "And then we can add a getter",
          "zh": "接著我們可以加入一個 getter，"
        },
        {
          "id": 30,
          "start": 84.1,
          "end": 87.08,
          "en": "is authenticated could be together name,",
          "zh": "isAuthenticated，名稱可以是任何名字，"
        },
        {
          "id": 31,
          "start": 87.08,
          "end": 89.34,
          "en": "the name is up to you of course.",
          "zh": "這個名稱當然由你決定。"
        },
        {
          "id": 32,
          "start": 89.34,
          "end": 91.15,
          "en": "Here we also get our state",
          "zh": "在這裡我們同樣取得 state，"
        },
        {
          "id": 33,
          "start": 92.25,
          "end": 94.87,
          "en": "and then we return state is logged in,",
          "zh": "然後我們回傳 state.isLoggedIn，"
        },
        {
          "id": 34,
          "start": 94.87,
          "end": 96.313,
          "en": "which is true or false.",
          "zh": "它的值是 true 或 false。"
        },
        {
          "id": 35,
          "start": 97.87,
          "end": 100.36,
          "en": "Now we can wire up the rest of the app.",
          "zh": "現在我們可以連接應用程式的其餘部分。"
        },
        {
          "id": 36,
          "start": 100.36,
          "end": 102.83,
          "en": "In App Vue we're not using authentication,",
          "zh": "在 App.vue 裡我們沒有使用 authentication，"
        },
        {
          "id": 37,
          "start": 102.83,
          "end": 105.41,
          "en": "but in the header we are.",
          "zh": "但在 header 裡我們有使用。"
        },
        {
          "id": 38,
          "start": 105.41,
          "end": 107.53999999999999,
          "en": "Here I got login and logout buttons",
          "zh": "這裡我有 login 和 logout 按鈕，"
        },
        {
          "id": 39,
          "start": 107.53999999999999,
          "end": 109.59,
          "en": "and I'm using the is logged in instead",
          "zh": "而我是改用 isLoggedIn"
        },
        {
          "id": 40,
          "start": 109.59,
          "end": 112.083,
          "en": "to show our height and extra menu item.",
          "zh": "來顯示或隱藏我們的額外選單項目。"
        },
        {
          "id": 41,
          "start": 113.44,
          "end": 115.24000000000001,
          "en": "So to make that all work,",
          "zh": "所以為了讓這一切運作，"
        },
        {
          "id": 42,
          "start": 115.24000000000001,
          "end": 116.57,
          "en": "I'll add methods here",
          "zh": "我會在這裡加入 methods，"
        },
        {
          "id": 43,
          "start": 116.57,
          "end": 118.46000000000001,
          "en": "to wire up those buttons",
          "zh": "來連接那些按鈕，"
        },
        {
          "id": 44,
          "start": 118.46000000000001,
          "end": 120.55,
          "en": "and add a login method,",
          "zh": "並加入一個 login method，"
        },
        {
          "id": 45,
          "start": 120.55,
          "end": 123.13,
          "en": "which will trigger this store,",
          "zh": "它會呼叫 this.$store 的"
        },
        {
          "id": 46,
          "start": 123.13,
          "end": 127.51,
          "en": "this patch, and then log in.",
          "zh": "dispatch，然後執行 login。"
        },
        {
          "id": 47,
          "start": 127.51,
          "end": 128.88,
          "en": "We got no namespace here",
          "zh": "這裡我們沒有 namespace，"
        },
        {
          "id": 48,
          "start": 128.88,
          "end": 131.793,
          "en": "because this is a route action directly in the store.",
          "zh": "因為這是直接在 store 裡的 root action。"
        },
        {
          "id": 49,
          "start": 133.79,
          "end": 135.9,
          "en": "Now save the thing for log out",
          "zh": "現在 logout 的部分也照樣處理，"
        },
        {
          "id": 50,
          "start": 139.76,
          "end": 142.393,
          "en": "of course with a different action being dispatched.",
          "zh": "當然是 dispatch 不同的 action。"
        },
        {
          "id": 51,
          "start": 143.42000000000002,
          "end": 148.42000000000002,
          "en": "And in computed I will add is logged in computed property,",
          "zh": "而在 computed 裡，我會加入 isLoggedIn 這個 computed property，"
        },
        {
          "id": 52,
          "start": 148.46,
          "end": 150.95,
          "en": "which points at the this store",
          "zh": "它指向 this.$store 的"
        },
        {
          "id": 53,
          "start": 152.1,
          "end": 155.313,
          "en": "is authenticated getter we just added.",
          "zh": "我們剛剛加入的 isAuthenticated getter。"
        },
        {
          "id": 54,
          "start": 157.04,
          "end": 159.32999999999998,
          "en": "So that is this gather.",
          "zh": "所以就是這個 getter。"
        },
        {
          "id": 55,
          "start": 159.32999999999998,
          "end": 161.91,
          "en": "It's a global getter, not namespace,",
          "zh": "它是全域 getter，而不是 namespaced，"
        },
        {
          "id": 56,
          "start": 161.91,
          "end": 164.003,
          "en": "which is why we access it like this.",
          "zh": "這就是為什麼我們這樣存取它。"
        },
        {
          "id": 57,
          "start": 165.68,
          "end": 169.47,
          "en": "This year should be at click of course not at logout.",
          "zh": "這裡應該是 @click，當然不是 @logout。"
        },
        {
          "id": 58,
          "start": 169.47,
          "end": 171.97,
          "en": "This was a mistake on my side.",
          "zh": "這是我這邊的失誤。"
        },
        {
          "id": 59,
          "start": 171.97,
          "end": 174.61,
          "en": "It was fixed in your attachment already though,",
          "zh": "不過在你下載的附件裡已經修正了，"
        },
        {
          "id": 60,
          "start": 174.61,
          "end": 177.31,
          "en": "but make sure you have click listers on those buttons.",
          "zh": "但請確認這些按鈕上有 click listeners。"
        },
        {
          "id": 61,
          "start": 178.29,
          "end": 181.39,
          "en": "And then this works.",
          "zh": "這樣就能運作了。"
        },
        {
          "id": 62,
          "start": 181.39,
          "end": 184.21,
          "en": "The admin page doesn't allow us to do much,",
          "zh": "admin 頁面沒能讓我們做太多事，"
        },
        {
          "id": 63,
          "start": 184.21,
          "end": 185.39,
          "en": "but we can go there.",
          "zh": "但我們可以進去。"
        },
        {
          "id": 64,
          "start": 185.39,
          "end": 186.9,
          "en": "Now we stay there if you log out,",
          "zh": "現在如果你登出，我們會留在那裡，"
        },
        {
          "id": 65,
          "start": 186.9,
          "end": 189.15,
          "en": "but it's not about that at the moment.",
          "zh": "但現在重點不是那個。"
        },
        {
          "id": 66,
          "start": 189.15,
          "end": 191.05,
          "en": "Instead, this is about Vue.js",
          "zh": "相反地，這裡談的是 Vue.js，"
        },
        {
          "id": 67,
          "start": 191.05,
          "end": 193.23,
          "en": "and you now hopefully have a good understanding",
          "zh": "而希望你現在已經有很好的理解，"
        },
        {
          "id": 68,
          "start": 193.23,
          "end": 194.19,
          "en": "of how it works",
          "zh": "瞭解它如何運作，"
        },
        {
          "id": 69,
          "start": 194.19,
          "end": 196.663,
          "en": "and how you may add it to your projects.",
          "zh": "以及如何把它加入你的專案。"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "21879816",
      "title": "Summary",
      "lectureOrder": 231,
      "videoOrder": 204,
      "sourceHash": "9af249e9706e0f6bd0e186fe64fb0a54bbdfb2f7b738cb29881ed84dd5b61d4f",
      "cues": [
        {
          "id": 1,
          "start": 2.12,
          "end": 4.15,
          "en": "So that's it for this module.",
          "zh": "這個模組就到這裡為止。"
        },
        {
          "id": 2,
          "start": 4.15,
          "end": 6.36,
          "en": "You learned what Vuex is,",
          "zh": "你學到了 Vuex 是什麼，"
        },
        {
          "id": 3,
          "start": 6.36,
          "end": 9.24,
          "en": "why you might want to use it, and how it works.",
          "zh": "為什麼你可能會想用它，以及它如何運作。"
        },
        {
          "id": 4,
          "start": 9.24,
          "end": 11.75,
          "en": "It's all about having that central state,",
          "zh": "重點就在於擁有那個中央 state，"
        },
        {
          "id": 5,
          "start": 11.75,
          "end": 13.62,
          "en": "which you manipulate through actions",
          "zh": "你透過 actions"
        },
        {
          "id": 6,
          "start": 13.62,
          "end": 16.993,
          "en": "and mutations and which you get through getters.",
          "zh": "和 mutations 來操作它，並透過 getters 來取得它。"
        },
        {
          "id": 7,
          "start": 18.23,
          "end": 20.25,
          "en": "You learned how to set all of it up,",
          "zh": "你已經學會如何把這些全部設定起來，"
        },
        {
          "id": 8,
          "start": 20.25,
          "end": 22.76,
          "en": "and how to manage more complex states",
          "zh": "以及如何管理更複雜的 state，"
        },
        {
          "id": 9,
          "start": 22.76,
          "end": 26.95,
          "en": "with multiple modules and different folder structures.",
          "zh": "使用多個 modules 和不同的資料夾結構。"
        },
        {
          "id": 10,
          "start": 26.95,
          "end": 28.81,
          "en": "You also learned about the map getters",
          "zh": "你也學到了 mapGetters"
        },
        {
          "id": 11,
          "start": 28.81,
          "end": 31.15,
          "en": "and map actions helpers.",
          "zh": "和 mapActions 輔助函式。"
        },
        {
          "id": 12,
          "start": 31.15,
          "end": 34.53,
          "en": "Now Vuex in a nutshell isn't too complex.",
          "zh": "總而言之，Vuex 其實不會太複雜。"
        },
        {
          "id": 13,
          "start": 34.53,
          "end": 38.23,
          "en": "Yes, you need to write some extra code to manage state,",
          "zh": "沒錯，你需要多寫一些程式碼來管理 state，"
        },
        {
          "id": 14,
          "start": 38.23,
          "end": 41.61,
          "en": "but their after you have a clearly defined flow,",
          "zh": "但之後你就會有一個明確定義的流程，"
        },
        {
          "id": 15,
          "start": 41.61,
          "end": 44.62,
          "en": "a clear structure for managing state.",
          "zh": "以及管理 state 的清晰結構。"
        },
        {
          "id": 16,
          "start": 44.62,
          "end": 47.12,
          "en": "And as you can absolutely see in this demo",
          "zh": "而正如你在這個示範中清楚看到的，"
        },
        {
          "id": 17,
          "start": 47.12,
          "end": 49.04,
          "en": "and the demo before,",
          "zh": "以及前一個示範，"
        },
        {
          "id": 18,
          "start": 49.04,
          "end": 52.44,
          "en": "sharing state and manipulating it from anywhere",
          "zh": "共用 state 並從應用程式的任何地方操作它，"
        },
        {
          "id": 19,
          "start": 52.44,
          "end": 56.52,
          "en": "in your app in a clearly defined way is super easy",
          "zh": "以明確定義的方式進行，其實非常簡單，"
        },
        {
          "id": 20,
          "start": 56.52,
          "end": 58.68,
          "en": "with Vuex in the end.",
          "zh": "到頭來有了 Vuex 就是這麼容易。"
        },
        {
          "id": 21,
          "start": 58.68,
          "end": 62.83,
          "en": "And that's why Vuex can be very helpful in bigger projects",
          "zh": "這就是為什麼 Vuex 在較大型的專案中非常有幫助，"
        },
        {
          "id": 22,
          "start": 62.83,
          "end": 66.56,
          "en": "and why it can make managing state a breeze.",
          "zh": "也是為什麼它能讓管理 state 變得輕而易舉。"
        },
        {
          "id": 23,
          "start": 66.56,
          "end": 69.35,
          "en": "It's much nicer then provide and eject",
          "zh": "它比 provide 和 inject 好得多，"
        },
        {
          "id": 24,
          "start": 69.35,
          "end": 71.75,
          "en": "at least in my opinion, in bigger projects,",
          "zh": "至少在我看來，在較大型的專案中是如此，"
        },
        {
          "id": 25,
          "start": 71.75,
          "end": 75.65,
          "en": "and can therefore definitely help you write any application",
          "zh": "因此它確實能幫助你撰寫任何應用程式，"
        },
        {
          "id": 26,
          "start": 75.65,
          "end": 77.623,
          "en": "of any size you want.",
          "zh": "不管你想要多大的規模。"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "21879870",
      "title": "Module Introduction",
      "lectureOrder": 233,
      "videoOrder": 205,
      "sourceHash": "64e4d25a89db741922490b610d729faafbd82008290c694f7644bbff7614de16",
      "cues": [
        {
          "id": 1,
          "start": 2.09,
          "end": 4.03,
          "en": "Now with all the course modules",
          "zh": "現在，你已經完成了目前為止的所有課程模組，"
        },
        {
          "id": 2,
          "start": 4.03,
          "end": 7.67,
          "en": "you completed up to this point, you learned a lot about Vue.",
          "zh": "你學到了很多關於 Vue 的知識。"
        },
        {
          "id": 3,
          "start": 7.67,
          "end": 12.12,
          "en": "And of course, you already practiced a lot with Vue too.",
          "zh": "當然，你也已經用 Vue 做了很多練習。"
        },
        {
          "id": 4,
          "start": 12.12,
          "end": 14.11,
          "en": "We already had a couple of projects,",
          "zh": "我們已經有過幾個專案，"
        },
        {
          "id": 5,
          "start": 14.11,
          "end": 19.11,
          "en": "and we had tons of demos, assignments and challenges.",
          "zh": "還有大量的示範、作業和挑戰。"
        },
        {
          "id": 6,
          "start": 19.12,
          "end": 22.86,
          "en": "Now however, it's time for our main course project,",
          "zh": "不過現在，是時候進行我們的主要課程專案了，"
        },
        {
          "id": 7,
          "start": 22.86,
          "end": 25.083,
          "en": "the Coach Finder application.",
          "zh": "也就是 Coach Finder 應用程式。"
        },
        {
          "id": 8,
          "start": 25.93,
          "end": 28.083,
          "en": "Now, here is the web app we are going to build",
          "zh": "現在，這就是我們接下來要在這個模組中"
        },
        {
          "id": 9,
          "start": 28.083,
          "end": 30.18,
          "en": "throughout this module.",
          "zh": "建置的網頁應用程式。"
        },
        {
          "id": 10,
          "start": 30.18,
          "end": 34.17,
          "en": "It's an application where we got a bunch of coaches here,",
          "zh": "這是一個應用程式，裡面有一堆教練，"
        },
        {
          "id": 11,
          "start": 34.17,
          "end": 37.78,
          "en": "we can filter those coaches, to for example",
          "zh": "我們可以篩選這些教練，例如"
        },
        {
          "id": 12,
          "start": 37.78,
          "end": 41.72,
          "en": "find a coach that is able to teach us backend development,",
          "zh": "找到一位有能力教我們後端開發的教練，"
        },
        {
          "id": 13,
          "start": 41.72,
          "end": 45.01,
          "en": "we can then contact this coach,",
          "zh": "接著我們可以聯絡這位教練，"
        },
        {
          "id": 14,
          "start": 45.01,
          "end": 49.61,
          "en": "leave our email address, and share a message.",
          "zh": "留下我們的電子郵件地址，並分享一則訊息。"
        },
        {
          "id": 15,
          "start": 49.61,
          "end": 51.88,
          "en": "Now this message has been sent to the coach",
          "zh": "這則訊息就會傳送給教練，"
        },
        {
          "id": 16,
          "start": 51.88,
          "end": 56.49,
          "en": "and under requests, we can view all the incoming requests,",
          "zh": "而在 requests 底下，我們可以查看所有收到的請求，"
        },
        {
          "id": 17,
          "start": 56.49,
          "end": 58.73,
          "en": "all the incoming messages.",
          "zh": "所有收到的訊息。"
        },
        {
          "id": 18,
          "start": 58.73,
          "end": 62.45,
          "en": "We can then use the email address to reply back.",
          "zh": "然後我們就可以用那個電子郵件地址回覆。"
        },
        {
          "id": 19,
          "start": 62.45,
          "end": 64.34,
          "en": "Now this application,",
          "zh": "現在，這個應用程式，"
        },
        {
          "id": 20,
          "start": 64.34,
          "end": 68.18,
          "en": "has basically all we learned throughout this course.",
          "zh": "基本上包含了我們在這門課程中學到的一切。"
        },
        {
          "id": 21,
          "start": 68.18,
          "end": 71.39,
          "en": "It uses routing and animations as you can tell.",
          "zh": "如你所見，它使用了 routing 和動畫。"
        },
        {
          "id": 22,
          "start": 71.39,
          "end": 74.8,
          "en": "It also uses Vuex to manage data",
          "zh": "它也使用 Vuex 來管理資料，"
        },
        {
          "id": 23,
          "start": 74.8,
          "end": 78.72,
          "en": "and it uses a bunch of components as you can see here.",
          "zh": "而且如你在這裡所見，它使用了很多元件。"
        },
        {
          "id": 24,
          "start": 78.72,
          "end": 81.36,
          "en": "It uses all kinds of ways of communicating",
          "zh": "它使用了各種不同的溝通方式，"
        },
        {
          "id": 25,
          "start": 81.36,
          "end": 85.45,
          "en": "between components, Vuex and props and route parameters,",
          "zh": "在元件、Vuex、props 和 route parameters 之間，"
        },
        {
          "id": 26,
          "start": 85.45,
          "end": 88.77,
          "en": "and you will see how all these things work together",
          "zh": "而你將會看到所有這些東西如何一起運作，"
        },
        {
          "id": 27,
          "start": 88.77,
          "end": 92.00999999999999,
          "en": "step by step and in great detail.",
          "zh": "一步一步、非常詳細地。"
        },
        {
          "id": 28,
          "start": 92.00999999999999,
          "end": 94.99000000000001,
          "en": "This is a big Vue application,",
          "zh": "這是一個大型的 Vue 應用程式，"
        },
        {
          "id": 29,
          "start": 94.99000000000001,
          "end": 98.63,
          "en": "which we are going to build together from the ground up",
          "zh": "我們將會一起從零開始建置，"
        },
        {
          "id": 30,
          "start": 98.63,
          "end": 102.1,
          "en": "where all the things we learned will come together.",
          "zh": "把我們學到的一切整合在一起。"
        },
        {
          "id": 31,
          "start": 102.1,
          "end": 106.86,
          "en": "Routing, Vuex, Components, HTTP, everything.",
          "zh": "Routing、Vuex、元件、HTTP，應有盡有。"
        },
        {
          "id": 32,
          "start": 106.86,
          "end": 109.59,
          "en": "It'll all be in that project and therefore",
          "zh": "這一切都會在那個專案裡，因此"
        },
        {
          "id": 33,
          "start": 109.59,
          "end": 113.95,
          "en": "with this project you will get a complete demo",
          "zh": "透過這個專案，你將得到一個完整的示範，"
        },
        {
          "id": 34,
          "start": 113.95,
          "end": 115.61,
          "en": "and a lot of practice",
          "zh": "以及大量的練習，"
        },
        {
          "id": 35,
          "start": 115.61,
          "end": 119.94,
          "en": "when it comes to building an entire app from the ground up.",
          "zh": "在從零開始建置整個應用程式這方面。"
        },
        {
          "id": 36,
          "start": 119.94,
          "end": 122.66,
          "en": "You can definitely also take this as a challenge",
          "zh": "你當然也可以把這當作一項挑戰，"
        },
        {
          "id": 37,
          "start": 122.66,
          "end": 124.83,
          "en": "and try this on your own first,",
          "zh": "先自己試著做做看，"
        },
        {
          "id": 38,
          "start": 124.83,
          "end": 127.54,
          "en": "but we will build this app from the ground up,",
          "zh": "但我們會從零開始建置這個應用程式，"
        },
        {
          "id": 39,
          "start": 127.54,
          "end": 130.45,
          "en": "including the planning phase together",
          "zh": "包括一起進行規劃階段，"
        },
        {
          "id": 40,
          "start": 130.45,
          "end": 132.683,
          "en": "step by step throughout this module.",
          "zh": "在這個模組中一步一步來。"
        },
        {
          "id": 41,
          "start": 133.58,
          "end": 137.53,
          "en": "We'll add routing and Vuex and a lot of other features",
          "zh": "我們會加入 routing、Vuex 以及很多其他功能，"
        },
        {
          "id": 42,
          "start": 137.53,
          "end": 139.34,
          "en": "and with this module,",
          "zh": "而透過這個模組，"
        },
        {
          "id": 43,
          "start": 139.34,
          "end": 143.14,
          "en": "you will not just get another app and more practice,",
          "zh": "你不只會得到另一個應用程式和更多練習，"
        },
        {
          "id": 44,
          "start": 143.14,
          "end": 146.77,
          "en": "but you will also see a lot of common conventions",
          "zh": "你也會看到很多常見的慣例"
        },
        {
          "id": 45,
          "start": 146.77,
          "end": 151.45,
          "en": "and practices and you will learn how to solve problems.",
          "zh": "和實務做法，並且學會如何解決問題。"
        },
        {
          "id": 46,
          "start": 151.45,
          "end": 153.393,
          "en": "So with that, let's dive right in.",
          "zh": "那麼，就讓我們直接開始吧。"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "21879872",
      "title": "Planning the Project / Web App",
      "lectureOrder": 234,
      "videoOrder": 206,
      "sourceHash": "406faae13789f2dabf2ce9a36d53ebefaf193a69cbbdb4a9b049ce9f1e1ecfde",
      "cues": [
        {
          "id": 1,
          "start": 2.12,
          "end": 4.23,
          "en": "As mentioned in this module,",
          "zh": "如同這個模組中所提到的，"
        },
        {
          "id": 2,
          "start": 4.23,
          "end": 7.18,
          "en": "we are going to build the Coach Finder app.",
          "zh": "我們將要建立 Coach Finder 應用程式。"
        },
        {
          "id": 3,
          "start": 7.18,
          "end": 11.61,
          "en": "So a web application, a website built with Vue.js,",
          "zh": "也就是一個網頁應用程式，一個用 Vue.js 建立的網站，"
        },
        {
          "id": 4,
          "start": 11.61,
          "end": 15.63,
          "en": "which should help us find a coach that, for example,",
          "zh": "它應該幫助我們找到一位教練，例如"
        },
        {
          "id": 5,
          "start": 15.63,
          "end": 19,
          "en": "helps us become better in web development, whatever.",
          "zh": "幫助我們在網頁開發上變得更好，諸如此類的。"
        },
        {
          "id": 6,
          "start": 19,
          "end": 21.83,
          "en": "And for this website, this web app,",
          "zh": "而對這個網站、這個網頁應用程式來說，"
        },
        {
          "id": 7,
          "start": 21.83,
          "end": 25.87,
          "en": "which we're going to build will have two main features.",
          "zh": "我們要建立的會有兩大主要功能。"
        },
        {
          "id": 8,
          "start": 25.87,
          "end": 28.67,
          "en": "It has the find a coach feature,",
          "zh": "它有「尋找教練」這項功能，"
        },
        {
          "id": 9,
          "start": 28.67,
          "end": 32.49,
          "en": "and it has a feature to send requests messages,",
          "zh": "以及傳送請求訊息的功能，"
        },
        {
          "id": 10,
          "start": 32.49,
          "end": 36.29,
          "en": "to potential coaches which we want to contact.",
          "zh": "傳給我們想聯絡的潛在教練。"
        },
        {
          "id": 11,
          "start": 36.29,
          "end": 38.55,
          "en": "Now for the find a coach part,",
          "zh": "至於「尋找教練」的部分，"
        },
        {
          "id": 12,
          "start": 38.55,
          "end": 42.75,
          "en": "we want to be able to list all available coaches.",
          "zh": "我們希望能列出所有可用的教練。"
        },
        {
          "id": 13,
          "start": 42.75,
          "end": 46.98,
          "en": "So all the coaches that signed up with our application,",
          "zh": "也就是所有註冊我們應用程式的教練，"
        },
        {
          "id": 14,
          "start": 46.98,
          "end": 50.49,
          "en": "we want to be able to view the coach details.",
          "zh": "我們希望能查看教練的詳細資料。"
        },
        {
          "id": 15,
          "start": 50.49,
          "end": 53.51,
          "en": "We will be able to register as a coach",
          "zh": "我們將可以註冊成為教練，"
        },
        {
          "id": 16,
          "start": 53.51,
          "end": 56.12,
          "en": "and we'll be able to contact a coach.",
          "zh": "也能夠聯絡教練。"
        },
        {
          "id": 17,
          "start": 56.12,
          "end": 60.13,
          "en": "Now, the contact a coach feature also establishes",
          "zh": "而「聯絡教練」這項功能也建立了"
        },
        {
          "id": 18,
          "start": 60.13,
          "end": 62.41,
          "en": "the connection to the other part of this web app,",
          "zh": "與這個網頁應用程式另一部分的連結，"
        },
        {
          "id": 19,
          "start": 62.41,
          "end": 64.2,
          "en": "the requests part,",
          "zh": "也就是 requests 的部分，"
        },
        {
          "id": 20,
          "start": 64.2,
          "end": 67.62,
          "en": "we will be able to send such requests to coaches.",
          "zh": "我們將可以傳送這類請求給教練。"
        },
        {
          "id": 21,
          "start": 67.62,
          "end": 68.58,
          "en": "And as a coach,",
          "zh": "而身為教練，"
        },
        {
          "id": 22,
          "start": 68.58,
          "end": 72.26,
          "en": "we can view incoming requests so that we then potentially",
          "zh": "我們可以查看收到的請求，之後就能"
        },
        {
          "id": 23,
          "start": 72.26,
          "end": 73.89,
          "en": "can reply to them.",
          "zh": "回覆它們。"
        },
        {
          "id": 24,
          "start": 73.89,
          "end": 77.26,
          "en": "This is the app, the web app we're going to build.",
          "zh": "這就是我們要建立的應用程式，也就是這個網頁應用程式。"
        },
        {
          "id": 25,
          "start": 77.26,
          "end": 80.57,
          "en": "And the focus of this module will, of course,",
          "zh": "而這個模組的重點當然會是"
        },
        {
          "id": 26,
          "start": 80.57,
          "end": 85.46000000000001,
          "en": "be on adding as many key view features as possible",
          "zh": "盡可能加入更多關鍵的 Vue 功能，"
        },
        {
          "id": 27,
          "start": 85.46000000000001,
          "end": 87.14,
          "en": "so that you get a very good idea",
          "zh": "讓你非常清楚瞭解"
        },
        {
          "id": 28,
          "start": 87.14,
          "end": 90.343,
          "en": "of how building real view apps works.",
          "zh": "打造真正的 Vue 應用程式是怎麼進行的。"
        },
        {
          "id": 29,
          "start": 91.35,
          "end": 94.38,
          "en": "Now for that, before we write any code,",
          "zh": "為此，在我們寫任何程式碼之前，"
        },
        {
          "id": 30,
          "start": 94.38,
          "end": 96.8,
          "en": "we of course wanna plan the app.",
          "zh": "我們當然要先規劃這個應用程式。"
        },
        {
          "id": 31,
          "start": 96.8,
          "end": 101.07,
          "en": "We want to have a clear plan on which code we need to write,",
          "zh": "我們要有清楚的計畫，知道需要寫哪些程式碼，"
        },
        {
          "id": 32,
          "start": 101.07,
          "end": 104.13,
          "en": "because even though we haven't done this thus far",
          "zh": "因為雖然我們到目前為止還沒這樣做過"
        },
        {
          "id": 33,
          "start": 104.13,
          "end": 107.12,
          "en": "in the course, since it's a Vue course,",
          "zh": "在這門課程中，因為這是 Vue 課程，"
        },
        {
          "id": 34,
          "start": 107.12,
          "end": 109.47,
          "en": "this actually will be a major part",
          "zh": "這其實會是"
        },
        {
          "id": 35,
          "start": 109.47,
          "end": 111.02000000000001,
          "en": "of any app you're building.",
          "zh": "你建立的任何應用程式的重要部分。"
        },
        {
          "id": 36,
          "start": 111.02000000000001,
          "end": 114.15,
          "en": "You need a plan, which then of course is allowed",
          "zh": "你需要一份計畫，它當然可以"
        },
        {
          "id": 37,
          "start": 114.15,
          "end": 117.39,
          "en": "to change over time, but you need an initial plan",
          "zh": "隨著時間改變，但你需要在開始工作前"
        },
        {
          "id": 38,
          "start": 117.39,
          "end": 119.28,
          "en": "before you start working.",
          "zh": "有一份初步計畫。"
        },
        {
          "id": 39,
          "start": 119.28,
          "end": 121.77,
          "en": "Otherwise you don't know which code to write.",
          "zh": "否則你不會知道該寫哪些程式碼。"
        },
        {
          "id": 40,
          "start": 121.77,
          "end": 125.01,
          "en": "Now there is no single right blueprint to follow.",
          "zh": "並沒有唯一正確的藍圖可以遵循。"
        },
        {
          "id": 41,
          "start": 125.01,
          "end": 128.12,
          "en": "There are tons of different ways of planning an application.",
          "zh": "規劃應用程式有非常多不同的方式。"
        },
        {
          "id": 42,
          "start": 128.12,
          "end": 131.55,
          "en": "And here's just one possible way of doing that.",
          "zh": "這裡只是其中一種可行的做法。"
        },
        {
          "id": 43,
          "start": 131.55,
          "end": 135.79,
          "en": "I like to start by defining the key features of the app",
          "zh": "我喜歡先定義我想建立的應用程式"
        },
        {
          "id": 44,
          "start": 135.79,
          "end": 137.4,
          "en": "I wanna build.",
          "zh": "的關鍵功能。"
        },
        {
          "id": 45,
          "start": 137.4,
          "end": 140.65,
          "en": "So in this case, find a coach and requests.",
          "zh": "所以在這個例子中，就是尋找教練和 requests。"
        },
        {
          "id": 46,
          "start": 140.65,
          "end": 144.72,
          "en": "And then the sup features that belong to these areas",
          "zh": "然後是屬於這些領域的子功能，"
        },
        {
          "id": 47,
          "start": 144.72,
          "end": 148.24,
          "en": "like listing all coaches, registering as a coach,",
          "zh": "例如列出所有教練、註冊成為教練、"
        },
        {
          "id": 48,
          "start": 148.24,
          "end": 151.03,
          "en": "sending messages and so on.",
          "zh": "傳送訊息等等。"
        },
        {
          "id": 49,
          "start": 151.03,
          "end": 153.21,
          "en": "Now, once the features are defined,",
          "zh": "一旦功能定義好了，"
        },
        {
          "id": 50,
          "start": 153.21,
          "end": 156.74,
          "en": "we can do two very important things.",
          "zh": "我們可以做兩件非常重要的事。"
        },
        {
          "id": 51,
          "start": 156.74,
          "end": 160.52,
          "en": "The first important thing which we can do is that we can",
          "zh": "第一件重要的事，就是我們可以"
        },
        {
          "id": 52,
          "start": 160.52,
          "end": 163.76,
          "en": "derive the data we need, the data models we need",
          "zh": "推導出我們需要的資料、需要的資料模型，"
        },
        {
          "id": 53,
          "start": 163.76,
          "end": 168.72,
          "en": "and in the Vue world data for the Vuex store layout we want.",
          "zh": "而在 Vue 的世界裡，就是我們想要的 Vuex store 配置所需的資料。"
        },
        {
          "id": 54,
          "start": 168.72,
          "end": 172.98,
          "en": "We can plan our application wide state and our getters,",
          "zh": "我們可以規劃整個應用程式的 state 和 getters，"
        },
        {
          "id": 55,
          "start": 172.98,
          "end": 176.88,
          "en": "and also the actions and mutations we will most likely need.",
          "zh": "以及我們最可能需要的 actions 和 mutations。"
        },
        {
          "id": 56,
          "start": 176.88,
          "end": 179.77,
          "en": "Now from experience, I can tell you typically",
          "zh": "根據經驗，我可以告訴你，通常"
        },
        {
          "id": 57,
          "start": 179.77,
          "end": 181.41,
          "en": "you will plan something",
          "zh": "你會規劃一些東西，"
        },
        {
          "id": 58,
          "start": 181.41,
          "end": 183.48,
          "en": "and then once you start building the app,",
          "zh": "然後一旦開始建立應用程式，"
        },
        {
          "id": 59,
          "start": 183.48,
          "end": 186.75,
          "en": "your plans change and you add more actions",
          "zh": "你的計畫會改變，你會加入更多 actions"
        },
        {
          "id": 60,
          "start": 186.75,
          "end": 189.45,
          "en": "or different actions and different mutations",
          "zh": "或不同的 actions 和不同的 mutations，"
        },
        {
          "id": 61,
          "start": 189.45,
          "end": 193.84,
          "en": "than initially planned because it turns out to work better.",
          "zh": "和最初規劃的不同，因為結果發現那樣更好。"
        },
        {
          "id": 62,
          "start": 193.84,
          "end": 195.51,
          "en": "And that is okay.",
          "zh": "這沒關係。"
        },
        {
          "id": 63,
          "start": 195.51,
          "end": 199.46,
          "en": "I'm not a fan of planning for days before you get started.",
          "zh": "我不喜歡在開始之前花好幾天規劃。"
        },
        {
          "id": 64,
          "start": 199.46,
          "end": 201.32,
          "en": "I rather get started quickly,",
          "zh": "我寧願快速開始，"
        },
        {
          "id": 65,
          "start": 201.32,
          "end": 204.203,
          "en": "but a rough plan definitely won't hurt.",
          "zh": "但粗略的計畫絕對不會有壞處。"
        },
        {
          "id": 66,
          "start": 205.28,
          "end": 207.22,
          "en": "Now, the other important part,",
          "zh": "而另一個重要部分，"
        },
        {
          "id": 67,
          "start": 207.22,
          "end": 209.45,
          "en": "which is not necessarily the second step,",
          "zh": "它不一定是第二步，"
        },
        {
          "id": 68,
          "start": 209.45,
          "end": 212.07,
          "en": "you can also start with that other part",
          "zh": "你也可以從那個部分開始，"
        },
        {
          "id": 69,
          "start": 212.07,
          "end": 215.95,
          "en": "is that you derive to design, the layout of this application",
          "zh": "就是你推導出設計，也就是這個應用程式的版面配置，"
        },
        {
          "id": 70,
          "start": 215.95,
          "end": 218.28,
          "en": "and you plan which components you need",
          "zh": "並規劃你需要哪些元件，"
        },
        {
          "id": 71,
          "start": 218.28,
          "end": 221.72,
          "en": "and how these components are related.",
          "zh": "以及這些元件之間如何關聯。"
        },
        {
          "id": 72,
          "start": 221.72,
          "end": 225.7,
          "en": "This also includes the part where you plan your routes,",
          "zh": "這也包含規劃路由的部分，"
        },
        {
          "id": 73,
          "start": 225.7,
          "end": 227.97,
          "en": "which you wanna set up with the router.",
          "zh": "也就是你想用 router 設定的路由。"
        },
        {
          "id": 74,
          "start": 227.97,
          "end": 230.313,
          "en": "So which different pages do you want to have?",
          "zh": "也就是你想要有哪些不同的頁面？"
        },
        {
          "id": 75,
          "start": 231.18,
          "end": 232.99,
          "en": "Now, when I say design here,",
          "zh": "當我在這裡說設計時，"
        },
        {
          "id": 76,
          "start": 232.99,
          "end": 236.62,
          "en": "I don't necessarily mean the colors and the font",
          "zh": "我不一定是指顏色和字型"
        },
        {
          "id": 77,
          "start": 236.62,
          "end": 239.27,
          "en": "or something like that, because whilst this,",
          "zh": "或那類的東西，因為雖然這"
        },
        {
          "id": 78,
          "start": 239.27,
          "end": 242.37,
          "en": "of course, is a part often that will be done",
          "zh": "當然通常是"
        },
        {
          "id": 79,
          "start": 242.37,
          "end": 244.78,
          "en": "by some designer for you.",
          "zh": "由某位設計師為你完成的部分。"
        },
        {
          "id": 80,
          "start": 244.78,
          "end": 247.25,
          "en": "I personally am not a designer,",
          "zh": "我個人不是設計師，"
        },
        {
          "id": 81,
          "start": 247.25,
          "end": 251.98,
          "en": "so my designs look okayish, but not great.",
          "zh": "所以我的設計看起來還行，但不算出色。"
        },
        {
          "id": 82,
          "start": 251.98,
          "end": 254.19,
          "en": "I'm really talking about the Vue part,",
          "zh": "我真正在談的是 Vue 的部分，"
        },
        {
          "id": 83,
          "start": 254.19,
          "end": 257.453,
          "en": "so the components and how these components are related.",
          "zh": "也就是元件以及這些元件之間的關聯。"
        },
        {
          "id": 84,
          "start": 258.37,
          "end": 260.9,
          "en": "These are the major two things we wanna do",
          "zh": "這是我們想做的兩件主要的事，"
        },
        {
          "id": 85,
          "start": 260.9,
          "end": 262.64,
          "en": "and therefore these are the steps",
          "zh": "因此這就是"
        },
        {
          "id": 86,
          "start": 262.64,
          "end": 264.823,
          "en": "I'll start with in the next lecture.",
          "zh": "我下一堂課會開始進行的步驟。"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "21879876",
      "title": "Planning the Data Requirements",
      "lectureOrder": 235,
      "videoOrder": 207,
      "sourceHash": "9f195eeb92329d6921d38db24acf0335ce2cc96b9ffa3224f7da012fcee356cc",
      "cues": [
        {
          "id": 1,
          "start": 2.09,
          "end": 5.51,
          "en": "Now I'll start with the data here.",
          "zh": "現在我會從這裡的資料開始。"
        },
        {
          "id": 2,
          "start": 5.51,
          "end": 8.9,
          "en": "So I'll plan my data first,",
          "zh": "所以我會先規劃我的資料，"
        },
        {
          "id": 3,
          "start": 8.9,
          "end": 11.32,
          "en": "but this is just one approach.",
          "zh": "但這只是一種做法。"
        },
        {
          "id": 4,
          "start": 11.32,
          "end": 13.43,
          "en": "I'll then move on to the sign",
          "zh": "接著我會繼續進行"
        },
        {
          "id": 5,
          "start": 13.43,
          "end": 15.24,
          "en": "of the components as a next step,",
          "zh": "元件的設計，作為下一步，"
        },
        {
          "id": 6,
          "start": 15.24,
          "end": 17.24,
          "en": "what do we need here?",
          "zh": "我們這裡需要什麼？"
        },
        {
          "id": 7,
          "start": 17.24,
          "end": 20.2,
          "en": "Well, obviously we got these two main features,",
          "zh": "很明顯，我們有這兩大主要功能，"
        },
        {
          "id": 8,
          "start": 20.2,
          "end": 23.48,
          "en": "we got the Coaches",
          "zh": "我們有 Coaches"
        },
        {
          "id": 9,
          "start": 23.48,
          "end": 25.92,
          "en": "and we got the Requests",
          "zh": "以及 Requests，"
        },
        {
          "id": 10,
          "start": 25.92,
          "end": 28.37,
          "en": "so the messages basically.",
          "zh": "基本上就是訊息。"
        },
        {
          "id": 11,
          "start": 28.37,
          "end": 31.33,
          "en": "I hope you can read my writing here,",
          "zh": "我希望你們看得懂我在這裡寫的字，"
        },
        {
          "id": 12,
          "start": 31.33,
          "end": 34.28,
          "en": "I'll soon start to draw and this will not be better.",
          "zh": "我很快就會開始畫圖，那也不會更好看。"
        },
        {
          "id": 13,
          "start": 34.28,
          "end": 36.3,
          "en": "So yeah, that's why I'm also talking",
          "zh": "所以是的，這也是為什麼我還會一邊講解，"
        },
        {
          "id": 14,
          "start": 36.3,
          "end": 38.9,
          "en": "hopefully we're all on the same page at the end.",
          "zh": "希望最後我們都能有一致的理解。"
        },
        {
          "id": 15,
          "start": 38.9,
          "end": 40.64,
          "en": "So we've got Coaches and Requests,",
          "zh": "所以我們有 Coaches 和 Requests，"
        },
        {
          "id": 16,
          "start": 40.64,
          "end": 44.8,
          "en": "these are our two main pieces of data.",
          "zh": "這是我們兩塊主要的資料。"
        },
        {
          "id": 17,
          "start": 44.8,
          "end": 46.59,
          "en": "Now we will probably need",
          "zh": "我們大概會需要"
        },
        {
          "id": 18,
          "start": 46.59,
          "end": 49.34,
          "en": "a list of Coaches.",
          "zh": "一份 Coaches 清單。"
        },
        {
          "id": 19,
          "start": 49.34,
          "end": 51.44,
          "en": "So we want that",
          "zh": "所以我們要那個，"
        },
        {
          "id": 20,
          "start": 51.44,
          "end": 56.44,
          "en": "and we probably also need a list of Requests, right?",
          "zh": "而我們大概也需要一份 Requests 清單，對吧？"
        },
        {
          "id": 21,
          "start": 56.46,
          "end": 59.81,
          "en": "Because multiple Requests can be sent",
          "zh": "因為可以傳送多個 Requests，"
        },
        {
          "id": 22,
          "start": 59.81,
          "end": 63.24,
          "en": "also multiple Requests to the same Coach.",
          "zh": "也可以傳送多個 Requests 給同一位 Coach。"
        },
        {
          "id": 23,
          "start": 63.24,
          "end": 66.65,
          "en": "Now every Request item of course,",
          "zh": "而每一個 Request 項目當然"
        },
        {
          "id": 24,
          "start": 66.65,
          "end": 69.43,
          "en": "should point at Coaches.",
          "zh": "應該指向 Coaches。"
        },
        {
          "id": 25,
          "start": 69.43,
          "end": 71.43,
          "en": "So a Request",
          "zh": "所以一個 Request"
        },
        {
          "id": 26,
          "start": 72.68,
          "end": 75.23,
          "en": "will definitely be an important data piece",
          "zh": "絕對會是一塊重要的資料，"
        },
        {
          "id": 27,
          "start": 75.23,
          "end": 80.12,
          "en": "and a Request will definitely hold some Coach ID",
          "zh": "而且一個 Request 一定會帶有某個 Coach ID，"
        },
        {
          "id": 28,
          "start": 80.12,
          "end": 82.38,
          "en": "because a Request needs to be connected",
          "zh": "因為一個 Request 需要連接"
        },
        {
          "id": 29,
          "start": 82.38,
          "end": 86.33,
          "en": "to the Coach to which it was sent.",
          "zh": "到它被傳送的那位 Coach。"
        },
        {
          "id": 30,
          "start": 86.33,
          "end": 88.12,
          "en": "Now in addition our Request",
          "zh": "此外，我們的 Request"
        },
        {
          "id": 31,
          "start": 88.12,
          "end": 89.98,
          "en": "will need a message,",
          "zh": "會需要一個 message，"
        },
        {
          "id": 32,
          "start": 89.98,
          "end": 93.19,
          "en": "like the text that sent to the Coach,",
          "zh": "也就是傳送給 Coach 的文字，"
        },
        {
          "id": 33,
          "start": 93.19,
          "end": 96.34,
          "en": "and so that the Coach is able to respond",
          "zh": "而為了讓 Coach 能夠回覆，"
        },
        {
          "id": 34,
          "start": 96.34,
          "end": 100.393,
          "en": "let's say a Request should contain an email address.",
          "zh": "比方說，一個 Request 應該包含一個 email 位址。"
        },
        {
          "id": 35,
          "start": 101.37,
          "end": 104.00999999999999,
          "en": "So these are the three pieces of data",
          "zh": "所以這是我希望一個 Request 裡"
        },
        {
          "id": 36,
          "start": 104.00999999999999,
          "end": 106.72,
          "en": "I want to have in a Request.",
          "zh": "擁有的三塊資料。"
        },
        {
          "id": 37,
          "start": 106.72,
          "end": 109.1,
          "en": "And we'll have a list of such Requests",
          "zh": "而我們會有一份這樣 Requests 的清單，"
        },
        {
          "id": 38,
          "start": 109.1,
          "end": 111.113,
          "en": "also as part of the application.",
          "zh": "同樣是這個應用程式的一部分。"
        },
        {
          "id": 39,
          "start": 112.89,
          "end": 114.67,
          "en": "Now back to the Coaches,",
          "zh": "現在回到 Coaches，"
        },
        {
          "id": 40,
          "start": 114.67,
          "end": 117.32,
          "en": "what is a Coach?",
          "zh": "什麼是 Coach？"
        },
        {
          "id": 41,
          "start": 117.32,
          "end": 120.29,
          "en": "Well obviously, Coaches are important.",
          "zh": "很明顯，Coaches 很重要。"
        },
        {
          "id": 42,
          "start": 120.29,
          "end": 122.91,
          "en": "A Coach will have an ID,",
          "zh": "一個 Coach 會有一個 ID，"
        },
        {
          "id": 43,
          "start": 122.91,
          "end": 124.73,
          "en": "a Coach also will have a name.",
          "zh": "一個 Coach 也會有一個名字。"
        },
        {
          "id": 44,
          "start": 124.73,
          "end": 128.5,
          "en": "Let's say we have a first name",
          "zh": "假設我們有一個名字（first name），"
        },
        {
          "id": 45,
          "start": 128.5,
          "end": 133.2,
          "en": "and we have a last name here.",
          "zh": "以及一個姓氏（last name）。"
        },
        {
          "id": 46,
          "start": 133.2,
          "end": 135.03,
          "en": "Now we can have more data",
          "zh": "我們可以有更多資料，"
        },
        {
          "id": 47,
          "start": 135.03,
          "end": 136.913,
          "en": "I want to have a,",
          "zh": "我想要有一個"
        },
        {
          "id": 48,
          "start": 138.003,
          "end": 139.51,
          "en": "description",
          "zh": "description，"
        },
        {
          "id": 49,
          "start": 140.9,
          "end": 142.27,
          "en": "where the coach simply is able",
          "zh": "讓 coach 能夠直接"
        },
        {
          "id": 50,
          "start": 142.27,
          "end": 144.4,
          "en": "to describe him or herself",
          "zh": "描述自己，"
        },
        {
          "id": 51,
          "start": 144.4,
          "end": 146.07,
          "en": "and I want to have a rate",
          "zh": "而我想要有一個 rate，"
        },
        {
          "id": 52,
          "start": 146.07,
          "end": 149.453,
          "en": "so the hourly rate we would charge for a coaching.",
          "zh": "也就是我們針對一次教練服務收取的每小時費率。"
        },
        {
          "id": 53,
          "start": 150.32,
          "end": 153.79,
          "en": "Now that looks like a good set of data for me",
          "zh": "這對我來說看起來是一組不錯的資料，"
        },
        {
          "id": 54,
          "start": 153.79,
          "end": 155.18,
          "en": "and with that,",
          "zh": "有了這些，"
        },
        {
          "id": 55,
          "start": 155.18,
          "end": 158.53,
          "en": "we should have the core data entities",
          "zh": "我們應該就有了這個應用程式所需的"
        },
        {
          "id": 56,
          "start": 158.53,
          "end": 162.12,
          "en": "to core data models we'll need in this app.",
          "zh": "核心資料實體，也就是核心資料模型。"
        },
        {
          "id": 57,
          "start": 162.12,
          "end": 165.49,
          "en": "Coaches and Requests and Requests through to",
          "zh": "Coaches 和 Requests，而 Requests 透過"
        },
        {
          "id": 58,
          "start": 165.49,
          "end": 168.9,
          "en": "Coach ID are connected to Coaches.",
          "zh": "Coach ID 連接到 Coaches。"
        },
        {
          "id": 59,
          "start": 168.9,
          "end": 171.04,
          "en": "Now that's just a rough data model.",
          "zh": "這只是粗略的資料模型。"
        },
        {
          "id": 60,
          "start": 171.04,
          "end": 174.42000000000002,
          "en": "You can definitely do this in a more professional way,",
          "zh": "你當然可以用更專業的方式來做，"
        },
        {
          "id": 61,
          "start": 174.42000000000002,
          "end": 178.01,
          "en": "you can use what you maybe learned in university.",
          "zh": "你可以運用你在大學學到的東西。"
        },
        {
          "id": 62,
          "start": 178.01,
          "end": 180.07,
          "en": "This is just a general plan",
          "zh": "這只是一個大致的計畫，"
        },
        {
          "id": 63,
          "start": 180.07,
          "end": 183.26,
          "en": "and that's how I like to start my projects.",
          "zh": "而這就是我喜歡開始專案的方式。"
        },
        {
          "id": 64,
          "start": 183.26,
          "end": 186.15,
          "en": "I now have a general idea of the data I'll need,",
          "zh": "我現在大致知道我會需要哪些資料，"
        },
        {
          "id": 65,
          "start": 186.15,
          "end": 188.94,
          "en": "and this will help me lay out VueX later.",
          "zh": "這會幫助我之後安排 Vuex。"
        },
        {
          "id": 66,
          "start": 188.94,
          "end": 193.21,
          "en": "For example, we'll probably have two VueX modules,",
          "zh": "例如，我們大概會有兩個 Vuex modules，"
        },
        {
          "id": 67,
          "start": 193.21,
          "end": 195.2,
          "en": "We'll have a module for our Coaches",
          "zh": "我們會有一個給 Coaches 的 module，"
        },
        {
          "id": 68,
          "start": 195.2,
          "end": 197.723,
          "en": "and we'll have a module for Requests.",
          "zh": "以及一個給 Requests 的 module。"
        },
        {
          "id": 69,
          "start": 199,
          "end": 202.64,
          "en": "Now of course data where planning data and planning VueX",
          "zh": "當然，規劃資料和規劃 Vuex"
        },
        {
          "id": 70,
          "start": 202.64,
          "end": 205.7,
          "en": "is not just about planning the data we want to store,",
          "zh": "不只是規劃我們想儲存的資料，"
        },
        {
          "id": 71,
          "start": 205.7,
          "end": 208.02,
          "en": "it's also about planning our Getters,",
          "zh": "也是規劃我們的 getters、"
        },
        {
          "id": 72,
          "start": 208.02,
          "end": 210.43,
          "en": "our actions, our mutations.",
          "zh": "actions 和 mutations。"
        },
        {
          "id": 73,
          "start": 210.43,
          "end": 212.32999999999998,
          "en": "So regarding the Getters,",
          "zh": "至於 getters，"
        },
        {
          "id": 74,
          "start": 212.32999999999998,
          "end": 214.02,
          "en": "it will be straightforward.",
          "zh": "會很直接。"
        },
        {
          "id": 75,
          "start": 214.02,
          "end": 216.57999999999998,
          "en": "We want a Getter to fetch all Coaches",
          "zh": "我們要一個 getter 來取得所有 Coaches，"
        },
        {
          "id": 76,
          "start": 216.57999999999998,
          "end": 219.44,
          "en": "and a Getter to fetch all Requests.",
          "zh": "以及一個 getter 來取得所有 Requests。"
        },
        {
          "id": 77,
          "start": 219.44,
          "end": 223.03,
          "en": "Now what about the mutations though?",
          "zh": "那 mutations 呢？"
        },
        {
          "id": 78,
          "start": 223.03,
          "end": 224.92000000000002,
          "en": "What about those?",
          "zh": "那些怎麼辦？"
        },
        {
          "id": 79,
          "start": 224.92000000000002,
          "end": 226.23,
          "en": "Well for a Coach,",
          "zh": "對 Coach 來說，"
        },
        {
          "id": 80,
          "start": 226.23,
          "end": 228.64,
          "en": "we definitely need a mutation to",
          "zh": "我們絕對需要一個 mutation 來"
        },
        {
          "id": 81,
          "start": 228.64,
          "end": 231.15,
          "en": "register as a Coach",
          "zh": "註冊成為 Coach，"
        },
        {
          "id": 82,
          "start": 231.15,
          "end": 236.15,
          "en": "and we need a mutation to set Coaches,",
          "zh": "以及一個 mutation 來設定 Coaches，"
        },
        {
          "id": 83,
          "start": 236.77,
          "end": 238.25,
          "en": "which might not be obvious,",
          "zh": "這可能不太明顯，"
        },
        {
          "id": 84,
          "start": 238.25,
          "end": 239.57,
          "en": "but when the app starts,",
          "zh": "但當應用程式啟動時，"
        },
        {
          "id": 85,
          "start": 239.57,
          "end": 242.59,
          "en": "I want to load Coaches from a database,",
          "zh": "我想從資料庫載入 Coaches，"
        },
        {
          "id": 86,
          "start": 242.59,
          "end": 244.25,
          "en": "from a web server.",
          "zh": "從網頁伺服器載入。"
        },
        {
          "id": 87,
          "start": 244.25,
          "end": 246.9,
          "en": "So from a backend and from Firebase in this case,",
          "zh": "也就是從後端，而在這個例子中是從 Firebase，"
        },
        {
          "id": 88,
          "start": 246.9,
          "end": 248.41,
          "en": "and once the data is loaded,",
          "zh": "一旦資料載入完成，"
        },
        {
          "id": 89,
          "start": 248.41,
          "end": 251.23,
          "en": "once the list of Coaches is loaded from the database,",
          "zh": "一旦 Coaches 清單從資料庫載入完成，"
        },
        {
          "id": 90,
          "start": 251.23,
          "end": 254.41,
          "en": "I want to set it in my local VueX store.",
          "zh": "我想將它設定到本機的 Vuex store 中。"
        },
        {
          "id": 91,
          "start": 254.41,
          "end": 258.49,
          "en": "So these will be the two mutations I need for Coaches.",
          "zh": "所以這就是我對 Coaches 需要的兩個 mutations。"
        },
        {
          "id": 92,
          "start": 258.49,
          "end": 262.62,
          "en": "Now for requests, I need a contact",
          "zh": "至於 requests，我需要一個 contact"
        },
        {
          "id": 93,
          "start": 263.8,
          "end": 265.25,
          "en": "Coach mutation,",
          "zh": "Coach mutation，"
        },
        {
          "id": 94,
          "start": 265.25,
          "end": 268.61,
          "en": "which basically sets or adds a new Request.",
          "zh": "它基本上會設定或新增一個新的 Request。"
        },
        {
          "id": 95,
          "start": 268.61,
          "end": 270.49,
          "en": "And I also need a set",
          "zh": "而我還需要一個 set"
        },
        {
          "id": 96,
          "start": 271.67,
          "end": 274.40999999999997,
          "en": "Requests mutation here",
          "zh": "Requests mutation 放在這裡，"
        },
        {
          "id": 97,
          "start": 274.40999999999997,
          "end": 276.15,
          "en": "so that I can set my Requests",
          "zh": "這樣我就能設定我的 Requests，"
        },
        {
          "id": 98,
          "start": 276.15,
          "end": 278.3,
          "en": "once I loaded them from a backend,",
          "zh": "一旦我從後端將它們載入，"
        },
        {
          "id": 99,
          "start": 278.3,
          "end": 280.15,
          "en": "because just like Coaches,",
          "zh": "因為就像 Coaches 一樣，"
        },
        {
          "id": 100,
          "start": 280.15,
          "end": 282.26,
          "en": "Requests will be sent to a database,",
          "zh": "Requests 會被送到資料庫，"
        },
        {
          "id": 101,
          "start": 282.26,
          "end": 283.45,
          "en": "will be stored in there",
          "zh": "會儲存在那裡，"
        },
        {
          "id": 102,
          "start": 283.45,
          "end": 285.52,
          "en": "and I want to be able to load them from there",
          "zh": "而我希望能夠從那裡載入它們，"
        },
        {
          "id": 103,
          "start": 285.52,
          "end": 288.15,
          "en": "and then set them through a mutation.",
          "zh": "然後透過 mutation 設定它們。"
        },
        {
          "id": 104,
          "start": 288.15,
          "end": 289.55,
          "en": "So when it comes to actions,",
          "zh": "至於 actions，"
        },
        {
          "id": 105,
          "start": 289.55,
          "end": 292.35,
          "en": "we basically have actions for loading Coaches",
          "zh": "我們基本上會有載入 Coaches 的 actions，"
        },
        {
          "id": 106,
          "start": 292.35,
          "end": 294.07,
          "en": "and loading Requests,",
          "zh": "以及載入 Requests 的 actions，"
        },
        {
          "id": 107,
          "start": 294.07,
          "end": 297.42,
          "en": "and we'll have actions for adding a new Coach",
          "zh": "還會有新增一位新 Coach 的 actions，"
        },
        {
          "id": 108,
          "start": 297.42,
          "end": 299.64,
          "en": "and for adding a new Request.",
          "zh": "以及新增一個新 Request 的 actions。"
        },
        {
          "id": 109,
          "start": 299.64,
          "end": 304.3,
          "en": "And this is about it regarding the data of this application.",
          "zh": "關於這個應用程式的資料，大概就是這樣。"
        },
        {
          "id": 110,
          "start": 304.3,
          "end": 307.22,
          "en": "Now let's move on to the layout, the components,",
          "zh": "現在讓我們繼續看版面配置、元件，"
        },
        {
          "id": 111,
          "start": 307.22,
          "end": 309.92,
          "en": "and also their routes where we are going to work with.",
          "zh": "以及我們將會用到的路由。"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "21879882",
      "title": "Planning the Layout / Components",
      "lectureOrder": 236,
      "videoOrder": 208,
      "sourceHash": "7fd09c6fec5ffb4e665523ea5f0044e05a49de086ba78ab21322fb55c33175c0",
      "cues": [
        {
          "id": 1,
          "start": 2.1,
          "end": 5.14,
          "en": "So let's now talk about the Layout.",
          "zh": "所以現在讓我們來談談版面配置。"
        },
        {
          "id": 2,
          "start": 5.14,
          "end": 7.51,
          "en": "And with the layout, I really mean everything.",
          "zh": "而說到版面配置，我指的真的是所有東西。"
        },
        {
          "id": 3,
          "start": 7.51,
          "end": 10.74,
          "en": "I mean components, I mean routes, everything.",
          "zh": "我指的是元件、路由，所有東西。"
        },
        {
          "id": 4,
          "start": 10.74,
          "end": 12.58,
          "en": "And let's maybe start with routes,",
          "zh": "我們也許就從路由開始，"
        },
        {
          "id": 5,
          "start": 12.58,
          "end": 16.21,
          "en": "with the main page as we wanna have in this application.",
          "zh": "也就是我們想在這個應用程式裡有的主要頁面。"
        },
        {
          "id": 6,
          "start": 16.21,
          "end": 17.96,
          "en": "Now I want to have a...",
          "zh": "我想要有一個……"
        },
        {
          "id": 7,
          "start": 17.96,
          "end": 22.3,
          "en": "Let's say slash coaches route,",
          "zh": "比如說 /coaches 這條路由，"
        },
        {
          "id": 8,
          "start": 22.3,
          "end": 25.75,
          "en": "which loads a list of coaches.",
          "zh": "它會載入一份教練清單。"
        },
        {
          "id": 9,
          "start": 25.75,
          "end": 30.75,
          "en": "So let's say coaches list components, something like this.",
          "zh": "比如說 coaches list 元件，類似這樣。"
        },
        {
          "id": 10,
          "start": 33.11,
          "end": 38.11,
          "en": "I also want to have coaches and then some ID.",
          "zh": "我也想要有 coaches 再加上某個 ID，"
        },
        {
          "id": 11,
          "start": 39.21,
          "end": 44.21,
          "en": "So a dynamic parameter route where I load the coach details.",
          "zh": "也就是一條動態參數路由，用來載入教練詳細資料。"
        },
        {
          "id": 12,
          "start": 46.76,
          "end": 49.48,
          "en": "So where we can view the details about a coach.",
          "zh": "讓我們可以查看某位教練的詳細資料。"
        },
        {
          "id": 13,
          "start": 49.48,
          "end": 53.023,
          "en": "And also some register route,",
          "zh": "還有某條 register 路由，"
        },
        {
          "id": 14,
          "start": 55.24,
          "end": 57.92,
          "en": "where we can register as a coach.",
          "zh": "讓我們可以註冊成為教練。"
        },
        {
          "id": 15,
          "start": 57.92,
          "end": 62.597,
          "en": "So where we load some coach registration component.",
          "zh": "也就是載入某個教練註冊元件。"
        },
        {
          "id": 16,
          "start": 65.66,
          "end": 68.5,
          "en": "And yes, I have a beautiful handwriting.",
          "zh": "是的，我的字很漂亮。"
        },
        {
          "id": 17,
          "start": 68.5,
          "end": 72.07,
          "en": "So these are the coach related routes, which I wanna have.",
          "zh": "這些就是我想擁有的與教練相關的路由。"
        },
        {
          "id": 18,
          "start": 72.07,
          "end": 76.37,
          "en": "Now four requests, I want to have a contact route",
          "zh": "至於 requests，我想要有一條 contact 路由，"
        },
        {
          "id": 19,
          "start": 76.37,
          "end": 80.143,
          "en": "where I open the forum where we can send a coach a message,",
          "zh": "開啟一個表單，讓我們可以傳訊息給教練，"
        },
        {
          "id": 20,
          "start": 81.71000000000001,
          "end": 86.71000000000001,
          "en": "that could be the contact coach component.",
          "zh": "那可以是 contact coach 元件。"
        },
        {
          "id": 21,
          "start": 86.81,
          "end": 90.4,
          "en": "And I want to have a requests route",
          "zh": "我還想要有一條 requests 路由，"
        },
        {
          "id": 22,
          "start": 90.4,
          "end": 93.28999999999999,
          "en": "where we view all incoming requests.",
          "zh": "用來查看所有收到的請求。"
        },
        {
          "id": 23,
          "start": 93.28999999999999,
          "end": 98.113,
          "en": "So that could be the requests received route.",
          "zh": "那可以是 requests received 這條路由。"
        },
        {
          "id": 24,
          "start": 101.24000000000001,
          "end": 103.78,
          "en": "So we've got five main pages in this application.",
          "zh": "所以這個應用程式裡我們有五個主要頁面。"
        },
        {
          "id": 25,
          "start": 103.78,
          "end": 107.08,
          "en": "Coaches list, coach details, coach registration,",
          "zh": "Coaches 清單、教練詳細資料、教練註冊、"
        },
        {
          "id": 26,
          "start": 107.08,
          "end": 109.72,
          "en": "contact coach, and requests received.",
          "zh": "聯絡教練，以及收到的請求。"
        },
        {
          "id": 27,
          "start": 109.72,
          "end": 114.47,
          "en": "And of course, every page here will be a component, right?",
          "zh": "當然，這裡每一個頁面都會是一個元件，對吧？"
        },
        {
          "id": 28,
          "start": 114.47,
          "end": 117.67,
          "en": "Because you load components with the view router.",
          "zh": "因為你是用 Vue Router 載入元件的。"
        },
        {
          "id": 29,
          "start": 117.67,
          "end": 119.5,
          "en": "Now that's it for the routes.",
          "zh": "路由的部分就是這樣。"
        },
        {
          "id": 30,
          "start": 119.5,
          "end": 122.06,
          "en": "Now what about the rest of the page?",
          "zh": "那頁面的其餘部分呢？"
        },
        {
          "id": 31,
          "start": 122.06,
          "end": 125.28,
          "en": "Well, obviously if we would draw the page,",
          "zh": "很明顯，如果我們把頁面畫出來，"
        },
        {
          "id": 32,
          "start": 125.28,
          "end": 128.02,
          "en": "I want to have some header at the top",
          "zh": "我想要在頂端有一個 header，"
        },
        {
          "id": 33,
          "start": 128.02,
          "end": 132.01,
          "en": "where we have links to the coaches list",
          "zh": "裡面有連到教練清單的連結，"
        },
        {
          "id": 34,
          "start": 132.01,
          "end": 135.23,
          "en": "and links to the requests",
          "zh": "以及連到 requests 的連結，"
        },
        {
          "id": 35,
          "start": 135.23,
          "end": 139.09,
          "en": "so that we can go to these areas of our app",
          "zh": "這樣我們就能透過 header 裡的連結"
        },
        {
          "id": 36,
          "start": 139.09,
          "end": 141.12,
          "en": "through links in the header.",
          "zh": "前往應用程式的這些區域。"
        },
        {
          "id": 37,
          "start": 141.12,
          "end": 144.013,
          "en": "Now, if we click coaches, if we select this,",
          "zh": "如果我們點擊 coaches，如果我們選擇這個，"
        },
        {
          "id": 38,
          "start": 145.69,
          "end": 150.61,
          "en": "then on this coaches list page,",
          "zh": "那麼在這個教練清單頁面上，"
        },
        {
          "id": 39,
          "start": 150.61,
          "end": 154.47,
          "en": "I in the end simply want to have a little list here",
          "zh": "我最後只想要在這裡有一個小小的清單，"
        },
        {
          "id": 40,
          "start": 154.47,
          "end": 156.1,
          "en": "with the header of course.",
          "zh": "當然還有 header。"
        },
        {
          "id": 41,
          "start": 156.1,
          "end": 159.45,
          "en": "Here, let's say with a filter",
          "zh": "這裡，比如說加上一個篩選器，"
        },
        {
          "id": 42,
          "start": 159.45,
          "end": 161.66,
          "en": "where we can actually filter by,",
          "zh": "讓我們可以實際依照"
        },
        {
          "id": 43,
          "start": 161.66,
          "end": 163.94,
          "en": "let's say area of expertise.",
          "zh": "比如說專業領域來篩選。"
        },
        {
          "id": 44,
          "start": 163.94,
          "end": 165.88,
          "en": "I forgot this when I defined the data,",
          "zh": "我在定義資料時忘了這個，"
        },
        {
          "id": 45,
          "start": 165.88,
          "end": 167.26,
          "en": "I just came up with it.",
          "zh": "我現在才想到。"
        },
        {
          "id": 46,
          "start": 167.26,
          "end": 170.8,
          "en": "But why don't we also add an area of expertise",
          "zh": "那我們何不也為教練加上一個專業領域"
        },
        {
          "id": 47,
          "start": 170.8,
          "end": 171.84,
          "en": "to our coaches?",
          "zh": "呢？"
        },
        {
          "id": 48,
          "start": 171.84,
          "end": 173.15,
          "en": "See, that's how I plan.",
          "zh": "你看，我就是這樣規劃的。"
        },
        {
          "id": 49,
          "start": 173.15,
          "end": 175.72,
          "en": "I start planning and then plans can change.",
          "zh": "我開始規劃，然後計畫就可能改變。"
        },
        {
          "id": 50,
          "start": 175.72,
          "end": 178.32,
          "en": "But let's say we also want to be able to filter",
          "zh": "但比如說，我們也希望能夠"
        },
        {
          "id": 51,
          "start": 178.32,
          "end": 180.08,
          "en": "by area of expertise",
          "zh": "依照專業領域來篩選，"
        },
        {
          "id": 52,
          "start": 180.08,
          "end": 182.78,
          "en": "and coaches should have areas of expertise.",
          "zh": "而教練應該要有專業領域。"
        },
        {
          "id": 53,
          "start": 182.78,
          "end": 185.01,
          "en": "Well, therefore here we have a filter.",
          "zh": "因此這裡我們有一個篩選器。"
        },
        {
          "id": 54,
          "start": 185.01,
          "end": 187.27,
          "en": "And below that we then have our list",
          "zh": "在它下面我們就有我們的清單，"
        },
        {
          "id": 55,
          "start": 187.27,
          "end": 190.323,
          "en": "where we see the different coach items.",
          "zh": "可以看到不同的教練項目。"
        },
        {
          "id": 56,
          "start": 191.27,
          "end": 193.07,
          "en": "Now we can click a coach item",
          "zh": "我們可以點擊某個教練項目，"
        },
        {
          "id": 57,
          "start": 193.07,
          "end": 195.37,
          "en": "and we're taken to the coach detail page",
          "zh": "就會被帶到教練詳細資料頁面，"
        },
        {
          "id": 58,
          "start": 195.37,
          "end": 199.2,
          "en": "where we see the name, the rate, the description",
          "zh": "在那裡我們會看到名字、費率和說明，"
        },
        {
          "id": 59,
          "start": 199.2,
          "end": 202.823,
          "en": "and where we got a contact button.",
          "zh": "還有一個 contact 按鈕。"
        },
        {
          "id": 60,
          "start": 204.12,
          "end": 206.46,
          "en": "And if we click the contact button,",
          "zh": "如果我們點擊 contact 按鈕，"
        },
        {
          "id": 61,
          "start": 206.46,
          "end": 209.45,
          "en": "we're taken to a number page with a header",
          "zh": "就會被帶到另一個頁面，有 header，"
        },
        {
          "id": 62,
          "start": 209.45,
          "end": 213.72,
          "en": "and with a forum where we can set our email",
          "zh": "以及一個表單，讓我們可以填寫 email，"
        },
        {
          "id": 63,
          "start": 213.72,
          "end": 216.4,
          "en": "and send a message to the coach.",
          "zh": "並傳送訊息給教練。"
        },
        {
          "id": 64,
          "start": 216.4,
          "end": 219.18,
          "en": "And this then leads to the requests of course,",
          "zh": "而這當然接著就會導向 requests，"
        },
        {
          "id": 65,
          "start": 219.18,
          "end": 221.21,
          "en": "once we sent this.",
          "zh": "一旦我們送出這個請求。"
        },
        {
          "id": 66,
          "start": 221.21,
          "end": 224.48,
          "en": "So the request is sent to the coach and can be viewed",
          "zh": "所以請求會被傳送給教練，並且可以"
        },
        {
          "id": 67,
          "start": 224.48,
          "end": 226.43,
          "en": "on the requests area of this app.",
          "zh": "在這個應用程式的 requests 區域查看。"
        },
        {
          "id": 68,
          "start": 226.43,
          "end": 229.993,
          "en": "So to say, and therefore, if requests is clicked,",
          "zh": "可以這麼說。因此，如果點擊 requests，"
        },
        {
          "id": 69,
          "start": 232.07,
          "end": 234.81,
          "en": "I want to load a different page",
          "zh": "我想要載入一個不同的頁面，"
        },
        {
          "id": 70,
          "start": 234.81,
          "end": 237.16,
          "en": "where we also have that header, of course.",
          "zh": "那裡當然也有那個 header。"
        },
        {
          "id": 71,
          "start": 237.16,
          "end": 241.03,
          "en": "But here, I simply want to render a list of requests",
          "zh": "但在這裡，我只想要渲染一份 requests 清單，"
        },
        {
          "id": 72,
          "start": 241.03,
          "end": 246.03,
          "en": "where we see the email and then the message sent.",
          "zh": "讓我們看到 email 以及傳送的訊息。"
        },
        {
          "id": 73,
          "start": 246.19,
          "end": 247.74,
          "en": "So email and message.",
          "zh": "也就是 email 和 message。"
        },
        {
          "id": 74,
          "start": 247.74,
          "end": 249.813,
          "en": "And then we can use that email to reply.",
          "zh": "然後我們可以用那個 email 來回覆。"
        },
        {
          "id": 75,
          "start": 250.93,
          "end": 254.88,
          "en": "This is roughly how those pages should look like.",
          "zh": "這些頁面大概就是長這樣。"
        },
        {
          "id": 76,
          "start": 254.88,
          "end": 256.86,
          "en": "And I hope it's clear what I mean here.",
          "zh": "我希望大家清楚我在這裡的意思。"
        },
        {
          "id": 77,
          "start": 256.86,
          "end": 258.5,
          "en": "Obviously we're going to build this",
          "zh": "很明顯，我們會一起"
        },
        {
          "id": 78,
          "start": 258.5,
          "end": 260,
          "en": "from the ground up together.",
          "zh": "從零開始建立這些。"
        },
        {
          "id": 79,
          "start": 260,
          "end": 262.22,
          "en": "So at least then it will be clear.",
          "zh": "所以至少到那時候就會清楚了。"
        },
        {
          "id": 80,
          "start": 262.22,
          "end": 263.28,
          "en": "And in these pages,",
          "zh": "而在這些頁面中，"
        },
        {
          "id": 81,
          "start": 263.28,
          "end": 265.55,
          "en": "we're going to use a bunch of components.",
          "zh": "我們會用到一堆元件。"
        },
        {
          "id": 82,
          "start": 265.55,
          "end": 267.9,
          "en": "We could plan all those components right now,",
          "zh": "我們可以現在就規劃所有那些元件，"
        },
        {
          "id": 83,
          "start": 267.9,
          "end": 271.19,
          "en": "but I rather get started and then we build those components",
          "zh": "但我寧願先開始，然後在我們"
        },
        {
          "id": 84,
          "start": 271.19,
          "end": 273.85,
          "en": "whilst we start building pages.",
          "zh": "開始建立頁面的同時建立那些元件。"
        },
        {
          "id": 85,
          "start": 273.85,
          "end": 278.25,
          "en": "For example, we will most likely use some separate component",
          "zh": "例如，我們很可能會使用某個獨立的元件"
        },
        {
          "id": 86,
          "start": 278.25,
          "end": 280.11,
          "en": "for the coach items here.",
