          "zh": "最後你會有一個正規表達式，"
        },
        {
          "id": 94,
          "start": 281.59000000000003,
          "end": 284.85,
          "en": "just saying that no matter what was entered here,",
          "zh": "只是要說明無論這裡輸入了什麼，"
        },
        {
          "id": 95,
          "start": 284.85,
          "end": 287.103,
          "en": "you wanna handle it with this route.",
          "zh": "你都想用這條路由來處理。"
        },
        {
          "id": 96,
          "start": 288.07,
          "end": 289.84000000000003,
          "en": "And actually now that I think about it",
          "zh": "而其實現在想想，"
        },
        {
          "id": 97,
          "start": 289.84000000000003,
          "end": 291.93,
          "en": "there's one more route which we'll need",
          "zh": "我們還會需要一條路由，"
        },
        {
          "id": 98,
          "start": 291.93,
          "end": 294.67,
          "en": "since we have no slash route here,",
          "zh": "因為我們這裡沒有 / 路由，"
        },
        {
          "id": 99,
          "start": 294.67,
          "end": 297.62,
          "en": "we just have slash coaches slash register",
          "zh": "我們只有 /coaches 和 /register，"
        },
        {
          "id": 100,
          "start": 297.62,
          "end": 298.82,
          "en": "we're not doing anything",
          "zh": "我們什麼都不會做，"
        },
        {
          "id": 101,
          "start": 298.82,
          "end": 301.54,
          "en": "if the user reaches just slash nothing,",
          "zh": "如果使用者只到達 /，後面什麼都沒有，"
        },
        {
          "id": 102,
          "start": 301.54,
          "end": 303.07,
          "en": "which will be the case though,",
          "zh": "不過這會是實際情況，"
        },
        {
          "id": 103,
          "start": 303.07,
          "end": 306.15,
          "en": "if just our domain is entered and therefore",
          "zh": "如果只輸入了我們的網域，因此"
        },
        {
          "id": 104,
          "start": 306.15,
          "end": 310.2,
          "en": "if just our domain slash nothing is entered",
          "zh": "如果只輸入了我們的網域加上 /，後面什麼都沒有，"
        },
        {
          "id": 105,
          "start": 310.2,
          "end": 313.823,
          "en": "I want to redirect to slash coaches here.",
          "zh": "我想在這裡重新導向到 /coaches。"
        },
        {
          "id": 106,
          "start": 315.21,
          "end": 316.49,
          "en": "So that's the route set up",
          "zh": "這就是路由設定，"
        },
        {
          "id": 107,
          "start": 316.49,
          "end": 320.77,
          "en": "I wanna work with for this module for this project,",
          "zh": "是我想在這個模組、這個專案中使用的，"
        },
        {
          "id": 108,
          "start": 320.77,
          "end": 323.613,
          "en": "now we need to build those pages, those components",
          "zh": "現在我們需要建立那些頁面、那些元件，"
        },
        {
          "id": 109,
          "start": 323.613,
          "end": 327.1,
          "en": "that should be loaded for the different routes.",
          "zh": "讓不同的路由載入。"
        },
        {
          "id": 110,
          "start": 327.1,
          "end": 330.48,
          "en": "Now, as for everything else in this module,",
          "zh": "而就像這個模組中其他所有內容一樣，"
        },
        {
          "id": 111,
          "start": 330.48,
          "end": 333.61,
          "en": "definitely also try such things on your own,",
          "zh": "絕對也要自己試試這些東西，"
        },
        {
          "id": 112,
          "start": 333.61,
          "end": 336.48,
          "en": "maybe don't continue with the next video right away",
          "zh": "也許不要馬上繼續看下一支影片，"
        },
        {
          "id": 113,
          "start": 336.48,
          "end": 339.56,
          "en": "instead try building these page components",
          "zh": "而是試著建立這些頁面元件，"
        },
        {
          "id": 114,
          "start": 339.56,
          "end": 343.06,
          "en": "for these different pages and wire them up to the routes.",
          "zh": "給這些不同的頁面，並把它們接到路由上。"
        },
        {
          "id": 115,
          "start": 343.06,
          "end": 345.47,
          "en": "You can try building the entire project",
          "zh": "你也可以試著建立整個專案，"
        },
        {
          "id": 116,
          "start": 345.47,
          "end": 348.01,
          "en": "as a challenge as well, it's up to you,",
          "zh": "當作一個挑戰，這取決於你，"
        },
        {
          "id": 117,
          "start": 348.01,
          "end": 350.67,
          "en": "how much you wanna progress together with me,",
          "zh": "你想跟我一起進行到什麼程度，"
        },
        {
          "id": 118,
          "start": 350.67,
          "end": 352.65999999999997,
          "en": "and how much you wanna try on your own.",
          "zh": "以及你想自己嘗試多少。"
        },
        {
          "id": 119,
          "start": 352.65999999999997,
          "end": 354.31,
          "en": "Starting in the next lecture,",
          "zh": "從下一堂課開始，"
        },
        {
          "id": 120,
          "start": 354.31,
          "end": 356.763,
          "en": "I will add those page components though.",
          "zh": "我就會加入那些頁面元件。"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "21879890",
      "title": "Adding Route Page Components",
      "lectureOrder": 238,
      "videoOrder": 210,
      "sourceHash": "8fdf5788a3de433ba99f0ddeb4e93d3d779232bc6aee58621dc08c9d9118df4a",
      "cues": [
        {
          "id": 1,
          "start": 2.09,
          "end": 4.43,
          "en": "So let's work on the pages.",
          "zh": "那我們來處理頁面。"
        },
        {
          "id": 2,
          "start": 4.43,
          "end": 5.91,
          "en": "Here in the source folder,",
          "zh": "在這裡的 source 資料夾中，"
        },
        {
          "id": 3,
          "start": 5.91,
          "end": 7.96,
          "en": "I'll add a new pages folder,",
          "zh": "我會加上一個新的 pages 資料夾，"
        },
        {
          "id": 4,
          "start": 7.96,
          "end": 9.44,
          "en": "which will hold the components",
          "zh": "它會存放那些"
        },
        {
          "id": 5,
          "start": 9.44,
          "end": 12.17,
          "en": "that are loaded as pages through routing.",
          "zh": "透過路由被載入為頁面的元件。"
        },
        {
          "id": 6,
          "start": 12.17,
          "end": 15.74,
          "en": "It's not a must-do to use a pages folder for that",
          "zh": "為此使用 pages 資料夾並非必須，"
        },
        {
          "id": 7,
          "start": 15.74,
          "end": 18.18,
          "en": "but I like to set those components apart",
          "zh": "但我喜歡把這些元件"
        },
        {
          "id": 8,
          "start": 18.18,
          "end": 19.44,
          "en": "from the other components,",
          "zh": "和其他元件區隔開來，"
        },
        {
          "id": 9,
          "start": 19.44,
          "end": 21.4,
          "en": "which are not loaded as pages.",
          "zh": "也就是那些不是以頁面形式載入的元件。"
        },
        {
          "id": 10,
          "start": 21.4,
          "end": 23.92,
          "en": "That's just personal preference though.",
          "zh": "不過這只是個人偏好。"
        },
        {
          "id": 11,
          "start": 23.92,
          "end": 27.54,
          "en": "And in there, I'll actually add two subfolders.",
          "zh": "在裡面，我其實會加上兩個子資料夾。"
        },
        {
          "id": 12,
          "start": 27.54,
          "end": 31.9,
          "en": "A coaches subfolder and a requests subfolder",
          "zh": "一個 coaches 子資料夾和一個 requests 子資料夾，"
        },
        {
          "id": 13,
          "start": 31.9,
          "end": 35.34,
          "en": "because these are the two main features we have in this app",
          "zh": "因為這是這個應用程式的兩個主要功能，"
        },
        {
          "id": 14,
          "start": 35.34,
          "end": 38.393,
          "en": "and will have different pages for these different features.",
          "zh": "而這些不同功能會有不同的頁面。"
        },
        {
          "id": 15,
          "start": 39.56,
          "end": 41.69,
          "en": "And in the pages folder itself,",
          "zh": "而在 pages 資料夾本身，"
        },
        {
          "id": 16,
          "start": 41.69,
          "end": 46.04,
          "en": "I'll also add a file, the NotFound.vue component,",
          "zh": "我也會加上一個檔案，NotFound.vue 元件，"
        },
        {
          "id": 17,
          "start": 46.04,
          "end": 48.49,
          "en": "which will be our Not Found page.",
          "zh": "它會是我們的 Not Found 頁面。"
        },
        {
          "id": 18,
          "start": 48.49,
          "end": 50.98,
          "en": "In the coaches subfolder,",
          "zh": "在 coaches 子資料夾中，"
        },
        {
          "id": 19,
          "start": 50.98,
          "end": 53.45,
          "en": "we can then add all the coach pages",
          "zh": "我們就可以加上所有 coach 頁面，"
        },
        {
          "id": 20,
          "start": 53.45,
          "end": 56.106,
          "en": "and that would be the page for all the coaches",
          "zh": "也就是所有 coaches 的頁面、"
        },
        {
          "id": 21,
          "start": 56.106,
          "end": 58.32,
          "en": "for a specific coach",
          "zh": "特定 coach 的頁面，"
        },
        {
          "id": 22,
          "start": 58.32,
          "end": 61.6,
          "en": "and for registering as a coach.",
          "zh": "以及註冊成為 coach 的頁面。"
        },
        {
          "id": 23,
          "start": 61.6,
          "end": 63.16,
          "en": "And for requests,",
          "zh": "至於 requests，"
        },
        {
          "id": 24,
          "start": 63.16,
          "end": 65.82,
          "en": "the pages will be the contact page here",
          "zh": "頁面會是這裡的 contact 頁面"
        },
        {
          "id": 25,
          "start": 65.82,
          "end": 68.97,
          "en": "and the open requests page.",
          "zh": "以及 open requests 頁面。"
        },
        {
          "id": 26,
          "start": 68.97,
          "end": 71.19,
          "en": "So let's start with the coaches pages.",
          "zh": "那我們從 coaches 頁面開始。"
        },
        {
          "id": 27,
          "start": 71.19,
          "end": 76.19,
          "en": "Here, I wanna have a CoachesList.vue component.",
          "zh": "在這裡，我想要一個 CoachesList.vue 元件。"
        },
        {
          "id": 28,
          "start": 76.35,
          "end": 79.2,
          "en": "CoachDetail.vue component.",
          "zh": "一個 CoachDetail.vue 元件。"
        },
        {
          "id": 29,
          "start": 79.2,
          "end": 84.2,
          "en": "And a CoachRegistration.vue component.",
          "zh": "以及一個 CoachRegistration.vue 元件。"
        },
        {
          "id": 30,
          "start": 85.15,
          "end": 89.75,
          "en": "In requests, that would be ContactCoach.vue",
          "zh": "在 requests 中，那會是 ContactCoach.vue"
        },
        {
          "id": 31,
          "start": 89.75,
          "end": 94.12,
          "en": "and RequestsReceieved.vue.",
          "zh": "以及 RequestsReceieved.vue。"
        },
        {
          "id": 32,
          "start": 94.12,
          "end": 96.81,
          "en": "Now, obviously, how you name these files,",
          "zh": "當然，你要怎麼命名這些檔案、"
        },
        {
          "id": 33,
          "start": 96.81,
          "end": 100.5,
          "en": "how you name these components is 100% up to you.",
          "zh": "怎麼命名這些元件，完全由你決定。"
        },
        {
          "id": 34,
          "start": 100.5,
          "end": 103.07,
          "en": "You don't have to use the same naming I do here,",
          "zh": "你不一定要用我在這裡使用的命名，"
        },
        {
          "id": 35,
          "start": 103.07,
          "end": 104.95,
          "en": "it's just my personal preference.",
          "zh": "這只是我的個人偏好。"
        },
        {
          "id": 36,
          "start": 104.95,
          "end": 106.593,
          "en": "Not something you have to use.",
          "zh": "不是非得採用的做法。"
        },
        {
          "id": 37,
          "start": 108.42,
          "end": 110.949,
          "en": "Now, all these components are created.",
          "zh": "現在，這些元件都建立好了。"
        },
        {
          "id": 38,
          "start": 110.949,
          "end": 113.62,
          "en": "Obviously though, they're all empty.",
          "zh": "不過顯然它們全都是空的。"
        },
        {
          "id": 39,
          "start": 113.62,
          "end": 116.52000000000001,
          "en": "Nonetheless, we can wire them up to the router file already",
          "zh": "儘管如此，我們已經可以把它們接到 router 檔案，"
        },
        {
          "id": 40,
          "start": 116.52000000000001,
          "end": 119.45,
          "en": "and then fill them with live step by step.",
          "zh": "然後一步步讓它們有生命力。"
        },
        {
          "id": 41,
          "start": 119.45,
          "end": 121.21,
          "en": "So for that here in router.js,",
          "zh": "為此，在這裡的 router.js 中，"
        },
        {
          "id": 42,
          "start": 121.21,
          "end": 123.97,
          "en": "I'm going to import all those page components,",
          "zh": "我要匯入所有這些頁面元件，"
        },
        {
          "id": 43,
          "start": 123.97,
          "end": 126.2,
          "en": "like the CoachDetail component",
          "zh": "像是 CoachDetail 元件，"
        },
        {
          "id": 44,
          "start": 126.2,
          "end": 131.2,
          "en": "from ./pages/coaches/CoachDetail.vue",
          "zh": "來自 ./pages/coaches/CoachDetail.vue，"
        },
        {
          "id": 45,
          "start": 131.83,
          "end": 135.13,
          "en": "and well, all the other files as well.",
          "zh": "以及其他所有檔案。"
        },
        {
          "id": 46,
          "start": 135.13,
          "end": 140.13,
          "en": "CoachesList from pages/coaches/CoachesList.vue.",
          "zh": "CoachesList 來自 pages/coaches/CoachesList.vue。"
        },
        {
          "id": 47,
          "start": 142.62,
          "end": 144.37,
          "en": "And CoachRegistration",
          "zh": "以及 CoachRegistration，"
        },
        {
          "id": 48,
          "start": 145.507,
          "end": 150.507,
          "en": "from the pages/coaches/CoachRegistration.vue file.",
          "zh": "來自 pages/coaches/CoachRegistration.vue 檔案。"
        },
        {
          "id": 49,
          "start": 152.09,
          "end": 157.09,
          "en": "Import ContactCoach from pages/coaches,",
          "zh": "從 pages/coaches 匯入 ContactCoach，"
        },
        {
          "id": 50,
          "start": 158.371,
          "end": 162.267,
          "en": "not coaches, sorry, requests/ContactCoach.vue.",
          "zh": "不是 coaches，抱歉，是 requests/ContactCoach.vue。"
        },
        {
          "id": 51,
          "start": 163.78,
          "end": 166.507,
          "en": "And import RequestsReceived",
          "zh": "並匯入 RequestsReceived，"
        },
        {
          "id": 52,
          "start": 170.003,
          "end": 175.003,
          "en": "from ./pages/requests/RequestsReceived.vue.",
          "zh": "來自 ./pages/requests/RequestsReceived.vue。"
        },
        {
          "id": 53,
          "start": 175.54,
          "end": 177.9,
          "en": "And last but not least, import NotFound",
          "zh": "最後同樣重要的是，匯入 NotFound，"
        },
        {
          "id": 54,
          "start": 179.61,
          "end": 183.883,
          "en": "from pages/NotFound.vue.",
          "zh": "來自 pages/NotFound.vue。"
        },
        {
          "id": 55,
          "start": 184.89,
          "end": 186.75,
          "en": "Okay, these are all the components.",
          "zh": "好，這些就是所有元件。"
        },
        {
          "id": 56,
          "start": 186.75,
          "end": 188.79,
          "en": "So now we can wire them up to the routes.",
          "zh": "現在我們可以把它們接到路由上。"
        },
        {
          "id": 57,
          "start": 188.79,
          "end": 190.53,
          "en": "For the /coaches route,",
          "zh": "對於 /coaches 路由，"
        },
        {
          "id": 58,
          "start": 190.53,
          "end": 193.84,
          "en": "we wanna load the CoachesList component.",
          "zh": "我們想要載入 CoachesList 元件。"
        },
        {
          "id": 59,
          "start": 193.84,
          "end": 197.85,
          "en": "For coaches/:id, that would be the CoachDetail component.",
          "zh": "對於 coaches/:id，那會是 CoachDetail 元件。"
        },
        {
          "id": 60,
          "start": 197.85,
          "end": 199.54,
          "en": "For contacting a coach,",
          "zh": "聯絡 coach 的部分，"
        },
        {
          "id": 61,
          "start": 199.54,
          "end": 202.233,
          "en": "that would be the ContactCoach component.",
          "zh": "那會是 ContactCoach 元件。"
        },
        {
          "id": 62,
          "start": 202.233,
          "end": 203.93,
          "en": "For registering, that would be",
          "zh": "至於註冊，那會是"
        },
        {
          "id": 63,
          "start": 203.93,
          "end": 207.014,
          "en": "the CoachRegistration component.",
          "zh": "CoachRegistration 元件。"
        },
        {
          "id": 64,
          "start": 207.014,
          "end": 210.59,
          "en": "For requests, so for the requests we received,",
          "zh": "至於 requests，也就是我們收到的 requests，"
        },
        {
          "id": 65,
          "start": 210.59,
          "end": 212.96,
          "en": "that would be the RequestsReceived component.",
          "zh": "那會是 RequestsReceived 元件。"
        },
        {
          "id": 66,
          "start": 212.96,
          "end": 215.23,
          "en": "And here it's the NotFound component.",
          "zh": "而這裡則是 NotFound 元件。"
        },
        {
          "id": 67,
          "start": 215.23,
          "end": 218.18,
          "en": "So now with that, we registered all components.",
          "zh": "這樣一來，我們就註冊了所有元件。"
        },
        {
          "id": 68,
          "start": 218.18,
          "end": 220.17000000000002,
          "en": "Now we can fill them with life.",
          "zh": "現在我們可以讓它們有生命力。"
        },
        {
          "id": 69,
          "start": 220.17000000000002,
          "end": 221.674,
          "en": "Before we do that though,",
          "zh": "不過在我們這麼做之前，"
        },
        {
          "id": 70,
          "start": 221.674,
          "end": 224.35,
          "en": "we need one other important component.",
          "zh": "我們還需要另一個重要元件。"
        },
        {
          "id": 71,
          "start": 224.35,
          "end": 226.96,
          "en": "The app component, the main component",
          "zh": "app 元件，也就是最後"
        },
        {
          "id": 72,
          "start": 226.96,
          "end": 229.793,
          "en": "that holds all the other components in the end.",
          "zh": "存放所有其他元件的主要元件。"
        },
        {
          "id": 73,
          "start": 230.71,
          "end": 232.85,
          "en": "So therefore, next to main.js,",
          "zh": "因此，在 main.js 旁邊，"
        },
        {
          "id": 74,
          "start": 232.85,
          "end": 234.9,
          "en": "I'll add a App.vue file",
          "zh": "我會加上一個 App.vue 檔案，"
        },
        {
          "id": 75,
          "start": 234.9,
          "end": 237.22,
          "en": "and this will be, of course, the main entry point",
          "zh": "這當然會是我們應用程式的"
        },
        {
          "id": 76,
          "start": 237.22,
          "end": 239.49,
          "en": "of our application so to say.",
          "zh": "主要進入點。"
        },
        {
          "id": 77,
          "start": 239.49,
          "end": 242.65,
          "en": "Here, I wanna render my router-view.",
          "zh": "在這裡，我想要渲染我的 router-view。"
        },
        {
          "id": 78,
          "start": 242.65,
          "end": 244.59,
          "en": "So in the template here,",
          "zh": "所以在這裡的 template 中，"
        },
        {
          "id": 79,
          "start": 244.59,
          "end": 246.85,
          "en": "I want to output router-view",
          "zh": "我想輸出 router-view，"
        },
        {
          "id": 80,
          "start": 246.85,
          "end": 248.9,
          "en": "so that we tell the view router",
          "zh": "好讓我們告訴 Vue router"
        },
        {
          "id": 81,
          "start": 248.9,
          "end": 252.87,
          "en": "where to render these different components we registered",
          "zh": "要在哪裡渲染我們註冊的這些不同元件，"
        },
        {
          "id": 82,
          "start": 252.87,
          "end": 257.87,
          "en": "and it's the App file I wanna import here in main.js.",
          "zh": "而我要在 main.js 中匯入的就是這個 App 檔案。"
        },
        {
          "id": 83,
          "start": 257.99,
          "end": 262,
          "en": "So import App from App.vue",
          "zh": "所以是 import App from App.vue，"
        },
        {
          "id": 84,
          "start": 262,
          "end": 265.88,
          "en": "to load the App here as our main App.",
          "zh": "把 App 載入為我們的主要 App。"
        },
        {
          "id": 85,
          "start": 265.88,
          "end": 267.52,
          "en": "In addition, we of course, also need",
          "zh": "此外，我們當然也需要"
        },
        {
          "id": 86,
          "start": 267.52,
          "end": 269.68,
          "en": "to make this app aware of the router,",
          "zh": "讓這個 app 知道 router 的存在，"
        },
        {
          "id": 87,
          "start": 269.68,
          "end": 272.65,
          "en": "so besides importing App.vue here,",
          "zh": "所以除了在這裡匯入 App.vue，"
        },
        {
          "id": 88,
          "start": 272.65,
          "end": 277.65,
          "en": "I'll also import router from ./router.js",
          "zh": "我也會 import router from ./router.js，"
        },
        {
          "id": 89,
          "start": 277.65999999999997,
          "end": 279.74,
          "en": "and store the App here",
          "zh": "並把 App 存放在這裡，"
        },
        {
          "id": 90,
          "start": 281.24,
          "end": 282.36,
          "en": "in a constant",
          "zh": "存放在一個常數中，"
        },
        {
          "id": 91,
          "start": 282.36,
          "end": 285.03,
          "en": "and on that app, we can then use router",
          "zh": "然後在那個 app 上使用 router，"
        },
        {
          "id": 92,
          "start": 285.03,
          "end": 287.54,
          "en": "so that we really use the router in this app.",
          "zh": "讓我們真的在這個 app 中使用 router。"
        },
        {
          "id": 93,
          "start": 287.54,
          "end": 289.57,
          "en": "And now we're done with the routing",
          "zh": "現在我們完成路由的部分了，"
        },
        {
          "id": 94,
          "start": 289.57,
          "end": 291.423,
          "en": "and we're all set to continue.",
          "zh": "準備好可以繼續。"
        },
        {
          "id": 95,
          "start": 292.93,
          "end": 294.74,
          "en": "So with all that out of the way,",
          "zh": "這些都處理完之後，"
        },
        {
          "id": 96,
          "start": 294.74,
          "end": 297.804,
          "en": "now it's time to fill it all with life.",
          "zh": "現在是時候讓它們全都有生命力了。"
        },
        {
          "id": 97,
          "start": 297.804,
          "end": 299.6,
          "en": "And it's totally up to you",
          "zh": "而這完全取決於你，"
        },
        {
          "id": 98,
          "start": 299.6,
          "end": 302.085,
          "en": "what filling this with life means.",
          "zh": "「讓它們有生命力」是什麼意思。"
        },
        {
          "id": 99,
          "start": 302.085,
          "end": 305.43,
          "en": "We'll definitely need a couple of different things here",
          "zh": "我們在這裡絕對會需要幾樣不同的東西，"
        },
        {
          "id": 100,
          "start": 305.43,
          "end": 306.54,
          "en": "but in the end,",
          "zh": "但到最後，"
        },
        {
          "id": 101,
          "start": 306.54,
          "end": 310.32,
          "en": "I would say that when we visit just our domain,",
          "zh": "我會說當我們只造訪我們的網域時，"
        },
        {
          "id": 102,
          "start": 310.32,
          "end": 312.34,
          "en": "we redirect to /coaches,",
          "zh": "我們會被重新導向到 /coaches，"
        },
        {
          "id": 103,
          "start": 312.34,
          "end": 315.36,
          "en": "so that is probably the first page we're going to see",
          "zh": "所以那大概是我們會看到的第一個頁面，"
        },
        {
          "id": 104,
          "start": 315.36,
          "end": 319.57,
          "en": "if we use this page, this application in a normal way.",
          "zh": "如果我們以正常方式使用這個應用程式的話。"
        },
        {
          "id": 105,
          "start": 319.57,
          "end": 322.89,
          "en": "So maybe we should start with CoachesList,",
          "zh": "所以也許我們應該從 CoachesList 開始，"
        },
        {
          "id": 106,
          "start": 322.89,
          "end": 325.633,
          "en": "at least with a very basic first version of it.",
          "zh": "至少先做出一個非常基本的第一版。"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "21879900",
      "title": "Working on the Main Layout & Styling",
      "lectureOrder": 239,
      "videoOrder": 211,
      "sourceHash": "2b010c3b56cb7cf32bd20e565f7080174d15522b25b677d1bf36582906bdba0b",
      "cues": [
        {
          "id": 1,
          "start": 2.11,
          "end": 4.42,
          "en": "So CoachesList.vue it is",
          "zh": "那就從 CoachesList.vue 開始，"
        },
        {
          "id": 2,
          "start": 4.42,
          "end": 6.88,
          "en": "that's the first page I wanna start with.",
          "zh": "這是我想要開始處理的第一個頁面。"
        },
        {
          "id": 3,
          "start": 6.88,
          "end": 11.88,
          "en": "And this will become a quite complex page in the end",
          "zh": "這最後會變成相當複雜的頁面，"
        },
        {
          "id": 4,
          "start": 12.77,
          "end": 14.87,
          "en": "because you might remember that on there",
          "zh": "因為你可能記得在那裡"
        },
        {
          "id": 5,
          "start": 14.87,
          "end": 18.27,
          "en": "I don't just wanted to output a list of coaches,",
          "zh": "我不只是想輸出 coaches 清單，"
        },
        {
          "id": 6,
          "start": 18.27,
          "end": 21.59,
          "en": "I also wanted to add some filtering logic so that",
          "zh": "我還想加入一些篩選邏輯，"
        },
        {
          "id": 7,
          "start": 21.59,
          "end": 25.12,
          "en": "we can filter the list of coaches which is displayed.",
          "zh": "讓我們能篩選顯示出來的 coaches 清單。"
        },
        {
          "id": 8,
          "start": 25.12,
          "end": 28.63,
          "en": "And outputting a list of coaches also means that we need",
          "zh": "而要輸出 coaches 清單也代表我們需要"
        },
        {
          "id": 9,
          "start": 28.63,
          "end": 29.89,
          "en": "coaches to begin with",
          "zh": "先有 coaches 才行，"
        },
        {
          "id": 10,
          "start": 29.89,
          "end": 32.653,
          "en": "and at the moment we're not managing any data at all.",
          "zh": "而目前我們完全沒有管理任何資料。"
        },
        {
          "id": 11,
          "start": 33.54,
          "end": 37.09,
          "en": "But we can get started with the base template at least.",
          "zh": "但我們至少可以先從基本 template 開始。"
        },
        {
          "id": 12,
          "start": 37.09,
          "end": 41.04,
          "en": "And here to get started with this base template,",
          "zh": "而在這裡，為了從這個基本 template 起步，"
        },
        {
          "id": 13,
          "start": 41.04,
          "end": 44.53,
          "en": "I of course add a template here to CoachesList.vue,",
          "zh": "我當然會在 CoachesList.vue 加上一個 template，"
        },
        {
          "id": 14,
          "start": 44.53,
          "end": 46.263,
          "en": "but now in there, what do we need?",
          "zh": "但在裡面我們需要什麼？"
        },
        {
          "id": 15,
          "start": 47.12,
          "end": 50.82,
          "en": "We will have a section or a div, whatever you want,",
          "zh": "我們會有個 section 或 div，看你想要哪個，"
        },
        {
          "id": 16,
          "start": 50.82,
          "end": 53.68,
          "en": "where we later we'll have to filter.",
          "zh": "之後我們要在那裡做篩選。"
        },
        {
          "id": 17,
          "start": 53.68,
          "end": 56.563,
          "en": "And below that we'll have another part of this page,",
          "zh": "在下面我們會有這個頁面的另一部分，"
        },
        {
          "id": 18,
          "start": 56.563,
          "end": 58.93,
          "en": "another section, another div,",
          "zh": "另一個 section、另一個 div，"
        },
        {
          "id": 19,
          "start": 58.93,
          "end": 62.31,
          "en": "where we will have our list of coaches.",
          "zh": "我們會在那裡放 coaches 清單。"
        },
        {
          "id": 20,
          "start": 62.31,
          "end": 65.18,
          "en": "These will be the two main areas.",
          "zh": "這會是兩個主要區域。"
        },
        {
          "id": 21,
          "start": 65.18,
          "end": 70.18,
          "en": "Now I will create two separate sub components for that",
          "zh": "我會為此建立兩個獨立的子元件，"
        },
        {
          "id": 22,
          "start": 70.21000000000001,
          "end": 74.743,
          "en": "so that our coaches list components stays relatively lean.",
          "zh": "讓我們 coaches 清單元件保持相對精簡。"
        },
        {
          "id": 23,
          "start": 75.62,
          "end": 79.26,
          "en": "But at least we now got a basic template, a dummy template,",
          "zh": "但至少我們現在有了基本 template，一個假 template，"
        },
        {
          "id": 24,
          "start": 79.26,
          "end": 81.82,
          "en": "which should allow us to see something on the screen",
          "zh": "讓我們在造訪這個頁面時，"
        },
        {
          "id": 25,
          "start": 81.82,
          "end": 83.97,
          "en": "when this page is visited.",
          "zh": "可以在畫面上看到一些東西。"
        },
        {
          "id": 26,
          "start": 83.97,
          "end": 87.67,
          "en": "So if you run our development server with npm run serve,",
          "zh": "所以如果你用 npm run serve 執行開發伺服器，"
        },
        {
          "id": 27,
          "start": 87.67,
          "end": 90.98,
          "en": "let's see if we can at least see this on the screen",
          "zh": "我們來看看能不能至少在畫面上看到這個，"
        },
        {
          "id": 28,
          "start": 90.98,
          "end": 93.37299999999999,
          "en": "when we visit our application.",
          "zh": "當我們造訪我們的應用程式時。"
        },
        {
          "id": 29,
          "start": 94.75999999999999,
          "end": 98.12,
          "en": "And indeed, if I load this page, I'm redirected to /coaches",
          "zh": "確實，如果我載入這個頁面，會被重新導向到 /coaches，"
        },
        {
          "id": 30,
          "start": 98.12,
          "end": 101.22999999999999,
          "en": "and I see filter and list of coaches.",
          "zh": "而我看到 filter 和 list of coaches。"
        },
        {
          "id": 31,
          "start": 101.22999999999999,
          "end": 103.4,
          "en": "Now the styling obviously is off,",
          "zh": "現在樣式顯然還不對，"
        },
        {
          "id": 32,
          "start": 103.4,
          "end": 105.07,
          "en": "I mean the entire content is missing",
          "zh": "我是說整個內容都還沒出現，"
        },
        {
          "id": 33,
          "start": 105.07,
          "end": 107.21000000000001,
          "en": "but I can already tell that this is also",
          "zh": "但我已經可以說這也"
        },
        {
          "id": 34,
          "start": 107.21000000000001,
          "end": 108.78,
          "en": "not the font I wanna use.",
          "zh": "不是我想要使用的字型。"
        },
        {
          "id": 35,
          "start": 108.78,
          "end": 111.06,
          "en": "So I wanna set up some global styling,",
          "zh": "所以我想設定一些全域樣式，"
        },
        {
          "id": 36,
          "start": 111.06,
          "end": 113.75999999999999,
          "en": "some base styling in App vue,",
          "zh": "在 App vue 中設定一些基本樣式，"
        },
        {
          "id": 37,
          "start": 113.75999999999999,
          "end": 116.53,
          "en": "which will apply to the entire app.",
          "zh": "套用到整個應用程式。"
        },
        {
          "id": 38,
          "start": 116.53,
          "end": 119.78,
          "en": "And this is therefore not scoped styling but just a style",
          "zh": "因此這不是 scoped 樣式，而只是一般的 style，"
        },
        {
          "id": 39,
          "start": 119.78,
          "end": 122.34,
          "en": "so that it is applied globally.",
          "zh": "讓它全域套用。"
        },
        {
          "id": 40,
          "start": 122.34,
          "end": 124.92,
          "en": "And I prepared to the styling for you",
          "zh": "我已經幫你準備好這些樣式，"
        },
        {
          "id": 41,
          "start": 124.92,
          "end": 128.01,
          "en": "because I don't wanna write the styles together with you",
          "zh": "因為我不想跟你一起寫這些樣式，"
        },
        {
          "id": 42,
          "start": 128.01,
          "end": 130.07,
          "en": "as this is not a CSS course",
          "zh": "這不是一門 CSS 課程，"
        },
        {
          "id": 43,
          "start": 130.07,
          "end": 131.76,
          "en": "and I know from other courses",
          "zh": "而且我從其他課程知道，"
        },
        {
          "id": 44,
          "start": 131.76,
          "end": 134.97,
          "en": "that it's boring to some people if you write too much CSS",
          "zh": "如果寫太多 CSS，對有些人來說很無聊，"
        },
        {
          "id": 45,
          "start": 134.97,
          "end": 137.82999999999998,
          "en": "hence I'll provide all the CSS code for you.",
          "zh": "因此我會把所有 CSS 程式碼提供給你。"
        },
        {
          "id": 46,
          "start": 137.82999999999998,
          "end": 140.45,
          "en": "Of course, you can also tweak it to your own needs.",
          "zh": "當然，你也可以依自己的需求調整它。"
        },
        {
          "id": 47,
          "start": 140.45,
          "end": 143.03,
          "en": "You can adjust it to look the way you want it to look,",
          "zh": "你可以把它調整成你想要的樣子，"
        },
        {
          "id": 48,
          "start": 143.03,
          "end": 144.61,
          "en": "whatever you want.",
          "zh": "隨便你想怎樣。"
        },
        {
          "id": 49,
          "start": 144.61,
          "end": 148.32,
          "en": "So attached, you find this app CSS file",
          "zh": "所以在附件中，你可以找到這個 app CSS 檔案，"
        },
        {
          "id": 50,
          "start": 148.32,
          "end": 151.32999999999998,
          "en": "and in there you find the styles which you should copy",
          "zh": "裡面有這些樣式，你應該把它們複製"
        },
        {
          "id": 51,
          "start": 151.32999999999998,
          "end": 154.98,
          "en": "into these style text of your App vue file.",
          "zh": "到你 App vue 檔案的 style 標籤裡。"
        },
        {
          "id": 52,
          "start": 154.98,
          "end": 158.56,
          "en": "An import to Google fonts, where I load a font",
          "zh": "一個匯入 Google fonts 的動作，我在那裡載入字型，"
        },
        {
          "id": 53,
          "start": 158.56,
          "end": 161.38,
          "en": "and then well, I set up some basic stylings,",
          "zh": "然後我設定了一些基本樣式，"
        },
        {
          "id": 54,
          "start": 161.38,
          "end": 165.06,
          "en": "set up that base font, remove the margin on the body",
          "zh": "設定那個基本字型、移除 body 的 margin，"
        },
        {
          "id": 55,
          "start": 165.06,
          "end": 169.14,
          "en": "and with this applied, we now have this font in effect.",
          "zh": "套用這些之後，我們現在就有這個字型效果。"
        },
        {
          "id": 56,
          "start": 169.14,
          "end": 172.82999999999998,
          "en": "So now that works, that looks well,",
          "zh": "現在這樣可以了，看起來不錯，"
        },
        {
          "id": 57,
          "start": 172.82999999999998,
          "end": 174.14,
          "en": "not the way I want it to look",
          "zh": "雖然不是我想要的樣子，"
        },
        {
          "id": 58,
          "start": 174.14,
          "end": 176.97,
          "en": "but it has the space styling at least.",
          "zh": "但至少有了間距樣式。"
        },
        {
          "id": 59,
          "start": 176.97,
          "end": 179.28,
          "en": "Now, how should we continue though?",
          "zh": "那麼我們接下來該怎麼做？"
        },
        {
          "id": 60,
          "start": 179.28,
          "end": 182.29,
          "en": "I mean, this page is pretty much worthless",
          "zh": "我是說，這個頁面幾乎沒什麼用，"
        },
        {
          "id": 61,
          "start": 182.29,
          "end": 185.25,
          "en": "if we don't have any coaches that could be output here.",
          "zh": "如果我們沒有任何 coaches 可以輸出在這裡。"
        },
        {
          "id": 62,
          "start": 185.25,
          "end": 188.96,
          "en": "So therefore I see two possible routes we can take.",
          "zh": "所以我看我們有兩條可能的路可以走。"
        },
        {
          "id": 63,
          "start": 188.96,
          "end": 191.85,
          "en": "We can either now start adding the Vuex",
          "zh": "我們可以現在開始加入 Vuex"
        },
        {
          "id": 64,
          "start": 191.85,
          "end": 194.07,
          "en": "and start adding data,",
          "zh": "並開始加入資料，"
        },
        {
          "id": 65,
          "start": 194.07,
          "end": 198.35,
          "en": "or we first of all finish up the entire base layout",
          "zh": "或者我們先完成整個基本版面和導覽，"
        },
        {
          "id": 66,
          "start": 198.35,
          "end": 202.1,
          "en": "and navigation, we add a header to this application",
          "zh": "為這個應用程式加上一個 header，"
        },
        {
          "id": 67,
          "start": 202.1,
          "end": 204.28,
          "en": "so that we can reach all pages",
          "zh": "讓我們能到達所有頁面，"
        },
        {
          "id": 68,
          "start": 204.28,
          "end": 207.01,
          "en": "and we have some dummy code on all pages",
          "zh": "並在所有頁面都有一些假內容，"
        },
        {
          "id": 69,
          "start": 207.01,
          "end": 211.38,
          "en": "and we then add to data and I'll go with that second route.",
          "zh": "之後再加入資料，而我會選擇第二條路。"
        },
        {
          "id": 70,
          "start": 211.38,
          "end": 214.67000000000002,
          "en": "I'll first of all wire up the navigation and the base layout",
          "zh": "我會先把導覽和基本版面接好，"
        },
        {
          "id": 71,
          "start": 214.67000000000002,
          "end": 216.823,
          "en": "before I then come back to the data.",
          "zh": "之後再回來處理資料。"
        },
        {
          "id": 72,
          "start": 218.55,
          "end": 223.067,
          "en": "So to add some basic layout and some basic navigation,",
          "zh": "所以為了加入基本版面和基本導覽，"
        },
        {
          "id": 73,
          "start": 223.067,
          "end": 225.39,
          "en": "I will go to the source folder",
          "zh": "我會前往 source 資料夾，"
        },
        {
          "id": 74,
          "start": 225.39,
          "end": 228.448,
          "en": "and add a components folder next to pages.",
          "zh": "並在 pages 旁邊加上一個 components 資料夾。"
        },
        {
          "id": 75,
          "start": 228.448,
          "end": 233.448,
          "en": "And in there, I'll add let's say a layout folder",
          "zh": "在裡面，我會加上一個 layout 資料夾，比如說，"
        },
        {
          "id": 76,
          "start": 233.71,
          "end": 238.71,
          "en": "and in that layout folder, we can add TheHeader.Vue file,",
          "zh": "在那個 layout 資料夾中，我們可以加上 TheHeader.Vue 檔案，"
        },
        {
          "id": 77,
          "start": 239.15,
          "end": 241.3,
          "en": "which should hold the base header",
          "zh": "它應該存放基本的 header，"
        },
        {
          "id": 78,
          "start": 241.3,
          "end": 244.63,
          "en": "with the navigation we want in this application.",
          "zh": "以及我們想在這個應用程式中使用的導覽。"
        },
        {
          "id": 79,
          "start": 244.63,
          "end": 249.63,
          "en": "This, TheHeader component will be used in the App vue file",
          "zh": "這個 TheHeader 元件會在 App vue 檔案中使用，"
        },
        {
          "id": 80,
          "start": 249.69,
          "end": 251.253,
          "en": "above the router view.",
          "zh": "放在 router view 上方。"
        },
        {
          "id": 81,
          "start": 252.42,
          "end": 256.52,
          "en": "So here we can add a script already in App vue",
          "zh": "所以在這裡我們已經可以在 App vue 中加上 script，"
        },
        {
          "id": 82,
          "start": 256.52,
          "end": 261.52,
          "en": "and import TheHeader from components/layoutTheHeader.Vue",
          "zh": "並從 components/layout/TheHeader.Vue 匯入 TheHeader，"
        },
        {
          "id": 83,
          "start": 262.93,
          "end": 267.02,
          "en": "and register this as a local component here in App vue.",
          "zh": "然後在 App vue 中把它註冊為區域元件。"
        },
        {
          "id": 84,
          "start": 267.02,
          "end": 270.52,
          "en": "A local component because we only use it here.",
          "zh": "會用區域元件是因為我們只在這裡用到它。"
        },
        {
          "id": 85,
          "start": 270.52,
          "end": 275.52,
          "en": "And then here we can render TheHeader above the router view.",
          "zh": "然後我們就可以在這裡把 TheHeader 渲染在 router view 上方。"
        },
        {
          "id": 86,
          "start": 278.37,
          "end": 280.69,
          "en": "Now here, back in TheHeader.vue,",
          "zh": "現在回到 TheHeader.vue，"
        },
        {
          "id": 87,
          "start": 280.69,
          "end": 284.17,
          "en": "the question is what do we want in here in the template?",
          "zh": "問題是我們想在這裡的 template 中放什麼？"
        },
        {
          "id": 88,
          "start": 284.17,
          "end": 287.03,
          "en": "Well, I want TheHeader HTML element,",
          "zh": "我想要一個 header HTML 元素，"
        },
        {
          "id": 89,
          "start": 287.03,
          "end": 291.35,
          "en": "which should hold my navigation",
          "zh": "它應該存放我的導覽，"
        },
        {
          "id": 90,
          "start": 291.35,
          "end": 295.56,
          "en": "and as part of the navigation, I'll have the main title",
          "zh": "而作為導覽的一部分，我會放這個頁面的主標題，"
        },
        {
          "id": 91,
          "start": 295.56,
          "end": 300.56,
          "en": "of this page so to say, where I wanna say something like",
          "zh": "可以說就是這樣，我想寫像是"
        },
        {
          "id": 92,
          "start": 300.82,
          "end": 302.163,
          "en": "Find a Coach.",
          "zh": "Find a Coach。"
        },
        {
          "id": 93,
          "start": 303.44,
          "end": 307.21,
          "en": "And next to that, also an unordered list",
          "zh": "除此之外，還有一個無序清單，"
        },
        {
          "id": 94,
          "start": 307.21,
          "end": 310.68,
          "en": "where we have our different navigation items",
          "zh": "裡面放我們不同的導覽項目，"
        },
        {
          "id": 95,
          "start": 310.68,
          "end": 313.69,
          "en": "and that of course should be a router links.",
          "zh": "而那當然應該是 router links。"
        },
        {
          "id": 96,
          "start": 313.69,
          "end": 317.44,
          "en": "And actually even that text here in the h1 element",
          "zh": "其實連 h1 元素裡的這段文字，"
        },
        {
          "id": 97,
          "start": 317.44,
          "end": 321.38,
          "en": "should be a router link because it should be clickable",
          "zh": "也應該是 router link，因為它應該可以點擊，"
        },
        {
          "id": 98,
          "start": 321.38,
          "end": 324.223,
          "en": "and should always lead us back to the starting page.",
          "zh": "而且應該總是帶我們回到起始頁面。"
        },
        {
          "id": 99,
          "start": 325.23,
          "end": 329.05,
          "en": "So here I want to go to /nothing",
          "zh": "所以在這裡我想前往 /nothing，"
        },
        {
          "id": 100,
          "start": 329.05,
          "end": 330.73,
          "en": "which will then redirect to coaches,",
          "zh": "它會接著重新導向到 coaches，"
        },
        {
          "id": 101,
          "start": 330.73,
          "end": 332.54,
          "en": "but this will basically always go back",
          "zh": "但這基本上總是會回到"
        },
        {
          "id": 102,
          "start": 332.54,
          "end": 335.653,
          "en": "to the root entry page of this app.",
          "zh": "這個應用程式的根進入頁面。"
        },
        {
          "id": 103,
          "start": 336.61,
          "end": 340.36,
          "en": "Here, I also wanna go to /coaches let's say,",
          "zh": "這裡我也想要前往 /coaches，比如說，"
        },
        {
          "id": 104,
          "start": 340.36,
          "end": 342.19,
          "en": "which of course is basically the same",
          "zh": "這當然基本上等同於"
        },
        {
          "id": 105,
          "start": 342.19,
          "end": 347.15,
          "en": "as clicking on this title, but here I wanna say All Coaches.",
          "zh": "點擊這個標題，但在這裡我想寫 All Coaches。"
        },
        {
          "id": 106,
          "start": 347.15,
          "end": 349.82,
          "en": "So this will be one of the navigation items we have.",
          "zh": "這會是我們的其中一個導覽項目。"
        },
        {
          "id": 107,
          "start": 349.82,
          "end": 353.97,
          "en": "And the other item we'll have, we'll go to /requests",
          "zh": "而另一個項目，我們要前往 /requests，"
        },
        {
          "id": 108,
          "start": 353.97,
          "end": 356.94,
          "en": "to show us the requests we received",
          "zh": "顯示我們收到的 requests，"
        },
        {
          "id": 109,
          "start": 356.94,
          "end": 360.1,
          "en": "so the messages that were sent by users to us",
          "zh": "也就是使用者傳送給我們的訊息，"
        },
        {
          "id": 110,
          "start": 360.1,
          "end": 362.513,
          "en": "if we are registered as a coach.",
          "zh": "如果我們註冊成為 coach 的話。"
        },
        {
          "id": 111,
          "start": 364.37,
          "end": 367.52,
          "en": "If we are not, we won't see any requests here.",
          "zh": "如果沒有註冊，我們就不會在這裡看到任何 requests。"
        },
        {
          "id": 112,
          "start": 367.52,
          "end": 372.52,
          "en": "So this is the basic set up here for TheHeader let's say.",
          "zh": "所以這就是 TheHeader 的基本設定。"
        },
        {
          "id": 113,
          "start": 374.28,
          "end": 376.29,
          "en": "I don't need any script here at the moment",
          "zh": "我目前不需要在這裡加任何 script，"
        },
        {
          "id": 114,
          "start": 376.29,
          "end": 378.55,
          "en": "because there's nothing dynamic in here,",
          "zh": "因為這裡沒有任何動態的東西，"
        },
        {
          "id": 115,
          "start": 378.55,
          "end": 382.24,
          "en": "nothing that would need a Vue script code.",
          "zh": "沒有需要 Vue script 程式碼的地方。"
        },
        {
          "id": 116,
          "start": 382.24,
          "end": 385.24,
          "en": "But of course, I want to have some styling here",
          "zh": "但當然，我想在這裡加一些樣式，"
        },
        {
          "id": 117,
          "start": 385.24,
          "end": 389.453,
          "en": "and I want to have some scoped CSS code in here.",
          "zh": "我想在這裡放一些 scoped CSS 程式碼。"
        },
        {
          "id": 118,
          "start": 390.51,
          "end": 392.31,
          "en": "And again, you find that attached,",
          "zh": "同樣地，你可以在附件中找到，"
        },
        {
          "id": 119,
          "start": 392.31,
          "end": 396.01,
          "en": "you find TheHeader CSS file attached,",
          "zh": "你會找到附上的 TheHeader CSS 檔案，"
        },
        {
          "id": 120,
          "start": 396.01,
          "end": 399.5,
          "en": "which contains a bunch of styles I prepared for you,",
          "zh": "裡面有我幫你準備的一些樣式，"
        },
        {
          "id": 121,
          "start": 399.5,
          "end": 402.6,
          "en": "which you can just copy between those style tacks",
          "zh": "你可以直接把它們複製到那些 style 標籤之間，"
        },
        {
          "id": 122,
          "start": 402.6,
          "end": 405.65999999999997,
          "en": "so that we all use the same styling.",
          "zh": "讓我們大家都使用相同的樣式。"
        },
        {
          "id": 123,
          "start": 405.65999999999997,
          "end": 407.4,
          "en": "I'm basically just giving TheHeader",
          "zh": "我基本上只是給 TheHeader"
        },
        {
          "id": 124,
          "start": 407.4,
          "end": 409.69,
          "en": "a certain width and a certain color",
          "zh": "一個特定寬度和特定顏色，"
        },
        {
          "id": 125,
          "start": 409.69,
          "end": 412.34000000000003,
          "en": "and then it's all just about styling the links",
          "zh": "然後就只是在設計連結的樣式，"
        },
        {
          "id": 126,
          "start": 412.34000000000003,
          "end": 414.46,
          "en": "and the active links, that's important,",
          "zh": "以及作用中的連結，這很重要，"
        },
        {
          "id": 127,
          "start": 414.46,
          "end": 415.94,
          "en": "the active router link",
          "zh": "也就是作用中的 router link，"
        },
        {
          "id": 128,
          "start": 415.94,
          "end": 418.697,
          "en": "by using that router link active clause,",
          "zh": "使用那個 router link active class，"
        },
        {
          "id": 129,
          "start": 418.697,
          "end": 422.74,
          "en": "which you learned would be applied to the link",
          "zh": "你學過它會被套用到"
        },
        {
          "id": 130,
          "start": 422.74,
          "end": 424.76,
          "en": "that's responsible for the current page.",
          "zh": "負責目前頁面的那個連結。"
        },
        {
          "id": 131,
          "start": 424.76,
          "end": 427.75,
          "en": "And then I also have some other styles",
          "zh": "然後我還有一些其他樣式，"
        },
        {
          "id": 132,
          "start": 427.75,
          "end": 430.39,
          "en": "for laying things out correctly.",
          "zh": "用來正確地排版。"
        },
        {
          "id": 133,
          "start": 430.39,
          "end": 433.59,
          "en": "With that we got TheHeader and if we now reload,",
          "zh": "這樣我們就有了 TheHeader，如果我們現在重新載入，"
        },
        {
          "id": 134,
          "start": 433.59,
          "end": 435.02,
          "en": "this is what we should see.",
          "zh": "這應該就是我們會看到的畫面。"
        },
        {
          "id": 135,
          "start": 435.02,
          "end": 438.07,
          "en": "You see All Coaches is active",
          "zh": "你會看到 All Coaches 是作用中的，"
        },
        {
          "id": 136,
          "start": 438.07,
          "end": 440.53,
          "en": "and we could also go to Requests",
          "zh": "我們也可以前往 Requests，"
        },
        {
          "id": 137,
          "start": 440.53,
          "end": 442.14,
          "en": "where we don't see anything on the screen,",
          "zh": "在那裡畫面上什麼都看不到，"
        },
        {
          "id": 138,
          "start": 442.14,
          "end": 444.85,
          "en": "but switching to page works.",
          "zh": "但切換到那個頁面是可行的。"
        },
        {
          "id": 139,
          "start": 444.85,
          "end": 448.31,
          "en": "So that's TheHeader off this application now.",
          "zh": "所以這就是這個應用程式現在的 TheHeader。"
        },
        {
          "id": 140,
          "start": 448.31,
          "end": 450.99,
          "en": "And with that, we made a good step forward",
          "zh": "這樣一來，我們向前邁進了一大步，"
        },
        {
          "id": 141,
          "start": 450.99,
          "end": 453.19,
          "en": "because now we've got a first basic way",
          "zh": "因為現在我們有了第一種基本方式，"
        },
        {
          "id": 142,
          "start": 453.19,
          "end": 455.86,
          "en": "of navigating around.",
          "zh": "可以在各處導覽。"
        },
        {
          "id": 143,
          "start": 455.86,
          "end": 458.42,
          "en": "Now let's also work on the other pages",
          "zh": "現在我們也來處理其他頁面，"
        },
        {
          "id": 144,
          "start": 458.42,
          "end": 460.343,
          "en": "and add some meat to them.",
          "zh": "為它們加上一些實質內容。"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "21879904",
      "title": "Wiring Up Pages",
      "lectureOrder": 240,
      "videoOrder": 212,
      "sourceHash": "53f52cf2e9e4d032ae03e4837eb526ba7c3b520e53d2922e87899e069017f7b0",
      "cues": [
        {
          "id": 1,
          "start": 2.07,
          "end": 4.76,
          "en": "So let's add some dummy content to the other pages",
          "zh": "所以讓我們為其他頁面加上一些假內容，"
        },
        {
          "id": 2,
          "start": 4.76,
          "end": 7.11,
          "en": "and I'll continue with requests received,",
          "zh": "而我會從 requests received 繼續，"
        },
        {
          "id": 3,
          "start": 7.11,
          "end": 9.41,
          "en": "because we can easily reach that page by clicking",
          "zh": "因為我們可以輕鬆地透過點擊"
        },
        {
          "id": 4,
          "start": 9.41,
          "end": 11.53,
          "en": "on requests in the header.",
          "zh": "頁首的 requests 來到那個頁面。"
        },
        {
          "id": 5,
          "start": 11.53,
          "end": 13.48,
          "en": "And well we got no requests yet",
          "zh": "而我們目前還沒有任何 requests，"
        },
        {
          "id": 6,
          "start": 13.48,
          "end": 16.53,
          "en": "so for the moment, I'll just output requests here,",
          "zh": "所以目前我只在這裡輸出 requests，"
        },
        {
          "id": 7,
          "start": 16.53,
          "end": 19.523,
          "en": "just so that we see that loading this works.",
          "zh": "只是讓我們看到載入這個頁面確實可行。"
        },
        {
          "id": 8,
          "start": 20.47,
          "end": 23.28,
          "en": "So therefore we now see requests here.",
          "zh": "因此我們現在在這裡看到 requests。"
        },
        {
          "id": 9,
          "start": 23.28,
          "end": 26.37,
          "en": "Now the other pages are a bit hard to reach at the moment,",
          "zh": "目前其他頁面有點難以到達，"
        },
        {
          "id": 10,
          "start": 26.37,
          "end": 29.51,
          "en": "we got no links to get to the contact page",
          "zh": "我們沒有連結可以前往 contact 頁面"
        },
        {
          "id": 11,
          "start": 29.51,
          "end": 31.793,
          "en": "or to get to the registration page,",
          "zh": "或前往註冊頁面，"
        },
        {
          "id": 12,
          "start": 32.69,
          "end": 35.57,
          "en": "but we can at least add some of those links already",
          "zh": "但我們至少可以先把其中一些連結加好，"
        },
        {
          "id": 13,
          "start": 35.57,
          "end": 37.05,
          "en": "I guess.",
          "zh": "我想。"
        },
        {
          "id": 14,
          "start": 37.05,
          "end": 39.67,
          "en": "For example in the coaches list,",
          "zh": "例如在 coaches 清單中，"
        },
        {
          "id": 15,
          "start": 39.67,
          "end": 42.06,
          "en": "yes, we don't have any coaches yet,",
          "zh": "沒錯，我們目前還沒有任何 coaches，"
        },
        {
          "id": 16,
          "start": 42.06,
          "end": 43.98,
          "en": "but outputting the list of coaches",
          "zh": "但輸出 coaches 清單"
        },
        {
          "id": 17,
          "start": 43.98,
          "end": 48.52,
          "en": "will actually just be a part of this component here.",
          "zh": "其實只是這個元件的一部分。"
        },
        {
          "id": 18,
          "start": 48.52,
          "end": 52.68,
          "en": "Let's say we will have an unordered list down here later,",
          "zh": "假設我們之後會在下面放一個無序清單，"
        },
        {
          "id": 19,
          "start": 52.68,
          "end": 54.86,
          "en": "but above that unordered list",
          "zh": "但在那個無序清單上方"
        },
        {
          "id": 20,
          "start": 54.86,
          "end": 56.84,
          "en": "I want to have a div,",
          "zh": "我想要有一個 div，"
        },
        {
          "id": 21,
          "start": 56.84,
          "end": 58.86,
          "en": "so a different container here in the end,",
          "zh": "所以最後這裡會有另一個容器，"
        },
        {
          "id": 22,
          "start": 58.86,
          "end": 61.9,
          "en": "which will give us CSS class of controls,",
          "zh": "它會帶有 CSS class 為 controls，"
        },
        {
          "id": 23,
          "start": 61.9,
          "end": 65.8,
          "en": "which should have two buttons let's say,",
          "zh": "假設它應該有兩個按鈕，"
        },
        {
          "id": 24,
          "start": 65.8,
          "end": 70.5,
          "en": "one button that allows us to refresh the list of coaches,",
          "zh": "一個按鈕讓我們重新整理 coaches 清單，"
        },
        {
          "id": 25,
          "start": 70.5,
          "end": 74.07,
          "en": "later we'll have coaches stored on a database in the web",
          "zh": "之後我們會把 coaches 存在網路上的資料庫，"
        },
        {
          "id": 26,
          "start": 74.07,
          "end": 76.96000000000001,
          "en": "and this button should then fetch the latest",
          "zh": "而這個按鈕到時候應該抓取"
        },
        {
          "id": 27,
          "start": 76.96000000000001,
          "end": 78.67,
          "en": "snapshot of that data.",
          "zh": "那份資料的最新快照。"
        },
        {
          "id": 28,
          "start": 78.67,
          "end": 81.43,
          "en": "But besides that refresh button,",
          "zh": "但除了那個重新整理按鈕，"
        },
        {
          "id": 29,
          "start": 81.43,
          "end": 82.53999999999999,
          "en": "which we need,",
          "zh": "也就是我們需要的按鈕之外，"
        },
        {
          "id": 30,
          "start": 82.53999999999999,
          "end": 84.65,
          "en": "we'll also have a button here",
          "zh": "我們這裡還會有一個按鈕，"
        },
        {
          "id": 31,
          "start": 84.65,
          "end": 88.423,
          "en": "which should allow us to register as a coach.",
          "zh": "它應該讓我們可以註冊成為 coach。"
        },
        {
          "id": 32,
          "start": 90.38,
          "end": 93.09,
          "en": "And therefore actually this should not be a button,",
          "zh": "因此這其實不該是一個 button，"
        },
        {
          "id": 33,
          "start": 93.09,
          "end": 94.563,
          "en": "but a router link.",
          "zh": "而應該是 router link。"
        },
        {
          "id": 34,
          "start": 95.4,
          "end": 99,
          "en": "So here I wanna have a router link, register as coach,",
          "zh": "所以在這裡我想要一個 router link，register as coach，"
        },
        {
          "id": 35,
          "start": 99,
          "end": 102.57,
          "en": "which goes to /register",
          "zh": "它會前往 /register，"
        },
        {
          "id": 36,
          "start": 102.57,
          "end": 106.343,
          "en": "because that was our registration route here.",
          "zh": "因為那是我們的註冊路由。"
        },
        {
          "id": 37,
          "start": 107.99000000000001,
          "end": 112.03,
          "en": "So this is our link I want here on the coaches page.",
          "zh": "這就是我想放在 coaches 頁面上的連結。"
        },
        {
          "id": 38,
          "start": 112.03,
          "end": 113.49000000000001,
          "en": "This one.",
          "zh": "就是這個。"
        },
        {
          "id": 39,
          "start": 113.49000000000001,
          "end": 116.00999999999999,
          "en": "And therefore we can now also add some dummy code here",
          "zh": "因此我們現在也可以在這裡加上一些假內容，"
        },
        {
          "id": 40,
          "start": 116.00999999999999,
          "end": 118.39,
          "en": "to the coach registration.",
          "zh": "放到 coach 註冊頁面。"
        },
        {
          "id": 41,
          "start": 118.39,
          "end": 120.46,
          "en": "For now I'll just say register here,",
          "zh": "目前我只會在這裡寫上 register，"
        },
        {
          "id": 42,
          "start": 120.46,
          "end": 122.64,
          "en": "but soon we'll add a form on this page,",
          "zh": "但很快我們會在這個頁面加上表單，"
        },
        {
          "id": 43,
          "start": 122.64,
          "end": 125.07,
          "en": "which allows us to fill in all the details",
          "zh": "讓我們可以填寫所有"
        },
        {
          "id": 44,
          "start": 125.07,
          "end": 128.293,
          "en": "we need to provide to register as a coach.",
          "zh": "註冊成為 coach 所需提供的細節。"
        },
        {
          "id": 45,
          "start": 129.77,
          "end": 132.933,
          "en": "So now if I click this, we should see register at least.",
          "zh": "所以現在如果我點這個，至少應該會看到 register。"
        },
        {
          "id": 46,
          "start": 134.01,
          "end": 136.79,
          "en": "Now we also have this contact page,",
          "zh": "我們也有這個 contact 頁面，"
        },
        {
          "id": 47,
          "start": 136.79,
          "end": 141.43,
          "en": "which we later can reach by clicking on the contact button",
          "zh": "之後我們可以點擊某位特定 coach 的"
        },
        {
          "id": 48,
          "start": 141.43,
          "end": 143.24,
          "en": "of a specific coach.",
          "zh": "contact 按鈕來到這裡。"
        },
        {
          "id": 49,
          "start": 143.24,
          "end": 145.39,
          "en": "At the moment we have no specific coach,",
          "zh": "目前我們沒有特定的 coach，"
        },
        {
          "id": 50,
          "start": 145.39,
          "end": 148.11,
          "en": "which is also a problem for the coach detail page,",
          "zh": "這也是 coach detail 頁面的問題，"
        },
        {
          "id": 51,
          "start": 148.11,
          "end": 150.2,
          "en": "which we can't reach for that reason.",
          "zh": "因為這個原因我們到不了那一頁。"
        },
        {
          "id": 52,
          "start": 150.2,
          "end": 152.55,
          "en": "But of course we can manually reach it",
          "zh": "但當然我們可以手動前往，"
        },
        {
          "id": 53,
          "start": 152.55,
          "end": 154.99,
          "en": "by filling in coaches/",
          "zh": "只要輸入 coaches/"
        },
        {
          "id": 54,
          "start": 154.99,
          "end": 157.68,
          "en": "and then some fictional coach ID here.",
          "zh": "然後在這裡加上某個虛構的 coach ID。"
        },
        {
          "id": 55,
          "start": 157.68,
          "end": 159.78,
          "en": "And if we do that, we would theoretically",
          "zh": "如果我們這麼做，理論上"
        },
        {
          "id": 56,
          "start": 159.78,
          "end": 162.51,
          "en": "reach the coach details page.",
          "zh": "就會到達 coach details 頁面。"
        },
        {
          "id": 57,
          "start": 162.51,
          "end": 166.82999999999998,
          "en": "So we can therefore add a dummy template",
          "zh": "因此我們可以加一個假的 template，"
        },
        {
          "id": 58,
          "start": 166.82999999999998,
          "end": 168.453,
          "en": "to coach detail as well,",
          "zh": "也加到 coach detail，"
        },
        {
          "id": 59,
          "start": 169.5,
          "end": 172.713,
          "en": "details for coach.",
          "zh": "details for coach。"
        },
        {
          "id": 60,
          "start": 173.62,
          "end": 176.32999999999998,
          "en": "And if we save that, we should see this on the screen",
          "zh": "如果我們儲存，當我們在 URL 中"
        },
        {
          "id": 61,
          "start": 176.32999999999998,
          "end": 179.433,
          "en": "if we reach this path here in the URL.",
          "zh": "到達這個路徑時，應該就會在畫面上看到它。"
        },
        {
          "id": 62,
          "start": 181.68,
          "end": 184.21,
          "en": "And with that, of course, we can then also",
          "zh": "這樣一來，我們當然也可以"
        },
        {
          "id": 63,
          "start": 184.21,
          "end": 187.7,
          "en": "add a router link here, in that,",
          "zh": "在那個 coach detail 頁面上"
        },
        {
          "id": 64,
          "start": 187.7,
          "end": 190.553,
          "en": "or on that, coach detail page,",
          "zh": "加一個 router link，"
        },
        {
          "id": 65,
          "start": 191.98,
          "end": 196.98,
          "en": "where we say contact, where I wanna go to, /coaches,",
          "zh": "我們寫 contact，我要前往 /coaches，"
        },
        {
          "id": 66,
          "start": 197.31,
          "end": 200.05,
          "en": "then the ID, which later will be dynamic,",
          "zh": "然後是 ID，之後它會是動態的，"
        },
        {
          "id": 67,
          "start": 200.05,
          "end": 204.02,
          "en": "but for now I'll hard-code it, /contact,",
          "zh": "但目前我會把它寫死，/contact，"
        },
        {
          "id": 68,
          "start": 204.02,
          "end": 206.46,
          "en": "because you might remember that the contact page",
          "zh": "因為你可能記得 contact 頁面"
        },
        {
          "id": 69,
          "start": 206.46,
          "end": 208.65,
          "en": "was this nested child route here,",
          "zh": "是這裡的巢狀子路由，"
        },
        {
          "id": 70,
          "start": 208.65,
          "end": 212.67000000000002,
          "en": "which we reached with coaches, some ID, /contact,",
          "zh": "我們是用 coaches、某個 ID、/contact 到達的，"
        },
        {
          "id": 71,
          "start": 212.67000000000002,
          "end": 216.05,
          "en": "and therefore that's just what I'm using here.",
          "zh": "所以我在這裡就是這樣用。"
        },
        {
          "id": 72,
          "start": 216.05,
          "end": 217.49,
          "en": "And if I save that,",
          "zh": "如果我儲存，"
        },
        {
          "id": 73,
          "start": 217.49,
          "end": 220.38,
          "en": "we now have that link on the coach detail page.",
          "zh": "我們現在在 coach detail 頁面上就有那個連結。"
        },
        {
          "id": 74,
          "start": 220.38,
          "end": 225.09300000000002,
          "en": "And if we click that we reach contact here.",
          "zh": "如果我們點它，就會到達這裡的 contact。"
        },
        {
          "id": 75,
          "start": 226.11,
          "end": 228.73,
          "en": "But what we also notice is that we reach it",
          "zh": "但我們也注意到，我們確實到了，"
        },
        {
          "id": 76,
          "start": 228.73,
          "end": 230.94,
          "en": "but nothing changes on the page.",
          "zh": "但頁面上什麼都沒有改變。"
        },
        {
          "id": 77,
          "start": 230.94,
          "end": 234.13,
          "en": "Well keep in mind that this is a child route.",
          "zh": "請記住，這是子路由。"
        },
        {
          "id": 78,
          "start": 234.13,
          "end": 238.12,
          "en": "Contact is a child route of that detail route here.",
          "zh": "Contact 是這裡那個 detail 路由的子路由。"
        },
        {
          "id": 79,
          "start": 238.12,
          "end": 240.05,
          "en": "And the consequence of that",
          "zh": "而這件事的結果"
        },
        {
          "id": 80,
          "start": 240.05,
          "end": 244.17,
          "en": "is that it will not be loaded to replace the route",
          "zh": "是它不會被載入來取代"
        },
        {
          "id": 81,
          "start": 244.17,
          "end": 246.14,
          "en": "that was on the screen previously,",
          "zh": "先前在畫面上的路由，"
        },
        {
          "id": 82,
          "start": 246.14,
          "end": 249.28,
          "en": "but that instead it needs a new router view.",
          "zh": "而是需要一個新的 router view。"
        },
        {
          "id": 83,
          "start": 249.28,
          "end": 251.72,
          "en": "It needs a separate router view,",
          "zh": "它需要一個獨立的 router view，"
        },
        {
          "id": 84,
          "start": 251.72,
          "end": 254.97,
          "en": "which has to be inside of the parent component",
          "zh": "而這個 router view 必須放在"
        },
        {
          "id": 85,
          "start": 254.97,
          "end": 256.6,
          "en": "of the child route.",
          "zh": "子路由的父元件裡面。"
        },
        {
          "id": 86,
          "start": 256.6,
          "end": 259.22,
          "en": "So in this case, in the coach detail component.",
          "zh": "所以在這個例子中，就是 coach detail 元件裡。"
        },
        {
          "id": 87,
          "start": 259.22,
          "end": 262.09,
          "en": "We need to add a router view there.",
          "zh": "我們需要在那裡加一個 router view。"
        },
        {
          "id": 88,
          "start": 262.09,
          "end": 265.93,
          "en": "So here we can add a router view",
          "zh": "所以我們可以在這裡加一個 router view，"
        },
        {
          "id": 89,
          "start": 265.93,
          "end": 269.44,
          "en": "and that's where then the child routes of coach detail",
          "zh": "這樣一來，coach detail 的子路由"
        },
        {
          "id": 90,
          "start": 269.44,
          "end": 273.14,
          "en": "will be loaded, in this case, the only child route we have,",
          "zh": "就會被載入，在這裡就是我們唯一的子路由，"
        },
        {
          "id": 91,
          "start": 273.14,
          "end": 275.32,
          "en": "which is this contact route.",
          "zh": "也就是這個 contact 路由。"
        },
        {
          "id": 92,
          "start": 275.32,
          "end": 278.54,
          "en": "So with that if we now also add some dummy content",
          "zh": "這樣一來，如果我們現在也加一些假內容"
        },
        {
          "id": 93,
          "start": 278.54,
          "end": 280.64,
          "en": "to contact coach,",
          "zh": "到 contact coach，"
        },
        {
          "id": 94,
          "start": 280.64,
          "end": 284.09000000000003,
          "en": "contact a coach or anything like that,",
          "zh": "contact a coach 或任何類似的東西，"
        },
        {
          "id": 95,
          "start": 284.09000000000003,
          "end": 289.09000000000003,
          "en": "you see that this now shows up here if we are on /contact.",
          "zh": "你會看到當我們在 /contact 時，這裡就會顯示出來。"
        },
        {
          "id": 96,
          "start": 289.3,
          "end": 292.40999999999997,
          "en": "If we are on just /c1 it's not there,",
          "zh": "如果我們只在 /c1，它不會出現，"
        },
        {
          "id": 97,
          "start": 292.40999999999997,
          "end": 294.403,
          "en": "if you click contact it is there.",
          "zh": "如果你點 contact，它就會出現。"
        },
        {
          "id": 98,
          "start": 295.47,
          "end": 297.9,
          "en": "And with that we can reach all the routes",
          "zh": "這樣一來，我們就能到達所有路由，"
        },
        {
          "id": 99,
          "start": 297.9,
          "end": 301.53,
          "en": "and we can see some dummy content on those pages.",
          "zh": "也能在那些頁面上看到一些假內容。"
        },
        {
          "id": 100,
          "start": 301.53,
          "end": 304.85,
          "en": "But of course we're not just there for dummy content only.",
          "zh": "但當然我們不是只為了假內容才走到這裡。"
        },
        {
          "id": 101,
          "start": 304.85,
          "end": 308.13,
          "en": "So therefore why don't we as a next step,",
          "zh": "所以下一步，我們何不"
        },
        {
          "id": 102,
          "start": 308.13,
          "end": 312.69,
          "en": "add Vuex so that we at least have a list of dummy coaches,",
          "zh": "加入 Vuex，讓我們至少有個假 coaches 清單，"
        },
        {
          "id": 103,
          "start": 312.69,
          "end": 315.62,
          "en": "which we can display and start working with",
          "zh": "可以顯示並開始操作，"
        },
        {
          "id": 104,
          "start": 315.62,
          "end": 318.05,
          "en": "before we then later add the functionality",
          "zh": "之後再加入功能，"
        },
        {
          "id": 105,
          "start": 318.05,
          "end": 319.993,
          "en": "to add our own coach data.",
          "zh": "來新增我們自己的 coach 資料。"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "21879906",
      "title": "Adding Vuex and Coach Data",
      "lectureOrder": 241,
      "videoOrder": 213,
      "sourceHash": "204d6d468e0ee4d77e38dfe3d6af9a1d9ae884b54d09eb4fb58225a3a4f6be14",
      "cues": [
        {
          "id": 1,
          "start": 2.04,
          "end": 5.52,
          "en": "So as mentioned, I wanna get started adding some data.",
          "zh": "所以如我所提到的，我想開始加入一些資料。"
        },
        {
          "id": 2,
          "start": 5.52,
          "end": 9.32,
          "en": "And we're going to use Vuex for managing that data,",
          "zh": "我們會用 Vuex 來管理那些資料，"
        },
        {
          "id": 3,
          "start": 9.32,
          "end": 12.06,
          "en": "because it will not just be static data,",
          "zh": "因為它不會只是靜態資料，"
        },
        {
          "id": 4,
          "start": 12.06,
          "end": 13.63,
          "en": "which never changes,",
          "zh": "永遠不會改變，"
        },
        {
          "id": 5,
          "start": 13.63,
          "end": 16.23,
          "en": "but obviously we'll be able to add coaches.",
          "zh": "而顯然我們將能夠新增 coaches。"
        },
        {
          "id": 6,
          "start": 16.23,
          "end": 19.2,
          "en": "After all we will be able to register as one.",
          "zh": "畢竟我們將能夠註冊成為其中一位。"
        },
        {
          "id": 7,
          "start": 19.2,
          "end": 21.92,
          "en": "And we'll also be able to send requests ends on.",
          "zh": "我們也將能夠發送 requests 等等。"
        },
        {
          "id": 8,
          "start": 21.92,
          "end": 25.22,
          "en": "And that's why we already installed Vuex.",
          "zh": "這就是為什麼我們已經安裝了 Vuex。"
        },
        {
          "id": 9,
          "start": 25.22,
          "end": 27.71,
          "en": "Hence I'll add a store folder",
          "zh": "因此我會新增一個 store 資料夾，"
        },
        {
          "id": 10,
          "start": 27.71,
          "end": 31.75,
          "en": "next to my pages and components folders.",
          "zh": "放在我的 pages 和 components 資料夾旁邊。"
        },
        {
          "id": 11,
          "start": 31.75,
          "end": 33.62,
          "en": "And then that store folder,",
          "zh": "然後在那個 store 資料夾中，"
        },
        {
          "id": 12,
          "start": 33.62,
          "end": 35.57,
          "en": "I'll add a index js file,",
          "zh": "我會新增一個 index.js 檔案，"
        },
        {
          "id": 13,
          "start": 35.57,
          "end": 37.89,
          "en": "where we set up the store in general.",
          "zh": "我們在其中一般性地設定 store。"
        },
        {
          "id": 14,
          "start": 37.89,
          "end": 40.51,
          "en": "But I also wanna work with modules here,",
          "zh": "但我也想在這裡使用 modules，"
        },
        {
          "id": 15,
          "start": 40.51,
          "end": 43.78,
          "en": "because we have two main features, coaches and requests,",
          "zh": "因為我們有兩個主要功能：coaches 和 requests，"
        },
        {
          "id": 16,
          "start": 43.78,
          "end": 47.64,
          "en": "and I'll make each feature and the state and actions",
          "zh": "我會把每個功能，以及屬於該功能的 state 和 actions，"
        },
        {
          "id": 17,
          "start": 47.64,
          "end": 50.84,
          "en": "that belong to this feature, a module.",
          "zh": "做成一個 module。"
        },
        {
          "id": 18,
          "start": 50.84,
          "end": 53.51,
          "en": "Hence, I'll add a modules folder in there.",
          "zh": "因此，我會在裡面新增一個 modules 資料夾。"
        },
        {
          "id": 19,
          "start": 53.51,
          "end": 57.28,
          "en": "And now it's up to you how you wanna split that code.",
          "zh": "現在要怎麼拆分那些程式碼就看你了。"
        },
        {
          "id": 20,
          "start": 57.28,
          "end": 62.28,
          "en": "One file for the entire module or multiple files per module.",
          "zh": "整個 module 一個檔案，或每個 module 多個檔案。"
        },
        {
          "id": 21,
          "start": 62.31,
          "end": 65.35,
          "en": "And I'm really just to show you different approaches,",
          "zh": "而我其實只是為了向你展示不同的做法，"
        },
        {
          "id": 22,
          "start": 65.35,
          "end": 68.63,
          "en": "I'll go with multiple files per module.",
          "zh": "我會採用每個 module 多個檔案。"
        },
        {
          "id": 23,
          "start": 68.63,
          "end": 71.12,
          "en": "So I'll add another sub folder here,",
          "zh": "所以我會在這裡再加一個子資料夾，"
        },
        {
          "id": 24,
          "start": 71.12,
          "end": 75.21000000000001,
          "en": "coaches and a second sub folder next to coaches,",
          "zh": "coaches，以及一個在 coaches 旁邊的第二個子資料夾，"
        },
        {
          "id": 25,
          "start": 75.21000000000001,
          "end": 76.733,
          "en": "which is requests.",
          "zh": "也就是 requests。"
        },
        {
          "id": 26,
          "start": 77.63,
          "end": 80.13,
          "en": "And now we're going to start with some coach data.",
          "zh": "現在我們要從一些 coach 資料開始。"
        },
        {
          "id": 27,
          "start": 80.13,
          "end": 83.8,
          "en": "So here I'll add a index js file inside of coaches.",
          "zh": "所以在這裡，我會在 coaches 裡面新增一個 index.js 檔案。"
        },
        {
          "id": 28,
          "start": 83.8,
          "end": 87.55,
          "en": "This is the file where we will merge all the coach related",
          "zh": "這個檔案是我們會把所有與 coach 相關的"
        },
        {
          "id": 29,
          "start": 87.55,
          "end": 90.343,
          "en": "mutations actions, getters ends on together.",
          "zh": "mutations、actions、getters 等等合併在一起的地方。"
        },
        {
          "id": 30,
          "start": 91.18,
          "end": 94.72999999999999,
          "en": "And then we'll have a mutations js file,",
          "zh": "然後我們會有一個 mutations.js 檔案，"
        },
        {
          "id": 31,
          "start": 94.72999999999999,
          "end": 99.25,
          "en": "a actions js file, a getters JS file.",
          "zh": "一個 actions.js 檔案、一個 getters.js 檔案。"
        },
        {
          "id": 32,
          "start": 99.25,
          "end": 102.71000000000001,
          "en": "And we then split our logic across those files.",
          "zh": "然後我們把邏輯分散到那些檔案中。"
        },
        {
          "id": 33,
          "start": 102.71000000000001,
          "end": 106.47,
          "en": "This may be overkill. This is not something you have to do.",
          "zh": "這可能有點殺雞用牛刀。這不是你一定要做的事。"
        },
        {
          "id": 34,
          "start": 106.47,
          "end": 109.12,
          "en": "But again, my idea with this course",
          "zh": "但再次強調，我這門課的想法"
        },
        {
          "id": 35,
          "start": 109.12,
          "end": 113.11,
          "en": "is that I also show you different ways of doing something.",
          "zh": "是我也會向你展示做某件事的不同方式。"
        },
        {
          "id": 36,
          "start": 113.11,
          "end": 115.37,
          "en": "So therefore now here in index js,",
          "zh": "所以現在在這裡的 index.js 中，"
        },
        {
          "id": 37,
          "start": 115.37,
          "end": 118.25999999999999,
          "en": "inside of the coaches module,",
          "zh": "在 coaches module 裡面，"
        },
        {
          "id": 38,
          "start": 118.25999999999999,
          "end": 121.44,
          "en": "I'll export an object which will hold",
          "zh": "我會匯出一個物件，它會持有"
        },
        {
          "id": 39,
          "start": 121.44,
          "end": 124.56,
          "en": "all the coach related state and so on.",
          "zh": "所有與 coach 相關的 state 等等。"
        },
        {
          "id": 40,
          "start": 124.56,
          "end": 127.53,
          "en": "And therefore here will have some state,",
          "zh": "因此這裡會有一些 state，"
        },
        {
          "id": 41,
          "start": 127.53,
          "end": 129.73,
          "en": "but will also have mutations,",
          "zh": "但也會有 mutations，"
        },
        {
          "id": 42,
          "start": 129.73,
          "end": 133.06,
          "en": "which I import from the mutations file.",
          "zh": "我會從 mutations 檔案匯入它們。"
        },
        {
          "id": 43,
          "start": 133.06,
          "end": 137.75,
          "en": "So import mutations from ./mutations js",
          "zh": "所以是 import mutations from './mutations.js'，"
        },
        {
          "id": 44,
          "start": 138.76,
          "end": 141.93,
          "en": "and assign mutations to mutations here.",
          "zh": "並在這裡把 mutations 指定給 mutations。"
        },
        {
          "id": 45,
          "start": 141.93,
          "end": 145.48,
          "en": "And since key name is similar to value name here,",
          "zh": "而由於這裡的鍵名和值名相似，"
        },
        {
          "id": 46,
          "start": 145.48,
          "end": 147.47,
          "en": "we can use this JavaScript shorthand",
          "zh": "我們可以使用這個 JavaScript 簡寫，"
        },
        {
          "id": 47,
          "start": 147.47,
          "end": 149.62,
          "en": "I showed you a couple of times already",
          "zh": "我已經向你展示過幾次了，"
        },
        {
          "id": 48,
          "start": 149.62,
          "end": 151.25,
          "en": "where we merged just like that.",
          "zh": "我們就那樣合併。"
        },
        {
          "id": 49,
          "start": 151.25,
          "end": 152.923,
          "en": "Simply to write less code.",
          "zh": "單純是為了少寫一點程式碼。"
        },
        {
          "id": 50,
          "start": 153.84,
          "end": 156.199,
          "en": "And I'll do the same now with actions,",
          "zh": "而我現在也會對 actions 做同樣的事，"
        },
        {
          "id": 51,
          "start": 156.199,
          "end": 159.36,
          "en": "which I import from actions js",
          "zh": "我從 actions.js 匯入它們，"
        },
        {
          "id": 52,
          "start": 159.36,
          "end": 161.76,
          "en": "and import getters",
          "zh": "並 import getters，"
        },
        {
          "id": 53,
          "start": 161.76,
          "end": 166.64,
          "en": "from ./getters js like this,",
          "zh": "像這樣 from './getters.js'，"
        },
        {
          "id": 54,
          "start": 166.64,
          "end": 170.04,
          "en": "and also add those to this module object.",
          "zh": "也把它們加入這個 module 物件。"
        },
        {
          "id": 55,
          "start": 170.04,
          "end": 174.82,
          "en": "So then we have actions and getters in there as well.",
          "zh": "這樣我們裡面也就有 actions 和 getters 了。"
        },
        {
          "id": 56,
          "start": 174.82,
          "end": 176.86,
          "en": "And now we export this module",
          "zh": "現在我們匯出這個 module，"
        },
        {
          "id": 57,
          "start": 176.86,
          "end": 179.16,
          "en": "to merge it into our main store,",
          "zh": "把它合併進我們的主要 store，"
        },
        {
          "id": 58,
          "start": 179.16,
          "end": 181.193,
          "en": "which we have yet to create.",
          "zh": "而這個 store 我們還沒建立。"
        },
        {
          "id": 59,
          "start": 182.27,
          "end": 185.34,
          "en": "So in the index js file in the store folder.",
          "zh": "所以在 store 資料夾中的 index.js 檔案裡。"
        },
        {
          "id": 60,
          "start": 185.34,
          "end": 188.78,
          "en": "So this file here, I'll now import",
          "zh": "所以這個檔案，我現在會"
        },
        {
          "id": 61,
          "start": 188.78,
          "end": 192.35,
          "en": "create store from Vuex",
          "zh": "從 Vuex 匯入 createStore，"
        },
        {
          "id": 62,
          "start": 193.34,
          "end": 197.49,
          "en": "and then simply create a store by calling create store",
          "zh": "然後就透過呼叫 createStore 來建立一個 store，"
        },
        {
          "id": 63,
          "start": 197.49,
          "end": 199.32999999999998,
          "en": "and I'll export this store",
          "zh": "我會匯出這個 store，"
        },
        {
          "id": 64,
          "start": 199.32999999999998,
          "end": 201.823,
          "en": "so that we can later use it in main js.",
          "zh": "這樣我們之後就能在 main.js 中使用它。"
        },
        {
          "id": 65,
          "start": 203.1,
          "end": 206.69,
          "en": "Now this store takes a conflict object, as you learned,",
          "zh": "現在這個 store 接受一個設定物件，如你所學，"
        },
        {
          "id": 66,
          "start": 206.69,
          "end": 210.03,
          "en": "and here we can add the modules option",
          "zh": "而在這裡我們可以加入 modules 選項，"
        },
        {
          "id": 67,
          "start": 210.03,
          "end": 213.5,
          "en": "to then import the coaches module",
          "zh": "然後把 coaches module"
        },
        {
          "id": 68,
          "start": 213.5,
          "end": 218.5,
          "en": "from ./modules/coaches/index js in there.",
          "zh": "從 ./modules/coaches/index.js 匯入進去。"
        },
        {
          "id": 69,
          "start": 221.15,
          "end": 224.16,
          "en": "Because it's this nested index js file",
          "zh": "因為就是這個巢狀的 index.js 檔案，"
        },
        {
          "id": 70,
          "start": 224.16,
          "end": 226.31,
          "en": "where we set up this entire module",
          "zh": "我們在其中設定這整個 module，"
        },
        {
          "id": 71,
          "start": 226.31,
          "end": 229.21,
          "en": "and combined the mutations action, scatters",
          "zh": "並合併該 module 的 mutations、actions、getters"
        },
        {
          "id": 72,
          "start": 229.21,
          "end": 231.14,
          "en": "and state of that module.",
          "zh": "和 state。"
        },
        {
          "id": 73,
          "start": 231.14,
          "end": 232.47,
          "en": "Hence it's that file",
          "zh": "因此就是那個檔案，"
        },
        {
          "id": 74,
          "start": 232.47,
          "end": 234.91,
          "en": "where we combine it all which we import.",
          "zh": "我們把所有東西合併在一起，也就是我們匯入的。"
        },
        {
          "id": 75,
          "start": 234.91,
          "end": 237.48,
          "en": "And then modules takes an object",
          "zh": "然後 modules 接受一個物件，"
        },
        {
          "id": 76,
          "start": 237.48,
          "end": 240.549,
          "en": "and I'll give this a key coaches",
          "zh": "我會給它一個鍵 coaches，"
        },
        {
          "id": 77,
          "start": 240.549,
          "end": 243.363,
          "en": "and point at my coaches module here.",
          "zh": "並指向我這裡的 coaches module。"
        },
        {
          "id": 78,
          "start": 245.02,
          "end": 246.96,
          "en": "And that key will be important",
          "zh": "那個鍵會很重要，"
        },
        {
          "id": 79,
          "start": 246.96,
          "end": 249.55,
          "en": "because I want to use name spacing.",
          "zh": "因為我想使用命名空間。"
        },
        {
          "id": 80,
          "start": 249.55,
          "end": 252.73,
          "en": "So in the index js file in the coaches folder,",
          "zh": "所以在 coaches 資料夾中的 index.js 檔案裡，"
        },
        {
          "id": 81,
          "start": 252.73,
          "end": 254.668,
          "en": "here I'll add name spaced,",
          "zh": "我會在這裡加入 namespaced，"
        },
        {
          "id": 82,
          "start": 254.668,
          "end": 258.01,
          "en": "true to use this name spacing feature",
          "zh": "設為 true，以使用這個命名空間功能，"
        },
        {
          "id": 83,
          "start": 258.01,
          "end": 260.14300000000003,
          "en": "I taught you in the Vuex section.",
          "zh": "我在 Vuex 章節教過你。"
        },
        {
          "id": 84,
          "start": 261.83,
          "end": 264.563,
          "en": "Now all those files were importing from mutations,",
          "zh": "現在所有我們從 mutations、"
        },
        {
          "id": 85,
          "start": 264.563,
          "end": 267.37,
          "en": "action, getters, they're all empty.",
          "zh": "actions、getters 匯入的檔案，它們全都是空的。"
        },
        {
          "id": 86,
          "start": 267.37,
          "end": 271.5,
          "en": "So here we should also export objects.",
          "zh": "所以這裡我們也應該匯出物件。"
        },
        {
          "id": 87,
          "start": 271.5,
          "end": 273.17,
          "en": "They can be empty right now",
          "zh": "它們現在可以是空的，"
        },
        {
          "id": 88,
          "start": 273.17,
          "end": 275.27,
          "en": "because we don't have any mutations",
          "zh": "因為我們還沒有任何 mutations、"
        },
        {
          "id": 89,
          "start": 275.27,
          "end": 277.12,
          "en": "or actions or getters yet,",
          "zh": "actions 或 getters，"
        },
        {
          "id": 90,
          "start": 277.12,
          "end": 281.17,
          "en": "but you should export at least an empty object in every file",
          "zh": "但每個檔案你都應該至少匯出一個空物件，"
        },
        {
          "id": 91,
          "start": 281.17,
          "end": 283.29,
          "en": "so that the imports here work,",
          "zh": "讓這裡的匯入能運作，"
        },
        {
          "id": 92,
          "start": 283.29,
          "end": 288.08299999999997,
          "en": "and we at least have empty objects in our module here.",
          "zh": "而我們這裡的 module 至少有空的物件。"
        },
        {
          "id": 93,
          "start": 289.06,
          "end": 291.54,
          "en": "Okay, so that is the first step.",
          "zh": "好，這就是第一步。"
        },
        {
          "id": 94,
          "start": 291.54,
          "end": 296.18,
          "en": "Now in the state here, in index js, in the coaches module,",
          "zh": "現在在這裡的 state 中，在 coaches module 的 index.js 裡，"
        },
        {
          "id": 95,
          "start": 296.18,
          "end": 298.54,
          "en": "I want to return my state object.",
          "zh": "我想回傳我的 state 物件。"
        },
        {
          "id": 96,
          "start": 298.54,
          "end": 302.61,
          "en": "And in here the state should be that we of course have",
          "zh": "而在這裡，state 應該是我們當然有一個"
        },
        {
          "id": 97,
          "start": 302.61,
          "end": 304.713,
          "en": "a list of coaches.",
          "zh": "coach 的清單。"
        },
        {
          "id": 98,
          "start": 306.36,
          "end": 309.44,
          "en": "And we're going to start with some dummy data here.",
          "zh": "我們會從一些 dummy data 開始。"
        },
        {
          "id": 99,
          "start": 309.44,
          "end": 311.53,
          "en": "Now you'll find that dummy data",
          "zh": "你會發現那些 dummy data"
        },
        {
          "id": 100,
          "start": 311.53,
          "end": 314.78,
          "en": "attached in the coaches js file,",
          "zh": "附在 coaches.js 檔案中，"
        },
        {
          "id": 101,
          "start": 314.78,
          "end": 316.8,
          "en": "which you can open with a text editor.",
          "zh": "你可以用文字編輯器打開它。"
        },
        {
          "id": 102,
          "start": 316.8,
          "end": 320.36,
          "en": "And in there, you'll just find an array full of coaches,",
          "zh": "在裡面，你會看到一個充滿 coaches 的陣列，"
        },
        {
          "id": 103,
          "start": 320.36,
          "end": 322.94,
          "en": "which will be my value for this coaches key",
          "zh": "它會是我在這裡 coaches state 中、"
        },
        {
          "id": 104,
          "start": 322.94,
          "end": 324.97,
          "en": "in our coaches state.",
          "zh": "這個 coaches 鍵的值。"
        },
        {
          "id": 105,
          "start": 324.97,
          "end": 328.02,
          "en": "And here I prepared two dummy coaches for you",
          "zh": "在這裡我為你準備了兩個 dummy coaches，"
        },
        {
          "id": 106,
          "start": 328.02,
          "end": 330.21,
          "en": "with some dummy IDs and data.",
          "zh": "帶有一些 dummy ID 和資料。"
        },
        {
          "id": 107,
          "start": 330.21,
          "end": 333.223,
          "en": "So did we have something on the screen right from the start.",
          "zh": "這樣我們一開始畫面上就有東西了。"
        },
        {
          "id": 108,
          "start": 336.5,
          "end": 337.92,
          "en": "Now, did we have a state?",
          "zh": "現在，我們有了 state，"
        },
        {
          "id": 109,
          "start": 337.92,
          "end": 341.31,
          "en": "I of course all the want a getter to get that state,",
          "zh": "我當然也想要一個 getter 來取得那個 state，"
        },
        {
          "id": 110,
          "start": 341.31,
          "end": 344.02,
          "en": "because as I mentioned in the Vuex module,",
          "zh": "因為正如我在 Vuex module 中提到的，"
        },
        {
          "id": 111,
          "start": 344.02,
          "end": 346.67,
          "en": "whilst you can directly access the state",
          "zh": "雖然你可以直接從你的元件內部"
        },
        {
          "id": 112,
          "start": 346.67,
          "end": 348.22,
          "en": "from inside your components,",
          "zh": "存取 state，"
        },
        {
          "id": 113,
          "start": 348.22,
          "end": 351.97,
          "en": "it is recommended that you always use getters and stat,",
          "zh": "但建議你總是使用 getters 和 state，"
        },
        {
          "id": 114,
          "start": 351.97,
          "end": 354.15,
          "en": "and we are using getters here.",
          "zh": "而我們這裡就是使用 getters。"
        },
        {
          "id": 115,
          "start": 354.15,
          "end": 357.31,
          "en": "So in the getters js file for the coaches,",
          "zh": "所以在 coaches 的 getters.js 檔案中，"
        },
        {
          "id": 116,
          "start": 357.31,
          "end": 360.8,
          "en": "I went to add a getter and that will be to coaches getter.",
          "zh": "我想新增一個 getter，那會是 coaches getter。"
        },
        {
          "id": 117,
          "start": 360.8,
          "end": 365.8,
          "en": "Let's say where we received a state we always do in getters",
          "zh": "比如說我們接收一個 state，我們在 getters 中總是這樣做，"
        },
        {
          "id": 118,
          "start": 366,
          "end": 369.22,
          "en": "and where we then return state coaches.",
          "zh": "然後我們回傳 state.coaches。"
        },
        {
          "id": 119,
          "start": 369.22,
          "end": 370.82,
          "en": "So nothing too fancy,",
          "zh": "所以沒什麼太花俏的，"
        },
        {
          "id": 120,
          "start": 370.82,
          "end": 373.42,
          "en": "no transformation or anything like that,",
          "zh": "沒有轉換或之類的東西，"
        },
        {
          "id": 121,
          "start": 373.42,
          "end": 375.943,
          "en": "but at least a getter in place now.",
          "zh": "但至少現在有一個 getter 就位了。"
        },
        {
          "id": 122,
          "start": 377.2,
          "end": 379.92,
          "en": "I will also add a second getter already though.",
          "zh": "不過我還會先加上第二個 getter。"
        },
        {
          "id": 123,
          "start": 379.92,
          "end": 382.64,
          "en": "And that's the hasCoaches getter.",
          "zh": "那就是 hasCoaches getter。"
        },
        {
          "id": 124,
          "start": 382.64,
          "end": 386.83,
          "en": "Because later in this coaches list component,",
          "zh": "因為之後在這個 coaches list 元件中，"
        },
        {
          "id": 125,
          "start": 386.83,
          "end": 390.62,
          "en": "I only wanna render this list if we have coaches.",
          "zh": "我只想在我們有 coaches 時渲染這個清單。"
        },
        {
          "id": 126,
          "start": 390.62,
          "end": 393.25,
          "en": "If we have no coaches at all,",
          "zh": "如果我們完全沒有 coaches，"
        },
        {
          "id": 127,
          "start": 393.25,
          "end": 397.17,
          "en": "which will be the case once we switched to real data",
          "zh": "這在我們從 dummy data 切換到真實資料、"
        },
        {
          "id": 128,
          "start": 397.17,
          "end": 398.61,
          "en": "away from the dummy data",
          "zh": "也就是改用真實資料之後就會發生，"
        },
        {
          "id": 129,
          "start": 398.61,
          "end": 400.75,
          "en": "and we haven't added any coaches yet,",
          "zh": "而我們還沒新增任何 coaches，"
        },
        {
          "id": 130,
          "start": 400.75,
          "end": 403.23,
          "en": "if we don't have any coaches at all,",
          "zh": "如果我們完全沒有任何 coaches，"
        },
        {
          "id": 131,
          "start": 403.23,
          "end": 404.99,
          "en": "I don't wanna show that list",
          "zh": "我就不想顯示那個清單，"
        },
        {
          "id": 132,
          "start": 404.99,
          "end": 408.11,
          "en": "because it would be an empty list anyways.",
          "zh": "因為它反正會是空的清單。"
        },
        {
          "id": 133,
          "start": 408.11,
          "end": 409.99,
          "en": "So then instead I wanna show a message",
          "zh": "所以我想改成顯示一則訊息，"
        },
        {
          "id": 134,
          "start": 409.99,
          "end": 411.853,
          "en": "like no coaches found.",
          "zh": "例如 no coaches found。"
        },
        {
          "id": 135,
          "start": 413.04,
          "end": 415.78,
          "en": "So therefore I'll add a helper getter",
          "zh": "因此我會加一個輔助 getter，"
        },
        {
          "id": 136,
          "start": 415.78,
          "end": 418.6,
          "en": "where I simply check whether we have coaches or not,",
          "zh": "我在裡面單純檢查我們有沒有 coaches，"
        },
        {
          "id": 137,
          "start": 418.6,
          "end": 421.26,
          "en": "and where I then return true or false.",
          "zh": "然後回傳 true 或 false。"
        },
        {
          "id": 138,
          "start": 421.26,
          "end": 424.26,
          "en": "So I wanna return to result of checking",
          "zh": "所以我想回傳檢查的結果，"
        },
        {
          "id": 139,
          "start": 424.26,
          "end": 426.68,
          "en": "if state coaches is truthy",
          "zh": "檢查 state.coaches 是否為 truthy"
        },
        {
          "id": 140,
          "start": 426.68,
          "end": 427.69,
          "en": "and",
          "zh": "以及"
        },
        {
          "id": 141,
          "start": 427.69,
          "end": 431.973,
          "en": "state coaches length is greater than zero.",
          "zh": "state.coaches.length 是否大於零。"
        },
        {
          "id": 142,
          "start": 433.32,
          "end": 436.245,
          "en": "This returns true if we have coaches,",
          "zh": "如果我們有 coaches，這會回傳 true，"
        },
        {
          "id": 143,
          "start": 436.245,
          "end": 438.15,
          "en": "at least one coach.",
          "zh": "至少一位 coach。"
        },
        {
          "id": 144,
          "start": 438.15,
          "end": 440.483,
          "en": "And it returns false otherwise.",
          "zh": "否則它會回傳 false。"
        },
        {
          "id": 145,
          "start": 442,
          "end": 445.05,
          "en": "And now with the getters in place, the state in place,",
          "zh": "現在 getters 就位了，state 也就位了，"
        },
        {
          "id": 146,
          "start": 445.05,
          "end": 449.69,
          "en": "we can go back to main js and import our store here",
          "zh": "我們可以回到 main.js，在這裡匯入我們的 store，"
        },
        {
          "id": 147,
          "start": 449.69,
          "end": 451.92,
          "en": "to make sure we use it in this app.",
          "zh": "確保我們在這個應用程式中使用它。"
        },
        {
          "id": 148,
          "start": 451.92,
          "end": 455.8,
          "en": "So import from the store folder index js file,",
          "zh": "所以從 store 資料夾的 index.js 檔案匯入，"
        },
        {
          "id": 149,
          "start": 455.8,
          "end": 457.19,
          "en": "and then",
          "zh": "然後"
        },
        {
          "id": 150,
          "start": 457.19,
          "end": 459.82,
          "en": "app use our store.",
          "zh": "app.use 我們的 store。"
        },
        {
          "id": 151,
          "start": 459.82,
          "end": 462.823,
          "en": "Now that Vuex store is part of this Vue app.",
          "zh": "現在那個 Vuex store 就是這個 Vue 應用程式的一部分了。"
        },
        {
          "id": 152,
          "start": 464.87,
          "end": 469.07,
          "en": "And with this, I'm getting an error, state is not defined.",
          "zh": "這樣一來，我得到一個錯誤：state is not defined。"
        },
        {
          "id": 153,
          "start": 469.07,
          "end": 472.28,
          "en": "I assume in my getters here, yes.",
          "zh": "我猜是在我這裡的 getters 中，沒錯。"
        },
        {
          "id": 154,
          "start": 472.28,
          "end": 474.09000000000003,
          "en": "In has coaches I'm using state.",
          "zh": "在 hasCoaches 中我使用了 state。"
        },
        {
          "id": 155,
          "start": 474.09000000000003,
          "end": 476.89,
          "en": "Of course, I should also accept this argument therefore.",
          "zh": "當然，因此我也應該接收這個參數。"
        },
        {
          "id": 156,
          "start": 477.776,
          "end": 480.42,
          "en": "But now with this, we're all set regarding that.",
          "zh": "但現在這樣一來，關於那部分我們都設定好了。"
        },
        {
          "id": 157,
          "start": 480.42,
          "end": 482.88,
          "en": "And we can now go to coaches list",
          "zh": "我們現在可以前往 coaches list，"
        },
        {
          "id": 158,
          "start": 482.88,
          "end": 486.67,
          "en": "and pull in our dummy data, our coaches.",
          "zh": "並把我們的 dummy data、我們的 coaches 拉進來。"
        },
        {
          "id": 159,
          "start": 486.67,
          "end": 490.04,
          "en": "So for that, we should add a script here.",
          "zh": "為此，我們應該在這裡加一個 script。"
        },
        {
          "id": 160,
          "start": 490.04,
          "end": 492.51,
          "en": "And to reach out to our coaches getter,",
          "zh": "而要取用我們的 coaches getter，"
        },
        {
          "id": 161,
          "start": 492.51,
          "end": 495.37,
          "en": "and we do this with a computer property.",
          "zh": "我們用 computed 屬性來做。"
        },
        {
          "id": 162,
          "start": 495.37,
          "end": 497.75,
          "en": "So we add to computed option here.",
          "zh": "所以我們在這裡加入 computed 選項。"
        },
        {
          "id": 163,
          "start": 497.75,
          "end": 500.25,
          "en": "And there, I will now add a computed property,",
          "zh": "在那裡，我現在會加一個 computed 屬性，"
        },
        {
          "id": 164,
          "start": 500.25,
          "end": 503.84,
          "en": "which I name filtered coaches.",
          "zh": "我把它命名為 filteredCoaches。"
        },
        {
          "id": 165,
          "start": 503.84,
          "end": 506.29,
          "en": "We are not filtering right now,",
          "zh": "我們現在還沒有在篩選，"
        },
        {
          "id": 166,
          "start": 506.29,
          "end": 509.52,
          "en": "but we soon will be once we also added",
          "zh": "但一旦我們也加入"
        },
        {
          "id": 167,
          "start": 509.52,
          "end": 511.18,
          "en": "this filter functionality.",
          "zh": "這個篩選功能，我們很快就會開始篩選。"
        },
        {
          "id": 168,
          "start": 511.18,
          "end": 514.97,
          "en": "So I will already name the computed property as such.",
          "zh": "所以我會先把這個 computed 屬性這樣命名。"
        },
        {
          "id": 169,
          "start": 514.97,
          "end": 515.96,
          "en": "But for the moment here,",
          "zh": "但目前在這裡，"
        },
        {
          "id": 170,
          "start": 515.96,
          "end": 520.78,
          "en": "I just want to return this store dollar assigned store",
          "zh": "我只想回傳 this.$store"
        },
        {
          "id": 171,
          "start": 520.78,
          "end": 524.02,
          "en": "getters, and then get the coaches",
          "zh": "getters，然後取得 coaches，"
        },
        {
          "id": 172,
          "start": 524.02,
          "end": 526.07,
          "en": "from this coaches getter.",
          "zh": "從這個 coaches getter。"
        },
        {
          "id": 173,
          "start": 526.07,
          "end": 529.11,
          "en": "Now, how do we get access to that coaches getter?",
          "zh": "現在，我們要如何存取那個 coaches getter？"
        },
        {
          "id": 174,
          "start": 529.11,
          "end": 533.86,
          "en": "It's not getters.coaches because keep in mind,",
          "zh": "它不是 getters.coaches，因為請記住，"
        },
        {
          "id": 175,
          "start": 533.86,
          "end": 536.26,
          "en": "this module is name spaced.",
          "zh": "這個 module 是有命名空間的。"
        },
        {
          "id": 176,
          "start": 536.26,
          "end": 539.17,
          "en": "So therefore we have to reach this getter",
          "zh": "因此我們必須透過這個 module 的命名空間"
        },
        {
          "id": 177,
          "start": 539.17,
          "end": 543.123,
          "en": "that belongs to this module through its namespace.",
          "zh": "來取用屬於這個 module 的 getter。"
        },
        {
          "id": 178,
          "start": 543.123,
          "end": 547.77,
          "en": "And the namespace name is defined in index js here,",
          "zh": "而那個命名空間名稱定義在這裡的 index.js，"
        },
        {
          "id": 179,
          "start": 547.77,
          "end": 550.703,
          "en": "this key, which we set up here for this module.",
          "zh": "就是我們這裡為這個 module 設定的這個鍵。"
        },
        {
          "id": 180,
          "start": 551.9,
          "end": 556.4,
          "en": "So we get access to our coaches here through getters",
          "zh": "所以我們在這裡透過 getters 存取我們的 coaches，"
        },
        {
          "id": 181,
          "start": 556.4,
          "end": 561.4,
          "en": "and then square brackets, coaches/coaches.",
          "zh": "然後用中括號，'coaches/coaches'。"
        },
        {
          "id": 182,
          "start": 561.77,
          "end": 564.9,
          "en": "The first coaches here is the namespace name.",
          "zh": "這裡第一個 coaches 是命名空間名稱。"
        },
        {
          "id": 183,
          "start": 564.9,
          "end": 568.793,
          "en": "The second coaches after the slash is the getter name.",
          "zh": "斜線後的第二個 coaches 是 getter 名稱。"
        },
        {
          "id": 184,
          "start": 570.74,
          "end": 574.4,
          "en": "This now gives us our coaches here under filtered coaches.",
          "zh": "這現在會在 filteredCoaches 下給我們我們的 coaches。"
        },
        {
          "id": 185,
          "start": 574.4,
          "end": 576.04,
          "en": "And now we can utilize them",
          "zh": "現在我們可以利用它們"
        },
        {
          "id": 186,
          "start": 576.04,
          "end": 578.6,
          "en": "to output our real list of coaches.",
          "zh": "輸出我們真正的 coaches 清單。"
        },
        {
          "id": 187,
          "start": 578.6,
          "end": 582.113,
          "en": "So here we can now render list items.",
          "zh": "所以這裡我們現在可以渲染清單項目。"
        },
        {
          "id": 188,
          "start": 583.14,
          "end": 586.46,
          "en": "And with the four, we can go through to coaches",
          "zh": "而用 v-for，我們可以走訪 coaches，"
        },
        {
          "id": 189,
          "start": 586.46,
          "end": 588.55,
          "en": "and filtered coaches,",
          "zh": "也就是 filteredCoaches，"
        },
        {
          "id": 190,
          "start": 588.55,
          "end": 593.41,
          "en": "bind the key to coach.id because every coach stored",
          "zh": "把 key 綁定到 coach.id，因為儲存在我們 store 中的"
        },
        {
          "id": 191,
          "start": 593.41,
          "end": 596.283,
          "en": "in our store here has an ID.",
          "zh": "每一位 coach 都有 ID。"
        },
        {
          "id": 192,
          "start": 598.7,
          "end": 599.533,
          "en": "And then of course,",
          "zh": "然後當然，"
        },
        {
          "id": 193,
          "start": 599.533,
          "end": 602.34,
          "en": "I'll put whatever we wanna, I'll put for the second,",
          "zh": "我會放入我們想要的，我先放入名字，"
        },
        {
          "id": 194,
          "start": 602.34,
          "end": 604.15,
          "en": "just to see whether this works.",
          "zh": "只是看看這樣能不能運作。"
        },
        {
          "id": 195,
          "start": 604.15,
          "end": 608.73,
          "en": "I'll just interpolate coach.firstName here.",
          "zh": "我會在這裡直接插值 coach.firstName。"
        },
        {
          "id": 196,
          "start": 608.73,
          "end": 609.62,
          "en": "We will of course,",
          "zh": "我們當然會，"
        },
        {
          "id": 197,
          "start": 609.62,
          "end": 611.953,
          "en": "I'll put this in a different way very soon.",
          "zh": "我很快就會用不同的方式來放這個。"
        },
        {
          "id": 198,
          "start": 615,
          "end": 618.23,
          "en": "If we now go to all coaches and reload,",
          "zh": "如果我們現在前往 all coaches 並重新載入，"
        },
        {
          "id": 199,
          "start": 618.23,
          "end": 621.073,
          "en": "we should see two coach names here.",
          "zh": "我們應該會在這裡看到兩個 coach 名字。"
        },
        {
          "id": 200,
          "start": 621.98,
          "end": 625.17,
          "en": "And that proves stat Vuex is wired up correctly",
          "zh": "這證明 Vuex 已經正確接好了，"
        },
        {
          "id": 201,
          "start": 625.17,
          "end": 627.45,
          "en": "and that we're able to access our coach data.",
          "zh": "而且我們能夠存取我們的 coach 資料。"
        },
        {
          "id": 202,
          "start": 627.45,
          "end": 630.343,
          "en": "And that of course is a great first step.",
          "zh": "那當然是很棒的第一步。"
        },
        {
          "id": 203,
          "start": 631.27,
          "end": 634.05,
          "en": "Now we can also use that other getter we set up,",
          "zh": "現在我們也可以使用我們設定的另一個 getter，"
        },
        {
          "id": 204,
          "start": 634.05,
          "end": 637.71,
          "en": "hasCoaches, to make sure we only rendered this list",
          "zh": "hasCoaches，來確保我們只在有 coaches 時"
        },
        {
          "id": 205,
          "start": 637.71,
          "end": 639.43,
          "en": "if we have coaches.",
          "zh": "才渲染這個清單。"
        },
        {
          "id": 206,
          "start": 639.43,
          "end": 641.14,
          "en": "So here on this unordered list,",
          "zh": "所以在這裡這個無序清單上，"
        },
        {
          "id": 207,
          "start": 641.14,
          "end": 643.46,
          "en": "I'll add a v-if check",
          "zh": "我會加一個 v-if 檢查，"
        },
        {
          "id": 208,
          "start": 643.46,
          "end": 647.11,
          "en": "and check if we have coaches",
          "zh": "檢查我們是否有 coaches，"
        },
        {
          "id": 209,
          "start": 648.12,
          "end": 652.3,
          "en": "and I'll add a h3 tag below that let's see",
          "zh": "我會在那下面加一個 h3 標籤，我們看看，"
        },
        {
          "id": 210,
          "start": 652.3,
          "end": 654.75,
          "en": "with v-else on it, which is the fallback.",
          "zh": "在上面加 v-else，也就是備援，"
        },
        {
          "id": 211,
          "start": 654.75,
          "end": 658.17,
          "en": "Whereas say, no coaches found in case we,",
          "zh": "並寫上 no coaches found，以防我們，"
        },
        {
          "id": 212,
          "start": 658.17,
          "end": 660.635,
          "en": "well, guess what have no coaches.",
          "zh": "嗯，你猜怎麼著，沒有 coaches。"
        },
        {
          "id": 213,
          "start": 660.635,
          "end": 662.78,
          "en": "Now adding this year however",
          "zh": "不過現在加上這個，"
        },
        {
          "id": 214,
          "start": 662.78,
          "end": 664.48,
          "en": "now implies that we need to have",
          "zh": "就意味著我們需要有一個"
        },
        {
          "id": 215,
          "start": 664.48,
          "end": 668.33,
          "en": "a hasCoaches data property, or computed property",
          "zh": "hasCoaches 的 data 屬性或 computed 屬性"
        },
        {
          "id": 216,
          "start": 668.33,
          "end": 671.07,
          "en": "in this component, which we don't have yet.",
          "zh": "在這個元件中，而我們還沒有。"
        },
        {
          "id": 217,
          "start": 671.07,
          "end": 674,
          "en": "So here in the computed of this component,",
          "zh": "所以在這個元件的 computed 中，"
        },
        {
          "id": 218,
          "start": 674,
          "end": 676.11,
          "en": "I'll add hasCoaches",
          "zh": "我會加入 hasCoaches，"
        },
        {
          "id": 219,
          "start": 676.11,
          "end": 679.26,
          "en": "because just having a getter off that name in Vuex,",
          "zh": "因為在 Vuex 中只有一個那個名稱的 getter，"
        },
        {
          "id": 220,
          "start": 679.26,
          "end": 681.13,
          "en": "of course doesn't do much.",
          "zh": "當然沒什麼作用。"
        },
        {
          "id": 221,
          "start": 681.13,
          "end": 682.24,
          "en": "It's not a way level",
          "zh": "它並不是自動地"
        },
        {
          "id": 222,
          "start": 682.24,
          "end": 685.15,
          "en": "as a computed property in every component then.",
          "zh": "在每個元件中成為 computed 屬性。"
        },
        {
          "id": 223,
          "start": 685.15,
          "end": 686.66,
          "en": "That's not how this works.",
          "zh": "這不是它運作的方式。"
        },
        {
          "id": 224,
          "start": 686.66,
          "end": 689.67,
          "en": "So we have to add a separate computed property here",
          "zh": "所以我們必須在這裡加一個獨立的 computed 屬性，"
        },
        {
          "id": 225,
          "start": 689.67,
          "end": 690.92,
          "en": "in coaches list.",
          "zh": "在 coaches list 中。"
        },
        {
          "id": 226,
          "start": 690.92,
          "end": 692.99,
          "en": "And now here we can return",
          "zh": "而現在這裡我們可以回傳"
        },
        {
          "id": 227,
          "start": 693.89,
          "end": 697.5,
          "en": "this store getters.",
          "zh": "this.$store.getters。"
        },
        {
          "id": 228,
          "start": 697.5,
          "end": 699.43,
          "en": "And then again, access coaches,",
          "zh": "然後再次存取 coaches，"
        },
        {
          "id": 229,
          "start": 699.43,
          "end": 702.11,
          "en": "which is the namespace/hasCoaches,",
          "zh": "也就是 'coaches/hasCoaches'，"
        },
        {
          "id": 230,
          "start": 702.11,
          "end": 703.36,
          "en": "which is the getter name.",
          "zh": "這是 getter 名稱。"
        },
        {
          "id": 231,
          "start": 705.1,
          "end": 706.79,
          "en": "Now with that, let's test this",
          "zh": "現在有了這個，讓我們測試一下，"
        },
        {
          "id": 232,
          "start": 706.79,
          "end": 709.85,
          "en": "and temporarily remove the coaches",
          "zh": "暫時把 coaches 從我們 module 的"
        },
        {
          "id": 233,
          "start": 709.85,
          "end": 714.17,
          "en": "here from our coaches array in the module.",
          "zh": "coaches 陣列中移除。"
        },
        {
          "id": 234,
          "start": 714.17,
          "end": 716.523,
          "en": "And we should see no coaches found now.",
          "zh": "我們現在應該會看到 no coaches found。"
        },
        {
          "id": 235,
          "start": 717.88,
          "end": 720.84,
          "en": "And if I bring back those coaches here in the module",
          "zh": "如果我把那些 coaches 放回這裡的 module 中"
        },
        {
          "id": 236,
          "start": 720.84,
          "end": 723.98,
          "en": "and save this, we see the coach data again.",
          "zh": "並儲存，我們又會看到 coach 資料。"
        },
        {
          "id": 237,
          "start": 723.98,
          "end": 725.22,
          "en": "So now that's working.",
          "zh": "所以現在這樣可以運作。"
        },
        {
          "id": 238,
          "start": 725.22,
          "end": 727.36,
          "en": "Now that dummy data is wired up,",
          "zh": "現在 dummy data 已經接好了，"
        },
        {
          "id": 239,
          "start": 727.36,
          "end": 730.89,
          "en": "and with that we can go back to working on our components,",
          "zh": "這樣一來我們就可以回去處理我們的元件，"
        },
        {
          "id": 240,
          "start": 730.89,
          "end": 733.193,
          "en": "and also improving the styling here.",
          "zh": "也改善這裡的樣式。"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "21879914",
      "title": "Working on the Coaches List and List Items",
      "lectureOrder": 242,
      "videoOrder": 214,
      "sourceHash": "11eebe4077b123d7f7c38d33ce787ed8551a14ad0eb31c6277c8d53d2aa4290c",
      "cues": [
        {
          "id": 1,
          "start": 2.19,
          "end": 3.7,
          "en": "So let's now work on the components",
          "zh": "所以現在讓我們來處理元件，"
        },
        {
          "id": 2,
          "start": 3.7,
          "end": 4.533,
          "en": "we need here.",
          "zh": "我們這裡需要的元件。"
        },
        {
          "id": 3,
          "start": 4.533,
          "end": 8.06,
          "en": "And I'm going to start with the coach items here.",
          "zh": "我會從這裡的 coach items 開始。"
        },
        {
          "id": 4,
          "start": 8.06,
          "end": 10.21,
          "en": "For that I wanna use a separate component,",
          "zh": "為此我想用一個獨立的元件，"
        },
        {
          "id": 5,
          "start": 10.21,
          "end": 13.76,
          "en": "because we'll have quite a lot of markup and styling",
          "zh": "因為我們會有相當多的標記和樣式"
        },
        {
          "id": 6,
          "start": 13.76,
          "end": 17.26,
          "en": "related to this part, related to this list items,",
          "zh": "與這部分相關、與這些清單項目相關，"
        },
        {
          "id": 7,
          "start": 17.26,
          "end": 20.23,
          "en": "and I don't wanna put that all into coach's list,",
          "zh": "而我不想把那些全部放進 coaches list，"
        },
        {
          "id": 8,
          "start": 20.23,
          "end": 22.48,
          "en": "even though that of course would work.",
          "zh": "雖然那樣當然也行得通。"
        },
        {
          "id": 9,
          "start": 22.48,
          "end": 24.27,
          "en": "I mean, technically you can build",
          "zh": "我的意思是，技術上你可以建立"
        },
        {
          "id": 10,
          "start": 24.27,
          "end": 27.24,
          "en": "an entire Vue app with just one component,",
          "zh": "一整個 Vue 應用程式只靠一個元件，"
        },
        {
          "id": 11,
          "start": 27.24,
          "end": 30.5,
          "en": "but the idea behind components is to split your code",
          "zh": "但元件背後的想法是把你的程式碼拆成"
        },
        {
          "id": 12,
          "start": 30.5,
          "end": 33.31,
          "en": "into smaller reusable pieces.",
          "zh": "更小、可重複使用的片段。"
        },
        {
          "id": 13,
          "start": 33.31,
          "end": 35.46,
          "en": "Therefore, in components,",
          "zh": "因此，在 components 裡，"
        },
        {
          "id": 14,
          "start": 35.46,
          "end": 38.12,
          "en": "I'll add a new sub-folder, coaches,",
          "zh": "我會新增一個子資料夾 coaches，"
        },
        {
          "id": 15,
          "start": 38.12,
          "end": 42.46,
          "en": "where all the coach-related components should go in.",
          "zh": "所有與 coach 相關的元件都應該放進去。"
        },
        {
          "id": 16,
          "start": 42.46,
          "end": 46.053,
          "en": "For example, the CoachItem.vue file.",
          "zh": "例如 CoachItem.vue 檔案。"
        },
        {
          "id": 17,
          "start": 48.86,
          "end": 51.43,
          "en": "Now, in this CoachItem.vue file,",
          "zh": "現在，在這個 CoachItem.vue 檔案中，"
        },
        {
          "id": 18,
          "start": 51.43,
          "end": 53.85,
          "en": "I want to define my template, which is a list item,",
          "zh": "我想定義我的 template，它是一個清單項目，"
        },
        {
          "id": 19,
          "start": 53.85,
          "end": 55.57,
          "en": "or which holds a list item.",
          "zh": "或者說它包含一個清單項目。"
        },
        {
          "id": 20,
          "start": 55.57,
          "end": 58.77,
          "en": "And in there, I now wanna output all that coach data.",
          "zh": "在裡面，我現在想輸出所有那些 coach 資料。"
        },
        {
          "id": 21,
          "start": 58.77,
          "end": 63.53,
          "en": "For example, in a h3 tag, the name of the coach.",
          "zh": "例如在一個 h3 標籤中，輸出 coach 的名字。"
        },
        {
          "id": 22,
          "start": 63.53,
          "end": 67.17,
          "en": "Here, I will interpolate the full name.",
          "zh": "這裡我會插值 full name。"
        },
        {
          "id": 23,
          "start": 67.17,
          "end": 68.53999999999999,
          "en": "And this doesn't exist yet,",
          "zh": "而這個還不存在，"
        },
        {
          "id": 24,
          "start": 68.53999999999999,
          "end": 70.74,
          "en": "but we'll add the logic to make sure",
          "zh": "但我們會加入邏輯來確保"
        },
        {
          "id": 25,
          "start": 70.74,
          "end": 73.553,
          "en": "we will have such a full name property at the end.",
          "zh": "最後我們會有這樣的 full name 屬性。"
        },
        {
          "id": 26,
          "start": 74.5,
          "end": 76.85300000000001,
          "en": "Then below that, a h4 tag,",
          "zh": "然後在那下面，一個 h4 標籤，"
        },
        {
          "id": 27,
          "start": 78.68,
          "end": 80.82,
          "en": "and I recommend that you use the same tags",
          "zh": "而我建議你使用相同的標籤，"
        },
        {
          "id": 28,
          "start": 80.82,
          "end": 84.19,
          "en": "so that the styling which I provide works for you as well.",
          "zh": "這樣我提供的樣式也能對你生效。"
        },
        {
          "id": 29,
          "start": 84.19,
          "end": 85.64,
          "en": "Technically, of course, you can use",
          "zh": "當然，技術上你可以使用"
        },
        {
          "id": 30,
          "start": 85.64,
          "end": 88.6,
          "en": "any tags you want and any structure you want,",
          "zh": "任何你想要的標籤和任何你想要的結構，"
        },
        {
          "id": 31,
          "start": 88.6,
          "end": 91.63,
          "en": "but here in the h4 tag, I wanna output dollar,",
          "zh": "但在這裡的 h4 標籤中，我想輸出 dollar，"
        },
        {
          "id": 32,
          "start": 91.63,
          "end": 94.25999999999999,
          "en": "then the rate which we get for this coach,",
          "zh": "然後是我們為這位 coach 取得的 rate，"
        },
        {
          "id": 33,
          "start": 94.25999999999999,
          "end": 98.763,
          "en": "/hour to show the rate this coach charges.",
          "zh": "/hour，來顯示這位 coach 收取的費率。"
        },
        {
          "id": 34,
          "start": 100.53999999999999,
          "end": 103.89,
          "en": "Then I will actually add a div here,",
          "zh": "接著我實際上會在這裡加一個 div，"
        },
        {
          "id": 35,
          "start": 103.89,
          "end": 107.7,
          "en": "where I wanna output the areas of expertise of that coach.",
          "zh": "我想在這裡輸出那位 coach 的專業領域。"
        },
        {
          "id": 36,
          "start": 107.7,
          "end": 109.71000000000001,
          "en": "Because the dummy data I gave you",
          "zh": "因為我給你的 dummy data"
        },
        {
          "id": 37,
          "start": 109.71000000000001,
          "end": 113.57,
          "en": "already has this areas property,",
          "zh": "已經有這個 areas 屬性，"
        },
        {
          "id": 38,
          "start": 113.57,
          "end": 117.22,
          "en": "which holds an array with some clearly defined keys,",
          "zh": "它持有一個帶有一些明確定義鍵的陣列，"
        },
        {
          "id": 39,
          "start": 117.22,
          "end": 120.17,
          "en": "frontend, backend, and career,",
          "zh": "frontend、backend 和 career，"
        },
        {
          "id": 40,
          "start": 120.17,
          "end": 121.86,
          "en": "which are the areas of expertise",
          "zh": "這些是我在這個應用程式中"
        },
        {
          "id": 41,
          "start": 121.86,
          "end": 123.423,
          "en": "I wanna support in this app,",
          "zh": "想支援的專業領域，"
        },
        {
          "id": 42,
          "start": 124.51,
          "end": 126.98,
          "en": "where a coach can be an expert.",
          "zh": "也就是 coach 可以成為專家的領域。"
        },
        {
          "id": 43,
          "start": 126.98,
          "end": 129.07,
          "en": "I'm an expert in all these areas, of course.",
          "zh": "當然，我是所有這些領域的專家。"
        },
        {
          "id": 44,
          "start": 129.07,
          "end": 132.243,
          "en": "Julie, for example, is an expert in career and frontend.",
          "zh": "例如 Julie 就是 career 和 frontend 的專家。"
        },
        {
          "id": 45,
          "start": 133.81,
          "end": 137.92000000000002,
          "en": "And I wanna output that here in CoachItem in that div.",
          "zh": "我想在 CoachItem 的這個 div 中輸出它。"
        },
        {
          "id": 46,
          "start": 137.92000000000002,
          "end": 140.25,
          "en": "Here, I wanna go through these areas",
          "zh": "這裡我想走訪這些 areas，"
        },
        {
          "id": 47,
          "start": 140.25,
          "end": 143.67000000000002,
          "en": "and render a batch for every area,",
          "zh": "為每個 area 渲染一個 badge，"
        },
        {
          "id": 48,
          "start": 143.67000000000002,
          "end": 147.41,
          "en": "so to show which areas of expertise this coach has.",
          "zh": "用來顯示這位 coach 有哪些專業領域。"
        },
        {
          "id": 49,
          "start": 147.41,
          "end": 150.38,
          "en": "For the moment, I'll simply add a span here,",
          "zh": "目前我會在這裡簡單加一個 span，"
        },
        {
          "id": 50,
          "start": 150.38,
          "end": 155.38,
          "en": "and add v-for on that to go through the area in areas,",
          "zh": "並在它上面加 v-for 來走訪 area in areas，"
        },
        {
          "id": 51,
          "start": 155.5,
          "end": 159.35,
          "en": "so to go through all the areas of expertise of a coach,",
          "zh": "藉此走訪一位 coach 的所有專業領域，"
        },
        {
          "id": 52,
          "start": 159.35,
          "end": 162.99,
          "en": "add the key, which is the area itself,",
          "zh": "加上 key，也就是 area 本身，"
        },
        {
          "id": 53,
          "start": 162.99,
          "end": 164.85,
          "en": "because it's unique anyways,",
          "zh": "因為它本來就是唯一的，"
        },
        {
          "id": 54,
          "start": 164.85,
          "end": 168.85,
          "en": "a coach can't be an expert in the same area twice.",
          "zh": "一位 coach 不可能在同一領域專精兩次。"
        },
        {
          "id": 55,
          "start": 168.85,
          "end": 171.59300000000002,
          "en": "And I then simply want to,",
          "zh": "然後我只想，"
        },
        {
          "id": 56,
          "start": 172.6,
          "end": 176.163,
          "en": "for the moment, output my area like this.",
          "zh": "目前就這樣輸出我的 area。"
        },
        {
          "id": 57,
          "start": 177.9,
          "end": 180.56,
          "en": "This will also become a separate component in the future,",
          "zh": "這在未來也會變成一個獨立的元件，"
        },
        {
          "id": 58,
          "start": 180.56,
          "end": 182.82,
          "en": "but for the moment I'll leave it like this.",
          "zh": "但目前我就先這樣保留。"
        },
        {
          "id": 59,
          "start": 182.82,
          "end": 187.82,
          "en": "And then below that I'll have a div with a class of actions",
          "zh": "然後在那下面，我會有一個 class 為 actions 的 div，"
        },
        {
          "id": 60,
          "start": 190.33,
          "end": 193.33,
          "en": "where I wanna render two buttons in the end,",
          "zh": "最後我想在裡面渲染兩個按鈕，"
        },
        {
          "id": 61,
          "start": 193.33,
          "end": 195.73,
          "en": "or two links, we could say.",
          "zh": "或者可以說是兩個連結。"
        },
        {
          "id": 62,
          "start": 195.73,
          "end": 199.31,
          "en": "One to contact the coach, and to, therefore,",
          "zh": "一個用來聯絡 coach，因此"
        },
        {
          "id": 63,
          "start": 199.31,
          "end": 201.9,
          "en": "go to this contact route,",
          "zh": "前往這個 contact 路由，"
        },
        {
          "id": 64,
          "start": 201.9,
          "end": 205.14,
          "en": "and one to view the details of a coach",
          "zh": "另一個用來檢視 coach 的詳細資料"
        },
        {
          "id": 65,
          "start": 205.14,
          "end": 206.653,
          "en": "and go to this detail route.",
          "zh": "並前往這個 detail 路由。"
        },
        {
          "id": 66,
          "start": 207.69,
          "end": 211.563,
          "en": "So therefore here I'll add a router link,",
          "zh": "所以在這裡我會加一個 router link，"
        },
        {
          "id": 67,
          "start": 212.84,
          "end": 215.85,
          "en": "like this, and on the first router link,",
          "zh": "像這樣，而在第一個 router link 上，"
        },
        {
          "id": 68,
          "start": 215.85,
          "end": 220.85,
          "en": "we're going to go to /coaches/ and then the coach ID.",
          "zh": "我們要前往 /coaches/，然後接 coach 的 ID。"
        },
        {
          "id": 69,
          "start": 223.72,
          "end": 225.17000000000002,
          "en": "So that should be dynamic.",
          "zh": "所以那應該是動態的。"
        },
        {
          "id": 70,
          "start": 225.17000000000002,
          "end": 227.24,
          "en": "For the moment I'll hard-code it though.",
          "zh": "不過目前我會先把它寫死。"
        },
        {
          "id": 71,
          "start": 227.24,
          "end": 230.69,
          "en": "/contact and say Contact here.",
          "zh": "接 /contact，然後在這裡寫上 Contact。"
        },
        {
          "id": 72,
          "start": 230.69,
          "end": 233.78,
          "en": "And the second link will then show us the details,",
          "zh": "第二個連結則會向我們顯示詳細資料，"
        },
        {
          "id": 73,
          "start": 233.78,
          "end": 236.02,
          "en": "so I will say View Details here,",
          "zh": "所以我會在這裡寫上 View Details，"
        },
        {
          "id": 74,
          "start": 236.02,
          "end": 240.563,
          "en": "and there, I wanna go to just /coaches/ that coach ID.",
          "zh": "而在那裡，我想前往 /coaches/ 加上那個 coach ID。"
        },
        {
          "id": 75,
          "start": 241.5,
          "end": 243.37,
          "en": "Again, I'll soon make this dynamic,",
          "zh": "同樣地，我很快就會把這個改成動態的，"
        },
        {
          "id": 76,
          "start": 243.37,
          "end": 246.203,
          "en": "because, of course, the ID shouldn't be hard-coded here.",
          "zh": "因為當然，ID 不應該在這裡被寫死。"
        },
        {
          "id": 77,
          "start": 247.3,
          "end": 249.4,
          "en": "That's the general markup.",
          "zh": "這就是大致的標記。"
        },
        {
          "id": 78,
          "start": 249.4,
          "end": 250.96,
          "en": "Now, for the styling,",
          "zh": "現在，關於樣式，"
        },
        {
          "id": 79,
          "start": 250.96,
          "end": 254.3,
          "en": "we're going to use some scoped CSS style,",
          "zh": "我們會使用一些 scoped CSS 樣式，"
        },
        {
          "id": 80,
          "start": 254.3,
          "end": 257.45,
          "en": "and attached you'll find the Coach Item CSS file,",
          "zh": "附件中你會找到 Coach Item CSS 檔案，"
        },
        {
          "id": 81,
          "start": 257.45,
          "end": 259.75,
          "en": "which contains those prepared styles,",
          "zh": "它包含那些準備好的樣式，"
        },
        {
          "id": 82,
          "start": 259.75,
          "end": 262.603,
          "en": "which you can simply paste between your style tags.",
          "zh": "你可以直接把它們貼到你的 style 標籤之間。"
        },
        {
          "id": 83,
          "start": 265.4,
          "end": 268.99,
          "en": "And with that added, we can add a script here,",
          "zh": "加上之後，我們可以在這裡加一個 script，"
        },
        {
          "id": 84,
          "start": 268.99,
          "end": 272.25,
          "en": "and now make sure that this coach item works.",
          "zh": "並確保這個 coach item 能運作。"
        },
        {
          "id": 85,
          "start": 272.25,
          "end": 275.7,
          "en": "The plan is to use this coach item in a coach list.",
          "zh": "計畫是在一個 coach list 中使用這個 coach item。"
        },
        {
          "id": 86,
          "start": 275.7,
          "end": 277.793,
          "en": "So we will receive all the data we need",
          "zh": "所以我們最後會透過 props"
        },
        {
          "id": 87,
          "start": 277.793,
          "end": 279.83,
          "en": "through props in the end,",
          "zh": "接收我們需要的所有資料，"
        },
        {
          "id": 88,
          "start": 279.83,
          "end": 282.68,
          "en": "because we're going to render the coach item here.",
          "zh": "因為我們要在這裡渲染 coach item。"
        },
        {
          "id": 89,
          "start": 282.68,
          "end": 284.76,
          "en": "Here we have all the coach data,",
          "zh": "這裡我們有所有的 coach 資料，"
        },
        {
          "id": 90,
          "start": 284.76,
          "end": 287.14,
          "en": "so we can then pass the coach data,",
          "zh": "所以我們可以把 coach 資料，"
        },
        {
          "id": 91,
          "start": 287.14,
          "end": 290.68,
          "en": "which we need in coach item, through props.",
          "zh": "也就是 coach item 裡需要的資料，透過 props 傳進去。"
        },
        {
          "id": 92,
          "start": 290.68,
          "end": 292.08,
          "en": "And we would do it like this",
          "zh": "我們會這樣做，"
        },
        {
          "id": 93,
          "start": 292.08,
          "end": 295.05,
          "en": "because the data for a specific coach,",
          "zh": "因為某位特定 coach 的資料，"
        },
        {
          "id": 94,
          "start": 295.05,
          "end": 296.8,
          "en": "especially in such a list,",
          "zh": "尤其是在這樣的清單中，"
        },
        {
          "id": 95,
          "start": 296.8,
          "end": 300.04,
          "en": "is of course not managed with Vuex.",
          "zh": "當然不是用 Vuex 管理的。"
        },
        {
          "id": 96,
          "start": 300.04,
          "end": 303.65,
          "en": "This is not application wide state or anything like that.",
          "zh": "這不是應用程式範圍的 state 或之類的東西。"
        },
        {
          "id": 97,
          "start": 303.65,
          "end": 307.04,
          "en": "It's really just internal local state",
          "zh": "它真的只是內部的區域 state，"
        },
        {
          "id": 98,
          "start": 307.04,
          "end": 310.34,
          "en": "in this loop here, in this v-for loop.",
          "zh": "在這個迴圈裡，在這個 v-for 迴圈裡。"
        },
        {
          "id": 99,
          "start": 310.34,
          "end": 313.483,
          "en": "And therefore that is a clear case for props.",
          "zh": "因此，這是 props 的明確使用情境。"
        },
        {
          "id": 100,
          "start": 314.78,
          "end": 317.46,
          "en": "Hence here we'll get some props,",
          "zh": "所以在這裡我們會接收一些 props，"
        },
        {
          "id": 101,
          "start": 317.46,
          "end": 319.42,
          "en": "and I want the ID of the coach,",
          "zh": "我要 coach 的 ID，"
        },
        {
          "id": 102,
          "start": 319.42,
          "end": 322.83,
          "en": "we need that to construct this link.",
          "zh": "我們需要它來建構這個連結。"
        },
        {
          "id": 103,
          "start": 322.83,
          "end": 326.693,
          "en": "I want the first name and the last name,",
          "zh": "我要 first name 和 last name，"
        },
        {
          "id": 104,
          "start": 328.13,
          "end": 332.013,
          "en": "I want to have the rate and the areas of expertise.",
          "zh": "我要有 rate 和專業領域。"
        },
        {
          "id": 105,
          "start": 333.55,
          "end": 336.73,
          "en": "And then we can add a couple of computed properties here",
          "zh": "然後我們可以在這裡加幾個 computed 屬性，"
        },
        {
          "id": 106,
          "start": 336.73,
          "end": 338.74,
          "en": "to make our life easier.",
          "zh": "讓我們的日子輕鬆一點。"
        },
        {
          "id": 107,
          "start": 338.74,
          "end": 341.02,
          "en": "For example, for the full name,",
          "zh": "例如，為了 full name，"
        },
        {
          "id": 108,
          "start": 341.02,
          "end": 344.343,
          "en": "which of course is a combination of first and last name,",
          "zh": "它當然是 first name 和 last name 的組合，"
        },
        {
          "id": 109,
          "start": 345.19,
          "end": 348.78,
          "en": "for that, I'll add a full name computed property here",
          "zh": "為此，我會在這裡加一個 fullName computed 屬性，"
        },
        {
          "id": 110,
          "start": 348.78,
          "end": 353.78,
          "en": "and return this.firstName + a blank + this.lastName,",
          "zh": "並回傳 this.firstName + 一個空白 + this.lastName，"
        },
        {
          "id": 111,
          "start": 355.08,
          "end": 356.93,
          "en": "but also maybe for those links,",
          "zh": "但也許也為那些連結，"
        },
        {
          "id": 112,
          "start": 356.93,
          "end": 359.59000000000003,
          "en": "which shouldn't be hard-coded.",
          "zh": "它們不應該被寫死。"
        },
        {
          "id": 113,
          "start": 359.59000000000003,
          "end": 362.257,
          "en": "Here we could add a coachContactLink",
          "zh": "這裡我們可以加一個 coachContactLink"
        },
        {
          "id": 114,
          "start": 364.27,
          "end": 367.23,
          "en": "computed property, where we return",
          "zh": "computed 屬性，我們在其中回傳"
        },
        {
          "id": 115,
          "start": 370.05,
          "end": 375.05,
          "en": "/coaches/ and then the ID.",
          "zh": "/coaches/，然後接 ID。"
        },
        {
          "id": 116,
          "start": 377.26,
          "end": 379.82,
          "en": "So this ID refers to this ID prop",
          "zh": "所以這個 ID 指的是這個 ID prop，"
        },
        {
          "id": 117,
          "start": 379.82,
          "end": 383.32,
          "en": "which we're getting, plus /contact.",
          "zh": "也就是我們接收到的，再加上 /contact。"
        },
        {
          "id": 118,
          "start": 383.32,
          "end": 385.09,
          "en": "This will then construct a path",
          "zh": "這會建構出一條路徑，"
        },
        {
          "id": 119,
          "start": 385.09,
          "end": 390.09,
          "en": "like /coaches/c1/contact, for example,",
          "zh": "例如像 /coaches/c1/contact，"
        },
        {
          "id": 120,
          "start": 391.43,
          "end": 395.37,
          "en": "and another computed property, the coachDetailsLink,",
          "zh": "還有另一個 computed 屬性 coachDetailsLink，"
        },
        {
          "id": 121,
          "start": 397.25,
          "end": 402.25,
          "en": "where I wanna return /coaches/ then again the ID,",
          "zh": "我想回傳 /coaches/，然後再接一次 ID，"
        },
        {
          "id": 122,
          "start": 404.36,
          "end": 407.08,
          "en": "but then slash nothing, because here we just want",
          "zh": "但後面不加東西，因為這裡我們只想要"
        },
        {
          "id": 123,
          "start": 407.08,
          "end": 409.733,
          "en": "to go to something like this.",
          "zh": "前往像這樣的東西。"
        },
        {
          "id": 124,
          "start": 411.5,
          "end": 414.1,
          "en": "Now we can also replace /coaches here,",
          "zh": "現在我們也可以把這裡的 /coaches 換掉，"
        },
        {
          "id": 125,
          "start": 414.1,
          "end": 416.81,
          "en": "if we want to, it's not necessary,",
          "zh": "如果我們想的話，這並非必要，"
        },
        {
          "id": 126,
          "start": 416.81,
          "end": 419.49,
          "en": "but to make this component a bit more flexible",
          "zh": "但為了讓這個元件更有彈性，"
        },
        {
          "id": 127,
          "start": 419.49,
          "end": 422.8,
          "en": "in case we should ever change this /coaches path",
          "zh": "以防我們哪天把這個 /coaches 路徑"
        },
        {
          "id": 128,
          "start": 422.8,
          "end": 426.467,
          "en": "to a different one, we can use this.$route.path",
          "zh": "改成別的路徑，我們可以用 this.$route.path"
        },
        {
          "id": 129,
          "start": 426.467,
          "end": 430.56,
          "en": "+ '/' to use whatever the current path is",
          "zh": "加上 '/'，來使用目前的任何路徑"
        },
        {
          "id": 130,
          "start": 430.56,
          "end": 433.683,
          "en": "as a starting point to then build a longer path.",
          "zh": "當作起點，然後建構出更長的路徑。"
        },
        {
          "id": 131,
          "start": 434.68,
          "end": 437.69,
          "en": "This is totally optional,",
          "zh": "這完全是選擇性的，"
        },
        {
          "id": 132,
          "start": 437.69,
          "end": 440.57,
          "en": "but it ensures that if we ever change our path",
          "zh": "但它能確保如果我們哪天把路徑"
        },
        {
          "id": 133,
          "start": 440.57,
          "end": 445.57,
          "en": "from /coaches to something else in our route config,",
          "zh": "在我們的 route config 中從 /coaches 改成別的，"
        },
        {
          "id": 134,
          "start": 445.9,
          "end": 447.87,
          "en": "we don't have to adjust everything",
          "zh": "我們就不必調整"
        },
        {
          "id": 135,
          "start": 447.87,
          "end": 449.92,
          "en": "in this specific component.",
          "zh": "這個特定元件中的所有東西。"
        },
        {
          "id": 136,
          "start": 449.92,
          "end": 451.62,
          "en": "So that's why I'm doing this here.",
          "zh": "這就是我這裡這麼做的原因。"
        },
        {
          "id": 137,
          "start": 453.17,
          "end": 455.19,
          "en": "And now it's the coachContactLink,",
          "zh": "而現在是 coachContactLink，"
        },
        {
          "id": 138,
          "start": 455.19,
          "end": 457.71,
          "en": "which I wanna bind to to here.",
          "zh": "我想用 to 綁定到這裡。"
        },
        {
          "id": 139,
          "start": 457.71,
          "end": 462.697,
          "en": "So I wanna bind to with a colon to coachContactLink",
          "zh": "所以我想用冒號把 to 綁定到 coachContactLink，"
        },
        {
          "id": 140,
          "start": 463.73,
          "end": 467.9,
          "en": "and bind to here with a colon to coachDetailsLink.",
          "zh": "並用冒號把這裡的 to 綁定到 coachDetailsLink。"
        },
        {
          "id": 141,
          "start": 469.40999999999997,
          "end": 470.35,
          "en": "And with that, we should have",
          "zh": "這樣一來，我們應該就有"
        },
        {
          "id": 142,
          "start": 470.35,
          "end": 472.783,
          "en": "a reusable coach item component.",
          "zh": "一個可重複使用的 coach item 元件。"
        },
        {
          "id": 143,
          "start": 474.36,
          "end": 478.813,
          "en": "Now back in the coaches list component here,",
          "zh": "現在回到這裡的 coaches list 元件，"
        },
        {
          "id": 144,
          "start": 479.9,
          "end": 482.27,
          "en": "I will replace this list item",
          "zh": "我會把這個清單項目"
        },
        {
          "id": 145,
          "start": 482.27,
          "end": 487.22,
          "en": "with my coach item component, which we just created.",
          "zh": "換成我們剛建立的 coach item 元件。"
        },
        {
          "id": 146,
          "start": 487.22,
          "end": 489.28,
          "en": "But, of course, for that, we first of all need",
          "zh": "但當然，為此我們首先需要"
        },
        {
          "id": 147,
          "start": 489.28,
          "end": 492.56,
          "en": "to register this component, so that Vue knows it.",
          "zh": "註冊這個元件，讓 Vue 知道它。"
        },
        {
          "id": 148,
          "start": 492.56,
          "end": 495.87,
          "en": "And of course it will be a local component in coaches list",
          "zh": "當然它會是 coaches list 中的區域元件，"
        },
        {
          "id": 149,
          "start": 495.87,
          "end": 497.74,
          "en": "because we only use it there.",
          "zh": "因為我們只在那裡使用它。"
        },
        {
          "id": 150,
          "start": 497.74,
          "end": 502.53,
          "en": "So I will import CoachItem from going up one level,",
          "zh": "所以我會 import CoachItem，往上走一層，"
        },
        {
          "id": 151,
          "start": 502.53,
          "end": 506.55,
          "en": "going up another level, because we're in the coaches folder",
          "zh": "再往上走一層，因為我們在 coaches 資料夾，"
        },
        {
          "id": 152,
          "start": 506.55,
          "end": 507.79,
          "en": "in the pages folder.",
          "zh": "也就是 pages 資料夾裡。"
        },
        {
          "id": 153,
          "start": 507.79,
          "end": 510.2,
          "en": "And then diving into the components folder,",
          "zh": "然後進入 components 資料夾，"
        },
        {
          "id": 154,
          "start": 510.2,
          "end": 513.223,
          "en": "going to coaches, going to CoachItem.vue,",
          "zh": "前往 coaches，前往 CoachItem.vue，"
        },
        {
          "id": 155,
          "start": 514.2,
          "end": 517.97,
          "en": "and here in this Vue components config object here,",
          "zh": "而在這裡這個 Vue components 設定物件中，"
        },
        {
          "id": 156,
          "start": 517.97,
          "end": 522.97,
          "en": "we add components and add our CoachItem component here.",
          "zh": "我們加入 components，並在這裡加入我們的 CoachItem 元件。"
        },
        {
          "id": 157,
          "start": 523.851,
          "end": 526.95,
          "en": "And with that, we can use it like this in the template.",
          "zh": "這樣一來，我們就能在 template 中這樣使用它。"
        },
        {
          "id": 158,
          "start": 526.95,
          "end": 530.33,
          "en": "And here, of course, we now want to loop with v-for.",
          "zh": "而在這裡，我們現在當然想用 v-for 迴圈。"
        },
        {
          "id": 159,
          "start": 530.33,
          "end": 532.907,
          "en": "So coach in filteredCoaches,",
          "zh": "所以是 coach in filteredCoaches，"
        },
        {
          "id": 160,
          "start": 534.25,
          "end": 536.6,
          "en": "bind the key to coach.id,",
          "zh": "把 key 綁定到 coach.id，"
        },
        {
          "id": 161,
          "start": 536.6,
          "end": 539.38,
          "en": "but now all the paths, all the other props",
          "zh": "但現在是所有的路徑、所有其他 props，"
        },
        {
          "id": 162,
          "start": 539.38,
          "end": 540.81,
          "en": "which we need here.",
          "zh": "我們這裡需要的。"
        },
        {
          "id": 163,
          "start": 540.81,
          "end": 545.81,
          "en": "So for example the ID, bind it to coach.id again,",
          "zh": "例如 ID，再次把它綁定到 coach.id，"
        },
        {
          "id": 164,
          "start": 545.81,
          "end": 548.33,
          "en": "then pass in the first name.",
          "zh": "然後傳入 first name。"
        },
        {
          "id": 165,
          "start": 548.33,
          "end": 552.683,
          "en": "So first-name and bind that to coach.firstName,",
          "zh": "所以是 first-name，並把它綁定到 coach.firstName，"
        },
        {
          "id": 166,
          "start": 556.79,
          "end": 559.79,
          "en": "we format that to make it a bit easier to read,",
          "zh": "我們這樣排版是為了讓它更容易閱讀，"
        },
        {
          "id": 167,
          "start": 559.79,
          "end": 562.01,
          "en": "bind the last name, by the way,",
          "zh": "綁定 last name，順帶一提，"
        },
        {
          "id": 168,
          "start": 562.01,
          "end": 563.54,
          "en": "I'm using this Kebab case here",
          "zh": "我在這裡使用的是 kebab case，"
        },
        {
          "id": 169,
          "start": 563.54,
          "end": 565.873,
          "en": "as I explained it earlier in the course,",
          "zh": "就像我在課程前面說明過的，"
        },
        {
          "id": 170,
          "start": 567.29,
          "end": 568.893,
          "en": "and bind this to coach.lastName.",
          "zh": "並把它綁定到 coach.lastName。"
        },
        {
          "id": 171,
          "start": 571.25,
          "end": 574.26,
          "en": "And then bind the rate to coach.rate,",
          "zh": "然後把 rate 綁定到 coach.rate，"
        },
        {
          "id": 172,
          "start": 574.26,
          "end": 579.26,
          "en": "sorry, hourlyRate, because on our coach data,",
          "zh": "抱歉，是 hourlyRate，因為在我們的 coach 資料中，"
        },
        {
          "id": 173,
          "start": 579.39,
          "end": 581.65,
          "en": "if we have a look at that in the state,",
          "zh": "如果我們在 state 中看一下，"
        },
        {
          "id": 174,
          "start": 581.65,
          "end": 584.79,
          "en": "it's the hourly rate property, which holds the rate.",
          "zh": "它是 hourlyRate 屬性，裡面持有費率。"
        },
        {
          "id": 175,
          "start": 584.79,
          "end": 589,
          "en": "So hourly rate is what we have to access here",
          "zh": "所以 hourlyRate 就是我們在這裡、"
        },
        {
          "id": 176,
          "start": 590.45,
          "end": 592.24,
          "en": "in coaches list.",
          "zh": "在 coaches list 中必須存取的。"
        },
        {
          "id": 177,
          "start": 592.24,
          "end": 596.403,
          "en": "And bind the areas to coach.areas.",
          "zh": "並把 areas 綁定到 coach.areas。"
        },
        {
          "id": 178,
          "start": 597.56,
          "end": 599.53,
          "en": "And if we do that and save it,",
          "zh": "如果我們這樣做並儲存，"
        },
        {
          "id": 179,
          "start": 599.53,
          "end": 601.85,
          "en": "we should see these coaches.",
          "zh": "我們應該會看到這些 coaches。"
        },
        {
          "id": 180,
          "start": 601.85,
          "end": 603.86,
          "en": "This is clearly not super beautiful,",
          "zh": "這顯然不是超級美觀，"
        },
        {
          "id": 181,
          "start": 603.86,
          "end": 605.363,
          "en": "but it is a start.",
          "zh": "但這是個開始。"
        },
        {
          "id": 182,
          "start": 607.23,
          "end": 609.19,
          "en": "Now, to make this a bit nicer,",
          "zh": "現在，為了讓它好看一點，"
        },
        {
          "id": 183,
          "start": 609.19,
          "end": 613.08,
          "en": "in coaches list, I'll also add some scoped styling",
          "zh": "在 coaches list 中，我也會加一些 scoped 樣式，"
        },
        {
          "id": 184,
          "start": 614.28,
          "end": 617.783,
          "en": "and attached you'll find a CoachesList.CSS file,",
          "zh": "附件中你會找到 CoachesList.CSS 檔案，"
        },
        {
          "id": 185,
          "start": 618.81,
          "end": 620.48,
          "en": "where you find two styles,",
          "zh": "裡面有兩個樣式，"
        },
        {
          "id": 186,
          "start": 620.48,
          "end": 623.18,
          "en": "which you should copy into that style tag.",
          "zh": "你應該把它們複製到那個 style 標籤中。"
        },
        {
          "id": 187,
          "start": 623.18,
          "end": 625.53,
          "en": "With that, at least the bullet points are gone.",
          "zh": "這樣一來，至少項目符號不見了。"
        },
        {
          "id": 188,
          "start": 626.4,
          "end": 628.46,
          "en": "But it's taking up the entire width here",
          "zh": "但它佔滿了這裡的整個寬度，"
        },
        {
          "id": 189,
          "start": 628.46,
          "end": 630.44,
          "en": "and it's going from edge to edge,",
          "zh": "而且是從一邊延伸到另一邊，"
        },
        {
          "id": 190,
          "start": 630.44,
          "end": 631.97,
          "en": "even if I zoom out a bit.",
          "zh": "即使我縮小一點也一樣。"
        },
        {
          "id": 191,
          "start": 631.97,
          "end": 636.06,
          "en": "And I would rather want that card look here.",
          "zh": "而我這裡比較想要那種卡片外觀。"
        },
        {
          "id": 192,
          "start": 636.06,
          "end": 638.1,
          "en": "I want to have these items in a box",
          "zh": "我想把這些項目放在一個盒子裡，"
        },
        {
          "id": 193,
          "start": 638.1,
          "end": 640.9,
          "en": "with a light drop shadow.",
          "zh": "帶有淡淡的陰影。"
        },
        {
          "id": 194,
          "start": 640.9,
          "end": 642.92,
          "en": "Yeah, I want to have this typical card look,",
          "zh": "是的，我想要這種典型的卡片外觀，"
        },
        {
          "id": 195,
          "start": 642.92,
          "end": 645.32,
          "en": "which we also saw earlier in the course already.",
          "zh": "我們在課程前面也已經看過了。"
        },
        {
          "id": 196,
          "start": 646.27,
          "end": 647.89,
          "en": "And I want that card look",
          "zh": "而我也想在這個應用程式的"
        },
        {
          "id": 197,
          "start": 647.89,
          "end": 650.14,
          "en": "in other parts of this app as well.",
          "zh": "其他部分有那種卡片外觀。"
        },
        {
          "id": 198,
          "start": 650.14,
          "end": 652.61,
          "en": "For example, the filter should later also be",
          "zh": "例如，篩選器之後也應該"
        },
        {
          "id": 199,
          "start": 652.61,
          "end": 656.343,
          "en": "in such a card, and other parts on other pages as well.",
          "zh": "放在這樣的卡片中，其他頁面的其他部分也是。"
        },
        {
          "id": 200,
          "start": 657.27,
          "end": 659.03,
          "en": "Therefore, as a next step,",
          "zh": "因此，下一步，"
        },
        {
          "id": 201,
          "start": 659.03,
          "end": 662.34,
          "en": "I'll build this card-based component,",
          "zh": "我會建立這個以卡片為基礎的元件，"
        },
        {
          "id": 202,
          "start": 662.34,
          "end": 665.44,
          "en": "which we can then use in different parts of the app.",
          "zh": "我們之後就能在應用程式的不同部分使用它。"
        },
        {
          "id": 203,
          "start": 665.44,
          "end": 666.273,
          "en": "And whilst we're at it,",
          "zh": "既然都做了，"
        },
        {
          "id": 204,
          "start": 666.273,
          "end": 669.61,
          "en": "we'll also build a button-based component,",
          "zh": "我們也會建立一個以按鈕為基礎的元件，"
        },
        {
          "id": 205,
          "start": 669.61,
          "end": 671.3,
          "en": "because we have a lot of buttons,",
          "zh": "因為我們有很多按鈕，"
        },
        {
          "id": 206,
          "start": 671.3,
          "end": 674.67,
          "en": "and also links that should look like buttons,",
          "zh": "還有一些應該看起來像按鈕的連結，"
        },
        {
          "id": 207,
          "start": 674.67,
          "end": 676.56,
          "en": "like Contact and View Details.",
          "zh": "像是 Contact 和 View Details。"
        },
        {
          "id": 208,
          "start": 676.56,
          "end": 679.633,
          "en": "And therefore, this is something that makes sense as well.",
          "zh": "因此，這也是合理的做法。"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "21879922",
      "title": "Adding a Couple of Base Components (Base Card, Base Button, Base Badge)",
      "lectureOrder": 243,
      "videoOrder": 215,
      "sourceHash": "c0239fd444a54a9940a8ac7ade162dfb1eed1f94ca7ac15444e7a9c2391ea477",
      "cues": [
        {
          "id": 1,
          "start": 2.15,
          "end": 4.34,
          "en": "So it's base component time.",
          "zh": "所以現在是 base 元件的時間了。"
        },
        {
          "id": 2,
          "start": 4.34,
          "end": 8.29,
          "en": "In the components folder, I'll add a new ui folder.",
          "zh": "在 components 資料夾裡，我會新增一個 ui 資料夾。"
        },
        {
          "id": 3,
          "start": 8.29,
          "end": 10.37,
          "en": "You could also name it base,",
          "zh": "你也可以把它命名為 base，"
        },
        {
          "id": 4,
          "start": 10.37,
          "end": 11.49,
          "en": "but I'll go with ui",
          "zh": "但我會用 ui，"
        },
        {
          "id": 5,
          "start": 11.49,
          "end": 14.61,
          "en": "because I have some core UI elements in there.",
          "zh": "因為我在裡面會放一些核心 UI 元素。"
        },
        {
          "id": 6,
          "start": 14.61,
          "end": 17.8,
          "en": "And I'll add a BaseCard.vue file in there,",
          "zh": "而我會在那裡新增一個 BaseCard.vue 檔案，"
        },
        {
          "id": 7,
          "start": 17.8,
          "end": 19.333,
          "en": "and also already a BaseButton.",
          "zh": "也順便先加上 BaseButton。"
        },
        {
          "id": 8,
          "start": 20.19,
          "end": 22.49,
          "en": "And also, didn't mention before,",
          "zh": "另外，我之前沒提到，"
        },
        {
          "id": 9,
          "start": 22.49,
          "end": 26.007,
          "en": "but we'll need it as well, also a BaseBadge,",
          "zh": "但我們也會需要它，也就是 BaseBadge，"
        },
        {
          "id": 10,
          "start": 26.88,
          "end": 29.23,
          "en": "which will basically render a badge.",
          "zh": "它基本上會渲染一個 badge。"
        },
        {
          "id": 11,
          "start": 29.23,
          "end": 32.52,
          "en": "For example, the areas of expertise here,",
          "zh": "例如這裡的專業領域，"
        },
        {
          "id": 12,
          "start": 32.52,
          "end": 34.6,
          "en": "there I wanna use that.",
          "zh": "我想在那裡使用它。"
        },
        {
          "id": 13,
          "start": 34.6,
          "end": 36.323,
          "en": "But let's start with the BaseCard.",
          "zh": "但我們就從 BaseCard 開始吧。"
        },
        {
          "id": 14,
          "start": 37.78,
          "end": 40.41,
          "en": "That will be a very simple component, in the end.",
          "zh": "到頭來，那會是一個非常簡單的元件。"
        },
        {
          "id": 15,
          "start": 40.41,
          "end": 42.423,
          "en": "The template is just a div,",
          "zh": "template 就只有一個 div，"
        },
        {
          "id": 16,
          "start": 43.33,
          "end": 46.99,
          "en": "and then a slot inside of the div,",
          "zh": "然後在 div 裡面放一個 slot，"
        },
        {
          "id": 17,
          "start": 46.99,
          "end": 49.98,
          "en": "because I want to use this card as a wrapper",
          "zh": "因為我想把這張 card 當作包裝容器，"
        },
        {
          "id": 18,
          "start": 49.98,
          "end": 52.393,
          "en": "around any content you want.",
          "zh": "包住任何你想要的內容。"
        },
        {
          "id": 19,
          "start": 53.9,
          "end": 56.153,
          "en": "Now, I'll give this a class of card,",
          "zh": "現在，我會給它一個 card class，"
        },
        {
          "id": 20,
          "start": 57.98,
          "end": 60.513,
          "en": "and then add some scoped CSS code.",
          "zh": "然後加上一些 scoped CSS 程式碼。"
        },
        {
          "id": 21,
          "start": 61.8,
          "end": 64.32,
          "en": "And attached, you find a base card CSS file",
          "zh": "而在附件中，你會找到一個 base card CSS 檔案，"
        },
        {
          "id": 22,
          "start": 64.32,
          "end": 67.85,
          "en": "which holds the styles you should paste in here.",
          "zh": "裡面有你應該貼到這裡的樣式。"
        },
        {
          "id": 23,
          "start": 67.85,
          "end": 70.4,
          "en": "This will give us this classic card look",
          "zh": "這會給我們這種經典的 card 外觀，"
        },
        {
          "id": 24,
          "start": 70.4,
          "end": 72.953,
          "en": "and also restrict the width we're taking.",
          "zh": "也會限制我們佔用的寬度。"
        },
        {
          "id": 25,
          "start": 74.78,
          "end": 76.563,
          "en": "And that's already it for the card.",
          "zh": "這張 card 就這樣完成了。"
        },
        {
          "id": 26,
          "start": 77.62,
          "end": 81.35,
          "en": "Now we can use that card by registering it",
          "zh": "現在我們可以透過註冊它來使用這張 card，"
        },
        {
          "id": 27,
          "start": 81.35,
          "end": 83.95,
          "en": "in main.js as a global component,",
          "zh": "在 main.js 中註冊為全域元件，"
        },
        {
          "id": 28,
          "start": 83.95,
          "end": 86.77,
          "en": "because I'm using it in many different areas of the app,",
          "zh": "因為我在 App 的許多不同地方都會用到它，"
        },
        {
          "id": 29,
          "start": 86.77,
          "end": 89.22,
          "en": "hence, I wanna use it as a global component.",
          "zh": "因此我想把它當作全域元件使用。"
        },
        {
          "id": 30,
          "start": 89.22,
          "end": 92.075,
          "en": "So in main.js I'll import BaseCard",
          "zh": "所以在 main.js 裡，我會 import BaseCard，"
        },
        {
          "id": 31,
          "start": 92.075,
          "end": 97.023,
          "en": "from ./components/uiBaseCard.vue,",
          "zh": "來自 ./components/ui/BaseCard.vue，"
        },
        {
          "id": 32,
          "start": 98.14,
          "end": 102.12,
          "en": "and then here use my app to call the component method",
          "zh": "然後在這裡使用我的 app 呼叫 component 方法，"
        },
        {
          "id": 33,
          "start": 102.12,
          "end": 105.82,
          "en": "and register a base-card component,",
          "zh": "註冊一個 base-card 元件，"
        },
        {
          "id": 34,
          "start": 105.82,
          "end": 109.193,
          "en": "which points at this BaseCard component we're importing.",
          "zh": "它指向我們正在 import 的這個 BaseCard 元件。"
        },
        {
          "id": 35,
          "start": 111.13,
          "end": 114.563,
          "en": "And now we can use it in CoachesList, for example,",
          "zh": "現在我們就可以在 CoachesList 中使用它，例如，"
        },
        {
          "id": 36,
          "start": 115.53,
          "end": 120.07,
          "en": "to wrap everything in this section,",
          "zh": "把這個區段裡的所有東西包起來，"
        },
        {
          "id": 37,
          "start": 120.07,
          "end": 123.56,
          "en": "so this controls div and the unordered list.",
          "zh": "也就是這個 controls div 和無序列表。"
        },
        {
          "id": 38,
          "start": 123.56,
          "end": 127.95,
          "en": "So here I'll use base-card, my opening tag,",
          "zh": "所以這裡我會使用 base-card 作為開啟標籤，"
        },
        {
          "id": 39,
          "start": 127.95,
          "end": 131.683,
          "en": "and then close it after this h3 tag here.",
          "zh": "然後在這個 h3 標籤之後把它關閉。"
        },
        {
          "id": 40,
          "start": 133.46,
          "end": 135.16,
          "en": "And with that, if we save this,",
          "zh": "這樣一來，如果我們儲存這個檔案，"
        },
        {
          "id": 41,
          "start": 135.16,
          "end": 138.163,
          "en": "this looks much nicer already.",
          "zh": "這看起來已經好多了。"
        },
        {
          "id": 42,
          "start": 139.57999999999998,
          "end": 141.25,
          "en": "But now we got all these buttons.",
          "zh": "但現在我們有這些按鈕。"
        },
        {
          "id": 43,
          "start": 141.25,
          "end": 142.659,
          "en": "And, actually, these here, of course,",
          "zh": "而其實，這裡這些當然"
        },
        {
          "id": 44,
          "start": 142.659,
          "end": 145.41,
          "en": "are links and not buttons,",
          "zh": "是連結而不是按鈕，"
        },
        {
          "id": 45,
          "start": 145.41,
          "end": 148.06,
          "en": "but I would argue they should look like buttons",
          "zh": "但我會認為它們應該看起來像按鈕，"
        },
        {
          "id": 46,
          "start": 148.06,
          "end": 151.1,
          "en": "because, whilst they technically are links,",
          "zh": "因為雖然它們技術上是連結，"
        },
        {
          "id": 47,
          "start": 151.1,
          "end": 152.28,
          "en": "well, in this UI,",
          "zh": "嗯，在這個 UI 裡，"
        },
        {
          "id": 48,
          "start": 152.28,
          "end": 155.13,
          "en": "having them look like a button makes more sense.",
          "zh": "讓它們看起來像按鈕更合理。"
        },
        {
          "id": 49,
          "start": 155.13,
          "end": 157.39,
          "en": "And, of course, we also got a button here, for example,",
          "zh": "而當然，我們這裡也有一個按鈕，例如，"
        },
        {
          "id": 50,
          "start": 157.39,
          "end": 159.52,
          "en": "which should look like a button.",
          "zh": "它應該看起來像按鈕。"
        },
        {
          "id": 51,
          "start": 159.52,
          "end": 162.25,
          "en": "So I wanna build a BaseButton component",
          "zh": "所以我想建立一個 BaseButton 元件，"
        },
        {
          "id": 52,
          "start": 162.25,
          "end": 166.403,
          "en": "which supports both real buttons and links.",
          "zh": "同時支援真正的按鈕和連結。"
        },
        {
          "id": 53,
          "start": 167.35,
          "end": 169.03,
          "en": "And we can build something like this",
          "zh": "我們可以建立這樣的東西，"
        },
        {
          "id": 54,
          "start": 169.03,
          "end": 170.57,
          "en": "and apply the same styling",
          "zh": "並套用相同的樣式，"
        },
        {
          "id": 55,
          "start": 170.57,
          "end": 172.867,
          "en": "no matter whether it's a link or a button.",
          "zh": "無論它是連結還是按鈕。"
        },
        {
          "id": 56,
          "start": 172.867,
          "end": 175.867,
          "en": "And we're going to do this in the BaseButton component here.",
          "zh": "而我們會在這裡的 BaseButton 元件中做這件事。"
        },
        {
          "id": 57,
          "start": 176.94,
          "end": 178.53,
          "en": "Here, we need a template.",
          "zh": "這裡我們需要一個 template。"
        },
        {
          "id": 58,
          "start": 178.53,
          "end": 181.77,
          "en": "And in that template, of course, we also have a button,",
          "zh": "而在那個 template 裡，我們當然也有一個 button，"
        },
        {
          "id": 59,
          "start": 181.77,
          "end": 185.313,
          "en": "the regular HTML button, which takes a slot.",
          "zh": "一般的 HTML button，它接收一個 slot。"
        },
        {
          "id": 60,
          "start": 186.3,
          "end": 188.55,
          "en": "But it will not just have the button,",
          "zh": "但它不會只有這個 button，"
        },
        {
          "id": 61,
          "start": 188.55,
          "end": 190.46,
          "en": "we also wanna support links.",
          "zh": "我們也想支援連結。"
        },
        {
          "id": 62,
          "start": 190.46,
          "end": 194.43,
          "en": "So I will actually also add router-link here as a component,",
          "zh": "所以我其實也會在這裡加上 router-link 這個元件，"
        },
        {
          "id": 63,
          "start": 194.43,
          "end": 196.313,
          "en": "which takes a slot.",
          "zh": "它接收一個 slot。"
        },
        {
          "id": 64,
          "start": 197.24,
          "end": 199.92000000000002,
          "en": "But, of course, only one of the two should be rendered",
          "zh": "但當然，這兩者中同時間只能"
        },
        {
          "id": 65,
          "start": 199.92000000000002,
          "end": 201.003,
          "en": "at the same time.",
          "zh": "渲染其中一個。"
        },
        {
          "id": 66,
          "start": 202.85,
          "end": 205.29,
          "en": "So, therefore, I will add a script",
          "zh": "因此，我會加上一個 script，"
        },
        {
          "id": 67,
          "start": 205.29,
          "end": 207.24,
          "en": "and accept some props.",
          "zh": "並接受一些 props。"
        },
        {
          "id": 68,
          "start": 207.24,
          "end": 209.48,
          "en": "And here I'll actually use the object form",
          "zh": "而在這裡，我其實會使用物件形式"
        },
        {
          "id": 69,
          "start": 209.48,
          "end": 210.7,
          "en": "of the finding the props,",
          "zh": "來定義 props，"
        },
        {
          "id": 70,
          "start": 210.7,
          "end": 213.11,
          "en": "simply to also practice this again.",
          "zh": "純粹是為了再練習一次。"
        },
        {
          "id": 71,
          "start": 213.11,
          "end": 215.85,
          "en": "Most of the time, I used just the array form",
          "zh": "大多數時候，我都只用陣列形式，"
        },
        {
          "id": 72,
          "start": 215.85,
          "end": 217.22,
          "en": "because it's shorter,",
          "zh": "因為它比較簡短，"
        },
        {
          "id": 73,
          "start": 217.22,
          "end": 219.1,
          "en": "but using that object form, of course,",
          "zh": "但使用那種物件形式，當然"
        },
        {
          "id": 74,
          "start": 219.1,
          "end": 222.49,
          "en": "allows you to be more explicit about your props.",
          "zh": "可以讓你更明確地描述你的 props。"
        },
        {
          "id": 75,
          "start": 222.49,
          "end": 224.143,
          "en": "So which props do I need here?",
          "zh": "那我這裡需要哪些 props 呢？"
        },
        {
          "id": 76,
          "start": 225.06,
          "end": 228.07999999999998,
          "en": "I want to have a link prop.",
          "zh": "我想要有一個 link prop。"
        },
        {
          "id": 77,
          "start": 228.07999999999998,
          "end": 230.44,
          "en": "The link prop should signal to us",
          "zh": "link prop 應該向我們表示"
        },
        {
          "id": 78,
          "start": 230.44,
          "end": 232.63,
          "en": "whether we wanna render a button,",
          "zh": "我們想渲染一個按鈕，"
        },
        {
          "id": 79,
          "start": 232.63,
          "end": 234.61,
          "en": "or if link is true,",
          "zh": "或者如果 link 為 true，"
        },
        {
          "id": 80,
          "start": 234.61,
          "end": 236.363,
          "en": "if we want to render a link.",
          "zh": "我們想渲染一個連結。"
        },
        {
          "id": 81,
          "start": 237.55,
          "end": 242.1,
          "en": "So, therefore, here I will set the type here to Boolean",
          "zh": "所以，在這裡我會把 type 設為 Boolean，"
        },
        {
          "id": 82,
          "start": 242.1,
          "end": 245.34,
          "en": "because I expect to get a Boolean here.",
          "zh": "因為我預期這裡會拿到 Boolean。"
        },
        {
          "id": 83,
          "start": 245.34,
          "end": 248.6,
          "en": "Set it to not required. It's optional.",
          "zh": "把它設為非必填。它是選填的。"
        },
        {
          "id": 84,
          "start": 248.6,
          "end": 250.29,
          "en": "You don't have to specify it.",
          "zh": "你不一定要指定它。"
        },
        {
          "id": 85,
          "start": 250.29,
          "end": 253.27,
          "en": "And set the default value to false.",
          "zh": "並把預設值設為 false。"
        },
        {
          "id": 86,
          "start": 253.27,
          "end": 256.76,
          "en": "So, by default, we don't render a link but a button.",
          "zh": "所以預設情況下，我們渲染的不是連結而是按鈕。"
        },
        {
          "id": 87,
          "start": 256.76,
          "end": 259.48,
          "en": "And we can use the link prop now here",
          "zh": "而我們現在可以在這裡使用 link prop，"
        },
        {
          "id": 88,
          "start": 259.48,
          "end": 264.05,
          "en": "to use or to render the button if not link,",
          "zh": "如果沒有 link 就渲染按鈕，"
        },
        {
          "id": 89,
          "start": 264.05,
          "end": 265.93,
          "en": "hence the exclamation mark,",
          "zh": "所以用驚嘆號，"
        },
        {
          "id": 90,
          "start": 265.93,
          "end": 269.77,
          "en": "and render the link, the router link, in the else case",
          "zh": "而在 else 的情況下渲染連結，也就是 router link，"
        },
        {
          "id": 91,
          "start": 269.77,
          "end": 271.323,
          "en": "if link should be true.",
          "zh": "如果 link 為 true 的話。"
        },
        {
          "id": 92,
          "start": 272.24,
          "end": 275.81,
          "en": "This allows us to switch from outside the component",
          "zh": "這讓我們能從元件外部"
        },
        {
          "id": 93,
          "start": 275.81,
          "end": 278.073,
          "en": "between a button and a router link.",
          "zh": "在按鈕和 router link 之間切換。"
        },
        {
          "id": 94,
          "start": 279.15999999999997,
          "end": 281.74,
          "en": "I also want a to prop here,",
          "zh": "我這裡也想要一個 to prop，"
        },
        {
          "id": 95,
          "start": 281.74,
          "end": 283.96,
          "en": "which I need if a link is set.",
          "zh": "當設定為連結時我會需要它。"
        },
        {
          "id": 96,
          "start": 283.96,
          "end": 286.15999999999997,
          "en": "This will get a string value.",
          "zh": "它會取得一個字串值。"
        },
        {
          "id": 97,
          "start": 286.15999999999997,
          "end": 289.233,
          "en": "And here I want to set this to not required,",
          "zh": "而在這裡我想把它設為非必填，"
        },
        {
          "id": 98,
          "start": 291.33,
          "end": 294.97,
          "en": "but set the default value to /, nothing.",
          "zh": "但把預設值設為空值，什麼都沒有。"
        },
        {
          "id": 99,
          "start": 294.97,
          "end": 299.97,
          "en": "The to prop is a useful prop if we do render a router link",
          "zh": "如果我們真的渲染一個 router link，to prop 就會很有用，"
        },
        {
          "id": 100,
          "start": 300.12,
          "end": 301.6,
          "en": "because in that case, of course,",
          "zh": "因為在那種情況下，當然"
        },
        {
          "id": 101,
          "start": 301.6,
          "end": 305.37,
          "en": "I wanna bind to on the router link to my own to prop",
          "zh": "我想在 router link 上把 to 綁定到我自己定義的 to prop，"
        },
        {
          "id": 102,
          "start": 305.37,
          "end": 306.57,
          "en": "which I just defined",
          "zh": "也就是我剛剛定義的那個，"
        },
        {
          "id": 103,
          "start": 306.57,
          "end": 309.133,
          "en": "so that we know where this link should go to.",
          "zh": "這樣我們就知道這個連結應該前往哪裡。"
        },
        {
          "id": 104,
          "start": 310.24,
          "end": 313.23,
          "en": "And then there's one last prop which I wanna support,",
          "zh": "然後還有最後一個我想支援的 prop，"
        },
        {
          "id": 105,
          "start": 313.23,
          "end": 315.57,
          "en": "and that's the mode prop.",
          "zh": "那就是 mode prop。"
        },
        {
          "id": 106,
          "start": 315.57,
          "end": 318.98,
          "en": "This is a prop that allows us to control the styling,",
          "zh": "這個 prop 讓我們能控制樣式，"
        },
        {
          "id": 107,
          "start": 318.98,
          "end": 321.87,
          "en": "the look of this button from outside.",
          "zh": "也就是從外部控制這顆按鈕的外觀。"
        },
        {
          "id": 108,
          "start": 321.87,
          "end": 324.92,
          "en": "Here, I simply want to get a string,",
          "zh": "這裡我只想取得一個字串，"
        },
        {
          "id": 109,
          "start": 324.92,
          "end": 327.94,
          "en": "and this is also not required.",
          "zh": "而這個也是非必填。"
        },
        {
          "id": 110,
          "start": 327.94,
          "end": 330.41,
          "en": "The default, then, is just an empty string",
          "zh": "那麼預設值就只是空字串，"
        },
        {
          "id": 111,
          "start": 330.41,
          "end": 332.58,
          "en": "or null, let's say,",
          "zh": "或者就說是 null，"
        },
        {
          "id": 112,
          "start": 332.58,
          "end": 336.873,
          "en": "and I will use mode as a class on the button.",
          "zh": "而我會把 mode 當作按鈕上的 class 使用。"
        },
        {
          "id": 113,
          "start": 338.47,
          "end": 340.46,
          "en": "That, of course, would theoretically allow us",
          "zh": "那當然理論上會讓我們"
        },
        {
          "id": 114,
          "start": 340.46,
          "end": 343.51,
          "en": "to pass anything as a class that will be added,",
          "zh": "可以傳入任何東西作為要被加上的 class，"
        },
        {
          "id": 115,
          "start": 343.51,
          "end": 346.67,
          "en": "but I will only support a couple of specific classes",
          "zh": "但我只會支援幾個特定的 class，"
        },
        {
          "id": 116,
          "start": 346.67,
          "end": 349.233,
          "en": "in the CSS code which we're soon going to add.",
          "zh": "在我們即將加上的 CSS 程式碼裡。"
        },
        {
          "id": 117,
          "start": 350.5,
          "end": 353.61,
          "en": "So now we add class mode on both the button",
          "zh": "所以現在我們在 button 上，"
        },
        {
          "id": 118,
          "start": 353.61,
          "end": 355.26,
          "en": "and the router link.",
          "zh": "以及 router link 上，都加上 class mode。"
        },
        {
          "id": 119,
          "start": 355.26,
          "end": 358.17,
          "en": "And now it's time for styling.",
          "zh": "現在是加上樣式的時候了。"
        },
        {
          "id": 120,
          "start": 358.17,
          "end": 362.01,
          "en": "So let's add some scoped CSS styling down there,",
          "zh": "所以讓我們在下面加一些 scoped CSS 樣式，"
        },
        {
          "id": 121,
          "start": 362.01,
          "end": 364.85,
          "en": "and attached you find a button CSS file",
          "zh": "而在附件中你會找到一個 button CSS 檔案，"
        },
        {
          "id": 122,
          "start": 364.85,
          "end": 367.203,
          "en": "with all the button styles in there.",
          "zh": "裡面有所有的按鈕樣式。"
        },
        {
          "id": 123,
          "start": 368.33,
          "end": 371.04,
          "en": "And here I set up a base styling,",
          "zh": "而在這裡我設定了一個基礎樣式，"
        },
        {
          "id": 124,
          "start": 371.04,
          "end": 374.43,
          "en": "and I'm always targeting button and anchor tag",
          "zh": "而我總是針對 button 和 anchor 標籤，"
        },
        {
          "id": 125,
          "start": 374.43,
          "end": 377.34,
          "en": "because the router link will render an anchor tag",
          "zh": "因為 router link 最後會渲染成 anchor 標籤，"
        },
        {
          "id": 126,
          "start": 377.34,
          "end": 378.94,
          "en": "in the end.",
          "zh": "最終就是如此。"
        },
        {
          "id": 127,
          "start": 378.94,
          "end": 382.23,
          "en": "And then here the hover and active styles",
          "zh": "然後這裡是 hover 和 active 樣式，"
        },
        {
          "id": 128,
          "start": 382.23,
          "end": 385.91,
          "en": "and also the flat and outline styles.",
          "zh": "還有 flat 和 outline 樣式。"
        },
        {
          "id": 129,
          "start": 385.91,
          "end": 388.56,
          "en": "And these are the two modes which I support",
          "zh": "而這就是我支援的兩種模式，"
        },
        {
          "id": 130,
          "start": 388.56,
          "end": 390.78,
          "en": "because here I'm selecting the flat class",
          "zh": "因為這裡我選取的是 flat class，"
        },
        {
          "id": 131,
          "start": 390.78,
          "end": 392.37,
          "en": "and the outline class,",
          "zh": "以及 outline class，"
        },
        {
          "id": 132,
          "start": 392.37,
          "end": 394.29,
          "en": "so these styles will kick in",
          "zh": "所以當 flat 或 outline class 被加到按鈕或連結上時，"
        },
        {
          "id": 133,
          "start": 394.29,
          "end": 398,
          "en": "if a flat or outline class is added to the button or link.",
          "zh": "這些樣式就會生效。"
        },
        {
          "id": 134,
          "start": 398,
          "end": 401.14,
          "en": "And that's exactly what we do with mode.",
          "zh": "而這正是我們用 mode 所做的事。"
        },
        {
          "id": 135,
          "start": 401.14,
          "end": 403.21,
          "en": "If mode is set to flat,",
          "zh": "如果 mode 設為 flat，"
        },
        {
          "id": 136,
          "start": 403.21,
          "end": 405.09000000000003,
          "en": "the flat class will be added,",
          "zh": "flat class 就會被加上，"
        },
        {
          "id": 137,
          "start": 405.09000000000003,
          "end": 408.86,
          "en": "and therefore these flat styles will kick in.",
          "zh": "因此這些 flat 樣式就會生效。"
        },
        {
          "id": 138,
          "start": 408.86,
          "end": 410.95,
          "en": "And that's my base button.",
          "zh": "這就是我的 base button。"
        },
        {
          "id": 139,
          "start": 410.95,
          "end": 415.05,
          "en": "This base button can now also be defined in main.js.",
          "zh": "這個 base button 現在也可以定義在 main.js 裡。"
        },
        {
          "id": 140,
          "start": 415.05,
          "end": 417.147,
          "en": "So we import BaseButton",
          "zh": "所以我們 import BaseButton，"
        },
        {
          "id": 141,
          "start": 419.217,
          "end": 423.293,
          "en": "from ./components/ui/BaseButton.vue,",
          "zh": "來自 ./components/ui/BaseButton.vue，"
        },
        {
          "id": 142,
          "start": 424.36,
          "end": 429.36,
          "en": "and then also call app.component BaseButton here like that.",
          "zh": "然後在這裡也呼叫 app.component 註冊 BaseButton，就像這樣。"
        },
        {
          "id": 143,
          "start": 432.7,
          "end": 434.36,
          "en": "And now we can use the BaseButton",
          "zh": "現在我們就可以在 App 的各個地方"
        },
        {
          "id": 144,
          "start": 434.36,
          "end": 436.64,
          "en": "in various places of this app.",
          "zh": "使用 BaseButton。"
        },
        {
          "id": 145,
          "start": 436.64,
          "end": 441.21,
          "en": "In CoachesList, for example, I have these two links here,",
          "zh": "例如在 CoachesList 裡，我這裡有這兩個連結，"
        },
        {
          "id": 146,
          "start": 441.21,
          "end": 443.17,
          "en": "or one button and one link,",
          "zh": "或者說一個按鈕和一個連結，"
        },
        {
          "id": 147,
          "start": 443.17,
          "end": 445.26,
          "en": "both should be a base button.",
          "zh": "兩者都應該是 base button。"
        },
        {
          "id": 148,
          "start": 445.26,
          "end": 449.33,
          "en": "So here I'll use base-button for my Refresh button.",
          "zh": "所以這裡我會為我的 Refresh 按鈕使用 base-button。"
        },
        {
          "id": 149,
          "start": 449.33,
          "end": 450.72,
          "en": "Currently, it's not doing anything,",
          "zh": "目前它不會做任何事，"
        },
        {
          "id": 150,
          "start": 450.72,
          "end": 452.183,
          "en": "but that will change soon.",
          "zh": "但那很快就會改變。"
        },
        {
          "id": 151,
          "start": 453.03,
          "end": 456.86,
          "en": "And here we can replace router-link with base-button.",
          "zh": "而這裡我們可以把 router-link 換成 base-button。"
        },
        {
          "id": 152,
          "start": 456.86,
          "end": 458.65999999999997,
          "en": "The to prop still exists",
          "zh": "to prop 依然存在，"
        },
        {
          "id": 153,
          "start": 458.65999999999997,
          "end": 463.413,
          "en": "because we added that to our router link in the base-button.",
          "zh": "因為我們在 base-button 裡的 router link 加上了它。"
        },
        {
          "id": 154,
          "start": 464.34000000000003,
          "end": 466.52,
          "en": "But, here, since this should be a link,",
          "zh": "但這裡，既然這應該是一個連結，"
        },
        {
          "id": 155,
          "start": 466.52,
          "end": 469.67,
          "en": "I now also set the link prop.",
          "zh": "我現在也設定 link prop。"
        },
        {
          "id": 156,
          "start": 469.67,
          "end": 471.08,
          "en": "And just adding it like this",
          "zh": "而像這樣直接加上它，"
        },
        {
          "id": 157,
          "start": 471.08,
          "end": 473.84000000000003,
          "en": "automatically sets it to true already.",
          "zh": "就已經自動把它設為 true。"
        },
        {
          "id": 158,
          "start": 473.84000000000003,
          "end": 476.48,
          "en": "And therefore this should now look like a link",
          "zh": "因此這現在應該看起來像連結，"
        },
        {
          "id": 159,
          "start": 476.48,
          "end": 478.053,
          "en": "or should render a link.",
          "zh": "或者說應該渲染成連結。"
        },
        {
          "id": 160,
          "start": 479.08,
          "end": 481.33,
          "en": "On the other hand, for this refresh button,",
          "zh": "另一方面，對於這個 refresh 按鈕，"
        },
        {
          "id": 161,
          "start": 481.33,
          "end": 484.72,
          "en": "I wanna use mode and set this to outline",
          "zh": "我想使用 mode 並把它設為 outline，"
        },
        {
          "id": 162,
          "start": 484.72,
          "end": 487.22,
          "en": "to make sure that here I'm using a different look.",
          "zh": "以確保這裡我使用的是不同的外觀。"
        },
        {
          "id": 163,
          "start": 488.82,
          "end": 492.04,
          "en": "And in CoachItem, we also got buttons,",
          "zh": "而在 CoachItem 裡，我們也有按鈕，"
        },
        {
          "id": 164,
          "start": 492.04,
          "end": 494.2,
          "en": "or links, in this case.",
          "zh": "或者在這裡是連結。"
        },
        {
          "id": 165,
          "start": 494.2,
          "end": 496.3,
          "en": "And these should look like buttons, though.",
          "zh": "不過這些應該看起來像按鈕。"
        },
        {
          "id": 166,
          "start": 496.3,
          "end": 498.11,
          "en": "So, these two router links,",
          "zh": "所以，這兩個 router link，"
        },
        {
          "id": 167,
          "start": 498.11,
          "end": 501.08,
          "en": "here I'll also use base-button",
          "zh": "這裡我也會使用 base-button，"
        },
        {
          "id": 168,
          "start": 501.08,
          "end": 504.813,
          "en": "and replace router-link with base-button,",
          "zh": "並把 router-link 換成 base-button，"
        },
        {
          "id": 169,
          "start": 506.07,
          "end": 509.403,
          "en": "and then add the link prop on both.",
          "zh": "然後在兩者上都加上 link prop。"
        },
        {
          "id": 170,
          "start": 511.6,
          "end": 513.27,
          "en": "And on the first base button,",
          "zh": "而在第一個 base button 上，"
        },
        {
          "id": 171,
          "start": 513.27,
          "end": 516.573,
          "en": "I'll set the mode to outline as well to use that look here.",
          "zh": "我也會把 mode 設為 outline，在這裡使用那種外觀。"
        },
        {
          "id": 172,
          "start": 519.04,
          "end": 522.66,
          "en": "If we save this, this looks a lot nicer, I would say.",
          "zh": "如果我們儲存這個檔案，我會說這看起來好多了。"
        },
        {
          "id": 173,
          "start": 522.66,
          "end": 524.07,
          "en": "Now we get these buttons,",
          "zh": "現在我們得到這些按鈕，"
        },
        {
          "id": 174,
          "start": 524.07,
          "end": 526.26,
          "en": "which still act as links,",
          "zh": "它們依然作為連結運作，"
        },
        {
          "id": 175,
          "start": 526.26,
          "end": 528.75,
          "en": "but which look like buttons.",
          "zh": "但看起來像按鈕。"
        },
        {
          "id": 176,
          "start": 528.75,
          "end": 531.57,
          "en": "And with that made a huge step forward.",
          "zh": "這樣一來，我們就往前邁進了一大步。"
        },
        {
          "id": 177,
          "start": 531.57,
          "end": 534.54,
          "en": "Now I want to render these areas of expertise",
          "zh": "現在我想用更好看的方式，"
        },
        {
          "id": 178,
          "start": 534.54,
          "end": 535.61,
          "en": "in a nicer way.",
          "zh": "來渲染這些專業領域。"
        },
        {
          "id": 179,
          "start": 535.61,
          "end": 539.443,
          "en": "And for that, I prepared this BaseBadge component.",
          "zh": "為此，我準備了這個 BaseBadge 元件。"
        },
        {
          "id": 180,
          "start": 540.29,
          "end": 543.57,
          "en": "Here, we're going to add a template",
          "zh": "這裡我們要加上一個 template，"
        },
        {
          "id": 181,
          "start": 543.57,
          "end": 545.76,
          "en": "and render a span, let's say",
          "zh": "並渲染一個 span，就這麼說吧，"
        },
        {
          "id": 182,
          "start": 545.76,
          "end": 550.69,
          "en": "where in the span we simply output a title",
          "zh": "在 span 裡我們就輸出 title，"
        },
        {
          "id": 183,
          "start": 550.69,
          "end": 553.883,
          "en": "or a text property, whatever you want.",
          "zh": "或者 text 屬性，隨你想要的。"
        },
        {
          "id": 184,
          "start": 554.89,
          "end": 557.57,
          "en": "On the span, I'll add a class of badge,",
          "zh": "在 span 上，我會加上一個 badge class，"
        },
        {
          "id": 185,
          "start": 557.57,
          "end": 561.193,
          "en": "but then, in addition, bind class dynamically to type.",
          "zh": "但除此之外，還會把 class 動態綁定到 type。"
        },
        {
          "id": 186,
          "start": 562.96,
          "end": 564.29,
          "en": "Now that of course means that here",
          "zh": "那當然代表這裡"
        },
        {
          "id": 187,
          "start": 564.29,
          "end": 566.16,
          "en": "we should also accept some props.",
          "zh": "我們也應該接受一些 props。"
        },
        {
          "id": 188,
          "start": 566.16,
          "end": 567.82,
          "en": "And I'll be lazy again here,",
          "zh": "而在這裡我又會偷懶一下，"
        },
        {
          "id": 189,
          "start": 567.82,
          "end": 569.97,
          "en": "I expect to get a type prop here",
          "zh": "我預期這裡會取得一個 type prop，"
        },
        {
          "id": 190,
          "start": 569.97,
          "end": 571.893,
          "en": "and, let's say, a title prop.",
          "zh": "以及就說是 title prop。"
        },
        {
          "id": 191,
          "start": 572.83,
          "end": 573.78,
          "en": "We have text here,",
          "zh": "我們這裡有 text，"
        },
        {
          "id": 192,
          "start": 573.78,
          "end": 576.4,
          "en": "but that will be a computed property soon.",
          "zh": "但那很快就會變成 computed 屬性。"
        },
        {
          "id": 193,
          "start": 576.4,
          "end": 579.53,
          "en": "And now we can add computed here",
          "zh": "現在我們可以在這裡加上 computed，"
        },
        {
          "id": 194,
          "start": 579.53,
          "end": 584.35,
          "en": "because actually my text computed property here,",
          "zh": "因為其實我這裡的 text computed 屬性，"
        },
        {
          "id": 195,
          "start": 584.35,
          "end": 589.35,
          "en": "that should actually be the title prop toUpperCase.",
          "zh": "其實應該是 title prop 的 toUpperCase。"
        },
        {
          "id": 196,
          "start": 591.91,
          "end": 594.13,
          "en": "It's just a transformation I want here.",
          "zh": "這只是我這裡想要的一個轉換。"
        },
        {
          "id": 197,
          "start": 594.13,
          "end": 596.35,
          "en": "Of course, it's nothing you have to add,",
          "zh": "當然，這不是你一定得加的東西，"
        },
        {
          "id": 198,
          "start": 596.35,
          "end": 599.48,
          "en": "but I wanna make sure that the title we receive as a prop",
          "zh": "但我想確保我們作為 prop 收到的 title，"
        },
        {
          "id": 199,
          "start": 599.48,
          "end": 601.38,
          "en": "is turned to all uppercase",
          "zh": "會被轉成全大寫，"
        },
        {
          "id": 200,
          "start": 601.38,
          "end": 602.963,
          "en": "and then output like this here.",
          "zh": "然後像這樣在這裡輸出。"
        },
        {
          "id": 201,
          "start": 604.87,
          "end": 606.53,
          "en": "And now we can add some styling here,",
          "zh": "現在我們可以在這裡加一些樣式，"
        },
        {
          "id": 202,
          "start": 606.53,
          "end": 608.76,
          "en": "some scoped CSS styling,",
          "zh": "一些 scoped CSS 樣式，"
        },
        {
          "id": 203,
          "start": 608.76,
          "end": 611.91,
          "en": "and as so often you find those styles attached",
          "zh": "而一如往常，你會在附件裡找到那些樣式，"
        },
        {
          "id": 204,
          "start": 611.91,
          "end": 614.71,
          "en": "in the badge CSS file.",
          "zh": "就在 badge CSS 檔案中。"
        },
        {
          "id": 205,
          "start": 614.71,
          "end": 617.15,
          "en": "And I got a basic badge style here",
          "zh": "而我這裡有一個基本的 badge 樣式，"
        },
        {
          "id": 206,
          "start": 617.15,
          "end": 619.257,
          "en": "where I just give some base colors,",
          "zh": "裡面我只給了一些基礎顏色、"
        },
        {
          "id": 207,
          "start": 619.257,
          "end": 622.15,
          "en": "some padding, display inline-block.",
          "zh": "一些 padding、display: inline-block。"
        },
        {
          "id": 208,
          "start": 622.15,
          "end": 625.33,
          "en": "And then I got three specific class styles here",
          "zh": "然後我這裡有三個特定的 class 樣式，"
        },
        {
          "id": 209,
          "start": 625.33,
          "end": 628.11,
          "en": "for frontend, backend, and career",
          "zh": "分別給 frontend、backend 和 career，"
        },
        {
          "id": 210,
          "start": 629.02,
          "end": 632.53,
          "en": "where, essentially, the background color is changing.",
          "zh": "基本上就是背景顏色會改變。"
        },
        {
          "id": 211,
          "start": 632.53,
          "end": 634.14,
          "en": "And these classes will be added",
          "zh": "而這些 class 會被加上，"
        },
        {
          "id": 212,
          "start": 634.14,
          "end": 635.74,
          "en": "by adding the type prop",
          "zh": "靠的是加上 type prop，"
        },
        {
          "id": 213,
          "start": 635.74,
          "end": 638.24,
          "en": "because here we bind the class to type.",
          "zh": "因為這裡我們把 class 綁定到 type。"
        },
        {
          "id": 214,
          "start": 638.24,
          "end": 640.47,
          "en": "So if we set the type to frontend",
          "zh": "所以如果我們之後使用 badge 時，"
        },
        {
          "id": 215,
          "start": 640.47,
          "end": 642.86,
          "en": "on the badge when we later use it,",
          "zh": "把 type 設為 frontend，"
        },
        {
          "id": 216,
          "start": 642.86,
          "end": 645.55,
          "en": "the frontend CSS class will be added,",
          "zh": "frontend CSS class 就會被加上，"
        },
        {
          "id": 217,
          "start": 645.55,
          "end": 648.023,
          "en": "and therefore these styles will be rendered.",
          "zh": "因此這些樣式就會被渲染出來。"
        },
        {
          "id": 218,
          "start": 649.43,
          "end": 651.18,
          "en": "And now we just need to register this",
          "zh": "現在我們只需要把這個"
        },
        {
          "id": 219,
          "start": 651.18,
          "end": 653.66,
          "en": "as a global component again.",
          "zh": "再次註冊為全域元件。"
        },
        {
          "id": 220,
          "start": 653.66,
          "end": 656.873,
          "en": "So here in main.js, I'll import BaseBadge",
          "zh": "所以在 main.js 這裡，我會 import BaseBadge，"
        },
        {
          "id": 221,
          "start": 658.82,
          "end": 663.82,
          "en": "from ./components/ui/BaseBadge.vue,",
          "zh": "來自 ./components/ui/BaseBadge.vue，"
        },
        {
          "id": 222,
          "start": 669.153,
          "end": 673.227,
          "en": "and then add component base-badge, BaseBadge, like this.",
          "zh": "然後加上 component('base-badge', BaseBadge)，就像這樣。"
        },
        {
          "id": 223,
          "start": 677.15,
          "end": 679.2,
          "en": "And with that added in CoachItem,",
          "zh": "把這個加上之後，在 CoachItem 裡，"
        },
        {
          "id": 224,
          "start": 679.2,
          "end": 681.82,
          "en": "we can use this BaseBadge component now.",
          "zh": "我們現在就可以使用這個 BaseBadge 元件。"
        },
        {
          "id": 225,
          "start": 681.82,
          "end": 686.17,
          "en": "So, there, instead of rendering a span like this,",
          "zh": "所以在那裡，與其像這樣渲染一個 span，"
        },
        {
          "id": 226,
          "start": 686.17,
          "end": 689.53,
          "en": "I want to loop through my base-badge,",
          "zh": "我想對我的 base-badge 做迴圈，"
        },
        {
          "id": 227,
          "start": 689.53,
          "end": 691.76,
          "en": "so replace span with that.",
          "zh": "所以把 span 換成它。"
        },
        {
          "id": 228,
          "start": 691.76,
          "end": 695.21,
          "en": "And we no longer pass something between the tags,",
          "zh": "而我們不再在標籤之間傳入東西，"
        },
        {
          "id": 229,
          "start": 695.21,
          "end": 698.3,
          "en": "because this component has no slot.",
          "zh": "因為這個元件沒有 slot。"
        },
        {
          "id": 230,
          "start": 698.3,
          "end": 700.66,
          "en": "Instead, we should set a type here",
          "zh": "取而代之，我們應該在這裡設定 type，"
        },
        {
          "id": 231,
          "start": 700.66,
          "end": 703.69,
          "en": "and bind this dynamically to area",
          "zh": "並把它動態綁定到 area，"
        },
        {
          "id": 232,
          "start": 703.69,
          "end": 706.43,
          "en": "because the areas I have in my data",
          "zh": "因為我 data 裡的這些 areas，"
        },
        {
          "id": 233,
          "start": 706.43,
          "end": 709.61,
          "en": "are frontend, backend, and career,",
          "zh": "是 frontend、backend 和 career，"
        },
        {
          "id": 234,
          "start": 709.61,
          "end": 713.623,
          "en": "and these are exactly the CSS classes supported here.",
          "zh": "而這些正是這裡支援的 CSS class。"
        },
        {
          "id": 235,
          "start": 715.03,
          "end": 717.17,
          "en": "Therefore, by the way, we could argue",
          "zh": "因此，順帶一提，我們可以爭論"
        },
        {
          "id": 236,
          "start": 717.17,
          "end": 719.35,
          "en": "whether that really is a base component.",
          "zh": "那到底算不算是 base 元件。"
        },
        {
          "id": 237,
          "start": 719.35,
          "end": 723.73,
          "en": "It's very specific to the coaches areas, of course.",
          "zh": "當然，它非常針對教練的領域。"
        },
        {
          "id": 238,
          "start": 723.73,
          "end": 725.88,
          "en": "But we do have some base styling as well.",
          "zh": "但我們也有一些基礎樣式。"
        },
        {
          "id": 239,
          "start": 725.88,
          "end": 728.27,
          "en": "That's why I keep it as a base component,",
          "zh": "這就是為什麼我把它保留為 base 元件，"
        },
        {
          "id": 240,
          "start": 728.27,
          "end": 730.1,
          "en": "But that's just a side note.",
          "zh": "但那只是附帶一提。"
        },
        {
          "id": 241,
          "start": 730.1,
          "end": 731.75,
          "en": "But, now back to CoachItem,",
          "zh": "不過，現在回到 CoachItem，"
        },
        {
          "id": 242,
          "start": 731.75,
          "end": 733.05,
          "en": "besides setting the type,",
          "zh": "除了設定 type 之外，"
        },
        {
          "id": 243,
          "start": 733.05,
          "end": 734.94,
          "en": "we should also bind the title.",
          "zh": "我們也應該綁定 title。"
        },
        {
          "id": 244,
          "start": 734.94,
          "end": 737.73,
          "en": "And that's also bound to area.",
          "zh": "而那也綁定到 area。"
        },
        {
          "id": 245,
          "start": 737.73,
          "end": 740.96,
          "en": "So it's the same value bound to different props here.",
          "zh": "所以這裡是同樣的值綁定到不同的 props。"
        },
        {
          "id": 246,
          "start": 740.96,
          "end": 743.46,
          "en": "We could theoretically use one prop,",
          "zh": "理論上我們可以只用一個 prop，"
        },
        {
          "id": 247,
          "start": 743.46,
          "end": 745.78,
          "en": "but since these props are used differently",
          "zh": "但因為這些 props 在元件內部的"
        },
        {
          "id": 248,
          "start": 745.78,
          "end": 747.31,
          "en": "inside of the component,",
          "zh": "使用方式不同，"
        },
        {
          "id": 249,
          "start": 747.31,
          "end": 750.77,
          "en": "I want to make it clear where we use these props",
          "zh": "我想透過挑選不同的 prop 名稱，"
        },
        {
          "id": 250,
          "start": 750.77,
          "end": 752.793,
          "en": "by picking different prop names.",
          "zh": "讓大家清楚我們在哪裡使用這些 props。"
        },
        {
          "id": 251,
          "start": 754.75,
          "end": 756.51,
          "en": "So with that, if we now save this,",
          "zh": "這樣一來，如果我們現在儲存這個檔案，"
        },
        {
          "id": 252,
          "start": 756.51,
          "end": 758.09,
          "en": "we got these nice badges",
          "zh": "我們就得到這些好看的 badge，"
        },
        {
          "id": 253,
          "start": 758.09,
          "end": 760.02,
          "en": "and therefore this already looks",
          "zh": "因此這看起來已經"
        },
        {
          "id": 254,
          "start": 760.02,
          "end": 763.34,
          "en": "much, much nicer, I would say.",
          "zh": "好上非常多了，我會這麼說。"
        },
        {
          "id": 255,
          "start": 763.34,
          "end": 766.07,
          "en": "Why don't we make sure that as a next step,",
          "zh": "我們何不確保在下一步，"
        },
        {
          "id": 256,
          "start": 766.07,
          "end": 768.4,
          "en": "we can also go to the Details page",
          "zh": "我們也可以前往 Details 頁面，"
        },
        {
          "id": 257,
          "start": 768.4,
          "end": 772.023,
          "en": "and view the concrete details for a selected coach.",
          "zh": "並檢視所選教練的具體詳細資料。"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "21879930",
      "title": "Building the Coach Detail Component",
      "lectureOrder": 244,
      "videoOrder": 216,
      "sourceHash": "b4ec6c736662d487d0e22b46b1cd802c3bb9c3641d9b7bd48911e66f76008875",
      "cues": [
        {
          "id": 1,
          "start": 2.18,
          "end": 4.93,
          "en": "So onwards to the coach detail page,",
          "zh": "那麼接著來到教練詳細資料頁面，"
        },
        {
          "id": 2,
          "start": 4.93,
          "end": 7.81,
          "en": "it's time to replace the dummy content we got here",
          "zh": "是時候把我們這裡的假內容換掉，"
        },
        {
          "id": 3,
          "start": 7.81,
          "end": 9.403,
          "en": "with some real content.",
          "zh": "換成一些真實內容。"
        },
        {
          "id": 4,
          "start": 10.24,
          "end": 12.85,
          "en": "For that I'm going to get rid of all the continent here",
          "zh": "為此，我要把這裡的所有內容都拿掉，"
        },
        {
          "id": 5,
          "start": 12.85,
          "end": 15.02,
          "en": "and write this from scratch again.",
          "zh": "然後重新從頭寫一次。"
        },
        {
          "id": 6,
          "start": 15.02,
          "end": 17.823,
          "en": "In this component, I want to have a section,",
          "zh": "在這個元件裡，我想要有一個區塊，"
        },
        {
          "id": 7,
          "start": 19.43,
          "end": 23.27,
          "en": "where I first of all, let's say using that base card,",
          "zh": "首先，就說使用那個 base card 吧，"
        },
        {
          "id": 8,
          "start": 23.27,
          "end": 26.14,
          "en": "I would put the name and the rate of the coach.",
          "zh": "我會放入教練的名字和費率。"
        },
        {
          "id": 9,
          "start": 26.14,
          "end": 31.11,
          "en": "So here we could have the h2 tag,",
          "zh": "所以這裡我們可以有 h2 標籤，"
        },
        {
          "id": 10,
          "start": 31.11,
          "end": 34.383,
          "en": "where we output the full name.",
          "zh": "在這裡輸出全名。"
        },
        {
          "id": 11,
          "start": 35.43,
          "end": 39.26,
          "en": "And below that age h3 tag, where we output it to rate.",
          "zh": "而在下面是一個 h3 標籤，在那裡輸出 rate。"
        },
        {
          "id": 12,
          "start": 39.26,
          "end": 44.26,
          "en": "So dollar sign then interpolate to rate",
          "zh": "所以先寫錢字號，然後插值 rate，"
        },
        {
          "id": 13,
          "start": 44.62,
          "end": 47.35,
          "en": "and then make it clear that it's an hourly rate",
          "zh": "然後說清楚這是每小時的費率，"
        },
        {
          "id": 14,
          "start": 47.35,
          "end": 48.883,
          "en": "by adding /hour.",
          "zh": "加上 /hour。"
        },
        {
          "id": 15,
          "start": 50.38,
          "end": 53.37,
          "en": "The next section of data which I wanna have",
          "zh": "我接下來想放在"
        },
        {
          "id": 16,
          "start": 53.37,
          "end": 58.37,
          "en": "on this page here is let's say the contact button.",
          "zh": "這個頁面上的下一個區塊，就說是聯絡按鈕吧。"
        },
        {
          "id": 17,
          "start": 58.73,
          "end": 62.193,
          "en": "So here again using the base card,",
          "zh": "所以這裡同樣使用 base card，"
        },
        {
          "id": 18,
          "start": 63.64,
          "end": 68.367,
          "en": "I will add a number h2 tag actually, like this",
          "zh": "我其實會加上一個 h2 標籤，像這樣，"
        },
        {
          "id": 19,
          "start": 70.07,
          "end": 75.07,
          "en": "where I wanna say interested, reach out now.",
          "zh": "在這裡我想寫「有興趣嗎？立刻聯絡我們」。"
        },
        {
          "id": 20,
          "start": 75.13,
          "end": 78.61,
          "en": "And below that render a base button, which of course",
          "zh": "然後在下面渲染一個 base button，它當然"
        },
        {
          "id": 21,
          "start": 78.61,
          "end": 82.03999999999999,
          "en": "will technically be a link, so we should add the link prop",
          "zh": "技術上會是一個連結，所以我們應該加上 link prop，"
        },
        {
          "id": 22,
          "start": 82.03999999999999,
          "end": 86.85,
          "en": "going to the contact page for this specific coach.",
          "zh": "指向這位特定教練的聯絡頁面。"
        },
        {
          "id": 23,
          "start": 86.85,
          "end": 89.61,
          "en": "Now of course this coach will have a dynamic ID,",
          "zh": "當然，這位教練會有動態的 ID，"
        },
        {
          "id": 24,
          "start": 89.61,
          "end": 92.14,
          "en": "We can view this page for different coaches.",
          "zh": "我們可以為不同教練檢視這個頁面。"
        },
        {
          "id": 25,
          "start": 92.14,
          "end": 95.5,
          "en": "So I will bind to two contact link,",
          "zh": "所以我會把 to 綁定到 contactLink，"
        },
        {
          "id": 26,
          "start": 95.5,
          "end": 98.6,
          "en": "which is a computed property just like full name",
          "zh": "它是一個 computed 屬性，就像 fullName 一樣，"
        },
        {
          "id": 27,
          "start": 98.6,
          "end": 100.62,
          "en": "which we will add soon.",
          "zh": "我們很快就會加上。"
        },
        {
          "id": 28,
          "start": 100.62,
          "end": 102.82300000000001,
          "en": "And on this button, I'll just say contact.",
          "zh": "而在這個按鈕上，我就寫 contact。"
        },
        {
          "id": 29,
          "start": 104.50999999999999,
          "end": 109.50999999999999,
          "en": "Actually, I'll put this into a header tag here,",
          "zh": "其實，我會把這個放進這裡的 header 標籤，"
        },
        {
          "id": 30,
          "start": 110.37,
          "end": 112.13300000000001,
          "en": "the h2 tag and the button.",
          "zh": "也就是 h2 標籤和按鈕。"
        },
        {
          "id": 31,
          "start": 114.02000000000001,
          "end": 116.7,
          "en": "And below that now at the router view,",
          "zh": "而在那下面，現在加上 router-view，"
        },
        {
          "id": 32,
          "start": 116.7,
          "end": 120.17,
          "en": "where later does nested child route",
          "zh": "之後巢狀的子路由，"
        },
        {
          "id": 33,
          "start": 120.17,
          "end": 122.403,
          "en": "to contact forum will be rendered.",
          "zh": "到聯絡表單，會在那裡被渲染。"
        },
        {
          "id": 34,
          "start": 123.75,
          "end": 127.34,
          "en": "And now below that section with the contact forum",
          "zh": "而現在，在那個含有聯絡表單的區塊下方，"
        },
        {
          "id": 35,
          "start": 127.34,
          "end": 130.74,
          "en": "at the contact button below that section.",
          "zh": "以及在該區塊下方的聯絡按鈕之後。"
        },
        {
          "id": 36,
          "start": 130.74,
          "end": 133.37,
          "en": "I'll add a number of section where I use a base card",
          "zh": "我會再加上另一個區塊，在那裡使用 base card，"
        },
        {
          "id": 37,
          "start": 135,
          "end": 138.62,
          "en": "in which I want to show the badges.",
          "zh": "我想在裡面顯示這些 badge。"
        },
        {
          "id": 38,
          "start": 138.62,
          "end": 142.92000000000002,
          "en": "So the areas of expertise using the base badge component",
          "zh": "也就是專業領域，使用 base badge 元件，"
        },
        {
          "id": 39,
          "start": 142.92000000000002,
          "end": 146.32999999999998,
          "en": "and below that the description for that coach.",
          "zh": "然後在下面加上那位教練的說明。"
        },
        {
          "id": 40,
          "start": 146.32999999999998,
          "end": 150.05,
          "en": "So here a paragraph where output description.",
          "zh": "所以這裡用一個段落，輸出 description。"
        },
        {
          "id": 41,
          "start": 150.05,
          "end": 152.86,
          "en": "Tt's not something we rendered before in any component",
          "zh": "這不是我們之前在任何元件中渲染過的東西，"
        },
        {
          "id": 42,
          "start": 152.86,
          "end": 155.363,
          "en": "it should of course be included in the details.",
          "zh": "它當然應該被包含在詳細資料裡。"
        },
        {
          "id": 43,
          "start": 156.91,
          "end": 161.01,
          "en": "And on the badge we use v-for to go through the area",
          "zh": "而在 badge 上，我們使用 v-for 來遍歷 area，"
        },
        {
          "id": 44,
          "start": 161.01,
          "end": 166.01,
          "en": "in areas, bind to key to area, bind the type two area",
          "zh": "在 areas 裡，把 key 綁定到 area、把 type 綁定到 area，"
        },
        {
          "id": 45,
          "start": 168.34,
          "end": 170.44,
          "en": "and bind the title two area.",
          "zh": "並把 title 綁定到 area。"
        },
        {
          "id": 46,
          "start": 170.44,
          "end": 172.423,
          "en": "So basically as we did it before.",
          "zh": "基本上就像我們之前做的那樣。"
        },
        {
          "id": 47,
          "start": 174.87,
          "end": 178.18,
          "en": "Now for the script section here,",
          "zh": "現在來到這裡的 script 區段，"
        },
        {
          "id": 48,
          "start": 178.18,
          "end": 182.04,
          "en": "of course we get props here and actually I don't get",
          "zh": "當然我們這裡會取得 props，而其實我並不是"
        },
        {
          "id": 49,
          "start": 182.04,
          "end": 185.45,
          "en": "all these values here as props,",
          "zh": "把這裡所有這些值都當成 props 取得，"
        },
        {
          "id": 50,
          "start": 185.45,
          "end": 188.53,
          "en": "but I just get an ID as a prop.",
          "zh": "而是只取得一個 ID 作為 prop。"
        },
        {
          "id": 51,
          "start": 188.53,
          "end": 191.133,
          "en": "Now, why do I get an ID as a prop here?",
          "zh": "那麼，為什麼我這裡要取得一個 ID 作為 prop 呢？"
        },
        {
          "id": 52,
          "start": 192.13,
          "end": 194.86,
          "en": "keep in mind, how does component will be loaded.",
          "zh": "請記住，這個元件是怎麼被載入的。"
        },
        {
          "id": 53,
          "start": 194.86,
          "end": 196.773,
          "en": "It will be loaded through routing.",
          "zh": "它會透過路由被載入。"
        },
        {
          "id": 54,
          "start": 197.78,
          "end": 200.41,
          "en": "The coach detailed component is loaded here",
          "zh": "coach detail 元件是在這裡被載入的，"
        },
        {
          "id": 55,
          "start": 200.41,
          "end": 201.463,
          "en": "on this path.",
          "zh": "在這條路徑上。"
        },
        {
          "id": 56,
          "start": 202.41,
          "end": 206.97,
          "en": "Therefore, theoretically, it wouldn't get any props at all.",
          "zh": "因此，理論上它根本不會取得任何 props。"
        },
        {
          "id": 57,
          "start": 206.97,
          "end": 209.45,
          "en": "The router loads it and the router by default",
          "zh": "是 router 載入它的，而 router 預設"
        },
        {
          "id": 58,
          "start": 209.45,
          "end": 211.52,
          "en": "passes no props.",
          "zh": "不會傳遞任何 props。"
        },
        {
          "id": 59,
          "start": 211.52,
          "end": 213.87,
          "en": "But you learned in the routing module",
          "zh": "但你在路由模組中學到，"
        },
        {
          "id": 60,
          "start": 213.87,
          "end": 218.06,
          "en": "that by adding props true to the route config,",
          "zh": "只要在路由設定中加上 props: true，"
        },
        {
          "id": 61,
          "start": 218.06,
          "end": 221.49,
          "en": "you can ensure that this dynamic value.",
          "zh": "就能確保這個動態值，"
        },
        {
          "id": 62,
          "start": 221.49,
          "end": 225.17000000000002,
          "en": "So the concrete value for the URL, which is then visited,",
          "zh": "也就是實際被造訪的 URL 的具體值，"
        },
        {
          "id": 63,
          "start": 225.17000000000002,
          "end": 230.17000000000002,
          "en": "is passed in as a prop of that name into that component.",
          "zh": "會以該名稱作為 prop 傳入那個元件。"
        },
        {
          "id": 64,
          "start": 231.1,
          "end": 233.95,
          "en": "So here I named this ID and therefore,",
          "zh": "所以這裡我把它命名為 id，因此，"
        },
        {
          "id": 65,
          "start": 233.95,
          "end": 237.76,
          "en": "when adding props true here, the view router will pass",
          "zh": "在這裡加上 props: true 之後，Vue Router 會把"
        },
        {
          "id": 66,
          "start": 237.76,
          "end": 242.76,
          "en": "the value ID holds in the end as a prop to coach detail.",
          "zh": "id 最終持有的值當成 prop 傳給 coach detail。"
        },
        {
          "id": 67,
          "start": 243.37,
          "end": 248.163,
          "en": "And that's why I wanted, or I expected as a prop here.",
          "zh": "這就是為什麼我這裡想要、或者說預期會有一個 prop。"
        },
        {
          "id": 68,
          "start": 249.44,
          "end": 253.78,
          "en": "And we can then later use that data, that ID to fetch",
          "zh": "而我們之後就可以使用那個資料、那個 ID 來取得"
        },
        {
          "id": 69,
          "start": 253.78,
          "end": 256.933,
          "en": "the relevant coach data from our Vuex store.",
          "zh": "我們 Vuex store 中相關的教練資料。"
        },
        {
          "id": 70,
          "start": 258.19,
          "end": 262.17,
          "en": "For that, I'll add a data option here where I add",
          "zh": "為此，我會在這裡加上 data 選項，在裡面加入"
        },
        {
          "id": 71,
          "start": 262.17,
          "end": 266.89,
          "en": "a selected coach field, which initially is null.",
          "zh": "一個 selectedCoach 欄位，它一開始是 null。"
        },
        {
          "id": 72,
          "start": 266.89,
          "end": 269.14,
          "en": "But which soon will not be null",
          "zh": "但它很快就不會是 null，"
        },
        {
          "id": 73,
          "start": 269.14,
          "end": 272.08,
          "en": "because when this component is created",
          "zh": "因為當這個元件被建立時，"
        },
        {
          "id": 74,
          "start": 272.08,
          "end": 274.97,
          "en": "using the created lifecycle hook,",
          "zh": "使用 created 生命週期鉤子，"
        },
        {
          "id": 75,
          "start": 274.97,
          "end": 277.09000000000003,
          "en": "I want to reach out to Vuex",
          "zh": "我想要向 Vuex 取得資料，"
        },
        {
          "id": 76,
          "start": 277.09000000000003,
          "end": 280.44,
          "en": "and fetched a concrete coach data for this ID,",
          "zh": "並為這個 ID 取得具體的教練資料，"
        },
        {
          "id": 77,
          "start": 280.44,
          "end": 282.963,
          "en": "and then set selected coach equal to that.",
          "zh": "然後把 selectedCoach 設為那個資料。"
        },
        {
          "id": 78,
          "start": 283.8,
          "end": 287.03,
          "en": "So in created, I'll set this selected coach equal",
          "zh": "所以在 created 裡，我會把 this.selectedCoach 設為"
        },
        {
          "id": 79,
          "start": 287.03,
          "end": 290.773,
          "en": "to this dollar sign store getters,",
          "zh": "this.$store.getters，"
        },
        {
          "id": 80,
          "start": 291.74,
          "end": 296.1,
          "en": "and then go to coaches, so to the coaches namespace",
          "zh": "然後前往 coaches，也就是到 coaches 命名空間的"
        },
        {
          "id": 81,
          "start": 296.1,
          "end": 299.28,
          "en": "/coaches getting all coaches.",
          "zh": "/coaches，取得所有教練。"
        },
        {
          "id": 82,
          "start": 299.28,
          "end": 301.81,
          "en": "But of course here I don't need all coaches",
          "zh": "但當然這裡我不需要所有教練，"
        },
        {
          "id": 83,
          "start": 301.81,
          "end": 306.81,
          "en": "instead I'll call find and find once a function",
          "zh": "而是會呼叫 find，並傳入一個函式，"
        },
        {
          "id": 84,
          "start": 306.95,
          "end": 309.3,
          "en": "where I go through all the coaches",
          "zh": "在裡面遍歷所有教練，"
        },
        {
          "id": 85,
          "start": 309.3,
          "end": 313.5,
          "en": "and compare the ID of every coach to this ID.",
          "zh": "並把每位教練的 ID 拿來和這個 ID 比較。"
        },
        {
          "id": 86,
          "start": 313.5,
          "end": 316.03,
          "en": "So to the ID where you received as a prop",
          "zh": "也就是和你作為 prop 收到的 ID 比較，"
        },
        {
          "id": 87,
          "start": 316.03,
          "end": 317.23,
          "en": "which is part of our URL",
          "zh": "那個 ID 是我們 URL 的一部分，"
        },
        {
          "id": 88,
          "start": 318.08,
          "end": 321.03,
          "en": "and if that returns true, that's the coach",
          "zh": "如果回傳 true，那就是那位教練，"
        },
        {
          "id": 89,
          "start": 321.03,
          "end": 322.74,
          "en": "which we ultimately return",
          "zh": "我們最終會回傳它，"
        },
        {
          "id": 90,
          "start": 322.74,
          "end": 324.923,
          "en": "and which we store in selected coach.",
          "zh": "並把它存進 selectedCoach。"
        },
        {
          "id": 91,
          "start": 326.3,
          "end": 330.073,
          "en": "And that's how we find a coach in our coaches list.",
          "zh": "這就是我們在教練列表中尋找教練的方式。"
        },
        {
          "id": 92,
          "start": 331.22,
          "end": 333.47,
          "en": "Now, theoretically, this could of course fail",
          "zh": "現在，理論上這當然有可能失敗，"
        },
        {
          "id": 93,
          "start": 333.47,
          "end": 336.26,
          "en": "If the user enters this with a URL",
          "zh": "如果使用者輸入的 URL"
        },
        {
          "id": 94,
          "start": 336.26,
          "end": 339.05,
          "en": "that contains the ID of a coach we don't know.",
          "zh": "含有我們不認識的教練 ID。"
        },
        {
          "id": 95,
          "start": 339.05,
          "end": 342.68,
          "en": "But this is only possible if a user directly enters",
          "zh": "但這只有在使用者直接輸入"
        },
        {
          "id": 96,
          "start": 342.68,
          "end": 345.8,
          "en": "this URL not through the links on our page.",
          "zh": "這個 URL、而不是透過我們頁面上的連結時才可能發生。"
        },
        {
          "id": 97,
          "start": 345.8,
          "end": 347.8,
          "en": "And therefore if the user does that,",
          "zh": "因此，如果使用者這麼做，"
        },
        {
          "id": 98,
          "start": 347.8,
          "end": 350.51,
          "en": "I'm fine with a broken experience",
          "zh": "我可以接受體驗壞掉，"
        },
        {
          "id": 99,
          "start": 350.51,
          "end": 353.31,
          "en": "because that is actually not even a way",
          "zh": "因為那其實根本不是一種"
        },
        {
          "id": 100,
          "start": 353.31,
          "end": 356.4,
          "en": "of using that app which I want to support.",
          "zh": "我想要支援的 App 使用方式。"
        },
        {
          "id": 101,
          "start": 356.4,
          "end": 358.52,
          "en": "So therefore fine for me to fetch",
          "zh": "所以對我來說，這樣取得"
        },
        {
          "id": 102,
          "start": 358.52,
          "end": 362.12,
          "en": "the selected coach like this, store it in data here",
          "zh": "selected coach、把它存在這裡的 data 是沒問題的，"
        },
        {
          "id": 103,
          "start": 362.12,
          "end": 367.06,
          "en": "and then add some computer properties to make sure we have",
          "zh": "然後再加上一些 computed 屬性，確保我們有"
        },
        {
          "id": 104,
          "start": 367.06,
          "end": 371.07,
          "en": "things like the full name or the contact link here.",
          "zh": "像 fullName 或 contactLink 這樣的東西。"
        },
        {
          "id": 105,
          "start": 371.07,
          "end": 375.67,
          "en": "So here let's add full name where I return",
          "zh": "所以這裡讓我們加上 fullName，在裡面回傳"
        },
        {
          "id": 106,
          "start": 375.67,
          "end": 379.003,
          "en": "this selected coach, first name,",
          "zh": "this.selectedCoach.firstName，"
        },
        {
          "id": 107,
          "start": 380.05,
          "end": 385.05,
          "en": "plus a blank , plus this selected coach, last name",
          "zh": "加上一個空格，再加上 this.selectedCoach.lastName，"
        },
        {
          "id": 108,
          "start": 386.18,
          "end": 389.83,
          "en": "and add a contact link, computed property",
          "zh": "然後加上 contactLink 這個 computed 屬性，"
        },
        {
          "id": 109,
          "start": 389.83,
          "end": 394.83,
          "en": "where I return this dollar sign route path",
          "zh": "在裡面回傳 this.$route.path"
        },
        {
          "id": 110,
          "start": 396.81,
          "end": 401.81,
          "en": "plus slash plus this ID plus a slash contact.",
          "zh": "加上斜線，加上 this.id，再加上 /contact。"
        },
        {
          "id": 111,
          "start": 405.51,
          "end": 408.07,
          "en": "Now, keep in mind we're all to referring to rate",
          "zh": "現在請記住，我們在 template 裡全都參考到 rate"
        },
        {
          "id": 112,
          "start": 408.07,
          "end": 413.07,
          "en": "and to areas here in our template and to description.",
          "zh": "以及 areas，還有 description。"
        },
        {
          "id": 113,
          "start": 413.29,
          "end": 416.55,
          "en": "And currently these data properties don't exist,",
          "zh": "但目前這些 data 屬性並不存在，"
        },
        {
          "id": 114,
          "start": 416.55,
          "end": 418.87,
          "en": "we just got the selected coach.",
          "zh": "我們只有 selectedCoach。"
        },
        {
          "id": 115,
          "start": 418.87,
          "end": 422.23,
          "en": "So this should actually be SelectedCoach.areas,",
          "zh": "所以這裡其實應該是 selectedCoach.areas，"
        },
        {
          "id": 116,
          "start": 425.62,
          "end": 430.38,
          "en": "or actually better use computed properties.",
          "zh": "或者其實更好的做法是使用 computed 屬性。"
        },
        {
          "id": 117,
          "start": 430.38,
          "end": 434.94,
          "en": "So here then add the areas, computed property,",
          "zh": "所以這裡就加上 areas 這個 computed 屬性，"
        },
        {
          "id": 118,
          "start": 434.94,
          "end": 439.28,
          "en": "for example, where I return this selectedcoach.areas",
          "zh": "舉例來說，在裡面回傳 this.selectedCoach.areas，"
        },
        {
          "id": 119,
          "start": 440.13,
          "end": 444.64,
          "en": "and add the rate computed property,",
          "zh": "再加上 rate 這個 computed 屬性，"
        },
        {
          "id": 120,
          "start": 444.64,
          "end": 449.08,
          "en": "where I return this selectedcoach.hourlyrate.",
          "zh": "在裡面回傳 this.selectedCoach.hourlyRate。"
        },
        {
          "id": 121,
          "start": 453.2,
          "end": 458.2,
          "en": "And return the description computed property,",
          "zh": "以及加上回傳 description 的 computed 屬性，"
        },
        {
          "id": 122,
          "start": 459.03,
          "end": 463.257,
          "en": "where I return this selectedcoach.description .",
          "zh": "在裡面回傳 this.selectedCoach.description。"
        },
        {
          "id": 123,
          "start": 465.29,
          "end": 469.33,
          "en": "with that, if we now go to the details here,",
          "zh": "這樣一來，如果我們現在前往這裡的詳細資料，"
        },
        {
          "id": 124,
          "start": 469.33,
          "end": 472.36,
          "en": "we see the details for this coach.",
          "zh": "我們就會看到這位教練的詳細資料。"
        },
        {
          "id": 125,
          "start": 472.36,
          "end": 476.64,
          "en": "So that is working and we see our different data",
          "zh": "所以這運作正常，我們現在可以在畫面上"
        },
        {
          "id": 126,
          "start": 476.64,
          "end": 478.53,
          "en": "on the screen now.",
          "zh": "看到我們不同的資料。"
        },
        {
          "id": 127,
          "start": 478.53,
          "end": 481.27,
          "en": "So that's that details page ,",
          "zh": "這就是那個詳細資料頁面，"
        },
        {
          "id": 128,
          "start": 481.27,
          "end": 484.08,
          "en": "of course you can tweak the styling to whatever you want",
          "zh": "當然你可以把樣式調整成任何你想要的樣子，"
        },
        {
          "id": 129,
          "start": 484.08,
          "end": 485.78,
          "en": "but I'm happy with this.",
          "zh": "但我對這樣很滿意。"
        },
        {
          "id": 130,
          "start": 485.78,
          "end": 489.67,
          "en": "Now it's up to us with what we want to continue",
          "zh": "現在就看我們想繼續做什麼，"
        },
        {
          "id": 131,
          "start": 489.67,
          "end": 493.41,
          "en": "the register page, the contact page,",
          "zh": "註冊頁面、聯絡頁面，"
        },
        {
          "id": 132,
          "start": 493.41,
          "end": 497.55,
          "en": "maybe the filter components to make sure we can filter.",
          "zh": "或許還有篩選元件，確保我們可以篩選。"
        },
        {
          "id": 133,
          "start": 497.55,
          "end": 499.43,
          "en": "I would say that's a good next step.",
          "zh": "我會說那是很好的下一步。"
        },
        {
          "id": 134,
          "start": 499.43,
          "end": 502.963,
          "en": "So I will continue with adding that filtering logic next.",
          "zh": "所以我接下來會繼續加上那個篩選邏輯。"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "21879936",
      "title": "Filtering Coaches",
      "lectureOrder": 245,
      "videoOrder": 217,
      "sourceHash": "fab9b7b8bf6a19671d20b793be0bbe7b2db2d884811256cdf1ed24b30effe535",
      "cues": [
        {
          "id": 1,
          "start": 2.07,
          "end": 5.23,
          "en": "So let's continue with that filter component",
          "zh": "所以讓我們繼續處理那個 filter component，"
        },
        {
          "id": 2,
          "start": 5.23,
          "end": 9.22,
          "en": "on CoachesList at the moment, I'm just saying filter here,",
          "zh": "在 CoachesList 上，目前我在這裡只寫了 filter，"
        },
        {
          "id": 3,
          "start": 9.22,
          "end": 11.62,
          "en": "and of course, we'll need a bit more than that.",
          "zh": "而當然，我們會需要比那更多一點。"
        },
        {
          "id": 4,
          "start": 11.62,
          "end": 14.98,
          "en": "Now all the markup at the logic related to the filtering",
          "zh": "現在所有跟篩選相關的 markup 和邏輯，"
        },
        {
          "id": 5,
          "start": 14.98,
          "end": 17.39,
          "en": "or to the filtering form, I would say,",
          "zh": "或者說跟篩選表單相關的，"
        },
        {
          "id": 6,
          "start": 17.39,
          "end": 19.42,
          "en": "should go into a separate component,",
          "zh": "應該放到一個獨立的 component 裡，"
        },
        {
          "id": 7,
          "start": 19.42,
          "end": 22.903,
          "en": "again to keep CoachesList relatively small.",
          "zh": "同樣是為了讓 CoachesList 保持相對精簡。"
        },
        {
          "id": 8,
          "start": 23.91,
          "end": 26.26,
          "en": "And therefore in source, components, coaches,",
          "zh": "因此，在 src/components/coaches，"
        },
        {
          "id": 9,
          "start": 26.26,
          "end": 29.4,
          "en": "I'll add a second component next to coach item.",
          "zh": "我會在 coach item 旁邊加上第二個 component。"
        },
        {
          "id": 10,
          "start": 29.4,
          "end": 32.79,
          "en": "And that's the CoachFilter.vue file.",
          "zh": "那就是 CoachFilter.vue 檔案。"
        },
        {
          "id": 11,
          "start": 32.79,
          "end": 36.44,
          "en": "In there, I wanna set up all the markup and base logic",
          "zh": "在裡面，我想要建立所有我們需要的 markup 和基礎邏輯，"
        },
        {
          "id": 12,
          "start": 36.44,
          "end": 39.09,
          "en": "that we need to let the user choose",
          "zh": "讓我們可以讓使用者選擇"
        },
        {
          "id": 13,
          "start": 39.09,
          "end": 41.97,
          "en": "between different filtering options.",
          "zh": "不同的篩選選項。"
        },
        {
          "id": 14,
          "start": 41.97,
          "end": 45.71,
          "en": "Now, I will use the base-card component in here as well,",
          "zh": "現在，我在這裡也會使用 base-card component，"
        },
        {
          "id": 15,
          "start": 45.71,
          "end": 49.4,
          "en": "so that we have that base container style here.",
          "zh": "這樣我們在這裡就有那個基礎容器樣式。"
        },
        {
          "id": 16,
          "start": 49.4,
          "end": 54.4,
          "en": "And then in there, maybe say an H2 tag, Find Your Coach.",
          "zh": "然後在裡面，也許放一個 h2 標籤，寫著 Find Your Coach。"
        },
        {
          "id": 17,
          "start": 55.07,
          "end": 59.62,
          "en": "And then below that, render a couple of checkboxes.",
          "zh": "接著在那下面，render 幾個 checkbox。"
        },
        {
          "id": 18,
          "start": 59.62,
          "end": 62.73,
          "en": "Now, he I wanna present three filtering options.",
          "zh": "現在，我想要呈現三個篩選選項。"
        },
        {
          "id": 19,
          "start": 62.73,
          "end": 67.5,
          "en": "Because in our store, we have free areas of expertise.",
          "zh": "因為在我們的 store 裡，我們有三個專業領域。"
        },
        {
          "id": 20,
          "start": 67.5,
          "end": 68.53,
          "en": "In this entire app,",
          "zh": "在整個 app 裡，"
        },
        {
          "id": 21,
          "start": 68.53,
          "end": 71.776,
          "en": "I support these three areas of expertise,",
          "zh": "我支援這三個專業領域，"
        },
        {
          "id": 22,
          "start": 71.776,
          "end": 74.02,
          "en": "frontend, backend, career.",
          "zh": "frontend、backend、career。"
        },
        {
          "id": 23,
          "start": 74.02,
          "end": 76.19,
          "en": "So these are the free filtering options",
          "zh": "所以這些就是三個"
        },
        {
          "id": 24,
          "start": 76.19,
          "end": 78.15,
          "en": "that should be presented here.",
          "zh": "應該在這裡呈現的篩選選項。"
        },
        {
          "id": 25,
          "start": 78.15,
          "end": 81.53,
          "en": "Therefore, I will actually use, let's say,",
          "zh": "因此，我其實會使用，比如說，"
        },
        {
          "id": 26,
          "start": 81.53,
          "end": 83.093,
          "en": "a span as a wrapper,",
          "zh": "一個 span 當作外層容器，"
        },
        {
          "id": 27,
          "start": 84.12,
          "end": 86.76,
          "en": "add a class of filter-option to it,",
          "zh": "給它加上 class filter-option，"
        },
        {
          "id": 28,
          "start": 86.76,
          "end": 89.43,
          "en": "this will become important for styling later.",
          "zh": "這之後對樣式設定會很重要。"
        },
        {
          "id": 29,
          "start": 89.43,
          "end": 94.43,
          "en": "And in that span, have an input of type checkbox",
          "zh": "而在那個 span 裡，放一個 type 是 checkbox 的 input，"
        },
        {
          "id": 30,
          "start": 94.64,
          "end": 97.15,
          "en": "with an ID of frontend, let's say",
          "zh": "比如說 id 是 frontend，"
        },
        {
          "id": 31,
          "start": 97.15,
          "end": 99.82,
          "en": "and which is checked initially,",
          "zh": "而且它一開始是勾選的，"
        },
        {
          "id": 32,
          "start": 99.82,
          "end": 103.58,
          "en": "because here I'll make sure that all filter options",
          "zh": "因為在這裡我會確保所有篩選選項，"
        },
        {
          "id": 33,
          "start": 103.58,
          "end": 105.68,
          "en": "or all inputs are checked initially,",
          "zh": "或者說所有 input 一開始都是勾選的，"
        },
        {
          "id": 34,
          "start": 105.68,
          "end": 109.083,
          "en": "and then the user can uncheck them and check them as needed.",
          "zh": "然後使用者可以視需要取消勾選或再勾選。"
        },
        {
          "id": 35,
          "start": 110.69,
          "end": 112.023,
          "en": "So that's the input here.",
          "zh": "這就是這裡的 input。"
        },
        {
          "id": 36,
          "start": 113.16,
          "end": 115.97,
          "en": "I also will add a label of course to make it clear",
          "zh": "我當然也會加上一個 label，以清楚表明"
        },
        {
          "id": 37,
          "start": 115.97,
          "end": 118.17,
          "en": "what this input refers to.",
          "zh": "這個 input 指的是什麼。"
        },
        {
          "id": 38,
          "start": 118.17,
          "end": 122.32,
          "en": "And here at the for attribute, to make sure that we point",
          "zh": "而這裡在 for 屬性上，確保我們指向"
        },
        {
          "id": 39,
          "start": 122.32,
          "end": 126.54,
          "en": "at this input with this label so that clicking the label",
          "zh": "這個帶有這個 label 的 input，這樣點擊 label"
        },
        {
          "id": 40,
          "start": 126.54,
          "end": 131.54,
          "en": "also checks this input and then add a text of frontend.",
          "zh": "也能勾選這個 input，然後加上文字 frontend。"
        },
        {
          "id": 41,
          "start": 132.08,
          "end": 134.76,
          "en": "And we can now repeat this twice,",
          "zh": "而我們現在可以把這個重複兩次，"
        },
        {
          "id": 42,
          "start": 134.76,
          "end": 139.61,
          "en": "because we also need our backend checkbox here,",
          "zh": "因為我們這裡也需要 backend 的 checkbox，"
        },
        {
          "id": 43,
          "start": 139.61,
          "end": 141.65,
          "en": "so let's add this.",
          "zh": "所以讓我們加上這個。"
        },
        {
          "id": 44,
          "start": 141.65,
          "end": 145.78,
          "en": "And we need the career checkbox,",
          "zh": "而我們需要 career 的 checkbox，"
        },
        {
          "id": 45,
          "start": 145.78,
          "end": 148.273,
          "en": "so that's also something we should add.",
          "zh": "所以那也是我們應該加上的東西。"
        },
        {
          "id": 46,
          "start": 151.39,
          "end": 152.59,
          "en": "Okay, so that's nice.",
          "zh": "好，這樣不錯。"
        },
        {
          "id": 47,
          "start": 152.59,
          "end": 154.57999999999998,
          "en": "Now we got these three checkboxes.",
          "zh": "現在我們有這三個 checkbox。"
        },
        {
          "id": 48,
          "start": 154.57999999999998,
          "end": 158.78,
          "en": "Now we need some logic to react to the user clicking",
          "zh": "現在我們需要一些邏輯來回應使用者點擊"
        },
        {
          "id": 49,
          "start": 158.78,
          "end": 160.603,
          "en": "on one of these checkboxes.",
          "zh": "其中一個 checkbox。"
        },
        {
          "id": 50,
          "start": 162.11,
          "end": 165.95,
          "en": "So therefore, I will add my script block down there",
          "zh": "因此，我會在下面加上我的 script 區塊，"
        },
        {
          "id": 51,
          "start": 165.95,
          "end": 168.07,
          "en": "and add a data property",
          "zh": "並加上一個 data 屬性，"
        },
        {
          "id": 52,
          "start": 168.07,
          "end": 170.34,
          "en": "because in this CoachFilter component,",
          "zh": "因為在這個 CoachFilter component 裡，"
        },
        {
          "id": 53,
          "start": 170.34,
          "end": 173.31,
          "en": "there is some internal data that we need to manage.",
          "zh": "有一些我們需要管理的內部資料。"
        },
        {
          "id": 54,
          "start": 173.31,
          "end": 176.68,
          "en": "I want to manage which filters the user chose",
          "zh": "我想要管理使用者選了哪些篩選條件，"
        },
        {
          "id": 55,
          "start": 176.68,
          "end": 179.57,
          "en": "or which options to user chose.",
          "zh": "或者說使用者選了哪些選項。"
        },
        {
          "id": 56,
          "start": 179.57,
          "end": 181.61,
          "en": "So here is this returned data object,",
          "zh": "所以這裡是回傳的 data 物件，"
        },
        {
          "id": 57,
          "start": 181.61,
          "end": 185.52,
          "en": "I'll add a filters key which holds another object",
          "zh": "我會加上一個 filters 鍵，裡頭包含另一個物件，"
        },
        {
          "id": 58,
          "start": 185.52,
          "end": 187.49,
          "en": "where I want to have a frontend filter",
          "zh": "我想要有一個 frontend 篩選項，"
        },
        {
          "id": 59,
          "start": 187.49,
          "end": 189.22,
          "en": "which initially is true,",
          "zh": "一開始是 true，"
        },
        {
          "id": 60,
          "start": 189.22,
          "end": 192.02,
          "en": "a backend filter which initially is true,",
          "zh": "一個 backend 篩選項，一開始是 true，"
        },
        {
          "id": 61,
          "start": 192.02,
          "end": 195.09,
          "en": "and a career filter, which is true.",
          "zh": "以及一個 career 篩選項，也是 true。"
        },
        {
          "id": 62,
          "start": 195.09,
          "end": 198.48,
          "en": "And that basically means as long as something is true",
          "zh": "這基本上表示，只要某個值是 true，"
        },
        {
          "id": 63,
          "start": 198.48,
          "end": 201.963,
          "en": "coaches that have that area of expertise should be shown.",
          "zh": "就應該顯示具備那個專業領域的教練。"
        },
        {
          "id": 64,
          "start": 203.53,
          "end": 206.59,
          "en": "And then I'll add a method to change that data.",
          "zh": "接著我會加上一個 method 來改變那份資料。"
        },
        {
          "id": 65,
          "start": 206.59,
          "end": 209.083,
          "en": "The let's say setFilter method.",
          "zh": "比如說就叫做 setFilter method。"
        },
        {
          "id": 66,
          "start": 210.45,
          "end": 213.53,
          "en": "This method should be bound to these inputs,",
          "zh": "這個 method 應該綁到這些 input 上，"
        },
        {
          "id": 67,
          "start": 213.53,
          "end": 214.95,
          "en": "that when they are clicked",
          "zh": "當它們被點擊，"
        },
        {
          "id": 68,
          "start": 214.95,
          "end": 219.07999999999998,
          "en": "or changed to be precise, setFilter runs.",
          "zh": "或者精確地說，被改變時，setFilter 就會執行。"
        },
        {
          "id": 69,
          "start": 219.07999999999998,
          "end": 223.85,
          "en": "For that we can listen to the change event here on input",
          "zh": "為此，我們可以在這裡的 input 上監聽 change 事件，"
        },
        {
          "id": 70,
          "start": 223.85,
          "end": 226.37,
          "en": "which is triggered whenever the value changes",
          "zh": "它會在任何值從已勾選變成未勾選，"
        },
        {
          "id": 71,
          "start": 226.37,
          "end": 229.61,
          "en": "from checked to unchecked or the other way around,",
          "zh": "或反過來時被觸發，"
        },
        {
          "id": 72,
          "start": 229.61,
          "end": 232.99,
          "en": "and that's when setFilter should be triggered.",
          "zh": "那就是 setFilter 應該被觸發的時候。"
        },
        {
          "id": 73,
          "start": 232.99,
          "end": 236.143,
          "en": "And therefore that of course gets added on all these inputs.",
          "zh": "因此這當然會加在所有這些 input 上。"
        },
        {
          "id": 74,
          "start": 237.57,
          "end": 241.89,
          "en": "Now setFilter therefore received default event object,",
          "zh": "現在 setFilter 因此會收到預設的 event 物件，"
        },
        {
          "id": 75,
          "start": 241.89,
          "end": 244.373,
          "en": "since we bind it to a default dom event.",
          "zh": "因為我們把它綁到一個預設的 DOM 事件。"
        },
        {
          "id": 76,
          "start": 246.45,
          "end": 248.74,
          "en": "And we can now extract two important pieces",
          "zh": "而我們現在可以從那個事件中"
        },
        {
          "id": 77,
          "start": 248.74,
          "end": 250.483,
          "en": "of information from that event.",
          "zh": "取出兩項重要的資訊。"
        },
        {
          "id": 78,
          "start": 251.81,
          "end": 254.17,
          "en": "The first one is the ID of the input",
          "zh": "第一項是那個被勾選、"
        },
        {
          "id": 79,
          "start": 254.17,
          "end": 256.73,
          "en": "that was checked or that was changed.",
          "zh": "或被改變的 input 的 id。"
        },
        {
          "id": 80,
          "start": 256.73,
          "end": 260.17,
          "en": "We get this by accessing event.target.id.",
          "zh": "我們透過存取 event.target.id 來取得它。"
        },
        {
          "id": 81,
          "start": 260.17,
          "end": 261.97,
          "en": "So that gives us access to these IDs",
          "zh": "這樣我們就能存取這些"
        },
        {
          "id": 82,
          "start": 261.97,
          "end": 263.813,
          "en": "which we added to these inputs.",
          "zh": "我們加在這些 input 上的 id。"
        },
        {
          "id": 83,
          "start": 265.11,
          "end": 268.227,
          "en": "And then the second piece of information is, isActive,",
          "zh": "而第二項資訊是 isActive，"
        },
        {
          "id": 84,
          "start": 269.198,
          "end": 270.59,
          "en": "is that currently checked?",
          "zh": "它目前有被勾選嗎？"
        },
        {
          "id": 85,
          "start": 270.59,
          "end": 273.25,
          "en": "For data we can access.event.target.checked",
          "zh": "為此我們可以存取 event.target.checked，"
        },
        {
          "id": 86,
          "start": 273.25,
          "end": 274.92,
          "en": "to find out whether data input",
          "zh": "來瞭解這個事件所觸發的 input"
        },
        {
          "id": 87,
          "start": 274.92,
          "end": 278.313,
          "en": "for which this event was triggered, is now checked or not.",
          "zh": "現在是否有被勾選。"
        },
        {
          "id": 88,
          "start": 279.25,
          "end": 284.25,
          "en": "And then I can derive my updatedFilters object here,",
          "zh": "接著我可以在這裡推導出我的 updatedFilters 物件，"
        },
        {
          "id": 89,
          "start": 285.2,
          "end": 287.67,
          "en": "where I copy the existing filters,",
          "zh": "我在裡面複製現有的 filters，"
        },
        {
          "id": 90,
          "start": 287.67,
          "end": 290.823,
          "en": "so does existing filters the option here?",
          "zh": "所以這裡是現有的 filters 選項，"
        },
        {
          "id": 91,
          "start": 292.09000000000003,
          "end": 295.57,
          "en": "With the spread operator, I copy it into this new object.",
          "zh": "用展開運算子，我把它複製進這個新物件。"
        },
        {
          "id": 92,
          "start": 295.57,
          "end": 299.12,
          "en": "So I copy all these properties into this new object,",
          "zh": "所以我把所有這些屬性複製進這個新物件，"
        },
        {
          "id": 93,
          "start": 299.12,
          "end": 302.86,
          "en": "but then we override one of these three properties.",
          "zh": "但接著我們覆寫這三個屬性中的一個。"
        },
        {
          "id": 94,
          "start": 302.86,
          "end": 305.85,
          "en": "We do this by dynamically setting the property name,",
          "zh": "我們透過動態設定屬性名稱來做到這件事，"
        },
        {
          "id": 95,
          "start": 305.85,
          "end": 308.73,
          "en": "which we wanna override and set it to our inputId,",
          "zh": "也就是我們想覆寫的那個，並把它設成我們的 inputId，"
        },
        {
          "id": 96,
          "start": 308.73,
          "end": 310.003,
          "en": "so to this constant.",
          "zh": "也就是這個常數。"
        },
        {
          "id": 97,
          "start": 311.22,
          "end": 314.76,
          "en": "This whole frontend, backend or career,",
          "zh": "也就是 frontend、backend 或 career，"
        },
        {
          "id": 98,
          "start": 314.76,
          "end": 317.47,
          "en": "and these are the input IDs we have here.",
          "zh": "而這些就是我們這裡的 input id。"
        },
        {
          "id": 99,
          "start": 317.47,
          "end": 321.24,
          "en": "So with that, we accessed one of these keys,",
          "zh": "這樣一來，我們就存取了其中一個鍵，"
        },
        {
          "id": 100,
          "start": 321.24,
          "end": 325.16,
          "en": "and set a new value for this dynamically set property.",
          "zh": "並為這個動態設定的屬性設定新值。"
        },
        {
          "id": 101,
          "start": 325.16,
          "end": 328.453,
          "en": "And the value is, isActive, which is true or false.",
          "zh": "而這個值就是 isActive，也就是 true 或 false。"
        },
        {
          "id": 102,
          "start": 330.81,
          "end": 333.24,
          "en": "And then we can set this filters,",
          "zh": "接著我們可以把 this.filters，"
        },
        {
          "id": 103,
          "start": 333.24,
          "end": 336.513,
          "en": "so our data option to the updatedFilters.",
          "zh": "也就是我們的 data 選項，設成 updatedFilters。"
        },
        {
          "id": 104,
          "start": 337.42,
          "end": 339.09000000000003,
          "en": "With that we should be able to manage",
          "zh": "這樣我們應該就能"
        },
        {
          "id": 105,
          "start": 339.09000000000003,
          "end": 341.2,
          "en": "the filters internally here.",
          "zh": "在這裡內部管理這些篩選條件。"
        },
        {
          "id": 106,
          "start": 341.2,
          "end": 342.59000000000003,
          "en": "But of course, that's not all.",
          "zh": "但當然，這還不是全部。"
        },
        {
          "id": 107,
          "start": 342.59000000000003,
          "end": 345.15999999999997,
          "en": "I also want to let the component that uses",
          "zh": "我也想要讓使用 CoachFilter component 的"
        },
        {
          "id": 108,
          "start": 345.15999999999997,
          "end": 349.05,
          "en": "the CoachFilter component, know about my filters.",
          "zh": "那個 component 知道我的篩選條件。"
        },
        {
          "id": 109,
          "start": 349.05,
          "end": 353.2,
          "en": "That's why I wanna emit, $emit a custom event here",
          "zh": "這就是為什麼我想要在這裡 $emit 一個自訂事件，"
        },
        {
          "id": 110,
          "start": 353.2,
          "end": 356.15999999999997,
          "en": "to communicate back to the parent component.",
          "zh": "來回傳訊息給父 component。"
        },
        {
          "id": 111,
          "start": 356.15999999999997,
          "end": 357.87,
          "en": "And that's the change-filter event,",
          "zh": "那就是 change-filter 事件，"
        },
        {
          "id": 112,
          "start": 357.87,
          "end": 360.91,
          "en": "let's say where I pass my updatedFilters,",
          "zh": "比如說我在裡面傳入我的 updatedFilters，"
        },
        {
          "id": 113,
          "start": 360.91,
          "end": 364.18,
          "en": "so where I provide the information about the updatedFilters",
          "zh": "也就是我提供關於 updatedFilters 的資訊"
        },
        {
          "id": 114,
          "start": 364.18,
          "end": 366.023,
          "en": "to the component that's listening.",
          "zh": "給正在監聽的那個 component。"
        },
        {
          "id": 115,
          "start": 367.53,
          "end": 368.363,
          "en": "And now it's of course,",
          "zh": "而現在，這當然是"
        },
        {
          "id": 116,
          "start": 368.363,
          "end": 372.32,
          "en": "a good practice to also add the emits option here,",
          "zh": "一個好做法，就是在這裡也加上 emits 選項，"
        },
        {
          "id": 117,
          "start": 372.32,
          "end": 375.08,
          "en": "and therefore make it clear that this component",
          "zh": "藉此清楚表明這個 component"
        },
        {
          "id": 118,
          "start": 375.08,
          "end": 377.103,
          "en": "emits a change-filter event.",
          "zh": "會發出 change-filter 事件。"
        },
        {
          "id": 119,
          "start": 378.62,
          "end": 380.29,
          "en": "Now we can add some styling,",
          "zh": "現在我們可以加上一些樣式，"
        },
        {
          "id": 120,
          "start": 380.29,
          "end": 382.58,
          "en": "so that's add some scoped styling.",
          "zh": "所以讓我們加上一些 scoped 樣式。"
        },
        {
          "id": 121,
          "start": 382.58,
          "end": 387.46,
          "en": "And as always attached you find the CoachFilter CSS file",
          "zh": "一如往常，附件裡有 CoachFilter 的 CSS 檔案，"
        },
        {
          "id": 122,
          "start": 387.46,
          "end": 389.21,
          "en": "with all those styles here,",
          "zh": "裡面有所有這些樣式，"
        },
        {
          "id": 123,
          "start": 389.21,
          "end": 391.713,
          "en": "which you can copy between your style tags.",
          "zh": "你可以把它們複製到你的 style 標籤之間。"
        },
        {
          "id": 124,
          "start": 394.24,
          "end": 396.882,
          "en": "With that we can now use CoachFilter",
          "zh": "這樣一來，我們現在就可以在"
        },
        {
          "id": 125,
          "start": 396.882,
          "end": 398.923,
          "en": "in the coachesList component.",
          "zh": "coachesList component 裡使用 CoachFilter。"
        },
        {
          "id": 126,
          "start": 400.08,
          "end": 404.59000000000003,
          "en": "So let's go to CoachesList and there first of all,",
          "zh": "所以讓我們前往 CoachesList，在那裡首先，"
        },
        {
          "id": 127,
          "start": 404.59000000000003,
          "end": 409.59000000000003,
          "en": "import CoachFilter from going up, going up, components,",
          "zh": "從往上、再往上，components、"
        },
        {
          "id": 128,
          "start": 410.14,
          "end": 415.14,
          "en": "coaches, CoachFilter.vue, and added here",
          "zh": "coaches、CoachFilter.vue 匯入 CoachFilter，並把它加到這裡"
        },
        {
          "id": 129,
          "start": 415.18,
          "end": 416.773,
          "en": "to the components option,",
          "zh": "的 components 選項，"
        },
        {
          "id": 130,
          "start": 418.61,
          "end": 421.51,
          "en": "and then added here instead of filter.",
          "zh": "然後在這裡取代 filter 加進去。"
        },
        {
          "id": 131,
          "start": 421.51,
          "end": 425.37,
          "en": "Here, I wanna add coach-filter",
          "zh": "在這裡，我想要加上 coach-filter，"
        },
        {
          "id": 132,
          "start": 425.37,
          "end": 428.853,
          "en": "like that, no, not like this, but like that.",
          "zh": "像那樣，不，不是這樣，而是那樣。"
        },
        {
          "id": 133,
          "start": 431.37,
          "end": 433.4,
          "en": "Of course here, I now want to listen",
          "zh": "當然在這裡，我現在想要監聽"
        },
        {
          "id": 134,
          "start": 433.4,
          "end": 437.7,
          "en": "to that change-filter event which is emitted eventually",
