        },
        {
          "id": 135,
          "start": 437.7,
          "end": 440.71,
          "en": "and call a setFilters method,",
          "zh": "並呼叫一個 setFilters method，"
        },
        {
          "id": 136,
          "start": 440.71,
          "end": 442.533,
          "en": "which we now have to add here.",
          "zh": "我們現在必須在這裡加上它。"
        },
        {
          "id": 137,
          "start": 443.55,
          "end": 448.547,
          "en": "So going down in this component, I'll add a methods key.",
          "zh": "所以往下到這個 component，我會加上一個 methods 鍵。"
        },
        {
          "id": 138,
          "start": 449.52,
          "end": 452.43,
          "en": "And in there add a setFilters method",
          "zh": "並在裡面加上一個 setFilters method，"
        },
        {
          "id": 139,
          "start": 452.43,
          "end": 455.653,
          "en": "where I get my updatedFilters as an argument,",
          "zh": "我在裡面會把 updatedFilters 當作引數取得，"
        },
        {
          "id": 140,
          "start": 456.5,
          "end": 459.14,
          "en": "because that is the kind of data we're emitting",
          "zh": "因為那就是我們在 CoachFilter component"
        },
        {
          "id": 141,
          "start": 459.14,
          "end": 461.62,
          "en": "in the CoachFilter component, right?",
          "zh": "裡發出的那種資料，對吧？"
        },
        {
          "id": 142,
          "start": 461.62,
          "end": 465.02,
          "en": "We pass the updatedFilters as an argument here",
          "zh": "我們在發出事件時，把 updatedFilters"
        },
        {
          "id": 143,
          "start": 465.02,
          "end": 466.57,
          "en": "when we emit the event.",
          "zh": "當作引數傳進去。"
        },
        {
          "id": 144,
          "start": 466.57,
          "end": 469.38,
          "en": "And therefore in the place where we listen to the event,",
          "zh": "因此，在我們監聽事件的地方，"
        },
        {
          "id": 145,
          "start": 469.38,
          "end": 471.563,
          "en": "we received this as a parameter.",
          "zh": "我們會把它當作參數收到。"
        },
        {
          "id": 146,
          "start": 475.15,
          "end": 479.17,
          "en": "And here I now want to manage a new piece of data",
          "zh": "而在這裡，我現在想要管理一筆新的資料，"
        },
        {
          "id": 147,
          "start": 479.17,
          "end": 480.84,
          "en": "or any data at all.",
          "zh": "或者說任何資料。"
        },
        {
          "id": 148,
          "start": 480.84,
          "end": 483.043,
          "en": "So let's add the data option in CoachesList.",
          "zh": "所以讓我們在 CoachesList 裡加上 data 選項。"
        },
        {
          "id": 149,
          "start": 484.25,
          "end": 486.3,
          "en": "And here in that object,",
          "zh": "而在這裡的那個物件裡，"
        },
        {
          "id": 150,
          "start": 486.3,
          "end": 491.3,
          "en": "I want to have an activeFilters data property,",
          "zh": "我想要有一個 activeFilters 的 data 屬性，"
        },
        {
          "id": 151,
          "start": 491.44,
          "end": 496.44,
          "en": "which also has frontend true, backend true, and career true.",
          "zh": "它同樣有 frontend: true、backend: true 和 career: true。"
        },
        {
          "id": 152,
          "start": 498.14,
          "end": 499.97,
          "en": "But this should now be overwritten",
          "zh": "但這個現在應該要在"
        },
        {
          "id": 153,
          "start": 499.97,
          "end": 502.52,
          "en": "whenever new filters are emitted.",
          "zh": "每當有新的篩選條件被發出時被覆寫。"
        },
        {
          "id": 154,
          "start": 502.52,
          "end": 506.6,
          "en": "So here in setFilters, I'll set this active filters equal",
          "zh": "所以在這裡的 setFilters，我會把 this.activeFilters 設為"
        },
        {
          "id": 155,
          "start": 506.6,
          "end": 508.253,
          "en": "to the updatedFilters.",
          "zh": "等於 updatedFilters。"
        },
        {
          "id": 156,
          "start": 509.52,
          "end": 512.32,
          "en": "And now with all of dead we can go back",
          "zh": "而現在，有了這一切，我們可以回到"
        },
        {
          "id": 157,
          "start": 512.32,
          "end": 515.68,
          "en": "to the filteredCoaches computed property.",
          "zh": "filteredCoaches 這個 computed 屬性。"
        },
        {
          "id": 158,
          "start": 515.68,
          "end": 518.69,
          "en": "And now not always return all coaches,",
          "zh": "而現在不要總是回傳所有教練，"
        },
        {
          "id": 159,
          "start": 518.69,
          "end": 521.113,
          "en": "but coaches that match our filters.",
          "zh": "而是回傳符合我們篩選條件的教練。"
        },
        {
          "id": 160,
          "start": 522.75,
          "end": 527.75,
          "en": "So here I get my coaches which is stored in a constant,",
          "zh": "所以在這裡我取得存在常數裡的 coaches，"
        },
        {
          "id": 161,
          "start": 528.02,
          "end": 531.12,
          "en": "but I will return coaches.filter,",
          "zh": "但我會回傳 coaches.filter，"
        },
        {
          "id": 162,
          "start": 531.12,
          "end": 532.88,
          "en": "calling the built in filter method",
          "zh": "呼叫 JavaScript 裡"
        },
        {
          "id": 163,
          "start": 532.88,
          "end": 536.69,
          "en": "which you can call on arrays in JavaScript,",
          "zh": "可以在陣列上呼叫的內建 filter method，"
        },
        {
          "id": 164,
          "start": 536.69,
          "end": 541.07,
          "en": "where we now execute a function on every item in coaches",
          "zh": "我們現在會在 coaches 裡的每個項目上執行一個函式，"
        },
        {
          "id": 165,
          "start": 541.07,
          "end": 544.03,
          "en": "and receive to coach as an input automatically",
          "zh": "並自動收到 coach"
        },
        {
          "id": 166,
          "start": 544.03,
          "end": 545.27,
          "en": "as a parameter.",
          "zh": "當作參數。"
        },
        {
          "id": 167,
          "start": 545.27,
          "end": 548.1,
          "en": "And now in here, I wanna have a couple of if checks,",
          "zh": "而現在在這裡，我想要有幾個 if 檢查，"
        },
        {
          "id": 168,
          "start": 548.1,
          "end": 553.05,
          "en": "and check if this.activeFilters.frontend is true,",
          "zh": "檢查 this.activeFilters.frontend 是否為 true，"
        },
        {
          "id": 169,
          "start": 553.05,
          "end": 554.74,
          "en": "which means I wanna show coaches",
          "zh": "這表示我想要顯示"
        },
        {
          "id": 170,
          "start": 554.74,
          "end": 559.17,
          "en": "that have the frontend area of expertise.",
          "zh": "具備 frontend 專業領域的教練。"
        },
        {
          "id": 171,
          "start": 559.17,
          "end": 561.35,
          "en": "So therefore I know that I want to show coaches",
          "zh": "因此我知道我想要顯示"
        },
        {
          "id": 172,
          "start": 561.35,
          "end": 563.13,
          "en": "with the frontend area.",
          "zh": "具備 frontend 領域的教練。"
        },
        {
          "id": 173,
          "start": 563.13,
          "end": 567.81,
          "en": "But now I can check if this coach in his or her areas",
          "zh": "但現在我可以檢查這位教練在他的 areas 裡"
        },
        {
          "id": 174,
          "start": 567.81,
          "end": 570.66,
          "en": "has this frontend key.",
          "zh": "是否有這個 frontend 鍵。"
        },
        {
          "id": 175,
          "start": 570.66,
          "end": 573.54,
          "en": "We can do this with coach.areas.includes",
          "zh": "我們可以用 coach.areas.includes 來做到，"
        },
        {
          "id": 176,
          "start": 573.54,
          "end": 576.88,
          "en": "which is a number built in method in JavaScript.",
          "zh": "這是 JavaScript 裡另一個內建 method。"
        },
        {
          "id": 177,
          "start": 576.88,
          "end": 579.143,
          "en": "And to that I pass frontend.",
          "zh": "而我傳入 frontend。"
        },
        {
          "id": 178,
          "start": 580.23,
          "end": 583,
          "en": "And here I then return true if that is matched,",
          "zh": "而在這裡，如果符合，我就回傳 true，"
        },
        {
          "id": 179,
          "start": 583,
          "end": 585.92,
          "en": "because that means that we want to see coaches",
          "zh": "因為那表示我們想要看到"
        },
        {
          "id": 180,
          "start": 585.92,
          "end": 588.07,
          "en": "that have the frontend area of expertise",
          "zh": "具備 frontend 專業領域的教練，"
        },
        {
          "id": 181,
          "start": 588.07,
          "end": 589.75,
          "en": "and this coach has it.",
          "zh": "而這位教練有。"
        },
        {
          "id": 182,
          "start": 589.75,
          "end": 593.31,
          "en": "So we return true to keep that coach",
          "zh": "所以我們回傳 true，把那位教練保留"
        },
        {
          "id": 183,
          "start": 593.31,
          "end": 595.623,
          "en": "in our returned coaches array.",
          "zh": "在我們回傳的 coaches 陣列裡。"
        },
        {
          "id": 184,
          "start": 597.15,
          "end": 599.63,
          "en": "And now we can duplicate this twice to do",
          "zh": "而現在我們可以把這個複製兩次，"
        },
        {
          "id": 185,
          "start": 599.63,
          "end": 601.693,
          "en": "the same I'm here for backend.",
          "zh": "在這裡對 backend 做一樣的事。"
        },
        {
          "id": 186,
          "start": 603.41,
          "end": 608.41,
          "en": "And of course, here for career.",
          "zh": "當然，這裡還有 career。"
        },
        {
          "id": 187,
          "start": 610.23,
          "end": 613.8,
          "en": "And ultimately, if none of these if checks match,",
          "zh": "而最終，如果這些 if 檢查都不符合，"
        },
        {
          "id": 188,
          "start": 613.8,
          "end": 617.18,
          "en": "we return false here inside of that filter method",
          "zh": "我們就回傳 false，在這個 filter method 裡面，"
        },
        {
          "id": 189,
          "start": 617.18,
          "end": 618.99,
          "en": "or inside of this filter function,",
          "zh": "或者說在這個 filter 函式裡面，"
        },
        {
          "id": 190,
          "start": 618.99,
          "end": 621.54,
          "en": "which means this coach, which doesn't have the fields",
          "zh": "這表示這位沒有我們要篩選的那些欄位的教練"
        },
        {
          "id": 191,
          "start": 621.54,
          "end": 623.963,
          "en": "we're filtering for is excluded.",
          "zh": "會被排除。"
        },
        {
          "id": 192,
          "start": 625.7,
          "end": 627.52,
          "en": "And that should be it.",
          "zh": "這樣應該就完成了。"
        },
        {
          "id": 193,
          "start": 627.52,
          "end": 631.49,
          "en": "With that saved, we now have this filter component here.",
          "zh": "儲存之後，我們現在就有這個篩選 component。"
        },
        {
          "id": 194,
          "start": 631.49,
          "end": 635.17,
          "en": "And now for example, Julie doesn't have backend.",
          "zh": "而現在舉例來說，Julie 沒有 backend。"
        },
        {
          "id": 195,
          "start": 635.17,
          "end": 639.57,
          "en": "So if I uncheck career and frontend, only Max's left,",
          "zh": "所以如果我取消勾選 career 和 frontend，就只剩 Max，"
        },
        {
          "id": 196,
          "start": 639.57,
          "end": 642.95,
          "en": "if I'm checked backend, we got no coaches at all.",
          "zh": "如果我只勾 backend，我們就完全沒有教練。"
        },
        {
          "id": 197,
          "start": 642.95,
          "end": 645.45,
          "en": "If I check front end, we see both coaches",
          "zh": "如果我勾選 frontend，我們會看到兩位教練，"
        },
        {
          "id": 198,
          "start": 645.45,
          "end": 647.4,
          "en": "because both coaches have that.",
          "zh": "因為兩位教練都有那個。"
        },
        {
          "id": 199,
          "start": 647.4,
          "end": 649.15,
          "en": "And that's the filter working.",
          "zh": "這就是篩選運作的方式。"
        },
        {
          "id": 200,
          "start": 649.15,
          "end": 651.26,
          "en": "So now with the filters added,",
          "zh": "現在既然篩選功能加好了，"
        },
        {
          "id": 201,
          "start": 651.26,
          "end": 656.26,
          "en": "let's work on the contact and the register as coach forms.",
          "zh": "讓我們來處理 contact 和 register as coach 這兩個表單。"
        },
        {
          "id": 202,
          "start": 656.32,
          "end": 659.54,
          "en": "And let may be start with registering as a coach.",
          "zh": "而或許就從 register as a coach 開始。"
        },
        {
          "id": 203,
          "start": 659.54,
          "end": 661.48,
          "en": "This page just pretty white right now",
          "zh": "這個頁面現在還很空白，"
        },
        {
          "id": 204,
          "start": 661.48,
          "end": 664.16,
          "en": "and of course here, I wanna have a nice form",
          "zh": "而當然在這裡，我想要有一個好看的表單，"
        },
        {
          "id": 205,
          "start": 664.16,
          "end": 668.163,
          "en": "where we can fill in all the details to sign up as a coach.",
          "zh": "讓我們可以填寫所有註冊成為教練的詳細資料。"
        }
      ]
