    {
      "id": "21879942",
      "title": "Registering as a Coach: The Form",
      "lectureOrder": 246,
      "videoOrder": 218,
      "sourceHash": "17ea283263dd5c5f21f85cc0b4a586bcf0606a4ce8fd48de23a5494613abbb9c",
      "cues": [
        {
          "id": 1,
          "start": 2.44,
          "end": 6.3,
          "en": "So for that, let's go to coach registration,",
          "zh": "所以為此，讓我們前往 coach registration，"
        },
        {
          "id": 2,
          "start": 6.3,
          "end": 10.34,
          "en": "and replace this dummy text with a proper template.",
          "zh": "並把這個 dummy 文字換成一個正式的 template。"
        },
        {
          "id": 3,
          "start": 10.34,
          "end": 12.91,
          "en": "Here, I want to have a section, let's say,",
          "zh": "在這裡，我想要有一個 section，比如說，"
        },
        {
          "id": 4,
          "start": 12.91,
          "end": 17.91,
          "en": "where I say an h2 tag, register as a coach now,",
          "zh": "我在裡面放一個 h2 標籤，寫著 register as a coach now，"
        },
        {
          "id": 5,
          "start": 21.21,
          "end": 25.27,
          "en": "and below that, I wanna have the entire form for signing up.",
          "zh": "而在那下面，我想要有整個註冊用的表單。"
        },
        {
          "id": 6,
          "start": 25.27,
          "end": 28.7,
          "en": "Eventually, this component will grow a little bit,",
          "zh": "最終，這個 component 會稍微變大，"
        },
        {
          "id": 7,
          "start": 28.7,
          "end": 31.78,
          "en": "later once we add HTTP requests.",
          "zh": "等我們之後加上 HTTP 請求時。"
        },
        {
          "id": 8,
          "start": 31.78,
          "end": 33.88,
          "en": "Therefore I will outsource this form into",
          "zh": "因此，我會直接把這個表單拆分到"
        },
        {
          "id": 9,
          "start": 33.88,
          "end": 36.11,
          "en": "a separate component right away.",
          "zh": "一個獨立的 component 裡。"
        },
        {
          "id": 10,
          "start": 36.11,
          "end": 41.11,
          "en": "Add the coachform.vue file here in components coaches,",
          "zh": "在 components/coaches 這裡新增 coachform.vue 檔案，"
        },
        {
          "id": 11,
          "start": 41.71,
          "end": 44.393,
          "en": "and then we'll have the actual form in there.",
          "zh": "然後我們就會把實際的表單放在裡面。"
        },
        {
          "id": 12,
          "start": 45.33,
          "end": 46.91,
          "en": "So here in the template,",
          "zh": "所以在這裡的 template 裡，"
        },
        {
          "id": 13,
          "start": 46.91,
          "end": 48.81,
          "en": "I want to have a form element of course,",
          "zh": "我當然想要有一個 form 元素，"
        },
        {
          "id": 14,
          "start": 48.81,
          "end": 51.84,
          "en": "because we'll well, have a form in here.",
          "zh": "因為我們在裡面會有一個表單。"
        },
        {
          "id": 15,
          "start": 51.84,
          "end": 54.29,
          "en": "This form needs a couple of controls,",
          "zh": "這個表單需要幾個控制項，"
        },
        {
          "id": 16,
          "start": 54.29,
          "end": 58.1,
          "en": "because every coach has a first and last name,",
          "zh": "因為每位教練都有名字和姓氏、"
        },
        {
          "id": 17,
          "start": 58.1,
          "end": 60.45,
          "en": "areas of expertise, a description,",
          "zh": "專業領域、一段簡介，"
        },
        {
          "id": 18,
          "start": 60.45,
          "end": 62.56,
          "en": "and an hourly rate.",
          "zh": "以及每小時的費率。"
        },
        {
          "id": 19,
          "start": 62.56,
          "end": 65.403,
          "en": "We need these input fields in our form.",
          "zh": "我們的表單需要這些 input 欄位。"
        },
        {
          "id": 20,
          "start": 66.24,
          "end": 68.81,
          "en": "Hence here, I'll get started by adding",
          "zh": "所以這裡，我一開始先加上"
        },
        {
          "id": 21,
          "start": 68.81,
          "end": 72.18,
          "en": "a div with a class of form-control,",
          "zh": "一個 class 是 form-control 的 div，"
        },
        {
          "id": 22,
          "start": 72.18,
          "end": 74.403,
          "en": "which is important for styling later.",
          "zh": "這對之後的樣式設定很重要。"
        },
        {
          "id": 23,
          "start": 75.53999999999999,
          "end": 80.22,
          "en": "Where I now add a label saying first name,",
          "zh": "我在裡面加上一個寫著 first name 的 label，"
        },
        {
          "id": 24,
          "start": 80.22,
          "end": 84.05,
          "en": "and below that input field with a type of text",
          "zh": "然後在下面加上 type 是 text 的 input 欄位，"
        },
        {
          "id": 25,
          "start": 85.64,
          "end": 90.55,
          "en": "and let's say an ID of first name therefore this label,",
          "zh": "並且比如說 id 是 first-name，因此這個 label，"
        },
        {
          "id": 26,
          "start": 90.55,
          "end": 92.53,
          "en": "it gets the for attribute and points",
          "zh": "它會取得 for 屬性，並且指向"
        },
        {
          "id": 27,
          "start": 92.53,
          "end": 94.773,
          "en": "at this element with this ID.",
          "zh": "這個帶有這個 id 的元素。"
        },
        {
          "id": 28,
          "start": 96.66,
          "end": 98.53999999999999,
          "en": "Then I'm going to duplicate this",
          "zh": "接著我要把這個複製一份，"
        },
        {
          "id": 29,
          "start": 98.53999999999999,
          "end": 102.16,
          "en": "because we also of course need a last name.",
          "zh": "因為我們當然也需要姓氏。"
        },
        {
          "id": 30,
          "start": 102.16,
          "end": 106.62,
          "en": "So here is last name on the second input,",
          "zh": "所以這裡第二個 input 是 last name，"
        },
        {
          "id": 31,
          "start": 106.62,
          "end": 111.28,
          "en": "and then we also need an input for the description.",
          "zh": "然後我們還需要一個給 description 用的 input。"
        },
        {
          "id": 32,
          "start": 111.28,
          "end": 115.7,
          "en": "Duplicate it again for the description here,",
          "zh": "再複製一份給這裡的 description，"
        },
        {
          "id": 33,
          "start": 115.7,
          "end": 118.12,
          "en": "pointing at description, but now here",
          "zh": "指向 description，但現在這裡"
        },
        {
          "id": 34,
          "start": 118.12,
          "end": 121.63,
          "en": "it's not an input, but let's say a text area element.",
          "zh": "它不是 input，而比如說是一個 textarea 元素。"
        },
        {
          "id": 35,
          "start": 121.63,
          "end": 124.2,
          "en": "So that we have a multi-line input.",
          "zh": "這樣我們就有多行輸入。"
        },
        {
          "id": 36,
          "start": 124.2,
          "end": 126.72,
          "en": "I'll give that an idea of description",
          "zh": "我會給它一個 id 叫 description"
        },
        {
          "id": 37,
          "start": 126.72,
          "end": 128.803,
          "en": "and let's say five rows.",
          "zh": "並比如說設定五個 rows。"
        },
        {
          "id": 38,
          "start": 131.46,
          "end": 134.32,
          "en": "Then again, I'm going to copy the default input here",
          "zh": "接著，我要再複製這裡預設的 input"
        },
        {
          "id": 39,
          "start": 135.42,
          "end": 139.71,
          "en": "and set up the hourly rate input field,",
          "zh": "並設定每小時費率的 input 欄位，"
        },
        {
          "id": 40,
          "start": 139.71,
          "end": 142.72,
          "en": "so here the ID is rate,",
          "zh": "所以這裡 id 是 rate，"
        },
        {
          "id": 41,
          "start": 142.72,
          "end": 146.81,
          "en": "and the type here can be number, or should be number",
          "zh": "而這裡的 type 可以是 number，或者說應該是 number"
        },
        {
          "id": 42,
          "start": 146.81,
          "end": 149.9,
          "en": "to make sure that well, we allow the user",
          "zh": "以確保我們能讓使用者"
        },
        {
          "id": 43,
          "start": 149.9,
          "end": 152.403,
          "en": "to enter a number here in a pleasant way.",
          "zh": "用舒服的方式在這裡輸入數字。"
        },
        {
          "id": 44,
          "start": 154.27,
          "end": 157.42000000000002,
          "en": "Now as a last step, users should be able",
          "zh": "現在最後一步，使用者應該要能夠"
        },
        {
          "id": 45,
          "start": 157.42000000000002,
          "end": 160.82,
          "en": "to choose their area of expertise.",
          "zh": "選擇他們的專業領域。"
        },
        {
          "id": 46,
          "start": 160.82,
          "end": 164.22,
          "en": "Now that means that I wanna have free checkboxes",
          "zh": "這表示我想要有三個 checkbox"
        },
        {
          "id": 47,
          "start": 164.22,
          "end": 167.5,
          "en": "where users can check the expertise they have.",
          "zh": "讓使用者可以勾選他們具備的專業。"
        },
        {
          "id": 48,
          "start": 167.5,
          "end": 169.82,
          "en": "So front and back and then career,",
          "zh": "也就是 front、back，然後 career，"
        },
        {
          "id": 49,
          "start": 169.82,
          "end": 172.06,
          "en": "and you can select as many as you know,",
          "zh": "而你可以愛選幾個就選幾個，"
        },
        {
          "id": 50,
          "start": 172.06,
          "end": 174.61,
          "en": "or as many as you feel comfortable teaching others.",
          "zh": "或者說，選幾個你覺得教別人教得來的。"
        },
        {
          "id": 51,
          "start": 175.82,
          "end": 179.12,
          "en": "So therefore again, I'll add a div here,",
          "zh": "所以因此，我在這裡再加上一個 div，"
        },
        {
          "id": 52,
          "start": 179.12,
          "end": 182.653,
          "en": "with a class of form control, this doesn't change.",
          "zh": "class 是 form-control，這點沒有改變。"
        },
        {
          "id": 53,
          "start": 185.534,
          "end": 188.767,
          "en": "But inside of here, I now first of all want",
          "zh": "但在裡面，我現在首先想要"
        },
        {
          "id": 54,
          "start": 188.767,
          "end": 191.64,
          "en": "to have a h3 tag where I say,",
          "zh": "有一個 h3 標籤，我在裡面寫，"
        },
        {
          "id": 55,
          "start": 191.64,
          "end": 195.03,
          "en": "areas of expertise to let the user know",
          "zh": "areas of expertise，讓使用者知道"
        },
        {
          "id": 56,
          "start": 195.03,
          "end": 197.97,
          "en": "what these checkboxes will be about,",
          "zh": "這些 checkbox 是關於什麼的，"
        },
        {
          "id": 57,
          "start": 197.97,
          "end": 200.9,
          "en": "then I'll have more divs in there.",
          "zh": "接著我在裡面會有更多 div。"
        },
        {
          "id": 58,
          "start": 200.9,
          "end": 204.593,
          "en": "Every div then holds an input of type checkbox,",
          "zh": "每個 div 接著包含一個 type 是 checkbox 的 input，"
        },
        {
          "id": 59,
          "start": 205.57,
          "end": 207.97,
          "en": "and this first one, will have an ideal front-end",
          "zh": "而第一個會有 id front-end"
        },
        {
          "id": 60,
          "start": 209.06,
          "end": 211.13,
          "en": "and a value of front-end,",
          "zh": "以及 value front-end，"
        },
        {
          "id": 61,
          "start": 211.13,
          "end": 213.04,
          "en": "the value will be important later",
          "zh": "這個 value 之後會很重要，"
        },
        {
          "id": 62,
          "start": 213.04,
          "end": 216.826,
          "en": "for retrieving the checkboxes.",
          "zh": "用來取得這些 checkbox。"
        },
        {
          "id": 63,
          "start": 216.826,
          "end": 221.826,
          "en": "After the input, also a label for front-end in this case,",
          "zh": "在 input 之後，這裡也加上一個 for 指向 front-end 的 label，"
        },
        {
          "id": 64,
          "start": 224.15,
          "end": 226.52,
          "en": "where I'll say front-end development,",
          "zh": "我在裡面寫 front-end development，"
        },
        {
          "id": 65,
          "start": 226.52,
          "end": 229.173,
          "en": "letting the user know what this checkbox means.",
          "zh": "讓使用者知道這個 checkbox 代表什麼。"
        },
        {
          "id": 66,
          "start": 230.84,
          "end": 234.27,
          "en": "Now we replicate this twice,",
          "zh": "現在我們把這個複製兩份，"
        },
        {
          "id": 67,
          "start": 234.27,
          "end": 237.13,
          "en": "to also have a checkbox for back-end",
          "zh": "這樣也有一個 back-end 的 checkbox，"
        },
        {
          "id": 68,
          "start": 237.13,
          "end": 242.13,
          "en": "with a value of back-end for back-end,",
          "zh": "value 是 back-end，for 也指向 back-end，"
        },
        {
          "id": 69,
          "start": 245.2,
          "end": 248.233,
          "en": "and here saying back-end development.",
          "zh": "而這裡寫著 back-end development。"
        },
        {
          "id": 70,
          "start": 249.68,
          "end": 251.4,
          "en": "Then on the last checkbox here,",
          "zh": "接著在這裡最後一個 checkbox，"
        },
        {
          "id": 71,
          "start": 251.4,
          "end": 254.99,
          "en": "I say career, with a value of Career,",
          "zh": "我寫 career，value 是 career，"
        },
        {
          "id": 72,
          "start": 254.99,
          "end": 259.99,
          "en": "for a career and saying career advisory maybe.",
          "zh": "for 指向 career，並寫著 career advisory 之類的。"
        },
        {
          "id": 73,
          "start": 264.123,
          "end": 268.19,
          "en": "These are the different checkboxes here,",
          "zh": "這些就是這裡不同的 checkbox，"
        },
        {
          "id": 74,
          "start": 268.19,
          "end": 272.67,
          "en": "now with that, below all those divs,",
          "zh": "這樣一來，在所有那些 div 下面，"
        },
        {
          "id": 75,
          "start": 272.67,
          "end": 274.52,
          "en": "I'll add a base-button,",
          "zh": "我會加上一個 base-button，"
        },
        {
          "id": 76,
          "start": 274.52,
          "end": 277.12,
          "en": "which will be the submit button in the end,",
          "zh": "它最後會是送出按鈕，"
        },
        {
          "id": 77,
          "start": 277.12,
          "end": 279.163,
          "en": "where I simply say register.",
          "zh": "我在裡面就簡單寫上 register。"
        },
        {
          "id": 78,
          "start": 280.42,
          "end": 281.83,
          "en": "Now that's the basic form.",
          "zh": "這就是基本的表單。"
        },
        {
          "id": 79,
          "start": 281.83,
          "end": 283.72,
          "en": "We'll come back to that markup later,",
          "zh": "我們之後會再回來看那個 markup，"
        },
        {
          "id": 80,
          "start": 283.72,
          "end": 285.36,
          "en": "we also need to add bindings",
          "zh": "我們還需要加上綁定，"
        },
        {
          "id": 81,
          "start": 285.36,
          "end": 287.96,
          "en": "and I also wanna add validation later,",
          "zh": "而我之後也想要加上驗證，"
        },
        {
          "id": 82,
          "start": 287.96,
          "end": 289.53,
          "en": "but that's a start.",
          "zh": "但這是個開始。"
        },
        {
          "id": 83,
          "start": 289.53,
          "end": 291.76,
          "en": "With that form created now,",
          "zh": "現在表單建立好了，"
        },
        {
          "id": 84,
          "start": 291.76,
          "end": 296.52,
          "en": "we can add our script area here, our script block,",
          "zh": "我們可以在這裡加上 script 區塊，"
        },
        {
          "id": 85,
          "start": 296.52,
          "end": 298.52,
          "en": "and add some data here.",
          "zh": "並在這裡加上一些 data。"
        },
        {
          "id": 86,
          "start": 298.52,
          "end": 300.95,
          "en": "So here I return the data object",
          "zh": "所以在這裡我回傳 data 物件，"
        },
        {
          "id": 87,
          "start": 300.95,
          "end": 304.74,
          "en": "and in there, I of course want to manage a first name",
          "zh": "而在裡面，我當然想要管理一個 first name"
        },
        {
          "id": 88,
          "start": 305.63,
          "end": 307.86,
          "en": "and a last name field,",
          "zh": "和一個 last name 欄位，"
        },
        {
          "id": 89,
          "start": 307.86,
          "end": 311.36,
          "en": "which we will bind with the model later,",
          "zh": "我們之後會用 v-model 綁定它們，"
        },
        {
          "id": 90,
          "start": 311.36,
          "end": 314.34,
          "en": "add a description and a rate",
          "zh": "再加上 description 和 rate，"
        },
        {
          "id": 91,
          "start": 314.34,
          "end": 316.64,
          "en": "which initially is null let's say,",
          "zh": "它一開始比如說是 null，"
        },
        {
          "id": 92,
          "start": 316.64,
          "end": 321.64,
          "en": "areas which initially is an empty array and that is it.",
          "zh": "areas 一開始是空陣列，就這樣。"
        },
        {
          "id": 93,
          "start": 323.26,
          "end": 325.35,
          "en": "Now we can bind these data properties",
          "zh": "現在我們可以把這些 data 屬性"
        },
        {
          "id": 94,
          "start": 325.35,
          "end": 327,
          "en": "with two way binding.",
          "zh": "用雙向綁定綁起來。"
        },
        {
          "id": 95,
          "start": 327,
          "end": 329.28,
          "en": "So here, on the first input with the model,",
          "zh": "所以在這裡，第一個 input 上用 v-model，"
        },
        {
          "id": 96,
          "start": 329.28,
          "end": 331.81,
          "en": "I bind this to first name,",
          "zh": "我把它綁到 first-name，"
        },
        {
          "id": 97,
          "start": 331.81,
          "end": 334.803,
          "en": "which is that first name data property we just added.",
          "zh": "也就是我們剛剛加的那個 first-name data 屬性。"
        },
        {
          "id": 98,
          "start": 335.67,
          "end": 337.26,
          "en": "Then here on the second input,",
          "zh": "接著這裡第二個 input，"
        },
        {
          "id": 99,
          "start": 337.26,
          "end": 340.90999999999997,
          "en": "I of course, bind it to last name,",
          "zh": "我當然把它綁到 last-name，"
        },
        {
          "id": 100,
          "start": 340.90999999999997,
          "end": 345.423,
          "en": "here on the text area that is bound to description,",
          "zh": "這裡的 textarea 綁到 description，"
        },
        {
          "id": 101,
          "start": 350.95,
          "end": 354.81,
          "en": "and here the rate that is bound to rate.",
          "zh": "而這裡的 rate 綁到 rate。"
        },
        {
          "id": 102,
          "start": 354.81,
          "end": 357.09000000000003,
          "en": "Now here I will use the number modifier",
          "zh": "現在這裡我會使用 number 修飾子"
        },
        {
          "id": 103,
          "start": 357.09000000000003,
          "end": 359.54,
          "en": "to force a conversion to number,",
          "zh": "來強制轉換成數字，"
        },
        {
          "id": 104,
          "start": 359.54,
          "end": 361.78,
          "en": "I showed you that this should happen automatically",
          "zh": "我示範過，如果 type 是 number，"
        },
        {
          "id": 105,
          "start": 361.78,
          "end": 364.11,
          "en": "if the type is number but to be super safe,",
          "zh": "這應該會自動發生，但為了超級保險，"
        },
        {
          "id": 106,
          "start": 364.11,
          "end": 367.25,
          "en": "I'll force it here, and whilst we're at it,",
          "zh": "我會在這裡強制它，而既然都做了，"
        },
        {
          "id": 107,
          "start": 367.25,
          "end": 371.49,
          "en": "I'll actually add trim on the other V model such as,",
          "zh": "我其實也會在其他 v-model 上加上 trim，"
        },
        {
          "id": 108,
          "start": 371.49,
          "end": 373.873,
          "en": "so that we always trim excess whitespace,",
          "zh": "這樣我們總是能去除多餘的空白，"
        },
        {
          "id": 109,
          "start": 377.15,
          "end": 380.15,
          "en": "and with that only the checkboxes are left,",
          "zh": "這樣一來就只剩下 checkbox 了，"
        },
        {
          "id": 110,
          "start": 380.15,
          "end": 381.76,
          "en": "Here we can also use V model",
          "zh": "這裡我們也可以用 v-model"
        },
        {
          "id": 111,
          "start": 381.76,
          "end": 383.61,
          "en": "as you learned earlier in the course,",
          "zh": "就像你在課程前面學到的，"
        },
        {
          "id": 112,
          "start": 383.61,
          "end": 387.38,
          "en": "here we can bind this to areas,",
          "zh": "這裡我們可以把它綁到 areas，"
        },
        {
          "id": 113,
          "start": 387.38,
          "end": 391.66,
          "en": "here we bind to the same property on all checkboxes,",
          "zh": "這裡我們在所有 checkbox 上都綁到同一個屬性，"
        },
        {
          "id": 114,
          "start": 391.66,
          "end": 393.86,
          "en": "of course, because they all belong together.",
          "zh": "當然，因為它們都屬於同一組。"
        },
        {
          "id": 115,
          "start": 395.28,
          "end": 399.29,
          "en": "Now with that, I'll go down to the script part again",
          "zh": "這樣一來，我會再次往下到 script 的部分"
        },
        {
          "id": 116,
          "start": 399.29,
          "end": 402.34000000000003,
          "en": "and add a method, a method that should be triggered",
          "zh": "並加上一個 method，一個應該在"
        },
        {
          "id": 117,
          "start": 402.34000000000003,
          "end": 404.23,
          "en": "when the form is submitted.",
          "zh": "表單送出時被觸發的 method。"
        },
        {
          "id": 118,
          "start": 404.23,
          "end": 407.183,
          "en": "Hence, I'll name it, submit form.",
          "zh": "因此，我會把它命名為 submitForm。"
        },
        {
          "id": 119,
          "start": 408.638,
          "end": 412.68,
          "en": "In here, we will later validate the form,",
          "zh": "在這裡面，我們之後會驗證表單，"
        },
        {
          "id": 120,
          "start": 412.68,
          "end": 414.18,
          "en": "but for the moment, I'll just create",
          "zh": "但目前，我只會建立"
        },
        {
          "id": 121,
          "start": 414.18,
          "end": 416.26,
          "en": "a form data object",
          "zh": "一個 formData 物件，"
        },
        {
          "id": 122,
          "start": 416.26,
          "end": 419.32,
          "en": "where I group all those values together.",
          "zh": "把所有那些值群組在一起。"
        },
        {
          "id": 123,
          "start": 419.32,
          "end": 421.39,
          "en": "Here, I wanna have a first key,",
          "zh": "這裡，我想要有一個 first 鍵，"
        },
        {
          "id": 124,
          "start": 421.39,
          "end": 423.73,
          "en": "which points at this first name,",
          "zh": "指向這個 first-name，"
        },
        {
          "id": 125,
          "start": 423.73,
          "end": 426.97,
          "en": "a last key, which points to this last name,",
          "zh": "一個 last 鍵，指向這個 last-name，"
        },
        {
          "id": 126,
          "start": 426.97,
          "end": 430.46,
          "en": "a desk key, which points at this description.",
          "zh": "一個 desc 鍵，指向這個 description。"
        },
        {
          "id": 127,
          "start": 430.46,
          "end": 432.33,
          "en": "You could use the same names of course here,",
          "zh": "你當然可以在這裡使用同樣的名稱，"
        },
        {
          "id": 128,
          "start": 432.33,
          "end": 434.04,
          "en": "but I'll go with these names",
          "zh": "但我會用這些名稱，"
        },
        {
          "id": 129,
          "start": 434.04,
          "end": 436.47,
          "en": "I will also use these names later in the course.",
          "zh": "我之後在課程裡也會用這些名稱。"
        },
        {
          "id": 130,
          "start": 436.47,
          "end": 439.763,
          "en": "So maybe you should stick to them to follow along smoothly.",
          "zh": "所以也許你應該沿用它們，才能順利跟著做。"
        },
        {
          "id": 131,
          "start": 440.62,
          "end": 445.533,
          "en": "bind the rate to this rate, and areas to this areas.",
          "zh": "把 rate 綁到這個 rate，areas 綁到這個 areas。"
        },
        {
          "id": 132,
          "start": 447.05,
          "end": 449.6,
          "en": "For the moment, I'll just console.log,",
          "zh": "目前，我就先 console.log"
        },
        {
          "id": 133,
          "start": 449.6,
          "end": 452.613,
          "en": "my form data here to see whether that worked.",
          "zh": "我的 formData，看看有沒有成功。"
        },
        {
          "id": 134,
          "start": 454.11,
          "end": 457.46,
          "en": "Now it's submit form which is bound here,",
          "zh": "現在這裡綁定的是 submitForm，"
        },
        {
          "id": 135,
          "start": 457.46,
          "end": 460.39,
          "en": "to the submit event on the form element",
          "zh": "綁在 form 元素的 submit 事件上，"
        },
        {
          "id": 136,
          "start": 460.39,
          "end": 462.37,
          "en": "where I used the prevent modifier",
          "zh": "我使用了 prevent 修飾子"
        },
        {
          "id": 137,
          "start": 462.37,
          "end": 466.67,
          "en": "to prevent the default of an automatic request being sent",
          "zh": "來防止預設會自動送出請求"
        },
        {
          "id": 138,
          "start": 466.67,
          "end": 468.17,
          "en": "to a server that doesn't exist",
          "zh": "到一個不存在的伺服器，"
        },
        {
          "id": 139,
          "start": 468.17,
          "end": 470.67,
          "en": "which I don't want here and bind this",
          "zh": "這是我在這裡不想要的，並把這個"
        },
        {
          "id": 140,
          "start": 470.67,
          "end": 472.31,
          "en": "to submit form like that.",
          "zh": "這樣綁到 submitForm。"
        },
        {
          "id": 141,
          "start": 474.2,
          "end": 478.52,
          "en": "Now we can use the coach form here in coach registration,",
          "zh": "現在我們可以在 coach registration 裡使用 coach form，"
        },
        {
          "id": 142,
          "start": 478.52,
          "end": 480.22,
          "en": "so there in the script area,",
          "zh": "所以在那裡的 script 區塊，"
        },
        {
          "id": 143,
          "start": 480.22,
          "end": 485.22,
          "en": "we import coachform from going up and going up",
          "zh": "我們匯入 CoachForm，往上、再往上"
        },
        {
          "id": 144,
          "start": 486.77,
          "end": 490.193,
          "en": "to components, coaches, coachform.vue,",
          "zh": "到 components/coaches/coachform.vue，"
        },
        {
          "id": 145,
          "start": 494.16,
          "end": 497.423,
          "en": "then adding this here to the components option like that.",
          "zh": "然後像這樣把它加到這裡的 components 選項。"
        },
        {
          "id": 146,
          "start": 498.5,
          "end": 501.95,
          "en": "Now we can simply add the coachform",
          "zh": "現在我們可以簡單地把 coach-form"
        },
        {
          "id": 147,
          "start": 501.95,
          "end": 506.863,
          "en": "as a HTML element, so to say here in coach registration.",
          "zh": "當作 HTML 元素加在這裡的 coach registration。"
        },
        {
          "id": 148,
          "start": 508.07,
          "end": 511.18,
          "en": "If we load this, we see this form.",
          "zh": "如果我們載入這個，就會看到這個表單。"
        },
        {
          "id": 149,
          "start": 511.18,
          "end": 513.07,
          "en": "Now it's of course super ugly,",
          "zh": "它現在當然超級醜，"
        },
        {
          "id": 150,
          "start": 513.07,
          "end": 515.36,
          "en": "so there are two changes I wanna make.",
          "zh": "所以我想做兩個調整。"
        },
        {
          "id": 151,
          "start": 515.36,
          "end": 519.47,
          "en": "First of all, in coach registration in this section,",
          "zh": "首先，在 coach registration 的這個 section 裡，"
        },
        {
          "id": 152,
          "start": 519.47,
          "end": 523.923,
          "en": "use the base-card to wrap the h2 tag and the form,",
          "zh": "用 base-card 把 h2 標籤和表單包起來，"
        },
        {
          "id": 153,
          "start": 525.08,
          "end": 527.93,
          "en": "and inside of coachform, I of course prepared",
          "zh": "而在 coachform 裡面，我當然準備了"
        },
        {
          "id": 154,
          "start": 527.93,
          "end": 530.51,
          "en": "a couple of styles which we can use.",
          "zh": "幾個我們可以使用的樣式。"
        },
        {
          "id": 155,
          "start": 530.51,
          "end": 535.51,
          "en": "Here at the bottom, we add scoped styling as always,",
          "zh": "在這裡底部，我們一如往常加上 scoped 樣式，"
        },
        {
          "id": 156,
          "start": 537.94,
          "end": 539.66,
          "en": "then attach to find styles",
          "zh": "然後在附件裡找到樣式，"
        },
        {
          "id": 157,
          "start": 539.66,
          "end": 541,
          "en": "which you should copy in here.",
          "zh": "你應該把它們複製到這裡。"
        },
        {
          "id": 158,
          "start": 541,
          "end": 543.03,
          "en": "The coachform CSS file.",
          "zh": "也就是 coachform 的 CSS 檔案。"
        },
        {
          "id": 159,
          "start": 543.03,
          "end": 545.94,
          "en": "There are some styles which we're not even using yet,",
          "zh": "有些樣式我們甚至還沒用到，"
        },
        {
          "id": 160,
          "start": 545.94,
          "end": 547.73,
          "en": "like the invalid styles,",
          "zh": "像是 invalid 的樣式，"
        },
        {
          "id": 161,
          "start": 547.73,
          "end": 551.62,
          "en": "but we will need them later once we add form validation.",
          "zh": "但等我們之後加上表單驗證時就會需要它們。"
        },
        {
          "id": 162,
          "start": 551.62,
          "end": 553.21,
          "en": "With that, if you save this,",
          "zh": "這樣一來，如果你儲存這個，"
        },
        {
          "id": 163,
          "start": 553.21,
          "end": 555.61,
          "en": "this all looks much nicer,",
          "zh": "這一切看起來好看多了，"
        },
        {
          "id": 164,
          "start": 555.61,
          "end": 559.03,
          "en": "now we got our registration form in place.",
          "zh": "現在我們的註冊表單就定位了。"
        },
        {
          "id": 165,
          "start": 559.03,
          "end": 560.9,
          "en": "If I click Register,",
          "zh": "如果我點擊 Register，"
        },
        {
          "id": 166,
          "start": 560.9,
          "end": 564.5,
          "en": "I print an empty object here, and I get a warning,",
          "zh": "我在這裡印出一個空物件，而且我得到一個警告，"
        },
        {
          "id": 167,
          "start": 564.5,
          "end": 567.71,
          "en": "which we can ignore here for the moment.",
          "zh": "我們目前可以在這裡忽略它。"
        },
        {
          "id": 168,
          "start": 567.71,
          "end": 569.483,
          "en": "But I'm getting this object here,",
          "zh": "但我這裡拿到了這個物件，"
        },
        {
          "id": 169,
          "start": 571.97,
          "end": 574.32,
          "en": "in this object, we see of course,",
          "zh": "在這個物件裡，我們當然看到"
        },
        {
          "id": 170,
          "start": 574.32,
          "end": 575.42,
          "en": "that everything is empty",
          "zh": "所有東西都是空的，"
        },
        {
          "id": 171,
          "start": 575.42,
          "end": 577.2,
          "en": "because we haven't entered anything.",
          "zh": "因為我們什麼都還沒輸入。"
        },
        {
          "id": 172,
          "start": 577.2,
          "end": 581.483,
          "en": "So if I clear this now and do enter some values here,",
          "zh": "所以如果我現在清掉這個，並在這裡輸入一些值，"
        },
        {
          "id": 173,
          "start": 584.56,
          "end": 587.16,
          "en": "like that, and register this.",
          "zh": "像那樣，然後送出註冊。"
        },
        {
          "id": 174,
          "start": 587.16,
          "end": 590.18,
          "en": "Now we see our values here, in areas",
          "zh": "現在我們在這裡看到我們的值，在 areas 裡"
        },
        {
          "id": 175,
          "start": 590.18,
          "end": 593.05,
          "en": "which is wrapped by a proxy to be reactive,",
          "zh": "它被一個 proxy 包住以具備反應性，"
        },
        {
          "id": 176,
          "start": 593.05,
          "end": 595.8,
          "en": "we see front-end and career being checked,",
          "zh": "我們看到 front-end 和 career 被勾選，"
        },
        {
          "id": 177,
          "start": 595.8,
          "end": 598.09,
          "en": "we see the other data as well and therefore,",
          "zh": "我們也看到其他資料，因此，"
        },
        {
          "id": 178,
          "start": 598.09,
          "end": 601.33,
          "en": "we are ready to pass that data on",
          "zh": "我們已經準備好把那些資料傳給"
        },
        {
          "id": 179,
          "start": 601.33,
          "end": 605.01,
          "en": "to coach registration, and in there,",
          "zh": "coach registration，並在那裡"
        },
        {
          "id": 180,
          "start": 605.01,
          "end": 607.32,
          "en": "then use it to create a new coach",
          "zh": "用它來建立一位新教練"
        },
        {
          "id": 181,
          "start": 607.32,
          "end": 611.063,
          "en": "in our view x store, that's what we're going to do next.",
          "zh": "在我們的 Vuex store 裡，那就是我們接下來要做的。"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "21879946",
      "title": "Adding Coaches to Vuex",
      "lectureOrder": 247,
      "videoOrder": 219,
      "sourceHash": "5df60ed24115df0993933cdd289c994685e1adb71e175d8807c7044db5c8fee4",
      "cues": [
        {
          "id": 1,
          "start": 2.07,
          "end": 4.41,
          "en": "So it's time to edit our state",
          "zh": "所以是時候來編輯我們的 state，"
        },
        {
          "id": 2,
          "start": 4.41,
          "end": 6.6,
          "en": "and add more coaches.",
          "zh": "並加入更多 coaches。"
        },
        {
          "id": 3,
          "start": 6.6,
          "end": 8.55,
          "en": "We now got the form in place",
          "zh": "我們現在把表單弄好了，"
        },
        {
          "id": 4,
          "start": 8.55,
          "end": 10.65,
          "en": "so we got all we need",
          "zh": "所以我們需要的一切都有了，"
        },
        {
          "id": 5,
          "start": 10.65,
          "end": 11.86,
          "en": "inside of that form.",
          "zh": "就在那個表單裡面。"
        },
        {
          "id": 6,
          "start": 11.86,
          "end": 13.48,
          "en": "Inside of the coach form component,",
          "zh": "在 coach form 元件裡面，"
        },
        {
          "id": 7,
          "start": 13.48,
          "end": 17.44,
          "en": "we now just need to expose the data that was entered,",
          "zh": "我們現在只需要把輸入的資料暴露出來，"
        },
        {
          "id": 8,
          "start": 17.44,
          "end": 20.33,
          "en": "so this form data here,",
          "zh": "也就是這裡的這份表單資料，"
        },
        {
          "id": 9,
          "start": 20.33,
          "end": 22.75,
          "en": "to the components that uses coach form",
          "zh": "給使用 coach form 的那些元件，"
        },
        {
          "id": 10,
          "start": 22.75,
          "end": 25.073,
          "en": "which is the coach registration component.",
          "zh": "也就是 coach registration 元件。"
        },
        {
          "id": 11,
          "start": 26.16,
          "end": 29.35,
          "en": "Theoretically we could also directly reach out",
          "zh": "理論上，我們也可以直接從"
        },
        {
          "id": 12,
          "start": 29.35,
          "end": 32.3,
          "en": "to the store from inside of coach form",
          "zh": "coach form 裡面去存取 store，"
        },
        {
          "id": 13,
          "start": 32.3,
          "end": 35.4,
          "en": "because ultimately we can interact with Vuex stores",
          "zh": "因為我們終究可以從任何元件"
        },
        {
          "id": 14,
          "start": 35.4,
          "end": 36.84,
          "en": "from any component.",
          "zh": "與 Vuex store 互動。"
        },
        {
          "id": 15,
          "start": 36.84,
          "end": 41.38,
          "en": "But I like this component to be reusable and independent",
          "zh": "但我希望這個元件是可重複使用且獨立的，"
        },
        {
          "id": 16,
          "start": 41.38,
          "end": 43.46,
          "en": "and just work with its parent",
          "zh": "只跟它的父元件合作，"
        },
        {
          "id": 17,
          "start": 43.46,
          "end": 47.18,
          "en": "even though we only use it in one part of this app here.",
          "zh": "即使我們在這個應用程式裡只用它一個地方。"
        },
        {
          "id": 18,
          "start": 47.18,
          "end": 49.33,
          "en": "This is just a personal decision though",
          "zh": "不過這只是我個人的決定，"
        },
        {
          "id": 19,
          "start": 49.33,
          "end": 51.9,
          "en": "so I will make sure that this component robber",
          "zh": "所以我會確保這個元件"
        },
        {
          "id": 20,
          "start": 51.9,
          "end": 54.41,
          "en": "emits an event and let's the parent know",
          "zh": "會發出一個事件，讓父元件知道"
        },
        {
          "id": 21,
          "start": 54.41,
          "end": 56.63,
          "en": "about the data that was entered.",
          "zh": "關於輸入的資料。"
        },
        {
          "id": 22,
          "start": 56.63,
          "end": 57.89,
          "en": "And then the parent,",
          "zh": "然後父元件，"
        },
        {
          "id": 23,
          "start": 57.89,
          "end": 60.83,
          "en": "so the coach registration component in this case",
          "zh": "在這裡也就是 coach registration 元件，"
        },
        {
          "id": 24,
          "start": 60.83,
          "end": 63.72,
          "en": "will do the communication with Vuex.",
          "zh": "會負責與 Vuex 溝通。"
        },
        {
          "id": 25,
          "start": 63.72,
          "end": 66.763,
          "en": "But that's just one possible way of approaching this.",
          "zh": "但這只是其中一種可能的做法。"
        },
        {
          "id": 26,
          "start": 67.77,
          "end": 70.22,
          "en": "However with that, in coach form,",
          "zh": "總之，在 coach form 裡面，"
        },
        {
          "id": 27,
          "start": 70.22,
          "end": 72.9,
          "en": "I'll emit here in submit form,",
          "zh": "我會在這裡的 submitForm 中 emit，"
        },
        {
          "id": 28,
          "start": 72.9,
          "end": 75.02,
          "en": "I'll emit safe data",
          "zh": "我會 emit saveData，"
        },
        {
          "id": 29,
          "start": 75.02,
          "end": 76.89,
          "en": "and emit the form data.",
          "zh": "並 emit 表單資料。"
        },
        {
          "id": 30,
          "start": 76.89,
          "end": 80.15,
          "en": "And yes this data is not validated at the moment,",
          "zh": "沒錯，這些資料目前還沒有驗證，"
        },
        {
          "id": 31,
          "start": 80.15,
          "end": 81.913,
          "en": "we'll add this later.",
          "zh": "我們之後會加上。"
        },
        {
          "id": 32,
          "start": 82.95,
          "end": 84.63,
          "en": "So now this is emitted",
          "zh": "現在這個已經 emit 出去了，"
        },
        {
          "id": 33,
          "start": 84.63,
          "end": 85.61,
          "en": "and that of course means",
          "zh": "這當然代表"
        },
        {
          "id": 34,
          "start": 85.61,
          "end": 88.56,
          "en": "that we should also add the emits option here",
          "zh": "我們也應該在這裡加上 emits 選項，"
        },
        {
          "id": 35,
          "start": 88.56,
          "end": 91.82300000000001,
          "en": "and make it clear that we emit safe data.",
          "zh": "並明確表示我們會 emit saveData。"
        },
        {
          "id": 36,
          "start": 92.83,
          "end": 94.75,
          "en": "And once we did all of that,",
          "zh": "等我們都做完之後，"
        },
        {
          "id": 37,
          "start": 94.75,
          "end": 97.3,
          "en": "inside of coach registration",
          "zh": "在 coach registration 裡面"
        },
        {
          "id": 38,
          "start": 97.3,
          "end": 100.89,
          "en": "we can accept this incoming data.",
          "zh": "我們就可以接收進來的資料。"
        },
        {
          "id": 39,
          "start": 100.89,
          "end": 105,
          "en": "So there on the coach form we can listen to save data,",
          "zh": "所以在那個 coach form 上，我們可以監聽 saveData，"
        },
        {
          "id": 40,
          "start": 105,
          "end": 107.88,
          "en": "which is that custom event we're emitting",
          "zh": "也就是我們 emit 的那個自訂事件，"
        },
        {
          "id": 41,
          "start": 107.88,
          "end": 111.673,
          "en": "and call maybe a method named saveData here.",
          "zh": "並在這裡呼叫一個或許叫做 saveData 的方法。"
        },
        {
          "id": 42,
          "start": 112.83,
          "end": 115.22,
          "en": "Of course we have yet to add this method.",
          "zh": "當然，我們還沒加上這個方法。"
        },
        {
          "id": 43,
          "start": 115.22,
          "end": 118.07,
          "en": "So here I'll add methods,",
          "zh": "所以在這裡我會加上 methods，"
        },
        {
          "id": 44,
          "start": 118.07,
          "end": 119.39,
          "en": "saveData.",
          "zh": "saveData。"
        },
        {
          "id": 45,
          "start": 119.39,
          "end": 121.33,
          "en": "And in here we'll get that formData",
          "zh": "在這裡我們會取得那份 formData，"
        },
        {
          "id": 46,
          "start": 122.92,
          "end": 127.92,
          "en": "which we pass with the event here in coach form.",
          "zh": "也就是我們在 coach form 裡隨著事件傳送的資料。"
        },
        {
          "id": 47,
          "start": 128.01,
          "end": 131.62,
          "en": "We get this as a parameter therefore in the save data method",
          "zh": "因此我們會在 saveData 方法中把它當作參數取得，"
        },
        {
          "id": 48,
          "start": 131.62,
          "end": 135.77,
          "en": "which we bind to this event in coach registration.",
          "zh": "而這個方法是我們在 coach registration 中綁到這個事件的。"
        },
        {
          "id": 49,
          "start": 135.77,
          "end": 138.02,
          "en": "And that's good because we need that data here",
          "zh": "這樣很好，因為我們在這裡需要那些資料"
        },
        {
          "id": 50,
          "start": 138.02,
          "end": 140.49,
          "en": "to communicate with our store.",
          "zh": "來與我們的 store 溝通。"
        },
        {
          "id": 51,
          "start": 140.49,
          "end": 144.25,
          "en": "So now we wanna add a new coach in our Vuex store",
          "zh": "現在我們想在 Vuex store 中新增一位 coach，"
        },
        {
          "id": 52,
          "start": 144.25,
          "end": 146.91,
          "en": "and that of course means one thing,",
          "zh": "這當然意味著一件事，"
        },
        {
          "id": 53,
          "start": 146.91,
          "end": 149.57999999999998,
          "en": "we need to add mutations and actions",
          "zh": "我們需要加上 mutations 和 actions，"
        },
        {
          "id": 54,
          "start": 149.57999999999998,
          "end": 152.23,
          "en": "because you shouldn't directly change your state",
          "zh": "因為你不應該直接從外部"
        },
        {
          "id": 55,
          "start": 152.23,
          "end": 153.253,
          "en": "from outside.",
          "zh": "改變你的 state。"
        },
        {
          "id": 56,
          "start": 154.26,
          "end": 159.26,
          "en": "Hence here in this empty mutations object in mutations.js",
          "zh": "所以在 mutations.js 裡這個空的 mutations 物件中，"
        },
        {
          "id": 57,
          "start": 160.31,
          "end": 163.073,
          "en": "I'll add a new mutation, registerCoach.",
          "zh": "我會加上一個新的 mutation，registerCoach。"
        },
        {
          "id": 58,
          "start": 164.29,
          "end": 166.87,
          "en": "You could of course also name this add coach",
          "zh": "你當然也可以把它命名為 addCoach，"
        },
        {
          "id": 59,
          "start": 166.87,
          "end": 168.143,
          "en": "if you preferred this.",
          "zh": "如果你比較喜歡這樣。"
        },
        {
          "id": 60,
          "start": 169.01,
          "end": 173.5,
          "en": "And in there I get my state and my payload",
          "zh": "在裡面我會取得我的 state 和我的 payload，"
        },
        {
          "id": 61,
          "start": 173.5,
          "end": 176.44,
          "en": "and I now reach out to state coaches",
          "zh": "接著我存取 state.coaches，"
        },
        {
          "id": 62,
          "start": 176.44,
          "end": 179.663,
          "en": "and push the pay load as a new coach.",
          "zh": "並把 payload 推進去當作新的 coach。"
        },
        {
          "id": 63,
          "start": 181.01,
          "end": 183.47,
          "en": "Now actually that would be invalid though,",
          "zh": "不過，其實這樣做會是無效的，"
        },
        {
          "id": 64,
          "start": 183.47,
          "end": 185.07,
          "en": "or not really great.",
          "zh": "或者說不是很好。"
        },
        {
          "id": 65,
          "start": 185.07,
          "end": 189.22,
          "en": "Because we must keep in mind that payload ultimately",
          "zh": "因為我們必須記得，payload 最終"
        },
        {
          "id": 66,
          "start": 189.22,
          "end": 192.63,
          "en": "is just the foreign data I'm setting up in coach form",
          "zh": "只是我在 coach form 中設定的那份外來資料，"
        },
        {
          "id": 67,
          "start": 192.63,
          "end": 197.3,
          "en": "and there I have first, last and desc as key names.",
          "zh": "而那裡我用的鍵名是 first、last 和 desc。"
        },
        {
          "id": 68,
          "start": 197.3,
          "end": 199.84,
          "en": "That's not in line with the key names",
          "zh": "這跟我其他資料裡"
        },
        {
          "id": 69,
          "start": 199.84,
          "end": 201.563,
          "en": "I have in the rest of my data.",
          "zh": "使用的鍵名並不一致。"
        },
        {
          "id": 70,
          "start": 202.61,
          "end": 204.07,
          "en": "That's no problem though,",
          "zh": "不過這沒問題，"
        },
        {
          "id": 71,
          "start": 204.07,
          "end": 206.95,
          "en": "because we have to add an action anyways",
          "zh": "因為我們本來就必須加上一個 action，"
        },
        {
          "id": 72,
          "start": 206.95,
          "end": 210.333,
          "en": "and I'll transform that data instead of ...",
          "zh": "而我會改為轉換那份資料，而不是⋯"
        },
        {
          "id": 73,
          "start": 211.32,
          "end": 213.27,
          "en": "So here in the actions.js file",
          "zh": "所以在 actions.js 檔案裡，"
        },
        {
          "id": 74,
          "start": 213.27,
          "end": 218.27,
          "en": "we now can register coach or add a register coach action",
          "zh": "我們現在可以註冊 coach，也就是加上一個 registerCoach action，"
        },
        {
          "id": 75,
          "start": 218.78,
          "end": 222.63,
          "en": "and there we'll get context and also pay load",
          "zh": "在裡面我們會取得 context 以及 payload，"
        },
        {
          "id": 76,
          "start": 222.63,
          "end": 225.24,
          "en": "or we can also name this data.",
          "zh": "或者我們也可以把它命名為 data。"
        },
        {
          "id": 77,
          "start": 225.24,
          "end": 226.79,
          "en": "It's our method",
          "zh": "這是我們的方法，"
        },
        {
          "id": 78,
          "start": 226.79,
          "end": 230.1,
          "en": "so we can name the parameters however we want.",
          "zh": "所以參數想怎麼命名都可以。"
        },
        {
          "id": 79,
          "start": 230.1,
          "end": 232.4,
          "en": "And that will be this foreign data in the end.",
          "zh": "而那最終就是這份外來資料。"
        },
        {
          "id": 80,
          "start": 233.28,
          "end": 236.69,
          "en": "And here I'll then construct my coach data",
          "zh": "接著在這裡我會建構我的 coach 資料，"
        },
        {
          "id": 81,
          "start": 236.69,
          "end": 239.42000000000002,
          "en": "where my coach or whatever you wanna name it",
          "zh": "把我的 coach，或你想叫什麼都行，"
        },
        {
          "id": 82,
          "start": 239.42000000000002,
          "end": 243.13,
          "en": "as a new object which now has a first name,",
          "zh": "建成一個新的物件，裡面有 firstName，"
        },
        {
          "id": 83,
          "start": 243.13,
          "end": 245.38,
          "en": "which points at data.first,",
          "zh": "指向 data.first，"
        },
        {
          "id": 84,
          "start": 245.38,
          "end": 249.35,
          "en": "which has a last name which is data.last,",
          "zh": "有 lastName，也就是 data.last，"
        },
        {
          "id": 85,
          "start": 249.35,
          "end": 252.79,
          "en": "which has a description which is data.desc,",
          "zh": "有 description，也就是 data.desc，"
        },
        {
          "id": 86,
          "start": 252.79,
          "end": 254.5,
          "en": "which has an hourly rate",
          "zh": "有 hourlyRate，"
        },
        {
          "id": 87,
          "start": 254.5,
          "end": 259.5,
          "en": "which is data.rate",
          "zh": "也就是 data.rate，"
        },
        {
          "id": 88,
          "start": 259.82,
          "end": 262.993,
          "en": "and areas which is data.areas.",
          "zh": "以及 areas，也就是 data.areas。"
        },
        {
          "id": 89,
          "start": 264.62,
          "end": 267.75,
          "en": "I also want to add an ID here",
          "zh": "我也想在這裡加上一個 ID，"
        },
        {
          "id": 90,
          "start": 267.75,
          "end": 269.76,
          "en": "and for that of course",
          "zh": "為此，當然"
        },
        {
          "id": 91,
          "start": 269.76,
          "end": 273.03,
          "en": "we can use new date to ISOstring",
          "zh": "我們可以用 new Date().toISOString()"
        },
        {
          "id": 92,
          "start": 273.03,
          "end": 274.98,
          "en": "to generate an ID like this",
          "zh": "來產生像這樣的 ID，"
        },
        {
          "id": 93,
          "start": 274.98,
          "end": 278.12,
          "en": "or we hard code this to c3,",
          "zh": "或者我們把它寫死成 c3，"
        },
        {
          "id": 94,
          "start": 278.12,
          "end": 279.52,
          "en": "which of course is not perfect",
          "zh": "這當然不完美，"
        },
        {
          "id": 95,
          "start": 279.52,
          "end": 283.05,
          "en": "because that means that as soon as we register twice,",
          "zh": "因為那表示一旦我們註冊兩次，"
        },
        {
          "id": 96,
          "start": 283.05,
          "end": 285.40999999999997,
          "en": "we have two coaches with the same ID,",
          "zh": "就會有兩位 ID 相同的 coach，"
        },
        {
          "id": 97,
          "start": 285.40999999999997,
          "end": 287.64,
          "en": "but that shouldn't be allowed anyways.",
          "zh": "但這本來就不應該被允許。"
        },
        {
          "id": 98,
          "start": 287.64,
          "end": 290.77,
          "en": "You should be able to register more than once.",
          "zh": "你應該要能註冊不只一次。"
        },
        {
          "id": 99,
          "start": 290.77,
          "end": 293.45,
          "en": "So I will hard code this for now,",
          "zh": "所以我現在先把它寫死，"
        },
        {
          "id": 100,
          "start": 293.45,
          "end": 295.94,
          "en": "later we'll send it to a server",
          "zh": "之後我們會把它送到伺服器，"
        },
        {
          "id": 101,
          "start": 295.94,
          "end": 299.31,
          "en": "and the server will give us a better real ID.",
          "zh": "而伺服器會給我們一個更好的真實 ID。"
        },
        {
          "id": 102,
          "start": 299.31,
          "end": 303.713,
          "en": "But for the moment we can use this dummy hard coded ID here.",
          "zh": "但現在我們可以先用這個寫死的假 ID。"
        },
        {
          "id": 103,
          "start": 305.36,
          "end": 307.31,
          "en": "So now we got this coach data",
          "zh": "現在我們有了這份 coach 資料，"
        },
        {
          "id": 104,
          "start": 307.31,
          "end": 310.883,
          "en": "and now I can context commit,",
          "zh": "我現在可以 context.commit，"
        },
        {
          "id": 105,
          "start": 310.883,
          "end": 312.87,
          "en": "register coach",
          "zh": "registerCoach，"
        },
        {
          "id": 106,
          "start": 312.87,
          "end": 317.303,
          "en": "and commit this mutation with that transformed coach data.",
          "zh": "並用轉換後的 coach 資料來 commit 這個 mutation。"
        },
        {
          "id": 107,
          "start": 318.17,
          "end": 320.02,
          "en": "And therefore now in this mutation,",
          "zh": "因此現在在這個 mutation 裡，"
        },
        {
          "id": 108,
          "start": 320.02,
          "end": 322.72,
          "en": "adding this data like this is okay",
          "zh": "這樣加入資料是沒問題的，"
        },
        {
          "id": 109,
          "start": 322.72,
          "end": 326.693,
          "en": "because that now is in the same format as the other coaches.",
          "zh": "因為它現在的格式跟其他 coach 一樣。"
        },
        {
          "id": 110,
          "start": 328.38,
          "end": 330.97,
          "en": "So now we got this register coach action",
          "zh": "現在我們有了這個 registerCoach action，"
        },
        {
          "id": 111,
          "start": 330.97,
          "end": 333.36,
          "en": "and we can therefore now dispatch this",
          "zh": "因此我們現在可以在 coach registration 元件裡"
        },
        {
          "id": 112,
          "start": 333.36,
          "end": 335.95,
          "en": "in the coach registration component",
          "zh": "dispatch 它，"
        },
        {
          "id": 113,
          "start": 335.95,
          "end": 338.65,
          "en": "whenever safe data is executed.",
          "zh": "每當 saveData 執行時。"
        },
        {
          "id": 114,
          "start": 338.65,
          "end": 343.17,
          "en": "Here we can use this store dispatch",
          "zh": "在這裡我們可以用 store.dispatch，"
        },
        {
          "id": 115,
          "start": 343.17,
          "end": 347.08,
          "en": "and then dispatch coaches/register coach,",
          "zh": "然後 dispatch 'coaches/registerCoach'，"
        },
        {
          "id": 116,
          "start": 347.08,
          "end": 348.6,
          "en": "this is the name space,",
          "zh": "這是命名空間，"
        },
        {
          "id": 117,
          "start": 348.6,
          "end": 351.28,
          "en": "this is the action name.",
          "zh": "這是 action 名稱。"
        },
        {
          "id": 118,
          "start": 351.28,
          "end": 352.90999999999997,
          "en": "And of course not just like this",
          "zh": "當然不只是這樣，"
        },
        {
          "id": 119,
          "start": 352.90999999999997,
          "end": 355.2,
          "en": "but also provide a second argument",
          "zh": "還要提供第二個引數，"
        },
        {
          "id": 120,
          "start": 355.2,
          "end": 357.03,
          "en": "which is that data we're getting",
          "zh": "也就是我們取得的那份資料，"
        },
        {
          "id": 121,
          "start": 358.09000000000003,
          "end": 361.04,
          "en": "and that should now be adding a new coach",
          "zh": "而這樣一來，當我們把所有細節都填好之後，"
        },
        {
          "id": 122,
          "start": 361.04,
          "end": 364.07,
          "en": "once we've filled out all the details.",
          "zh": "就應該會新增一位 coach。"
        },
        {
          "id": 123,
          "start": 364.07,
          "end": 367.01,
          "en": "So with that if I now reload here",
          "zh": "這樣一來，如果我現在在這裡重新載入，"
        },
        {
          "id": 124,
          "start": 367.85,
          "end": 371.06,
          "en": "and I enter Max Schwarz,",
          "zh": "並輸入 Max Schwarz，"
        },
        {
          "id": 125,
          "start": 371.06,
          "end": 372.87,
          "en": "this is a test.",
          "zh": "這是測試。"
        },
        {
          "id": 126,
          "start": 372.87,
          "end": 375.25,
          "en": "15 and backend.",
          "zh": "15 和 backend。"
        },
        {
          "id": 127,
          "start": 375.25,
          "end": 378.32,
          "en": "If I register and go back to all coaches,",
          "zh": "如果我註冊，然後回到 all coaches，"
        },
        {
          "id": 128,
          "start": 378.32,
          "end": 380.3,
          "en": "we see that data down there",
          "zh": "我們會看到那筆資料在下面，"
        },
        {
          "id": 129,
          "start": 380.3,
          "end": 382.45,
          "en": "and of course we can also view the details.",
          "zh": "當然我們也可以檢視詳細資料。"
        },
        {
          "id": 130,
          "start": 384.01,
          "end": 385.9,
          "en": "Now maybe it would be nice",
          "zh": "現在，如果能這樣應該會不錯，"
        },
        {
          "id": 131,
          "start": 385.9,
          "end": 388.59,
          "en": "if we would automatically be forwarded",
          "zh": "就是一旦我們提交那份表單，"
        },
        {
          "id": 132,
          "start": 388.59,
          "end": 390.72,
          "en": "once we submitted that form,",
          "zh": "就自動被轉送，"
        },
        {
          "id": 133,
          "start": 390.72,
          "end": 393.88,
          "en": "be forwarded to that all coaches page I mean,",
          "zh": "我的意思是，被轉送到那個 all coaches 頁面，"
        },
        {
          "id": 134,
          "start": 393.88,
          "end": 396.35,
          "en": "and that's something we can simply implement",
          "zh": "而這我們可以簡單地實作，"
        },
        {
          "id": 135,
          "start": 396.35,
          "end": 399.78,
          "en": "by going back to save data in coach registration,",
          "zh": "只要回到 coach registration 裡的 saveData，"
        },
        {
          "id": 136,
          "start": 399.78,
          "end": 404.78,
          "en": "and using this $router.push to push us to /coaches.",
          "zh": "並使用 $router.push 把我們推到 /coaches。"
        },
        {
          "id": 137,
          "start": 406.04,
          "end": 408.94,
          "en": "Or use something which I haven't shown you before",
          "zh": "或者使用一個我還沒給你看過的東西，"
        },
        {
          "id": 138,
          "start": 408.94,
          "end": 411.493,
          "en": "and that's the replace method on the router.",
          "zh": "也就是 router 上的 replace 方法。"
        },
        {
          "id": 139,
          "start": 412.38,
          "end": 414.46,
          "en": "It's also navigating us away,",
          "zh": "它同樣會把我們導航離開，"
        },
        {
          "id": 140,
          "start": 414.46,
          "end": 415.7,
          "en": "just like push,",
          "zh": "就像 push 一樣，"
        },
        {
          "id": 141,
          "start": 415.7,
          "end": 418.11,
          "en": "but the difference is that we can't go back",
          "zh": "但差別在於，之後我們無法"
        },
        {
          "id": 142,
          "start": 418.11,
          "end": 421.08,
          "en": "to the page we came from thereafter.",
          "zh": "回到我們先前所在的那個頁面。"
        },
        {
          "id": 143,
          "start": 421.08,
          "end": 422.31,
          "en": "And that's good because here",
          "zh": "這樣很好，因為在這裡"
        },
        {
          "id": 144,
          "start": 422.31,
          "end": 424.34,
          "en": "I don't want to go back to the form",
          "zh": "我不希望在表單提交後"
        },
        {
          "id": 145,
          "start": 424.34,
          "end": 426.13,
          "en": "once it is submitted.",
          "zh": "還能回到那個表單。"
        },
        {
          "id": 146,
          "start": 426.13,
          "end": 428.89300000000003,
          "en": "So that's why I'm using replace instead of push here.",
          "zh": "所以這就是我在這裡用 replace 而不用 push 的原因。"
        },
        {
          "id": 147,
          "start": 430.06,
          "end": 432.06,
          "en": "Now with that out of the way,",
          "zh": "這件事處理完之後，"
        },
        {
          "id": 148,
          "start": 432.06,
          "end": 433.02,
          "en": "let's try this again.",
          "zh": "我們再試一次。"
        },
        {
          "id": 149,
          "start": 433.02,
          "end": 434.37,
          "en": "Let's reload,",
          "zh": "重新載入，"
        },
        {
          "id": 150,
          "start": 434.37,
          "end": 435.63,
          "en": "and every time we reload,",
          "zh": "順帶一提，每次我們重新載入時，"
        },
        {
          "id": 151,
          "start": 435.63,
          "end": 437.93,
          "en": "we lose our generated coach by the way",
          "zh": "都會失去剛剛產生的那位 coach，"
        },
        {
          "id": 152,
          "start": 437.93,
          "end": 441.33,
          "en": "because it's only stored temporarily in memory",
          "zh": "因為它只是暫時存在記憶體裡，"
        },
        {
          "id": 153,
          "start": 441.33,
          "end": 443.919,
          "en": "that's why we later add HTTP in the server",
          "zh": "這就是我們之後會加入 HTTP 和伺服器的原因，"
        },
        {
          "id": 154,
          "start": 443.919,
          "end": 447.65,
          "en": "so that's why we lose it when we reload at the moment.",
          "zh": "也是目前重新載入時會失去它的原因。"
        },
        {
          "id": 155,
          "start": 447.65,
          "end": 448.9,
          "en": "But that's good because that means",
          "zh": "但這樣也好，因為那表示"
        },
        {
          "id": 156,
          "start": 448.9,
          "end": 451.53,
          "en": "we can register the same coach again",
          "zh": "我們可以再次註冊同一位 coach，"
        },
        {
          "id": 157,
          "start": 451.53,
          "end": 453.718,
          "en": "without having an ID clash.",
          "zh": "而不會發生 ID 衝突。"
        },
        {
          "id": 158,
          "start": 453.718,
          "end": 455.193,
          "en": "This is a test,",
          "zh": "這是測試，"
        },
        {
          "id": 159,
          "start": 456.40999999999997,
          "end": 457.42,
          "en": "add that data",
          "zh": "加入那筆資料，"
        },
        {
          "id": 160,
          "start": 457.42,
          "end": 460.713,
          "en": "and now if I register I'm forwarded to this page.",
          "zh": "現在如果我註冊，就會被轉送到這個頁面。"
        },
        {
          "id": 161,
          "start": 462.11,
          "end": 463.43,
          "en": "Now I think it would be good",
          "zh": "現在我覺得，如果一旦我們完成註冊，"
        },
        {
          "id": 162,
          "start": 463.43,
          "end": 466.3,
          "en": "if this button would not be available anymore",
          "zh": "這個按鈕就不再出現，"
        },
        {
          "id": 163,
          "start": 466.3,
          "end": 468.54,
          "en": "as soon as we did register though.",
          "zh": "應該會比較好。"
        },
        {
          "id": 164,
          "start": 468.54,
          "end": 472.8,
          "en": "And therefore I want to make sure that we are aware",
          "zh": "因此我想確保我們能知道"
        },
        {
          "id": 165,
          "start": 472.8,
          "end": 475.99,
          "en": "of when that user signed up.",
          "zh": "使用者是何時註冊的。"
        },
        {
          "id": 166,
          "start": 475.99,
          "end": 477.85,
          "en": "And I want to make sure",
          "zh": "我也想確保"
        },
        {
          "id": 167,
          "start": 477.85,
          "end": 482.85,
          "en": "that we can check for the user being a coach by using Vuex.",
          "zh": "我們可以透過 Vuex 來檢查使用者是否已經是一位 coach。"
        },
        {
          "id": 168,
          "start": 483.53,
          "end": 486.11,
          "en": "In the root index tray as follows,",
          "zh": "在 root index 檔案這邊做法如下，"
        },
        {
          "id": 169,
          "start": 486.11,
          "end": 487.35,
          "en": "the store folder.",
          "zh": "也就是 store 資料夾。"
        },
        {
          "id": 170,
          "start": 487.35,
          "end": 490.34,
          "en": "We currently just register the coaches module.",
          "zh": "我們目前只註冊了 coaches module。"
        },
        {
          "id": 171,
          "start": 490.34,
          "end": 494.22,
          "en": "Here I actually now want to also have some root state",
          "zh": "在這裡我其實現在也想加上一些 root state，"
        },
        {
          "id": 172,
          "start": 494.22,
          "end": 497.23,
          "en": "and that I want to manage the ID of the user",
          "zh": "而我想管理使用者的 ID，"
        },
        {
          "id": 173,
          "start": 497.23,
          "end": 499.02,
          "en": "who's using this app.",
          "zh": "也就是使用這個應用程式的使用者。"
        },
        {
          "id": 174,
          "start": 499.02,
          "end": 500.56,
          "en": "At the moment,",
          "zh": "目前，"
        },
        {
          "id": 175,
          "start": 500.56,
          "end": 502.75,
          "en": "this ID is of course hard coded.",
          "zh": "這個 ID 當然是寫死的。"
        },
        {
          "id": 176,
          "start": 502.75,
          "end": 504.65,
          "en": "I'll use c3 here.",
          "zh": "我在這裡會用 c3。"
        },
        {
          "id": 177,
          "start": 504.65,
          "end": 508.55,
          "en": "Later, after the authentication course module,",
          "zh": "之後，在 authentication 課程模組之後，"
        },
        {
          "id": 178,
          "start": 508.55,
          "end": 511.13,
          "en": "we will actually have a real user ID here.",
          "zh": "我們在這裡就會有真正的使用者 ID。"
        },
        {
          "id": 179,
          "start": 511.13,
          "end": 512.72,
          "en": "For the moment it's this dummy ID,",
          "zh": "目前它就是這個假 ID，"
        },
        {
          "id": 180,
          "start": 512.72,
          "end": 514.52,
          "en": "but that's okay.",
          "zh": "但沒關係。"
        },
        {
          "id": 181,
          "start": 514.52,
          "end": 516.88,
          "en": "So we'll have a use ID here",
          "zh": "所以我們這裡會有一個 user ID，"
        },
        {
          "id": 182,
          "start": 516.88,
          "end": 519.96,
          "en": "and that user ID should now be used",
          "zh": "而這個 user ID 現在應該被用在"
        },
        {
          "id": 183,
          "start": 519.96,
          "end": 521.86,
          "en": "when we sign up as a coach.",
          "zh": "當我們註冊成為 coach 時。"
        },
        {
          "id": 184,
          "start": 521.86,
          "end": 524.6,
          "en": "But should thereafter be used to verify",
          "zh": "但之後也應該用來驗證"
        },
        {
          "id": 185,
          "start": 524.6,
          "end": 528.2,
          "en": "whether we already got a coach with that ID.",
          "zh": "我們是否已經有 ID 相同的 coach。"
        },
        {
          "id": 186,
          "start": 528.2,
          "end": 532.04,
          "en": "Now first of all here in coach's actions,",
          "zh": "首先，在這裡的 coach actions 中，"
        },
        {
          "id": 187,
          "start": 532.04,
          "end": 534.68,
          "en": "I no longer wanna hard code the ID here",
          "zh": "我不再想把 ID 寫死在這裡，"
        },
        {
          "id": 188,
          "start": 534.68,
          "end": 537.48,
          "en": "but instead use this user ID.",
          "zh": "而是改用這個 user ID。"
        },
        {
          "id": 189,
          "start": 537.48,
          "end": 538.833,
          "en": "So for that,",
          "zh": "為此，"
        },
        {
          "id": 190,
          "start": 538.833,
          "end": 542.4,
          "en": "thankfully we can use our context",
          "zh": "幸好我們可以使用 context，"
        },
        {
          "id": 191,
          "start": 542.4,
          "end": 545.16,
          "en": "and access the root getters here.",
          "zh": "在這裡存取 root getters。"
        },
        {
          "id": 192,
          "start": 545.16,
          "end": 548.29,
          "en": "Now we just need a root getter that gives us this ID.",
          "zh": "現在我們只差一個能給我們這個 ID 的 root getter。"
        },
        {
          "id": 193,
          "start": 548.29,
          "end": 551.17,
          "en": "So in the root.js index file here",
          "zh": "所以在 root.js 這個 index 檔案裡，"
        },
        {
          "id": 194,
          "start": 551.17,
          "end": 555.54,
          "en": "I'll add getters and then add a user ID getter",
          "zh": "我會加上 getters，然後加上一個 userId getter，"
        },
        {
          "id": 195,
          "start": 555.54,
          "end": 558.86,
          "en": "where I just return state user ID",
          "zh": "裡面我只回傳 state.userId，"
        },
        {
          "id": 196,
          "start": 558.86,
          "end": 560.793,
          "en": "and get state as a parameter.",
          "zh": "並把 state 當作參數取得。"
        },
        {
          "id": 197,
          "start": 562.19,
          "end": 565.6,
          "en": "And now we can use this root getter here in this action",
          "zh": "現在我們可以在這個 action 裡使用這個 root getter，"
        },
        {
          "id": 198,
          "start": 565.6,
          "end": 569.003,
          "en": "by accessing context rootGetters.userid",
          "zh": "透過存取 context.rootGetters.userId，"
        },
        {
          "id": 199,
          "start": 569.003,
          "end": 571,
          "en": "so that we use the real user ID here",
          "zh": "這樣我們在這裡就會用真正的 user ID，"
        },
        {
          "id": 200,
          "start": 571.94,
          "end": 574.61,
          "en": "and then here in the coach getters",
          "zh": "接著在這裡的 coach getters 中，"
        },
        {
          "id": 201,
          "start": 574.61,
          "end": 577.04,
          "en": "we can add a isCoach getter",
          "zh": "我們可以加上一個 isCoach getter，"
        },
        {
          "id": 202,
          "start": 577.04,
          "end": 579.79,
          "en": "which returns true if the user already is a coach",
          "zh": "如果使用者已經是 coach 就回傳 true，"
        },
        {
          "id": 203,
          "start": 579.79,
          "end": 581.313,
          "en": "and falls otherwise,",
          "zh": "否則回傳 false，"
        },
        {
          "id": 204,
          "start": 582.5,
          "end": 584.31,
          "en": "and her we can utilize the fact",
          "zh": "在這裡我們可以利用一項特性，"
        },
        {
          "id": 205,
          "start": 584.31,
          "end": 586.93,
          "en": "that we get the state in a getter",
          "zh": "也就是在 getter 裡我們會取得 state，"
        },
        {
          "id": 206,
          "start": 586.93,
          "end": 590.678,
          "en": "but also other getters and also the rootState",
          "zh": "也會取得其他 getters，還有 rootState"
        },
        {
          "id": 207,
          "start": 590.678,
          "end": 592.9,
          "en": "and the rootGetters.",
          "zh": "以及 rootGetters。"
        },
        {
          "id": 208,
          "start": 592.9,
          "end": 595.8,
          "en": "That's what I showed you in the Vuex module.",
          "zh": "這就是我在 Vuex module 那部分示範過的。"
        },
        {
          "id": 209,
          "start": 595.8,
          "end": 599.95,
          "en": "And therefore here we wanna get our coaches",
          "zh": "因此，在這裡我們想取得我們的 coaches，"
        },
        {
          "id": 210,
          "start": 599.95,
          "end": 603.72,
          "en": "by accessing getters.coaches or state coaches,",
          "zh": "透過存取 getters.coaches 或 state.coaches，"
        },
        {
          "id": 211,
          "start": 603.72,
          "end": 605.86,
          "en": "doesn't really make a difference here.",
          "zh": "在這裡其實沒什麼差別。"
        },
        {
          "id": 212,
          "start": 605.86,
          "end": 608.62,
          "en": "And then we wanna look through those coaches",
          "zh": "然後我們想逐一查看這些 coaches，"
        },
        {
          "id": 213,
          "start": 608.62,
          "end": 612.5,
          "en": "and see if we got a coach with our user ID",
          "zh": "看看是否有 coach 的 ID 等於我們的 user ID，"
        },
        {
          "id": 214,
          "start": 612.5,
          "end": 614.67,
          "en": "which we can get from rootGetters.",
          "zh": "而這個 ID 我們可以從 rootGetters 取得。"
        },
        {
          "id": 215,
          "start": 614.67,
          "end": 618.497,
          "en": "We get our userID by accessing rootGetters.userId.",
          "zh": "我們透過存取 rootGetters.userId 來取得 userID。"
        },
        {
          "id": 216,
          "start": 620.56,
          "end": 624.81,
          "en": "And then we can return coaches.some",
          "zh": "接著我們可以回傳 coaches.some，"
        },
        {
          "id": 217,
          "start": 624.81,
          "end": 627.59,
          "en": "which is a built in method that returns true",
          "zh": "這是內建方法，會在"
        },
        {
          "id": 218,
          "start": 627.59,
          "end": 631.41,
          "en": "if some coach fulfills a criteria",
          "zh": "有某位 coach 符合條件時回傳 true，"
        },
        {
          "id": 219,
          "start": 631.41,
          "end": 633.59,
          "en": "and here we run a function every coach",
          "zh": "在這裡我們對每位 coach 執行一個函式，"
        },
        {
          "id": 220,
          "start": 633.59,
          "end": 637.147,
          "en": "and return true if coach.id is equal to userId.",
          "zh": "並在 coach.id 等於 userId 時回傳 true。"
        },
        {
          "id": 221,
          "start": 638.66,
          "end": 640.35,
          "en": "With that this will return true",
          "zh": "這樣一來，只要我們找到至少一位"
        },
        {
          "id": 222,
          "start": 640.35,
          "end": 642.67,
          "en": "if we find at least one coach",
          "zh": "coach 的 ID 等於我們的 user ID，"
        },
        {
          "id": 223,
          "start": 642.67,
          "end": 645.15,
          "en": "that has our user ID as ID",
          "zh": "它就會回傳 true，"
        },
        {
          "id": 224,
          "start": 645.15,
          "end": 647.363,
          "en": "which means we are a coach already.",
          "zh": "這表示我們已經是一位 coach。"
        },
        {
          "id": 225,
          "start": 649.29,
          "end": 651.5,
          "en": "Now I got two unused parameters here",
          "zh": "現在我這裡有兩個未使用的參數，"
        },
        {
          "id": 226,
          "start": 651.5,
          "end": 655.34,
          "en": "which this specific project set up wouldn't like.",
          "zh": "這個專案的特定設定不會喜歡這樣。"
        },
        {
          "id": 227,
          "start": 655.34,
          "end": 660.34,
          "en": "So here I'll use an underscore and _2 as parameter names",
          "zh": "所以在這裡我會用底線和 _2 當作參數名稱，"
        },
        {
          "id": 228,
          "start": 661.73,
          "end": 663.42,
          "en": "which is a specific convention",
          "zh": "這是一項特定的慣例，"
        },
        {
          "id": 229,
          "start": 663.42,
          "end": 667.13,
          "en": "that signals the ... of this project",
          "zh": "用來向這個專案的⋯表示"
        },
        {
          "id": 230,
          "start": 667.13,
          "end": 668.91,
          "en": "that I have to take these arguments",
          "zh": "我必須接收這些引數，"
        },
        {
          "id": 231,
          "start": 668.91,
          "end": 670.813,
          "en": "but I'm deliberately not using them.",
          "zh": "但我刻意不使用它們。"
        },
        {
          "id": 232,
          "start": 672.04,
          "end": 674.7,
          "en": "Well and with that we hopefully get true here",
          "zh": "這樣一來，如果我們有 ID 相符的 coach，"
        },
        {
          "id": 233,
          "start": 674.7,
          "end": 676.953,
          "en": "if we have a coach with our ID.",
          "zh": "希望這裡就會回傳 true。"
        },
        {
          "id": 234,
          "start": 678.04,
          "end": 680.41,
          "en": "Of course the downside of this approach by the way,",
          "zh": "順帶一提，這個做法當然有個缺點，"
        },
        {
          "id": 235,
          "start": 680.41,
          "end": 682.81,
          "en": "is that we always go through all coaches",
          "zh": "就是我們總是要遍歷所有 coaches，"
        },
        {
          "id": 236,
          "start": 682.81,
          "end": 685.25,
          "en": "to check whether we are a coach or not",
          "zh": "來檢查我們是不是 coach，"
        },
        {
          "id": 237,
          "start": 685.25,
          "end": 687.69,
          "en": "so an alternative way of solving this",
          "zh": "所以另一個解決這個問題的方法，"
        },
        {
          "id": 238,
          "start": 687.69,
          "end": 689.71,
          "en": "would be to simply add a new state",
          "zh": "就是直接在我們的 coaches state 裡"
        },
        {
          "id": 239,
          "start": 689.71,
          "end": 691.92,
          "en": "to our a coaches state here",
          "zh": "加上一個新的 state，"
        },
        {
          "id": 240,
          "start": 691.92,
          "end": 696.92,
          "en": "where we say UserIsCoach where we set this to true",
          "zh": "命名為 userIsCoach，並在使用者註冊時"
        },
        {
          "id": 241,
          "start": 697.68,
          "end": 699.65,
          "en": "as soon as the user signed up.",
          "zh": "立刻把它設為 true。"
        },
        {
          "id": 242,
          "start": 699.65,
          "end": 701.67,
          "en": "This is absolutely an alternative.",
          "zh": "這絕對是一種替代做法。"
        },
        {
          "id": 243,
          "start": 701.67,
          "end": 704.66,
          "en": "I'll still go with the other approach to also show that,",
          "zh": "我還是會採用另一種做法，也順便示範那個，"
        },
        {
          "id": 244,
          "start": 704.66,
          "end": 707.06,
          "en": "but it's up to you which approach you wanna use.",
          "zh": "但你想用哪種做法由你決定。"
        },
        {
          "id": 245,
          "start": 708.18,
          "end": 709.56,
          "en": "With that however,",
          "zh": "這樣一來，"
        },
        {
          "id": 246,
          "start": 709.56,
          "end": 711.99,
          "en": "I have this isCoach getter",
          "zh": "我就有了這個 isCoach getter，"
        },
        {
          "id": 247,
          "start": 711.99,
          "end": 714.42,
          "en": "and now in coach registration",
          "zh": "而現在在 coach registration 裡，"
        },
        {
          "id": 248,
          "start": 714.42,
          "end": 718.19,
          "en": "we can also add computed properties",
          "zh": "我們也可以加上 computed properties，"
        },
        {
          "id": 249,
          "start": 718.19,
          "end": 721.62,
          "en": "and add a isCoach computed property",
          "zh": "並加上一個 isCoach computed property，"
        },
        {
          "id": 250,
          "start": 721.62,
          "end": 724.06,
          "en": "where I return the result of reaching out",
          "zh": "裡面我回傳存取，"
        },
        {
          "id": 251,
          "start": 724.06,
          "end": 726.34,
          "en": "to this store.getters",
          "zh": "store.getters"
        },
        {
          "id": 252,
          "start": 726.34,
          "end": 728.073,
          "en": "coaches/isCoach.",
          "zh": "'coaches/isCoach' 的結果。"
        },
        {
          "id": 253,
          "start": 729.68,
          "end": 732.67,
          "en": "Which is that new getter we just worked on.",
          "zh": "也就是我們剛剛處理的那個新 getter。"
        },
        {
          "id": 254,
          "start": 732.67,
          "end": 736.08,
          "en": "And now we can use the isCoach property",
          "zh": "現在我們可以用 isCoach 屬性"
        },
        {
          "id": 255,
          "start": 736.08,
          "end": 740.32,
          "en": "to control whoever we wanna show this register button or not",
          "zh": "來控制我們到底要不要顯示這個 register 按鈕，"
        },
        {
          "id": 256,
          "start": 740.32,
          "end": 743.26,
          "en": "but I'm in the wrong component as I noticed",
          "zh": "但我發現我待錯元件了，"
        },
        {
          "id": 257,
          "start": 743.26,
          "end": 745.99,
          "en": "so let's cut that and removed that.",
          "zh": "所以我們把它剪掉、移除掉。"
        },
        {
          "id": 258,
          "start": 745.99,
          "end": 748.19,
          "en": "It's in the coaches list of course,",
          "zh": "它當然是在 coaches list 裡，"
        },
        {
          "id": 259,
          "start": 748.19,
          "end": 751.85,
          "en": "here we have this register as coach button",
          "zh": "這裡我們有這個 register as coach 按鈕，"
        },
        {
          "id": 260,
          "start": 751.85,
          "end": 754.59,
          "en": "so here in computed,",
          "zh": "所以在這裡的 computed 中，"
        },
        {
          "id": 261,
          "start": 754.59,
          "end": 758.933,
          "en": "I wanna add this isCoach computed property I just worked on.",
          "zh": "我想加上我剛剛處理的那個 isCoach computed property。"
        },
        {
          "id": 262,
          "start": 759.95,
          "end": 762.46,
          "en": "And now we can use isCoach here",
          "zh": "現在我們可以在這裡使用 isCoach，"
        },
        {
          "id": 263,
          "start": 762.46,
          "end": 767.24,
          "en": "with the v=if to only show this button if not is coach.",
          "zh": "搭配 v-if，只在不是 coach 時顯示這個按鈕。"
        },
        {
          "id": 264,
          "start": 767.24,
          "end": 769.593,
          "en": "So if the user is not a coach yet.",
          "zh": "也就是如果使用者還不是 coach。"
        },
        {
          "id": 265,
          "start": 770.88,
          "end": 772.49,
          "en": "With that if we save this,",
          "zh": "這樣一來，如果我們儲存這個，"
        },
        {
          "id": 266,
          "start": 772.49,
          "end": 773.85,
          "en": "if I reload",
          "zh": "如果我重新載入，"
        },
        {
          "id": 267,
          "start": 773.85,
          "end": 775.18,
          "en": "the button's available.",
          "zh": "按鈕是可用的。"
        },
        {
          "id": 268,
          "start": 775.18,
          "end": 778.14,
          "en": "But if I do now sign up here as a coach",
          "zh": "但如果我現在在這裡註冊成為 coach，"
        },
        {
          "id": 269,
          "start": 779.63,
          "end": 783.24,
          "en": "this hopefully is no longer the case thereafter.",
          "zh": "之後希望就不再是這樣了。"
        },
        {
          "id": 270,
          "start": 783.24,
          "end": 784.47,
          "en": "Now the button is gone",
          "zh": "現在按鈕不見了，"
        },
        {
          "id": 271,
          "start": 784.47,
          "end": 786.393,
          "en": "because now I am a coach.",
          "zh": "因為現在我是 coach 了。"
        },
        {
          "id": 272,
          "start": 787.33,
          "end": 790.89,
          "en": "So now adding a coach or registering as a coach works",
          "zh": "所以現在新增 coach，或者註冊成為 coach 可以運作，"
        },
        {
          "id": 273,
          "start": 790.89,
          "end": 793.89,
          "en": "at least in this dummy version.",
          "zh": "至少在這個假版本裡可以。"
        },
        {
          "id": 274,
          "start": 793.89,
          "end": 798.41,
          "en": "But with that our core coach feature is pretty much done,",
          "zh": "這樣一來，我們核心的 coach 功能就差不多完成了，"
        },
        {
          "id": 275,
          "start": 798.41,
          "end": 801.45,
          "en": "there's just one thing missing if I reload,",
          "zh": "如果我重新載入，只差一件事，"
        },
        {
          "id": 276,
          "start": 801.45,
          "end": 803.6,
          "en": "I want to add validation to this form",
          "zh": "我想為這個表單加上驗證，"
        },
        {
          "id": 277,
          "start": 803.6,
          "end": 806.15,
          "en": "so that we can't submit and empty form",
          "zh": "這樣我們就無法提交空表單，"
        },
        {
          "id": 278,
          "start": 806.15,
          "end": 808.38,
          "en": "because that won't work for us.",
          "zh": "因為那樣對我們行不通。"
        },
        {
          "id": 279,
          "start": 808.38,
          "end": 810.53,
          "en": "So that's what we're going to work on next",
          "zh": "所以這就是我們接下來要處理的，"
        },
        {
          "id": 280,
          "start": 810.53,
          "end": 814.863,
          "en": "before we do work on the context and requests features.",
          "zh": "在我們處理 context 和 requests 功能之前。"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "21879948",
      "title": "Adding Form Validation",
      "lectureOrder": 248,
      "videoOrder": 220,
      "sourceHash": "7e9a47e15f03605b450672d040c2a73cbfdae8c9faecfd42943fd73799b50dc7",
      "cues": [
        {
          "id": 1,
          "start": 2.24,
          "end": 5.11,
          "en": "So let's work on the validation of this form",
          "zh": "所以讓我們來處理這個表單的驗證，"
        },
        {
          "id": 2,
          "start": 5.11,
          "end": 7.46,
          "en": "because at the moment we can submit it",
          "zh": "因為目前我們可以在什麼都沒輸入的情況下"
        },
        {
          "id": 3,
          "start": 7.46,
          "end": 9.07,
          "en": "without entering anything",
          "zh": "就送出它，"
        },
        {
          "id": 4,
          "start": 9.07,
          "end": 12.76,
          "en": "and that's of course not the idea behind this form.",
          "zh": "那當然不是這個表單的本意。"
        },
        {
          "id": 5,
          "start": 12.76,
          "end": 15.25,
          "en": "So in the coach form component here,",
          "zh": "所以在這裡的 coach form 元件裡，"
        },
        {
          "id": 6,
          "start": 15.25,
          "end": 16.36,
          "en": "we're fetching the input,",
          "zh": "我們有取得輸入，"
        },
        {
          "id": 7,
          "start": 16.36,
          "end": 20.43,
          "en": "but now I wanna add an extra step when we submit the form.",
          "zh": "但現在我想在送出表單時加一個額外步驟。"
        },
        {
          "id": 8,
          "start": 20.43,
          "end": 22.35,
          "en": "I also want to validate it",
          "zh": "我也想驗證它，"
        },
        {
          "id": 9,
          "start": 22.35,
          "end": 26.62,
          "en": "and for that I'll add a separate method, validateForm simply",
          "zh": "為此我會加一個獨立的方法，就叫 validateForm，"
        },
        {
          "id": 10,
          "start": 26.62,
          "end": 28.75,
          "en": "to split the logic in two methods",
          "zh": "把邏輯拆成兩個方法，"
        },
        {
          "id": 11,
          "start": 28.75,
          "end": 31.51,
          "en": "and not have one super long method",
          "zh": "而不是只有一個超長的方法，"
        },
        {
          "id": 12,
          "start": 31.51,
          "end": 35.2,
          "en": "and in submitForm right at the start,",
          "zh": "而在 submitForm 的一開始，"
        },
        {
          "id": 13,
          "start": 35.2,
          "end": 38.433,
          "en": "I'll simply call this validateForm,",
          "zh": "我會直接呼叫這個 validateForm，"
        },
        {
          "id": 14,
          "start": 39.5,
          "end": 41.903,
          "en": "so this new method which we're adding here.",
          "zh": "也就是我們在這裡新增的這個方法。"
        },
        {
          "id": 15,
          "start": 43.19,
          "end": 45.96,
          "en": "Now in here I want to go through all the inputs",
          "zh": "現在在這裡，我想要遍歷所有 input，"
        },
        {
          "id": 16,
          "start": 45.96,
          "end": 49.15,
          "en": "and check whether they are valid or not,",
          "zh": "檢查它們是否有效，"
        },
        {
          "id": 17,
          "start": 49.15,
          "end": 52.44,
          "en": "and I will add an overall new data property here",
          "zh": "而我會在這裡加一個整體的新 data property，"
        },
        {
          "id": 18,
          "start": 52.44,
          "end": 57.31,
          "en": "to this entire component, the formIsValid data component,",
          "zh": "加到整個元件上，也就是 formIsValid 這個 data property，"
        },
        {
          "id": 19,
          "start": 57.31,
          "end": 59.21,
          "en": "which initially is true,",
          "zh": "它初始是 true，"
        },
        {
          "id": 20,
          "start": 59.21,
          "end": 63.063,
          "en": "but which will be false as soon as one input is false.",
          "zh": "但只要有一個 input 是 false，它就會變成 false。"
        },
        {
          "id": 21,
          "start": 65.37,
          "end": 67.56,
          "en": "No actually I'll make form validation",
          "zh": "不，其實我會讓表單驗證"
        },
        {
          "id": 22,
          "start": 67.56,
          "end": 70.5,
          "en": "even a bit more complex than just that.",
          "zh": "比這樣再複雜一點。"
        },
        {
          "id": 23,
          "start": 70.5,
          "end": 74.51,
          "en": "I also want to manage the validity of every single element,",
          "zh": "我也想要管理每一個元素的有效性，"
        },
        {
          "id": 24,
          "start": 74.51,
          "end": 77.58,
          "en": "so that I can later re-highlight the elements",
          "zh": "這樣我之後就能重新標示那些元素，"
        },
        {
          "id": 25,
          "start": 77.58,
          "end": 82.38,
          "en": "by coloring the label red for example, that were invalid.",
          "zh": "例如把 label 標成紅色，也就是那些無效的欄位。"
        },
        {
          "id": 26,
          "start": 82.38,
          "end": 85.1,
          "en": "Therefore, the other data which has managed here",
          "zh": "因此，這裡管理的其他 data"
        },
        {
          "id": 27,
          "start": 85.1,
          "end": 89.12,
          "en": "is no longer just devalue of a certain property,",
          "zh": "就不再只是某個屬性的 value，"
        },
        {
          "id": 28,
          "start": 89.12,
          "end": 92.28999999999999,
          "en": "but instead here that will be an object now,",
          "zh": "而是這裡現在會是一個 object，"
        },
        {
          "id": 29,
          "start": 92.28999999999999,
          "end": 94.59,
          "en": "where I want to have a val key,",
          "zh": "我想要有一個 val 鍵，"
        },
        {
          "id": 30,
          "start": 94.59,
          "end": 97.19,
          "en": "which holds the value the user entered",
          "zh": "它保存使用者輸入的值，"
        },
        {
          "id": 31,
          "start": 97.19,
          "end": 100.14,
          "en": "and a isValidKey which initially is true,",
          "zh": "以及一個 isValid 鍵，初始為 true，"
        },
        {
          "id": 32,
          "start": 100.14,
          "end": 104.343,
          "en": "which can become false if data input should be invalid.",
          "zh": "如果該輸入無效，它就會變成 false。"
        },
        {
          "id": 33,
          "start": 105.6,
          "end": 108.37,
          "en": "So I'm going to replace my values here",
          "zh": "所以我要把我這裡的 values"
        },
        {
          "id": 34,
          "start": 108.37,
          "end": 110.593,
          "en": "with that new concept.",
          "zh": "換成這個新概念。"
        },
        {
          "id": 35,
          "start": 111.97,
          "end": 114.66,
          "en": "Here val is null initially,",
          "zh": "這裡 val 初始是 null，"
        },
        {
          "id": 36,
          "start": 114.66,
          "end": 118.69,
          "en": "and here it's an empty array initially.",
          "zh": "而這裡初始是空陣列。"
        },
        {
          "id": 37,
          "start": 118.69,
          "end": 121.38,
          "en": "So now the data got a little bit more complex",
          "zh": "現在 data 變得稍微複雜一點了，"
        },
        {
          "id": 38,
          "start": 121.38,
          "end": 123.55,
          "en": "and now we need to update v-model",
          "zh": "現在我們需要更新 v-model，"
        },
        {
          "id": 39,
          "start": 123.55,
          "end": 128.53,
          "en": "and bind this to firstName.val, lastName.val",
          "zh": "並把它綁到 firstName.val、lastName.val"
        },
        {
          "id": 40,
          "start": 128.53,
          "end": 132.42,
          "en": "and so on because now first name, last name, description,",
          "zh": "等等，因為現在 firstName、lastName、description"
        },
        {
          "id": 41,
          "start": 132.42,
          "end": 136.1,
          "en": "actually hold objects where we have a val property,",
          "zh": "實際上都是 object，裡面有 val 屬性，"
        },
        {
          "id": 42,
          "start": 136.1,
          "end": 138.98,
          "en": "which then holds to value that should be bound,.",
          "zh": "它才是保存應該被綁定的值。"
        },
        {
          "id": 43,
          "start": 138.98,
          "end": 141.82999999999998,
          "en": "so that's why I'm updating my v-model bindings",
          "zh": "所以這就是為什麼我要更新所有 input 的"
        },
        {
          "id": 44,
          "start": 141.82999999999998,
          "end": 143.53300000000002,
          "en": "for all the inputs here,",
          "zh": "v-model 綁定，"
        },
        {
          "id": 45,
          "start": 144.42000000000002,
          "end": 148.22,
          "en": "including the checkboxes of course like this",
          "zh": "當然也包括 checkboxes，就像這樣，"
        },
        {
          "id": 46,
          "start": 149.6,
          "end": 154.6,
          "en": "and now with that in our validateForm method,",
          "zh": "現在有了這些，在我們的 validateForm 方法裡，"
        },
        {
          "id": 47,
          "start": 154.98,
          "end": 156.62,
          "en": "I will go through all these inputs,",
          "zh": "我會遍歷所有這些 input，"
        },
        {
          "id": 48,
          "start": 156.62,
          "end": 157.94,
          "en": "have a look at each of them",
          "zh": "逐一檢查每一個，"
        },
        {
          "id": 49,
          "start": 157.94,
          "end": 159.833,
          "en": "and see whether it's valid or not.",
          "zh": "看看它是否有效。"
        },
        {
          "id": 50,
          "start": 161.15,
          "end": 164.55,
          "en": "For this initially I'll set thisFormIsValid to true",
          "zh": "為此，我一開始會把 this.formIsValid 設為 true，"
        },
        {
          "id": 51,
          "start": 164.55,
          "end": 167.64,
          "en": "in case it got invalid and therefore falls in",
          "zh": "以防它之前變成無效，因此"
        },
        {
          "id": 52,
          "start": 167.64,
          "end": 169.79,
          "en": "between since the last validation",
          "zh": "從上次驗證之後一直是錯的，"
        },
        {
          "id": 53,
          "start": 169.79,
          "end": 173.3,
          "en": "and then I'll go through all these inputs.",
          "zh": "然後我會遍歷所有這些 input。"
        },
        {
          "id": 54,
          "start": 173.3,
          "end": 176.1,
          "en": "The first one I'll check is the firstName.",
          "zh": "我第一個要檢查的是 firstName。"
        },
        {
          "id": 55,
          "start": 176.1,
          "end": 180.02,
          "en": "Here with an IF statement I'll check if the value is empty,",
          "zh": "這裡我會用一個 if 陳述式檢查 value 是否為空，"
        },
        {
          "id": 56,
          "start": 180.02,
          "end": 182.25,
          "en": "keep in mind we're trimming it already,",
          "zh": "請記得我們已經 trim 過了，"
        },
        {
          "id": 57,
          "start": 182.25,
          "end": 183.98,
          "en": "so therefore excess white space",
          "zh": "所以多餘的空白"
        },
        {
          "id": 58,
          "start": 183.98,
          "end": 186.44,
          "en": "will already have been removed.",
          "zh": "已經被移除了。"
        },
        {
          "id": 59,
          "start": 186.44,
          "end": 188.99,
          "en": "If it's still empty it's invalid",
          "zh": "如果它仍然是空的，就是無效，"
        },
        {
          "id": 60,
          "start": 188.99,
          "end": 192.1,
          "en": "and therefore then I would set this firstName.isValid",
          "zh": "因此我會把 this.firstName.isValid"
        },
        {
          "id": 61,
          "start": 192.1,
          "end": 195.69,
          "en": "to false and since the overall form is invalid,",
          "zh": "設為 false，而既然整體表單無效，"
        },
        {
          "id": 62,
          "start": 195.69,
          "end": 197.94,
          "en": "if at least one input is invalid,",
          "zh": "只要至少有一個 input 無效，"
        },
        {
          "id": 63,
          "start": 197.94,
          "end": 201.723,
          "en": "I'll set this formIsValid to false here.",
          "zh": "我就在這裡把 this.formIsValid 設為 false。"
        },
        {
          "id": 64,
          "start": 203.25,
          "end": 206.823,
          "en": "And then we can repeat this for the lastName",
          "zh": "然後我們可以對 lastName 重複這個做法，"
        },
        {
          "id": 65,
          "start": 207.73,
          "end": 211.313,
          "en": "and set this lastName is valid to false here.",
          "zh": "在這裡把 this.lastName.isValid 設為 false。"
        },
        {
          "id": 66,
          "start": 212.16,
          "end": 215.5,
          "en": "And again, repeat it for the description",
          "zh": "再一次，對 description 重複，"
        },
        {
          "id": 67,
          "start": 217.11,
          "end": 220.823,
          "en": "and set this description is valid to false.",
          "zh": "並把 this.description.isValid 設為 false。"
        },
        {
          "id": 68,
          "start": 222.2,
          "end": 224.84,
          "en": "Now for to rate the check is a bit different,",
          "zh": "至於 rate，檢查方式有點不同，"
        },
        {
          "id": 69,
          "start": 224.84,
          "end": 227.38,
          "en": "here I'll not check whether it's empty,",
          "zh": "這裡我不會檢查它是否為空，"
        },
        {
          "id": 70,
          "start": 227.38,
          "end": 232.03,
          "en": "but I'll check if we don't have a rate, so if it's null",
          "zh": "而是檢查我們是否沒有 rate，也就是它是否為 null"
        },
        {
          "id": 71,
          "start": 232.03,
          "end": 237.03,
          "en": "or zero or anything like that, or even if we do have a rate,",
          "zh": "或零之類的，或者即使我們有 rate，"
        },
        {
          "id": 72,
          "start": 238.36,
          "end": 241.98,
          "en": "I'll check if this rate val is smaller than zero,",
          "zh": "我也會檢查這個 rate.val 是否小於零，"
        },
        {
          "id": 73,
          "start": 241.98,
          "end": 243.3,
          "en": "because you shouldn't be able",
          "zh": "因為你當然不應該"
        },
        {
          "id": 74,
          "start": 243.3,
          "end": 246.163,
          "en": "to have a negative hourly rate of course.",
          "zh": "有負的時薪。"
        },
        {
          "id": 75,
          "start": 247.45,
          "end": 251.44,
          "en": "So in these cases, rate is valid would become false.",
          "zh": "所以在這些情況下，rate.isValid 會變成 false。"
        },
        {
          "id": 76,
          "start": 251.44,
          "end": 256.44,
          "en": "And for the areas I'll check if this areas val.length",
          "zh": "而對於 areas，我會檢查這個 areas.val.length"
        },
        {
          "id": 77,
          "start": 258.17,
          "end": 261.05,
          "en": "is equal to zero which means no areas",
          "zh": "是否等於零，意思是沒有加入任何"
        },
        {
          "id": 78,
          "start": 261.05,
          "end": 264.53,
          "en": "of expertise have been added, that's also not valid,",
          "zh": "專業領域，那也同樣無效，"
        },
        {
          "id": 79,
          "start": 264.53,
          "end": 266.6,
          "en": "you need at least one area.",
          "zh": "你至少需要一個領域。"
        },
        {
          "id": 80,
          "start": 266.6,
          "end": 270.27,
          "en": "So in this case, this.areasisValid would become false",
          "zh": "所以在這種情況下，this.areas.isValid 會變成 false，"
        },
        {
          "id": 81,
          "start": 270.27,
          "end": 273.303,
          "en": "and this.formisValid would become false.",
          "zh": "而 this.formIsValid 也會變成 false。"
        },
        {
          "id": 82,
          "start": 275,
          "end": 277.12,
          "en": "So that's my validation logic,",
          "zh": "這就是我的驗證邏輯，"
        },
        {
          "id": 83,
          "start": 277.12,
          "end": 280.56,
          "en": "that means that after calling this.validateForm,",
          "zh": "那意味著在呼叫 this.validateForm 之後，"
        },
        {
          "id": 84,
          "start": 280.56,
          "end": 284.62,
          "en": "this.formIsValid will be false if the form is invalid,",
          "zh": "如果表單無效，this.formIsValid 就會是 false，"
        },
        {
          "id": 85,
          "start": 284.62,
          "end": 286.90999999999997,
          "en": "so therefore in submitForm I can check,",
          "zh": "所以在 submitForm 裡我可以檢查，"
        },
        {
          "id": 86,
          "start": 286.90999999999997,
          "end": 289.11,
          "en": "if not this.formIsValid",
          "zh": "如果 this.formIsValid 不是 true，"
        },
        {
          "id": 87,
          "start": 290.48,
          "end": 292.71,
          "en": "and in this case just return to make sure",
          "zh": "而在這種情況下就直接 return，以確保"
        },
        {
          "id": 88,
          "start": 292.71,
          "end": 295.33,
          "en": "that the rest of this method doesn't execute",
          "zh": "這個方法剩下的部分不會執行，"
        },
        {
          "id": 89,
          "start": 295.33,
          "end": 298.783,
          "en": "because I don't want to continue if the form is invalid.",
          "zh": "因為如果表單無效，我不想繼續下去。"
        },
        {
          "id": 90,
          "start": 300.52,
          "end": 303.27,
          "en": "And now we can go to our template",
          "zh": "現在我們可以到我們的 template，"
        },
        {
          "id": 91,
          "start": 303.27,
          "end": 307.59,
          "en": "and actually show users some feedback if inputs",
          "zh": "如果 input 或整個表單無效，"
        },
        {
          "id": 92,
          "start": 307.59,
          "end": 310.52,
          "en": "or the overall form are invalid.",
          "zh": "實際給使用者一些回饋。"
        },
        {
          "id": 93,
          "start": 310.52,
          "end": 314.17,
          "en": "Let's start with the overall maybe, for that",
          "zh": "也許先從整體開始，為此"
        },
        {
          "id": 94,
          "start": 314.17,
          "end": 318.673,
          "en": "before the base button I'll add a paragraph where I say,",
          "zh": "在 base button 之前我會加一個段落，寫著"
        },
        {
          "id": 95,
          "start": 319.88,
          "end": 322.82,
          "en": "please fix the above errors",
          "zh": "please fix the above errors"
        },
        {
          "id": 96,
          "start": 322.82,
          "end": 327.11,
          "en": "and submit again or anything like that",
          "zh": "and submit again 之類的，"
        },
        {
          "id": 97,
          "start": 327.11,
          "end": 331.879,
          "en": "and we only show this with the IF, if not formIsValid,",
          "zh": "而我們只用 v-if 顯示它，如果 formIsValid 不是 true，"
        },
        {
          "id": 98,
          "start": 331.879,
          "end": 335.613,
          "en": "so if the form is invalid, if formIsValid is false,",
          "zh": "也就是如果表單無效、formIsValid 是 false，"
        },
        {
          "id": 99,
          "start": 337.34000000000003,
          "end": 340.43,
          "en": "But that's not all instead I also wanna highlight the inputs",
          "zh": "但不只這樣，我還想標示出那些無效的 input，"
        },
        {
          "id": 100,
          "start": 340.43,
          "end": 344.40999999999997,
          "en": "that were invalid, so let's start with the first name.",
          "zh": "所以讓我們從 firstName 開始。"
        },
        {
          "id": 101,
          "start": 344.40999999999997,
          "end": 348,
          "en": "There on the overall div I'll bind a class dynamically",
          "zh": "在那個最外層的 div 上，我會動態綁定一個 class，"
        },
        {
          "id": 102,
          "start": 348.94,
          "end": 351.39,
          "en": "and I'll use this object syntax for that",
          "zh": "為此我會使用這種 object 語法，"
        },
        {
          "id": 103,
          "start": 351.39,
          "end": 354.54,
          "en": "and here, I wanna add the invalid class,",
          "zh": "在這裡，我想加上 invalid class，"
        },
        {
          "id": 104,
          "start": 354.54,
          "end": 357.21,
          "en": "which is defined down there in the CSS rules",
          "zh": "它定義在下面的 CSS 規則裡，"
        },
        {
          "id": 105,
          "start": 357.21,
          "end": 360.2,
          "en": "to then change the label color and so on.",
          "zh": "用來改變 label 顏色等等。"
        },
        {
          "id": 106,
          "start": 360.2,
          "end": 364.15,
          "en": "I wanna add that invalid class here on first name,",
          "zh": "我想在這裡把那個 invalid class 加到 firstName，"
        },
        {
          "id": 107,
          "start": 364.15,
          "end": 369.15,
          "en": "If not firstName.isValid, if it is invalid therefore.",
          "zh": "如果 firstName.isValid 不是 true，也就是如果它無效。"
        },
        {
          "id": 108,
          "start": 370.44,
          "end": 373.773,
          "en": "Then this invalid CSS class will be added to this div.",
          "zh": "那麼這個 invalid CSS class 就會被加到這個 div。"
        },
        {
          "id": 109,
          "start": 374.94,
          "end": 379.84,
          "en": "In addition, below the input I'll have a paragraph,",
          "zh": "此外，在 input 下面我會放一個段落，"
        },
        {
          "id": 110,
          "start": 379.84,
          "end": 384.84,
          "en": "where I say first name must not be empty",
          "zh": "寫著 first name must not be empty，"
        },
        {
          "id": 111,
          "start": 385.12,
          "end": 389.883,
          "en": "and this has shown IF not first name is valid.",
          "zh": "而這會用 v-if 顯示，如果 firstName.isValid 不是 true。"
        },
        {
          "id": 112,
          "start": 391.64,
          "end": 393.95,
          "en": "Now I'm going to copy that paragraph",
          "zh": "現在我要複製那個段落，"
        },
        {
          "id": 113,
          "start": 393.95,
          "end": 395.93,
          "en": "because for last name I wanna say this,",
          "zh": "因為針對 lastName 我想要這樣寫，"
        },
        {
          "id": 114,
          "start": 395.93,
          "end": 397.9,
          "en": "to say the name just with last name",
          "zh": "把名稱改成 last name，"
        },
        {
          "id": 115,
          "start": 397.9,
          "end": 401.22,
          "en": "and check if last name is not valid,",
          "zh": "並檢查 lastName.isValid 是否不是 true，"
        },
        {
          "id": 116,
          "start": 401.22,
          "end": 404.4,
          "en": "and I will also copy that class assignment",
          "zh": "我也會複製那個 class 指派，"
        },
        {
          "id": 117,
          "start": 404.4,
          "end": 406.2,
          "en": "and assign it on this divv as well",
          "zh": "並把它也指派到這個 div，"
        },
        {
          "id": 118,
          "start": 406.2,
          "end": 409.78,
          "en": "but of course, checking last name is valid",
          "zh": "當然，檢查的是 lastName.isValid"
        },
        {
          "id": 119,
          "start": 409.78,
          "end": 412.483,
          "en": "or it not being valid to be precise.",
          "zh": "或者更精確地說，它是否無效。"
        },
        {
          "id": 120,
          "start": 415.02,
          "end": 418.67,
          "en": "Now for the text area for the description it's the same,",
          "zh": "至於 description 的 textarea，也是一樣，"
        },
        {
          "id": 121,
          "start": 418.67,
          "end": 420.46,
          "en": "copy to paragraph and say",
          "zh": "複製那個段落並改成"
        },
        {
          "id": 122,
          "start": 424.005,
          "end": 426.21,
          "en": "description must not be empty",
          "zh": "description must not be empty，"
        },
        {
          "id": 123,
          "start": 426.21,
          "end": 430.8,
          "en": "and also copy this CSS class assignment to the div",
          "zh": "同時也把這個 CSS class 指派複製到那個 div，"
        },
        {
          "id": 124,
          "start": 430.8,
          "end": 432.9,
          "en": "by checking description is valid",
          "zh": "檢查 description.isValid 是否不是 true，"
        },
        {
          "id": 125,
          "start": 434.86,
          "end": 438.75,
          "en": "and again, copy the paragraph over to the rate",
          "zh": "再一次，把段落複製到 rate，"
        },
        {
          "id": 126,
          "start": 438.75,
          "end": 440.86,
          "en": "and here, I of course wanna say",
          "zh": "而在這裡，我當然想寫"
        },
        {
          "id": 127,
          "start": 440.86,
          "end": 445.86,
          "en": "rate must be greater than zero",
          "zh": "rate must be greater than zero，"
        },
        {
          "id": 128,
          "start": 447.83,
          "end": 450.5,
          "en": "and also add the CSS class here",
          "zh": "也在這裡把 CSS class 加上，"
        },
        {
          "id": 129,
          "start": 450.5,
          "end": 453.603,
          "en": "to the div if rate is not valid.",
          "zh": "加到那個 div，如果 rate.isValid 不是 true。"
        },
        {
          "id": 130,
          "start": 455.47,
          "end": 458.90999999999997,
          "en": "Copy the paragraph again and go down to the checkboxes",
          "zh": "再複製一次那個段落，往下到 checkboxes，"
        },
        {
          "id": 131,
          "start": 458.90999999999997,
          "end": 463.90999999999997,
          "en": "and here below all checkboxes, I'll also add this paragraph",
          "zh": "在這裡所有 checkboxes 的下方，我也會加上這個段落，"
        },
        {
          "id": 132,
          "start": 464.21,
          "end": 467.14,
          "en": "and say, whoops here,",
          "zh": "並寫，哎呀，這裡，"
        },
        {
          "id": 133,
          "start": 467.14,
          "end": 472.14,
          "en": "say at least one expertise must be selected.",
          "zh": "寫 at least one expertise must be selected。"
        },
        {
          "id": 134,
          "start": 475.15,
          "end": 479.28,
          "en": "and of course show this if areas are not valid,",
          "zh": "當然，如果 areas 無效就顯示這個，"
        },
        {
          "id": 135,
          "start": 479.28,
          "end": 481.29,
          "en": "I forgot this on the other paragraphs,",
          "zh": "我在其他段落忘了這個，"
        },
        {
          "id": 136,
          "start": 481.29,
          "end": 483.95,
          "en": "here I should check if rate is not valid here,",
          "zh": "這裡我應該檢查 rate.isValid 是否不是 true，"
        },
        {
          "id": 137,
          "start": 483.95,
          "end": 487.74,
          "en": "if description is not valid",
          "zh": "如果 description.isValid 不是 true，"
        },
        {
          "id": 138,
          "start": 488.66,
          "end": 491.86,
          "en": "and I did update it for first and last name,",
          "zh": "而 first name 和 last name 我已經更新了，"
        },
        {
          "id": 139,
          "start": 491.86,
          "end": 494.29,
          "en": "but also now I'll copy that class here",
          "zh": "但現在我也會在這裡複製那個 class，"
        },
        {
          "id": 140,
          "start": 496.37,
          "end": 499.3,
          "en": "and add it on that form control div",
          "zh": "並把它加到那個 form-control div，"
        },
        {
          "id": 141,
          "start": 499.3,
          "end": 503.593,
          "en": "around the checkboxes if areas are not valid.",
          "zh": "也就是包住 checkboxes 的那個，如果 areas 無效。"
        },
        {
          "id": 142,
          "start": 505.37,
          "end": 507.48,
          "en": "With that, we hopefully have some validation,",
          "zh": "這樣一來，我們希望就有了一些驗證，"
        },
        {
          "id": 143,
          "start": 507.48,
          "end": 510.94,
          "en": "if I now reload and submit the empty form everything is red,",
          "zh": "如果我現在重新載入並送出空表單，全部都會變紅，"
        },
        {
          "id": 144,
          "start": 510.94,
          "end": 512.64,
          "en": "we got these error messages",
          "zh": "我們會看到這些錯誤訊息，"
        },
        {
          "id": 145,
          "start": 512.64,
          "end": 515.313,
          "en": "and we got this main form error message.",
          "zh": "也會看到這個主要的表單錯誤訊息。"
        },
        {
          "id": 146,
          "start": 516.25,
          "end": 520.68,
          "en": "If a reload again and I do enter something here and here,",
          "zh": "如果我再次重新載入，並在這裡和這裡輸入一些東西，"
        },
        {
          "id": 147,
          "start": 520.68,
          "end": 524.02,
          "en": "but I have a negative rate here for example,",
          "zh": "但例如我在這裡輸入了負的 rate，"
        },
        {
          "id": 148,
          "start": 524.02,
          "end": 527.47,
          "en": "only the invalid values are marked as such.",
          "zh": "只有無效的值會被標示出來。"
        },
        {
          "id": 149,
          "start": 527.47,
          "end": 532.47,
          "en": "And of course if we enter something valid in all the fields,",
          "zh": "而當然，如果我們在所有欄位都輸入有效的內容，"
        },
        {
          "id": 150,
          "start": 532.56,
          "end": 535.95,
          "en": "we are able to submit this but of course we get an error",
          "zh": "我們就能送出它，但當然我們會得到一個錯誤，"
        },
        {
          "id": 151,
          "start": 535.95,
          "end": 538.37,
          "en": "because at the moment I'm still not extracting",
          "zh": "因為目前我在 my form data 裡"
        },
        {
          "id": 152,
          "start": 538.37,
          "end": 541.23,
          "en": "the values correctly in my form data,",
          "zh": "還沒有正確地取出這些值，"
        },
        {
          "id": 153,
          "start": 541.23,
          "end": 542.88,
          "en": "that's something we'll fix later.",
          "zh": "那是我們之後會修的東西。"
        },
        {
          "id": 154,
          "start": 543.82,
          "end": 547,
          "en": "Before we fix that, there's one other thing I wanna fix.",
          "zh": "在修那個之前，還有一件我想修的事。"
        },
        {
          "id": 155,
          "start": 547,
          "end": 549.29,
          "en": "If this is invalid, it would maybe be nice,",
          "zh": "如果這個無效，也許會不錯，"
        },
        {
          "id": 156,
          "start": 549.29,
          "end": 553.87,
          "en": "if it wouldn't stay red after we entered a valid value here,",
          "zh": "如果我們在這裡輸入了有效值之後它不會一直保持紅色，"
        },
        {
          "id": 157,
          "start": 553.87,
          "end": 554.95,
          "en": "it's a minor thing,",
          "zh": "這是件小事，"
        },
        {
          "id": 158,
          "start": 554.95,
          "end": 558.41,
          "en": "but I think it's a better user experience if as soon",
          "zh": "但我覺得如果只要這個被修正了，"
        },
        {
          "id": 159,
          "start": 558.41,
          "end": 561.22,
          "en": "as this was fixed, this would go away,",
          "zh": "它就會消失，會是更好的使用者體驗，"
        },
        {
          "id": 160,
          "start": 561.22,
          "end": 563.82,
          "en": "this red color and this error text",
          "zh": "也就是這個紅色和這個錯誤文字，"
        },
        {
          "id": 161,
          "start": 563.82,
          "end": 567.053,
          "en": "and therefore that's a functionality I also wanna add here.",
          "zh": "因此這也是我想在這裡加上的功能。"
        },
        {
          "id": 162,
          "start": 568.05,
          "end": 571.56,
          "en": "For that, we can add a new method, clearValidity",
          "zh": "為此，我們可以加一個新方法 clearValidity，"
        },
        {
          "id": 163,
          "start": 573.72,
          "end": 578.72,
          "en": "or anything like that and expect to get the input name here",
          "zh": "或之類的名稱，並預期在這裡取得 input 名稱"
        },
        {
          "id": 164,
          "start": 578.88,
          "end": 583.443,
          "en": "as a argument and then reach out to this input,",
          "zh": "作為參數，然後存取這個 input，"
        },
        {
          "id": 165,
          "start": 584.77,
          "end": 588.73,
          "en": "so to a data property, first name, last name, description",
          "zh": "也就是某個 data property，first name、last name、description"
        },
        {
          "id": 166,
          "start": 588.73,
          "end": 592.81,
          "en": "and so on, of that inputs some value.",
          "zh": "等等，來取出那個 input 的某個值。"
        },
        {
          "id": 167,
          "start": 592.81,
          "end": 594.38,
          "en": "So if input is first name,",
          "zh": "所以如果 input 是 first name，"
        },
        {
          "id": 168,
          "start": 594.38,
          "end": 596.04,
          "en": "we'll reach out to this first name.",
          "zh": "我們就會存取 this.firstName。"
        },
        {
          "id": 169,
          "start": 596.04,
          "end": 599.07,
          "en": "If this last name we'll reach out to this last name",
          "zh": "如果是 last name，我們就會存取 this.lastName，"
        },
        {
          "id": 170,
          "start": 599.07,
          "end": 601.93,
          "en": "and set isValid of that input to true",
          "zh": "並把那個 input 的 isValid 設為 true，"
        },
        {
          "id": 171,
          "start": 603.75,
          "end": 605.93,
          "en": "and clear validity should be called",
          "zh": "而 clearValidity 應該在"
        },
        {
          "id": 172,
          "start": 605.93,
          "end": 608.71,
          "en": "whenever an input loses focus",
          "zh": "每當某個 input 失去焦點時被呼叫，"
        },
        {
          "id": 173,
          "start": 608.71,
          "end": 611.66,
          "en": "and for that on every input element in HTML,",
          "zh": "為此，在 HTML 裡每個 input 元素上，"
        },
        {
          "id": 174,
          "start": 611.66,
          "end": 615.37,
          "en": "we got the blur event, it's a built in event,",
          "zh": "我們有 blur 事件，它是內建事件，"
        },
        {
          "id": 175,
          "start": 615.37,
          "end": 619.07,
          "en": "which is triggered whenever well, this loses focus.",
          "zh": "每當它失去焦點時就會被觸發。"
        },
        {
          "id": 176,
          "start": 619.07,
          "end": 621.25,
          "en": "That's when I wanna call clear validity",
          "zh": "那就是我想呼叫 clearValidity 的時機，"
        },
        {
          "id": 177,
          "start": 621.25,
          "end": 624.74,
          "en": "and in this case forward first name,",
          "zh": "而在這種情況下傳入 first name，"
        },
        {
          "id": 178,
          "start": 624.74,
          "end": 626.903,
          "en": "because that's for the first name input.",
          "zh": "因為那是針對 firstName 這個 input。"
        },
        {
          "id": 179,
          "start": 628.53,
          "end": 633.53,
          "en": "But now repeat this also on the last name here",
          "zh": "但現在也在這裡的 lastName 上重複這個做法，"
        },
        {
          "id": 180,
          "start": 635.11,
          "end": 638.9,
          "en": "also on the text area,",
          "zh": "也在 textarea 上，"
        },
        {
          "id": 181,
          "start": 638.9,
          "end": 641.453,
          "en": "here it's description,",
          "zh": "這裡是 description，"
        },
        {
          "id": 182,
          "start": 642.43,
          "end": 645.27,
          "en": "and also repeat this on the rate",
          "zh": "也在 rate 上重複，"
        },
        {
          "id": 183,
          "start": 648.96,
          "end": 650.93,
          "en": "and then of course is on the checkboxes,",
          "zh": "然後當然還有 checkboxes，"
        },
        {
          "id": 184,
          "start": 650.93,
          "end": 655.93,
          "en": "so in every checkbox element, I'll clear areas, whoops,",
          "zh": "所以在每個 checkbox 元素上，我會 clear areas，哎呀，"
        },
        {
          "id": 185,
          "start": 658.13,
          "end": 661.87,
          "en": "copy that to all the checkbox inputs.",
          "zh": "把那個複製到所有 checkbox input。"
        },
        {
          "id": 186,
          "start": 661.87,
          "end": 664.92,
          "en": "Reformat this to make it a bit easier to read",
          "zh": "重新格式化一下，讓它更容易閱讀，"
        },
        {
          "id": 187,
          "start": 664.92,
          "end": 667.25,
          "en": "and with this, if we now saved this,",
          "zh": "有了這個，如果我們現在儲存，"
        },
        {
          "id": 188,
          "start": 667.25,
          "end": 670.18,
          "en": "if I submit the invalid form, it's all red",
          "zh": "如果我送出無效的表單，全部都是紅的，"
        },
        {
          "id": 189,
          "start": 670.18,
          "end": 672.683,
          "en": "but if I enter a valid name that becomes black.",
          "zh": "但如果我輸入有效的名稱，它就會變成黑色。"
        },
        {
          "id": 190,
          "start": 675.75,
          "end": 677.69,
          "en": "This is a test.",
          "zh": "這是個測試。"
        },
        {
          "id": 191,
          "start": 677.69,
          "end": 680.18,
          "en": "If I enter something invalid, it also becomes black",
          "zh": "如果我輸入無效的內容，它也會變成黑色，"
        },
        {
          "id": 192,
          "start": 680.18,
          "end": 682.11,
          "en": "because we have to validate again,",
          "zh": "因為我們必須再次驗證，"
        },
        {
          "id": 193,
          "start": 682.11,
          "end": 684.73,
          "en": "but at least it recognizes that we did something",
          "zh": "但至少它會辨識出我們做了些改變，"
        },
        {
          "id": 194,
          "start": 684.73,
          "end": 688.83,
          "en": "and when I, I blurred something here it also becomes black.",
          "zh": "而當我在這裡讓某個欄位失焦時，它也會變成黑色。"
        },
        {
          "id": 195,
          "start": 688.83,
          "end": 691.54,
          "en": "Now of course, if I do have an invalid input here,",
          "zh": "當然，如果我在這裡有無效的 input，"
        },
        {
          "id": 196,
          "start": 691.54,
          "end": 692.91,
          "en": "we still get an error,",
          "zh": "我們仍然會得到錯誤，"
        },
        {
          "id": 197,
          "start": 692.91,
          "end": 696.15,
          "en": "but at least we give the user the feedback that we see",
          "zh": "但至少我們給使用者回饋，讓他們知道我們看到"
        },
        {
          "id": 198,
          "start": 696.15,
          "end": 697.923,
          "en": "that he or she changed something.",
          "zh": "他或她做了改變。"
        },
        {
          "id": 199,
          "start": 699.01,
          "end": 702.01,
          "en": "With that though we got validation in place",
          "zh": "這樣一來，我們就完成了驗證，"
        },
        {
          "id": 200,
          "start": 702.01,
          "end": 703.32,
          "en": "and I'm happy with that.",
          "zh": "而我對此很滿意。"
        },
        {
          "id": 201,
          "start": 703.32,
          "end": 706.4,
          "en": "Now, I just wanna make sure data is submitted correctly",
          "zh": "現在，我只想確保資料能正確被送出，"
        },
        {
          "id": 202,
          "start": 706.4,
          "end": 710.57,
          "en": "and for that here in the submit form method,",
          "zh": "為此，在 submitForm 方法裡，"
        },
        {
          "id": 203,
          "start": 710.57,
          "end": 713.71,
          "en": "we need to drill into the val properties",
          "zh": "我們需要深入取用所有 input 屬性的"
        },
        {
          "id": 204,
          "start": 713.71,
          "end": 715.94,
          "en": "of all our input properties,",
          "zh": "val 屬性，"
        },
        {
          "id": 205,
          "start": 715.94,
          "end": 719.283,
          "en": "because that is where we store the concrete values.",
          "zh": "因為那才是我們儲存實際值的地方。"
        },
        {
          "id": 206,
          "start": 721.44,
          "end": 724.51,
          "en": "WIth that though, if you reload,",
          "zh": "這樣一來，如果你重新載入，"
        },
        {
          "id": 207,
          "start": 724.51,
          "end": 727.46,
          "en": "if I have something invalid, we get an error",
          "zh": "如果我有無效的內容，我們會得到錯誤，"
        },
        {
          "id": 208,
          "start": 727.46,
          "end": 731.463,
          "en": "but if I do enter valid values here,",
          "zh": "但如果我在這裡輸入有效的值，"
        },
        {
          "id": 209,
          "start": 733.27,
          "end": 737.683,
          "en": "like this, this is submittable and we see our coach here.",
          "zh": "像這樣，就可以送出了，而我們在這裡看到我們的教練。"
        },
        {
          "id": 210,
          "start": 738.7,
          "end": 742.24,
          "en": "So that's all working, as a next step we can move on",
          "zh": "所以這一切都能運作，下一步我們可以繼續"
        },
        {
          "id": 211,
          "start": 742.24,
          "end": 744.74,
          "en": "to their requests feature and make sure",
          "zh": "到 requests 功能，並確保"
        },
        {
          "id": 212,
          "start": 744.74,
          "end": 746.42,
          "en": "that we've got a contact form",
          "zh": "我們有一個聯絡表單，"
        },
        {
          "id": 213,
          "start": 746.42,
          "end": 749.12,
          "en": "and that when we do use that contact form,",
          "zh": "而當我們使用那個聯絡表單時，"
        },
        {
          "id": 214,
          "start": 749.12,
          "end": 750.42,
          "en": "we send a request which",
          "zh": "我們送出的請求"
        },
        {
          "id": 215,
          "start": 750.42,
          "end": 753.333,
          "en": "then also shows up here under requests.",
          "zh": "也會顯示在這裡的 requests 底下。"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "21879954",
      "title": "Working on the Contact Form",
      "lectureOrder": 249,
      "videoOrder": 221,
      "sourceHash": "0ab9c71026671a41a6ba1b1c423baa53d6f9fc7aa3a9f7e76c505fd8df54d973",
      "cues": [
        {
          "id": 1,
          "start": 2.07,
          "end": 4.52,
          "en": "So for the moment we got the coach part",
          "zh": "目前我們已經把 coach 這個部分"
        },
        {
          "id": 2,
          "start": 4.52,
          "end": 5.99,
          "en": "implemented pretty well,",
          "zh": "實作得相當不錯了，"
        },
        {
          "id": 3,
          "start": 5.99,
          "end": 8.72,
          "en": "let's now move on to Requests.",
          "zh": "現在讓我們繼續來看看 Requests。"
        },
        {
          "id": 4,
          "start": 8.72,
          "end": 11.32,
          "en": "And with that, I mean that we can, for example,",
          "zh": "我指的是，我們可以例如"
        },
        {
          "id": 5,
          "start": 11.32,
          "end": 15.6,
          "en": "contact a coach and send the request from this page.",
          "zh": "從這個頁面聯絡教練並送出請求。"
        },
        {
          "id": 6,
          "start": 15.6,
          "end": 18.15,
          "en": "Now, at the moment on this page, we always get a warning,",
          "zh": "目前在這個頁面上，我們總是會看到一個警告，"
        },
        {
          "id": 7,
          "start": 18.15,
          "end": 20.67,
          "en": "but that warning will go away soon.",
          "zh": "但那個警告很快就會消失。"
        },
        {
          "id": 8,
          "start": 20.67,
          "end": 22.84,
          "en": "So for the moment we can ignore that",
          "zh": "所以目前我們可以忽略它，"
        },
        {
          "id": 9,
          "start": 22.84,
          "end": 24.89,
          "en": "because that warnings should go away",
          "zh": "因為只要我們把這裡的文字"
        },
        {
          "id": 10,
          "start": 24.89,
          "end": 28.2,
          "en": "as soon as we replaced this text here",
          "zh": "換成實際的 HTML 標記，"
        },
        {
          "id": 11,
          "start": 28.2,
          "end": 33.2,
          "en": "in the Contact coach component with some actual HTML markup.",
          "zh": "也就是 Contact coach 元件裡的這段文字，那個警告應該就會消失。"
        },
        {
          "id": 12,
          "start": 34.92,
          "end": 36.18,
          "en": "So let's do that.",
          "zh": "所以讓我們來做這件事。"
        },
        {
          "id": 13,
          "start": 36.18,
          "end": 38.81,
          "en": "In here, I want to render a contact form.",
          "zh": "在這裡，我想要 render 一個聯絡表單。"
        },
        {
          "id": 14,
          "start": 38.81,
          "end": 39.643,
          "en": "So of course,",
          "zh": "所以當然，"
        },
        {
          "id": 15,
          "start": 39.643,
          "end": 42.77,
          "en": "a form element sounds about right to be rendered here.",
          "zh": "在這裡 render 一個 form 元素聽起來很合理。"
        },
        {
          "id": 16,
          "start": 42.77,
          "end": 46.82,
          "en": "And in that form, I want to provide two inputs,",
          "zh": "而在那個 form 裡，我想要提供兩個 input，"
        },
        {
          "id": 17,
          "start": 46.82,
          "end": 48.97,
          "en": "one for an email address,",
          "zh": "一個用於 email 地址，"
        },
        {
          "id": 18,
          "start": 48.97,
          "end": 51.71,
          "en": "which a user can enter to let the coach",
          "zh": "使用者可以輸入它，讓被聯絡的教練"
        },
        {
          "id": 19,
          "start": 51.71,
          "end": 56.19,
          "en": "who is being contacted to know how to contact the user.",
          "zh": "知道該如何聯絡這位使用者。"
        },
        {
          "id": 20,
          "start": 56.19,
          "end": 58.85,
          "en": "So therefore we want to leave our email address,",
          "zh": "所以我們想要留下 email 地址，"
        },
        {
          "id": 21,
          "start": 58.85,
          "end": 61.3,
          "en": "and we also want to send a message",
          "zh": "而我們也想送出一則訊息，"
        },
        {
          "id": 22,
          "start": 61.3,
          "end": 65.42,
          "en": "along with the email address to coach we're contacting.",
          "zh": "連同 email 地址一起傳給我們正在聯絡的教練。"
        },
        {
          "id": 23,
          "start": 65.42,
          "end": 67.13,
          "en": "So therefore here I'll add a div",
          "zh": "所以在這裡我會加一個 div，"
        },
        {
          "id": 24,
          "start": 67.13,
          "end": 69.653,
          "en": "and in that div add a label,",
          "zh": "並在那個 div 裡加一個 label，"
        },
        {
          "id": 25,
          "start": 70.94,
          "end": 75.94,
          "en": "which says your email and which is for an element",
          "zh": "內容是 your email，並且對應到一個"
        },
        {
          "id": 26,
          "start": 76.58,
          "end": 78.49,
          "en": "with an ID of email.",
          "zh": "ID 為 email 的元素。"
        },
        {
          "id": 27,
          "start": 78.49,
          "end": 80.82,
          "en": "And that's the next element I add there after",
          "zh": "那是我接著加的下一個元素，"
        },
        {
          "id": 28,
          "start": 80.82,
          "end": 84.69,
          "en": "our input field of type email with an ID of email,",
          "zh": "也就是 type 為 email、ID 為 email 的 input 欄位，"
        },
        {
          "id": 29,
          "start": 84.69,
          "end": 87.763,
          "en": "which is added below this label.",
          "zh": "它加在這個 label 下面。"
        },
        {
          "id": 30,
          "start": 89.12,
          "end": 93.66,
          "en": "And then we can have another div here like that.",
          "zh": "然後我們可以在這裡再加另一個像這樣的 div。"
        },
        {
          "id": 31,
          "start": 93.66,
          "end": 98.53999999999999,
          "en": "And in that div I want to have another label for",
          "zh": "在那個 div 裡，我想要再加一個 label，對應到"
        },
        {
          "id": 32,
          "start": 98.53999999999999,
          "end": 100.62,
          "en": "let's say the message.",
          "zh": "比如說 message。"
        },
        {
          "id": 33,
          "start": 100.62,
          "end": 103.95,
          "en": "So for an element with ID message",
          "zh": "也就是對應到 ID 為 message 的元素，"
        },
        {
          "id": 34,
          "start": 103.95,
          "end": 106.85,
          "en": "and I say message in that label,",
          "zh": "我在那個 label 裡寫 message，"
        },
        {
          "id": 35,
          "start": 106.85,
          "end": 109.91,
          "en": "and then we want to render a text area here,",
          "zh": "然後我們想在這裡 render 一個 textarea，"
        },
        {
          "id": 36,
          "start": 109.91,
          "end": 112.92,
          "en": "let's say so that the message is,",
          "zh": "比如說，這樣訊息就能"
        },
        {
          "id": 37,
          "start": 112.92,
          "end": 115.09,
          "en": "can be multi line and it's a bit easier",
          "zh": "是多行的，也比較容易"
        },
        {
          "id": 38,
          "start": 115.09,
          "end": 117.49000000000001,
          "en": "to enter a longer texts.",
          "zh": "輸入較長的文字。"
        },
        {
          "id": 39,
          "start": 117.49000000000001,
          "end": 120.05,
          "en": "So therefore here I'll have five rows,",
          "zh": "所以在這裡我會設定五個 rows，"
        },
        {
          "id": 40,
          "start": 120.05,
          "end": 123.403,
          "en": "let's say, and give this an ideal message.",
          "zh": "比如說，並給它一個 id 為 message。"
        },
        {
          "id": 41,
          "start": 124.5,
          "end": 127.91,
          "en": "And then below that, I'll add another div",
          "zh": "然後在那下面，我會再加一個 div，"
        },
        {
          "id": 42,
          "start": 129.94,
          "end": 132.21,
          "en": "with a class of actions,",
          "zh": "class 為 actions，"
        },
        {
          "id": 43,
          "start": 132.21,
          "end": 135.56,
          "en": "which will be important for styling later.",
          "zh": "這對之後的樣式設定很重要。"
        },
        {
          "id": 44,
          "start": 135.56,
          "end": 137.763,
          "en": "I will provide some styles to you though.",
          "zh": "不過我會提供一些樣式給你們。"
        },
        {
          "id": 45,
          "start": 138.95,
          "end": 141.8,
          "en": "And in there I want to render a button.",
          "zh": "在那裡我想要 render 一個 button。"
        },
        {
          "id": 46,
          "start": 141.8,
          "end": 142.633,
          "en": "And of course,",
          "zh": "而當然，"
        },
        {
          "id": 47,
          "start": 142.633,
          "end": 144.87,
          "en": "here we can use our base button component,",
          "zh": "這裡我們可以使用我們的 BaseButton 元件，"
        },
        {
          "id": 48,
          "start": 144.87,
          "end": 146.98,
          "en": "which we created a while ago,",
          "zh": "那是我們不久前建立的，"
        },
        {
          "id": 49,
          "start": 146.98,
          "end": 150.23,
          "en": "and in there, say, send message.",
          "zh": "並在裡面寫 send message。"
        },
        {
          "id": 50,
          "start": 150.23,
          "end": 152.02,
          "en": "Now to these other divs,",
          "zh": "至於其他那幾個 div，"
        },
        {
          "id": 51,
          "start": 152.02,
          "end": 156.05,
          "en": "I actually want to enter, add a class of form control.",
          "zh": "我其實想要加上 class 為 form-control。"
        },
        {
          "id": 52,
          "start": 156.05,
          "end": 159.82,
          "en": "So add that to the first and the second div",
          "zh": "所以把這個加到第一個和第二個"
        },
        {
          "id": 53,
          "start": 159.82,
          "end": 163.27,
          "en": "that holds an input, and now we can add some styling.",
          "zh": "包含 input 的 div，現在我們可以加一些樣式。"
        },
        {
          "id": 54,
          "start": 163.27,
          "end": 165.85,
          "en": "So for that let's add scoped styling.",
          "zh": "為此，讓我們加上 scoped 樣式。"
        },
        {
          "id": 55,
          "start": 165.85,
          "end": 167.15,
          "en": "And as always,",
          "zh": "一如往常，"
        },
        {
          "id": 56,
          "start": 167.15,
          "end": 170.95,
          "en": "you find styles attached to this lecture here,",
          "zh": "你可以在這堂課的附件裡找到樣式，"
        },
        {
          "id": 57,
          "start": 170.95,
          "end": 174.78,
          "en": "you find the contact coach CSS file,",
          "zh": "你會找到 contact coach 的 CSS 檔，"
        },
        {
          "id": 58,
          "start": 174.78,
          "end": 175.98,
          "en": "which contains the styles",
          "zh": "其中包含你可以複製貼上的樣式，"
        },
        {
          "id": 59,
          "start": 175.98,
          "end": 180.15,
          "en": "you can copy and paste into these scoped style text",
          "zh": "貼到這個 contact coach 元件裡的"
        },
        {
          "id": 60,
          "start": 180.15,
          "end": 182.053,
          "en": "in the contact coach component.",
          "zh": "scoped style 區塊中。"
        },
        {
          "id": 61,
          "start": 184.37,
          "end": 187.363,
          "en": "And that will give this form some general styling.",
          "zh": "這樣就會給這個表單一些基本的樣式。"
        },
        {
          "id": 62,
          "start": 188.82,
          "end": 192.46,
          "en": "Now, of course, this is not just about markup and styling,",
          "zh": "當然，這不只是關於標記和樣式，"
        },
        {
          "id": 63,
          "start": 192.46,
          "end": 194.98,
          "en": "but we also need a script for some logic.",
          "zh": "我們還需要 script 來處理一些邏輯。"
        },
        {
          "id": 64,
          "start": 194.98,
          "end": 199.51,
          "en": "We want to fetch the inputs for email and message.",
          "zh": "我們想要取得 email 和 message 的輸入。"
        },
        {
          "id": 65,
          "start": 199.51,
          "end": 203.45,
          "en": "We probably want to do some kind of validation.",
          "zh": "我們大概會想做某種驗證。"
        },
        {
          "id": 66,
          "start": 203.45,
          "end": 206.4,
          "en": "It's up to you if it should be as detailed",
          "zh": "要不要像教練註冊頁面那樣詳細，"
        },
        {
          "id": 67,
          "start": 206.4,
          "end": 209.18,
          "en": "as on the coach registration page or not,",
          "zh": "完全由你決定，"
        },
        {
          "id": 68,
          "start": 209.18,
          "end": 211.04,
          "en": "but some validation won't hurt.",
          "zh": "但做一些驗證不會有壞處。"
        },
        {
          "id": 69,
          "start": 211.04,
          "end": 214.07999999999998,
          "en": "And ultimately once we got a valid input,",
          "zh": "而最終當我們取得有效的輸入後，"
        },
        {
          "id": 70,
          "start": 214.07999999999998,
          "end": 216.66,
          "en": "we want to do something with that input,",
          "zh": "我們想對那個輸入做一些處理，"
        },
        {
          "id": 71,
          "start": 216.66,
          "end": 219.06,
          "en": "and we want to, in the end, create a new message,",
          "zh": "而我們最終想要建立一則新訊息，"
        },
        {
          "id": 72,
          "start": 219.06,
          "end": 223.04,
          "en": "which is attached to the coach to whom the message is sent.",
          "zh": "並把它附加到訊息要送給的那位教練上。"
        },
        {
          "id": 73,
          "start": 223.04,
          "end": 224.97,
          "en": "That's the idea here.",
          "zh": "這就是這裡的想法。"
        },
        {
          "id": 74,
          "start": 224.97,
          "end": 226.37,
          "en": "So therefore in this script,",
          "zh": "所以在這個 script 裡，"
        },
        {
          "id": 75,
          "start": 226.37,
          "end": 228.62,
          "en": "I'll start by adding some data",
          "zh": "我會先加一些 data，"
        },
        {
          "id": 76,
          "start": 228.62,
          "end": 231.96,
          "en": "because we definitely want to manage some data here.",
          "zh": "因為我們在這裡一定要管理一些資料。"
        },
        {
          "id": 77,
          "start": 231.96,
          "end": 234.18,
          "en": "And the data we definitely want to manage",
          "zh": "而我們一定要管理的資料"
        },
        {
          "id": 78,
          "start": 234.18,
          "end": 237.55,
          "en": "is the email address and the message.",
          "zh": "就是 email 地址和訊息。"
        },
        {
          "id": 79,
          "start": 237.55,
          "end": 238.82999999999998,
          "en": "I guess that makes sense",
          "zh": "我想這很合理，"
        },
        {
          "id": 80,
          "start": 238.82999999999998,
          "end": 241.403,
          "en": "because these are the two inputs we got here.",
          "zh": "因為這就是我們這裡的兩個輸入。"
        },
        {
          "id": 81,
          "start": 242.44,
          "end": 243.91,
          "en": "But in addition to that,",
          "zh": "但除此之外，"
        },
        {
          "id": 82,
          "start": 243.91,
          "end": 248.91,
          "en": "here I will also add a form is valid, data property,",
          "zh": "我在這裡也會加一個 formIsValid 的 data property，"
        },
        {
          "id": 83,
          "start": 250.46,
          "end": 252.43,
          "en": "and set it to true initially.",
          "zh": "並把它初始設為 true。"
        },
        {
          "id": 84,
          "start": 252.43,
          "end": 254.62,
          "en": "And this should be set to false",
          "zh": "而它應該被設為 false，"
        },
        {
          "id": 85,
          "start": 254.62,
          "end": 259.013,
          "en": "if either the email address or text area is invalid.",
          "zh": "只要 email 地址或 textarea 其中之一無效。"
        },
        {
          "id": 86,
          "start": 260.49,
          "end": 262.42,
          "en": "So as a next step,",
          "zh": "所以下一步，"
        },
        {
          "id": 87,
          "start": 262.42,
          "end": 266.84,
          "en": "we can add methods here to this object here,",
          "zh": "我們可以在這裡的這個 object 加上 methods，"
        },
        {
          "id": 88,
          "start": 266.84,
          "end": 269.14,
          "en": "to this component, conflict object,",
          "zh": "也就是這個元件的 config object，"
        },
        {
          "id": 89,
          "start": 269.14,
          "end": 273.13,
          "en": "and a submit form method sounds about right,",
          "zh": "而一個 submitForm 方法聽起來很合適，"
        },
        {
          "id": 90,
          "start": 273.13,
          "end": 275.56,
          "en": "because that's the method that should be triggered",
          "zh": "因為那正是表單送出時"
        },
        {
          "id": 91,
          "start": 275.56,
          "end": 277.38,
          "en": "when the form is submitted.",
          "zh": "應該被觸發的方法。"
        },
        {
          "id": 92,
          "start": 277.38,
          "end": 281.26,
          "en": "And of course we can therefore add a submit event handler",
          "zh": "所以我們當然可以為這個 form 加上 submit 事件處理器，"
        },
        {
          "id": 93,
          "start": 281.26,
          "end": 285.12,
          "en": "to this form and prevent the browser default",
          "zh": "並阻止瀏覽器的預設行為，"
        },
        {
          "id": 94,
          "start": 285.12,
          "end": 287.42,
          "en": "as we did as many times before in the course,",
          "zh": "就像我們在課程中做過很多次那樣，"
        },
        {
          "id": 95,
          "start": 287.42,
          "end": 292.313,
          "en": "and then point at submit form when this form is submitted.",
          "zh": "然後在表單送出時指向 submitForm。"
        },
        {
          "id": 96,
          "start": 294.34000000000003,
          "end": 297.8,
          "en": "So inside of submit form, I now want to validate,",
          "zh": "所以在 submitForm 裡面，我現在想要進行驗證，"
        },
        {
          "id": 97,
          "start": 297.8,
          "end": 300.07,
          "en": "and if the data is valid,",
          "zh": "而如果資料有效，"
        },
        {
          "id": 98,
          "start": 300.07,
          "end": 302.89,
          "en": "create a new message or ensured",
          "zh": "就建立一則新訊息，或確保"
        },
        {
          "id": 99,
          "start": 302.89,
          "end": 305.73,
          "en": "that a new message is created somehow.",
          "zh": "新訊息以某種方式被建立。"
        },
        {
          "id": 100,
          "start": 305.73,
          "end": 308.01,
          "en": "So let's start with validation.",
          "zh": "所以讓我們從驗證開始。"
        },
        {
          "id": 101,
          "start": 308.01,
          "end": 310.85,
          "en": "First of all, I'll set form is valid to true",
          "zh": "首先，我會把 formIsValid 設為 true，"
        },
        {
          "id": 102,
          "start": 310.85,
          "end": 313.6,
          "en": "so that if it was false in between,",
          "zh": "這樣如果它中間曾經是 false，"
        },
        {
          "id": 103,
          "start": 313.6,
          "end": 316.6,
          "en": "we now clear any error message we might be showing.",
          "zh": "我們現在就清掉可能正在顯示的錯誤訊息。"
        },
        {
          "id": 104,
          "start": 316.6,
          "end": 319.423,
          "en": "We're not showing one yet, but we will soon do that.",
          "zh": "我們還沒顯示任何錯誤，但我們很快就會這麼做。"
        },
        {
          "id": 105,
          "start": 320.69,
          "end": 324.4,
          "en": "So as a next step, we can then check if this email",
          "zh": "所以下一步，我們可以檢查這個 email"
        },
        {
          "id": 106,
          "start": 324.4,
          "end": 325.993,
          "en": "is empty, let's say,",
          "zh": "是否為空，比如說，"
        },
        {
          "id": 107,
          "start": 327.06,
          "end": 329.12,
          "en": "or if this email",
          "zh": "或者這個 email"
        },
        {
          "id": 108,
          "start": 330.26,
          "end": 333.9,
          "en": "includes no at symbol.",
          "zh": "是否不包含 @ 符號。"
        },
        {
          "id": 109,
          "start": 333.9,
          "end": 335.93,
          "en": "So here I checked for the opposite.",
          "zh": "所以在這裡我檢查的是相反的情況。"
        },
        {
          "id": 110,
          "start": 335.93,
          "end": 339.26,
          "en": "If it does not include an at symbol,",
          "zh": "如果它不包含 @ 符號，"
        },
        {
          "id": 111,
          "start": 339.26,
          "end": 343.15,
          "en": "or if this message is empty.",
          "zh": "或者這個 message 是空的。"
        },
        {
          "id": 112,
          "start": 343.15,
          "end": 344.94,
          "en": "If either of that's the case,",
          "zh": "如果其中任何一種情況成立，"
        },
        {
          "id": 113,
          "start": 344.94,
          "end": 349.09000000000003,
          "en": "then I want to set this form is valid to false",
          "zh": "那我就要把 formIsValid 設為 false，"
        },
        {
          "id": 114,
          "start": 349.09000000000003,
          "end": 353.193,
          "en": "and return so that the rest of this method doesn't execute.",
          "zh": "並 return，讓這個方法剩下的部分不要執行。"
        },
        {
          "id": 115,
          "start": 355.24,
          "end": 357.94,
          "en": "So now that we manage this validity,",
          "zh": "現在我們管理了這個有效性，"
        },
        {
          "id": 116,
          "start": 357.94,
          "end": 360.33,
          "en": "I want to do two things in the markup,",
          "zh": "我想在標記裡做兩件事。"
        },
        {
          "id": 117,
          "start": 360.33,
          "end": 364.1,
          "en": "For one, I want to bind my input and my text area",
          "zh": "第一，我想要把 input 和 textarea"
        },
        {
          "id": 118,
          "start": 364.1,
          "end": 367.08,
          "en": "to email and message with two way binding",
          "zh": "用雙向綁定綁到 email 和 message，"
        },
        {
          "id": 119,
          "start": 367.08,
          "end": 370.43,
          "en": "so that this is updated with every keystroke,",
          "zh": "這樣每次按鍵都會更新，"
        },
        {
          "id": 120,
          "start": 370.43,
          "end": 374.49,
          "en": "and I want to show an error message if the form is invalid.",
          "zh": "而如果表單無效，我想顯示一則錯誤訊息。"
        },
        {
          "id": 121,
          "start": 374.49,
          "end": 377.59,
          "en": "Now we'll start with the two way binding with V model.",
          "zh": "現在我們從使用 v-model 的雙向綁定開始。"
        },
        {
          "id": 122,
          "start": 377.59,
          "end": 379.97,
          "en": "I'll automatically trim the input",
          "zh": "我會自動 trim 輸入，"
        },
        {
          "id": 123,
          "start": 379.97,
          "end": 382.55,
          "en": "and then point at email here",
          "zh": "然後在這裡指向 email，"
        },
        {
          "id": 124,
          "start": 382.55,
          "end": 385.91,
          "en": "and on the text area, all to trimming it,",
          "zh": "而在 textarea 上也自動 trim，"
        },
        {
          "id": 125,
          "start": 385.91,
          "end": 387.14300000000003,
          "en": "point at message.",
          "zh": "指向 message。"
        },
        {
          "id": 126,
          "start": 389.18,
          "end": 392.13,
          "en": "And then we can show an error as well",
          "zh": "然後我們也可以顯示錯誤，"
        },
        {
          "id": 127,
          "start": 392.13,
          "end": 395.86,
          "en": "by adding a paragraph here, for example, above the button,",
          "zh": "例如在這裡、button 上方加一個段落，"
        },
        {
          "id": 128,
          "start": 395.86,
          "end": 398.75,
          "en": "which has a class of errors,",
          "zh": "它的 class 為 errors，"
        },
        {
          "id": 129,
          "start": 398.75,
          "end": 401.64,
          "en": "which should be shown with V-if",
          "zh": "它應該用 v-if 來顯示，"
        },
        {
          "id": 130,
          "start": 401.64,
          "end": 405.6,
          "en": "if forum is valid is false,",
          "zh": "如果 formIsValid 是 false，"
        },
        {
          "id": 131,
          "start": 405.6,
          "end": 407.263,
          "en": "so if it's not true,",
          "zh": "也就是如果它不是 true，"
        },
        {
          "id": 132,
          "start": 408.34000000000003,
          "end": 410.88,
          "en": "and then here you can output any message you want.",
          "zh": "然後在這裡你可以輸出任何你想要的訊息。"
        },
        {
          "id": 133,
          "start": 410.88,
          "end": 415.88,
          "en": "I'll say, please enter a valid email and non empty message.",
          "zh": "我會寫 please enter a valid email and non empty message。"
        },
        {
          "id": 134,
          "start": 418.72,
          "end": 422.43,
          "en": "So this is a less complex validation approach",
          "zh": "所以這是一個比教練註冊時"
        },
        {
          "id": 135,
          "start": 422.43,
          "end": 425,
          "en": "than we took it in coach registration,",
          "zh": "更簡單的驗證做法，"
        },
        {
          "id": 136,
          "start": 425,
          "end": 427.3,
          "en": "but that of course is always a perfectly fine way",
          "zh": "但這當然一直是可以接受的"
        },
        {
          "id": 137,
          "start": 427.3,
          "end": 428.133,
          "en": "of doing it.",
          "zh": "做法。"
        },
        {
          "id": 138,
          "start": 428.133,
          "end": 430.98,
          "en": "And ultimately it comes down to your requirements",
          "zh": "而最終這取決於你的需求"
        },
        {
          "id": 139,
          "start": 430.98,
          "end": 435.003,
          "en": "and your preferences, how you want to validate a form.",
          "zh": "和偏好，也就是你想怎麼驗證表單。"
        },
        {
          "id": 140,
          "start": 435.96,
          "end": 437.76,
          "en": "With that, however, we are validating,",
          "zh": "這樣一來，我們就完成了驗證、"
        },
        {
          "id": 141,
          "start": 437.76,
          "end": 440.27,
          "en": "we are fetching the input values,",
          "zh": "我們取得了輸入值，"
        },
        {
          "id": 142,
          "start": 440.27,
          "end": 443.46,
          "en": "and if we make it past this validation here,",
          "zh": "而如果我們通過了這裡的驗證，"
        },
        {
          "id": 143,
          "start": 443.46,
          "end": 446.49,
          "en": "then we want to create this message.",
          "zh": "那我們就想建立這則訊息。"
        },
        {
          "id": 144,
          "start": 446.49,
          "end": 448.4,
          "en": "And now of course the question is,",
          "zh": "而現在問題當然是，"
        },
        {
          "id": 145,
          "start": 448.4,
          "end": 452.473,
          "en": "what exactly does create a message mean in this app?",
          "zh": "在這個 app 裡，「建立一則訊息」到底是什麼意思？"
        },
        {
          "id": 146,
          "start": 453.36,
          "end": 456.62,
          "en": "Well, keep in mind that we have this Requests page",
          "zh": "嗯，請記得我們有這個 Requests 頁面，"
        },
        {
          "id": 147,
          "start": 456.62,
          "end": 459.18,
          "en": "where we want to show all the requests",
          "zh": "我們想在那裡顯示所有我們"
        },
        {
          "id": 148,
          "start": 459.18,
          "end": 461.513,
          "en": "we as a coach received.",
          "zh": "身為教練所收到的請求。"
        },
        {
          "id": 149,
          "start": 462.53,
          "end": 465.64,
          "en": "So that of course requires us to be registered as a coach.",
          "zh": "所以那當然需要我們註冊為教練。"
        },
        {
          "id": 150,
          "start": 465.64,
          "end": 469.96,
          "en": "But once we are, if we as a coach receive a message,",
          "zh": "但一旦我們是了，如果我們身為教練收到訊息，"
        },
        {
          "id": 151,
          "start": 469.96,
          "end": 471.71,
          "en": "it should show up here.",
          "zh": "它應該會顯示在這裡。"
        },
        {
          "id": 152,
          "start": 471.71,
          "end": 474.443,
          "en": "And that of course means that in the end a message,",
          "zh": "而那當然意味著，最終一則訊息、"
        },
        {
          "id": 153,
          "start": 474.443,
          "end": 478.29,
          "en": "a request is just another piece of data",
          "zh": "一個請求就只是另一筆資料，"
        },
        {
          "id": 154,
          "start": 478.29,
          "end": 480.8,
          "en": "we want to manage in this Vue application",
          "zh": "我們想在這個 Vue 應用程式中管理，"
        },
        {
          "id": 155,
          "start": 480.8,
          "end": 484.01,
          "en": "and therefore probably with VueX.",
          "zh": "因此大概會用 Vuex 來管理。"
        },
        {
          "id": 156,
          "start": 484.01,
          "end": 486.893,
          "en": "So let's do this in the next lecture.",
          "zh": "所以讓我們在下一堂課來做這件事。"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "21879956",
      "title": "Storing Requests (Messages) With Vuex",
      "lectureOrder": 250,
      "videoOrder": 222,
      "sourceHash": "884b8669ba744084347cf9895d384bf8295f850ff871d37a37bfa9df9a2b4a81",
      "cues": [
        {
          "id": 1,
          "start": 2.15,
          "end": 5.07,
          "en": "So creating messages means storing data",
          "zh": "所以建立訊息意味著把資料儲存"
        },
        {
          "id": 2,
          "start": 5.07,
          "end": 6.99,
          "en": "in our Vuex store.",
          "zh": "在我們的 Vuex store 裡。"
        },
        {
          "id": 3,
          "start": 6.99,
          "end": 10.09,
          "en": "Thus far, we only got our coaches module.",
          "zh": "到目前為止，我們只有我們的 coaches module。"
        },
        {
          "id": 4,
          "start": 10.09,
          "end": 13.43,
          "en": "Now, of course, we also need a module for requests",
          "zh": "現在，我們當然也需要一個給 requests 的 module，"
        },
        {
          "id": 5,
          "start": 13.43,
          "end": 16.6,
          "en": "because we also wanna manage requests.",
          "zh": "因為我們也想要管理 requests。"
        },
        {
          "id": 6,
          "start": 16.6,
          "end": 20.11,
          "en": "So in the store, modules folder, under requests,",
          "zh": "所以在 store 的 modules 資料夾裡、requests 底下，"
        },
        {
          "id": 7,
          "start": 20.11,
          "end": 24.28,
          "en": "I'll create an index.JS fault just as I did it in coaches.",
          "zh": "我會建立一個 index.js 檔，就像我在 coaches 裡做的一樣。"
        },
        {
          "id": 8,
          "start": 24.28,
          "end": 26.52,
          "en": "And I'll also create all the other files,",
          "zh": "而我還會建立所有其他檔案，"
        },
        {
          "id": 9,
          "start": 26.52,
          "end": 31.52,
          "en": "mutations.JS, getters.JS, and actions.JS.",
          "zh": "mutations.js、getters.js 和 actions.js。"
        },
        {
          "id": 10,
          "start": 33,
          "end": 36.5,
          "en": "Again, it's up to you whether you want this layout or not,",
          "zh": "再次，這取決於你要不要這樣的配置，"
        },
        {
          "id": 11,
          "start": 36.5,
          "end": 37.92,
          "en": "but I'll go for that,",
          "zh": "但我會採用它，"
        },
        {
          "id": 12,
          "start": 37.92,
          "end": 40.753,
          "en": "also to be in line with my coaches setup.",
          "zh": "也是為了和我的 coaches 設定保持一致。"
        },
        {
          "id": 13,
          "start": 41.86,
          "end": 45.35,
          "en": "Now in index.JS here in the requests folder,",
          "zh": "現在在 requests 資料夾這裡的 index.js 中，"
        },
        {
          "id": 14,
          "start": 45.35,
          "end": 50.32,
          "en": "we then export an object and we import that object",
          "zh": "我們會匯出一個物件，然後把那個物件"
        },
        {
          "id": 15,
          "start": 50.32,
          "end": 53.93,
          "en": "from index.JS in requests into our main store",
          "zh": "從 requests 的 index.js 匯入我們主要的 store，"
        },
        {
          "id": 16,
          "start": 53.93,
          "end": 57.34,
          "en": "in this index.JS file in the store folder.",
          "zh": "也就是 store 資料夾裡的這個 index.js 檔。"
        },
        {
          "id": 17,
          "start": 57.34,
          "end": 60.49,
          "en": "So here just as we imported the coaches module,",
          "zh": "所以在這裡，就像我們匯入 coaches module 一樣，"
        },
        {
          "id": 18,
          "start": 60.49,
          "end": 62.59,
          "en": "we can import the requests module",
          "zh": "我們可以匯入 requests module，"
        },
        {
          "id": 19,
          "start": 62.59,
          "end": 66.853,
          "en": "from modules, requests, index.JS,",
          "zh": "從 modules/requests/index.js，"
        },
        {
          "id": 20,
          "start": 68.65,
          "end": 72.96000000000001,
          "en": "and then simply add the requests key here",
          "zh": "然後在這裡單純加上 requests 這個鍵，"
        },
        {
          "id": 21,
          "start": 72.96000000000001,
          "end": 75.45,
          "en": "in the modules object in our store",
          "zh": "在我們 store 裡的 modules 物件中，"
        },
        {
          "id": 22,
          "start": 75.45,
          "end": 77.663,
          "en": "and point at requests module.",
          "zh": "並指向 requests module。"
        },
        {
          "id": 23,
          "start": 79.17,
          "end": 82.21000000000001,
          "en": "Now, instead of this exported object,",
          "zh": "現在，除了這個匯出的物件之外，"
        },
        {
          "id": 24,
          "start": 82.21000000000001,
          "end": 84.64,
          "en": "I will now also set namespace to true,",
          "zh": "我現在也會把 namespaced 設為 true，"
        },
        {
          "id": 25,
          "start": 84.64,
          "end": 87.83,
          "en": "so that we use namespacing for this module as well",
          "zh": "這樣我們也會為這個 module 使用 namespacing，"
        },
        {
          "id": 26,
          "start": 87.83,
          "end": 91.22,
          "en": "and we don't just merge it into the global state,",
          "zh": "而不是只是把它合併進 global state，"
        },
        {
          "id": 27,
          "start": 91.22,
          "end": 93.22999999999999,
          "en": "into the global store, which we could do,",
          "zh": "合併進 global store，我們是可以這麼做，"
        },
        {
          "id": 28,
          "start": 93.22999999999999,
          "end": 94.94,
          "en": "but which I don't wanna do here.",
          "zh": "但我在這裡不想這麼做。"
        },
        {
          "id": 29,
          "start": 94.94,
          "end": 99.03,
          "en": "And then we need to bring in our mutations hands on.",
          "zh": "然後我們需要把我們的 mutations 加進來。"
        },
        {
          "id": 30,
          "start": 99.03,
          "end": 101.50999999999999,
          "en": "But first of all, we need a state.",
          "zh": "但首先，我們需要一個 state。"
        },
        {
          "id": 31,
          "start": 101.50999999999999,
          "end": 104.91,
          "en": "We need a state in this module, and that state should manage",
          "zh": "我們需要在這個 module 裡有一個 state，而那個 state 應該管理"
        },
        {
          "id": 32,
          "start": 104.91,
          "end": 109.28999999999999,
          "en": "one simple thing, our requests.",
          "zh": "一件簡單的事，我們的 requests。"
        },
        {
          "id": 33,
          "start": 109.28999999999999,
          "end": 113.57,
          "en": "So all the requests we know, and then every request",
          "zh": "也就是我們知道的所有 requests，然後每一個 request"
        },
        {
          "id": 34,
          "start": 113.57,
          "end": 117.47999999999999,
          "en": "will have a certain coach ID attached to it,",
          "zh": "都會附上某個 coach ID，"
        },
        {
          "id": 35,
          "start": 117.47999999999999,
          "end": 121.63,
          "en": "and then later, if that coach ID matches our ID,",
          "zh": "之後如果那個 coach ID 和我們的 ID 相符，"
        },
        {
          "id": 36,
          "start": 121.63,
          "end": 123.6,
          "en": "that's a request we'll see,",
          "zh": "那就是我們會看到的 request，"
        },
        {
          "id": 37,
          "start": 123.6,
          "end": 126.363,
          "en": "all the other requests will be invisible to us.",
          "zh": "所有其他的 requests 對我們來說都會是隱形的。"
        },
        {
          "id": 38,
          "start": 128.31,
          "end": 132.18,
          "en": "So now that's our state and array of requests.",
          "zh": "所以現在那是我們的 state，一個 requests 陣列。"
        },
        {
          "id": 39,
          "start": 132.18,
          "end": 135.38,
          "en": "Now, of course, since we already are fetching data",
          "zh": "現在，當然，因為我們已經在"
        },
        {
          "id": 40,
          "start": 135.38,
          "end": 138.4,
          "en": "for our request in the contactCoach component,",
          "zh": "contactCoach 元件裡為我們的 request fetch 資料，"
        },
        {
          "id": 41,
          "start": 138.4,
          "end": 141.34,
          "en": "we now need a mutation and an action",
          "zh": "我們現在需要一個 mutation 和一個 action"
        },
        {
          "id": 42,
          "start": 141.34,
          "end": 143.45,
          "en": "for creating a new request.",
          "zh": "來建立新的 request。"
        },
        {
          "id": 43,
          "start": 143.45,
          "end": 146.56,
          "en": "So let's start with the mutation here.",
          "zh": "所以讓我們從這裡的 mutation 開始。"
        },
        {
          "id": 44,
          "start": 146.56,
          "end": 150.32,
          "en": "Here in mutations.JS, we also export an object.",
          "zh": "在這裡的 mutations.js 中，我們也匯出一個物件。"
        },
        {
          "id": 45,
          "start": 150.32,
          "end": 154.01,
          "en": "And in here we can add addRequest mutation,",
          "zh": "而在這裡我們可以加上 addRequest mutation，"
        },
        {
          "id": 46,
          "start": 154.01,
          "end": 155.71,
          "en": "sounds like a fitting name,",
          "zh": "聽起來是個合適的名稱，"
        },
        {
          "id": 47,
          "start": 155.71,
          "end": 159.59300000000002,
          "en": "where we get our state, like in all mutations and a payload,",
          "zh": "我們會取得 state，就像所有 mutations 一樣，還有一個 payload，"
        },
        {
          "id": 48,
          "start": 160.44,
          "end": 163.28,
          "en": "which in the end will hold the request data.",
          "zh": "它最終會裝著 request 的資料。"
        },
        {
          "id": 49,
          "start": 163.28,
          "end": 166.46,
          "en": "And then we can simply reach out to state.requests",
          "zh": "然後我們就可以單純存取 state.requests，"
        },
        {
          "id": 50,
          "start": 166.46,
          "end": 169.87,
          "en": "and push the payload onto this array",
          "zh": "並把 payload push 到這個陣列上，"
        },
        {
          "id": 51,
          "start": 169.87,
          "end": 173.34,
          "en": "assuming that the payload already is the finished request",
          "zh": "假設 payload 已經是要加入的、"
        },
        {
          "id": 52,
          "start": 173.34,
          "end": 174.543,
          "en": "as we wanna add it.",
          "zh": "完成好的 request。"
        },
        {
          "id": 53,
          "start": 175.92000000000002,
          "end": 178.94,
          "en": "And that's done already here for the mutation.",
          "zh": "這樣這個 mutation 就完成了。"
        },
        {
          "id": 54,
          "start": 178.94,
          "end": 180.77,
          "en": "Now, let's add an action.",
          "zh": "現在，讓我們加上一個 action。"
        },
        {
          "id": 55,
          "start": 180.77,
          "end": 185.77,
          "en": "So here we export an object as well in the actions file,",
          "zh": "所以在這裡，我們在 actions 檔中也匯出一個物件，"
        },
        {
          "id": 56,
          "start": 185.87,
          "end": 188.65,
          "en": "and we could name this action, contactCoach.",
          "zh": "我們可以把這個 action 命名為 contactCoach。"
        },
        {
          "id": 57,
          "start": 189.9,
          "end": 194.42,
          "en": "Now we will get our context here and also probably a payload",
          "zh": "現在我們會在這裡取得 context，可能也會有 payload，"
        },
        {
          "id": 58,
          "start": 194.42,
          "end": 197.9,
          "en": "because we need that data that was fetched from the form",
          "zh": "因為我們需要從表單取得的那份資料，"
        },
        {
          "id": 59,
          "start": 197.9,
          "end": 199.743,
          "en": "in the contactCoach component.",
          "zh": "在 contactCoach 元件裡。"
        },
        {
          "id": 60,
          "start": 200.96,
          "end": 205.96,
          "en": "Then we can create a new request here,",
          "zh": "接著我們可以在這裡建立一個新的 request，"
        },
        {
          "id": 61,
          "start": 206.44,
          "end": 211.44,
          "en": "which can be an object where we can add a user email field",
          "zh": "它可以是一個物件，我們可以在裡面加一個 userEmail 欄位，"
        },
        {
          "id": 62,
          "start": 211.66,
          "end": 214.61,
          "en": "where we point at payload email, for example,",
          "zh": "例如指向 payload.email，"
        },
        {
          "id": 63,
          "start": 214.61,
          "end": 217.32999999999998,
          "en": "assuming that the payload we get is an object",
          "zh": "假設我們取得的 payload 是一個物件，"
        },
        {
          "id": 64,
          "start": 217.32999999999998,
          "end": 220.81,
          "en": "with an email field and add a message",
          "zh": "裡面有 email 欄位，然後加一個 message，"
        },
        {
          "id": 65,
          "start": 220.81,
          "end": 223.233,
          "en": "where we point at payload.message.",
          "zh": "指向 payload.message。"
        },
        {
          "id": 66,
          "start": 224.23,
          "end": 226.79,
          "en": "But there's one more thing we need to add here.",
          "zh": "但我們還需要在這裡再加一件事。"
        },
        {
          "id": 67,
          "start": 226.79,
          "end": 230.09,
          "en": "And that's the coach ID because every request",
          "zh": "那就是 coach ID，因為每一個 request"
        },
        {
          "id": 68,
          "start": 230.09,
          "end": 233.47,
          "en": "needs to be attached to a coach ID.",
          "zh": "都需要附上一個 coach ID。"
        },
        {
          "id": 69,
          "start": 233.47,
          "end": 235.63,
          "en": "So for that, I wanna get to the idea of the coach,",
          "zh": "所以為此，我想要取得那位教練的 ID，"
        },
        {
          "id": 70,
          "start": 235.63,
          "end": 238.21,
          "en": "to whom this request was sent.",
          "zh": "也就是這個 request 被送往的那位教練。"
        },
        {
          "id": 71,
          "start": 238.21,
          "end": 241.43,
          "en": "And therefore here, I assume that this is all the part",
          "zh": "因此在這裡，我假設這全都是"
        },
        {
          "id": 72,
          "start": 241.43,
          "end": 245.16,
          "en": "of the incoming payload, the coach ID.",
          "zh": "傳入 payload 的一部分，也就是 coach ID。"
        },
        {
          "id": 73,
          "start": 245.16,
          "end": 248.13,
          "en": "And then we just wanna add an ID to the request itself",
          "zh": "然後我們就想要為 request 本身加上一個 ID，"
        },
        {
          "id": 74,
          "start": 248.13,
          "end": 251.3,
          "en": "so that every request object has a new ID.",
          "zh": "這樣每個 request 物件都會有一個新的 ID。"
        },
        {
          "id": 75,
          "start": 251.3,
          "end": 254.2,
          "en": "And we can simply create a dummy ID for the moment",
          "zh": "而目前我們可以單純建立一個 dummy ID，"
        },
        {
          "id": 76,
          "start": 254.2,
          "end": 258.08,
          "en": "by taking the current date and getting a string snapshot",
          "zh": "就是取目前日期並取得它的字串快照，"
        },
        {
          "id": 77,
          "start": 258.08,
          "end": 259.183,
          "en": "of it, so to say.",
          "zh": "可以這麼說。"
        },
        {
          "id": 78,
          "start": 260.71,
          "end": 263.01,
          "en": "And with that, we already got all we need.",
          "zh": "這樣我們就已經有了所有需要的東西。"
        },
        {
          "id": 79,
          "start": 263.01,
          "end": 268.01,
          "en": "Now we can call it context.commit, commit the add, whoops,",
          "zh": "現在我們可以呼叫 context.commit，commit 那個 add，哎呀，"
        },
        {
          "id": 80,
          "start": 268.07,
          "end": 271.22,
          "en": "the addRequest mutation.",
          "zh": "the addRequest mutation。"
        },
        {
          "id": 81,
          "start": 271.22,
          "end": 275.09000000000003,
          "en": "That's the name I chose here in the mutations.JS file.",
          "zh": "那就是我在這裡的 mutations.js 檔中選擇的名稱。"
        },
        {
          "id": 82,
          "start": 275.09000000000003,
          "end": 277.8,
          "en": "And then also pass on our payload,",
          "zh": "然後也把我們的 payload 傳下去，"
        },
        {
          "id": 83,
          "start": 277.8,
          "end": 280.86,
          "en": "which for me here will just be this new request",
          "zh": "對我來說，這裡就只是這個新的 request，"
        },
        {
          "id": 84,
          "start": 280.86,
          "end": 281.963,
          "en": "we're building here.",
          "zh": "我們在這裡建立的。"
        },
        {
          "id": 85,
          "start": 283.81,
          "end": 288.81,
          "en": "And that should now add a new request to our requests state",
          "zh": "這樣應該就會把一個新的 request 加到我們的 requests state，"
        },
        {
          "id": 86,
          "start": 289.5,
          "end": 293.513,
          "en": "if this action is dispatched with the appropriate payload.",
          "zh": "如果這個 action 是用適當的 payload dispatch 的話。"
        },
        {
          "id": 87,
          "start": 294.90999999999997,
          "end": 297.61,
          "en": "So now it's up to us to dispatch this.",
          "zh": "所以現在輪到我們來 dispatch 這個。"
        },
        {
          "id": 88,
          "start": 297.61,
          "end": 302.61,
          "en": "So back in the contactCoach component here in submit form,",
          "zh": "所以回到 contactCoach 元件這裡的 submit form，"
        },
        {
          "id": 89,
          "start": 303.44,
          "end": 308.44,
          "en": "we now wanna reach out to this store and call dispatch.",
          "zh": "我們現在想要存取這個 store 並呼叫 dispatch。"
        },
        {
          "id": 90,
          "start": 310.59,
          "end": 313.673,
          "en": "And then since our module is namedspaced,",
          "zh": "然後因為我們的 module 是 namespaced 的，"
        },
        {
          "id": 91,
          "start": 314.58,
          "end": 318.39,
          "en": "it's the requests namespace we have to access,",
          "zh": "我們必須存取的是 requests namespace，"
        },
        {
          "id": 92,
          "start": 318.39,
          "end": 321.6,
          "en": "and therefore it's the requests/contactCoach here.",
          "zh": "所以這裡就是 requests/contactCoach。"
        },
        {
          "id": 93,
          "start": 322.903,
          "end": 324.83,
          "en": "ContactCoach is our actual name,",
          "zh": "contactCoach 是我們實際的名稱，"
        },
        {
          "id": 94,
          "start": 324.83,
          "end": 326.89300000000003,
          "en": "requests is our namespace name.",
          "zh": "requests 是我們的 namespace 名稱。"
        },
        {
          "id": 95,
          "start": 328.69,
          "end": 330.73,
          "en": "Now, of course, we need to add some data here",
          "zh": "現在，我們當然需要在這裡加上一些資料，"
        },
        {
          "id": 96,
          "start": 330.73,
          "end": 333.2,
          "en": "and that data should be this object,",
          "zh": "而那些資料應該是這個物件，"
        },
        {
          "id": 97,
          "start": 333.2,
          "end": 335.44,
          "en": "which we're extracting here in our action.",
          "zh": "也就是我們在這裡的 action 中取出的。"
        },
        {
          "id": 98,
          "start": 335.44,
          "end": 339.15,
          "en": "So we need a coach ID, an email, and a message field",
          "zh": "所以我們需要在 payload 物件裡"
        },
        {
          "id": 99,
          "start": 339.15,
          "end": 341.29,
          "en": "in our payload object.",
          "zh": "有一個 coach ID、一個 email 和一個 message 欄位。"
        },
        {
          "id": 100,
          "start": 341.29,
          "end": 344.97,
          "en": "So therefore here, I wanna create a new object,",
          "zh": "所以為此，在這裡我想要建立一個新的物件，"
        },
        {
          "id": 101,
          "start": 344.97,
          "end": 348.28,
          "en": "which has an email field pointing at this email,",
          "zh": "裡面有一個指向這個 email 的 email 欄位，"
        },
        {
          "id": 102,
          "start": 348.28,
          "end": 351.67,
          "en": "a message field pointing at this message,",
          "zh": "一個指向這個 message 的 message 欄位，"
        },
        {
          "id": 103,
          "start": 351.67,
          "end": 353.92,
          "en": "and then one other important thing,",
          "zh": "然後還有一件重要的事，"
        },
        {
          "id": 104,
          "start": 353.92,
          "end": 358.59000000000003,
          "en": "the ID of the coach to whom this message is sent.",
          "zh": "就是這則訊息被送往的那位教練的 ID。"
        },
        {
          "id": 105,
          "start": 358.59000000000003,
          "end": 362.48,
          "en": "And we can get does ID here because you have to keep in mind",
          "zh": "而我們可以在這裡取得那個 ID，因為你必須記住，"
        },
        {
          "id": 106,
          "start": 362.48,
          "end": 364.5,
          "en": "that when we contact a coach,",
          "zh": "當我們聯絡一位教練時，"
        },
        {
          "id": 107,
          "start": 364.5,
          "end": 368.283,
          "en": "this URL contains the coach ID.",
          "zh": "這個 URL 裡包含了那位教練的 ID。"
        },
        {
          "id": 108,
          "start": 369.26,
          "end": 372.503,
          "en": "So therefore, since this is a child route,",
          "zh": "因此，因為這是一個 child route，"
        },
        {
          "id": 109,
          "start": 373.986,
          "end": 376.9,
          "en": "the contactCoach component is a child route of coach detail,",
          "zh": "contactCoach 元件是 coach detail 的 child route，"
        },
        {
          "id": 110,
          "start": 376.9,
          "end": 378.77,
          "en": "which has this ID parameter,",
          "zh": "它擁有這個 ID 參數，"
        },
        {
          "id": 111,
          "start": 378.77,
          "end": 381.64,
          "en": "we can extract that here as well.",
          "zh": "我們也可以在這裡把它取出來。"
        },
        {
          "id": 112,
          "start": 381.64,
          "end": 383.92,
          "en": "We could do it with Props to Route,",
          "zh": "我們可以用 props to route 來做，"
        },
        {
          "id": 113,
          "start": 383.92,
          "end": 386.46,
          "en": "but to also see that other approach you learned,",
          "zh": "但為了也看看你學過的另一種做法，"
        },
        {
          "id": 114,
          "start": 386.46,
          "end": 390.16,
          "en": "here in contactCoach, I'll get the ID differently.",
          "zh": "在 contactCoach 這裡，我會用不同的方式取得 ID。"
        },
        {
          "id": 115,
          "start": 390.16,
          "end": 394.77,
          "en": "I'll set my coach ID field here to this dollars and route",
          "zh": "我會把這裡的 coach ID 欄位設成 this.$route"
        },
        {
          "id": 116,
          "start": 394.77,
          "end": 399.37,
          "en": "and then ID because that parameter holds the ID of the coach",
          "zh": "然後是 .params.id，因為那個參數保存了那位教練的 ID，"
        },
        {
          "id": 117,
          "start": 399.37,
          "end": 400.973,
          "en": "to whom this message is sent.",
          "zh": "也就是這則訊息要送往的教練。"
        },
        {
          "id": 118,
          "start": 403.43,
          "end": 407.13,
          "en": "And that should then dispatch this successfully.",
          "zh": "這樣應該就能成功 dispatch 這個。"
        },
        {
          "id": 119,
          "start": 407.13,
          "end": 408.42,
          "en": "Now, last but not least,",
          "zh": "現在，最後但同樣重要的是，"
        },
        {
          "id": 120,
          "start": 408.42,
          "end": 411.43,
          "en": "I then also wanna navigate away from this page.",
          "zh": "我還想要從這個頁面導覽離開。"
        },
        {
          "id": 121,
          "start": 411.43,
          "end": 415.40999999999997,
          "en": "So we can do this with this router and then replace maybe",
          "zh": "所以我們可以用 this.$router，然後也許用 replace"
        },
        {
          "id": 122,
          "start": 415.40999999999997,
          "end": 418.32,
          "en": "instead of push so that we can't go back to this page",
          "zh": "而不是 push，這樣我們之後就無法回到這個頁面，"
        },
        {
          "id": 123,
          "start": 418.32,
          "end": 421.4,
          "en": "thereafter and go to /coaches.",
          "zh": "然後前往 /coaches。"
        },
        {
          "id": 124,
          "start": 421.4,
          "end": 424.563,
          "en": "But it's up to you where and how you wanna navigate.",
          "zh": "但你要導覽到哪裡、怎麼導覽，取決於你。"
        },
        {
          "id": 125,
          "start": 425.89,
          "end": 429.24,
          "en": "With that saved, we should now actually be able",
          "zh": "儲存之後，我們現在應該真的能夠"
        },
        {
          "id": 126,
          "start": 429.24,
          "end": 431.37,
          "en": "to send requests.",
          "zh": "送出 requests 了。"
        },
        {
          "id": 127,
          "start": 431.37,
          "end": 436.21,
          "en": "So if we contact a coach here and we fill out this form,",
          "zh": "所以如果我們在這裡聯絡一位教練，我們填寫這個表單，"
        },
        {
          "id": 128,
          "start": 436.21,
          "end": 439.41,
          "en": "first of all, if it's invalid, we get an error message.",
          "zh": "首先，如果它無效，我們會得到一則錯誤訊息。"
        },
        {
          "id": 129,
          "start": 439.41,
          "end": 441.493,
          "en": "But if I fill it out there after,",
          "zh": "但如果我之後把它填好，"
        },
        {
          "id": 130,
          "start": 443.55,
          "end": 445.17,
          "en": "we at least leave the page,",
          "zh": "我們至少離開了頁面，"
        },
        {
          "id": 131,
          "start": 445.17,
          "end": 448.473,
          "en": "but I get an unknown action requests/contactCoach.",
          "zh": "但我得到 unknown action requests/contactCoach。"
        },
        {
          "id": 132,
          "start": 450.17,
          "end": 453.82,
          "en": "Yes, because in the requests module,",
          "zh": "是的，因為在 requests module 裡，"
        },
        {
          "id": 133,
          "start": 453.82,
          "end": 456.93,
          "en": "remember that's a nice object I'm exporting here,",
          "zh": "記得那是我在這裡匯出的一個物件，"
        },
        {
          "id": 134,
          "start": 456.93,
          "end": 459.35,
          "en": "which I'm in the end importing into my store,",
          "zh": "我最終會把它匯入我的 store，"
        },
        {
          "id": 135,
          "start": 459.35,
          "end": 461.25,
          "en": "but what's missing here?",
          "zh": "但這裡少了什麼？"
        },
        {
          "id": 136,
          "start": 461.25,
          "end": 463.42,
          "en": "Well, the mutations and actions I defined",
          "zh": "嗯，就是我在那些個別檔案中"
        },
        {
          "id": 137,
          "start": 463.42,
          "end": 465.11,
          "en": "in those separate files,",
          "zh": "定義的 mutations 和 actions，"
        },
        {
          "id": 138,
          "start": 465.11,
          "end": 468.38,
          "en": "I don't import and add them to my module here.",
          "zh": "我沒有匯入並把它們加到這裡的 module。"
        },
        {
          "id": 139,
          "start": 468.38,
          "end": 470.3,
          "en": "That's of course something we have to do.",
          "zh": "那當然是我們必須做的事。"
        },
        {
          "id": 140,
          "start": 470.3,
          "end": 474.63,
          "en": "We have to import mutations from ./mutations.JS",
          "zh": "我們必須 import mutations from './mutations.js'"
        },
        {
          "id": 141,
          "start": 474.63,
          "end": 478.633,
          "en": "and import actions from ./actions.JS.",
          "zh": "以及 import actions from './actions.js'。"
        },
        {
          "id": 142,
          "start": 479.87,
          "end": 483.19,
          "en": "And once that's done, we can add mutations",
          "zh": "一旦完成，我們就可以用"
        },
        {
          "id": 143,
          "start": 483.19,
          "end": 485.61,
          "en": "using the JavaScript shorthand here",
          "zh": "這裡的 JavaScript 簡寫來加入 mutations，"
        },
        {
          "id": 144,
          "start": 485.61,
          "end": 490.61,
          "en": "and actions as key value pairs to this module object.",
          "zh": "並把 actions 以鍵值對加入這個 module 物件。"
        },
        {
          "id": 145,
          "start": 492.76,
          "end": 497.76,
          "en": "And with that done, if I try to contact a coach,",
          "zh": "完成之後，如果我試著聯絡一位教練，"
        },
        {
          "id": 146,
          "start": 499.27,
          "end": 503.55,
          "en": "this is a test, now we no longer get this.",
          "zh": "這是一則測試，現在我們不會再得到這個了。"
        },
        {
          "id": 147,
          "start": 503.55,
          "end": 506.25,
          "en": "We also don't see the requests anywhere though.",
          "zh": "不過我們也還在哪裡都看不到那些 requests。"
        },
        {
          "id": 148,
          "start": 506.25,
          "end": 509.323,
          "en": "So as a next step, let's work on the requests page.",
          "zh": "所以下一步，讓我們來處理 requests 頁面。"
        }
      ]
    }
  ]
}